msgid "Defeat the leaders of each races and I will give you the Dark Mythril Fragment.You can exchange Dark Mythril Fragments to one 7th armor or to <selfname>weapon."
msgstr "击败各族的首领，我就给你暗黑秘银碎片。你可以用暗黑秘银碎片兑换一件第七套防具，或兑换<selfname>武器。"

msgid "[Quest] Defeat the 4 types of monsters."
msgstr "[任务]击败4种怪物。"

