msgid "Greetings Knight, Could you please help me? I need your help to prevent an inevitable disaster."
msgstr "你好，骑士。能请你帮帮我吗？我需要你的帮助来阻止一场不可避免的灾难。"

msgid "Recently, a dimensional rift was created near the castle. Draki's army will soon invade us using this rift. Could you please use the rift before them to take a look at their moves and look for the lost ones. "
msgstr "最近，城堡附近出现了一道次元裂隙。德拉基的军队很快就会利用这道裂隙入侵我们。你能抢在他们之前穿过裂隙，查看他们的动向并寻找失踪的人吗？"

msgid "Do you wish to activate the [Boom Boom Power Premium]? Client will be closed."
msgstr "你想激活[轰轰强力特权]吗？客户端将关闭。"

msgid "You don't have [Boom Boom Power Premium]. Please check your inventory. Premiums can be purchased from PUS."
msgstr "你没有[轰轰强力特权]。请检查背包。特权可从PUS购买。"

msgid "Thank you for saving me."
msgstr "谢谢你救了我。"

msgid "I miss my mom and dad¡¦"
msgstr "我想爸爸妈妈了……"

msgid "Thank you! I will guide you to where other monsters are."
msgstr "谢谢！我带你去其他怪物所在的地方。"

msgid "A girl's parents? Many were taken to the upper level so maybe her parents were taken to the upper level as well."
msgstr "一个女孩的父母？很多人都被带到了上层，也许她的父母也被带到上层去了。"

msgid "I will guide you to the upper level. Take care!"
msgstr "我带你去上层。保重！"

msgid "What happened to my body? Where is my daughter and wife?"
msgstr "我的身体怎么了？我的女儿和妻子在哪里？"

msgid "Thank god my daughter is alive. I remember my wife was taken to the upper level before I became trapped in here. Please look for my wife once you get to the upper level."
msgstr "谢天谢地，我女儿还活着。我记得在我被困在这里之前，我妻子被带到了上层。你到了上层之后，请帮我寻找我的妻子。"

msgid " I remember my wife taken to the upper level before I became trapped in here. Please look for my wife once you get to the upper level."
msgstr "我记得在我被困在这里之前，我妻子被带到了上层。你到了上层之后，请帮我寻找我的妻子。"

msgid "(Cough¡¦)"
msgstr "（咳嗽……）"

msgid "I saw a monster taking a beautiful lady to the upper level. Do you want me to guide you to there?"
msgstr "我看到一只怪物把一位美丽的女士带到了上层。要我带你去那里吗？"

msgid "Oh my¡¦ What has happened to me."
msgstr "天哪……我这是怎么了。"

msgid "Is my daughter fine? Did my husband turn into monster too?"
msgstr "我女儿没事吧？我丈夫是不是也变成怪物了？"

msgid "Thank god my daughter is alive. I remember a beautiful lady with pointy ears being taken to the upper level by a scorpion monster."
msgstr "谢天谢地，我女儿还活着。我记得一位长着尖耳朵的美丽女士被一只蝎子怪带到了上层。"

msgid "Haha¡¦ you are too late. She should be transformed into a monster by now!"
msgstr "哈哈……你来晚了。她现在应该已经变成怪物了！"

msgid "The Princess was taken to be used in an experiment."
msgstr "公主被抓去做实验了。"

msgid "Drakis turned me into a monster¡¦ It is fortunate you came before I lost my human nature."
msgstr "德拉基把我变成了怪物……幸好你在我失去人性之前赶来了。"

msgid "My silky skin¡¦ is all ruined. Thanks for saving me."
msgstr "我丝滑的肌肤……全毁了。谢谢你救了我。"

msgid "You sure are a knight. Are you going to head to the upper levels? I keep hearing the howls of the dead¡¦ Maybe someone should find a way for them to rest in peace."
msgstr "你果然是位骑士。你要前往上层吗？我一直能听到亡者的哀嚎……也许该有人想办法让他们安息。"

msgid "Are you going to head to the upper levels? I keep hearing the howls of the dead¡¦ Maybe someone should find a way for them to rest in peace."
msgstr "你要前往上层吗？我一直能听到亡者的哀嚎……也许该有人想办法让他们安息。"

msgid "Now they can rest in peace."
msgstr "现在他们可以安息了。"

msgid "Thank you Knight. Can I ask you a favor?"
msgstr "谢谢你，骑士。我能请你帮个忙吗？"

msgid "We are a Knightage of old forgotten kingdom. Our kingdom has fallen from attacks of unknown monsters and they have brought us here. Our princess was also captured and I believe she is somewhere up top. Could you please rescue our princess?"
msgstr "我们是一个被遗忘的古老王国的骑士团。我们的王国在不知名怪物的袭击下沦陷了，他们把我们抓到了这里。我们的公主也被抓走了，我相信她就在上面某处。你能救救我们的公主吗？"

msgid "I believe our princess is captured somewhere up top. Could you please rescue our princess?"
msgstr "我相信我们的公主被抓在上面某处。你能救救我们的公主吗？"

msgid "You have saved me¡¦ Thank you."
msgstr "你救了我……谢谢你。"

msgid "Our royal family has inherited the ability to control time. We considered this ability as a blessing that helped our family to establish a kingdom but we soon found it wasn't."
msgstr "我们王室世代继承了操控时间的能力。我们曾以为这是保佑家族建立王国的祝福，但很快就发现并非如此。"

msgid "Drakis teleported through the rift and destroyed our kingdom. People were taken back through Drakis Rift and had twisted experiments performed on them. You will find the high rank Drakis at the top of this tower. We don't know what their plan is but it certainly will bring disaster to the whole Adonis continent."
msgstr "德拉基穿越裂隙而来，摧毁了我们的王国。人们被抓回德拉基裂隙，遭受扭曲的实验。你在这座塔的顶层会找到高阶德拉基。我们不知道他们的计划是什么，但那必将给整个阿多尼斯大陆带来灾难。"

msgid "If you reach the top of the tower, you will be able to face the high rank Drakis who are responsible for these atrocities. Please defeat them and take revenge for us."
msgstr "如果你到达塔顶，就能面对那些制造这些暴行的高阶德拉基。请击败他们，为我们复仇。"

msgid "I can't believe this¡¦ You are just a human¡¦"
msgstr "真不敢相信……你不过是个人类……"

msgid "How dare an inferior human try to disrupt our master plan. We could have traveled back in time to our glorious days! "
msgstr "区区人类也敢打乱我们的大计。我们本可以回到那辉煌的往昔！"

msgid "This is not the end! This is the beginning of the end! We can still go back in time to where you weren't here."
msgstr "这还没完！这只是终结的开始！我们还能回到你还不存在的过去。"

msgid "They will be the stepping stone to our master plan. Farewell. Hahaha!"
msgstr "他们将成为我们大计的垫脚石。永别了。哈哈哈！"

msgid "I see¡¦ That was what Drakis have been plotting for. If Drakis are going back in time, the only thing we can do is to defeat them over and over again until we find a solution to defeat them completely. I will ask for God's help."
msgstr "原来如此……这就是德拉基一直在图谋的。如果德拉基能回到过去，我们唯一能做的就是一次又一次地击败他们，直到找到彻底消灭他们的办法。我会祈求神的帮助。"

msgid "Even if time goes back again, we need to still rescue those captured people."
msgstr "即使时间再次倒流，我们仍要救出那些被抓的人。"

msgid "There must be a blind spot for time control. Let's ask [Forgotten Princess] about it."
msgstr "时间操控一定有盲点。去问问[被遗忘的公主]吧。"

msgid "Even if we keep failing, we have to keep trying to stop Drakis from controlling time. At some point we will be successful."
msgstr "即使不断失败，我们也必须继续阻止德拉基操控时间。总有一天我们会成功的。"

msgid "You need to defeat Draki's Tower Boss 3 times."
msgstr "你需要击败德拉基之塔Boss 3次。"

msgid "You haven't defeated Draki's Tower Boss 3 times yet."
msgstr "你还没有击败德拉基之塔Boss 3次。"

msgid "Available only once a day."
msgstr "每天仅限一次。"

msgid "According to this message¡¦ a huge disaster will take over the whole Adonis continent. Please go to the other side of Drakis Rift and see if there are any survivors."
msgstr "根据这条消息……一场巨大的灾难将笼罩整个阿多尼斯大陆。请去德拉基裂隙的另一边，看看是否有幸存者。"

msgid "My parents were taken by monsters along with other villagers. Plesae find my parents."
msgstr "我的父母和其他村民一起被怪物抓走了。请帮我找到我的父母。"

msgid "Many were captured and brought here. Drakis have taken some to the top of the tower. Maybe her parents are there too."
msgstr "很多人被抓来这里。德拉基把一些人带到了塔顶。也许她的父母也在那里。"

msgid "Thank god my daughter is alive. I remember a beautiful lady with pointy ears taken to the upper level by a scorpion monster."
msgstr "谢天谢地，我女儿还活着。我记得一位长着尖耳朵的美丽女士被一只蝎子怪带到了上层。"

msgid "My silky skin¡¦ is all ruined. Are you going to head to the upper levels? I keep hearing the howls of the dead¡¦ Maybe someone should find a way for them to rest in peace."
msgstr "我丝滑的肌肤……全毁了。你要前往上层吗？我一直能听到亡者的哀嚎……也许该有人想办法让他们安息。"

msgid "Our royal family has inherited the ability to control time. We considered this ability as a blessing which helped our family establish a kingdom but it brought us disaster as well. One day, Drakis teleported through the rift and destroyed our kingdom. People were taken back through Drakis Rift and had twisted experiments perfomred on them. You will find the high rank Drakis at the top of this tower. Please defeat them and bring us peace."
msgstr "我们王室世代继承了操控时间的能力。我们曾以为这是保佑家族建立王国的祝福，但它也给我们带来了灾难。有一天，德拉基穿越裂隙而来，摧毁了我们的王国。人们被抓回德拉基裂隙，遭受扭曲的实验。你在这座塔的顶层会找到高阶德拉基。请击败他们，为我们带来和平。"

msgid "This is not the end! This is the beginning of the end! We can still go back in time to where you weren't here. You will just become a part of our master plan!"
msgstr "这还没完！这只是终结的开始！我们还能回到你还不存在的过去。你也将成为我们大计的一部分！"

msgid "You have defeated them 3 times. Thank you for your hard work. Please come back tomorrow."
msgstr "你已经击败他们3次了。辛苦了。请明天再来。"

msgid "Where¡¦ am¡¦ I?"
msgstr "我……这是……在哪儿？"

msgid "You can exchange 30 [Draki Commander Badge]s for [Superior Draki Supply Box]."
msgstr "你可以用30个[德拉基指挥官徽章]兑换[高级德拉基补给箱]。"

msgid "Do you wish to spend 30 [Draki Commander Badge]s to exchange?"
msgstr "你想消耗30个[德拉基指挥官徽章]进行兑换吗？"

msgid "You do not have enough [Draki Commander Badge]. Please come back when you are ready."
msgstr "你的[德拉基指挥官徽章]不足。准备好后请再来。"

msgid "You do no have [Draki Supply Box]. Please use <Draki Rift> located at each nation's castle to obtain [Draki Supply Box] at Draki's Tower."
msgstr "你没有[德拉基补给箱]。请通过位于各国城堡的<德拉基裂隙>前往德拉基之塔，获取[德拉基补给箱]。"

msgid "[Superior Draki Supply Box] Exchange"
msgstr "[高级德拉基补给箱]兑换"

msgid "[Old Draki Supply Box] Exchange"
msgstr "[旧德拉基补给箱]兑换"

msgid "You have reached level 70! | Using an [Equipment Exchange Voucher] will allow you to receive level 70 [selfname] weapons and 7th armor set."
msgstr "你已达到70级！|使用[装备兑换券]即可领取70级[selfname]武器和第七套防具套装。"

msgid "You can exchange [Golden Fortune Pouch] for a gift!"
msgstr "你可以用[黄金福袋]兑换礼物！"

msgid "You can obatain [Golden Fortune Pouch] from Giant Spinning Top in Moradon. Did you bring the [Golden Fortune Pouch]?"
msgstr "你可以在莫拉登的巨大陀螺处获得[黄金福袋]。你把[黄金福袋]带来了吗？"

msgid "Item has been exchanged. Have a great day!"
msgstr "道具已兑换。祝你愉快！"

msgid "You do not have [Golden Fortune Pouch]. You can obatin it from Giant Spinning Top in Moradon."
msgstr "你没有[黄金福袋]。你可以在莫拉登的巨大陀螺处获得。"

msgid "I have been working so hard to buy a gift for my parents but I lost it¡¦ Could you please defeat the monsters and retrieve them for me? I will exchange 7 [Stolen Fortune Pouch]s for [Golden Fortune Pouch]. "
msgstr "我辛辛苦苦攒钱给父母买礼物，结果却弄丢了……你能帮我击败怪物把它们找回来吗？我会用7个[被窃福袋]兑换[黄金福袋]。"

msgid "Do you have 7 [Stolen Fortune Pouch]s?"
msgstr "你有7个[被窃福袋]吗？"

msgid "[Stolen Fortune Pouch] can only be exchanged once per day."
msgstr "[被窃福袋]每天只能兑换一次。"

msgid "You don't have enouth [Stolen Fortune Pouch]s. You need to bring 7 of them. [Stolen Fortune Pouch] can be obatined from monsters all over the places."
msgstr "你的[被窃福袋]不够。你需要带来7个。[被窃福袋]可从各地的怪物身上获得。"

msgid "You brought the [Stolen Fortune Pouch]! Thank you!"
msgstr "你把[被窃福袋]带来了！谢谢你！"

msgid "If the Legion of the Devils get summoned, Eslant will become a living hell. They are using [Silver Mithril Fragment] to accerlerate the ritual summoning. We need to stop them."
msgstr "如果恶魔军团被召唤出来，艾斯兰特将变成人间地狱。他们正在用[银秘银碎片]加速召唤仪式。我们必须阻止他们。"

msgid "To slow down the ritual summon, you need to defeat 30 of each Paramun, Giant Golem, Crimson Wing and Troll Warrior."
msgstr "为了延缓召唤仪式，你需要分别击败30只帕拉蒙、巨型魔像、绯红之翼和巨魔战士。"

msgid "You have defeated them all. Thank you!"
msgstr "你把它们全击败了。谢谢你！"

msgid "To stop the ritual summon, you need to be stronger. Have you heard about [Accessory Enhance Scroll]?"
msgstr "要阻止召唤仪式，你需要变得更强。你听说过[饰品强化卷轴]吗？"

msgid "Accessory Enhance Scroll can be obatined from completing [Eslant Ritual Summon] quest and can be used to upgrade the [Quest Accessory]. Using this item increases the chance of success."
msgstr "[饰品强化卷轴]可通过完成[艾斯兰特仪式召唤]任务获得，用于升级[任务饰品]。使用该道具可提高成功率。"

msgid "If you defeat 30 of each of the 4 monsters, I will give you a valuable item randomly. There is a chance that you can get the [Accessory Enhance Scoll] as well! "
msgstr "如果你分别击败4种怪物各30只，我就随机给你一件贵重道具。你还有机会获得[饰品强化卷轴]！"

msgid "[Quest Accesory] can be exchanged for 3 [Silver Mithril Fragment]."
msgstr "[任务饰品]可用3个[银秘银碎片]兑换。"

msgid "Please select the [Quest Accessory] you would like to get."
msgstr "请选择你想要的[任务饰品]。"

msgid "You don't have 3 Silver Mirthril Fragment. You can obatin [Silver Mithril Fragment] from [Eslant Ritual Summon] quest. "
msgstr "你没有3个银秘银碎片。你可以通过[艾斯兰特仪式召唤]任务获得[银秘银碎片]。"

msgid "Item has been exchanged. Please check your mailbox."
msgstr "道具已兑换。请查收邮箱。"

msgid "Congratulations. You have earned a [Veteran] title. Thank you for supporting Knight Online."
msgstr "恭喜。你获得了[老兵]称号。感谢你支持《骑士OL》。"

msgid "Congratulations. You have earned a [Ultimate Veteran] title. Thank you for supporting Knight Online."
msgstr "恭喜。你获得了[终极老兵]称号。感谢你支持《骑士OL》。"

msgid "The first place ranked Knight of Draki's Tower Ranking gets a Title [Ruler of Draki's Tower] Exchange Voucher. Do you have the Title [Ruler of Draki's Tower] Exchange Voucher? "
msgstr "德拉基之塔排行榜第一名的骑士将获得称号[德拉基之塔的统治者]兑换券。你持有称号[德拉基之塔的统治者]兑换券吗？"

msgid "You don't have Title [Ruler of Draki Tower] Exchange Voucher. Only the first place ranked knight of Draki's Tower Ranking can get the Title [Ruler of Draki's Tower] Exchange Voucher."
