msgid "Are you here to eliminate the darkness from the seal? You will need the Fragements of Seven Deadly Sins to enter into the seal. I recommend you to enter as a party."
msgstr "你是来净化封印中的黑暗的吗？你需要七宗罪碎片才能进入封印。我建议你组队进入。"

msgid "Insufficient materials. Please check your materials and try again later."
msgstr "材料不足。请检查你的材料后再来。"

msgid "I'm [Ascetic of Modesty] Beriel. I practice asceticism to fight against the Seven Deadly Sins. I have overthrown the Greed in myself and have found inner peace.Do you wish to learn true modesty from me?"
msgstr "我是[谦逊苦行者]贝丽尔。我苦修以对抗七宗罪。我已战胜了内心的贪婪，获得了内心的平静。你想向我学习真正的谦逊吗？"

msgid "I have taught you everything about Modesty. I hope you can find another Ascetic to learn about avoiding the Seven Deadly Sins."
msgstr "我已经把谦逊的一切都教给你了。希望你能找到另一位苦行者，学习如何规避七宗罪。"

msgid "\"\"Human beings needs to know how to control themselves. If not, they are no different than animals\"\". Welcome. I'm [Ascetic of Moderation] Ragel. Are you prepared for a new lesson?"
msgstr "\"人必须懂得克制自己。否则，便与禽兽无异。\"欢迎。我是[节制苦行者]拉格尔。准备好上新课了吗？"

msgid "Oh... you haven't learned about Modesty yet? You must learn about Modestry prior to learning about Moderation."
msgstr "哦……你还没学过谦逊吗？学习节制之前，你必须先学谦逊。"

msgid "I have taught you everything about Moderation.  I hope you can find another Ascetic to learn about avoiding the Seven Deadly Sins."
msgstr "我已经把节制的一切都教给你了。希望你能找到另一位苦行者，学习如何规避七宗罪。"

msgid "\"\"Patience is a virtue\"\". I'm [Ascetic of Patience] Barael. Welcome. Are you prepared for a new lesson?"
msgstr "\"忍耐是一种美德。\"我是[忍耐苦行者]巴拉埃尔。欢迎。准备好上新课了吗？"

msgid "Oh... you haven't learned about Moderation yet? You must learn about Moderation prior to learning about Patience."
msgstr "哦……你还没学过节制吗？学习忍耐之前，你必须先学节制。"

msgid "I have taught you everything about Patience.  I hope you can find another Ascetic to learn about avoiding the Seven Deadly Sins."
msgstr "我已经把忍耐的一切都教给你了。希望你能找到另一位苦行者，学习如何规避七宗罪。"

msgid "\"\"The early bird gets the worm\"\". Welcome, I'm [Ascetic of Diligence] Tron. Do you wish to talk with me?"
msgstr "\"早起的鸟儿有虫吃。\"欢迎，我是[勤奋苦行者]特隆。你想和我聊聊吗？"

msgid "Oh... you haven't learned about Patience yet? You must learn about Patience prior to learn about Diligence."
msgstr "哦……你还没学过忍耐吗？学习勤奋之前，你必须先学忍耐。"

msgid "\"\"An ounce of practice is worth a pound of theory\"\". The true diligence is a practice. "
msgstr "\"一分实践抵得上十分理论。\"真正的勤奋在于实践。"

msgid "Greetings. I'm the 30 year-old virgin, [Ascetic of Purity] Remi. Do you wish to learn about Purity?"
msgstr "你好。我是30岁的处男，[纯洁苦行者]雷米。你想学习纯洁之道吗？"

msgid "Oh¡¦ I wish I could teach you about Purity, but you haven't learn about Diligence yet."
msgstr "哦……我也想教你纯洁之道，但你还没学过勤奋。"

msgid "I have taught you everything about Purity. I hope you can find another Ascetic to learn about avoiding the Seven Deadly Sins."
msgstr "我已经把纯洁的一切都教给你了。希望你能找到另一位苦行者，学习如何规避七宗罪。"

msgid "\"\"If someone strikes you on the right cheek, turn to him the other also\"\". I'm [Ascetic of Kindness] Lapiel."
msgstr "\"有人打你的右脸，连另一边也转过去由他打。\"我是[善良苦行者]拉皮尔。"

msgid "You do not know about Purity yet. "
msgstr "你还不了解纯洁之道。"

msgid "I have taught you the everything about Kindness. I hope you can find another Ascetic to learn about avoiding the Seven Deadly Sins. [Ascetic of Charity] is located at 718, 190. Please don't get lost."
msgstr "我已经把善良的一切都教给你了。希望你能找到另一位苦行者，学习如何规避七宗罪。[慈爱苦行者]位于718, 190。别迷路了。"

msgid "I respect you for overcoming the Six Deadly Sins and coming this far. I'm the last Ascetic, [Ascetic of Charity] Miel. Are you ready for the last lesson?"
msgstr "你已克服了六宗罪、走到这一步，我很敬佩。我是最后一位苦行者，[慈爱苦行者]米尔。准备好上最后一课了吗？"

msgid "Oh... you haven't learn about Kindness yet. You must learn about Kindness prior to learning about Charity. Please come back again."
msgstr "哦……你还没学过善良。学习慈爱之前，你必须先学善良。请再来。"

msgid "I have taught you the everything about Charity and you have completed all of the asceticisms. I hope you will fight against Seven Deadly Sins like one of us."
msgstr "我已经把慈爱的一切都教给你了，你也完成了所有苦修。希望你能像我们中的一员那样，与七宗罪作斗争。"

msgid "Welcome. The Knight who hears the call of Ultima, I'm [White Knight] White. Ultima is unleashed from the deepest dungeon in Bifrost and trying to destroy Adonis. Please fight against Ultima."
msgstr "欢迎。聆听乌蒂玛召唤的骑士啊，我是[白骑士]怀特。乌蒂玛已从比弗罗斯特最深的地牢中被释放，企图毁灭阿多尼斯。请与乌蒂玛作战。"

msgid "We are giving out supplies to Knights who have [Call of Ultima]. You need 20 empty inventory slots, and we will give out additional supplies once you reach level 80."
msgstr "我们正向持有[乌蒂玛的召唤]的骑士发放补给。你需要20个背包空位，等你达到80级后我们还会发放额外补给。"

msgid "You should have received your supplies. Again, we will give out additional supplies once you reach level 80."
msgstr "你应该已经收到补给了。再强调一次，等你达到80级后我们会发放额外补给。"

msgid "You don't have [Call of Ultima]."
msgstr "你没有[乌蒂玛的召唤]。"

msgid "We are giving out additional supplies to Knights who have [Illusion of Ultima] and have reached level 80."
msgstr "我们正向持有[乌蒂玛的幻象]且达到80级的骑士发放额外补给。"

msgid "You don't have [Illusion of Ultima]."
msgstr "你没有[乌蒂玛的幻象]。"

msgid "You have not experienced enough. Please come back when you reach level 80."
msgstr "你的阅历还不够。请达到80级后再来。"

msgid "You should have received your supplies. Please take Ultima down and bring world peace again."
msgstr "你应该已经收到补给了。请击败乌蒂玛，让世界重归和平。"

msgid "Insufficient empty slots in inventory. [Call of Ultima] needs 21 empty slots and [Illusion of Ultima] nees 11 empty slots."
msgstr "背包空位不足。[乌蒂玛的召唤]需要21个空位，[乌蒂玛的幻象]需要11个空位。"

msgid "We rent out various equipments for the knights who own [Illusion Armor Support]. Which equipment do you wish to rent? (Once per day)"
msgstr "我们向持有[幻象防具支援]的骑士出租各种装备。你想租哪件装备？（每日一次）"

msgid "You do not have the required item."
msgstr "你没有所需的道具。"

msgid "If you own [Illusion Armor Support], you can rent [Dark Knight Armor] for 4 hours. However, if you already rent from [VIP Manager] Julianne, you cannot rent the item anymore. (Once per day)"
msgstr "如果你持有[幻象防具支援]，可以租用[暗黑骑士防具]4小时。不过，如果你已经向[VIP管理员]朱莉安妮租过，就不能再租了。（每日一次）"

msgid "You have already rented equipment today. Please come back tomorrow."
msgstr "你今天已经租过装备了。请明天再来。"

msgid "You have already completed all of the asceticisms."
msgstr "你已经完成了所有苦修。"

msgid "Insufficient Noah. You need 2,000,000 Noah to enter Bifrost."
msgstr "诺亚不足。你需要2,000,000诺亚才能进入比弗罗斯特。"

msgid "I hope my beloved one is doing well¡¦"
msgstr "希望我心爱的人一切安好……"

msgid "Greetings Knight, Could you do me a favor please?"
msgstr "你好，骑士。能请你帮我个忙吗？"

msgid "My beloved one has fallen ill. The Brotherhood of the Lunar Order will perform a ritual to help during the fall equinox if I can provide a sacrificial offering. Could you please get me a [Lunar Offering Box] from Sundries? I will compensate you with useful buffs! "
msgstr "我心爱的人病倒了。只要我能献上祭品，月之教团就会在秋分举行仪式相助。你能去杂货店帮我买一个[月之供品箱]吗？我会用实用的增益来报答你！"

msgid "Thank you! I will grant you useful buffs as a token of my appreciation."
msgstr "谢谢！我会赐予你实用的增益，聊表谢意。"

msgid "Oh! hello again. The gods were pleased with the sacrifice. No more for today, thanks."
msgstr "哦！又见面了。神明对祭品很满意。今天就到这里，谢谢。"

msgid "I'm afraid that is not what I asked for¡¦"
msgstr "恐怕这不是我要的东西……"

msgid "If you have the [Lunar Gift Box], I can exchange the it for a reward for you. Do you wish to continue?"
msgstr "如果你有[月之礼盒]，我可以帮你兑换成奖励。要继续吗？"

msgid "Not enough items."
msgstr "道具不足。"

msgid "Hail Ultima! The Brotherhood is in need of [Lunar Order Token]. Do you have any for me? I have much to offer."
msgstr "致敬乌蒂玛！教团需要[月之教团代币]。你有吗？我有很多好东西可以给你。"

msgid "Item has been exchanged for a reward. May the blessing be with you."
msgstr "道具已兑换为奖励。愿祝福与你同在。"

msgid "Undeads will soon rise and devastate the area. We need to create weapons inlaid with silver. However we are short of [Silver Bar]. If you can bring us [Silver Bar], we will give you [Illusion Armor Support Voucher]."
msgstr "不死族即将苏醒，蹂躏这片地区。我们需要打造镶银的武器。但我们缺[银条]。如果你能给我们带来[银条]，我们就给你[幻象防具支援券]。"

msgid "Item has been given."
msgstr "道具已发放。"

msgid "You have already received the support."
msgstr "你已经领取过支援了。"

msgid "You do not have the item that I asked for."
msgstr "你没有我要的道具。"

msgid "You have brought it! Thank you. <font color=@#990000@>This event is only available to one character per account.</font>This means if you complete the event with this character, you won't be able to try this event with other characters. Do you wish to complete the event?"
msgstr "你带来了！谢谢。<font color=@#990000@>本活动每个账号仅限一个角色参与。</font>这意味着如果你用这个角色完成了活动，就无法再用其他角色参与本活动。你要完成活动吗？"

msgid "We rent out various equipment for knights who own [Illusion Armor Support]. Which item do you wish to rent? (Once a day)"
msgstr "我们向持有[幻象防具支援]的骑士出租各种装备。你想租哪件道具？（每日一次）"

msgid "If you own [Illusion Armor Support: Lv60], you can rent [VII Tier Armor] for 4 hours. However, if you already rent [Illusion Armor Support: Lv80] or rent an item from [VIP Manager] Julianne, you cannot rent the item anymore. (Once per day)"
msgstr "如果你持有[幻象防具支援：60级]，可以租用[第七阶防具]4小时。不过，如果你已经租用了[幻象防具支援：80级]或向[VIP管理员]朱莉安妮租过道具，就不能再租了。（每日一次）"

msgid "You are not prepared yet. Please come back when you reach level 60."
msgstr "你还没准备好。请达到60级后再来。"

msgid "Not enough spaces in inventory."
msgstr "背包空间不足。"

msgid "The Stellar Tattoo increases your HP+100, Defense+20, and Damage+1%. Item is valid for 30 days and the price is 100,000,000 Noah."
msgstr "星纹纹身可提升HP+100、防御+20、伤害+1%。道具有效期30天，售价100,000,000诺亚。"

msgid "<font color=@#990000@>This event is only available to one character per account.</font>This means if you complete the event with this character, you won't be able to try this event with other characters. Do you wish to complete the event?"
msgstr "<font color=@#990000@>本活动每个账号仅限一个角色参与。</font>这意味着如果你用这个角色完成了活动，就无法再用其他角色参与本活动。你要完成活动吗？"

msgid "You already have a maximum number of Holy Waters you can hold"
msgstr "你已达到圣水持有上限。"

msgid "You already have a maximum number of Holy Water Bombs you can hold"
msgstr "你已达到圣水炸弹持有上限。"

msgid "Monsters have stolen my gifts! Could you please kill them and collect the gifts for me? I will reward you if you do so."
msgstr "怪物偷走了我的礼物！你能帮我杀了它们，把礼物拿回来吗？我会奖励你的。"

msgid "You brought my gifts! Choose the reward you want."
msgstr "你把我的礼物拿回来了！选你想要的奖励吧。"

msgid "Haha. Thank you!"
msgstr "哈哈。谢谢你！"

msgid "An Alencia Wing! Of course. Which option would you like?"
msgstr "艾伦西亚之翼！当然可以。你想要哪种属性？"

msgid "Hail Knight. A Red Chicken has spawned in Moradon! I heard Red Chicken Feather brings good luck.  Could you please collect 10 for me? I will reward you with an amulet."
msgstr "致敬，骑士。莫拉登出现了一只红鸡！我听说红鸡羽毛能带来好运。你能帮我收集10根吗？我会用护身符作为报酬。"

msgid "You have already completed it. "
msgstr "你已经完成过了。"

msgid "I'm out of materials for my Winter Holiday dress. Could you please gather more for me? I will reward you for your trouble."
msgstr "我的冬季节日礼服材料不够了。你能帮我再收集一些吗？我会酬谢你的辛劳。"

msgid "You are trying to defy against the Castellan? He does not have time to deal with each one of you. Register for Clan Deathmatch and prove yourself. Do you wish to register for Clan Deathmatch?"
msgstr "你想挑战城主吗？他可没工夫一个一个对付你们。去报名宗族死斗，证明你们自己吧。你要报名参加宗族死斗吗？"

msgid "Sounds good. The registration fee is 100,000,000 Noah."
msgstr "好的。报名费是100,000,000诺亚。"

msgid "Registration has been completed.  All participating clans should observe the time and rules. The last standing clans will fight for the qualification to do battle against the Castellan clan."
msgstr "报名已完成。所有参赛宗族须遵守时间和规则。最终幸存的宗族将争夺与城主宗族对战的资格。"

msgid "Hmm.. You are a member of the current Castellan clan.  Castellan clan cannot register."
msgstr "嗯……你是现任城主宗族的成员。城主宗族不能报名。"

msgid "You are not the person in charge."
msgstr "你不是负责人。"

msgid "You should have came earlier. We close the registration 2 hours before the Deathmatch starts."
msgstr "你该早点来的。我们在死斗开始前2小时就截止报名了。"

msgid "Your clan rank is too low. "
msgstr "你的宗族排名太低。"

msgid "You are already on the list. You are not pulling my leg, are you?"
msgstr "你已经在名单上了。你不是在耍我吧？"

msgid "You are too late. All spots are already filled. "
msgstr "你来太晚了。名额已经全满了。"

msgid "You don't have enough Noah. The registration fee is 100,000,000 Noah."
msgstr "你的诺亚不足。报名费是100,000,000诺亚。"

msgid "You would like to cancel your registration? There will be no refund for your cancellation. Do you still wish to cancel your registration?"
msgstr "你想取消报名？取消报名不予退款。你仍要取消报名吗？"

msgid "Your clan is not registered. You are not pulling my leg, are you?"
msgstr "你的宗族没有报名。你不是在耍我吧？"

msgid "Registration has been cancelled successfully."
msgstr "报名已成功取消。"

msgid "I'm knitting a special hat for the Winter Holiday. Red Chicken Feather would look good on this hat. Could you pleae collect 5 feathers for me?"
msgstr "我正在为冬季节日织一顶特别的帽子。红鸡羽毛缀在这顶帽子上会很好看。你能帮我收集5根羽毛吗？"

msgid "You can prove your honor by contributing 10,000 Nation Points or 300,000,000 Noah. How do you want to prove your honor?"
msgstr "你可以通过捐献10,000国家点数或300,000,000诺亚来证明你的荣誉。你想怎样证明你的荣誉？"

msgid "You don't have enough Noah. If you want to prove your honor, you need to contribute 300,000,000 Noah"
msgstr "你的诺亚不足。如果你想证明你的荣誉，需要捐献300,000,000诺亚。"

msgid "Please bring me 10,000 Nation Points or 300,000,000 Noah"
msgstr "请给我带来10,000国家点数或300,000,000诺亚。"

msgid "I remember you. You already got your Qualification of Rebirth!"
msgstr "我记得你。你已经拿到转生资格了！"

msgid "You don't have the item"
msgstr "你没有该道具。"

msgid "Your inventory is full"
msgstr "你的背包已满。"

msgid "Item has been exchanged for the reward"
msgstr "道具已兑换为奖励。"

msgid "Please select the item you would like to receive"
msgstr "请选择你想领取的道具。"

msgid "Hail Knight, someone has stole my ingredients for a Rice Soup, could you please get me 10 Rice Soup Ingredients? I will cook a Rice Soup for you as a reward."
msgstr "致敬，骑士。有人偷走了我做米汤的材料，你能帮我弄来10份米汤材料吗？我会煮一碗米汤给你作为报酬。"

msgid "If we leave these Nagging Ghosts wander around, something bad will happen"
msgstr "如果放任这些唠叨鬼四处游荡，会出坏事的。"

msgid "I will reward you if you bring me all 4 naggy messages from the Nagging Ghost"
msgstr "如果你把唠叨鬼的4条唠叨消息全给我带来，我就奖励你。"

