msgid "Level Reach Event details "
msgstr "等级达成活动详情"

msgid "<<Lv.50>>||Depending on your premium status, you will boost your level to Lv.60 (Lv.65 for premium) along with Tier VII Armor Set (14 Days) and 2 Unique Weapon Vouchers (7 Days) ||<<Lv.60>>||Depending on your premium status, you will boost your level to Lv.65 (Lv.70 for premium) along with Tier VII Armor Set (14 Days) and 2 Unique Weapon Vouchers (7 Days) "
msgstr "<<Lv.50>>||根据你的特权状态，等级将提升至Lv.60（特权用户为Lv.65），并附赠第七阶防具套装（14天）和2张独特武器券（7天）||<<Lv.60>>||根据你的特权状态，等级将提升至Lv.65（特权用户为Lv.70），并附赠第七阶防具套装（14天）和2张独特武器券（7天）"

msgid "Do you wish to participate in the Level Jump Event?"
msgstr "你想参加等级跃升活动吗？"

msgid "Your level cannot participate in Level Jump Event (Even number levels)"
msgstr "你的等级无法参加等级跃升活动（偶数等级）。"

msgid "You need at least 7 slots of empty inventory in order to participate in Level Jump Event|Please have enough space in your inventory"
msgstr "参加等级跃升活动至少需要7个背包空位|请确保背包有足够空间。"

msgid "You have reached Lv.50! I will apply the Level Jump to your character.|Your level will boost to Lv.60/Lv.65 depends on your premium status"
msgstr "你已达到Lv.50！我将为你的角色进行等级跃升。|你的等级将根据特权状态提升至Lv.60/Lv.65。"

msgid "You have reached Lv.60! I will apply the Level Jump to your character.|Your level will boost to Lv.65/Lv.70 depends on your premium status"
msgstr "你已达到Lv.60！我将为你的角色进行等级跃升。|你的等级将根据特权状态提升至Lv.65/Lv.70。"

msgid "You are currently not using any premiums.|If you are using premium during the Level Jump Event, you will receive additional +5 levels"
msgstr "你当前没有使用任何特权。|如果在等级跃升活动期间使用特权，将额外提升5级。"

msgid "You have already participated in Level Jump Event"
msgstr "你已经参加过等级跃升活动了。"

msgid "For those who have the Coin Bag will receive a coin per day. Coins can be used to exchange with reward items."
msgstr "持有金币袋的人每天可领取一枚金币。金币可用于兑换奖励道具。"

msgid "You have already received it today"
msgstr "你今天已经领取过了。"

msgid "Which item do you wish to exchange with?"
msgstr "你想兑换成哪个道具？"

msgid "You cannot enter right now"
msgstr "现在无法进入。"

msgid "I assume you are here for the Blessing of Lunar Goddess? How many Lunar Coin are you willing to give me?"
msgstr "我想你是为了月之女神的祝福而来的吧？你愿意给我多少枚月之金币？"

msgid "Welcome. If you have 13th Anniversary Emblem Voucher, please select the bonus stats you wish to receive"
msgstr "欢迎。如果你持有13周年纹章券，请选择你想要的附加属性。"

msgid "Have you caught the fugitive and got bounty emblem? You can either receive Offensive or Defensive emblem."
msgstr "你抓到逃犯、拿到悬赏纹章了吗？你可以选择领取进攻型或防御型纹章。"

msgid "The unending war has created wandering spirits. Lunar Goddess feels pity for them"
msgstr "无休止的战争催生了游荡的亡魂。月之女神怜悯他们。"

msgid "Please bring me their spirits so I can send them back to the Lunar Goddess and I reward you in return. Just letting you know, I only can send 10 spirits per day"
msgstr "请把他们的亡魂带给我，好让我送他们回归月之女神身边，作为回报我会奖赏你。顺便告诉你，我每天只能送渡10个亡魂。"

msgid "To show the appreciation to the Lunar Goddess, we are offering tributes. She blesses the nation who offers more tributes. Do you wish to receive the blessing?"
msgstr "为了向月之女神表达敬意，我们献上供品。她会赐福于献上更多供品的国家。你想接受祝福吗？"

msgid "You cannot be blessed right now"
msgstr "现在无法赐福。"

msgid "You have been blessed. May the peace be with you"
msgstr "你已受赐福。愿平安与你同在。"

msgid "I don't see what I've asked for"
msgstr "我没看到我要的东西。"

msgid "(This teleport gate seems to be linked to the enemy nation.. Should I use this?)"
msgstr "（这道传送门似乎连着敌国……我该用它吗？）"

msgid "(Hmm.. I guess the winning nation can't use this)"
msgstr "（嗯……看来获胜的一方用不了这个）"

msgid "(Cannot enter for unknown reasons)"
msgstr "（因未知原因无法进入）"

msgid "You can exchange Full Moon Rift Jewel for rewards"
msgstr "你可以用满月裂隙宝石兑换奖励。"

msgid "If you bring Monster Coins, I will activate skills you can use for defense. Skills vary by number of coins. Please select the skill you wish to learn"
msgstr "如果你带来怪物金币，我就为你开启可用于防守的技能。技能随金币数量而不同。请选择你想学的技能。"

msgid "There is not enough space in your inventory"
msgstr "背包空间不足。"

msgid "Good luck"
msgstr "祝你好运。"

msgid "We are giving out 1 Full Moon Rift Vouchers per day. They expire in 24 hours so please use them before they expire"
msgstr "我们每天发放1张满月裂隙券。它们会在24小时后过期，请在过期前使用。"

msgid "You already have the voucher. You are required to use ones you already have"
msgstr "你已经持有券了。请先使用你已有的券。"

msgid "You can only participate once a day"
msgstr "每天只能参加一次。"

msgid "You need Absolute Vouchers to receive [Half Moon Legend] and [Full Moon Legend] titles"
msgstr "你需要绝对券才能领取[半月传说]和[满月传说]称号。"

msgid "You need 3 Absolute Vouchers for [Half Moon Legend] title. Do you wish to continue?"
msgstr "你需要3张绝对券才能获得[半月传说]称号。要继续吗？"

msgid "You need 20 Absolute Vouchers for [Full Moon Legend] title. Do you wish to continue?"
msgstr "你需要20张绝对券才能获得[满月传说]称号。要继续吗？"

msgid "Not enough [Absolute Voucher]. Voucher can be exchanged for 5 Teared Voucher Pieces "
msgstr "[绝对券]不足。1张券可兑换5个残破券碎片。"

msgid "You already have the title. Please double check your title list and achievements"
msgstr "你已经拥有该称号了。请再次确认你的称号列表和成就。"

msgid "You can exchange Ibexs or Crisis Potion from Dragon Box into 100 Contaminated  Holy Waters"
msgstr "你可以把龙宝箱里的羚羊角或危机药水兑换成100瓶被污染的圣水。"

msgid "I'm afraid that is not what I've asked for"
msgstr "恐怕这不是我要的东西。"

msgid "Hello, I'm Julia and I'm here to help Moira"
msgstr "你好，我是朱莉娅，是来协助莫伊拉的。"

msgid "We are selling +180 Fire Resistance Potion for a limited time only. <font color=@#990000@> They are 35,000,000 Noah for 30.</font> Do you wish to purchase them?"
msgstr "我们限时出售+180火抗药水。<font color=@#990000@>30瓶售价35,000,000诺亚。</font>你要购买吗？"

msgid "I'm Aaron and I manage clan competition fairly. What did you come here for?"
msgstr "我是艾伦，我公正地管理宗族竞赛。你来这里有什么事？"

