msgstr "只要交上 3000 诺亚的手续费，[大商人]凯山就会帮你办理第一次转职。[大商人]凯山就在莫拉登中心往北走的地方。"

msgid " [Grand Merchant] Kaishan will be pleased to receive a silk spool for making Menissiah Atienne`s dress whom he dotes on.|Then you`ll be able to receive the reward below."
msgstr "[大商人]凯山很疼爱女儿梅尼西亚·阿蒂埃内，你要是送他一卷丝线，好给他宝贝女儿做裙子，他一定会很高兴的。|这样你就能领到下面的报酬了。"

msgid "Dark Forces are coming over the hill..."
msgstr "黑暗势力正翻过山头逼近……"

msgid "<selfname>... hmmm~ not a bad name."
msgstr "<selfname>……嗯～这名字嘛，还不赖。"

msgid "The two faces of the monk. Beware the darkness!|The soulless monks attack from the dark behind your eyes."
msgstr "僧侣的两张面孔。当心黑暗！|那些失去灵魂的僧侣，会从你视线背后的黑暗中扑出来袭击你。"

msgid "I don't wanna get any closer to you... you don't have time for me anyway. Ah~ what a downer."
msgstr "我才不想再靠近你呢……反正你心里也没有我。唉～真没劲。"

msgid "He seems to be a nomad monk of the Esoteric Buddhist order... but at night does he change into a savage mage of the darkness? Here, I'm also known as  Paramoon. Cute name, eh? MUAHAHAHA- "
msgstr "他看起来像是密教的游方僧侣……可一到夜里，他会不会就变成黑暗中凶残的法师呢？对了，我还有个名字叫帕拉蒙。可爱的名字吧？哇哈哈——"

msgid "Pablo's an odd one for sure... But I'm still curious about his identity."
msgstr "巴勃罗这家伙确实古怪……可我还是很好奇他的真实身份。"

msgid "Careful... Careful... Darkness is falling... The darkness..."
msgstr "小心……小心……黑暗正在降临……那黑暗……"

msgid "Did you wrestle with Paramun? HAHA- Don't make a face for that! Wasn't it a good experience?"
msgstr "你跟帕拉蒙交过手了？哈哈——别那副表情嘛！这不也是段不错的经历吗？"

msgid "What?? You're already over level 70 - too high! Heh."
msgstr "什么？你都已经超过 70 级了——太高啦！哼。"

msgid "The two faces of the monk... Beware of the darkness!|The soulless monks attack from the dark behind your eyes..."
msgstr "僧侣的两张面孔……当心黑暗！|那些失去灵魂的僧侣，会从你视线背后的黑暗中扑出来袭击你……"

msgid "You`ve gathered all the Apple of Moradon * Quick, take them to [Grand Merchant`s Daughter] Menissiah"
msgstr "你已经把莫拉登苹果都集齐了*快去把它们交给[大商人之女]梅尼西亚吧。"

msgid "He seems to be a nomad monk of the Esoteric Buddhist order... but at night does he change into a savage mage of the darkness? Here, I'm also known as  Paramun. Isn't it a cute name? HAHAHA- "
msgstr "他看起来像是密教的游方僧侣……可一到夜里，他会不会就变成黑暗中凶残的法师呢？对了，我还有个名字叫帕拉蒙。这名字可爱吧？哈哈哈——"

msgid "For some reason Pablo is scary or mentally strange... but I'm more curious about Pablo's identity."
msgstr "不知为什么，巴勃罗要么很吓人，要么就脑子不太正常……可我更想知道巴勃罗到底是什么来头。"

msgid "Careful... Careful... Darkness is spreading... The darkness."
msgstr "小心……小心……黑暗正在蔓延……那黑暗。"

msgid "Did you wrestle with Paramun? HAHA- Don't make that look. Don't you think it was good experience?"
msgstr "你跟帕拉蒙交过手了？哈哈——别那副表情。你不觉得这是段不错的经历吗？"

msgid "What?? You are over level 70... too high heh-"
msgstr "什么？你都超过 70 级了……太高啦，哼——"

msgid "Why so busy? Come here and let's dicuss about how the world is going around."
msgstr "干嘛这么忙？过来坐坐，聊聊这世道都变成什么样了。"

msgid "He is a nomad monk of the Esoteric Buddhist order... but is his real identity a savage mage of darkness at night? Here I'm also called  Brahman. I have a feeling this is the start of a beautiful friendship... KeKe~"
msgstr "他是密教的游方僧侣……可他到了夜里的真实身份，会不会是黑暗中凶残的法师呢？对了，在这儿我叫婆罗门。我有种预感，咱们的友谊就要从这里开始了……咯咯～"

msgid "You still haven`t paid your respects to [Grand Merchant] Kaishan? We can`t guarantee your safety if you go around Moradon without having seen him"
msgstr "你还没去拜访[大商人]凯山吗？没拜见过他就在莫拉登到处乱跑，你的安全我们可担保不了。"

msgid "Those soulless monks... for some reason I pity them."
msgstr "那些失去灵魂的僧侣……不知为什么，我反倒有些同情他们。"

msgid "Do you know how it feels to lose your soul? It sure is terrible to become a mindless beast every night."
msgstr "你知道失去灵魂是什么滋味吗？每到夜里就变成一头没有理智的野兽，那可真够受的。"

msgid "Why so busy? Come here and let's shoot the breeze a while."
msgstr "干嘛这么忙？过来唠会儿嗑吧。"

msgid "He seems to be a nomad monk of the Esoteric Buddhist order... but at night does he change into a savage mage of the darkness? Here, I'm also known as  Brahman. I have a feeling this is the start of a beautiful friendship... KeKe~"
msgstr "他看起来像是密教的游方僧侣……可一到夜里，他会不会就变成黑暗中凶残的法师呢？对了，我还有个名字叫婆罗门。我有种预感，咱们的友谊就要从这里开始了……咯咯～"

msgid "Are you enjoying your trip?"
msgstr "旅途还愉快吗？"

msgid "Such an ominous and heavy force...? It's them... It must be them. "
msgstr "如此不祥而沉重的力量……？是他们……一定是他们。"

msgid "Hello, welcome to Moradon! Have you seen worms in front of the village? The Apple of Moradon that they have are useful for various purposes as they are strong. If it is okay with you.. Can you find and bring the Apple of Moradon to me?"
msgstr "你好，欢迎来到莫拉登！你在村子前面看见蠕虫了吗？它们身上的莫拉登苹果因为药性强，用途很广。你要是方便的话……能帮我找些莫拉登苹果带来吗？"

msgid "It was a hard fight, Master- "
msgstr "这一战打得够辛苦的，师父——"

msgid "The power of their sorcery... As this evil energy melts into your body, it drags your soul down into an endless hell."
msgstr "他们巫术的力量……那邪恶的能量一旦融进你的身体，就会把你的灵魂拖进无尽的地狱。"

msgid "Have I ever told you that I found peace because of you? Hmm..."
msgstr "我跟你说过没有，是你让我重获了平静？嗯……"

msgid "It's a Troll Conjurator|Nobody emits evil force like they do! If the evil force is allowed to spread, all Islante will be hell-bound to damnation. But why do I feel such peace as soon as I see you??"
msgstr "是巨魔召唤师|没人能像他们那样散发出邪气！这邪气要是蔓延开来，整个艾斯兰特都会坠入地狱。可为什么我一见到你，心里就这么平静呢？？"

msgid "If you find and bring three of them to me so that I can make strong cloth, I will give you a rich reward. Apple of Moradon can be obtained from the worms in front of the castle. "
msgstr "如果你能找来三个交给我，好让我织出结实的布，我会重重谢你。莫拉登苹果可以从城堡前的蠕虫身上获得。"

msgid "Oh.. Dear.. Cloth can be made only when three Apple of Moradon are collected.."
msgstr "哎呀……天哪……莫拉登苹果得集满三个，才能织成布啊……"

msgid "I feel good about all of the Apple of Moradon you brought!"
msgstr "你带来的这些莫拉登苹果我都很满意！"

msgid "You`re that stranger [Manager] Billbor mentioned? |You have very pleasant silk spools. Are you going to give them to me? "
msgstr "你就是[管理员]比尔博提到的那个外乡人吧？|你带的这些丝线轴真不错，是打算送给我吗？"

msgid "It's the power of their sorcery... As the evil energy melts into your body, it drags your soul down into an endless hell."
msgstr "这是他们巫术的力量……那邪恶的能量一旦融进你的身体，就会把你的灵魂拖进无尽的地狱。"

msgid "What's it like? When the coldness eats into your bones? Do you know? There've been a lot of miserable fellas suffering from the pain lately... Seems someone's been provoking the Apostle of Piercing Cold's anger... Heh."
msgstr "那滋味怎么样？寒气钻进骨头的时候？你知道吗？近来有好多可怜的家伙在这种痛苦里挣扎……看来是有人惹恼了「寒霜使徒」……哼。"

msgid "Haven't you already got a lot of commitments?  This doesn't feel good. Right now, you've got to deal with the jobs you've been asked to."
msgstr "你手头的事不是已经够多了吗？这可不妙。眼下你得先把交代给你的活儿办完。"

msgid "There are too many sentinels around.. Come back some other time.."
msgstr "这周围哨兵太多了……改天再来吧……"

msgid "What mission are you going to undertake?"
msgstr "你打算接哪个任务？"

msgid "Because of those guys trying to steal the Apostle of Piercing Cold's high quality Pet Transformation Scroll, they're just making the Apostle more fuious. Tut Tut~ It's not even worth trying... it'll only end with more souls floating up to heaven."
msgstr "就因为那些家伙想偷「寒霜使徒」那本高级宠物变身卷轴，结果把使徒惹得更火大了。啧啧～这事根本不值得一试……只会让更多灵魂飘上天罢了。"

msgid "Master, you tried hard and fought well. How good is this high quality Pet Transformation Scroll the Apostle of Piercing Cold owns? "
msgstr "师父，你尽力了，也打得漂亮。「寒霜使徒」手里那本高级宠物变身卷轴，到底有多厉害呢？"

msgid "Uh-oh, Master, you`re short on Noahs. You`ll have a hard time making ends meet.. Go see Sentinel Patrick. I heard they`re hiring extra guards."
msgstr "哎呀，师父，你诺亚不够花了。日子可要紧巴了……去找哨兵帕特里克吧，我听说他们正在额外招人站岗。"

msgid "If your bones start to freeze under their Glacier Spells... How would you counter it? Well, it's not easy~"
msgstr "要是你的骨头在他们的冰川法术下开始冻结……你打算怎么应付？唉，这可不容易哦～"

msgid "You haven`t completed the monster hunting mission. Come back after you`ve finished it. "
msgstr "你还没完成讨伐怪物的任务。办完了再回来。"

msgid "you're still standing on your own two feet, so obviously it wasn't that bad. You know, you're quite a strange guy. Ha!~"
msgstr "你现在还能两条腿站着，看来伤得不重嘛。我说，你这小子还挺古怪的。哈！～"

msgid "Moradon maintains peace at all times as we protect it from monsters which were created by the war against Pathos. Incidentally, I`m running low on guards lately. Can you lend a hand?"
msgstr "我们一边抵御着由帕托斯战争催生的怪物，一边始终守护着莫拉登的安宁。说起来，我近来卫兵人手不够。能搭把手吗？"

msgid "If you exit through that gate you`ll spot Worms right outside. They began to breed after the war against Pathos. Go hunt me 5 of those pesky monsters!!"
msgstr "出了那道门，你就能看见外面的蠕虫了。它们是帕托斯战争之后开始大量繁殖的。去给我宰 5 只那些烦人的怪物！！"

msgid "What's it like? When the coldness eats into your bones? Do you know? There've been a lot of miserable fellas suffering from the pain lately... Seems someone's been   provoking the Apostle of Piercing Cold's anger... Heh."
msgstr "那滋味怎么样？寒气钻进骨头的时候？你知道吗？近来有好多可怜的家伙在这种痛苦里挣扎……看来是有人惹恼了「寒霜使徒」……哼。"

msgid "I hunted all 5 Worms. Report it to the guards "
msgstr "5 只蠕虫我全宰了。去向卫兵复命吧。"

msgid "So, what do you think? Was it a good experience? Well you're still standing on your own two feet, so obviously it wasn't that bad. You know, you're quite a strange guy. Ha!~"
msgstr "怎么样，你觉得？算段好经历吧？你现在还能两条腿站着，看来伤得不重嘛。我说，你这小子还挺古怪的。哈！～"

msgid "Can you see the flames, dancing over the desert? Hmmm~ you can see them quite clearly tonight, it's unusually beautiful. KeKe~ Come and look... KeKe~"
msgstr "你看见沙漠上空舞动的火焰了吗？嗯～今晚看得格外清楚，美得反常。咯咯～过来看看……咯咯～"

msgid "Listen, capture all 5. Is that the best you can do?"
msgstr "听着，5 只全部抓回来。这就是你的极限了吗？"

msgid "You are better than you look. Haha... You say it was a joke? I've prepared compensation for your trouble. Please kindly accept it."
msgstr "你比看上去要厉害。哈哈……你说刚才是开玩笑？我已经备好了辛苦费，请务必收下。"

msgid "You're always busy. What's up with that? Are you running away from someone? KeKe~"
msgstr "你总是这么忙。怎么回事？在躲什么人吗？咯咯～"

msgid "What if it's the enemy? You're going to take on the entire Magic Army? Ha Ha- They serve  the Apostle of Flames They're usually known as the Red Magic Army. Ho! The hand of help has arrived to crush the cruel Red Army, eh? We'll soon see..."
msgstr "万一是敌人呢？你打算一个人扛起整支魔法大军？哈哈——他们效力于「火焰使徒」，平时被称作红魔军。嗬！这就来了帮手要踏平残暴的红魔军啦？咱们走着瞧……"

msgid "Master, I award you with the title of Supreme Warrior of The Karus, for your amazing victory over the Red Army~ Hee Hee!~"
msgstr "师父，鉴于你对红魔军的辉煌胜利，我特授予你「卡鲁斯至高战士」的称号～嘻嘻！～"

msgid "As the materials have alredy been secured, I have nothing to ask of you for today... I will ask you a favor next time~"
msgstr "材料既然已经备齐，今天我就没什么要麻烦你的了……下次再请你帮忙～"

msgid "Will you help me?"
msgstr "你愿意帮我吗？"

msgid "Those dazzling flames... the Red Magic Army... the Apostle of Flames..."
msgstr "那耀眼的火焰……红魔军……火焰使徒……"

msgid "Wonder what Menissiah`s up to lately. I miss her. Let`s go see her, Master."
msgstr "不知梅尼西亚近来在忙什么。我想她了。咱们去看她吧，师父。"

msgid "You... will become an... in Karus... I can feel it..."
msgstr "你……将会在卡鲁斯……成为一个……我感觉得到……"

msgid "As my father has issued an order, I can't go out of the castle gate on my own authority. So can we be friends with each other? We appear to be of similar age and the foreigner Inisia may have a lot of stories... Oh! This is a secret from my father"
msgstr "因为父亲下了命令，我不能擅自走出城堡大门。那我们能交个朋友吗？咱俩年纪相仿，而外乡人伊尼西亚说不定有好多故事可以讲……哦！这可不能让我父亲知道。"

msgid "Oh? Nowadays, I am totally preoccupied with the manufacturing of medications learned from my teacher but it is so hard to find the materials for practice. Can you find two Apples of Moradon for me? "
msgstr "哦？近来我一门心思钻研跟老师学的制药术，可练习用的材料实在难找。你能帮我找两个莫拉登苹果吗？"

msgid "Master, I award you with the title of Supreme Warrior of El Morad, for your amazing victory over the Red Army~ Hee Hee!~"
msgstr "师父，鉴于你对红魔军的辉煌胜利，我特授予你「艾莫拉德至高战士」的称号～嘻嘻！～"

msgid "You... will become an... in El Morad... I can feel it..."
msgstr "你……将会在艾莫拉德……成为一个……我感觉得到……"

msgid "All the ingredients requested by [Grand Merchant`s Daughter] Menissiah have been collected."
msgstr "[大商人之女]梅尼西亚要的材料已经全部集齐了。"

msgid "I have felt their burning gaze... Their bloodthirsty rage is matched only by their incredible stamina... they're unbearable to be near, let alone fight. Even if you defeat them you'll only do so at great loss..."
msgstr "我感觉到了他们那灼热的目光……他们嗜血的狂暴，唯有那超乎寻常的体力能与之匹敌……靠近都让人受不了，更别说交手了。就算你打赢他们，也必定付出惨重代价……"

msgid "Just go. Now. Seems like you've already got a lot of commitments."
msgstr "快走，现在就走。看来你手头的事已经够多了。"

msgid "In order to make the medication, I need two Apple of Moradon."
msgstr "要配药，我需要两个莫拉登苹果。"

msgid "Thanks to you, I will be able to finish the practice safely."
msgstr "多亏了你，我才能顺利完成这次练习。"

msgid "It's the  Doom SoldierArmy... The resurrection of these guys ain't good news right now, what with us fighting the El Morad Army too. If they hit us from behind... Ah~ isn't there anywhere to make a stand for Karus in Ronark Land..."
msgstr "是末日军……这帮家伙复活可不是什么好消息，何况我们还在跟艾莫拉德军交战。要是他们从背后捅我们一刀……唉～难道罗纳克之地就没有卡鲁斯可以立足之地了吗……"

msgid "Well Master, nice job easing Elrod's mind a little."
msgstr "好啦师父，总算让埃尔罗德安心了一些，干得漂亮。"

msgid "Ahh, that baleful red gaze, dripping with evil bloodthirtyness... It's the Doom Soldiers alright. They're knights too. Darkness Knights..."
msgstr "啊，那凶狠的红目光，滴着邪恶的嗜血之气……果然是末日士兵。他们也是骑士。黑暗骑士……"

msgid "Is it you that confounded the Doom Soldier Armies and drove them back? I never would've guessed you'd become so talented. You're a real asset ...  Your services are most appreciated."
msgstr "击退末日大军、把他们打散的人，就是你吗？我真没想到你已经这么有本事了。你是难得的人才……非常感谢你的效力。"

msgid "Stop, that's fine. More experience at your level is meaningless. Go and find a tougher mission."
msgstr "住手，够了。你这个等级再积累经验也没意义。去找个更难的任务吧。"

msgid "Patrick`s hiring more guards. Go and apply."
msgstr "帕特里克在招更多卫兵。去应募吧。"

msgid "It's the Doom Soldier Army... The resurrection of these guys ain't good news right now, what with us fighting the Karus too. If they hit us from behind... Ah~ isn't there anywhere for El Morad to make a stand in Ronark Land..."
msgstr "是末日军……这帮家伙复活可不是什么好消息，何况我们还在跟卡鲁斯交战。要是他们从背后捅我们一刀……唉～难道罗纳克之地就没有艾莫拉德可以立足之地了吗……"

msgid "Well Master, nice job easing Della's mind a little."
msgstr "好啦师父，总算让德拉安心了一些，干得漂亮。"

msgid "Have you seen monsters that look like rats in front of Moradon Castle?"
msgstr "你在莫拉登城堡前面见过那种像老鼠一样的怪物吗？"

msgid "They`re called Bandicoots. They sometimes venture into the castle and gnaw on the gates and skedaddle. What a major headache. Get rid of 5 of them."
msgstr "那叫袋狸。它们时不时溜进城堡，啃咬城门然后就溜之大吉。真是个大麻烦。去干掉 5 只。"

msgid "I learned a different potion production method, and I need Apple of Moradon this time. If you bring me 5 Apple of Moradon, I think I can make antifebrile. Will you help me?"
msgstr "我学会了一种新的药水配方，这次需要莫拉登苹果。你要是能给我带来 5 个莫拉登苹果，我想我就能做出退烧药了。你愿意帮我吗？"

msgid "Darn it! How did this happen? Our base was infiltrated during the night and our supplies set on fire. Luckily a guard survived and saw the culprit at work, so we know who it is. Still, something isn't right here..."
msgstr "该死！怎么会这样？我们的基地夜里被人摸进来，补给全被放火烧了。幸好有个卫兵活了下来，亲眼看见了纵火的家伙，所以我们知道是谁干的。可这事儿透着蹊跷……"

msgid "It was a Dark Knight who did it. But why? There must've had a specific motive. But what, we don't know. We'll just have to capture one of the Knights."
msgstr "是一个黑暗骑士干的。可为什么？肯定有什么特别的动机。至于动机是什么，我们还不清楚。只能抓一个骑士回来审审。"

msgid "Whoa, Master, you`ve caught all 5 Bandicoots. Bring them to the sentinel and get our reward."
msgstr "哇，师父，你把 5 只袋狸全抓回来了。把它们带给哨兵，领我们的赏去吧。"

msgid "Will there be some hidden truth, as Elrod expects? "
msgstr "真会像埃尔罗德预料的那样，藏着什么隐情吗？"

msgid "No... it doesn't fit. Darkness Knights don't go randomly doing stuff like this. We'll capture one and interrogate it."
msgstr "不对……说不通。黑暗骑士不会随便干这种事。我们抓一个来审问。"

msgid "Wow, I underestimated you. Here, this is compensation for guarding Moradon. "
msgstr "哇，我倒小看你了。来，这是给你守卫莫拉登的酬劳。"

msgid "You still haven`t caught all 5 Bandicoots?"
msgstr "你还没把 5 只袋狸都抓回来吗？"

msgid "Darkness conceals the truth, but it cannot destroy it. Ha, just as expected, El Morad was behind this one. They paid the Darkness Knights to make it look like a random attack. The El Moradians had only recently attacked, so we weren't expecting them back again so soon."
msgstr "黑暗会掩盖真相，却无法摧毁真相。哼，果然，幕后是艾莫拉德。他们收买了黑暗骑士，把这事伪装成随机袭击。艾莫拉德前不久才攻打过，我们压根没料到他们这么快又来。"

msgid "It was a  Dark Knight who did it. But why? There must've had a specific motive. But what, we don't know. We'll just have to capture one of the Knights."
msgstr "是一个黑暗骑士干的。可为什么？肯定有什么特别的动机。至于动机是什么，我们还不清楚。只能抓一个骑士回来审审。"

msgid "I don`t have time to make your armor right now. I`m researching infusing steel with new magic."
msgstr "我现在没空给你打盔甲。我正在研究给钢铁注入新魔法。"

msgid "Which one is tempting?"
msgstr "哪一个让你动心？"

msgid "Will there be something hidden as Della expected? "
msgstr "真会像德拉预料的那样，藏着什么秘密吗？"

msgid "Do you know anything about <font color=@#006699@>weapon upgrade</font> by any chance? The true charm of a knight comes from the weapon. In other words, I mean that strong power can be created [forged?] into the weapon that you have!"
msgstr "你碰巧知道<font color=@#006699@>武器强化</font>吗？骑士真正的魅力来自武器。也就是说，强大的力量是可以被「锻造」进你手中武器里的！"

msgid "Darkness conceals the truth, but it cannot destroy it. Ha, just as expected, Karus was behind this one. They paid the Dark Knights to make it look like a random attack. Karus had only recently attacked, so we weren't expecting them back again so soon."
msgstr "黑暗会掩盖真相，却无法摧毁真相。哼，果然，幕后是卡鲁斯。他们收买了黑暗骑士，把这事伪装成随机袭击。卡鲁斯前不久才攻打过，我们压根没料到他们这么快又来。"

msgid "It's 'do' or 'die' here! And ¡®here' is Ronark Land, if you didn't know. The battles against El Morad here rage ever on. There'll be no peace until the day Karus' flag is raised over the whole territory."
msgstr "在这里，不成功便成仁！而且这儿就是罗纳克之地，别不知道。对艾莫拉德的战斗在这里永不停歇。除非卡鲁斯的旗帜插上整片土地，否则绝无宁日。"

msgid "Don't think, though, that El Morad is our only enemy here. Eveyone and everything here is our enemy! Remember that, and you might stand a chance. Of all our enemies here, the  Troll Conjuratorhas unrivaled strength and Darkness Spells. Wouldn't you like to give ¡®em a kicking? It'd be a good measure of your skills..."
msgstr "不过别以为艾莫拉德是我们在这里唯一的敌人。这里的一切、所有人都是我们的敌人！记住这一点，你或许才有一线生机。在这儿所有敌人里，巨魔召唤师拥有无人能及的力量和黑暗法术。你不想去揍他们一顿吗？正好也能掂量掂量你的本事……"

msgid "Master, you really gave it some out there! With your skills, you could be the next Outpost Captain! KeKe~"
msgstr "师父，你在外面可真拼！凭你的本事，下个前哨队长就是你了！咯咯～"

msgid "(Feels like he's going to be Top Dog in Karus...)"
msgstr "（感觉他日后会成为卡鲁斯的头号人物……）"

msgid "Master! [Blacksmith] Heppa, the most famous guy in Moradon, is looking for you. "
msgstr "师父！[铁匠]赫帕，莫拉登最有名的那位，正在找你。"

msgid "Not just anyone could do that. But you managed, and magnificently so. <selfname>!! You are truly one of the finest of Karus's Warriors, stopping at nothing to paint the wind with the blood of your enemies and raise our flag over Ronark Land!!"
msgstr "不是谁都能做到的。可你做到了，而且干得漂亮。<selfname>！！你真是卡鲁斯最优秀的战士之一，不惜以敌人之血染遍长空，把我们的旗帜插上罗纳克之地！！"

msgid "No one can match the Troll Conjurator's strength and Darkness Spells."
msgstr "没人能匹敌巨魔召唤师的力量和黑暗法术。"

msgid "It's 'do' or 'die' here! And ¡®here' is Ronark Land, if you didn't know. The battles against Karus here rage ever on. There'll be no peace until the day El Morad's flag is raised over the whole territory."
msgstr "在这里，不成功便成仁！而且这儿就是罗纳克之地，别不知道。对卡鲁斯的战斗在这里永不停歇。除非艾莫拉德的旗帜插上整片土地，否则绝无宁日。"

msgid "I know you`re a foreigner, but poise is the lifeblood of knighthood, tsk, tsk... |Haven`t you even heard of [item upgrade]?"
msgstr "我知道你是外乡人，可仪态是骑士精神的命脉，啧，啧……|你连[道具强化]都没听说过吗？"

msgid "I`ll give you a reward if you take the weapons and scroll I hand you and make a [practice dagger +4] with an anvil"
msgstr "你把我交给你的武器和卷轴拿去，在铁砧上做出一把[见习短剑+4]，我就给你奖励。"

msgid "Don't think, though, that Karus is our only enemy here. Eveyone and everything here is our enemy! Remember that, and you might stand a chance. Of all our enemies here, the  Troll Conjuratorhas unrivaled strength and Darkness Spells. Wouldn't you like to give ¡®em a kicking? It'd be a good measure of your skills..."
msgstr "不过别以为卡鲁斯是我们在这里唯一的敌人。这里的一切、所有人都是我们的敌人！记住这一点，你或许才有一线生机。在这儿所有敌人里，巨魔召唤师拥有无人能及的力量和黑暗法术。你不想去揍他们一顿吗？正好也能掂量掂量你的本事……"

msgid "(Feels like he's going to be Top Dog in El Morad...)"
msgstr "（感觉他日后会成为艾莫拉德的头号人物……）"

msgid "Not just anyone could do that. But you managed, and magnificently so. <selfname>!! You are truly one of the finest of El Morad's Warriors, stopping at nothing to paint the wind with the blood of your enemies and raise our flag over Ronark Land!!"
msgstr "不是谁都能做到的。可你做到了，而且干得漂亮。<selfname>！！你真是艾莫拉德最优秀的战士之一，不惜以敌人之血染遍长空，把我们的旗帜插上罗纳克之地！！"

msgid "Hey, <selfname>!! We're going against El Morad again shortly. But there's something I want you to take care of first. (Indicating the map) Here, and here... These are important strategic sites, and we need to take and hold them. One is a supply route; the other can be used to hit the enemy from the rear and cut-off their frontal assault."
msgstr "喂，<selfname>！！我们马上又要对艾莫拉德动手了。不过有件事我想先交给你办。（指着地图）这儿，还有这儿……这些都是重要的战略要地，我们必须夺下并守住。一个是补给线；另一个可以用来从背后打击敌人，切断他们的正面进攻。"

msgid "No doubt El Morad has the same idea, so it's vital that you get on this immediately.  Before you can secure these points fully, you'll first have to eliminate  Falcon and the  Crimson Wing"
msgstr "艾莫拉德肯定也打着同样的主意，所以你必须立刻行动。在完全控制这些要点之前，你得先除掉「猎鹰」和「绯红之翼」。"

msgid "Brilliant work Master, you've secured both areas. Time to report back to base I think."
msgstr "干得漂亮师父，两处都拿下了。我看是时候回基地复命了。"

msgid "Falcon and Crimson Wing are Harpies. Take ¡®em out by using their low intelligence against them."
msgstr "猎鹰和绯红之翼都是鹰身女妖。利用她们智力低下这一点来收拾她们。"

msgid "Nicely done! Great! We claim these strategic points in the name of Karus!"
msgstr "干得漂亮！太棒了！我们以卡鲁斯之名占领这些战略要点！"

msgid "Hey, <selfname>!! We're going against Karus again shortly. But there's something I want you to take care of first. (Indicating the map) Here, and here... These are important strategic sites, and we need to take and hold them. One is a supply route; the other can be used to hit the enemy from the rear and cut-off their frontal assault."
msgstr "喂，<selfname>！！我们马上又要对卡鲁斯动手了。不过有件事我想先交给你办。（指着地图）这儿，还有这儿……这些都是重要的战略要地，我们必须夺下并守住。一个是补给线；另一个可以用来从背后打击敌人，切断他们的正面进攻。"

msgid "No doubt Karus has the same idea, so it's vital that you get on this immediately.  Before you can secure these points fully, you'll first have to eliminate  Falcon and the  Crimson Wing"
msgstr "卡鲁斯肯定也打着同样的主意，所以你必须立刻行动。在完全控制这些要点之前，你得先除掉「猎鹰」和「绯红之翼」。"

msgid "Master! The upgrade is successful|Let`s take it to Heppa"
msgstr "师父！强化成功了|咱们把它带给赫帕吧。"

msgid "Nicely done! Great! We claim these strategic points in the name of El Morad!"
msgstr "干得漂亮！太棒了！我们以艾莫拉德之名占领这些战略要点！"

msgid "Blast. Why did I believe him?. Everything was running smoothly... But now we're facing the enemy front and back. Biiig trouble."
msgstr "该死。我怎么就信了他呢。一切原本都顺顺当当……可现在我们腹背受敌。大麻烦。"

msgid "Betrayal!!  Apostle of Piercing Cold has betrayed us! He promised to cover our flanks while we took El Morad's front lines. But now they've come around and are attacking our rear!. We're caught like a rat in a trap... damn!!"
msgstr "背叛！！「寒霜使徒」背叛了我们！他答应在我们攻打艾莫拉德正面防线时掩护我们侧翼。可现在他们却绕到背后袭击我们！我们像落进陷阱的老鼠一样被夹住了……可恶！！"

msgid "Now that the traitors have been dealt with, we must see to the El Moradian scum!"
msgstr "叛徒既已解决，接下来就该收拾艾莫拉德那帮渣滓了！"

msgid "Blast, my calculations were all wrong. I trusted the Apostles too much. Now they must be stopped, whatever the cost. For Karuusss!!"
msgstr "该死，我的盘算全错了。我太信任那些使徒了。现在必须不惜一切代价阻止他们。为了卡鲁uuus！！"

msgid "You've made a quite an impression! I can't tell you how inspiring it was having you fighting for us out there. So how did you do it? You brushed them aside like crumbs! You didn't do it all single-handedly, did you?"
msgstr "你可真让人刮目相看！你在外面为我们而战，那份振奋简直无法言表。那你是怎么做到的？你把他们像碎屑一样一扫而光！该不会全是你一个人干的吧？"

msgid "You need an item upgrade scroll to upgrade your weapon. If you bring me 5 Apples of Moradon, I will award you low quality item upgrade scroll. Let's talk in detail after you bring me Apples of Moradon.  "
msgstr "强化武器需要道具强化卷轴。你要是给我带来 5 个莫拉登苹果，我就赏你一张低级道具强化卷轴。等你把莫拉登苹果带来，咱们再细谈。"

msgid "Make a [practice dagger +4] using an anvil"
msgstr "用铁砧做出一把[见习短剑+4]。"

msgid "Now that the traitors have been dealt with, we must see to the Karusian scum!"
msgstr "叛徒既已解决，接下来就该收拾卡鲁斯那帮渣滓了！"

msgid "Blast, my calculations were all wrong. I trusted the Apostles too much. Now they must be stopped, whatever the cost. For El Morraaadd!!"
msgstr "该死，我的盘算全错了。我太信任那些使徒了。现在必须不惜一切代价阻止他们。为了艾莫拉aaad！！"

msgid "(From reading the letter, you learn that) the   Apostles of Flames are gathering on the northwest plains. The Apostles of Piercing Cold are joining them! The numbers are only an estimate, but even so... Damn! The news just gets better and better..."
msgstr "（读罢此信，你得知）火焰使徒们正在西北平原集结。寒霜使徒们也在加入他们！人数只是估计，但即便如此……该死！这消息真是一个比一个「精彩」……"

msgid "Well at least now we know what's going on, we have an advantage. After all, knowledge is half the battle. We must stop them before they grow too large."
msgstr "不过至少现在我们摸清了状况，占了先机。毕竟，知己知彼就是胜利的一半。必须趁他们尚未壮大之前阻止他们。"

msgid "Thank you for doing me this favor. I will pay you 100 Noahs for each. If something else comes up, you have to help me out again."
msgstr "谢谢你帮我这个忙。每一个我付你 100 诺亚。以后再有什么事，还得麻烦你。"

msgid "Apples of Moradon are sturdy hence very versatile. Bags made with them are extremely useful across-the-board."
msgstr "莫拉登苹果质地结实，因此用途极广。用它做的袋子方方面面都极其好用。"

msgid "You`ll find Kecoons to the right of Moradon, where it`s indicated on this map."
msgstr "凯昆就在莫拉登右边，地图上标的那个位置。"

msgid "Hey!! I told you to go buy a cheap upgradeable (+1) top from the store! |And don`t wear it. I don`t like taking clothes off people. Haha"
msgstr "喂！！我不是叫你去商店买一件便宜的、可强化的（+1）上衣吗？|还有别穿上身。我可不喜欢扒人衣服。哈哈。"

msgid "See the increase in your Attack Power and other indicators after the upgrade?? The anvil infuses weaponry or armor with magic powers.. Go to the anvil for upgrades |I`ll give you rewards for upgraded weapons"
msgstr "强化后你的攻击力和其他数值都涨了，看见了吗？？铁砧能给武器或盔甲注入魔力……要强化就去铁砧那儿|我会为强化过的武器给你奖励。"

msgid "<selfname>, as a token of my gratitude for your help last time, here`s a special medicine I developed. It`s a special gift just for you. "
msgstr "<selfname>，为感谢你上次的帮忙，这是我新研制的一种特效药，专门送给你的一份小心意。"

msgid "It`s called antifebrile and Apple of Moradon is the main ingredient. How about it? Can you get some for me? "
msgstr "它叫退烧药，主要成分就是莫拉登苹果。怎么样？能帮我弄些来吗？"

msgid "I`m glad you`re not declining my kindness. Thank you in advance."
msgstr "你肯领我的情，我就放心了。先谢啦。"

msgid "Hmm. You`re going to refuse my kindness? That`s too bad."
msgstr "嗯……你要拒绝我的好意吗？那太可惜了。"

msgid "Hmm. I need Apple of Moradon to make antifebrile."
msgstr "嗯……我需要莫拉登苹果来配退烧药。"

msgid "Master, you have the Apple of Moradon. Go to [Grand Merchant`s Daughter] Menissiah and receive antifebriles."
msgstr "师父，你已经拿到莫拉登苹果了。去[大商人之女]梅尼西亚那儿领退烧药吧。"

msgid "You finally brought Apple of Moradon. Here you are. I hope they`ll be of valuable use and I look forward to our next exchange."
msgstr "你总算把莫拉登苹果带来了。给你。希望它们能派上大用场，也期待咱们下次再合作。"

msgid "Master, I hear Menissiah is making new a potion."
msgstr "师父，我听说梅尼西亚在配一种新药水。"

msgid "Oh, you thought of me. Thank you. I`m studying how to move higher and faster than everyone else."
msgstr "哦，你心里还想着我。谢谢。我正在研究怎么才能比所有人都跳得更高、跑得更快。"

msgid "Just in time. I know it sounds thick-skinned, but I have another favor to ask you. I need Apple of Moradon to make this medicine."
msgstr "来得正好。我知道这话说得有点脸皮厚，可我还有件事要请你帮忙。配这种药需要莫拉登苹果。"

msgid "I`ll be able to make my experiment ingredients and yours as well, <selfname>, if only I had just five Apples of Moradon..."
msgstr "<selfname>，只要再给我五个莫拉登苹果，我就能把实验材料连同你的那份一起配出来了……"

msgid "How about it? Will you get them for me?"
msgstr "怎么样？愿意帮我弄来吗？"

msgid "Thank you so much. I will surely to complete it."
msgstr "太感谢了。我一定把它完成。"

msgid "Is that a No? Darn, what am I going to do?"
msgstr "这是拒绝吗？哎呀，那我可怎么办？"

msgid "I need 5 Apples of Moradon."
msgstr "我需要 5 个莫拉登苹果。"

msgid "Master, you collected all 5 Gavolt scales. Take them to Menissiah."
msgstr "师父，5 片加沃尔特鳞片你都集齐了。拿去交给梅尼西亚吧。"

msgid "I am finally be able to make potion. Please wait ."
msgstr "我终于能配药水了。请稍等。"

msgid "Here it is. Potion made with Menissiah`s care."
msgstr "来。这是梅尼西亚用心配制的药水。"

msgid "I mastered a potion production method which requires Apples of Moradon, but I haven`t been able to obtain the ingredients yet. I will give you the hasten potion if you  bring me Apples of Moradon. "
msgstr "我掌握了一种需要莫拉登苹果的药水配方，可材料一直凑不齐。你要是给我带来莫拉登苹果，我就把加速药水给你。"

msgid "Everyone knows Menissiah in Moradon.. They all warm to her on first encounter"
msgstr "莫拉登人人都认识梅尼西亚……大家头一回见她就喜欢上了她。"

msgid "A large load, regardless of weight, can be carried in the magic bag. Its production method is demanding and requires various ingredients one of which is multiple Apples of Moradon. I will give you compensation if you bring me Apples of Moradon."
msgstr "不管多重的东西都能装进魔法袋里。它的制法很讲究，需要各种材料，其中之一就是多个莫拉登苹果。你把莫拉登苹果带来，我就给你报酬。"

msgid "Silk spools can be obtained from the Worms in front of the castle. I will compensate you 100 Noahs for each spool."
msgstr "丝线轴可以从城堡前的蠕虫身上获得。每给我一卷丝线轴，我就付你 100 诺亚。"

msgid "Master, you collected all the Apples of Moradon. Menissiah will give you a reward for them."
msgstr "师父，莫拉登苹果你都集齐了。梅尼西亚会因此给你奖励的。"

msgid "Worms dwell in the windbreak forest in front of the castle. You`ll spot them right in front of the castle."
msgstr "蠕虫住在城堡前的防风林里。你就在城堡正前方能看见它们。"

msgid "You`re still short. Can you try a little harder?! Thank you"
msgstr "还差一点。再加把劲行不行？！谢谢。"

msgid "Tyons have disappeared to a certain extent, but they`re able to breed exceptional well. Their numbers are sure to increase again."
msgstr "泰昂已经消失了不少，可它们繁殖能力极强。数量肯定还会多起来。"

msgid "Are you going to help me?"
msgstr "你愿意帮我吗？"

msgid "Tyons penetrated the farm and are ruining the crops. There`s even a reward being offered for Tyons."
msgstr "泰昂闯进农场糟蹋庄稼了。现在甚至还有悬赏捉拿泰昂呢。"

msgid "This year`s harvest will be ruined because of the Tyons. Wish someone would get rid of them. "
msgstr "今年的收成就要被泰昂毁了。真希望有人能把它们除掉。"

msgid "I will award you handsomely if you eliminate the Tyons that penetrated the farm and bring me their meat. I`m counting on you."
msgstr "你要是能除掉闯进农场的泰昂、把它们的肉带给我，我必有重谢。全指望你了。"

msgid "Shouldn`t this be enough!? If we hand over the meat to the Farm Manager, we will get a large reward. "
msgstr "这些总该够了吧！？把肉交给农场管理员，我们就能领到一大笔赏钱。"

msgid "Tyons are stock monsters spotted in the vicinity of farms. There should be loads of them here."
msgstr "泰昂是农场附近常见的怪物。这附近应该多得是。"

msgid "Hmm, not bad. But they`ll soon multiply again as their breeding ability`s exceptional. Take a look outside. There`s already more of them lingering outside."
msgstr "嗯，不错。可它们繁殖力强，很快又会多起来。出去看看，外面已经又聚了一群。"

msgid "If you bring Tyon meat to the Farm Manager, he turns them into 10,000 Noahs."
msgstr "你把泰昂肉带给农场管理员，他会换成 10000 诺亚给你。"

msgid "Who are you supposed to be?"
msgstr "你是哪位？"

msgid "I thought I smelled something green. It was coming from you. "
msgstr "我就说闻到一股青涩味儿。原来是从你身上来的。"

msgid "Master. There`s rumors circulating that [Archmage] Drake is looking for people to entrust missions. "
msgstr "师父。外头都在传，[大法师]德雷克正在物色可托付任务的人。"

msgid "Wow, your own mother wouldn't even recognize you! Hee Hee! "
msgstr "哇，你亲妈都认不出你了！嘻嘻！"

msgid "His Royal Highness has personally assigned a mission to me for the first time in a long while. A war against the enemy should ensue shortly..."
msgstr "殿下难得亲自给我指派了一个任务。一场对敌之战想必很快就要打响了……"

msgid "If we exert pressure on the enemy there, it will be possible for us to infiltrate their mainland, then we will deposit a spy to hunt Lich who`s taken refuge near Kalluga Valley. As the Lich maintain intricate relations with powerful factions, the sole objective of this mission is to seize the Emblem of Karus and deliver it safely to our mainland.|Emblem of Karus is an essential ingredient for casting a great curse on the enemy nation using an ancient black magic I developed."
msgstr "我们在那边对敌人施压，就能趁机渗入他们的本土，再安插一名密探，去猎杀躲在卡卢加谷附近的巫妖。由于巫妖与各大势力关系盘根错节，本任务唯一目标就是夺取卡鲁斯徽章，并安全送回我们本土。|卡鲁斯徽章是施展我所研发的一种古老黑魔法、对敌国降下大诅咒时必不可少的材料。"

msgid "Wow, this is the Emblem of Karus. It might be dangerous for us to remain here. Let`s return to the mainland quickly."
msgstr "哇，这就是卡鲁斯徽章。我们继续待在这儿可能有危险。快回本土吧。"

msgid "Didn`t I tell you bring the Emblem of Karus?"
msgstr "我不是叫你把卡鲁斯徽章带来吗？"

msgid "Wow, you have safely collected the Emblem of Karus.. Good work. Your honor will increase accordingly as a result."
msgstr "哇，你把卡鲁斯徽章安全地带回来了……干得漂亮。你的声望也会随之提升。"

msgid "10 million EXP are awarded for infiltrating enemy mainland after winning the Lunar War and capturing Lich near Kalluga Valley and securing the Emblem of Karus. "
msgstr "在月之战争获胜后渗入敌国本土、于卡卢加谷附近擒获巫妖并夺获卡鲁斯徽章者，奖励 1000 万 EXP。"

msgid "Master, you also need the Nostrum of Constitution to learn the 70Lv and 75Lv skills. [Warrior Master] Skaki will tell you about that."
msgstr "师父，要学 70 级和 75 级技能，你还需要「体质秘药」。[战士大师]斯卡基会告诉你详情。"

msgid "Master, you also need the Stamp of Agility to learn the 72Lv and 75Lv skills. [Secret Agent] Clarence will tell you about that."
msgstr "师父，要学 72 级和 75 级技能，你还需要「敏捷印记」。[密探]克拉伦斯会告诉你详情。"

msgid "The border defending battle is held every day at 10 AM and 1, 3, 5 and 10 PM and 1 AM. And it is held additionally at 8 PM on Tuesday, Friday, Saturday and Sunday when there is no war. When the relevant time comes, the announcement for recruitment will be aired automatically so that application for participation can be made"
msgstr "边境防御战每天在上午 10 点、下午 1 点、3 点、5 点、10 点以及凌晨 1 点举行。此外，在没有战争的周二、周五、周六、周日晚 8 点加开一场。时间一到，招募公告会自动播报，届时即可报名参加。"

msgid "The word is that both Enigma and Cruel are in the outskirts of Ronark Land. There is no great danger now as they are quite far from here, but we might have a huge disaster in our hands if even just one of them was to make a move..."
msgstr "据说「谜」和「残酷」两个家伙都盘踞在罗纳克之地的郊外。他们离这儿还远，眼下没什么大危险，可只要其中一个动了手，我们恐怕就要大祸临头了……"

msgid "If you could take care of them both, I will give you a weapon made just for you. So what do you think?"
msgstr "你要是能把他俩都收拾了，我就给你打造一件专属你的武器。怎么样？"

msgid "Well.. You seem very busy. Return when you have completed the mission you already have.  Good luck then!"
msgstr "这个嘛……你看起来很忙。等把手头的任务做完再回来吧。祝好运！"

msgid "They were quite strong, weren't they, Master? Good job!"
msgstr "他们挺强的，是吧，师父？干得好！"

msgid "Did you get rid of them? (Perhaps they weren't that strong after all... I got scared for nothing...)|Hm~ well done. So, what equipment would you like?"
msgstr "你把他们除掉了？（搞不好他们本来也没那么强……我白担心了……）|嗯～干得漂亮。那么，你想要什么装备？"

msgid "Getting rid of their followers first could be a way. I heard that some of followers cast HP restoring spells."
msgstr "先除掉他们的随从或许是个办法。我听说有些随从会施放恢复 HP 的法术。"

msgid "The word is that both Hell Fire and Havoc are in the outskirts of Ronark Land. There is no great danger now as they are quite far from here, but we might have a huge disaster in our hands if even just one of them was to make a move..."
msgstr "据说「地狱火」和「浩劫」两个家伙都盘踞在罗纳克之地的郊外。他们离这儿还远，眼下没什么大危险，可只要其中一个动了手，我们恐怕就要大祸临头了……"

msgid "Master, Ronark Land seems to have many enemies posing threat. Let's look for [Outpost Captain] Elrod."
msgstr "师父，罗纳克之地似乎盘踞着不少虎视眈眈的敌人。咱们去找[前哨队长]埃尔罗德吧。"

msgid "It feels as if I am sitting on a bed of nails, with all these enemies suddenly appearing from nowhere to threaten Ronark Land and there is not one we can take lightly..."
msgstr "感觉就像坐在针毡上，这些敌人不知从哪儿冒出来，威胁着罗纳克之地，而且一个都不能掉以轻心……"

msgid "The biggest threats to Ronark Land are the four Patriarchs, and their followers..."
msgstr "罗纳克之地最大的威胁，是那四位「族长」和他们的随从……"

msgid "I think we've more or less completed the expedition mission, with this. "
msgstr "我看这下我们的远征任务差不多就算完成了。"

msgid "Have you dealt with all those followers of Patriarchs?! Wow~"
msgstr "你把那些族长的随从全收拾了？！哇～"

msgid "Since we lack the strength to defeat them ourselves, I am thinking of requesting for reinforcements. What do you think? Well.."
msgstr "凭我们自己的力量打不过他们，我在考虑请求增援。你觉得呢？唉……"

msgid "Master, Ronark Land seems to have many enemies posing threat. Let's look for [Outpost Captain] Della."
msgstr "师父，罗纳克之地似乎盘踞着不少虎视眈眈的敌人。咱们去找[前哨队长]德拉吧。"

msgid "You need an item called the Armband of Magic to change your job.  You can get the Armband of Magic when you bring 50 Gavolt Wings, 50 Zombie Eyes, and 50 Blood of Glyptodont to [Archmage] Drake."
msgstr "转职需要一种叫「魔力臂环」的道具。你给[大法师]德雷克带来 50 个加沃尔特之翼、50 个僵尸之眼和 50 滴 glyptodont 之血，就能拿到魔力臂环。"

msgid "Master, now you can learn the Absolute Power. Let's look for [Archmage] Drake."
msgstr "师父，现在你可以学「绝对之力」了。咱们去找[大法师]德雷克吧。"

msgid "Absolute Power... It is an amazing skill that briefly increases magical attack by 30%, so mastering the spell of Absolute Power will boost your magical attack power significantly. "
msgstr "绝对之力……这是个了不起的技能，能在短时间内使魔法攻击提升 30%，所以掌握绝对之力的咒文，将大幅提升你的魔法攻击力。"

msgid "I will give it to you if you pass my test. Win seven victories at the National Defence Combat at the upper reaches of the Kalluga Valley and bring me the Symbol of Victory.  Would you like to try?"
msgstr "你要是能通过我的考验，我就把它给你。去卡卢加峡谷上游的「国境防御战」中赢下七场胜利，把「胜利象征」带给我。想试试吗？"

msgid "Master, you have won seven victories at the National Defence Combat.  Let's go and visit [Archmage] Drake to get the Absolute Power scroll that he promised."
msgstr "师父，你在国境防御战中赢下了七场胜利。咱们去拜访[大法师]德雷克，领取他答应给的绝对之力卷轴吧。"

msgid "Oh, have you won seven times at the combat? You must have worked incredibly hard.  Right then, here is your Absolute Power."
msgstr "哦，你在比武中赢了七次？你一定下了苦功。那么，这是你的绝对之力。"

msgid "I will give you the Absolute Power scroll as a reward for your seven victories at the National Defence Combat. "
msgstr "作为你在国境防御战中七场胜利的奖赏，我把绝对之力卷轴给你。"

msgid "I hear that the Death Magician has appeared in Ronark Land.. Do you think it is true? Let's go and ask [Outpost Captain] Della about it."
msgstr "我听说死亡术士出现在罗纳克之地了……你觉得是真的吗？咱们去问问[前哨队长]德拉吧。"

msgid "I told you that you need the Armband of Magic, Cursed Bone, Feather of Harpy Queen and Kekuri Ring to change your job, didn't I? "
msgstr "我跟你说过转职需要魔力臂环、诅咒之骨、鹰后之羽和凯库里戒指，对吧？"

msgid "You need the Nostrum of Magic is required to learn the 70Lv and 80Lv skills, master. [Archmage] Drake will tell you about it."
msgstr "师父，要学 70 级和 80 级技能，你需要「魔力秘药」。[大法师]德雷克会告诉你详情。"

msgid "I see that you will soon reach the level of Archmage and be my equal.  When you reach that final stage of magicians, you get to learn the ultimate magic.  There is no being that can easily take on a magician who has learned the ultimate magic. Not even a god... |You can never complete that ultimate magic with some ordinary skills.  To complete the ultimate magic, you would need the Nostrum of Magic and a Stamp of Magic Power.  Moreover, those two items also require combining several different substances to make them."
msgstr "我看你很快就要达到大法师的境界，与我平起平坐了。当你走到法师的这最后阶段，就能习得终极魔法。没有哪个存在能轻易对付一个掌握了终极魔法的法师。哪怕是神也不行……|那终极魔法绝不是靠些寻常本事就能练成的。要练成终极魔法，你需要「魔力秘药」和「魔力印记」。而且这两样东西，还得把好几种不同的材料合起来才能做成。"

msgid "To start off, Nostrum of Magic requires 2 Feathers of Harpy Queen, 5 Venomous Tails of Lesath, and 2 Magic Powders to make.  So, do you feel like bringing them here?"
msgstr "先来说，魔力秘药需要 2 根鹰后之羽、5 条利萨思毒尾和 2 份魔法粉末才能做成。怎么样，有兴趣把它们带来吗？"

msgid "Master, you have collected all the materials needed for the Nostrum of Magic.  I really wonder what this ultimate magic could be."
msgstr "师父，魔力秘药所需的材料你都集齐了。我真想知道这终极魔法究竟是什么。"

msgid "Master. You have collected all the materials for needed for the Nostrum of Magic.  I really wonder what this ultimate magic could be."
msgstr "师父。魔力秘药所需的材料你都集齐了。我真想知道这终极魔法究竟是什么。"

msgid "To make the Nostrum of Magic, you need 2 Feathers of Harpy Queen, 5 Venomous Tails of Lesath, and 2 Magic Powders.  You must not miss even one."
msgstr "要做魔力秘药，你需要 2 根鹰后之羽、5 条利萨思毒尾和 2 份魔法粉末。一样都不能少。"

msgid "They used to be part of the Death Magicians and were a terror to everyone, but then they disappeared without any trace, as if they vanished into thin air. And now they are back. The ones who made everyone quiver in fear..."
msgstr "他们曾是死亡术士的一员，曾令所有人闻风丧胆，可后来却消失得无影无踪，仿佛凭空蒸发。而现在他们回来了——就是那群曾让所有人瑟瑟发抖的家伙……"

msgid " What about you... How good are you?? Ah~am I thinking too recklessly..."
msgstr "那你呢……你有多少斤两？？啊～我是不是太胆大妄为了……"

msgid "The ingredients are sufficient. This is the Magic Nostrum. Hyahh...|Here, the Magic Nostrum is an important object, but it`s useless in any task other than completing  Ultimate Magic."
msgstr "材料够了。这就是魔力秘药。嘿呀……|听着，魔力秘药虽然是要紧之物，但除了练成终极魔法之外，它别无用处。"

msgid "You are able to master Ultimate Magic when you reach the highest mage level(70Lv). Magic Nostrum and the Stamp of Magic Power is required to complete Ultimate Magic. [Archmage] Drake awards the Magic Nostrum for 2 Feather of Harpy Queen, 5 Tail of Lesth and 2 Magic Jewel Power. "
msgstr "当你达到法师最高等级（70 级）时，就能掌握终极魔法。练成终极魔法需要魔力秘药和魔力印记。[大法师]德雷克会以 2 根鹰后之羽、5 条利萨思之尾和 2 份魔法宝石之力，换给你魔力秘药。"

msgid "This needs to be a surgical strike - fast and precise."
msgstr "这得是一次外科手术式的打击——又快又准。"

msgid "We could be facing great numbers, so be prepared. We need to do a good job here. But don't think this will solve all our problems. New threats can appear from anywhere at anytime."
msgstr "我们可能要面对大批敌人，做好准备。这一仗必须打好。但别以为这就万事大吉了。新的威胁随时会从任何地方冒出来。"

msgid "It's a  Troll Conjurator|Nobody emits evil force like they do! If the evil force is allowed to spread, all Islante will be hell-bound to damnation. But why do I feel such peace as soon as I see you??"
msgstr "是巨魔召唤师|没人能像他们那样散发出邪气！这邪气要是蔓延开来，整个艾斯兰特都会坠入地狱。可为什么我一见到你，心里就这么平静呢？？"

msgid "[You found the Linnart Village Notice Board. Would you like to read it?}"
msgstr "[你发现了林纳特村公告板。要读一读吗？}"

msgid "[No more new notices.]"
msgstr "[没有新的公告了。]"

msgid "[Read the notices.]"
msgstr "[阅读公告。]"

msgid "Master, have you seen the village notice board in Linnart Village? Lots of quests... What're they all about?"
msgstr "师父，你见过林纳特村的公告板吗？好多任务……都是些什么呀？"

msgid "Master, There are no more new notices. Hee Hee! "
msgstr "师父，没有新的公告了。嘻嘻！"

msgid "Recently, in the Dark Land west of Linnart Village, large numbers of  Dragon Tooth Soldiers have been sighted. They've been attacking and plundering the merchants coming from Moradon. Travellers are advised to avoid the Dark Lands untill the Dragon Teeth Sodlers have been cleared out.||- Sentinel Hassan."
msgstr "近日，在林纳特村以西的黑暗之地，出现了大批龙牙兵。他们不断袭击、劫掠从莫拉登前来的商人。在龙牙兵被肃清之前，奉劝旅人避开黑暗之地。||——哨兵 哈桑。"

msgid "Master, you've already got a lot of other stuff to deal with."
msgstr "师父，你手头要处理的事已经够多了。"

msgid "Hopefully the Dark Lands will quite-down for awhile. Master, you tried incredibly hard."
msgstr "但愿黑暗之地能消停一阵子。师父，你真的尽力了。"

msgid "(Monologue) Hmmm... are the Dark Lands west from here?"
msgstr "（独白）嗯……黑暗之地是在这边往西吗？"

msgid "[Recently, many Dragon Tooth Soldiers have been seen west of Linnart Village in the Dark Lands]"
msgstr "[近日，林纳特村以西的黑暗之地出现了许多龙牙兵]"

msgid "[You found the Laiva Village Notice Board. Would you like to read it?}"
msgstr "[你发现了莱瓦村公告板。要读一读吗？}"

msgid "Master, have you seen the village notice board in Laiva Village? Lots of quests... What're they all about?"
msgstr "师父，你见过莱瓦村的公告板吗？好多任务……都是些什么呀？"

msgid "Recently, in Blue Feather's Valley, southeast of Laiva Village, large numbers of  Dragon Tooth Solders have been sighted. They've been attacking and plundering the merchants coming from Moradon. Travellers are warned to steer clear of Blue Feather's Valley untill the Dragon Tooth Soldiers have been dealt with.||                  - Sentinel Beth."
msgstr "近日，在莱瓦村东南的蓝羽谷，出现了大批龙牙兵。他们不断袭击、劫掠从莫拉登前来的商人。在龙牙兵被清除之前，奉劝旅人切勿靠近蓝羽谷。||——哨兵 贝丝。"

msgid "Blue Feather's Valley will become quite for some time? Master, you tried hard."
msgstr "蓝羽谷会消停一阵子了？师父，你尽力了。"

msgid "(Monologue) Hmm... is Blue Feather Valley southeast from here?"
msgstr "（独白）嗯……蓝羽谷是在这边东南方向吗？"

msgid "[Recently, many Dragon Tooth Soldiers have been appearing southeast of Laiva Village in Blue Feather  Valley]"
msgstr "[近日，莱瓦村东南的蓝羽谷出现了许多龙牙兵]"

msgid "Recently, in the Dark Land west of Linnart Village, vast numbers of  Dragon Tooth Soldiers have been sighted. They've been attacking and plundering the merchants coming from Moradon. Travellers are advised to avoid the Dark Lands untill the rest of the Dragon Tooth Sodlers have been cleared out.||- Sentinel Hassan."
msgstr "近日，在林纳特村以西的黑暗之地，出现了大批龙牙兵。他们不断袭击、劫掠从莫拉登前来的商人。在残余龙牙兵被肃清之前，奉劝旅人避开黑暗之地。||——哨兵 哈桑。"

msgid "Recently, in Blue Feather's Valley, southeast of Laiva Village, vast numbers of  Dragon Tooth Solders have been sighted. They've been attacking and plundering the merchants coming from Moradon. Travellers are warned to steer clear of Blue Feather's Valley untill the rest of the Dragon Tooth Soldiers have been dealt with.||                  - Sentinel Beth."
msgstr "近日，在莱瓦村东南的蓝羽谷，出现了大批龙牙兵。他们不断袭击、劫掠从莫拉登前来的商人。在残余龙牙兵被清除之前，奉劝旅人切勿靠近蓝羽谷。||——哨兵 贝丝。"

msgid "[Recently, more Dragon Tooth Soldiers have been seen west of Linnart Village in the Dark Lands]"
msgstr "[近日，林纳特村以西的黑暗之地又出现了更多龙牙兵]"

msgid "[Recently, more Dragon Tooth Soldiers have been appearing southeast of Laiva Village in Blue Feather  Valley]"
msgstr "[近日，莱瓦村东南的蓝羽谷又出现了更多龙牙兵]"

msgid "It's rumored they're planning to join a  Dragon Tooth Skeleton Squad Leader to replenish the men they lost plundering the Dark Lands. If they do get together, innocent deaths will sky rocket... Linnart Village's warriors must unite to stop the soldiers and protect the Dark Lands!!||            - Sentinel Hashan."
msgstr "据传，他们打算与一支龙牙骷髅小队长会合，补足在劫掠黑暗之地时损失的人手。一旦他们真的汇合，无辜者的死伤将直线上升……林纳特村的战士必须团结起来，阻止这些士兵，守护黑暗之地！！||——哨兵 哈桑。"

msgid "Wow, you even creamed the Dragon Knight Squad Leader! It's only a matter of time before the whole lot crumbles!"
msgstr "哇，你连龙骑小队长都干掉了！这帮人全线崩溃只是时间问题！"

msgid "(Monologue) The Dragon Tooth Skeleton Squad Leader's reinforcements will be going past... round about here. Hmmm... not long now."
msgstr "（独白）龙牙骷髅小队长的援兵马上就要经过……大概就在这一带。嗯……快了。"

msgid "[The Dragon Tooth Soldiers who have been plundering the Dark Lands, and  the Dragon Tooth Skeleton's Squad Leader, are planning to get together...]"
msgstr "[一直在黑暗之地劫掠的龙牙兵，与龙牙骷髅小队长，正计划会合……]"

msgid "It's rumored they're planning to join a  Dragon Tooth Commander to replenish the men they lost plundering the Dark Lands. If they do get together, innocent deaths will sky rocket... Laiva Village's warriors must unite to stop the soldiers and protect the Dark Lands!!||            - Sentinel Hashan."
msgstr "据传，他们打算与一名龙牙指挥官会合，补足在劫掠黑暗之地时损失的人手。一旦他们真的汇合，无辜者的死伤将直线上升……莱瓦村的战士必须团结起来，阻止这些士兵，守护黑暗之地！！||——哨兵 哈桑。"

msgid "(Monologue) The Dragon Tooth Commander's reinforcements will be going past... round about here. Hmmm... not long now."
msgstr "（独白）龙牙指挥官的援兵马上就要经过……大概就在这一带。嗯……快了。"

msgid "[The Dragon Tooth Soldiers who have been plundering the Blue Feather Valley, and  the Dragon Tooth Skeleton's Squad Leader, are planning to get together...]"
msgstr "[一直在蓝羽谷劫掠的龙牙兵，与龙牙骷髅小队长，正计划会合……]"

msgid "I feel it... They are resurrecting... Any true knights of Karus  must go immediately to the Plains of Silence!! And STOP THEM! Their strength will overwhelm Karus if they are not put down. Do so. Now.||                - Archmage Drake."
msgstr "我感觉到了……他们正在复活……卡鲁斯所有真正的骑士必须立刻赶往寂静平原！！阻止他们！若不镇压，他们的力量将压垮卡鲁斯。立刻动手。现在就去。||——大法师 德雷克。"

msgid "Errr~ what happens if they resurrect again?"
msgstr "呃……要是他们又复活了会怎么样？"

msgid "(Monologue) The Leech's resurrecting in... The Plains of Silence. It's southwest from here."
msgstr "（独白）那个尸鬼正在……寂静平原复活。在这儿的西南方。"

msgid "I feel it... They are resurrecting... Any true knights of El Morad  must go immediately to the  Ruins of Kalia Village!! And stop their resurrection! Their strength will overwhelm El Morad if they are not put down. Do so. Now.||                - Archmage Drake."
msgstr "我感觉到了……他们正在复活……艾莫拉德所有真正的骑士必须立刻赶往卡利亚村遗迹！！阻止他们复活！若不镇压，他们的力量将压垮艾莫拉德。立刻动手。现在就去。||——大法师 德雷克。"

msgid "(Monologue) The Leech's resurrecting in... The Ruins of Kalia Village It's northeast from here."
msgstr "（独白）那个尸鬼正在……卡利亚村遗迹复活。在这儿的东北方。"

msgid "(Monologue)... Must stop their resurrection at the Ruins of Kalia Village!"
msgstr "（独白）……必须在卡利亚村遗迹阻止他们复活！"

msgid "(Monologue)... Must stop their resurrection in the Ruins of Kalia Village!!"
msgstr "（独白）……必须在卡利亚村遗迹阻止他们复活！！"

msgid "God is angry with us. Karus' legacy, and Linnart Village's precious possession, the  Berubasi Relic Site, has been taken by a sect of Esoteric Buddhist priests. Would someone please drive them out, thus sparing us all from god's wrath. Thankyou. ? Grand Celebrant Murca."
msgstr "神在向我们降怒。卡鲁斯的遗产、林纳特村的至宝——贝鲁巴西遗迹遗址，已被一伙密教祭司占据。求哪位高人把他们赶出去，好让我们免受神谴。多谢。？大祭司长 穆尔卡。"

msgid "We're not too late are we?"
msgstr "我们还不算太晚吧？"

msgid "(Monologue) Were the Esoteric Buddhist priests called Deruvish?"
msgstr "（独白）那些密教祭司是叫德鲁维什吗？"

msgid "[Karus' legacy, Linnart Village's precious possession the Berubasi Relic Site, has been over-run by Esoteric Buddhist priests..."
msgstr "[卡鲁斯的遗产、林纳特村的至宝贝鲁巴西遗迹遗址，已被密教祭司侵占……"

msgid "God is angry with us. El Morad's legacy, and Laiva Village's precious possession, the  Relic Site of Temple, has been taken by a sect of Esoteric Buddhist priests. Please, somebody, drive them out and save El Morad from god's wrath. ? Grand Celebrant Helena."
msgstr "神在向我们降怒。艾莫拉德的遗产、莱瓦村的至宝——神殿遗迹遗址，已被一伙密教祭司占据。求求哪位高人把他们赶出去，把艾莫拉德从神谴中拯救出来。？大祭司长 海伦娜。"

msgid "[El Morad's legacy, Laiva Village's precious possession the Relic Site of Temple, is swarming with Esoteric Buddhist priests."
msgstr "[艾莫拉德的遗产、莱瓦村的至宝神殿遗迹遗址，现在挤满了密教祭司。"

msgid "(Monologue) Were the Esoteric Buddhist priests called Apostle?"
msgstr "（独白）那些密教祭司是叫使徒吗？"

msgid "           - Offical Notice -||I have killed millions of monsters, and I've never been afraid for my life. But! Those Trolls were a real pants-filler. I nearly died several times fighting them, but next time they won't be so lucky. That's because I'm going to go back there and rip them some new ones! Anyone else who wants a piece, come and meet me at the Waste Land!! "
msgstr "——官方公告——||我宰过的怪物数以百万计，从没为自己的小命担心过。可是！那些巨魔可真把我吓得屁滚尿流。跟他们干仗我死了好几回，可下一回就没那么走运了。因为我要杀回去，把他们揍个稀烂！还有谁想来分一杯羹，就到荒地来找我！！"

msgid "Well, the Trolls were just as tough as advertised. But, errr~ Master, you killed them all! Ha Ha Ha!"
msgstr "唉，这些巨魔果然跟传闻一样硬。不过，呃～师父，你把他们全宰了！哈哈哈！"

msgid "(Monologue) Must get to the Waste Land..."
msgstr "（独白）必须赶到荒地……"

msgid "[Whoever wants to, erm, ¡®share the glory', come to the Waste Land!]"
msgstr "[谁想来，呃，「分享这份荣耀」，就到荒地来！]"

msgid "           - Offical Notice -||I have killed millions of monsters, and I've never been afraid for my life. But! Those Trolls were a real bed-wetter. I nearly died several times fighting them, but next time they won't be so lucky. That's because I'm going to go back there and rip them some new ones! Anyone else who wants a piece, come and meet me at the Revival Hole!! "
msgstr "——官方公告——||我宰过的怪物数以百万计，从没为自己的小命担心过。可是！那些巨魔可真把我吓得尿了裤子。跟他们干仗我死了好几回，可下一回就没那么走运了。因为我要杀回去，把他们揍个稀烂！还有谁想来分一杯羹，就到复活之洞来找我！！"

msgid "(Monologue) Must go to the Revival Hole..."
msgstr "（独白）必须去复活之洞……"

msgid "[Who want to enjoy the glory together come to the Revival Hole!!]"
msgstr "[想一同分享荣耀的，就到复活之洞来！！]"

msgid "Not long ago, in the Valley of Dry Wind, I noticed an incredible increase in the number of Harpy. Everyone knows what Harpies are like... I'm concerned that if we don't do something about them, they'll overtake the whole village!||          - Weapon Merchant Mori."
msgstr "前不久，在枯风谷，我注意到鹰身女妖的数量激增。谁都知道鹰身女妖是什么德行……我担心要是再不采取点措施，她们会把整个村子都占了！||——武器商人 森。"

msgid "Huh~ Looks like the Linnart Village folk are quite upset about these feathered dames."
msgstr "哼～看来林纳特村的人对这些长羽毛的娘们儿头疼得很。"

msgid "(Monologue) Have to take extra care here not to pull whole bunches of them in one go."
msgstr "（独白）在这儿可得格外小心，别一口气把整群都拉过来。"

msgid "Not long ago, in Blue Feather Valley, I noticed an incredible increase in the number of Harpy. Everyone knows what Harpies are like... I'm concerned that if we don't do something about them, they'll overtake the whole village!||          - Weapon Merchant Falthus."
msgstr "前不久，在蓝羽谷，我注意到鹰身女妖的数量激增。谁都知道鹰身女妖是什么德行……我担心要是再不采取点措施，她们会把整个村子都占了！||——武器商人 法尔苏斯。"

msgid "Huh~ Looks like the aiva Village folk are quite upset about these feathered dames."
msgstr "哼～看来莱瓦村的人对这些长羽毛的娘们儿头疼得很。"

msgid "It is of great concern that the number of Harpies is increasing dramatically in the Valley of Dry Wind."
msgstr "枯风谷里鹰身女妖数量急剧增加，令人十分担忧。"

msgid "It is of great concern that the number of Harpies is increasing dramatically in Blue Feather Valley."
msgstr "蓝羽谷里鹰身女妖数量急剧增加，令人十分担忧。"

msgid "You have already received a present today. So then, I will see you tomorrow."
msgstr "你今天已经领过一份礼物了。那么，明天再见。"

msgid "<selfname>... Welcome.|How have you been? It's already been a month since Moradon Castle was re-built. I think you're used to the place now... Heh. Anyway, I've prepared a little present for you this time, I hope you like it."
msgstr "<selfname>……欢迎。|近来可好？莫拉登城堡重建已经一个月了。我看你现在也习惯这儿了……哼。不管怎样，这次我又给你备了一份小礼物，希望你喜欢。"

msgid "This time, I thought a, erm... What was it? umm... I had the list somewhere...(searches~)... ah, here it is. Right, this time I've prepared an Ascent Scroll, a Spirit of Merchant and a Bridegroom, Bride Transformation Scroll. The important thing to remember here is, that everthing is free!! Do you like it?"
msgstr "这次我想送的，呃……是什么来着？唔……清单我放哪儿了……（翻找～）……啊，在这儿。对，这次我备了一张「回城卷轴」、一个「商人之魂」，还有一张「新郎、新娘变身卷轴」。重点是，这些全都是免费的！！喜欢吗？"

msgid "Have a great day! And if you're passing by again, come in and see me for more goodies. Byee!"
msgstr "祝你今天愉快！要是再路过，就进来找我领更多好东西吧。拜拜！"

msgid "Welcome. What's up?"
msgstr "欢迎。有事吗？"

msgid "This is...  the promise of training. <selfname>, you have already made it to 35, that is amazing. It seems that I just met you just a few days ago, and I can't believe that you've already made it to level 35!"
msgstr "这是……训练之约。<selfname>，你都已经到 35 级了，真了不起。感觉前几天才刚认识你，真不敢相信你都已经 35 级了！"

msgid "This is...  the promise of training. <selfname>, could you visit me again after you reach level 35?"
msgstr "这是……训练之约。<selfname>，等你到 35 级之后，能再来看看我吗？"

msgid "You will be going through many trials while training. I hope my gift will help you."
msgstr "修炼路上你会经历许多考验。希望我的礼物能帮上你。"

msgid "Hmm... Your inventory is full."
msgstr "嗯……你的背包满了。"

msgid "If you have a chance, could you take a moment to visit Cougar? You might be able to get the information that you will need during your adventures from <slefname>... well, then, thank you."
msgstr "有机会的话，能不能去拜访一下库伽？你或许能从<slefname>那儿打听到冒险途中需要的情报……那，多谢了。"

msgid "This is the mission I can assign you now... "
msgstr "这是我现在能指派给你的任务……"

msgid "Hmm... a stranger- It might be your first adventure here in El Morad. Nice to meet you.- I'm Jalk, a Sentinel at the El Morad Castle. I'm at your service.-If you have time, could you do me a favor?"
msgstr "嗯……一位生面孔。这大概是你在艾莫拉德的第一次冒险吧。幸会。我是雅尔克，艾莫拉德城堡的一名哨兵。愿为你效劳。要是有空，能帮我个忙吗？"

msgid "Here in the mainland, we have Shadow Seekers, and they're notorious for their disturbance to our people. Could you give us a hand dealing with them?"
msgstr "在这本土上，我们这儿有「影寻者」，他们以滋扰我们的百姓而出了名。你能帮我们收拾他们吗？"

msgid "And listen, Sir, you need weapons, this is the place. I got all you need up to Level 35."
msgstr "听着，先生，你需要武器的话，来对地方了。35 级以内你要的我这儿全有。"

msgid "You seem to carry heavy responsibilities."
msgstr "你似乎肩负着重任。"

msgid "You must be still hunting... Don't give up!!"
msgstr "你肯定还在打怪……别放弃！！"

msgid "Oh~ you tried very hard. I hope you did not hurt yourself. As a token of our appreciation, I will give you my weapon. Here, you'll have an easier time hunting with this weapon. Please pick one item you like among them."
msgstr "哦～你真的很努力。希望你没伤到自己。为表谢意，我把我的武器送给你。来，拿着它打怪会轻松些。从里面挑一件你喜欢的吧。"

msgid "How is your adventure here in the mainland? Isn't it tough? Haha-just like before, I came here to ask you to hunt. The target is Saber Tooth... They're pretty tough, but probably a worthy challenge for a stout adventurer like yourself!"
msgstr "你在这本土上的冒险怎么样？挺辛苦吧？哈哈——跟以前一样，我这回来是想请你去打怪。目标是剑齿虎……它们相当难缠，但对你这样健壮的冒险者来说，或许正是个值得一战的对手！"

msgid "I will give you useful armor if you complete the hunting."
msgstr "你要是完成讨伐，我就给你好用的盔甲。"

msgid "Well-done. The reward is the armor that is supplied only to the Palace Guard, and I'm sure it might be useful for you."
msgstr "干得漂亮。这份奖励是只有近卫宫卫队才配发的盔甲，相信对你会有用。"

msgid "The Apes around here are acting up...It's actually a serious problem because Rage is out of action."
msgstr "这附近的巨猿最近闹腾得厉害……因为「暴怒」出不了手，这还真是个大麻烦。"

msgid "Not long ago, I was wounded in battle and I wanted to call you for help, but you already had too many missions, and no one else could help."
msgstr "前不久我在战斗中负了伤，本想叫你来帮忙，可你手头任务已经太多，而又没有别人能帮。"

msgid "Apes... ."
msgstr "巨猿……"

msgid "You've conquered those oversized and foul smelling Apes?! Thank you very much ? This is a sign of my appreciation, use it well."
msgstr "你把那些个头超大、臭气熏天的巨猿都征服了？！太感谢了！这是我的一点心意，好好用。"

msgid "Welcome. Nice to meet you. I'm Clark. I visit many places around Moradon for trading. I have something to urgently tell you. [Scroll Merchant] Karon lost some materials she needed for making a new scroll. She's asked me to find some of the items, but I'm having difficulty."
msgstr "欢迎。幸会。我是克拉克。我为做生意跑遍莫拉登各地。有件事得赶紧告诉你。[卷轴商人]卡伦做新卷轴需要的一些材料弄丢了。她托我找几样东西，可我正犯难呢。"

msgid "What... How did you know about that? Nobody knows about it... Well, to be honest I don't know too much either. All I know is that Karus offered to secretly trade >Oaths of Darkness nothing more."
msgstr "什么……你怎么会知道那件事？没人知道啊……好吧，老实说我也不太清楚。我只知道卡鲁斯提议秘密交易「黑暗誓言」，仅此而已。"

msgid "This is the only thing that I learned to do, and that I can do. Haha~"
msgstr "这是我唯一学会、也唯一会做的事。哈哈～"

msgid "From what I've heard, you're the ideal candidate for the quest. Can you do it?"
msgstr "据我所知，你正是这个任务的理想人选。你能办吗？"

msgid "Master, you also need the Stamp of Magic Power to learn the 70v, 72Lv and 75Lv skills. [Archmage] Drake will tell you about it."
msgstr "师父，要学 70 级、72 级和 75 级技能，你还需要「魔力印记」。[大法师]德雷克会告诉你详情。"

msgid "Besides the Nostrum of Magic, you also need a Stamp of Magic Power to complete the ultimate magic. What a Stamp of Magic Power does is, that it continuously replenishes the magic power of the caster using the ultimate magic, which consumes magic power infinitely.|Using the ultimate magic is that dangerous. But as someone who has committed himself to the study of magic, don't you think it worth the challenge?"
msgstr "除了魔力秘药，要练成终极魔法你还需要「魔力印记」。魔力印记的作用，是为施放终极魔法的施法者持续补充魔力，因为终极魔法会无限地消耗魔力。|施展终极魔法就是这么危险。可作为一名投身魔法研究的人，你不觉得这值得一搏吗？"

msgid "To make a Stamp of Magic Power, you need 1 Lupus Pendant,  1 Lycaon's Pendant, and one Silver Bar. So. Do you feel like bringing them here?"
msgstr "要做一枚魔力印记，你需要 1 个天狼吊坠、1 个狼王吊坠和 1 根银锭。怎么样？有兴趣把它们带来吗？"

msgid "Master, you`ve collected all the ingredients needed for making the Stamp of Magic Power. I can`t believe this is all it takes to make it."
msgstr "师父，做魔力印记所需的材料你都集齐了。真不敢相信做成它就靠这些。"

msgid "You have safely completed this mission as well, master~."
msgstr "这个任务你也顺利完成了，师父～。"

msgid "How did you manage to defeat those Death Magicians while still fighting in the battles against Karus?? Wow~"
msgstr "你怎么能在还忙着跟卡鲁斯作战的同时，又干掉了那些死亡术士？？哇～"

msgid "To make a Stamp of Magic Power, you need 1 Lupus Pendant,  1 Lycaon's Pendant, and one Silver Bar."
msgstr "要做一枚魔力印记，你需要 1 个天狼吊坠、1 个狼王吊坠和 1 根银锭。"

msgid "Here, this is the Stamp of Magic Power. It possesses unlimited magic power but it`s useless in any task other than completing Ultimate Magic."
msgstr "来，这就是魔力印记。它拥有无穷的魔力，但除了练成终极魔法之外别无用处。"

msgid "You are able to master Ultimate Magic when you reach the highest mage level(70Lv). Magic Nostrum and the Stamp of Magic Power is required to complete Ultimate Magic. [Archmage] Drake awards the Stamp of Magic Power 30 Dragon Teeth Soldier bones, 30 sapphires, and Silver Bar."
msgstr "当你达到法师最高等级（70 级）时，就能掌握终极魔法。练成终极魔法需要魔力秘药和魔力印记。[大法师]德雷克会以 30 根龙牙兵骸骨、30 颗蓝宝石和银锭，换给你魔力印记。"

msgid "Master, have you heard of the essential collectible for high-ranking knights? I heard [Archmage] Drake knows about it.."
msgstr "师父，你听说过高阶骑士必备的收藏品吗？我听说[大法师]德雷克知道这回事……"

msgid "You`ve already reached that position as well. Magic Power is certainly an essential material used by high-ranking knights in mastering skills and magic."
msgstr "你也已经走到那个阶段了。魔力确实是高阶骑士掌握技能和魔法时必不可少的材料。"

msgid "Here's the deal. You want Magic Powder you got to get me 3 Sapphires, 3 Crystals and 3 Opals."
msgstr "这么着吧。你想要魔法粉末，就得给我弄来 3 颗蓝宝石、3 块水晶和 3 颗蛋白石。"

msgid "Master, all the materials for Magic Powder have been gathered. Hurry and see [Archmage] Drake."
msgstr "师父，做魔法粉末的材料都凑齐了。快去见[大法师]德雷克吧。"

msgid "Nuh-uh. I need 3 Sapphires to make Magic Powder."
msgstr "不行不行。做魔法粉末我需要 3 颗蓝宝石。"

msgid "Nuh-uh. I need 3 Crystals to make Magic Powder."
msgstr "不行不行。做魔法粉末我需要 3 块水晶。"

msgid "Nuh-uh. I need 3 Opals to make Magic Powder."
msgstr "不行不行。做魔法粉末我需要 3 颗蛋白石。"

msgid "Hmm. You brought all the ingredients I enumerated.|Here you are. You too will soon be able to employ rare and exceptional technique."
msgstr "嗯。我列的材料你都带来了。|给你。你很快也能施展稀罕而高超的技艺了。"

msgid "Higher level magic and skills are not granted automatically. Some can only be crafted from items that must be collected. Of these, Magic Powder is the most sought after. It can be obtained from [Archmage] Drake if you bring him 5 Sapphires, 5 Crystals and 5 Opals. "
msgstr "更高级的魔法和技能不会自动到手。有些只能靠收集来的道具合成。其中，魔法粉末最为抢手。你给[大法师]德雷克带去 5 颗蓝宝石、5 块水晶和 5 颗蛋白石，就能从他那儿换到魔法粉末。"

msgid "Master, do you know of Ssohn Magic? I heard Archmage Drake is looking for someone to teach it to."
msgstr "师父，你听说过「索恩魔法」吗？我听说大法师德雷克正在找人传授它。"

msgid "Do you know of `Ssohn` magic? The most brutal high-level black magic, it attacks the selected target simultaneously absorbing the opponent`s constitution. Since you`re a figure already making substantial contribution to our nation, I thought it will be all right for me to teach it to you."
msgstr "你听说过「索恩」魔法吗？那是最凶残的高级黑魔法，会同时攻击选定目标并吸收对手的体质。既然你已经是对本国有相当贡献的人物，我想传授给你也无妨。"

msgid "Sun Magic requires 3 Magic Powers and the 1 M Noahs needed to operate the Magic Anvil. So, will you gather the materials needed to learn Sun Magic?"
msgstr "太阳魔法需要 3 份魔法粉末，以及运转魔法铁砧所需的 100 万诺亚。那么，你愿意去凑齐学习太阳魔法所需的材料吗？"

msgid "Master, all the Ssohn Magic ingredients have been collected. Let`s go seek out [Archmage] Drake."
msgstr "师父，索恩魔法的材料都凑齐了。咱们去找[大法师]德雷克吧。"

msgid "You`re short on Noahs. Where did you spend them all?"
msgstr "你诺亚不够花了。都花哪儿去了？"

msgid "3 Magic Powders are required to complete Sun Magic."
msgstr "练成太阳魔法需要 3 份魔法粉末。"

msgid "You will now be able to employ Ssohn magic. Please continue your pursuit of magic studies."
msgstr "你现在可以施展索恩魔法了。请继续钻研你的魔法之道。"

msgid "The Sun Magic Scroll must be crafted in order to learn Sun Magic. You can gain the Sun Magic Scroll from [Archmage] Drake when you bring him 3 Magic Powders and 1 M Noahs."
msgstr "要学太阳魔法，必须先制出太阳魔法卷轴。你给[大法师]德雷克带去 3 份魔法粉末和 100 万诺亚，就能从他那儿拿到太阳魔法卷轴。"

msgid "Master, I hear [Archmage] Drake is giving a lecture on the Impact Magic Scroll. Let`s go check it out."
msgstr "师父，我听说[大法师]德雷克在开讲「冲击魔法卷轴」。咱们去看看吧。"

msgid "The Impact Magic Scroll is remarkably useful for a Mage. If you wish to learn it, bring me 7 Insignias of Victor as well as 1.5 M Noahs. For your information, the Insignia of Victor is awarded when you prove to be victorious in National Border Defense Battle."
msgstr "冲击魔法卷轴对法师来说极为实用。你想学的话，就给我带来 7 枚勇士勋章和 150 万诺亚。顺便告诉你，勇士勋章是在国境防御战中证明自己获胜时颁发的。"

msgid "Nothing worth having is ever easy. 7 Insignias of Victor may be obtained by proving your worth against your enemy in National Border Defense Battle."
msgstr "值得拥有的东西从不会轻易到手。7 枚勇士勋章，要靠你在国境防御战中向敌人证明自己的实力才能获得。"

msgid "Master, all 7 Insignias of Victor have been gathered!"
msgstr "师父，7 枚勇士勋章都集齐了！"

msgid "Listen, didn`t I tell you the 3rd Armor Set(helmet, top, bottom) is needed for the Goblin Armor Formalwear?"
msgstr "听着，我不是跟你说过，哥布林正装护甲需要第 3 套盔甲（头盔、上衣、下装）吗？"

msgid "You brought all the required armor. I`ll be right back.|Here. Isn`t it a nice armor compared to the name? "
msgstr "需要的盔甲你都带来了。我马上回来。|给。比起它的名字，这盔甲不赖吧？"

msgid "Goblin Armor Formalwear can be obtained from [Archmage] Drake. The 3rd Armor Set(helmet, top, bottom) is needed to acquire the Goblin Armor Formalwear."
msgstr "哥布林正装护甲可以从[大法师]德雷克那里获得。要拿到哥布林正装护甲，需要第 3 套盔甲（头盔、上衣、下装）。"

msgid "Master, I hear that a lot of preparation goes into obtaining Impact Magic Scroll. [Archmage] Drake should know the details."
msgstr "师父，我听说要拿到冲击魔法卷轴得做不少准备。具体细节[大法师]德雷克应该清楚。"

msgid "In truth, the Goblin Armor Formalwear I made for you plus gauntlet and boots are combined to make a complete Goblin Armor. This is someone`s special request. Can you bring them?"
msgstr "说实话，我给你做的这件哥布林正装护甲，再加上护手和靴子，就能凑成一套完整的哥布林护甲。这是有人特意托我做的。你能把它们带来吗？"

msgid "To make it, I need to combine the Goblin Armor Formalwear you`re wearing and the 3rd Armor Set(gauntlet and boots). Want to give it a try?"
msgstr "要做成它，得把你身上穿的哥布林正装护甲和第 3 套盔甲（护手和靴子）合起来。想试试吗？"

msgid "Master, you have acquired the Goblin Armor Formalwear you`re wearing and the 3rd Armor Set. Let`s go back to the Archmage to receive the complete Goblin Armor. "
msgstr "师父，你已经拿到了身上穿的哥布林正装护甲和第 3 套盔甲。咱们回大法师那儿领完整的哥布林护甲吧。"

msgid "I told you the Goblin Armor Formalwear and 3rd Armor Set(gauntlet and boots) are needed to make the complete Goblin Armor!"
msgstr "我跟你说过，做成完整的哥布林护甲需要哥布林正装护甲和第 3 套盔甲（护手和靴子）！"

msgid "Hmm. You have collected all the required objects. I will make the complete Goblin Armor for you soon. |Here it is. This is the ultimate Goblin Armor. Looks good."
msgstr "嗯。需要的东西你都集齐了。我这就给你做完整的哥布林护甲。|来。这就是究极哥布林护甲。看着不错吧。"

msgid "Goblin Armor Formalwear and 3rd Armor Set(gauntlet and boots) are needed to make the complete Goblin Armor. Take the ingredients to [Archmage] Drake for receive it."
msgstr "做成完整的哥布林护甲需要哥布林正装护甲和第 3 套盔甲（护手和靴子）。把材料带给[大法师]德雷克即可领取。"

msgid "Master, have you heard of Impact, a powerful attack magic? Don`t you think [Archmage] Drake should be able to tell us about it?"
msgstr "师父，你听说过「冲击」这种强力攻击魔法吗？[大法师]德雷克应该能跟我们讲讲吧？"

msgid "Impact is serious magic. It's rarely taught to even the most able Mage. But I like your look so I'm willing to take a chance - IF you can prove you're up to it. So then! Earn 7 Insignias of Victor in Border Defense Battle to prove your worthiness."
msgstr "冲击可是正经魔法。哪怕是最出色的法师也很少教。不过我看你顺眼，愿意冒个险——前提是你得证明自己够格。那么！去边境防御战挣得 7 枚勇士勋章，证明你的资格吧。"

msgid "Don't forget to bring me 1.5 M Noahs along with the 7 Insignias of Victor. What? Too expensive? You think I am running a charity here? I already gave you a discount, so move it!"
msgstr "别忘了除了 7 枚勇士勋章，再给我带 150 万诺亚来。什么？太贵？你当我这儿是开慈善堂的？我都给你打折了，赶紧的！"

msgid "Gasp! Gasp! Master, all 7 Insignias of Victor have been gathered! Go see [Archmage] Drake now."
msgstr "呼！呼！师父，7 枚勇士勋章都集齐了！快去见[大法师]德雷克吧。"

msgid "Think you're worthy, do you? Not TOO dense, I swear. The cost is 7 Insignias of Victor. 7!"
msgstr "觉得自己够格了是吧？我发誓，你脑子可不太灵光。代价是 7 枚勇士勋章。7 枚！"

msgid "This look like 1.5 M Noahs to you? Trying to pull a fast one? Better hurry with my money before I triple the price!"
msgstr "这在你眼里像 150 万诺亚吗？想蒙我？趁我还没把价钱翻三倍，赶紧把钱送来！"

msgid "You got it all. Now we're talking. You've got your Impact Magic. Use it well."
msgstr "东西齐了。这才像话。冲击魔法你拿到了。好好用。"

msgid "You have to bring 7 Insignias of Victor and 1.5 M Noahs to [Archmage] Drake to learn the powerful offensive magic Impact."
msgstr "要学强力攻击魔法「冲击」，你得把 7 枚勇士勋章和 150 万诺亚带给[大法师]德雷克。"

msgid "I finally have some downtime."
msgstr "我总算能歇口气了。"

msgid "They say that the Spoiler is an avian monster that evolved from one of Pathos's spells."
msgstr "据说「掠夺者」是一种鸟类怪物，由帕托斯的某个法术演化而来。"

msgid "Master! I've heard that Apple of Moradon has a sticky effect. Let's go and find [Mercenary Supply Officer] Osmond and check it out."
msgstr "师父！我听说莫拉登苹果有黏性。咱们去找[佣兵补给官]奥斯蒙德问问看。"

msgid "Hello.|My name is Osmond. I'm the official Quartermaster for Mercenaries and so on. You're <selfname>, right? I knew it was you- I've heard all the stories! So what brings you here?"
msgstr "你好。|我叫奥斯蒙德，是佣兵等人的官方军需官。你就是<selfname>吧？我就知道是你——你的事迹我都听说了！那么，是什么风把你吹来了？"

msgid "Right now we're in the middle of repairing the wall of Moradon castle, and need lots of cement. Please bring me any Apple of Moradon you have. I will give you a reasonable price for them."
msgstr "眼下我们正在抢修莫拉登城堡的城墙，需要大量水泥。请把你手上的莫拉登苹果都带给我。我会给你个公道价。"

msgid "Master! It's the Apple of Moradon! You can trade it to  Osmond at a reasonable price."
msgstr "师父！是莫拉登苹果！你可以公道价卖给奥斯蒙德。"

msgid "Shoot... There isn't enough Apple of Moradon for all the repairs."
msgstr "糟了……莫拉登苹果不够修所有城墙的。"

msgid "Thank you.|We were worried about our lack of Apple of Moradon, but this really helps. Thanks again!"
msgstr "谢谢你。|我们正愁莫拉登苹果不够，这下可帮大忙了。再次感谢！"

msgid "We are short of the Apples of Moradon to be used for the repair of the castle wall. I will give you appropriate compensation if you bring two Apples of Moradon."
msgstr "我们修城墙用的莫拉登苹果不够。你给我带来两个莫拉登苹果，我会给你相应的报酬。"

msgid "Master, there's a strange rumor going around Moradon."
msgstr "师父，莫拉登城里传开了一个奇怪的传闻。"

msgid "Our top Merchant is having big trouble since we became infected with a nasty disease on the way to Moradon. In time, everyone will die from this thing. We've got to get the antidote soon."
msgstr "我们最顶尖的商人在来莫拉登的路上染上了一种恶疾，现在麻烦大了。用不了多久，所有人都会死于此病。我们得尽快弄到解药。"

msgid "Please fetch some Apples of Moradon."
msgstr "请去弄些莫拉登苹果来。"

msgid "Master, Rage will be satisfied with this much."
msgstr "师父，暴怒对这些就满意了。"

msgid "You are placing a bet of 5000 Noahs, okay? You have to keep your words, okay? I will not refund your money even if you say your fingers slipped or you didn't know it was going to be like this or whatever after you lose, okay? Then, shall we get started?"
msgstr "你押的是 5000 诺亚，明白吗？说话要算数，明白吗？就算你输了之后说什么手滑啦、不知道会这样啦之类的，我也一分钱不退，明白吗？那么，咱们开始？"

msgid "Not TOO weird a hobby. This guy's psycho, I'm thinking. Repulsive as it is, find me a Rotten Eye."
msgstr "这癖好也不算太怪。这家伙是个变态，我看。虽然恶心，还是去给我找一只「腐眼」来。"

msgid "I've heard a rumor that there're ometimes Silver Feathers in amongst the Saber Tooth's feathers."
msgstr "我听传闻说，剑齿虎的羽毛里有时会夹杂着银羽。"

msgid "Master!  <font color=@#990000@>[Mercenary Quartermaster] Mr. Osmond</font> is looking for you, Master, for the preparation of war materials"
msgstr "师父！<font color=@#990000@>[佣兵军需官]奥斯蒙德先生</font>正在找你，师父，是为了战备物资的筹备。"

msgid "What shall we do with this.. It's huge trouble.. Gasp! Oh my! Not even a hint of your approaching. Oh, are you asking me what I am so worried about? It's because of the supply route for the provision of war materials."
msgstr "这可怎么办……真是大麻烦……呼！哎呀！你过来我一点都没察觉。哦？你问我在愁什么？是为了运送战备物资的补给线。"

msgid "While we were trying to transport war materials for their provisioning, the violence of [Boss] monsters has become more severe. Consequently, the transportation plan is being delayed indefinitely. I wish someone would take care of these guys.. Oh! I think I can ask <selfname> a favor! Fortunately, you don't seem to have anything to do! As for a reward, I will talk to the Commander so that you can be richly rewarded. Please, do me this favor."
msgstr "我们正想把战备物资运往前线，可[头目]怪物的袭扰越来越凶。结果运输计划被无限期推迟。真希望有人能收拾这帮家伙……哦！我想我可以请<selfname>帮忙！巧的是，你好像正好没事干！报酬嘛，我会去跟指挥官说，让你得到重赏。求你了，帮我这个忙。"

msgid "Is this guy the last one? Master! I took care of all the guys on the wanted list!"
msgstr "这家伙是最后一个吗？师父！通缉名单上的家伙我全收拾了！"

msgid "Um.. Not yet..? Oh.. My heart breaks when I think about the fellow soldiers who are suffering as the materials are not delivered!"
msgstr "嗯……还没……？唉……一想到物资送不到、正在受苦的战友们，我这心都碎了！"

msgid "Oh! You took care of them all! Thank you. Now we can start the transporation! Here is your compensation. Do us a favor the next time too!"
msgstr "哦！你把他们全收拾了！谢谢。这下我们可以开始运输了！这是你的酬劳。下次也再来帮我们忙！"

msgid "Among the goods needed for the war, bezoars of Glyptodont, which are used as explosive material, are in severe shortage. I wish you can secure about five of them for us."
msgstr "战备所需物资中，用作炸药材料的 glyptodont 胃石严重短缺。希望你能为我们弄到五个左右。"

msgid "Master- They're preparing the War Supplies over in the Folk Vilage. So Osmond is busy eh? You should go and pay him a visit."
msgstr "师父——村民村那边正在筹备军需物资。奥斯蒙德挺忙的是吧？你该去拜访他一下。"

msgid "Karon is my best friend, so I really don't want to let him down. Please, help me out on this one, Ok?"
msgstr "卡伦是我最好的朋友，我真不想让他失望。求你了，这一回帮帮我，好吗？"

msgid "To save the sickly Merchant, we need Rough Bone Powder. Quick! Quick! We must save them, they're like family to me. I'll go mad without them!"
msgstr "为了救那位生病的商人，我们需要粗骨粉。快！快！我们得救他，他就像我的家人一样。没有他我会疯掉的！"

msgid "Ohhh.. We just have two Apples of Moradon. Master, you also played a part in the preparation for the war!!"
msgstr "哦……我们正好有两个莫拉登苹果。师父，你也为战备出了一份力！！"

msgid "This opportunity won't come ¡®round again. I hope you come back in time with the stuff... "
msgstr "这种机会不会再来第二次。希望你能及时把东西带回来……"

msgid "If possible, make them high quality Talismans, Ok?"
msgstr "可以的话，做成高品质护身符，好吗？"

msgid "Master, they say  Vilbore is giving special gifts to knights who reach 35Lv. And the fact is that you are also close to reaching 35Lv - so cheer up ^^"
msgstr "师父，听说维尔博雷会给达到 35 级的骑士发特别礼物。而你也快到 35 级了——加油哦 ^^"

msgid "Master, I`m bored. Why don`t we go see [Blacksmith] Heppa?"
msgstr "师父，我好无聊。咱们去看[铁匠]赫帕吧？"

msgid "Kecoons are hostile but they like to hide nice objects|What if I give you a reward for bringing me what I ask for?"
msgstr "凯昆有敌意，可它们喜欢藏些好东西|我要是按你带来的东西给你发奖励，怎么样？"

msgid "Bring 2 Apples of Moradon which can be acquired from Kecoons. How about it? Want to give it a shot?"
msgstr "去凯昆身上弄来 2 个莫拉登苹果。怎么样？想试试吗？"

msgid "Master, all 4 Apples of Moradon [Blacksmith] Heppa asked for have been collected"
msgstr "师父，[铁匠]赫帕要的 4 个莫拉登苹果都集齐了。"

msgid "Didn`t you remember that I told you I needed at least 2 Apples of Moradon?"
msgstr "我不是跟你说过，我至少需要 2 个莫拉登苹果吗？你忘了？"

msgid "Haha, you brought them|I will give you a reward in exchange for the Apples of Moradon."
msgstr "哈哈，你带来了|我会用这些莫拉登苹果换给你奖励。"

msgid "[Blacksmith] Heppa will award a new armor for Apples of Moradon."
msgstr "[铁匠]赫帕会用莫拉登苹果赏你一件新盔甲。"

msgid "Whew, this is exhausting. Master, we`re low on weapons. Go see [Blacksmith] Heppa. Who knows? Maybe he`ll give you a nice weapon. "
msgstr "呼，真累。师父，我们的武器不够了。去见[铁匠]赫帕吧。谁知道呢？说不定他会给你件好武器。"

msgid "Craftsmen can distinguish high-grade ingredients with a single glance. I discovered something while traversing the Seashore of Hope. With that, I should be able to make you a to-die-for weapon. How about it?"
msgstr "匠人一眼就能辨出上等材料。我在漫步「希望之海」时发现了一样东西。有了它，我就能给你打一件绝赞的武器。怎么样？"

msgid "If you`re tempted, bring me Bulture horns and iron bar and I`ll make you something fabulous."
msgstr "你要是动心了，就给我带牛角和铁条来，我给你打件了不得的玩意儿。"

msgid "Master, all the materials [Blacksmith] Heppa asked for have been collected. All right, it`s time for Weapon Change!"
msgstr "师父，[铁匠]赫帕要的材料都集齐了。好嘞，该换武器了！"

msgid "Didn`t I tell you Bulture horns and iron bar are required for weapons? It`s an easy task for me, still I`m charging a fee of 1,000 Noahs."
msgstr "我不是跟你说过，做武器需要牛角和铁条吗？这活儿对我来说很轻松，不过我还是要收 1000 诺亚的手工费。"

msgid "[Select the weapon you want to be awarded]\nHmm. You brought them. Time to burn my craftsman`s passion. |There you go. Hope it comes to good use."
msgstr "[选择你想领取的武器]\\n嗯。你带来了。该燃起我这匠人的热情了。|给你。希望它派上好用场。"

msgid "[Blacksmith] Heppa will make you 16Lv weaponry for 3 Bulture horns and 5 iron bar."
msgstr "[铁匠]赫帕会用 3 个牛角和 5 根铁条，给你打 16 级的武器。"

msgid "Master, I heard that [Blacksmith] Heppa has been awfully down lately. Let`s go see what`s getting him so down. "
msgstr "师父，我听说[铁匠]赫帕近来情绪特别低落。咱们去看看是什么让他这么消沉吧。"

msgid "Master, I heard that [Blacksmith] Heppa has been awfully down  lately. Let`s go see what`s getting him so down. "
msgstr "师父，我听说[铁匠]赫帕近来情绪特别低落。咱们去看看是什么让他这么消沉吧。"

msgid "Frankly, I`ve been concerned about weapon production methods lately. As you`re well aware, unremarkable ingredients produce stock weapons and special ingredients are so hard to come by  ...|I`m contemplating using Apples of Moradon but there aren`t many warriors in Moradon who can hunt werewolves, the only ones with  Apples of Moradon."
msgstr "说实话，我近来一直在为武器的制法发愁。你也知道，普通材料只能打出大路货武器，而特殊材料又如此难求……|我在琢磨用莫拉登苹果，可莫拉登城里能猎杀狼人的战士没几个，而莫拉登苹果只有狼人才掉。"

msgid "Now it occurs to me that you may have the ability to hunt werewolf. You don't need to be modest.  My eyes, which have dealt with numerous warriors and knights for decades, are relatively correct! So I want to ask of you a favor. Can you hunt werewolf and collect 3 Apples of Moradon for me? I really need the materials as I am in a slump."
msgstr "现在我想起来，你或许有猎杀狼人的本事。你也别谦虚。我这双几十年来打交道无数战士和骑士的眼睛，可是很准的！所以我想求你帮个忙。你能去猎杀狼人、给我收集 3 个莫拉登苹果吗？我正低迷期，真的很需要这材料。"

msgid "Master, now werewolf is not a difficult opponent any more. You are really great. By the way, I collected 3 Apples of Moradon. Hurry, bring them to [Blacksmith] Hepa."
msgstr "师父，现在狼人已经不是难对付的对手了。你真厉害。对了，3 个莫拉登苹果我都收集好了。快去带给[铁匠]赫帕吧。"

msgid "I need 3 Apples of Moradon for my research on weapon production!"
msgstr "我做武器研究需要 3 个莫拉登苹果！"

msgid "Wow, you brought the Apples of Moradon I asked for. I feel motivated already. Shall we begin?"
msgstr "哇，你把我要的莫拉登苹果带来了。我一下子就来劲了。咱们开始？"

msgid "In order to help the research on weapon production by [Blacksmith] Hepa who is in a slump, we need 3 Apples of Moradon. If you bring 3 Apples of Moradon to [Blacksmith] Hepa, you can receive experience as compensation. "
msgstr "为了帮助正处低迷期的[铁匠]赫帕做武器研究，我们需要 3 个莫拉登苹果。你把 3 个莫拉登苹果带给[铁匠]赫帕，就能获得经验作为报酬。"

msgid "Master, [Blacksmith] Heppa`s technique isn`t what it used to be. He seems to be preoccupied with something..."
msgstr "师父，[铁匠]赫帕的手艺大不如前了。他好像心事重重……"

msgid "I guess I could tell someone like you about the Armor of Destruction. It can be made with the Amulet of Destruction which can be obtained by hunting Hell Hounds that dwell in the mainland. Armor of Destruction is made by melting and mixing the Amulet of Destruction and iron bar. It sounds savage but its performance is guaranteed."
msgstr "我想我可以跟你这种人透露「毁灭盔甲」的事。它可以用「毁灭护符」做成，而毁灭护符要猎杀栖息在本土的地狱犬获得。毁灭盔甲是把毁灭护符和铁条熔化混合而成。听着野蛮，但性能绝对有保证。"

msgid "At least 7 Amulets of Destruction and 15 iron bar are needed to make the Armor of Destruction. Want to give it a shot? "
msgstr "做毁灭盔甲至少需要 7 个毁灭护符和 15 根铁条。想试试吗？"

msgid "At least 7 Amulets of Destruction are required to make Armor of Destruction."
msgstr "做毁灭盔甲至少需要 7 个毁灭护符。"

msgid "Didn`t I tell you at least 15 iron bar are needed to make the Armor of Destruction?"
msgstr "我不是跟你说过，做毁灭盔甲至少需要 15 根铁条吗？"

msgid "It requires a lot of work hence I will charge a fee of 500,000 Noahs."
msgstr "这活儿很费功夫，所以我要收 50 万诺亚的手工费。"

msgid "Here, this is the Armor of Destruction made just for you."
msgstr "来，这是专门给你做的毁灭盔甲。"

msgid "At least 5 Amulets of Destruction and 12 iron bar are needed to make the Body Armor of Destruction bottom. Want to give it a shot? "
msgstr "做毁灭盔甲下装至少需要 5 个毁灭护符和 12 根铁条。想试试吗？"

msgid "At least 5 Amulets of Destruction are required to make Body Armor of Destruction."
msgstr "做毁灭盔甲至少需要 5 个毁灭护符。"

msgid "Didn`t I tell you at least 12 iron bar are needed to make the Body Armor of Destruction?"
msgstr "我不是跟你说过，做毁灭盔甲至少需要 12 根铁条吗？"

msgid "Here, this is the Body Armor of Destruction made just for you."
msgstr "来，这是专门给你做的毁灭盔甲下装。"

msgid "At least 4 Amulets of Destruction and 9 iron bar are needed to make the Body Armor of Destruction helmet. Want to give it a shot? "
msgstr "做毁灭盔甲头盔至少需要 4 个毁灭护符和 9 根铁条。想试试吗？"

msgid "At least 4 Amulets of Destruction are required to make Body Armor of Destruction helmet."
msgstr "做毁灭盔甲头盔至少需要 4 个毁灭护符。"

msgid "Didn`t I tell you at least 9 iron bar are needed to make the Body Armor of Destruction helmet?"
msgstr "我不是跟你说过，做毁灭盔甲头盔至少需要 9 根铁条吗？"

msgid "At least 3 Amulets of Destruction and 6 iron bar are needed to make the Body Armor of Destruction gauntlet. Want to give it a shot? "
msgstr "做毁灭盔甲护手至少需要 3 个毁灭护符和 6 根铁条。想试试吗？"

msgid "At least 3 Amulets of Destruction are required to make Body Armor of Destruction gauntlet."
msgstr "做毁灭盔甲护手至少需要 3 个毁灭护符。"

msgid "Didn`t I tell you at least 6 iron bar are needed to make the Body Armor of Destruction gauntlet?"
msgstr "我不是跟你说过，做毁灭盔甲护手至少需要 6 根铁条吗？"

msgid "At least 3 Amulets of Destruction and 3 iron bar are needed to make the Body Armor of Destruction boots. Want to give it a shot? "
msgstr "做毁灭盔甲靴子至少需要 3 个毁灭护符和 3 根铁条。想试试吗？"

msgid "At least 3 Amulets of Destruction are required to make Body Armor of Destruction boots."
msgstr "做毁灭盔甲靴子至少需要 3 个毁灭护符。"

msgid "Didn`t I tell you at least 3 iron bar are needed to make the Body Armor of Destruction boots?"
msgstr "我不是跟你说过，做毁灭盔甲靴子至少需要 3 根铁条吗？"

msgid "To make Body Armor of Destruction top, you must take 7 Amulets of Destruction, 15 iron bar, and 500,000 Noahs to [Blacksmith] Heppa."
msgstr "要做毁灭盔甲上衣，你必须把 7 个毁灭护符、15 根铁条和 50 万诺亚带给[铁匠]赫帕。"

msgid "To make Body Armor of Destruction top, you must take 5 Amulets of Destruction, 12 iron bar, and 500,000 Noahs to [Blacksmith] Heppa."
msgstr "要做毁灭盔甲上衣，你必须把 5 个毁灭护符、12 根铁条和 50 万诺亚带给[铁匠]赫帕。"

msgid "To make Body Armor of Destruction helmet, you must take 4 Amulets of Destruction, 9 iron bar, and 500,000 Noahs to [Blacksmith] Heppa."
msgstr "要做毁灭盔甲头盔，你必须把 4 个毁灭护符、9 根铁条和 50 万诺亚带给[铁匠]赫帕。"

msgid "To make Body Armor of Destruction gauntlet, you must take 3 Amulets of Destruction, 6 iron bar, and 500,000 Noahs to [Blacksmith] Heppa."
msgstr "要做毁灭盔甲护手，你必须把 3 个毁灭护符、6 根铁条和 50 万诺亚带给[铁匠]赫帕。"

msgid "To make Body Armor of Destruction boots, you must take 3 Amulets of Destruction, 3 iron bar, and 500,000 Noahs to [Blacksmith] Heppa."
msgstr "要做毁灭盔甲靴子，你必须把 3 个毁灭护符、3 根铁条和 50 万诺亚带给[铁匠]赫帕。"

msgid "Master. You ¡®ll earn a Wolfman's Claw if you catch Lycan here. Ask [Sentinel] Melverick."
msgstr "师父。你在这儿抓住狼人，就能得到「狼人之爪」。去问问[哨兵]梅尔弗里克吧。"

msgid "Phew! Our master's armor is too old. There's a lot of armor in Folk Village's Mercenary Storage... You should ask  Osmond for a favor."
msgstr "呼！我们主人的盔甲太旧了。村民村的佣兵仓库里有好多盔甲……你该去找奥斯蒙德帮个忙。"

msgid "This is Apple of Moradon. Emm, it looks delicious, and it's worth its weight in coin. Heh!"
msgstr "这是莫拉登苹果。嗯，看着就好吃，还值不少钱。哼！"

msgid "Ehh?? The way I see it, <selfname>'s wearing some good armor!"
msgstr "诶？？要我说，<selfname>你身上穿的盔甲不错嘛！"

msgid "Thanks. Now I can finish my new fishing tool..."
msgstr "谢谢。这下我能把新的钓鱼工具做完了……"

msgid "The best Fishing Cork is made with Wolfman's Claw!! Wolfman's Claw, equals Fishing Cork. Simple! Moradon equals apple, apple equals Moradon! Ha Ha Ha!"
msgstr "最好的钓鱼浮漂是用狼人之爪做的！！狼人之爪，等于钓鱼浮漂。简单！莫拉登等于苹果，苹果等于莫拉登！哈哈哈！"

msgid "I commend your passion but don`t save your strength."
msgstr "我欣赏你的热情，但别保留实力。"

msgid "You should contribute to your country if you`ve returned home after wandering for so long. I`ve got just the mission for a new recruit like you."
msgstr "在外漂泊了这么久才回家，也该为国家出份力了。我正好有个任务，适合你这样的新兵。"

msgid "Master, if Moradon has Mercenary Captain Cougar, we have [Captain] Polkwein. It wouldn`t hurt to say hello."
msgstr "师父，莫拉登有佣兵队长库伽，我们这儿有[队长]波尔克温。去打个招呼没坏处。"

msgid "Not long ago, Recons from Karus infiltrated our country, examined our land and began to draft a map. We planted a spy among them in return. And that spy submitted regular reconnaissance reports. But somehow, the soldier who went to receive the reconnaissance report didn`t come back this time."
msgstr "前不久，卡鲁斯的侦察兵渗入我国，勘察我们的土地并开始绘制地图。我们也反将一军，在他们中间安插了一名密探。那名密探定期提交侦察报告。可不知怎的，这回去取侦察报告的士兵却没回来。"

msgid "I need a favor. Go take out the hostiles and establish contact with our spy. Give him this [Orders from Captain] and return with [3 Scouting Maps] and [Reconnaissance Report]. Well, you up to it?"
msgstr "我需要你帮个忙。去干掉那些敌对的侦察兵，跟我们的密探接上头。把这封[队长手令]交给他，再带回[3 张侦察地图]和[侦察报告]。怎么样，你行吗？"

msgid "Master, all [Reconnaissance Report] and [3 Scouting Maps] have been gathered. Hurry back to [Captain] Folkwine."
msgstr "师父，[侦察报告]和[3 张侦察地图]都集齐了。快回[队长]福尔克温那儿去。"

msgid "What happened to the reconnaissance map? Don`t tell me you dropped it somewhere."
msgstr "侦察地图怎么回事？别告诉我你给掉在哪儿了。"

msgid "Listen, I told you to bring the reconnaissance report. Just what were you doing?"
msgstr "听着，我叫你把侦察报告带来。你刚才到底干什么去了？"

msgid "Good work. You`ve successfully completed your mission."
msgstr "干得好。你顺利完成了任务。"

msgid "(whisper whisper) I`m a bogus Recon who infiltrated this house. You`d better leave before other Recons catch on."
msgstr "（窃窃私语）我是潜入这屋子的假侦察兵。趁别的侦察兵还没发觉，你快走吧。"

msgid "I`d better share my mission with you."
msgstr "我最好把我的任务告诉你。"

msgid "This is the reconnaissance report. I hope you deliver it safely to the captain."
msgstr "这是侦察报告。希望你把它安全交给队长。"

msgid "You didn`t bring the captain`s written order? Did you come here to fool around?"
msgstr "你没带队长的书面手令？你是来这儿胡闹的吗？"

msgid "And you must attack the Recons around me now and confiscate the reconnaissance map from them. Without the map, the reconnaissance report is utterly useless. Mark my words."
msgstr "还有，你现在必须攻击我周围的侦察兵，从他们那儿缴获侦察地图。没有地图，侦察报告一文不值。记住我的话。"

msgid "We've got a spy among the enemy scouts. Find the scouts and establish contact with our spy to receive [Reconnaissance Report]. Also, defeat all enemy scouts and collect all [3 Scouting Maps] you can find."
msgstr "我们在敌方侦察兵中安插了一名密探。找到侦察兵，与我们的密探接上头领取[侦察报告]。另外，击败所有敌方侦察兵，把能找到的[3 张侦察地图]都收集起来。"

msgid "We have plenty of cooking ingredients but it`s not time to eat yet so just hold your horses."
msgstr "我们的食材很充足，但还没到吃饭的时候，再忍忍。"

msgid "Don`t you think I should make a lavish dish!? "
msgstr "你不觉得我该做一道豪华大餐吗！？"

msgid "Master, it`s time for the Imperial Palace Chef to start cooking. Go and see him."
msgstr "师父，御厨该开始做菜了。去看看他吧。"

msgid "Oh, no, I need to make BBQ and I`m short on Tyon meat."
msgstr "哦不，我要做烧烤，可泰昂肉不够了。"

msgid "Can you find me 2 slabs of Tyon meat from the nearby farm? I`ll give you a hefty reward and some BBQ. What do you say?"
msgstr "你能从附近农场给我弄两块泰昂肉吗？我会给你丰厚的报酬，再分你点烧烤。怎么样？"

msgid "Master, you`ve collected all slabs of Tyon meat. Let`s go to the Imperial Palace Chef."
msgstr "师父，泰昂肉都集齐了。咱们去找御厨吧。"

msgid "Tyons live to the right of the nearby farm. They`re a bit wild so be careful now."
msgstr "泰昂住在附近农场的右边。它们有点野，小心点。"

msgid "Wow! You brought them!?!? Here`s your reward."
msgstr "哇！你带来了！？？？这是你的奖励。"

msgid "Can I ask you one more favor?! "
msgstr "能再请你帮个忙吗！？"

msgid "Please take this BBQ to the Lunar Gate Sentinel. I`m too busy to take it myself. I`ll give you a nice gift if you do this for me."
msgstr "请把这份烧烤带给月门哨兵。我太忙，走不开。你要是帮我这个忙，我会送你件好礼物。"

msgid "If you`re craving something delicious, you`ve come to the right place. "
msgstr "你要是馋好吃的，那可来对地方了。"

msgid "Today, the Imperial Palace Chef will be bringing  BBQ.  Did you see him when you were coming here?"
msgstr "今天御厨会送来烧烤。你来这儿的路上看见他了吗？"

msgid "Thanks. For bringing the food, I mean.|Erm, look, I'm sorry to ask you this, but could you take this Ring to my girl? You'll find her near the Islante Entrace."
msgstr "谢谢。我是说，谢谢你把吃的送来。|这个，不好意思开口，但你能把这枚戒指送给我女朋友吗？她在艾斯兰特入口附近。"

msgid "I`m sorry to ask you a favor but I`m hoping you, <selfname>, would do this for me. Take this ring to my love. She`ll be somewhere near the Islante entrance. "
msgstr "不好意思要你帮忙，但我希望由你，<selfname>，来替我做这件事。把这枚戒指送给我的爱人。她应该就在艾斯兰特入口附近的某个地方。"

msgid "I was wondering if you can take this ring to my love. I heard she`s always lingering somewhere near the Islante entrance. You should be able to spot her there."
msgstr "不知道你能不能替我把这枚戒指送给我的爱人。我听说她总在艾斯兰特入口附近徘徊。你在那儿应该能找到她。"

msgid "I wanted to thank you for delivering the ring."
msgstr "我想谢谢你替我送戒指。"

msgid "Is there anything you`d like to say to me?"
msgstr "你有什么想对我说的吗？"

msgid "She was sent to theLunar Gateages ago, and is still stationed there. I want to see her face again..."
msgstr "她很久以前就被派去月门，至今还驻守在那儿。我好想再见见她的脸……"

msgid "I`m sorry, but I`m of no relation to you what-so-ever."
msgstr "抱歉，可我跟你没有任何关系。"

msgid "Ah... you seem to be someone with whom I could share my predicament."
msgstr "啊……你看起来像是个能听我诉苦的人。"

msgid "Um... A ring ... No, never mind."
msgstr "呃……一枚戒指……不，当我没说。"

msgid "You'll get some Armor out of this if you do [Graveyard Keeper] Bottom this favor."
msgstr "你帮[墓地看守]Bottom 这个忙，就能得到一件盔甲。"

msgid "You'll get a Weapon out of this if you do [Sentinel] Cape this favor."
msgstr "你帮[哨兵]Cape 这个忙，就能得到一件武器。"

msgid "Eh, ham! Who's this? Isn't it <selfname>? Wow, long time no see. What are you doing ¡®round here? This place is actually a cave that goes all the way down to the underground regions of Jurad Mountain. By Royal decree, I am the gatekeeper! Say what? You want to go in? Right then! You'll be needing my permission!"
msgstr "咳，哈！这位是谁？这不就是<selfname>吗？哇，好久不见。你在这儿晃悠什么？这地方其实是一个洞穴，一路直通到朱拉德山的地下区域。奉王之命，我就是这儿的守门人！你说什么？你想进去？那好！你可得有我的许可才行！"

msgid "Eh, ham! Who's this? Isn't it <selfname>? Wow, long time no see. What are you doing ¡®round here? This place is actually a cave that goes all the way down to the underground regions of Jurad Mountain. By Royal decree, I am the gatekeeper! What's that? Say what? You want to go in? Right then! You'll be needing my permission!"
msgstr "咳，哈！这位是谁？这不就是<selfname>吗？哇，好久不见。你在这儿晃悠什么？这地方其实是一个洞穴，一路直通到朱拉德山的地下区域。奉王之命，我就是这儿的守门人。你说什么？你想进去？那好！你可得有我的许可才行！"

msgid "Master! There's a problem at Islante's Jurad Mountain! Go to Islante quickly!"
msgstr "师父！艾斯兰特的朱拉德山出事了！快去艾斯兰特！"

msgid "They say there's an enormous hole in the side of the Jurad Moutain. It's something to do with a big fight between Karus and some Evil Soldiers. The good news is, because of the power of our Karusian ancestry, we've claimed the entrance! Although, in order to stop chaos setting in, only the best warriors are allowed access, and then only at times chosen by Legure. Sounds good though. You want to go down there? Great! You're going to wet yourself when you hear this:|You'll get fantastic rewards from down there at the cost of just 1% experience.|Failure doesn't lose you any xp, but it doesn't get you any rewards either.| Right, let's get down there."
msgstr "据说朱拉德山的山壁上裂出了一个巨大的洞窟。这事跟卡鲁斯和某种邪恶士兵之间的一场大战有关。好消息是，托我们卡鲁斯先祖之力，我们已经占据了入口！不过为了防止大乱子，只允许最精锐的战士进入，而且只能在莱格尔选定的时间进入。听着不错吧。你想下去？好极了！你听了这个准得吓尿：|你只要付出 1% 的经验，就能从下面拿到超棒的奖励。|失败不扣经验，但也拿不到奖励。|那好，咱们下去吧。"

msgid "When I let you in, at the appointed time, you'll have 35 minutes to poke around in Jurad Mountain's Underground Haunt. Be aware that El Moradians may be down there too, and eveyone's fair game here. Anyway, there's a bloody big monster down there- the Deva Bird. Kill it and you'll receive a Gemstone. It's really precious, something nice.Oh, and when you win in Jurad Mountain, that's when you'll see 1% of your xp disappear, and when you'll get your fat reward. Ok? And remember this - If you don't defeat the Devabird in time, the outcome will be based on the number of the kills the enemy made."
msgstr "到了约定时间我放你进去后，你有 35 分钟在朱拉德山的地下魔窟里探索。注意艾莫拉德人可能也在下面，在这儿谁都可以猎杀谁。对了，下面有只血大的怪物——提婆鸟。杀了它你就能拿到一颗宝石。那可是稀罕好东西。哦，还有，你在朱拉德山获胜时，就会看到 1% 的经验消失，同时领到丰厚的奖励。明白吗？还有记住——要是你没能及时打败提婆鸟，胜负就按敌方的击杀数来判定。"

msgid "So, would you like to enter Jurad Mountain's Underground?"
msgstr "那么，你想进入朱拉德山的地下吗？"

msgid "They say there's an enormous hole in the side of the Jurad Moutain. It's something to do with a big fight between El Morad and some Evil Soldiers. The good news is, because of the power of our El Moradian ancestry, we've claimed the entrance! Although, in order to stop chaos setting in, only the best warriors are allowed access, and then only at times chosen by Beldan. Do you want to go in? Great! You're going to wet yourself when you hear this:|You'll get fantastic rewards from down there at the cost of just 1% experience.|Failure doesn't lose you any xp, but it doesn't get you any rewards either.| Right, let's get down there."
msgstr "据说朱拉德山的山壁上裂出了一个巨大的洞窟。这事跟艾莫拉德和某种邪恶士兵之间的一场大战有关。好消息是，托我们艾莫拉德先祖之力，我们已经占据了入口！不过为了防止大乱子，只允许最精锐的战士进入，而且只能在贝尔丹选定的时间进入。你想进去？好极了！你听了这个准得吓尿：|你只要付出 1% 的经验，就能从下面拿到超棒的奖励。|失败不扣经验，但也拿不到奖励。|那好，咱们下去吧。"

msgid "When I let you in, at the appointed time, you'll have 35 minutes to poke around in Jurad Mountain's Underground Haunt. Be aware that Karusians may be down there too, and eveyone's fair game here. Anyway, there's a bloody big monster down there- the Deva Bird. Kill it and you'll receive a Gemstone. It's really precious, something nice.Oh, and when you win in Jurad Mountain, that's when you'll see 1% of your xp disappear, and when you'll get your fat reward. Ok? And remember this - If you don't defeat the Devabird in time, the outcome will be based on the number of the kills the enemy made. Got that?"
msgstr "到了约定时间我放你进去后，你有 35 分钟在朱拉德山的地下魔窟里探索。注意卡鲁斯人可能也在下面，在这儿谁都可以猎杀谁。对了，下面有只血大的怪物——提婆鸟。杀了它你就能拿到一颗宝石。那可是稀罕好东西。哦，还有，你在朱拉德山获胜时，就会看到 1% 的经验消失，同时领到丰厚的奖励。明白吗？还有记住——要是你没能及时打败提婆鸟，胜负就按敌方的击杀数来判定。清楚了？"

msgid "Hey, Hey... You're totally the wrong level for this place. Go and get yourself some more scars before coming back here!"
msgstr "喂，喂……你这等级来这地方完全不对路。先去身上多添几道疤再来！"

msgid "Hmm... Well, you've made no contribution to the country. First, get CONT from [Knight Squad Secretary] Delaga in Karus Castle."
msgstr "嗯……你对国家还没有任何贡献。先去卡鲁斯城堡找[骑士团书记]德拉加拿 CONT。"

msgid "It's not time to enter yet. Come back around 18:40. Sometimes I'll call you, too."
msgstr "还没到进入时间。18:40 左右再来。有时我也会叫你。"

msgid "Geez, you've got a temper! Now you can wait!"
msgstr "哎呀，你脾气还挺大！那你就等着吧！"

msgid "Ahh... You cannot enter unless 8 other people are here too. This place is too dangerous for soloing or messing around. Come back with some friends. Trust me, it's better that way. You can not face the enemy alone. Nope. No way. You're too important to us."
msgstr "啊……除非另外还有 8 个人到齐，否则你进不去。这地方太危险，不适合单人独闯或胡闹。带些朋友一起来。相信我，那样更好。你没法独自面对敌人。不行。绝对不行。你对我们太重要了。"

msgid "Hmm... Well, you've made no contribution to the country. First, get CONT from [Knight Squad Secretary] Charel in El Morad Castle."
msgstr "嗯……你对国家还没有任何贡献。先去艾莫拉德城堡找[骑士团书记]查雷尔拿 CONT。"

msgid "It's not time to enter yet~ comeback at 1840... Sometimes I call you..."
msgstr "还没到进入时间~1840 再来……有时我会叫你……"

msgid "If you bring a [Voucher], bought from a shop, it can be exchanged for certified National items."
msgstr "你带上从商店买来的[兑换券]，就能兑换认证的国定道具。"

msgid "Menu for testing Familiars."
msgstr "使魔测试菜单。"

msgid "You can use it after summoning a Familiar."
msgstr "你召唤出使魔之后就能使用它。"

msgid "You don't have a [Voucher for Magic Bag]."
msgstr "你没有[魔法袋兑换券]。"

msgid "You don't have a [Voucher for Automatic Looting]."
msgstr "你没有[自动拾取兑换券]。"

msgid "Huh. There must've been some disturbance at Jurad Moutain."
msgstr "哼。朱拉德山那边肯定出了什么乱子。"

msgid "You can't enter right now. Don't worry, I'll tell you when it's time."
msgstr "你现在进不去。别担心，到时候我会告诉你。"

msgid "Thank you, to everyone who participated in the [Era of Knight] test. We are giving out the following supplies for more efficiency testing, so please take them now."
msgstr "感谢所有参与[骑士时代]测试的玩家。为了更高效地测试，我们发放以下补给，请现在领取。"

msgid "This is the newly added weapon and armor list for the [Era of Knight]."
msgstr "这是[骑士时代]新增的武器与盔甲清单。"

msgid "Insufficient free Inventory slots."
msgstr "背包空位不足。"

msgid "This is the newly added accessories list for the [Era of Knight]."
msgstr "这是[骑士时代]新增的饰品清单。"

msgid "This is the newly added item and Powerup Store item list for [Era of Knight]."
msgstr "这是[骑士时代]新增的道具与强化商店道具清单。"

msgid "Your skill points and stat points are higher than your level Find somewhere else to grind!"
msgstr "你的技能点数和属性点数高于你的等级。换个地方练级去！"

msgid "You carry sins with you. You must cleanse yourself of sins before entering this place."
msgstr "你身上带着罪孽。进入此地之前必须先洗清罪孽。"

msgid "Your skill points and stat points are higher than your level. Find somewhere else to grind!"
msgstr "你的技能点数和属性点数高于你的等级。换个地方练级去！"

msgid "Master~  The war in Ronark Land Base isn't seem to be going so well due to the knights of El Morad."
msgstr "师父～罗纳克之地基地的战况，因为艾莫拉德骑士的缘故似乎不太顺利。"

msgid "You haven't finished the monster hunting mission that you were given before. Come back when you have completed that mission."
msgstr "你之前接到的讨伐怪物任务还没完成。完成那个任务后再来。"

msgid "You'll get some Armor out of this if you do [Graveyard Keeper] Slay this favor."
msgstr "你帮[墓地看守]Slay 这个忙，就能得到一件盔甲。"

msgid "You'll get the 5th piece of Armor  out of this if you do [Sentinel] Cape this favor."
msgstr "你帮[哨兵]Cape 这个忙，就能得到第 5 件盔甲。"

msgid "You'll get some Armor out of this if you hunt the Ape and go to [Mercenary] Tales."
msgstr "你去猎杀巨猿、再去找[佣兵]Tales，就能得到一件盔甲。"

msgid "You'll get some Armor out of this if you do the [Mercenary Adjutant] Rage this favor."
msgstr "你帮[佣兵副官]Rage 这个忙，就能得到一件盔甲。"

msgid "Well...  What can I do for you?"
msgstr "哦……我能为你做些什么？"

msgid "Hi! Eh? You don't know me? I'm Shojin, one of the heroes of the Adonisian Continent's past. Hahaha~you recognize me, now? That's okay. I can put up with that rudeness. Why am I here? Um~I would like to revive the Hero Weapon, so I have been learning blacksmith skills from Heppa. But that's not everything. I want to combine blacksmith skill with the alchemy that I learned from an alchemist in my heroic days. I could develop my alchemy further thanks to the experience. Why? Do you want anything born out of alchemy? Alright, I will do that. However, the rule of equivalent exchange requires you to get some materials."
msgstr "嗨！啊？你不认识我？我是肖金，阿多尼斯大陆昔日的英雄之一。哈哈哈~现在认出来了吧？没关系。这点失礼我受得了。问我为什么在这儿？嗯~我想复活英雄武器，所以一直在跟赫帕学打铁。但还不止这些。我想把打铁手艺和我当年英雄时代跟一位炼金术士学的炼金术结合起来。多亏了那段经历，我的炼金术能更上一层楼。怎么？你想要点炼金术炼出来的东西吗？好，我给你做。不过按照等价交换的法则，你得去弄些材料来。"

msgid "Um~Production literally means combining many items. It's a type of alchemy! Well, I have repeatedly failed as my EXP is not high enough. But the weapons and armors made out of it have incredible abilities.  Are you interested? I can try if you want, but as I told you just before, there's a possibility of failure. Just get the materials."
msgstr "嗯~所谓制作，字面上就是把许多物品组合起来。这是炼金术的一种！唉，我的 EXP 还不够，失败了好多次。可做出来的武器和盔甲性能惊人。你感兴趣吗？你要的话我可以试试，不过就像我刚才说的，有可能失败。你只管把材料弄来。"

msgid " Are you going to start production? Finally! Let's do it~"
msgstr "要开始制作了吗？终于！咱们动手吧~"

msgid "Hey hey~To make the Mattock, I need 100 CONT and 1 million Noah  are needed."
msgstr "嘿嘿~要做鹤嘴锄，需要 100 CONT 和 100 万诺亚。"

msgid "Well, here it is, If you get this, you won't have hard time obtaining materials. Good luck then!"
msgstr "喏，给你。有了这个，你弄材料就不费劲了。祝好运！"

msgid "Hey hey~To make the Mattock, you should give me a reward. Go to make 1 million Noah... "
msgstr "嘿嘿~要做鹤嘴锄，你该给我点报酬。去挣 100 万诺亚吧……"

msgid "Hey hey~ I need reputation to make the Mattock. Kill the enemy to get 100 CONT... "
msgstr "嘿嘿~做鹤嘴锄需要声望。去杀敌，挣够 100 CONT……"

msgid "Hmm~ Remember you can't get weapons for material if you don't have this~!!"
msgstr "嗯~记住，没有这个，你就别想拿材料换武器~！！"

msgid "Hmm... Did Masi ask you to come? You need the Mattock to help Masi.- One Mattock can be used in Moradon, and the other Mattock can be used in Ronark Land. Which one would you like to take?"
msgstr "嗯……是马西叫你来的吗？你需要鹤嘴锄去帮马西。一把鹤嘴锄可以在莫拉登用，另一把可以在罗纳克之地用。你想拿哪一把？"

msgid "Hmm... Did Masi ask you to come? You need the Mattock to help Masi... The material costs 3000 Noah. Would you like to make Mattock?"
msgstr "嗯……是马西叫你来的吗？你需要鹤嘴锄去帮马西……材料费 3000 诺亚。你想做鹤嘴锄吗？"

msgid "Welcome~ I'm Masi, a scholar who studies Ancient Civilizations. Nice to meet you, haha~ These days, historians in each Nation are desperate to study Draki. I'm in charge of sending research samples about Draki...But I'm very busy with too many orders of research samples... Could you give me a hand?"
msgstr "欢迎~我是马西，一名研究古代文明的学者。幸会，哈哈~近来各国的史学家都在拼命研究卓拉克。我负责发送关于卓拉克的研究样本……可我太忙了，研究样本的订单多得做不过来……你能搭把手吗？"

msgid "Oh~really? Thank you... I really appreciate that you instantly offered help, haha~Then I will tell you what to do. Please, listen and take a memo. You have to collect 10 bones for 5 parts including a head bone, leg bone, backbone, tail bone and foot bone... Take 10 bones for each part to [Heppa's Disciple] Shojin to have the bones combined into a research sample. Then, you should bring that to me. Whenever you bring me each sample, I will give you aMonster Sealing Cube as a reward."
msgstr "哦~真的吗？谢谢……你二话不说就肯帮忙，真让我感激，哈哈~那我告诉你怎么做。听好，记下来。你得为五个部位各收集 10 块骨头，包括头骨、腿骨、脊骨、尾骨和足骨……每个部位各拿 10 块骨头去找[赫帕的徒弟]肖金，把骨头拼成一个研究样本。然后把它带给我。你每带来一个样本，我就给你一个怪物封印方块作为奖励。"

msgid "There's an island away from Moradon, and it's said that  Unidentified Fossils are found there. Hm~I heard that you can collect them around Ronark Land where Draki Dragon Fossils are."
msgstr "离莫拉登不远有一座岛，据说那儿能找到不明化石。嗯~我听说在罗纳克之地卓拉克龙化石一带附近就能收集到。"

msgid "Collecting them is not so easy. You can easily collect them if you have just one Mattock. Go to find [Heppa's Disciple] Shojin. You can get the Mattock for Moradon and Mattock for Ronark if you go to Shojin."
msgstr "收集它们可不容易。只要有一把鹤嘴锄，你就能轻松挖到。去找[赫帕的徒弟]肖金吧。你去肖金那儿，就能拿到莫拉登用鹤嘴锄和罗纳克用鹤嘴锄。"

msgid "You brought the sample... I will never forget you contributed to the Draki research. I will reward you a Monster Sealing Cube for you to try, haha~"
msgstr "你把样本带来了……我永远不会忘记你为卓拉克研究做出的贡献。我赏你一个怪物封印方块拿去试试，哈哈~"

msgid "Oh, what you're holding is...  Hm~it seems like a pretty old mirror...  Don't you want to give me that? Let's make a deal, because it might be any use for you. What about it?"
msgstr "哦，你手里拿的是……嗯~看着像面挺古老的镜子……你不想把它给我吗？咱们做笔交易吧，它对你也许派不上什么用场。怎么样？"

msgid "Thank you. Choose one you'd like to have. Red Potion  will increase your hp by 300. Blue Potion increases your Defense  by 60, Yellow Potion will increase your EXP. But keep in mind that the EXP increases are different according to your level."
msgstr "谢谢。挑一件你想要的。红药水会让你的 HP 增加 300。蓝药水让你的防御增加 60，黄药水会增加你的 EXP。不过记住，EXP 的增量会随你的等级而不同。"

msgid "Hmm~ that mirror will be useless for you... Well, if you like it, that's fine."
msgstr "嗯~那镜子对你没什么用……好吧，你要是喜欢，那也行。"

msgid "Good luck. I should keep collecting samples. If you're not busy, bring me samples again, haha~"
msgstr "祝好运。我还得继续收集样本。你要不忙，再给我带样本过来，哈哈~"

msgid "Welcomd. <selfname>~ New Weapon Event is going on...  How are you doing?"
msgstr "欢迎。<selfname>~新武器活动正在进行……最近怎么样？"

msgid "10 new weapons will be newly introduced. Two-Handed Sword, Two-handed Axe, One-handed Sword, Bow, Knife, Flame Staff, Glacier Staff, Lightning Staff, Priest Club, Shield... 10 weapons were launched. I will give one Si Leveler bar for each person who obtains the 10 weapons and shows me first~!! Aren't you interested? Haha~I wonder what kind of weapon it may be. I heard the weapons looks great... believe it or not... "
msgstr "将新推出 10 种新武器。双手剑、双手斧、单手剑、弓、短刀、火焰法杖、冰川法杖、雷电法杖、牧师钉锤、盾牌……10 种武器上线了。谁先凑齐这 10 种武器并第一个拿给我看，我就每人送一根斯级强化条~！！你不感兴趣吗？哈哈~真不知会是怎样的武器。听说这些武器帅得很……信不信由你……"

msgid "For your information, the newly launched weapon, if combined with other materials, will be compound into a completed weapon. To learn about the compound, please ask [Heppa's Disciple] Shojin."
msgstr "顺便说一句，新推出的武器要是和其他材料组合，就会合成成一件成品武器。想了解合成，请问[赫帕的徒弟]肖金。"

msgid "Wow~this is the new weapon, the Two-handed Sword. The weapon will reveal a hidden power if upgraded to +7... but I would like to thank you for showing me this. Haha~Good luck."
msgstr "哇~这就是新武器，双手剑。这武器要是强化到 +7，就会显露隐藏的力量……不过还是谢谢你拿给我看。哈哈~祝好运。"

msgid "Well~you're a bit late. Another Knight already showed me the two-handed sword."
msgstr "唉~你来晚了一步。另一位骑士已经把双手剑拿给我看过了。"

msgid "Wow~this is the new weapon, the Two-handed Axe. The weapon will reveal a hidden power if upgraded to +7... but I would like to thank you for showing me this. Good luck!"
msgstr "哇~这就是新武器，双手斧。这武器要是强化到 +7，就会显露隐藏的力量……不过还是谢谢你拿给我看。祝好运！"

