msgstr "哇~这就是新武器，短刀。这武器要是强化到 +7，就会显露隐藏的力量……不过还是谢谢你拿给我看。祝好运！"

msgid "Don't you own any new weapons?"
msgstr "你一件新武器都没有吗？"

msgid "Do you want Mattock for Moradon? Well, collecting is pretty hard in the rough place like Ronark Land... but making a Mattock will cost you 3000 Noah for materials. Would you like to make Mattock?"
msgstr "你想要莫拉登用鹤嘴锄？唉，在罗纳克之地那种鬼地方采集可不容易……不过做一把鹤嘴锄材料费要 3000 诺亚。你想做鹤嘴锄吗？"

msgid "Collect 10 bones for 5 parts including head bone, leg bone, backbone, tail bone and foot bone, and then go to [Heppa's Disciple] Shojin to select  Production. "
msgstr "为五个部位各收集 10 块骨头，包括头骨、腿骨、脊骨、尾骨和足骨，然后去找[赫帕的徒弟]肖金选择「制作」。"

msgid "Well~you're a bit late. Another Knight already showed me the two-handed axe."
msgstr "唉~你来晚了一步。另一位骑士已经把双手斧拿给我看过了。"

msgid "Well~you're a bit late. Another Knight already showed me the one-handed sword."
msgstr "唉~你来晚了一步。另一位骑士已经把单手剑拿给我看过了。"

msgid "Well~you're a bit late. Another Knight already showed me the bow."
msgstr "唉~你来晚了一步。另一位骑士已经把弓拿给我看过了。"

msgid "Well~you're a bit late. Another Knight already showed me the Flame Staff."
msgstr "唉~你来晚了一步。另一位骑士已经把火焰法杖拿给我看过了。"

msgid "Well~you're a bit late. Another Knight already showed me the Glacier Staff."
msgstr "唉~你来晚了一步。另一位骑士已经把冰川法杖拿给我看过了。"

msgid "Well~you're a bit late. Another Knight already showed me the Lightning Staff."
