msgstr "唉~你来晚了一步。另一位骑士已经把牧师钉锤拿给我看过了。"

msgid "Well~you're a bit late. Another Knight already showed me the Shield."
msgstr "唉~你来晚了一步。另一位骑士已经把盾牌拿给我看过了。"

msgid "Well~you're a bit late. Another Knight already showed me the knife."
msgstr "唉~你来晚了一步。另一位骑士已经把短刀拿给我看过了。"

msgid "Hmm... material cost for Mattock is 3000 Noah."
msgstr "嗯……鹤嘴锄的材料费是 3000 诺亚。"

msgid "[A coffin with unidentified force was found. What would you like to do with it?]"
msgstr "[发现了一具散发着不明力量的棺材。你想怎么处理它？]"

msgid "Master, the Stamp of Strength is required to learn the skill 70 Level and 80 Level. [Warrior Master] Skaki will let you know."
msgstr "师父，学 70 级和 80 级技能需要「力量印记」。[战士大师]斯卡基会告诉你。"

msgid "Master, the Stamp of Strength is required to learn the 70 and 80 level skill. [Warrior Master] Skaki will let you know."
msgstr "师父，学 70 级和 80 级技能需要「力量印记」。[战士大师]斯卡基会告诉你。"

msgid "Master, the Nostrum of Speed is required to learn the 70 and 80 level skill. [Secret Agent] Clarence will let you know."
msgstr "师父，学 70 级和 80 级技能需要「迅捷秘药」。[密探]克拉伦斯会告诉你。"

msgid "Master, the Nostrum of Wisdom is required to learn the 70, 74 and 80 level skill.. [Priest] Minerva will let you know."
msgstr "师父，学 70、74 和 80 级技能需要「智慧秘药」。[牧师]密涅瓦会告诉你。"

msgid "Hmm... Is the Tyrant of All Means¡¼Marce Krowaz leading the Draki of All Means now? We shouldn't underestimate him... '"
msgstr "嗯……如今率领「万般卓拉克」的，是「万般暴君」马尔采·克罗瓦兹吗？我们可不能小看他……"

msgid "On my! Who are you? Do you have any business with me?"
msgstr "哎呀！你是谁？找我有事吗？"

msgid "...The Draki rejected the God of Logos, but  they were powerless. They were destined to slowly disappear from disasters and diseases. But there were some who appeared to help them. They wore white robes, and their voices were warm and deep like that of the Goddess Akara.  The Draki thought they would save them. So the Draki rejected the God of Logos, and started to worship them.  The Pure White Savior led the Draki to the Eternal Place, just before a meteorite fell in Ronark Land..."
msgstr "……卓拉克人曾背弃逻各斯之神，可他们无能为力。他们注定要在灾祸与疾病中慢慢消亡。可这时出现了一些人来帮助他们。他们身穿白袍，声音温暖而深沉，如同女神阿卡拉。卓拉克人以为他们会拯救自己。于是卓拉克人背弃了逻各斯之神，开始崇拜他们。就在一颗陨石坠落在罗纳克之地的前夕，纯白救世主带领卓拉克人前往了永恒之地……"

msgid "Are you interested in Krowaz's Land? The land to which the Gods of All Means took the Draki, which the Tyrant of All Mean Marce Krowa controls. If you have a chance to go there, bring me back some precious Gems. Then, I will make something useful for you."
msgstr "你对克罗瓦兹之地感兴趣吗？那是万般之神将卓拉克人带去的土地，由万般暴君马尔采·克罗瓦兹统治。你要是有机会去那儿，给我带回些珍贵的宝石。那样，我就给你做点有用的东西。"

msgid "Would you like to enter into the Krowaz's Land? If the party leader applies for the entrance, all the party members can enter into the same area at one scoop. Otherwise, everybody enters individually."
msgstr "你想进入克罗瓦兹之地吗？如果队长申请进入，整队成员就能一并进入同一区域。否则，大家各自单独进入。"

msgid "Are you leaving Krowaz's land?"
msgstr "你要离开克罗瓦兹之地吗？"

msgid "[You opened the coffin, but there was nothing.]"
msgstr "[你打开了棺材，但里面什么都没有。]"

msgid "Sorry, but only Level 70 players or higher can enter Krowaz's Land."
msgstr "抱歉，只有 70 级以上的玩家才能进入克罗瓦兹之地。"

msgid "This door does not open automatically. It's connected to other doors, and opens when others open... "
msgstr "这扇门不会自动打开。它和别的门相连，别人打开时它才会开……"

msgid "After the server integration, a new server opened. The opening event for the new¡ºGeronique¡»server is going on now!"
msgstr "服务器合并后，开了一个新服务器。新服务器「赫罗妮克」的开幕活动正在进行！"

msgid "A star sign for each day of the week is dropped. Whoever collects 10 star signs for that day of the week will be given many presents through a prize draw. The more star signs you give me during the event, the higher your chances for winning the prize becomes!! Haha~ For details, please refer to the event page on our website."
msgstr "一周里每天都会掉落一个星座。谁收集到某天对应的 10 个星座，就能通过抽奖获得许多礼物。活动期间你给我的星座越多，中奖几率就越高！！哈哈~详情请见我们官网的活动页面。"

msgid "# Event duration August 30~ September 13  # Star sign for each day of week  Monday (Arcas)  Tuesday (Virgo)  Wednesday (Libra)  Thursday (Canes Venatici)  Friday (Leo)  Saturday (Hydra)  Sunday (Corona Borealis) "
msgstr "# 活动时间 8 月 30 日~9 月 13 日 # 一周每日星座 周一（武仙座 Arcas） 周二（处女座） 周三（天秤座） 周四（猎犬座） 周五（狮子座） 周六（长蛇座） 周日（北冕座）"

msgid "You already participated in the event today. Please visit again tomorrow. Thank you."
msgstr "你今天已经参加过活动了。请明天再来。谢谢。"

msgid "You have collected Arcas. Would you like to register for the interview after giving the star signs to me?"
msgstr "你收集到了武仙座。把星座交给我之后，你想登记参加抽奖吗？"

msgid "You have collected Virgo. Would you like to register for the interview after giving the star signs to me?"
msgstr "你收集到了处女座。把星座交给我之后，你想登记参加抽奖吗？"

msgid "You have collected Libra. Would you like to register for the interview after giving the star signs to me?"
msgstr "你收集到了天秤座。把星座交给我之后，你想登记参加抽奖吗？"

msgid "You have collected Canes Venatici. Would you like to register for the interview after giving the star signs to me?"
msgstr "你收集到了猎犬座。把星座交给我之后，你想登记参加抽奖吗？"

msgid "You have collected Leo. Would you like to register for the interview after giving the star signs to me?"
msgstr "你收集到了狮子座。把星座交给我之后，你想登记参加抽奖吗？"

msgid "You have collected Hydra. Would you like to register for the interview after giving the star signs to me?"
msgstr "你收集到了长蛇座。把星座交给我之后，你想登记参加抽奖吗？"

msgid "You have collected Corona Borealis. Would you like to register for the interview after giving the star signs to me?"
msgstr "你收集到了北冕座。把星座交给我之后，你想登记参加抽奖吗？"

msgid "Thank you. Please visit again tomorrow. Have a nice day!"
msgstr "谢谢。请明天再来。祝你愉快！"

msgid "Welcome, <selfname>!! Welcome to the ¡ºGeronique¡» server. We give special gifts to Knights who reach the 60th Level on this server. 2 Vouchers for Pathos Gloves (15-day) will be given. Please go to [Peddler] Hemes. Hope to see you soon."
msgstr "欢迎，<selfname>！！欢迎来到「赫罗妮克」服务器。我们会给在本服务器达到 60 级的骑士特别礼物。将发放 2 张帕托斯手套兑换券（15 天）。请去找[商贩]赫墨斯。期待早日再见。"

msgid "<selfname>, you have reached the 60th Level. Congratulations! Please, continue to enjoy Geronique server, and we hope to see your character succeed even more!. Have a wonderful day!"
msgstr "<selfname>，你已达到 60 级。恭喜！请继续畅玩赫罗妮克服务器，我们期待你的角色更加辉煌！祝你度过美好的一天！"

msgid "Hmm~ This is a Certificate for Pathos's Gloves, registered with the Geronique server opening event. It can be exchanged with gloves for 15-day use. Would you like to exchange the event gloves certificate?"
msgstr "嗯~这是一张帕托斯手套凭证，已登记在赫罗妮克服务器开幕活动中。它可以兑换一双可用 15 天的手套。你想兑换活动手套凭证吗？"

msgid "You've already participated in the event before."
msgstr "你之前已经参加过活动了。"

msgid "It has been over a year since I last visited the continent of Adonis...  I never expected it to prosper like this, haha~ It has changed so much and I don't know where I am~"
msgstr "距我上次造访阿多尼斯大陆已经一年多了……我真没想到它会如此繁荣，哈哈~变化太大，我都不认路了~"

msgid " No, you don't have to care about it.  That doesn't really matter... Haha ~  I only dropped here to rest in Moradon during this Thanksgiving, so all I want is to have some fun... Haha~ Hey, don't you want a Thanksgiving gift? Bring me  10 Statues of Akarra.  Then although my skills are mediocre, I will cast you a buff that you need."
msgstr "不，你不必在意。那真的无关紧要……哈哈~我只是趁这个感恩节路过莫拉登歇歇脚，只想找点乐子……哈哈~喂，你不想要份感恩节礼物吗？给我带来 10 尊阿卡拉雕像。那样，虽说我手艺平平，也会给你加一个你需要的增益。"

msgid "Haha~ you have the Statues of Akarra... Won't you give them to me? I will cast you a useful buff in return for 10 of those statues, so what do you think? Haha~"
msgstr "哈哈~你带着阿卡拉雕像……不打算给我吗？你给我 10 尊雕像，我就给你加一个实用的增益，怎么样？哈哈~"

msgid "Good~ Then shall I show off my skills for once? Hey,hey~ Take it easy, you don't have to look so scared~ I used to be really famous for this, you know... (cough~) Just relax~ There won't be any side effect either... Haha~ Now, tell me what you need."
msgstr "好~那我就露一手我的本事吧？嘿，嘿~别紧张，你不用这么害怕~我这手当年可是很有名的……（咳~）放松就好~也不会有什么副作用……哈哈~好了，告诉我你需要什么。"

msgid "Huoh~ Don't be so greedy!! You can only receive one buff each time!! Come back when the power of my buff fades away.  Then enjoy your holiday ^^"
msgstr "嚯~别这么贪！！每次只能领一个增益！！等我的增益效果消退了再来。好好享受你的假期吧 ^^"

msgid "[Sigh of Relief~]Phew~ It was a success, hehe~ How do you like it? Then drop by again when the buff disappears, haha~"
msgstr "[松了口气~]呼~成功了，嘿嘿~感觉怎么样？等增益消失了再顺道过来，哈哈~"

msgid "A monster originally raised in Moradon for security purposes, they are now incorporated in mercenary training due to their violent nature. "
msgstr "这种怪物原本是为了安保目的在莫拉登饲养的，因其性情凶猛，现在被纳入了佣兵训练。"

