msgid "Pumpkin Monsters are in the fields. Bring me the event items from the Pumpkin Monsters and I will give you a Halloween Gift!"
msgstr "南瓜怪就在田野里。把南瓜怪身上的活动道具带给我，我就给你一份万圣节礼物！"

