msgid "Do you want to exit from here?"
msgstr "你想从这里退出吗？"

msgid "Master, do you know about the place called Arrdream? You should go to Fargo and ask him about it."
msgstr "师父，你听说过阿德雷姆这个地方吗？你该去找法戈问问。"

msgid "Master, do you know about the place called Arrdream? You should go to Polkwein and ask him about it."
msgstr "师父，你听说过阿德雷姆这个地方吗？你该去找波尔克温问问。"

msgid "There's no room to put the letter of introduction in.  Empty your inventory and then come back."
msgstr "背包里没有放介绍信的空位了。清空背包后再来。"

msgid "One caught by madness cannot see beyond one's own nose... And the madness can drag you even deeper into the depth of darkness..."
msgstr "被疯狂攫住的人，看不见自己鼻尖以外的东西……而那疯狂还会把你更深地拖入黑暗的深渊……"

msgid "Those ones seized with madness might be running around and causing trouble somewhere here in Islante right now... Shall we go and have a look? Troll Warriors seized with madness, huh... Kuku~"
msgstr "那些被疯狂攫住的家伙，这会儿说不定就在艾斯兰特这一带到处乱跑闹事……咱们去看看？被疯狂攫住的巨魔战士，呵……咯咯~"

msgid "Master, nice shot~!!"
msgstr "师父，漂亮的一击~！！"

msgid "Won't you come with me to watch those seized with madness? Kuku~"
msgstr "不跟我一块儿去看看那些被疯狂攫住的家伙吗？咯咯~"

msgid "I watched you crushing those seized with madness.. But this wind of madness will not be stopped that easily~"
msgstr "我看着你碾碎那些被疯狂攫住的家伙……可这股疯狂之风，可不会那么轻易停下~"

msgid "Get rid of your pride.. Or you won't become any stronger.  This would be the end of the road for you if you are intoxicated by how strong you have become. But what you really face on your path to strength may not be the shadow of your pride, but your own hesitation... Will you be able to understand it yourself? "
msgstr "放下你的骄傲……否则你不会变得更强。你要是陶醉于自己变得多强，那这条路也就到头了。可你在变强之路上真正面对的，也许不是骄傲的影子，而是你自己的犹豫……你自己能明白吗？"

msgid "Break your limit... <selfname>~"
msgstr "打破你的极限……<selfname>~"

msgid "Master, you have done well~."
msgstr "师父，你做得很好~。"

msgid " So, did I take another step forward?? Haha~"
msgstr "那么，我是不是又向前迈进了一步？？哈哈~"

msgid "Merry Christmas ^0^//"
msgstr "圣诞快乐 ^0^//"

msgid "what a surprise~ Did you bring me a present? Yes? Ho~ ho~ ho~"
msgstr "真惊喜~你给我带礼物来了？真的？吼~吼~吼~"

msgid "Nice to meet you~ I am a [Sexy Santa] Parfait ho~ho~ Maybe I don't look like Santa because I am wearing Sexy Santa cloth ho ho, but I am Santa Claus~¢½. You can call me Sexy Santa"
msgstr "幸会~我是[性感圣诞老人]帕菲，吼~吼~也许我看着不像圣诞老人，因为我穿着性感圣诞老人装，吼吼，但我就是圣诞老人~¢½。你可以叫我性感圣诞老人。"

msgid "You don't belive me that I am Santa? If you do me a favor, I will give you a nice Christmas present. Hmm..let's see..what kind of favor I should ask you..ho~ho~"
msgstr "你不信我是圣诞老人？你帮我个忙，我就送你份漂亮的圣诞礼物。嗯……让我想想……该让你帮什么忙呢……吼~吼~"

msgid "Surprise~ Snowman Transform Scroll~¡Ù I only will give you this when you bring me 20 Christmas Trees~ Everytime you bring me 20 Christmas Trees, I will give you one scroll of your choice and I have many different styles~ ho~ho~"
msgstr "惊喜~雪人变身卷轴~¡Ù 你给我带来 20 棵圣诞树，我才给你这个~每次你给我带来 20 棵圣诞树，我就送你一张你挑的卷轴，我可有好多种样式呢~吼~吼~"

msgid "Say good-bye to your sad looking accessories because I have Surprise!! Christmas belt and Christmas Pendant~¡Ù I only will give this present when you bring me 100 Christmas Trees. When you bring me 100 Christmas Trees, your present could be a Belt or maybe"
msgstr "跟你那寒碜的饰品说再见吧，因为我有惊喜！！圣诞腰带和圣诞吊坠~¡Ù 你得给我带来 100 棵圣诞树，我才送这份礼物。你带来 100 棵圣诞树时，你的礼物可能是腰带，也可能是"

msgid "Ah! Found it ho~ho~ Gain additional exprerience with Santa's Smile..and..let's see..Increase your defense with Santa's Coat..and...Last but not the least~ Increase your HP with Santa's Mind! Everytime you bring me 20 Lost Present, I will give you one item o"
msgstr "啊！找到了吼~吼~用「圣诞老人的微笑」获得额外经验……还有……让我想想……用「圣诞老人的外衣」提升你的防御……还有……最后但同样重要的~用「圣诞老人的意志」提升你的 HP！每次你给我带来 20 个遗失的礼物，我就送你一件"

msgid "Ah! Found it ho~ho~ Gain extra Nation Points with Santa's Present..and..let's see..Increase your defense with Santa's Coat..and...Last but not the least~ Increase your HP with Santa's Mind! Everytime you bring me 20 Lost Present, I will give you one item of"
msgstr "啊！找到了吼~吼~用「圣诞老人的礼物」获得额外国家点数……还有……让我想想……用「圣诞老人的外衣」提升你的防御……还有……最后但同样重要的~用「圣诞老人的意志」提升你的 HP！每次你给我带来 20 个遗失的礼物，我就送你一件"

msgid "You will bring me a lost present, won't you??"
msgstr "你会给我带来遗失的礼物的，对吧？？"

msgid "You will bring me a Christmas Tree, won't you??"
msgstr "你会给我带来圣诞树的，对吧？？"

msgid "Joy! Joy! You can exchange 20 Christmas Trees for Snowman Transform Scroll~¢½ Would you like to exchange?"
msgstr "太棒了！你可以用 20 棵圣诞树兑换雪人变身卷轴~¢½。你想兑换吗？"

msgid "Thank you so~~ much!! Have a Merry Christmas and please Love Knight Online more~¢½"
msgstr "太~~感谢了！！祝你圣诞快乐，请更加热爱 Knight Online 吧~¢½"

msgid "Joy! Joy! You can exchange 100 Christmas Trees for Christmas Accessory~¢½, Would you like to exchange?"
msgstr "太棒了！你可以用 100 棵圣诞树兑换圣诞饰品~¢½，你想兑换吗？"

msgid "Hmmm..You don't have enough Christmas Trees to exchange for Christmas Accessory"
msgstr "嗯……你的圣诞树不够，换不了圣诞饰品。"

msgid "Joy! Joy! You can exchange 20 Lost Present for Christmas Scroll of your choice~¢½ Would you like to exchange?"
msgstr "太棒了！你可以用 20 个遗失的礼物兑换一张你挑的圣诞卷轴~¢½。你想兑换吗？"

msgid "Your inventory is full. You have so many items"
msgstr "你的背包满了。你东西真多。"

msgid "Oops!!.. You don't have enought X-mas trees to exchange with a Snowman ransformation scroll"
msgstr "哎呀！！……你的圣诞树不够，换不了雪人变身卷轴。"

msgid "Oops!! ..You don't have enough lost presents to exchange with a X-mas package present"
msgstr "哎呀！！……你的遗失礼物不够，换不了圣诞礼包。"

msgid "I cannot let the El Morad take over this base, never!!"
msgstr "我绝不能让艾莫拉德占领这个基地，绝不！！"

msgid "There's a mission for you, <selfname>..."
msgstr "有个任务交给你，<selfname>……"

msgid "You're new around here. It's obvious you're a Mage from the power flowing through you. You decide you want to reach a higher level as a Mage, come find me. I'll teach you new magic."
msgstr "你是新来的吧。从你体内流动的力量就能看出，你是个法师。等你决定要在法师这条路上走得更远，就来找我。我教你新魔法。"

msgid "Searching for Drake, Master? I heard he's in <font color=@#006699@>Linate Village</font>. Look for him there!"
msgstr "在找德雷克吗，师父？我听说他在<font color=@#006699@>利纳特村</font>。去那儿找他吧！"

msgid "Impressive! You found me. Now for that new magic I promised you."
msgstr "了不起！你找到我了。现在就来教我答应你的新魔法吧。"

msgid "What the..? Who are you?"
msgstr "搞什么……？你是谁？"

msgid "Your magic power will increase accordingly when you reach Level 35. We've got to increase your skill and these Magic Scrolls should do the trick. They'll help you gain renown as a Mage."
msgstr "等你到 35 级，你的魔力会相应提升。我们得提升你的技能，这些魔法卷轴正合用。它们会帮你博得名声，成为一名法师。"

msgid "It's not free, though. Magic Scrolls don't make themselves, you follow? You got to get me some materials!"
msgstr "不过这不是白给的。魔法卷轴又不会自己长腿做出来，明白吗？你得给我弄些材料来！"

msgid "You still didn't get enough? Buy Magic Stones at the store. Go on!"
msgstr "你还没凑够？去商店买魔法石。快去！"

msgid "You haven't finished collecting all the materials I told you, yet?"
msgstr "我叫你收集的材料，你还没凑齐吗？"

msgid "You need 5 Pincer Poisons for the Blast Spell. "
msgstr "爆裂法术需要 5 个螯钳毒囊。"

msgid "Blast Magic requires 200 Magic Stones. What, you don't know where to buy them? Get them at the store. Hurry it up!"
msgstr "爆裂魔法需要 200 颗魔法石。怎么，你不知道上哪儿买？去商店买。快点！"

msgid "Got them? Hand 'em over and I'll make you a Magic Scroll."
msgstr "弄到了？交出来，我给你做魔法卷轴。"

msgid "When you go to the front of El Morad castle gate, you will see the Pincers. "
msgstr "你走到艾莫拉德城堡正门前，就能看见那些螯钳怪。"

msgid "Master, all the materials have been gathered."
msgstr "师父，材料都集齐了。"

msgid "Well, everything's ready. Now what type of Magic Scroll do you want? There are Magic Scrolls for Flame, Glacier, and Lightning. Choose one that best suits the magic power flowing through your body."
msgstr "好，万事俱备。那你要哪种魔法卷轴？有火焰、冰川和雷电三种。挑一个最契合你体内流动魔力的。"

msgid "Good. Now you're ready to perform properly as a Mage. Stop by anytime you want another Magic Scroll, but remember nothing is free."
msgstr "好。现在你可以像模像样地当一名法师了。想要别的魔法卷轴随时来找我，但记住，没有什么是免费的。"

msgid "Didn`t I tell you to bring back the Emblem of Karus?"
msgstr "我不是叫你把卡鲁斯徽章带回来吗？"

msgid "10 million EXP are awarded for infiltrating enemy mainland after winning the Lunar War and capturing Lich near Kalluga Valley and collecting the Emblem of Karus. "
msgstr "在月之战争获胜后渗入敌国本土、于卡卢加谷附近擒获巫妖并夺获卡鲁斯徽章者，奖励 1000 万 EXP。"

msgid "When you go to the front of Karus castle gate, you will see the Pincers. "
msgstr "你走到卡鲁斯城堡正门前，就能看见那些螯钳怪。"

msgid "Master, You've have collected all the materials."
msgstr "师父，你把材料都集齐了。"

msgid "I see you brought everything I told you. Yes... From now one I will call you by the title of Elemental Lord, the one who has a thorough knowledge of the universe.  Would you like change your Job now?"
msgstr "我看你把我交代的东西都带来了。没错……从今往后，我就以「元素之主」这个称号称呼你，那是通晓宇宙万物之人的称号。你想现在转职吗？"

msgid "Hm. Now you are ready.  I appoint you as a Blade Master. Would you like to change your Job now?"
msgstr "嗯。现在你准备好了。我任命你为刀锋大师。你想现在转职吗？"

msgid "There enough items here to conduct the ceremony.  You will be conferred the name of Kasar Hood.  Would you like to hold the ceremony right now?"
msgstr "这里的道具足够举行仪式了。你将被授予「卡萨兜帽」之名。你想现在就举行仪式吗？"

msgid "You have prepared all the items needed for the 2nd Job change.  You are here to take an oath with the god as a Paladin.  Would you like to hold the ceremony right now?"
msgstr "你已经备齐了二次转职所需的全部道具。你来此是要以圣骑士的身份与神立誓。你想现在就举行仪式吗？"

msgid "You wasting my time? You don't want it, get out!"
msgstr "你在浪费我的时间？不想要就滚出去！"

msgid "Your bag seems full."
msgstr "你的背包好像满了。"

msgid "[The classified documents box of our force is well kept right now]"
msgstr "[我方机密文件箱目前保管妥当]"

msgid "[We haven't found anything]"
msgstr "[我们什么都没找到]"

msgid "Master, your inventory is full and there is no space for the Classified Document. "
msgstr "师父，你的背包满了，没有放机密文件的空位。"

msgid "[You have succeeded in seizing the document from the Classified Documents Box]"
msgstr "[你已成功从机密文件箱中夺取文件]"

msgid "I am analyst Caesar | What kind of mission do you want?||- Spy Rescue Mission :  Available once a day |- Seize the Enemy's Classified Document  mission: Available only on Mondays, Wednesdays, Fridays and Sundays |- Searching for the Lost Soul Mission : Available only on Tuesdays, Thursdays, and Saturdays"
msgstr "我是分析官凯撒 | 你想接哪种任务？||——密探营救任务：每天可接一次|——夺取敌国机密文件任务：仅限周一、周三、周五、周日|——寻找失落之魂任务：仅限周二、周四、周六"

msgid "I am analyst Julius | What kind of mission do you want?||- Spy Rescue Mission :  Available once a day |- Seize the Enemy's Classified Document  mission: Available only on Mondays, Wednesdays, Fridays and Sundays |- Searching for the Lost Soul Mission : Available only on Tuesdays, Thursdays, and Saturdays"
msgstr "我是分析官尤利乌斯 | 你想接哪种任务？||——密探营救任务：每天可接一次|——夺取敌国机密文件任务：仅限周一、周三、周五、周日|——寻找失落之魂任务：仅限周二、周四、周六"

msgid "I analyze the information I get from the spies who work in various places of Ronark Land.  What do you think.. Would you like to try too?"
msgstr "我分析从在罗纳克之地各处活动的密探那儿得到的情报。你觉得……要不要也来试试？"

msgid "I don't think I can give you a mission since we don't know the location of the soul that is still lingering in this world "
msgstr "我没法给你派任务，因为我们还不知道那个仍在世间徘徊的灵魂的位置。"

msgid "I am sorry - "
msgstr "抱歉——"

msgid "First of all, you should know the location of El Morad Military HQ in advance.  Return with a classified document from the El Morad Military HQ, but remember that each document has different grade.  The higher grade the classified document is, the higher your reward will be, and one more thing..."
msgstr "首先，你得事先弄清艾莫拉德军方总部的位置。从艾莫拉德军方总部带回一份机密文件，但记住每份文件的等级不同。机密文件等级越高，你的报酬就越丰厚，还有一件事……"

msgid "You will need this potion.  To open that classified document box, you will need the power of this potion.  Not only it makes your body invisible for 1 minute so you can evade the detection by the enemy's guard tower, you need the power of this potion to open that document box.  But, remember that you cannot evade the eyes of the enemy rogues and general magic of the magicians.  This potion is extremely difficult to make, so it will cost you 1 million Noahs. What would you like to do?"
msgstr "你会需要这瓶药水。要打开那个机密文件箱，你需要这药水的力量。它不仅能让你的身体隐形 1 分钟，好躲过敌方哨塔的侦测，你还需要这药水的力量才能打开文件箱。但是，记住你躲不过敌方刺客的眼睛和法师的通用魔法。这药水极难配制，所以要收你 100 万诺亚。你想怎么做？"

msgid "You have already carried out today's mission.  Hey, you know how to have a kick - "
msgstr "你今天的任务已经做完了。嘿，你可真会找乐子——"

msgid "Master, do you know of [Analyst] Caesar in Ronark Land ?"
msgstr "师父，你知道罗纳克之地的[分析官]凯撒吗？"

msgid "Master, you have seized the enemy's classified document."
msgstr "师父，你已经夺取了敌方的机密文件。"

msgid "Return with the classified document from the enemy's military HQ. And you must never lose the potion I gave to you."
msgstr "从敌方军方总部带回机密文件。还有，我给你的药水绝不能弄丢。"

msgid "Wow.. This mission wasn't easy at all but you managed to complete it successfully.  Hand it over to me now."
msgstr "哇……这个任务可一点都不轻松，可你还是顺利完成了。现在把它交给我吧。"

msgid "What??? That document... Didn't you bring it here to give me??"
msgstr "什么？？那份文件……你不是把它带来交给我的吗？？"

msgid "Your mission ended as soon as it went past midnight.  Now this document is nothing more than a mere piece of paper."
msgstr "一过午夜，你的任务就结束了。现在这份文件不过是一张废纸罢了。"

msgid "I don't think I can give you a mission since we don't know the location of the soul yet. "
msgstr "我没法给你派任务，因为我们还不知道那个灵魂的位置。"

msgid "First of all, you should know the location of Karus Military HQ in advance.  Return with a classified document from the Karus Military HQ, but remember that each document has different grade.  The higher grade the classified document is, the higher your reward will be, and one more thing..."
msgstr "首先，你得事先弄清卡鲁斯军方总部的位置。从卡鲁斯军方总部带回一份机密文件，但记住每份文件的等级不同。机密文件等级越高，你的报酬就越丰厚，还有一件事……"

msgid "Master, do you know of [Analyst] Julius in Ronark Land ?"
msgstr "师父，你知道罗纳克之地的[分析官]尤利乌斯吗？"

msgid "The location of another sealed soul should be found by tomorrow... Would you like to come back tomorrow?"
msgstr "另一个被封印灵魂的位置明天之前应该能找到……你想明天再来吗？"

msgid "I am still busy analyzing the enemy's classified documents collected so far... I'm sorry but could you visit again tomorrow?"
msgstr "我还在忙着分析目前收集到的敌方机密文件……抱歉，你能明天再来吗？"

msgid "There have been so many battles here in Ronark Land, and many Karus knights were killed in battle.  It is their effort that did not let El Morad to take over this place."
msgstr "罗纳克之地这里经历过太多战斗，许多卡鲁斯骑士战死沙场。正是他们的牺牲，才没让艾莫拉德占领此地。"

msgid "According to the information that just came in, an unidentified corpse has been found near the central area of Ronark.  I am guessing that it could be the body of our Karus warrior... I want you to go there and confirm it."
msgstr "根据刚收到的情报，在罗纳克中心区域附近发现了一具不明尸体。我猜那可能是我们卡鲁斯战士的遗体……我要你去那儿确认一下。"

msgid " But, you will have to hurry as I heard that El Morad is also looking for that corpse.  It will be for naught If they get the body before us. "
msgstr "不过你得抓紧，因为我听说艾莫拉德也在找那具尸体。要是让他们抢先拿到遗体，我们就白忙活了。"

msgid "This altar delivers the King's prayer to the God when the nation is losing in war. But do not expect a response from the God without offering the national treasury."
msgstr "这座祭坛会在国家战事不利时，把国王的祈祷传达给神。但不献上国库，就别指望神会回应。"

msgid "Okay - then go to the central area by this way.  You will have to search the central area very thoroughly. "
msgstr "好——那就从这条路去中心区域。你得把中心区域仔仔细细搜一遍。"

msgid "        Steal the enemy's classified document!|- the potion you are given is for one-use only, and the stealth skill comes into effect for one minute (If you don't have the potion, then you can get it from NPC again)|- Keep it mind that the stealth skill of the potion you received is not effective against the general magic of magicians and the eyes of the enemy's rogues. "
msgstr "        夺取敌方机密文件！|——给你的药水只能用一次，隐身效果持续 1 分钟（要是没药水，可以再找 NPC 领）|——记住，你拿到的这瓶药水的隐身效果，对法师的通用魔法和敌方刺客的眼睛无效。"

msgid "Master, I think this is what Caesar wanted, so let's hurry back and report to him. "
msgstr "师父，我想这就是凯撒要的东西，咱们快回去向他复命吧。"

msgid "Do you know that  you are given 10 minutes??"
msgstr "你知道你有 10 分钟时间吧？？"

msgid "Huh!! That.. That is... The dead soul didn't find the right way- Is this what we say we were lucky that this happened. If he was in the hands of El Morad he wouldn't have been able to rest even after his death... Well done, <selfname>..."
msgstr "啊！那……那是……那亡魂没能找到归途——这事发生了，我们反倒该说是幸运。他要是落到艾莫拉德手里，死后都不得安息……干得好，<selfname>……"

msgid "Are you going to look after that soul??"
msgstr "你要去照料那个灵魂吗？？"

msgid "There have been so many battles here in Ronark Land, and many El Morad knights were killed in battle.  It is their effort that did not let Karus to take over this place."
msgstr "罗纳克之地这里经历过太多战斗，许多艾莫拉德骑士战死沙场。正是他们的牺牲，才没让卡鲁斯占领此地。"

msgid " But, you will have to hurry as I heard that Karus is also looking for that corpse.  It will be for naught If they get the body before us."
msgstr "不过你得抓紧，因为我听说卡鲁斯也在找那具尸体。要是让他们抢先拿到遗体，我们就白忙活了。"

msgid "Human power always has its limit. If you are losing, borrow the power from God. But, God's help always costs you something.."
msgstr "人的力量总有极限。快撑不住的时候，就去借神的力量。但是，神的帮助总要你付出些代价……"

msgid "        Searchng for the Lost Soul.. |- The limit time for the mission is 10 minutes |- You can find the dead body in the central area of Ronark Land |- After accepting the quest, for 10 minutes, you can not use summon skill and the village (But, if you get reward, the ban is canceled)."
msgstr "        寻找失落之魂……|——任务限时 10 分钟|——你可以在罗纳克之地中心区域找到尸体|——接任务后的 10 分钟内，你无法使用召唤技能和回城（但领到奖励后，此限制解除）。"

msgid "Master, I think this is what Julius wanted, so let's hurry back and report to him. "
msgstr "师父，我想这就是尤利乌斯要的东西，咱们快回去向他复命吧。"

msgid "Huh!! That.. That is... The dead soul didn't find the right way- Is this what we say we were lucky that this happened. If he was in the hands of Karus he wouldn't have been able to rest even after his death... Well done, <selfname>..."
msgstr "啊！那……那是……那亡魂没能找到归途——这事发生了，我们反倒该说是幸运。他要是落到卡鲁斯手里，死后都不得安息……干得好，<selfname>……"

msgid "[You found the dead body of a Karus warrior who seems to be killed while fighting bravely..]"
msgstr "[你发现了一具卡鲁斯战士的遗体，他似乎是在英勇作战时牺牲的……]"

msgid "[You found the dead body of an El Morad warrior who seems to be killed while fighting bravely..]"
msgstr "[你发现了一具艾莫拉德战士的遗体，他似乎是在英勇作战时牺牲的……]"

msgid "[You didn't find anything new.]"
msgstr "[你没有发现任何新东西。]"

msgid "[You found something in the dead body.]"
msgstr "[你在遗体身上发现了某物。]"

msgid "Master, your inventory is full."
msgstr "师父，你的背包满了。"

msgid "[The soul who hasn't left the battlefield is staying in the dead body]"
msgstr "[尚未离开战场的灵魂仍留在遗体中]"

msgid "Master, if you need <font color=@#006666@>Low Level Elemental Magic Scroll</font>, look for Menissiah."
msgstr "师父，你要是需要<font color=@#006666@>低级元素魔法卷轴</font>，就去找梅尼西亚。"

msgid "Low Level Elemental Magic Scroll? Did I have that?"
msgstr "低级元素魔法卷轴？我有那东西吗？"

msgid "Ah, here it is! This what you wanted? I haven't used it for a while so it slipped my mind. You need it?"
msgstr "啊，在这儿！这就是你要的？我好久没用，都忘了。你需要它？"

msgid "Make you a deal. I need Apples of Moradon for reasons of my own, see, but I have no clue how to find it. Suppose you get me 5 Apples of Moradon and I'll give YOU this Magic Scroll."
msgstr "做个交易吧。我自己因为一些原因需要莫拉登苹果，可我完全不知道上哪儿找。要不你给我弄来 5 个莫拉登苹果，我就把这魔法卷轴给你。"

msgid "Nothing free in this world. Or can't you handle it?"
msgstr "这世上没有白给的东西。还是说，你办不到？"

msgid "Master, all 5 Apples of Moradon have been gathered!"
msgstr "师父，5 个莫拉登苹果都集齐了！"

msgid "Still don't have it? Putting me on the spot here..."
msgstr "还没弄到？你这是要让我下不来台啊……"

msgid "Look at that, got it right away. You're better than I thought."
msgstr "哟，看，立马就弄到了。你比我想的厉害。"

msgid "Doubt you can get them. That's F-A-N-G O-F W-E-R-E-W-O-L-F, by the way."
msgstr "我看你弄不到。顺便告诉你，那可是 狼-人-之-牙 。"

msgid "Hm.. without help of the power of this potion, you won't be able to succeed this mission. "
msgstr "嗯……不借这药水的力量，你完成不了这个任务。"

msgid " 5000 Noahs might be reasonable for me, don't you think so? Okay, bring me 5000 Noahs and try it!"
msgstr "5000 诺亚对我来说算公道价了吧？行，给我带来 5000 诺亚，然后试试！"

msgid "Happy new year, haha~~ I have something good and would you like to see it??"
msgstr "新年快乐，哈哈~~我有个好东西，你想看看吗？？"

msgid "This is such a unique scroll that can transform your pet into Etaros.. Haha~~"
msgstr "这可是独一无二的卷轴，能把你的宠物变身成埃塔罗……哈哈~~"

msgid "If you want to have this scroll, look for Etaroses that are spread all over this continent, collect 50 pieces in which their souls are kept in and bring them to me. "
msgstr "你想要这卷轴的话，就去找遍布整个大陆的埃塔罗，收集 50 块封存着它们灵魂的碎片带给我。"

msgid "Collecting 50 pieces of Etaros Soul, Great ~~~ Success!!"
msgstr "收集 50 块埃塔罗之魂，太棒了~~~成功！！"

msgid "You need 50 pieces of Etaros soul. "
msgstr "你需要 50 块埃塔罗之魂。"

msgid "Haha~~ You did a great job... Happy new year!"
msgstr "哈哈~~你干得漂亮……新年快乐！"

msgid "You chose premium potion. Please select a correct potion type for your voucher"
msgstr "你选了高级药水。请为你的兑换券选择正确的药水类型。"

msgid "You chose 100 premium HP potion. Would you like to receive it?"
msgstr "你选了 100 高级 HP 药水。你想领取吗？"

msgid "Sorry, you don't have a voucher for 100 premium HP potion"
msgstr "抱歉，你没有 100 高级 HP 药水的兑换券。"

msgid "Thank you. "
msgstr "谢谢。"

msgid "You chose 300 premium HP potion. Would you like to receive it?"
msgstr "你选了 300 高级 HP 药水。你想领取吗？"

msgid "Sorry, you don't have a voucher for 300 premium HP potion"
msgstr "抱歉，你没有 300 高级 HP 药水的兑换券。"

msgid "You chose 100 premium MP potion. Would you like to receive it?"
msgstr "你选了 100 高级 MP 药水。你想领取吗？"

msgid "Sorry, you don't have a voucher for 100 premium MP potion"
msgstr "抱歉，你没有 100 高级 MP 药水的兑换券。"

msgid "You chose 300 premium MP potion. Would you like to receive it?"
msgstr "你选了 300 高级 MP 药水。你想领取吗？"

msgid "Sorry, you don't have a voucher for 300 premium MP potion"
msgstr "抱歉，你没有 300 高级 MP 药水的兑换券。"

msgid "Hm.. you have grown up too big to go to Arrdream - About the intense battles you had in Ardream, just keep that as a precious memory now. "
msgstr "嗯……你已经长大，不适合再去阿德雷姆了——那些你在阿德雷姆经历的激烈战斗，现在就把它当作一段珍贵的回忆吧。"

msgid "[You can't open the classified document box] "
msgstr "[你打不开机密文件箱]"

msgid "The potion is 1 million Noahs... Would you like to buy it?"
msgstr "这药水要 100 万诺亚……你想买吗？"

msgid "You need a [Bahamut Armor Certificate] to get the Bahamut Armor. A [Bahamut Armor Certificate] can be purchased from the Power-up store."
msgstr "要拿到巴哈姆特盔甲，你需要一张[巴哈姆特盔甲凭证]。[巴哈姆特盔甲凭证]可以从强化商店购买。"

msgid "You have selected Bahamut Armor HP+200 Would you really like to get it?"
msgstr "你选择了巴哈姆特盔甲 HP+200。你真的要领取吗？"

msgid "You have selected Bahamut Armor Defense +30. Would you really like to get it?"
msgstr "你选择了巴哈姆特盔甲 防御+30。你真的要领取吗？"

msgid "You have selected Bahamut Armor EXP Gain Rate +4%. Would you really like to get it?"
msgstr "你选择了巴哈姆特盔甲 EXP 获取率+4%。你真的要领取吗？"

msgid "You have selected Bahamut Armor Noah Drop Rate +6%. Would you really like to get it?"
msgstr "你选择了巴哈姆特盔甲 诺亚掉落率+6%。你真的要领取吗？"

msgid "You have selected Bahamut Helmet HP+100. Would you really like to get it?"
msgstr "你选择了巴哈姆特头盔 HP+100。你真的要领取吗？"

msgid "You have selected Bahamut Helmet Defense +20. Would you really like to get it?"
msgstr "你选择了巴哈姆特头盔 防御+20。你真的要领取吗？"

msgid "You have selected Bahamut Helmet EXP Gain Rate +2%. Would you really like to get it?"
msgstr "你选择了巴哈姆特头盔 EXP 获取率+2%。你真的要领取吗？"

msgid "You have selected Bahamut Helmet Noah Drop Rate +3%. Would you really like to get it?"
msgstr "你选择了巴哈姆特头盔 诺亚掉落率+3%。你真的要领取吗？"

msgid "Master, do you know Asgaberry?"
msgstr "师父，你听说过阿斯加莓吗？"

msgid "Master, do you know something about Cardinal jewel?"
msgstr "师父，你知道「枢机宝石」是什么吗？"

msgid "Do you know the chocolate that makes you fall into love? I need that chocolate right now so desperately. Would you like to find it for me?"
msgstr "你知道那种能让你坠入爱河的巧克力吗？我现在急需那种巧克力。你愿意帮我找吗？"

msgid "Thank you.  [Chocolatier] Cacao who is at the port right now would know something about it."
msgstr "谢谢。此刻在港口的[巧克力师]可可应该知道些什么。"

msgid "Love Chocolate? I am not selling it now 'cause it wasn't profitable.  Unless I have  Lavender..."
msgstr "爱情巧克力？我现在不卖那个，因为不赚钱。除非我有薰衣草……"

msgid "Hm..I'm sorry but would you please step aside for me? I'm really busy trying to adjust to the demand of Valentine chocolates."
msgstr "嗯……抱歉，你能让一让吗？我真的忙得不可开交，正赶着赶制情人节巧克力。"

msgid "Collecting 10 Lavender complete!!"
msgstr "收集 10 株薰衣草完成！！"

msgid "Wow ~ You have collected the ones with good quality. I will make it for you soon."
msgstr "哇~你收集到的这些品质真好。我这就给你做。"

msgid "That is Love Chocolate~~. You should bring that to Menicia~"
msgstr "那就是爱情巧克力~~。你该把它带给梅尼西亚~"

msgid "Have you met with Cacao?"
msgstr "你见到可可了吗？"

msgid "Wow~ Lavender flavor chocolate.. Thank you.  Here, take this.  It's a gift for you since you always comply with my request."
msgstr "哇~薰衣草味的巧克力……谢谢。来，拿着。这是给你的礼物，亏你总是答应我的请求。"

msgid "Phew~ I'm so busy! Hey you! Find some chocolate for me!"
msgstr "呼~我忙死了！喂！给我找点巧克力来！"

msgid "Phew~ I'm so busy! "
msgstr "呼~我忙死了！"

msgid "First of all, get special chocolate from  [Chocolatier] Valence  and bring it here."
msgstr "首先，去[巧克力师]瓦朗斯那儿拿到特制巧克力，再把它带过来。"

msgid "Master, you have received the special chocolate~ you should bring it to Ciders."
msgstr "师父，你拿到特制巧克力了~你该把它带给西德斯。"

msgid "Did you see [Chocolatier] Valence?"
msgstr "你见到[巧克力师]瓦朗斯了吗？"

msgid "All right~ This is it. Thank you!"
msgstr "好嘞~就是这个。谢谢！"

msgid "To make that chocolate, you have to bring the materials for that. The materials are 5 lavenders and 5 rosemaries."
msgstr "要做那种巧克力，你得把材料带来。材料是 5 株薰衣草和 5 枝迷迭香。"

msgid "Yo ho~!"
msgstr "哟呵~！"

msgid "Master, you've collected all the materials for the chocolate~ "
msgstr "师父，做巧克力的材料你都集齐了~"

msgid "Are you still collecting the materials I requested?"
msgstr "你还在收集我要的材料吗？"

msgid "Aha~ You have brought them on time! Now you can bring this to Ciders."
msgstr "啊哈~你按时带来了！这下你可以把这个带给西德斯了。"

msgid "Hm.. What have I done today~~"
msgstr "嗯……我今天都干了些什么呀~~"

msgid "I haven't lost it yet!!!"
msgstr "我还没把它弄丢呢！！！"

msgid "What about my diary?? Huh???"
msgstr "我的日记呢？？啊？？？"

msgid "Um, ah! Uh?? This is my diary.. Thank you ~ (Hm, but I feel like I will lose it again tomorrow..) "
msgstr "嗯，啊！呃？？这是我的日记……谢谢~（嗯，可我感觉明天我又会把它弄丢……）"

msgid "Um, ah! Uh?? My diary!! My diary!!! My diary is gone!!!!! Hey~ Have you seen my diary?? I think I lost it somewhere near the  Outskirt of Inside the Moradon Castle.."
msgstr "嗯，啊！呃？？我的日记！！我的日记！！！我的日记不见了！！！！！喂~你看见我的日记了吗？我想我是把它丢在莫拉登城堡外围附近的什么地方了……"

msgid "Oh, did you find the diary?? Haha~"
msgstr "哦，你找到日记了？？哈哈~"

msgid "[You have acquired the diary.]"
msgstr "[你拾到了日记。]"

msgid "Master, you've already found the diary^^"
msgstr "师父，你已经找到日记了^^"

msgid "Ah.. I have to prepare a present for my boyfriend..."
msgstr "啊……我得为男朋友准备一份礼物……"

msgid "Master, if Moradon has Mercenary Captain Cougar, we have [Captain] Fargo. It wouldn`t hurt to say hello."
msgstr "师父，莫拉登有佣兵队长库伽，我们这儿有[队长]法戈。去打个招呼没坏处。"

msgid "Master, all [Reconnaissance Report] and [3 Scouting Maps] have been gathered. Hurry back to [Captain] Fargo."
msgstr "师父，[侦察报告]和[3 张侦察地图]都集齐了。快回[队长]法戈那儿去。"

msgid "What about the reconnaissance map? Don`t tell me you dropped it somewhere."
msgstr "侦察地图怎么回事？别告诉我你给掉在哪儿了。"

msgid "Listen, I told you to bring the reconnaissance report. Just what have you done?"
msgstr "听着，我叫你把侦察报告带来。你刚才到底干什么去了？"

msgid "I should share my mission with you. "
msgstr "我该把我的任务告诉你。"

msgid "This is the reconnaissance report. I hope you will deliver it to the captain safely. "
msgstr "这是侦察报告。希望你把它安全交给队长。"

msgid "Captain Fargo has planted a spy among the enemy scouts. Find the scouts and establish contact with our spy to receive [Reconnaissance Report]. Also, defeat all enemy scouts and collect all [3 Scouting Maps] you can find. If you return to Captain Fargo with all the required items, you will be rewarded with experience points."
msgstr "法戈队长在敌方侦察兵中安插了一名密探。找到侦察兵，与我们的密探接上头领取[侦察报告]。另外，击败所有敌方侦察兵，把能找到的[3 张侦察地图]都收集起来。你带着全部所需物品回到法戈队长那儿，就能获得经验奖励。"

msgid "There`s no problem with Moradon`s security right now. If one occurs I`ll tell you."
msgstr "眼下莫拉登的安保没什么问题。真出了事我会告诉你。"

msgid "I have a mission for you."
msgstr "我有个任务交给你。"

msgid "The mercenary squad haven`t assigned any missions lately. Go see [Mercenary Captain] Kugar. At this rate, we`ll even forget that we`re mercenaries."
msgstr "佣兵小队近来没派什么任务。去找[佣兵队长]库伽吧。照这样下去，我们都要忘了自己是佣兵了。"

msgid "The mercenary brigade`s haven`t assigned any missions lately. Go see [Mercenary Captain] Kugar. At this rate, we`ll even forget that we`re mercenaries."
msgstr "佣兵大队近来没派什么任务。去找[佣兵队长]库伽吧。照这样下去，我们都要忘了自己是佣兵了。"

msgid "Just in time. I`ve prepared a special training session as the morale among mercenary ranks seem to be low. The orc Prisoners captured thus far are kept in an underground holding cell in Moradon. I`ve lodged a combat Certificate in each of their clothes. Think of this as a training session.   "
msgstr "来得正好。我看佣兵们的士气有些低落，就准备了一场特别训练。迄今为止抓获的兽人战俘都关在莫拉登的地下拘留室里。我在他们每个人的衣服里都塞了一张战斗证书。把这当作一场训练吧。"

msgid "Fight a duel with the Orc prisoners of war at the P.O.W. camp and collect just five certificates of duels which are held by them. How about starting it now?"
msgstr "去战俘营跟兽人战俘决斗，从他们身上收集 5 张决斗证书。现在就开始怎么样？"

msgid "Master all the certificates have been retrieved. Let`s go report to the captain. "
msgstr "师父，证书都取回来了。咱们去向队长复命吧。"

msgid "What happened? Don't say that you caught Orc but forgot to collect the duel certificates! You should have collected at least five duel certificates."
msgstr "怎么回事？别告诉我你抓了兽人却忘了收决斗证书！你至少该收集 5 张决斗证书。"

msgid "I knew you`d be able to do it with ease. You can train freely until the mission. "
msgstr "我就知道你能轻松搞定。在下次任务之前你可以自由训练。"

msgid "[Mercenary Commander] Couger orders the Mercenary to have duels against the Orc prisoners of war at the dungeon as a special training for mercenaries. If you hunt Orc prisoners of war at the dungeon and collect five cetificates of duel held by them, you can be compensated."
msgstr "[佣兵指挥官]库伽命令佣兵在地牢与兽人战俘决斗，作为佣兵的特别训练。你要是去地牢猎杀兽人战俘、收集他们身上的 5 张决斗证书，就能得到补偿。"

msgid "Um, Uh.. May I ask you a favor, I prepared a surprise gift for the person right in front of me, but I forgot to bring it, would you please help me?"
msgstr "嗯，啊……能请你帮个忙吗？我为眼前这位准备了一份惊喜礼物，可我忘了带来，你能帮帮我吗？"

msgid "If you go to [Mediator] Ciders, he has the present I asked for, and would you bring it without letting my boyfriend know about that?"
msgstr "你去[中间人]西德斯那儿，他手里有我要的那件礼物，你能在不让我男朋友知道的情况下把它带来吗？"

msgid "Master, this seems to be the ordered present. "
msgstr "师父，这应该就是订的那件礼物。"

msgid "Master, I heard they`re making small body armor for kids like me in front of the blacksmith`s. Go ask [Blacksmith] Heppa. "
msgstr "师父，我听说铁匠铺前面在给像我这样的小孩做小盔甲。去问问[铁匠]赫帕吧。"

msgid "This is the handmade chocolate, now let's go back to Skar^^"
msgstr "这就是手工巧克力，现在咱们回斯卡那儿去吧^^"

msgid "Master, I hear Blacksmith Heppa needs for Apples of Moradon. Let`s go see him. "
msgstr "师父，我听说铁匠赫帕需要莫拉登苹果。咱们去看看他。"

msgid "Silan`s bones, concentrated with Silan`s life force, are harder than steel but most blacksmiths don`t touch them as they are hard to melt.  But I discovered a special method to melt Silan bones. I will give you a big reward if you bring me the bones."
msgstr "西兰的骨头凝聚着西兰的生命力，比钢铁还硬，可大多数铁匠都不愿碰，因为它难熔化。但我发现了一种熔化西兰骨头的特殊方法。你把骨头带给我，我会重重谢你。"

msgid "Can you go find me 2 Apples of Moradon to make a special body armor? "
msgstr "你能帮我找 2 个莫拉登苹果来做一件特别的盔甲吗？"

msgid "You`re short on Apple of Moradon. This is not enough."
msgstr "你的莫拉登苹果不够。这不够。"

msgid "All 2 Apples of Moradon have been collected. "
msgstr "2 个莫拉登苹果都集齐了。"

msgid "Hand me the Apple of Moradon and I`ll give you a reward."
msgstr "把莫拉登苹果交给我，我就给你奖励。"

msgid "If you bring 10 Apples of Moradon, and a fee of 3,000 Noahs he will make you one of the five Silan Body Armor parts."
msgstr "你带来 10 个莫拉登苹果和 3000 诺亚手续费，他就给你做五件西兰盔甲部件中的一件。"

msgid "I need more of the Spools of Black Silk for making the War Supplies armor. The Cave Leeches in the Abyss Dungeoun tend to horde those Spools of Black Silk."
msgstr "做军需盔甲我还需要更多黑丝线。深渊地牢里的洞穴水蛭爱囤积那些黑丝线。"

msgid "It might be better you to participate in warfare than in something like this. It`s too trivial a task for someone like you. "
msgstr "你与其干这种事，不如去参战更合适。对你这种人来说，这任务太琐碎了。"

msgid "Incidents never fail to occur."
msgstr "事端总是少不了。"

msgid "Ok, first of all I should explain about Pincers Scorpions. Pincers Scorpions are monsters evolved from scorpions. Their apple is highly toxic. Many people die from it every year. But, Apple of Moradon is also used as an ingredient in cement for repairing castle walls and bridges here in Moradon, because it has a very strong cohesive effect."
msgstr "好，首先我得跟你讲讲螯钳蝎。螯钳蝎是由蝎子演化来的怪物。它们的苹果有剧毒。每年都有很多人因此丧命。不过，莫拉登苹果因为黏合性极强，在莫拉登这里也被用作修补城墙和桥梁的水泥原料。"

msgid "Now then, the place I'm introducing you to this time is Ardream. You can enter it from levels 45 to 80, and there are often some good PvP fights to be found out there. I'll give you a letter of introduction, so go and introduce yourself to Ardream's [Search Captain] Zamed."
msgstr "那么，这次我要给你介绍的地方是阿德雷姆。45 到 80 级都能进入，那边常有一些不错的 PvP 战斗。我给你一封介绍信，去阿德雷姆的[搜索队长]扎梅德那儿报个到吧。"

msgid "Master!! Master, you already have too many other missions to deal with. Come back and help theNameless Warrior later."
msgstr "师父！！师父，你手头别的任务已经太多了。回头再来帮无名战士吧。"

msgid "Master, there still seems to be too many bands of Rotten Eyes for the warriors' spirits to fall asleep comfortably."
msgstr "师父，腐眼的族群似乎还是太多，战士们的灵魂无法安息。"

msgid "Not long ago, our Village's Knight Squad suffered great losses from a Monster attack. So it's of no small concern that our citizen's morale is falling because it's been confirmed that more of our men died than monsters. As such, we've decided to... increase... the number of dead monsters when we officially inform the citizenry."
msgstr "前不久，我们村的骑士团在一次怪物袭击中损失惨重。由于已确认我方阵亡人数多于怪物，百姓士气低落，这可不是小事。因此，我们决定……在正式向百姓通报时……多报一些被消灭的怪物数量。"

msgid "If you're not too busy, could you lend us a hand? We don't have enough hunters because most of them are busy re-building the village."
msgstr "你要是不太忙，能搭把手吗？我们猎人不够，因为大多数人都忙着重建村子。"

msgid "Hmm... I feel this isn't really enough."
msgstr "嗯……我觉得这还远远不够。"

msgid "Thank you so much.|I'm ashamed of myself as an Imperial Palace Guard in Folk Village. But I think you did what's best for the citizens and soldiers, and for that I thank you. Here's a little something for ya. Choose the one you like."
msgstr "太感谢了。|身为村民村的一名宫卫，我自惭形秽。但我认为你做了对百姓和士兵最有利的事，为此我感谢你。来，这是一点心意。挑一件你喜欢的。"

msgid "I should do this for all our citizens and soldiers. Please, help me."
msgstr "我该为我们所有的百姓和士兵做这件事。求你了，帮帮我。"

msgid "Managing Supplies is not suited for everyone."
msgstr "管理补给这活儿，不是谁都能干的。"

msgid "Always be ready, because you never know when war will break out."
msgstr "时刻做好准备，因为你永远不知道战争何时爆发。"

msgid "The best knights don't fight with their tounges... You need endless training and a will of iron!"
msgstr "最优秀的骑士不靠嘴皮子打架……你需要无止境的训练和钢铁般的意志！"

msgid "This is Folk Village.|What's up?"
msgstr "这里是村民村。|有事吗？"

msgid "Ach, so busy, so busy...|Ahh, <selfname>. Welcome. Folk Village is really jumping, preparing the war supplies for our people. If you're not too busy, would you mind lending me a hand?"
msgstr "唉，忙死了，忙死了……|啊，<selfname>。欢迎。村民村正热火朝天地为我们的百姓筹备军需。你要是不太忙，介意搭把手吗？"

msgid "Perhaps you've heard of Apple of Moradon?  Apple of Moradon contains an explosive chemical element so it's often used in explosives."
msgstr "你也许听说过莫拉登苹果？莫拉登苹果含有一种爆炸性化学元素，所以常被用于炸药。"

msgid "I must report back to Rage by tomorrow... Can you speed up a bit, Ok? Thanks."
msgstr "我明天之前必须向暴怒复命……你能快点吗？谢谢。"

msgid "At last, I can relax a bit. Thank you so much. I do appreciate it."
msgstr "终于，我能松口气了。太感谢了。真的感激不尽。"

msgid "Hmm ? if you've not made any contribution to the country, you can't be dispatched. First, charge CONT from [Knight Squad Secretary] Delaga in this castle."
msgstr "嗯？你要是对国家没有任何贡献，就不能被派遣。先去本城堡找[骑士团书记]德拉加充入 CONT。"

msgid "Sorry, who are you? I'm known as ¡®The Middle Man', Berret I climb mountains and cross rivers, cross hill and dale, and go wherever I have to to make a little money. "
msgstr "抱歉，你是哪位？我人称「中间人」贝雷特。我翻山渡河、穿山越谷，哪儿有钱赚就往哪儿去。"

msgid "Do you have any Apple of Moradon? Fishing Cork made with Apple of Moradon is the best. My goods aren't affected by the changing seasons and they can sell for a long time. Whenever you get hold of Apple of Moradon, bring it to me. I'll give you the best price for it, no questions asked."
msgstr "你有莫拉登苹果吗？用莫拉登苹果做的钓鱼浮漂是最好的。我的货不受季节影响，能卖很久。你一弄到莫拉登苹果就带给我。我给你最高价，绝不问东问西。"

msgid "I sell the best products and make the best profit. Simple as that. I need Apples of Moradon to make the best Fishing Cork."
msgstr "我卖最好的货，赚最多的钱。就这么简单。我需要莫拉登苹果来做最好的钓鱼浮漂。"

msgid "Ah~ that's right. This is Apples of Moradon. I will buy 10 Apples of Moradon you have for 70 thousand Noahs.  Would you like to do the trade?"
msgstr "啊~对了。这是莫拉登苹果。我出 7 万诺亚收购你手上的 10 个莫拉登苹果。你想做这笔交易吗？"

msgid "Always be ready. You never know when war will break out."
msgstr "时刻做好准备。你永远不知道战争何时爆发。"

msgid "It must be the Handmade Chocolate made by Valence."
msgstr "那一定是瓦朗斯做的手工巧克力。"

msgid "Hmm... you got the right item. Here's what you want."
msgstr "嗯……你拿对了东西。这就是你要的。"

msgid "Welcome! What do you need?"
msgstr "欢迎！你需要什么？"

msgid "Then please bring me all the materials for handmade chocolatier. I will make it right away."
msgstr "那请把做手工巧克力的所有材料带给我。我马上就做。"

msgid "I collected all the materials for Handmade Chocolate, Master."
msgstr "师父，手工巧克力的材料我都集齐了。"

msgid "10 rosemary goes into the handmade chocolate."
msgstr "手工巧克力里要放 10 枝迷迭香。"

msgid "Well, you finally brought that... "
msgstr "你总算把那个带来了……"

msgid "Have you found the location of the Secret Documents?"
msgstr "你找到机密文件的位置了吗？"

msgid "        [ Kaisha's Blessing]  Def 20 will increase. Would you like to accept Kaisha's Blessing?"
msgstr "        [凯莎的祝福] 防御将增加 20。你愿意接受凯莎的祝福吗？"

msgid "Do not touch the altar! Only Kings and Leaders can do that!"
msgstr "别碰祭坛！只有国王和领袖才能碰！"

msgid "Use your full force before you come! I can't lend my power yet... "
msgstr "拿出你的全部力量再来吧！我现在还借不出我的力量……"

msgid "King of El Morad...  Prepare National treasury first for the offering."
msgstr "艾莫拉德的国王……先为国库备齐供奉之物。"

msgid "Kaisha's Blessing shall be with the El Morad Knights... "
msgstr "愿凯莎的祝福与艾莫拉德骑士同在……"

msgid "        [ Veramuth's Blessing]  Def 40 and HP250 will increase. Would you like to accept Veramuth's Blessing?"
msgstr "        [维拉穆斯的祝福] 防御增加 40，HP 增加 250。你愿意接受维拉穆斯的祝福吗？"

msgid "Veramuth's Blessing shall be with the El Morad Knights... "
msgstr "愿维拉穆斯的祝福与艾莫拉德骑士同在……"

msgid "        [ Ares's Blessing ] In the National Treasury,  1 million Noah is used as an offering, and with  Def +60, HP +500,  Prison Gate is open every 40 seconds. Would you like to accept Ares's Blessing?"
msgstr "        [阿瑞斯的祝福] 从国库取用 100 万诺亚作为供奉，防御+60、HP+500，狱门每 40 秒开启一次。你愿意接受阿瑞斯的祝福吗？"

msgid "Ares's Blessing shall be with the El Morad Knights... "
msgstr "愿阿瑞斯的祝福与艾莫拉德骑士同在……"

msgid "        [ Ares's Blessing ] In the National Treasury,   2 million Noah is used as an offering, and with  Def+80, HP +750,  Prison Gate is open every 40 seconds. Would you like to accept Diaz's Blessing?"
msgstr "        [阿瑞斯的祝福] 从国库取用 200 万诺亚作为供奉，防御+80、HP+750，狱门每 40 秒开启一次。你愿意接受迪亚兹的祝福吗？"

msgid "Diaz's Blessing shall be with the El Morad Knights... "
msgstr "愿迪亚兹的祝福与艾莫拉德骑士同在……"

msgid "        [ Logos's Blessing ] In the National Treasury,   3 million Noah is used as an offering, and with  Def+80, HP +1000,  Prison Gate is open every 40 seconds. Would you like to accept Logos's Blessing?"
msgstr "        [逻各斯的祝福] 从国库取用 300 万诺亚作为供奉，防御+80、HP+1000，狱门每 40 秒开启一次。你愿意接受逻各斯的祝福吗？"

msgid "Logos's Blessing shall be with the El Morad Knights... "
msgstr "愿逻各斯的祝福与艾莫拉德骑士同在……"

msgid "This Altar delivers the King's prayer to God when the Nation is losing a war. But do not expect the response of God without making offerings to the National Treasury."
msgstr "这座祭坛会在国家战事不利时，把国王的祈祷传达给神。但不向国库供奉，就别指望神会回应。"

msgid "Human power has its limits. If you're losing, borrow some power from God. But God's help always costs you something... "
msgstr "人的力量总有极限。快撑不住的时候，就去借神的力量。但是，神的帮助总要你付出些代价……"

msgid "King of Karus...  Prepare National treasury for the offering first."
msgstr "卡鲁斯的国王……先为国库备齐供奉之物。"

msgid "Kaisha's Blessing shall be with the Karus Knights... "
msgstr "愿凯莎的祝福与卡鲁斯骑士同在……"

msgid "Veramuth's Blessing shall be with the Karus Knights... "
msgstr "愿维拉穆斯的祝福与卡鲁斯骑士同在……"

msgid "Ares's Blessing shall be with the Karus Knights... "
msgstr "愿阿瑞斯的祝福与卡鲁斯骑士同在……"

msgid "Diaz's Blessing shall be with the Karus Knights... "
msgstr "愿迪亚兹的祝福与卡鲁斯骑士同在……"

msgid "Logos's Blessing shall be with the Karus Knights... "
msgstr "愿逻各斯的祝福与卡鲁斯骑士同在……"

msgid "[3 National notices were found.]"
msgstr "[发现了 3 份国家公告。]"

msgid "Only El Morad citizens can participate."
msgstr "仅限艾莫拉德公民参加。"

msgid "Only Karus citizens can participate."
msgstr "仅限卡鲁斯公民参加。"

msgid "I shall confess my love to her with love candies"
msgstr "我要用爱情糖向她表白。"

msgid "I do want to confess my love to her with my own candies. Please help me to pratice for making my own candies.  Bring me ordinary candies, then I can make white day candies to my love. Help me ~~~"
msgstr "我真想用我自己做的糖果向她表白。求你帮我练习做糖果。给我带些普通糖果来，这样我就能做白色情人节糖果送给我的心上人。帮帮我~~~"

msgid "Hmm~~. Please bring me 15 ordinary candies,then I shall make my own lovely candy."
msgstr "嗯~~。请给我带 15 颗普通糖果来，我就做我自己心爱的糖果。"

msgid "Hmm~~ I need 15 ordinary candies for this new candy"
msgstr "嗯~~做这种新糖果我需要 15 颗普通糖果。"

msgid "Wow~~ You brought me 15 candies. I will thank you if I get my love this time."
msgstr "哇~~你给我带了 15 颗糖。这回要是能追到心上人，我一定好好谢你。"

msgid "Great! You have all materials."
msgstr "太好了！材料都齐了。"

msgid "Hmm~~ I need 25 ordinary candies for a new white day candy."
msgstr "嗯~~做一颗新的白色情人节糖果，我需要 25 颗普通糖果。"

msgid "Wow~~ You brought me 25 candies. I will thank you if I get my love this time."
msgstr "哇~~你给我带了 25 颗糖。这回要是能追到心上人，我一定好好谢你。"

msgid "Hmm~~ Bring me 25 ordinary candies, then I shall make my own lovely candy. Please~~~"
msgstr "嗯~~给我带 25 颗普通糖果来，我就做我自己心爱的糖果。拜托了~~~"

msgid "Hmm~~ I need 100 ordinary candies for this new candy."
msgstr "嗯~~做这种新糖果我需要 100 颗普通糖果。"

msgid "Good work!  You brought me 100 ordinary candies. I will thank you if I get my love."
msgstr "干得好！你给我带了 100 颗普通糖果。我要是能追到心上人，一定谢你。"

msgid "Hmm~ Bring me 100 ordinary candies, then I shall make my own lovely candy. Please~~~"
msgstr "嗯~给我带 100 颗普通糖果来，我就做我自己心爱的糖果。拜托了~~~"

msgid "Ah~~ I wish I receive candies at this white day."
msgstr "啊~~真希望这个白色情人节我能收到糖果。"

msgid "I need more information about Karus... "
msgstr "我需要更多关于卡鲁斯的情报……"

msgid "I need more information about El Morad... "
msgstr "我需要更多关于艾莫拉德的情报……"

msgid "Sorry, I'm not in the mood to talk to you."
msgstr "抱歉，我现在没心情跟你说话。"

msgid "Master, what about hunting in Islante?"
msgstr "师父，去艾斯兰特打猎怎么样？"

msgid "Welcome! It's been quite a while since I saw you here. Did you come here to loosen up? Haha~"
msgstr "欢迎！好久没在这儿见到你了。你是来放松放松的吗？哈哈~"

msgid "Your current responsibilities seem too heavy to carry out another quest... "
msgstr "你眼下的职责看起来已经够重，恐怕再接不了别的任务了……"

msgid "Troll Berserker! It's one of the targets which many hunters and questers want to hunt. Do you accept the challenge? The quest target is 250... "
msgstr "巨魔狂战士！它是许多猎人和任务党都想猎杀的目标之一。你接受挑战吗？任务目标是 250……"

msgid "Whooa...! It's not just not to loosen up!"
msgstr "哇哦……！这可不止是放松放松那么简单！"

msgid "Isn't your quest just a tad bit too difficult for you? Haha!"
msgstr "你的任务对你来说是不是有点太难了？哈哈！"

msgid "What about your quest this time?... Was it bearable?"
msgstr "你这次的任务怎么样？……扛得住吗？"

msgid "Welcome! It's been quite a while since I saw you here. Did you come here to loosen yourself up? Haha~"
msgstr "欢迎！好久没在这儿见到你了。你是来放松放松的吗？哈哈~"

msgid "Your responsibilities seem too heavy to carry out another mission... "
msgstr "你眼下的职责看起来已经够重，恐怕再接不了别的任务了……"

msgid "Master, what about another quest in Islante?"
msgstr "师父，要不要在艾斯兰特再接个任务？"

msgid "Are you looking for another quest? I like this attitude of ceaseless effort! Find the Troll Captain."
msgstr "你在找新任务吗？我喜欢这种不停进取的劲头！去找巨魔队长。"

msgid "Given all the quests you have done so far, this quest may not be unreasonable... "
msgstr "考虑到你迄今完成的任务，这个任务也许不算过分……"

msgid "Master, you completed another quest!"
msgstr "师父，你又完成了一个任务！"

msgid "What about your quest?"
msgstr "你的任务怎么样了？"

msgid "Another quest is completed. Well-done!"
msgstr "又一个任务完成了。干得漂亮！"

msgid "Master, It's said that something strange is going on in Islante. Please go to [Ascetic] Veda and ask."
msgstr "师父，听说艾斯兰特那边出了些怪事。请去问问[苦行者]维达。"

msgid "Nights here in Islante are getting more and more fearful. Citizens here are suffering from a monster in their dreams every night... "
msgstr "艾斯兰特这里的夜晚越来越吓人。这里的百姓每晚都被梦里的怪物折磨……"

msgid "Hmm... Before I hear the strange rumor, I think you'd better finish your quest first."
msgstr "嗯……在我讲那桩怪事之前，你最好先把你的任务做完。"

msgid "Given the shape of the monster, I suspect it's a Buro, a monster living in the northeastern part of the forest. They're said to be capable of real magic, but who knows? If they're the real cause of the nightmares, they should be removed... "
msgstr "从那怪物的外形看，我怀疑是布罗——一种住在森林东北部的怪物。据说它们真会魔法，可谁知道呢？它们要是就是噩梦的根源，就该被除掉……"

msgid "Islante is not suffering from nightmares any more, is it?"
msgstr "艾斯兰特不再被噩梦困扰了，是吧？"

msgid "Where's the end of the nightmares... "
msgstr "噩梦何时才是个头啊……"

msgid "After you got rid of the Buro, no one is suffering from nightmares any more. Thank you!"
msgstr "你除掉布罗之后，再也没人做噩梦了。谢谢你！"

msgid "Master, it's said that something strange is going on in Islante. Please go to [Ascetic] Taved and ask."
msgstr "师父，听说艾斯兰特那边出了些怪事。请去问问[苦行者]塔维德。"

msgid "Given the shape of the monster, I suspect it's a Buro, a monster living in the northeastern part of the forest. They're said to be capable of real magic, but who knows? If they're the real cause of the nightmares, they should be removed..."
msgstr "从那怪物的外形看，我怀疑是布罗——一种住在森林东北部的怪物。据说它们真会魔法，可谁知道呢？它们要是就是噩梦的根源，就该被除掉……"

msgid "After you got rid of Buro, no one is suffering from nightmares any more. Thank you!"
msgstr "你除掉布罗之后，再也没人做噩梦了。谢谢你！"

msgid "Master, it's said that there's a monster who's gone berserk in Islante. Please ask [Ascetic] Veda for details."
msgstr "师父，听说艾斯兰特那边有只怪物狂暴了。具体请去问[苦行者]维达。"

msgid "Hm~they were no more than rocks. The ancient Priest gave life to them, and employed them as servants. They're Stone Golems. After the war against Pathos, the Priests lost control of them, and they staged an attack against anything living."
msgstr "嗯~它们原本不过是些石头。远古的祭司赋予了它们生命，把它们当仆役使唤。它们就是石魔像。帕托斯之战后，祭司们失去了对它们的控制，它们便见活物就攻。"

msgid "Well, the carelessness of the ancient Priests may have caused the current problem, but everybody makes mistakes. But the power of Dark Stones is the strongest, and they're ruthless. The outcome of one mistake seems too severe... "
msgstr "唉，眼下的麻烦也许源于远古祭司的疏忽，可谁都有犯错的时候。但暗黑石的力量最强，而且毫不留情。一次失误带来的后果也太重了……"

msgid "Dark Stones which lost control, rest in peace... ha~"
msgstr "失去控制的暗黑石，安息吧……哈~"

msgid "Dark Stone is one of the strongest Stone Golems."
msgstr "暗黑石是最强的石魔像之一。"

msgid "You're still very good. If we have a way to regain control over them, we won't need to be engaged in tough fights like this... "
msgstr "你仍然很出色。要是我们有办法重新控制它们，就不必打这样的硬仗了……"

msgid "Master, it's said that there's a monster who's gone berserk in Islante. Please ask [Ascetic] Taved for details."
msgstr "师父，听说艾斯兰特那边有只怪物狂暴了。具体请去问[苦行者]塔维德。"

msgid "Hm~they were no more than rocks. The ancient Priest gave life to them, and employed them as servants. They're Stone Golems. After the war against Pathos, the Priests lost control of them, and they staged an attack agasint anything living."
msgstr "嗯~它们原本不过是些石头。远古的祭司赋予了它们生命，把它们当仆役使唤。它们就是石魔像。帕托斯之战后，祭司们失去了对它们的控制，它们便见活物就攻。"

msgid "Well, the carelessness of the ancient Priests may have caused the current problem, but everybody makes mistakes. But the power of Dark Stones is the strongest, and they're ruthless. The outcome of one mistake seems too severe..."
msgstr "唉，眼下的麻烦也许源于远古祭司的疏忽，可谁都有犯错的时候。但暗黑石的力量最强，而且毫不留情。一次失误带来的后果也太重了……"

msgid "You're still very good. If we have a way to regain control over them, we won't need to be engaged in tough fights like this..."
msgstr "你仍然很出色。要是我们有办法重新控制它们，就不必打这样的硬仗了……"

msgid "Master, it's said that there're creatures that were created from the changes of Spirit of Flame... Please meet [Ascetic] Veda and check it out."
msgstr "师父，听说有些生物是由火焰之灵异变而来的……请去会见[苦行者]维达了解一下。"

msgid "You are the leader of a clan! Right now we provide   the item which recovers the grade of clan after the transfer, and are you sure that you have it?"
msgstr "你是一个公会的会长！我们现在提供转职后恢复公会等级的道具，你确定你手上有了吗？"

msgid "Nation Migration System>> When migrating, submitting the [Application for Asylum] will be exchanged for [Confirmation of National Migration].>> If you are a clan member, 30% Nation Points contribution will be refunded if you leave the clan at this time.>> When the country migration is completed by submitting the [Confirmation of National Migration], the remaining 70% Nation Points contribution will be refunded."
msgstr "国家移民系统>>移民时，提交[庇护申请]即可兑换成[国家移民确认书]。>>你若是公会成员，此时退会将返还 30% 的国家点数贡献。>>提交[国家移民确认书]完成国家移民后，剩余 70% 的国家点数贡献将被返还。"

msgid "To become [Royal Knight Squad], you have to be [Formal Knight Squad]  1st Class. So come back when you are [Formal Knight Squad]  1st Class."
msgstr "要成为[皇家骑士团]，你必须先达到[正式骑士团]一等。所以等你到了[正式骑士团]一等再来。"

msgid "Only clans with more than  25000 Knight Squad Saving Points, so return after you've accumulated more CONT."
msgstr "仅限骑士团储蓄点数超过 25000 的公会申请，等你攒够更多 CONT 再来。"

msgid "Master! You have successfully seized the classified document! Hurry back to [Councilor] Herga!"
msgstr "师父！你成功夺取了机密文件！快回[议事官]赫尔加那儿！"

msgid "Hm? You have done today's mission already.  Aren't you absent-minded... Come back tomorrow!"
msgstr "嗯？你今天的任务已经做完了。你是不是心不在焉……明天再来！"

msgid "You came on time, good. El Morad is showing some suspicious activities, and I want to know what is happening there but I have no one to spare as all the spies are doing their mission in Ronark Land. So would you sneak into the El Morad castle and return with the classified document?"
msgstr "你准时到了，很好。艾莫拉德那边有些可疑动向，我想知道那边在搞什么，可所有密探都在罗纳克之地执行任务，抽不出人手。所以你愿不愿意潜入艾莫拉德城堡，把机密文件带回来？"

msgid "Are you taking this mission!? Great, then I will give you the [Enemy State Moving Scroll] and the [Scroll] which you can copy the information on. You just need to copy the information in the enemy's classified document box on this [Scroll]."
msgstr "你接这个任务了！？好，那我就给你[敌国移动卷轴]和可以抄写情报的[卷轴]。你只需把敌方机密文件箱里的情报抄到这张[卷轴]上。"

msgid "        Disturbing the Enemy|- You have to make the [Scroll] into [Copy of Information Paper] from the classified document box in the El Morad Castle.  |- You have to sneak into the castle when the enemy's defense is loose, and when you get killed by users of the enemy nation then your quest becomes initialized.  |-During the quest, the summon related skills are not available and when you acquire [Copy of Information Paper] you can escape to the entrance of Lunar Gate with [/Village] command. |-[Infiltration Scroll] can be place in the skill shortcut window for use."
msgstr "        骚扰敌方|——你要在艾莫拉德城堡的机密文件箱前，把[卷轴]变成[情报抄件]。|——你要趁敌方防守松懈时潜入城堡，一旦被敌国玩家杀死，任务就会重置。|——任务期间，召唤相关技能不可用，拿到[情报抄件]后，可以用[/Village]命令逃到月门入口。|[潜入卷轴]可以放到技能快捷栏里使用。"

msgid "To get the item needed for the mission, you have to have two empty spaces in your inventory. Return after you have checked it. "
msgstr "要领任务所需道具，你的背包里得有两个空位。检查好了再来。"

msgid "You still haven't left yet? Infiltrate the El Morad castle and make [Scroll] into [Copy of Information Paper] and then come back."
msgstr "你还没走？潜入艾莫拉德城堡，把[卷轴]变成[情报抄件]再回来。"

msgid "Oh, this is definitely a [Copy of Information Paper], let me see... Right! So they were planning something like this! You will have to take the next mission, too!"
msgstr "哦，这铁定是[情报抄件]，让我看看……对！原来他们在盘算这种勾当！你还得接下一个任务！"

msgid "You lost the [Scroll]? What a clumsy fellow you are. I will give you another one, so complete the mission without making any mistake this time."
msgstr "你把[卷轴]弄丢了？你可真毛躁。我再给你一张，这次别再出错，把任务完成。"

msgid "I gave you the [Enemy Nation Moving Scroll] and [Scroll], so don't lose them and return safely!"
msgstr "[敌国移动卷轴]和[卷轴]我都给你了，别弄丢了，安全回来！"

msgid "Master! You have successfully seized the classified document! Hurry back to [Councilor] Nez!"
msgstr "师父！你成功夺取了机密文件！快回[议事官]内兹那儿！"

msgid "Hm? You have done today's mission already.  You must have forgotten that. Please come back tomorrow."
msgstr "嗯？你今天的任务已经做完了。你一定是忘了。请明天再来。"

msgid "Karus is showing some suspicious activities. I want to know what is happening there but I have no one to spare as all the spies are doing their mission in Ronark Land.  So could you sneak into the Luferson Castle instead and return with the classified document?"
msgstr "卡鲁斯那边有些可疑动向。我想知道那边在搞什么，可所有密探都在罗纳克之地执行任务，抽不出人手。所以你愿不去潜入卢弗森城堡，把机密文件带回来？"

msgid "Are you taking the mission!? Great, then I will give you this [Enemy Nation Moving Scroll] and the [Scroll] on which you can copy the information. You can copy the information in the enemy's classified document box on this [Scroll]."
msgstr "你接任务了！？好，那我就给你这张[敌国移动卷轴]和可以抄写情报的[卷轴]。你可以把敌方机密文件箱里的情报抄到这张[卷轴]上。"

msgid "To get the item needed for the mission, you have to have two empty spaces in your inventory. Please check it and come back."
msgstr "要领任务所需道具，你的背包里得有两个空位。检查好了再来。"

msgid "Is there any misunderstanding? Hurry and infiltrate the Luferson Castle, and make the [Scroll] into [Copy of Information Paper] and then come back."
msgstr "有什么误会吗？快潜入卢弗森城堡，把[卷轴]变成[情报抄件]再回来。"

msgid "Oh, this is definitely a [Copy of Information Paper]! Um,um, I see! So they were planning something like this! Could you take the next mission, too?"
msgstr "哦，这铁定是[情报抄件]！嗯，嗯，我明白了！原来他们在盘算这种勾当！你能再接下一个任务吗？"

msgid "You lost the [Scroll]? I will give you another scroll, so don't lose it again."
msgstr "你把[卷轴]弄丢了？我再给你一张卷轴，别再弄丢了。"

msgid "I definitely gave you the[Enemy Moving Scroll] and [Scroll]. Please don't lose it. Then, good luck."
msgstr "[敌国移动卷轴]和[卷轴]我铁定给你了。请别弄丢。那么，祝好运。"

msgid "According to the [Copy of Information Paper] you brought, the enemy is planning to confuse our force in each of the war bases. So we decided to take the initiative this time and disrupt their information instead. Now, take this [Fake Information Paper] and go to the person in charge of each base.  We already got in touch with them, so you have to go to each base and help the person in charge to disrupt the enemy's plan."
msgstr "根据你带回的[情报抄件]，敌人正打算在各个战区基地混淆我方部队。所以这次我们决定主动出击，反过来扰乱他们的情报。现在，拿上这张[假情报纸]，去找每个基地的负责人。我们已经和他们联络过了，你要去每个基地，协助负责人打乱敌人的计划。"

msgid "Accordnig to the [Copy of Information Paper] you brought, the enemy is planning to confuse our force at each of the war bases. So those above as decided to take the initiative this time and disrupt their information instead.  Take the [Fake Information Paper] to the person in charge of each base. We already got in touch with them, so you have to go to each base and help the person in charge to disrupt the enemy's plan. "
msgstr "根据你带回的[情报抄件]，敌人正打算在各个战区基地混淆我方部队。所以上面这次决定主动出击，反过来扰乱他们的情报。把[假情报纸]带给每个基地的负责人。我们已经和他们联络过了，你要去每个基地，协助负责人打乱敌人的计划。"

msgid "       Disrupting the Enemy Base|- You have to receive Disrupt the Enemy Information mission from the people in charge of  [Arrdream], [Ronark Base], and [Ronark Land].|- People in charge of each mission area are as follows. |- [Arrdream] - [Search Captain] Zamed |- [Ronark Base] - [Base Spearhead] Cruzed |- [Ronark Land] - [Analyst] Caesar"
msgstr "       扰乱敌方基地|——你要从[阿德雷姆]、[罗纳克基地]和[罗纳克之地]的负责人那里接「扰乱敌方情报」任务。|——各任务区域的负责人如下。|——[阿德雷姆] - [搜索队长]扎梅德|——[罗纳克基地] - [基地先锋]克鲁泽|——[罗纳克之地] - [分析官]凯撒"

msgid "       Disrupting the Enemy Base|- You have to receive Disrupt the Enemy Information mission from the people in charge of  [Arrdream], [Ronark Base], and [Ronark Land].|- People in charge of each mission area are as follows. |- [Arrdream] - [Search Captain] Laek |- [Ronark Base] - [Base Spearhead] Krable |- [Ronark Land] - [Analyst] Julius"
msgstr "       扰乱敌方基地|——你要从[阿德雷姆]、[罗纳克基地]和[罗纳克之地]的负责人那里接「扰乱敌方情报」任务。|——各任务区域的负责人如下。|——[阿德雷姆] - [搜索队长]莱克|——[罗纳克基地] - [基地先锋]克拉布尔|——[罗纳克之地] - [分析官]尤利乌斯"

msgid "Did [Councilor] Herga send you? Since the situation is urgent, you should hurry.  Take the [Fake Information Paper], infiltrate the enemy's base and switch it with the [Arrdream Information Paper].  Will you carry out the mission?"
msgstr "是[议事官]赫尔加派你来的？情况紧急，你得抓紧。拿上[假情报纸]，潜入敌方基地，把它换成[阿德雷姆情报纸]。你愿意执行这个任务吗？"

msgid "You can do the mission after you complete the mission of [Councilor] Herga and bring the [Fake Information Paper].  "
msgstr "你要完成[议事官]赫尔加的任务、带上[假情报纸]之后，才能做这个任务。"

msgid "This is the mission objective.  You must switch the [Fake Information Paper] with [Arrdream Information paper]. Have you verified it?"
msgstr "这是任务目标。你必须把[假情报纸]和[阿德雷姆情报纸]调包。你确认过了吗？"

msgid "This is definitely the [Arrdream Information Paper], and the fact that it is here means that you have succeeded in switching it! This is the reward for the success of the mission. "
msgstr "这铁定是[阿德雷姆情报纸]，它在这儿就说明你调包成功了！这是任务成功的奖励。"

msgid "Master! It was a clean switch! Let's hurry back to the base!"
msgstr "师父！调包干净利落！咱们快回基地！"

msgid "Did [Councilor] Nez send you? Since the situation is urgent, you should hurry.  Take the [Fake Information Paper], infiltrate the enemy's base and switch it with the [Arrdream Information Paper].  Will you carry out the mission?"
msgstr "是[议事官]内兹派你来的？情况紧急，你得抓紧。拿上[假情报纸]，潜入敌方基地，把它换成[阿德雷姆情报纸]。你愿意执行这个任务吗？"

msgid "You can do the mission after you complete the mission of [Councilor] Nez and bring the [Fake Information Paper].  "
msgstr "你要完成[议事官]内兹的任务、带上[假情报纸]之后，才能做这个任务。"

msgid "Only users of 45Lv ~ 59Lv can carry out the mission here."
msgstr "只有 45 级～59 级的玩家才能在这儿执行任务。"

msgid "       Disrupting the Arrdream Base|- Only users of [45Lv ~ 59Lv] can carry out the mission.  |- You have to change the [Ardream Information Paper] with [Fake Information Paper] from the [Information Paper Box] deep inside [Arrdream] enemy base.  |- You can get the information paper only when you approach the box while using [Unidentified Potion]. |- If you fail the quest in the middle, you have to buy [Unidentified Potion] again with 1 million Noahs. |- During the mission, [ /Village ] command is unavailable."
msgstr "       扰乱阿德雷姆基地|——只有[45 级～59 级]的玩家才能执行任务。|——你要在[阿德雷姆]敌方基地深处的[情报纸箱]前，把[阿德雷姆情报纸]换成[假情报纸]。|——只有使用[不明药水]靠近箱子时，才能拿到情报纸。|——中途任务失败，你就得再花 100 万诺亚买[不明药水]。|——任务期间，[/Village]命令不可用。"

msgid "You will need this potion.  You have to open the information paper box after drinking this potion.   Not only it makes your body invisible for 1 minute so you can evade the detection by the enemy's guard tower, you need the power of this potion to open that document box.  But, remember that you cannot evade the eyes of the enemy rogues and general magic of the magicians.  But, this potion is extremely difficult to make, so it will cost you 1 million Noahs. Would you like to have it made?"
msgstr "你会需要这瓶药水。你得喝下这瓶药水后再打开情报纸箱。它不仅能让你的身体隐形 1 分钟，好躲过敌方哨塔的侦测，你还需要这药水的力量才能打开那个文件箱。但是，记住你躲不过敌方刺客的眼睛和法师的通用魔法。而且这药水极难配制，要收你 100 万诺亚。你想配制吗？"

msgid "Did [Councilor] Herga send you? Since the situation is urgent, you should hurry.  Take the [Fake Information Paper], infiltrate the enemy's base and switch it with the [Ronark Base Information Paper].  Will you carry out the mission?"
msgstr "是[议事官]赫尔加派你来的？情况紧急，你得抓紧。拿上[假情报纸]，潜入敌方基地，把它换成[罗纳克基地情报纸]。你愿意执行这个任务吗？"

msgid "Only users of 60Lv ~ 69Lv can carry out the mission here."
msgstr "只有 60 级～69 级的玩家才能在这儿执行任务。"

msgid "This is the mission objective.  You must switch the [Fake Information Paper] with [Ronark Base Information paper]. Have you verified it?"
msgstr "这是任务目标。你必须把[假情报纸]和[罗纳克基地情报纸]调包。你确认过了吗？"

msgid "       Disrupting the Ronark Base|- Only users of [60Lv ~ 69Lv] can carry out the mission.  |- You have to change the [Ronark Information Paper] with [Fake Information Paper] from the [Information Paper Box] deep inside [Ronark Base] enemy base.  |- You can get the information paper only when you approach the box while using [Unidentified Potion]. |- If you fail the quest in the middle, you have to buy [Unidentified Potion] again with 1 million Noahs. |- During the mission, [ /Village ] command is unavailable."
msgstr "       扰乱罗纳克基地|——只有[60 级～69 级]的玩家才能执行任务。|——你要在[罗纳克基地]敌方基地深处的[情报纸箱]前，把[罗纳克情报纸]换成[假情报纸]。|——只有使用[不明药水]靠近箱子时，才能拿到情报纸。|——中途任务失败，你就得再花 100 万诺亚买[不明药水]。|——任务期间，[/Village]命令不可用。"

msgid "This is definitely the [Ronark Base Information Paper], and the fact that it is here means that you have succeeded in switching it! This is the reward for the success of the mission. "
msgstr "这铁定是[罗纳克基地情报纸]，它在这儿就说明你调包成功了！这是任务成功的奖励。"

msgid "Only users of 70Lv or above can carry out the mission here."
msgstr "只有 70 级以上的玩家才能在这儿执行任务。"

msgid "       Disrupting the Ronark Land Base|- Only users of [70Lv or higher] can carry out the mission.  |- You have to change the [Ronark Land Information Paper] with [Fake Information Paper] from the [Information Paper Box] deep inside [Ronark Land] enemy base.  |- You can get the information paper only when you approach the box while using [Unidentified Potion]. |- If you fail the quest in the middle, you have to buy [Unidentified Potion] again with 1 million Noahs. |- During the mission, [ /Village ] command is unavailable."
msgstr "       扰乱罗纳克之地基地|——只有[70 级以上]的玩家才能执行任务。|——你要在[罗纳克之地]敌方基地深处的[情报纸箱]前，把[罗纳克之地情报纸]换成[假情报纸]。|——只有使用[不明药水]靠近箱子时，才能拿到情报纸。|——中途任务失败，你就得再花 100 万诺亚买[不明药水]。|——任务期间，[/Village]命令不可用。"

msgid "Did [Councilor] Nez send you? Since the situation is urgent, you should hurry.  Take the [Fake Information Paper], infiltrate the enemy's base and switch it with the [Ronark Base Information Paper].  Will you carry out the mission?"
msgstr "是[议事官]内兹派你来的？情况紧急，你得抓紧。拿上[假情报纸]，潜入敌方基地，把它换成[罗纳克基地情报纸]。你愿意执行这个任务吗？"

msgid "Did [Councilor] Herga send you? Since the situation is urgent, you should hurry.  Take the [Fake Information Paper], infiltrate the enemy's base and switch it with the [Ronark Land Information Paper].  Will you carry out the mission?"
msgstr "是[议事官]赫尔加派你来的？情况紧急，你得抓紧。拿上[假情报纸]，潜入敌方基地，把它换成[罗纳克之地情报纸]。你愿意执行这个任务吗？"

msgid "This is the mission objective.  You must switch the [Fake Information Paper] with [Ronark Land Information paper]. Have you verified it?"
msgstr "这是任务目标。你必须把[假情报纸]和[罗纳克之地情报纸]调包。你确认过了吗？"

msgid "This is definitely the [Ronark Land Information Paper], and the fact that it is here means that you have succeeded in switching it! This is the reward for the success of the mission. "
msgstr "这铁定是[罗纳克之地情报纸]，它在这儿就说明你调包成功了！这是任务成功的奖励。"

msgid "Did [Councilor] Nez send you? Since the situation is urgent, you should hurry.  Take the [Fake Information Paper], infiltrate the enemy's base and switch it with the [Ronark Land Information Paper].  Will you carry out the mission?"
msgstr "是[议事官]内兹派你来的？情况紧急，你得抓紧。拿上[假情报纸]，潜入敌方基地，把它换成[罗纳克之地情报纸]。你愿意执行这个任务吗？"

msgid " You already have this potion.  One should be more than enough."
msgstr "你已经有这瓶药水了。一瓶应该绰绰有余。"

msgid "You are already on a mission that requires this potion. Return once you have completed that mission as it is dangerous to use more than a bottle of this potion. "
msgstr "你已经在做一个需要这药水的任务了。等你完成那个任务再回来，因为用超过一瓶这种药水很危险。"

msgid "Your bag is full! Make some space in your bag if you want the mission order!"
msgstr "你的背包满了！想接任务令就给背包腾点地方！"

msgid "This mission is temporarily suspended as a risk has been identified.  Those who received the mission previously should move to [Islante] and complete the mission there.  "
msgstr "本任务因发现风险已暂时暂停。之前接过任务的人请前往[艾斯兰特]，在那里完成任务。"

msgid "You already have [Fake Information Paper] with you! Leave, now!"
msgstr "你身上已经带着[假情报纸]了！快走，现在就走！"

msgid "You still have [Fake Information Paper] with you, please hurry complete the disruption mission. "
msgstr "你身上还带着[假情报纸]，请快去完成扰乱任务。"

msgid "This quest gives one more chance to those who have lost the Accessory of Legend, so don't you think you'd better get the Accessory of Legend first?"
msgstr "这个任务给那些弄丢了传说饰品的人一次重来的机会，所以你不觉得最好先把传说饰品拿到手吗？"

msgid "We are giving one more chance to those who lost the Accessory of Legend. And as we don't give any additional reward like the previous one, please check it before taking on the mission. "
msgstr "我们给那些弄丢了传说饰品的人又一次机会。而且我们不会像上次那样再给额外奖励，所以接任务前请先看清楚。"

msgid "       Instruction for Open the Arsenal |- If you  last borrowed on the same day of the previous week, then you cannot borrow it.  |- Please check whether you borrowed  the equipment on the same day last week.|- ex)  If you borrowed the equipment on Monday of the first week and haven't borrowed anything until Monday of the second week, then you cannot borrow the equipment. "
msgstr "       开启军械库须知|——如果你上次租借正好是上周同一天，就不能再借。|——请先确认上周同一天你是否借过装备。|——例）如果你第一周的周一借了装备，直到第二周的周一之前都没借过，那你就不能借装备。"

msgid "We are giving the mission of rescuing the spies who are currently operating in Arrdream region... We are giving different rewards according to one's ability, so please take the mission that is appropriate for your level. "
msgstr "我们正在发放营救目前在阿德雷姆地区活动的密探的任务……我们按能力给予不同报酬，请接适合你等级的任务。"

msgid "Hmph~ I am on a mission given by Tikta. I am a spy who is watching the activities of El Morad and investigating geographical features here! Heh~"
msgstr "哼~我正在执行提克塔交给我的任务。我是监视艾莫拉德动向、调查这里地理特征的密探！呵~"

msgid "Re..Really?? Hm~ To tell you the truth I coudn't even think about going back lately because the El Morad have tightened their security. I have to deliver the Intelligence Report to Caesar, but I couldn't meet the deadline. So could you do me a favor? Could you deliver this Intelligence Report on behalf of me? I don't think I can get out of here..Hm~"
msgstr "真……真的吗？嗯~说实话，近来艾莫拉德加强了警戒，我连回去的念头都不敢有。我得把情报报告交给凯撒，可已经错过了期限。所以你能帮我个忙吗？你能替我把这份情报报告送去吗？我看我是走不出这儿了……嗯~"

msgid "Ugh..I can't help it if it's Tikta's order. Then I will trust you and follow you, so you have to protect me, okay? I won't let you get away if you run without me!! Well~ let's go!!"
msgstr "唉……既然是提克塔的命令，我也没办法。那我就信你，跟你走，你可得保护好我，明白吗？你要是撇下我自己跑，我可饶不了你！！那~咱们走！！"

msgid "Hmph~ I am on a mission given by Aimo. I am a spy who is watching the activities of Karus and investigating geographical features here! Heh~"
msgstr "哼~我正在执行艾莫交给我的任务。我是监视卡鲁斯动向、调查这里地理特征的密探！呵~"

msgid "Re... Really??  To tell you the truth I coudn't even think about going back lately because the Karus have tightened their security I have to deliver the Intelligence Report to Julius, but I couldn't meet the deadline. So could you do me a favor? Could you deliver this Intelligence Report on behalf of me? I don't think I can get out of here..Hm~"
msgstr "真……真的吗？说实话，近来卡鲁斯加强了警戒，我连回去的念头都不敢有。我得把情报报告交给尤利乌斯，可已经错过了期限。所以你能帮我个忙吗？你能替我把这份情报报告送去吗？我看我是走不出这儿了……嗯~"

msgid "Ugh..I can't help it if it's Aimo's order. Then I will trust you and follow you, so you have to protect me, okay? I won't let you get away if you run without me!! Well~ let's go!!"
msgstr "唉……既然是艾莫的命令，我也没办法。那我就信你，跟你走，你可得保护好我，明白吗？你要是撇下我自己跑，我可饶不了你！！那~咱们走！！"

msgid "To become [Training Knight Squad], you have to be more than [Normal Clan]   3rd Class, so come back when you are  [Normal Clan]  3rd Class."
msgstr "要成为[训练骑士团]，你必须先达到[普通公会]三等，所以等你到了[普通公会]三等再来。"

msgid "To become [Formal Knight Squad], you have to be [Training Knight Squad]  1st Class, come back when you are [Training Knight Squad]  1st Class."
msgstr "要成为[正式骑士团]，你必须先达到[训练骑士团]一等，等你到了[训练骑士团]一等再来。"

msgid "Hi, they call me jewel. Why am I here you ask? It's a bit of a long story ... but I will tell you, <selfname>. I have been taught to craft magical jewelry as a part of my family's business, but greed has corrupted my family and I ran away. I travelled around the world before ending up here in Moradon. Now I use my jeweling skills here to combine old accessories to help people. My skills have yet to be perfected, but sometimes I get lucky!"
msgstr "嗨，大家都叫我珠宝匠。你问我为什么在这儿？说来话长……不过我会告诉你的，<selfname>。我家祖传就是做魔法首饰的，可贪婪腐蚀了我的家族，我就跑了出来。我周游世界，最后到了莫拉登。如今我在这儿用我的首饰手艺，把旧饰品合成起来帮助别人。我的手艺还没臻于完美，但偶尔也能成！"

msgid "Combining three old accessories into a new accessory is the greatest skill a jewel crafter can possess. These old accessories now can have a new life and make their owner feel reborn in the process! Oh how wonderful! Bring me 3 identical Old Accesory, Nest Scrap (5), Scrap of Steel (50) and Soft Stone (1), and I will make you a new accessory. Be aware that my skills are not perfected yet, so I cannot guarantee results. I have a higher probability to fail than succeed. Haha!"
msgstr "把三件旧饰品合成一件新饰品，是珠宝匠所能拥有的最高手艺。这些旧饰品如今能重获新生，让主人在这个过程中如获新生！哦，多美妙！给我带来 3 件相同的旧饰品、巢穴碎屑(5)、钢铁碎屑(50)和柔软之石(1)，我就给你做一件新饰品。注意我的手艺还没完美，我不敢保证结果。失败的概率比成功还高。哈哈！"

msgid "Are you ready to try crafting?"
msgstr "你准备好试试打造了吗？"

msgid "Hmm.. This is pretty rare stuff ... Well, <selfname> you know not everything in life is free! But I will let you have it for only 1 million Noah. How can I make it cheaper?"
msgstr "嗯……这可是相当稀罕的东西……唉，<selfname>，你也知道这世上没有免费的东西！不过我只收你 100 万诺亚就给你。我还能怎么便宜？"

msgid "Let's see ... 998, 999, 1 million ... Perfect. No need for change I guess ... Here you go. Gread deal, huh? Do not tell anyone else! OK?"
msgstr "我看看……998、999、100 万……正好。看来不用找零了……给你。划算吧？别告诉别人！好吗？"

msgid "<selfname>? Are you short on Noah?"
msgstr "<selfname>？你诺亚不够？"

msgid "You still have the [Fake infosheet], go perform the confusion tactic please"
msgstr "你还带着[假情报纸]，请去执行迷惑战术吧。"

msgid "You chose 5000 premium HP potion. Would you like to receive it?"
msgstr "你选了 5000 高级 HP 药水。你想领取吗？"

msgid "Sorry, you don't have a voucher for 5000 premium HP potion"
msgstr "抱歉，你没有 5000 高级 HP 药水的兑换券。"

msgid "You chose 5000 premium MP potion. Would you like to receive it?"
msgstr "你选了 5000 高级 MP 药水。你想领取吗？"

msgid "Sorry, you don't have a voucher for 5000 premium MP potion"
msgstr "抱歉，你没有 5000 高级 MP 药水的兑换券。"

msgid "Kill the Undyings around here and bring me their Apples of Moradon."
msgstr "把这附近的不死怪宰了，把它们的莫拉登苹果带给我。"

msgid "The Nameless Warrior will perform a ritual to praise the souls of the dead warriors. Go and meet him, check him out. ^^"
msgstr "无名战士将举行仪式，祭奠阵亡战士的灵魂。去见见他，看看情况。^^"

msgid "There is nothing I can do now... Blast."
msgstr "我现在什么也做不了……该死。"

msgid "Not long ago, our Village's Knight Squad suffered great losses from a Monster attack. Since then, our morale has been badly shaken."
msgstr "前不久，我们村的骑士团在一次怪物袭击中损失惨重。从那以后，我们的士气就大受打击。"

msgid "This is an Apple of Moradon, isn't it? Uh ? These guys look scary so they make my blood run cold, aren't they?"
msgstr "这是莫拉登苹果，对吧？呃？这些家伙看着吓人，让我毛骨悚然，是吧？"

msgid "Master- They're preparing the War Supplies over in the Folk Village. So Osmond is busy eh? You should go and pay him a visit."
msgstr "村民村那边正在筹备军需。奥斯蒙德挺忙的是吧？你该去拜访他一下。"

msgid "Do you know about an object called the horn of comprehension?"
msgstr "你听说过一种叫「领悟之角」的东西吗？"

msgid "The horn of comprehension is the most precious object to us priests."
msgstr "领悟之角是我们祭司最珍贵的宝物。"

msgid "A prospective priest who went out training a while ago had lost it to the Fallen Angels on the lowest level of the Abyss Dungeon.  Right now, that prospective priest is going through a period of repentance for his mistake, so we need someone to go there and bring it back."
msgstr "前不久出去修行的一位候补祭司，在深渊地牢最底层把它弄丢了，落到了堕落天使手里。眼下那位候补祭司正在为自己的过错忏悔，所以我们需要有人去那儿把它取回来。"

msgid "If it goes into someone's hand, worse yet into the hand of the enemy, then it could be a big problem for us.  Could you bring the back Horn of Comprehension from the lowest level of the Abyss Dungeon? "
msgstr "它要是落到别人手里，更糟的是落到敌人手里，那对我们可就是大麻烦了。你能去深渊地牢最底层把领悟之角取回来吗？"

msgid "Master, do you know the skill called Scream? You should visit [Warrior Master] Skaki and ask him about it."
msgstr "师父，你听说过叫「尖啸」的技能吗？你该去拜访[战士大师]斯卡基，问问他。"

msgid "Master, I hear that there are enemies who threatening Ronark Land.  Let's look for [Outpost Captain] Della."
msgstr "师父，我听说罗纳克之地有虎视眈眈的敌人。咱们去找[前哨队长]德拉吧。"

msgid "Master, I hear that there are enemies who threatening Ronark Land.  Let's look for [Outpost Captain] Elrod."
msgstr "师父，我听说罗纳克之地有虎视眈眈的敌人。咱们去找[前哨队长]埃尔罗德吧。"

msgid "I`ll be waiting. May the gods bless you..."
msgstr "我会等着。愿众神保佑你……"

msgid "May the gods bless you..."
msgstr "愿众神保佑你……"

msgid "horn of comprehension can be retrieved from Fallen Angels in the nether Abyss Dungeon."
msgstr "领悟之角可以从深渊地牢最底层的堕落天使身上取回。"

msgid "Master, you retrieved the horn of comprehension. Hurry back to [Priest] Minerva."
msgstr "师父，你取回了领悟之角。快回[牧师]密涅瓦那儿去。"

msgid "Thank you. This completes the retrieval of all the horn of comprehension in the mainland. May the gods shower you with blessings."
msgstr "谢谢你。这下本土上所有的领悟之角都收齐了。愿众神降福于你。"

msgid "Master, they`re none other than Fallen Angels. They`re powerful monsters so be careful."
msgstr "师父，它们正是堕落天使。它们是强大的怪物，小心点。"

msgid "Master, Minvera is looking for something. Go see what it is."
msgstr "师父，密涅瓦在找什么东西。去看看是什么。"

msgid "Master, have you heard of an attack technique called Judgment?"
msgstr "师父，你听说过叫「审判」的攻击技吗？"

msgid "There`s talk about physical attack being as important an attack technique to a priest as is magic."
msgstr "有一种说法是，对祭司而言，物理攻击和魔法一样，都是重要的攻击手段。"

msgid "You know who to see if you want to know more about Judgment, don`t you?"
msgstr "你想多了解审判的话，该去找谁，你心里有数吧？"

msgid "Come on, Master. [Priest] Minerva`s an expert in this field."
msgstr "走吧，师父。[牧师]密涅瓦是这方面的行家。"

msgid "Judgment, which priests can learn with the 2nd job change is a technique which employs powerful attack power."
msgstr "审判是祭司二次转职后能学的技能，是一种威力强大的攻击技。"

msgid "You will first have to prove to me that you are capable enough to handle Judgment Scroll.  Win seven victories at National Defence Combat at the upper reaches of the kalluga valley and then bring me the Symbol of Vctory to me, and I will give you this scroll."
msgstr "你首先得向我证明，你有能力驾驭审判卷轴。去卡卢加峡谷上游的国境防御战中赢下七场胜利，把胜利象征带给我，我就把这卷轴给你。"

msgid "The gods will bless your journey with light."
msgstr "众神将以光明护佑你的旅程。"

msgid "Master, all the ingredients have been collected. Go to complete the Judgment Scroll."
msgstr "师父，材料都集齐了。去把审判卷轴做完吧。"

msgid "You are ready. Please wait."
msgstr "你准备好了。请稍等。"

msgid "This is the Judgment Scroll. As it is a dangerous technique, please use it to protect justice under the name of the gods."
msgstr "这就是审判卷轴。它是一种危险的技能，请你以众神之名用它来守护正义。"

msgid "Whoa... You are beginning to emit the aura of the gods. That indicates that you have reached the final stage of priest training. "
msgstr "哇……你身上开始散出神的光辉了。这说明你已经到了祭司修行的最后阶段。"

msgid "The priest who completes the final training earns the right to receive the pure ability that the god grants directly to the priests.  But. To be endowed with the ability, there are two things that you need.  They are the Nostrum of Wisdom and Stamp of Intelligence.  I will make the Nostrum of Wisdom for you if you bring me 5 Holy Water of Temple, 5 Venomous Tails of Lesath, and 2 Magic Powders. Do you want to do it?"
msgstr "完成最终修行的祭司，将有权领受神直接赐予祭司的纯粹能力。但是，要被赋予这种能力，你需要两样东西。它们是智慧秘药和智力印记。你给我带来 5 瓶神殿圣水、5 条利萨思毒尾和 2 份魔法粉末，我就给你做智慧秘药。你愿意做吗？"

msgid "You will be the most celebrated priest in the continent if the gods personally award you with infinite ability."
msgstr "要是神亲自赐予你无穷的能力，你将成为整个大陆最负盛名的祭司。"

msgid "Do you believe that you still need more training? You are modest. May the gods be with you... "
msgstr "你觉得自己还需要更多修行？你很谦虚。愿众神与你同在……"

msgid "Making a Nostrum of Wisdom requires ,5 Holy Water of Life, 5 Venomous Tails of Lesath, and 2 Magic Powders."
msgstr "做智慧秘药需要 5 瓶生命圣水、5 条利萨思毒尾和 2 份魔法粉末。"

msgid "Master, all the materials needed for making the Nostrum of Wisdom have been collected. My heart`s going ballistic to think that you will be conferred infinite ability by the gods."
msgstr "师父，做智慧秘药所需的材料都集齐了。一想到你将被众神赐予无穷的能力，我这心就激动得不行。"

msgid "You have accumulated all the ingredients required for making Nostrum of Wisdom. Please wait. Here`s the Nostrum of Wisdom. I hope you will be bestowed with the ability of the gods and realize your dream. "
msgstr "做智慧秘药所需的材料你都备齐了。请稍等。这就是智慧秘药。愿你被赋予神的能力，实现你的梦想。"

msgid "Priest, you who will undertake the final stage of training, you will need two objects to practice the ability which the gods will confer on you should you complete the final stage of your training. "
msgstr "祭司啊，即将踏上最终修行的你，要练习神将赐予你的能力，需要两样道具——前提是你完成最终修行。"

msgid "They are the Nostrum of Wisdom and Stamp of Intelligence.  The god's ability will not be endowed on you even if one of them is insufficient.  Stamp of Intelligence can be made with 1 Lycaon's Pendant, 1 Robo's Pendant, and 1 Silver Bar.  Can you find them?"
msgstr "它们就是智慧秘药和智力印记。缺了其中任何一样，神的能力都不会赋予你。智力印记可以用 1 个狼王吊坠、1 个罗伯吊坠和 1 根银锭做成。你能找到它们吗？"

msgid "The gods will be moved by your devotion."
msgstr "众神会被你的虔诚所打动。"

msgid "But the gods will not be disappointed in you."
msgstr "但众神不会让你失望。"

msgid "To make a Stamp of Intelligence, you need 1 Lycaon's Pendant,  1 Robo's Pendant, and one Silver Bar. What you brought isn't enough."
msgstr "做一枚智力印记，你需要 1 个狼王吊坠、1 个罗伯吊坠和 1 根银锭。你带来的不够。"

msgid "Master, you have collected 1 Lycaon's Pendant, 1 Robo's Pendant, and one Silver Bar. Now you can make the stamp of intelligence with these."
msgstr "师父，你已经收集到 1 个狼王吊坠、1 个罗伯吊坠和 1 根银锭。现在你可以用这些来做智力印记了。"

msgid "The ingredients for making the Stamp of Intelligence have all been collected. This is the Stamp of Intelligence. It is an essential item for the final stage of your training. "
msgstr "做智力印记的材料都集齐了。这就是智力印记。它是你最终修行阶段必不可少的道具。"

msgid "It is now time for me to teach you the most powerful secret weapon. The name of that secret weapon is Scream..."
msgstr "现在该由我来教你最强大的秘密武器了。那秘密武器的名字叫尖啸……"

msgid " It has such a name because it makes an enormous sound like the scream of Lucifer when you use the skill.  Show me whether you are qualified to deal with the secret scroll of this skill.  Win seven victories at the National Defence Combat at the upper reaches of the Kalluga Valley and bring me the Symbol of Victory. Then I will acknowledge your ability and give you this secret scroll."
msgstr "之所以叫这个名字，是因为你使用这个技能时，会发出像路西法尖啸一般的巨响。让我看看你够不够资格驾驭这个技能的秘密卷轴。去卡卢加峡谷上游的国境防御战中赢下七场胜利，把胜利象征带给我。那样我就认可你的能力，把这秘密卷轴给你。"

msgid "Come back after you have collected all the items I enumerated."
msgstr "把我列的东西都集齐了再回来。"

msgid "Don`t you want to learn the Scream? I guess you`re already sufficiently strong as is."
msgstr "你不想学尖啸吗？我看你现在已经够强了。"

msgid "Master, all the objects needed for obtaining the Scream Secret Scroll have been collected. Go see [Warrior Master] Skaki."
msgstr "师父，获得尖啸秘密卷轴所需的东西都集齐了。去见[战士大师]斯卡基吧。"

msgid "Um~ You've won seven victories as I told you.  Great job, here~ I will hand this scream secret scroll to you.  Make good use of this."
msgstr "嗯~你照我说的赢下了七场胜利。干得漂亮，来~我把这卷尖啸秘密卷轴交给你。好好用。"

msgid "You are now fast approaching the ultimate warrior level."
msgstr "你现在正飞速逼近终极战士的境界。"

msgid " We warriors have been thinking for a long time on the limit of our abilities. And as a result, we discovered the special skill filled with the last of our spirit and strength, and we recognized it as our final limit. And it is time for you to be handed down with that last secret skill. Since it is the last secret skill, the process of making it is also very complex. First, you need a Stamp of Strength and Nostrum of Constitution.  But these two items cannot be obtained from somewhere straightaway.  Such "
msgstr "我们战士长久以来一直在思考自身能力的极限。结果，我们发现了凝聚我们最后一丝精神与力量的特殊技能，并把它认作我们的终极极限。现在，该由我把那最后的秘密技能传授给你了。因为是最后的秘密技能，它的炼制过程也十分复杂。首先，你需要力量印记和体质秘药。可这两样东西没法直接弄到。这样"

msgid "I truly want to witness you practicing the culmination of all skills."
msgstr "我真心想亲眼见证你修炼这集所有技能之大成的一招。"

msgid "It shouldn`t matter too much. You are sufficiently strong as it is."
msgstr "这应该没什么大不了的。你现在已经足够强了。"

msgid "To make a Stamp of Strength, you need  1 Fangs of Bakirra, 1 Venomous Tails of Shaula, 2 Magic Powders and you can't afford to miss any one of them."
msgstr "做一枚力量印记，你需要 1 颗巴基拉獠牙、1 条绍拉毒尾、2 份魔法粉末，一样都不能少。"

msgid "Master, all the ingredients needed to make the Stamp of Power have been amassed. The ultimate secret weapon of the warrior... I can`t wait to witness it."
msgstr "师父，做力量印记所需的材料都凑齐了。战士的终极秘密武器……我都等不及要亲眼见证了。"

msgid "Wow... every single ingredient is here. The Stamp of Power will soon be completed. Please wait. This is the Stamp of Power. It is an essential object for completing the ultimate skill of the warrior."
msgstr "哇……每一样材料都在。力量印记马上就要做成了。请稍等。这就是力量印记。它是练成战士终极技能必不可少的道具。"

msgid "The skill practiced in the ultimate warrior level not only requires ultimate power but also ultimate constitution."
msgstr "终极战士境界所修的技能，不仅需要终极的力量，还需要终极的体质。"

msgid " For that reason, you need an item called the Nostrum of Constitution along with the Stamp of Strength.  To make Nostrum of Constitution, you need 1 Lupus Pendant, 1 Robo's Pendant, and one Silver Bar. If you have the Stamp of Strength, then you can complete the final skill of warriors with the Nostrum of Constitution.  What do you say, are you going to bring those?"
msgstr "正因如此，除了力量印记，你还需要一种叫「体质秘药」的道具。做体质秘药需要 1 个天狼吊坠、1 个罗伯吊坠和 1 根银锭。你有了力量印记，再加上体质秘药，就能练成战士的最终技能。怎么样，你打算把它们带来吗？"

msgid "I truly want to teach you the final skill as well."
msgstr "我真心也想把这最终技能教给你。"

msgid "I was hoping you`d be the one mastering the final skill..."
msgstr "我一直盼着由你来练成这最终技能……"

msgid "To make the Nostrum of Constitution, you must have all of 1 Lupus Pendant, 1 Robo's Pendant, and 1 Silver Bar."
msgstr "做体质秘药，你必须把 1 个天狼吊坠、1 个罗伯吊坠和 1 根银锭全部备齐。"

msgid "Master, all the Nostrum of Constitution ingredients have been gathered. I want to witness the final secret weapon of the warrior."
msgstr "师父，体质秘药的材料都集齐了。我真想亲眼看看战士的终极秘密武器。"

msgid "You`ve gathered all the Nostrum of Constitution ingredients. I will make it for you right away. This is Nostrum of Constitution. It isn`t long till you complete the final skill now."
msgstr "体质秘药的材料你都凑齐了。我这就给你做。这就是体质秘药。你离练成最终技能不远了。"

msgid "For me to make the Scroll of Magic Shield, you must prove your ability at the National Combat.  And that can also prove whether you are qualified to use the Magic Shield."
msgstr "要我给你做魔法护盾卷轴，你必须先在国家比武中证明你的实力。而这也能证明你是否有资格使用魔法护盾。"

msgid "Win seven victories at the National Defence Combat at upper reaches of the kalluga valley and bring me the Symbol of Victory, and I will  make the Scroll of Magic Shield for you. Do you want to do it?"
msgstr "去卡卢加峡谷上游的国境防御战中赢下七场胜利，把胜利象征带给我，我就给你做魔法护盾卷轴。你愿意做吗？"

msgid "I`ll be waiting."
msgstr "我会等着。"

msgid "That might be a wise choice."
msgstr "那或许是个明智的选择。"

msgid "I hear that the Death Magician has appeared in Ronark Land.. Do you think it is true? Let's go and ask [Outpost Captain] Elrod about it."
msgstr "我听说死亡术士出现在罗纳克之地了……你觉得是真的吗？咱们去问问[前哨队长]埃尔罗德吧。"

msgid "Master, you have won seven victories.  Let's return to [Secret Agent] Clarence."
msgstr "师父，你赢下了七场胜利。咱们回[密探]克拉伦斯那儿去。"

msgid "Master, you have finally won all seven victories.  Let's return to [Secret Agent] Clarence."
msgstr "师父，你终于赢下了全部七场胜利。咱们回[密探]克拉伦斯那儿去。"

msgid "You have moved me with your drive. Here is the Magic Shield Scroll. Please don`t lose that rogue`s passion of yours."
msgstr "你的干劲打动了我。这就是魔法护盾卷轴。请别丢掉你那股刺客的冲劲。"

msgid "What do you think is the most important thing for rogues?"
msgstr "你觉得对我们刺客来说，最重要的是什么？"

msgid " The most important things for us Rogues would obviously be speed and agility.  And when these elements reach the maximum, that rogue can be called to have reached the highest status.  The highest status... Of course it is easy to speak about it, but it requires great persistence and effort to reach that status, of course.  To respond to your such great effort, I will hand you down  the last secret art of us Rogues.  To complete the last secret art of Rogues, as I said before, the Rogue"
msgstr "对我们刺客而言，最重要的显然就是速度和敏捷。当这两样都达到极致，那这个刺客才算达到了最高境界。最高境界……说起来当然容易，可要达到那个境界，自然需要极大的坚持和努力。为了回报你如此大的付出，我要把我们刺客最后的秘术传授给你。要练成刺客最后的秘术，就像我刚才说的，刺客"

msgid "Come back if you have all the ingredients."
msgstr "材料齐了就回来。"

msgid "To make the Nostrum of Speed, you need 5 Bracelets of Orc Bandit, 5 Venomous Tails of Shaula, and 2 Magic Powders, and you don't have all of them yet. "
msgstr "做迅捷秘药，你需要 5 个兽人匪盗手镯、5 条绍拉毒尾和 2 份魔法粉末，这些你还没凑齐。"

msgid "Master, the Nostrum of Speed ingredients have all been acquired. You are now one step closer to being the greatest rogue."
msgstr "师父，迅捷秘药的材料都弄到了。你离成为最伟大的刺客又近了一步。"

msgid "You have collected all the ingredients needed to make the Nostrum of Speed. This is the Nostrum of Speed. It is one of the items you will need to unleash your latent ultimate ability."
msgstr "做迅捷秘药所需的材料你都收集齐了。这就是迅捷秘药。它是释放你潜藏终极能力所需的道具之一。"

msgid "The two most important rogue traits speed and dexterity... The Stamp of Dexterity is the symbol of the most accomplished dexterity."
msgstr "刺客最重要的两大特质——速度与灵巧……灵巧印记正是最精湛灵巧的象征。"

msgid " You need this along with the Nostrum of Speed to learn the ultimate secret art, and it also requires several special ingredients to make.  To complete the Stamp of Agility, you need 1 Lupus Pendant, 1 Robo's Pendant, and one Silver Bar. Are you going to bring those?"
msgstr "要学终极秘术，你需要把它和迅捷秘药一起用，而它本身也需要好几种特殊材料才能做成。要做敏捷印记，你需要 1 个天狼吊坠、1 个罗伯吊坠和 1 根银锭。你打算把它们带来吗？"

msgid "Come back when you have all the ingredients."
msgstr "材料齐了就回来。"

msgid "I already told you that to make the Stamp of Agility, you need 1 Lupus Pendant, 1 Robo's Pendant, and 1 Slver Bar."
msgstr "我不是跟你说过，做敏捷印记需要 1 个天狼吊坠、1 个罗伯吊坠和 1 根银锭吗？"

msgid "Master, you`ve collected all the Stamp of Dexterity ingredients. Now it`s just a matter of time till you learn the ultimate secret technique."
msgstr "师父，灵巧印记的材料你都收集齐了。现在你练成终极秘术只是时间问题。"

msgid "You`ve collected all the Stamp of Dexterity ingredients. This is the Stamp of Dexterity, an object needed to master the final secret technique of the rogue."
msgstr "灵巧印记的材料你都收集齐了。这就是灵巧印记，是掌握刺客最终秘术所需的道具。"

msgid "Master, I heard that [Secret Agent] Clarence knows of an assistant magic that increases all resistance of the body during combat. "
msgstr "师父，我听说[密探]克拉伦斯懂一种辅助魔法，能在战斗中提升全身所有抗性。"

msgid "I guess you came to me after hearing some stories, but I don't carelessly make it for just anyone. "
msgstr "我猜你是听了些风声才来找我的，可我不会随随便便给谁做。"

msgid "Please bring every single item I enumerated then."
msgstr "那就把我列的每一样东西都带来。"

msgid "How did you manage to defeat those Death Magicians while still fighting in the battles against El Morad?? Wow~"
msgstr "你怎么能在还忙着跟艾莫拉德作战的同时，又干掉了那些死亡术士？？哇~"

msgid "You have brought all the materials. I will keep my word and produce the Holy Water of Poison."
msgstr "材料你都带来了。我会信守承诺，给你炼出剧毒圣水。"

msgid "For a long time, us rogues have been offering the valuable berries to the Imperial Family."
msgstr "长久以来，我们刺客一直把珍贵的浆果进献给王室。"

msgid "But cardinals living in the vicinity stole all the Asga berries and there`s nothing to present to the Imperial Family. Please help us and retrieve the berries."
msgstr "可是住在附近的枢机鸟把阿斯加浆果全偷走了，没有东西可以进献给王室了。求你帮帮我们，把浆果夺回来。"

msgid "We`re counting on you."
msgstr "我们全指望你了。"

msgid "Are you still oblivious to the value of the berries?"
msgstr "你还不明白这些浆果的价值吗？"

msgid "Asga berries can be obtained by hunting cardinals."
msgstr "阿斯加浆果可以通过猎杀枢机鸟获得。"

msgid "Master, the Asga berries have been retrieved. Go back to [Secret Proxy] Clarence now."
msgstr "师父，阿斯加浆果夺回来了。现在就回[密探]克拉伦斯那儿去。"

msgid "You brought Asga berries? I will give you a small gift for them."
msgstr "你带来了阿斯加浆果？我会因此送你一件小礼物。"

msgid "Belua`s peal is immensely beautiful but it is sacred enough to resurrect a dying plant."
msgstr "贝鲁亚钟声绝美无比，却又神圣到能让一株垂死的植物复苏。"

msgid "We were waiting for a true knight who will give us a chance to hear it. Please defeat the cardinals which are threatening this village and seize their jewels and show it in front of the Belua Bell. The bell will toll then."
msgstr "我们一直在等一位真正的骑士，给我们一个听到它钟声的机会。请击败威胁这个村子的枢机鸟，夺下它们的宝石，拿到贝鲁亚钟前展示。那样钟就会响。"

msgid "Belua Bell will certainly toll in front of you."
msgstr "贝鲁亚钟一定会在你面前敲响的。"

msgid "You don`t deserve to ring the Belua Bell."
msgstr "你不配敲响贝鲁亚钟。"

msgid "Cardinal`s jewels can be obtained by hunting cardinals."
msgstr "枢机鸟的宝石可以通过猎杀枢机鸟获得。"

msgid "Master, Cardinal`s jewels have been gathered. Now we can hear the peal of the Belua Bell."
msgstr "师父，枢机鸟的宝石都集齐了。这下我们能听到贝鲁亚钟的钟声了。"

msgid "Thanks to you, we are able to listen to the beautiful peal. Thank you."
msgstr "多亏了你，我们才能听到这美妙的钟声。谢谢。"

msgid "Master, aren`t you hungry suddenly?  Something smells good..."
msgstr "师父，你是不是突然觉得饿了？有东西闻着好香……"

msgid "Hey, it`s coming from there. I bet he`s the Imperial Palace Chef. Go see him, Master."
msgstr "嘿，香味就是从那边飘来的。我打赌他就是御厨。去看看他吧，师父。"

msgid "The Imperial Palace is always replete with guests, from passersby to knights..."
msgstr "皇宫里总是宾客盈门，从过路人到骑士应有尽有……"

msgid "It is our duty to provide them with food and study methods to cook more delicious and nutritious dishes. But we`ve been inundated with guests today, short on help, and even the pig to be barbecued ran away. If you catch the pig for us I will make you delicious BBQ."
msgstr "为他们提供食物、研究怎么做更美味营养的菜肴，是我们的职责。可今天客人多得应接不暇，人手又不够，连要烤的猪都跑了。你要是帮我们把猪抓回来，我就给你做美味的烧烤。"

msgid "Tyon meat can be obtained by catching Tyons in the farm. Please help us."
msgstr "泰昂肉可以在农场抓泰昂获得。请帮帮我们。"

msgid "Guess you`re not really hungry."
msgstr "我看你是不怎么饿嘛。"

msgid "Hmm... How much longer till we see the Tyon meat?"
msgstr "嗯……泰昂肉还要多久才到？"

msgid "Master, you obtained Tyon meat. We`re finally having delicious BBQ, heh heh."
msgstr "师父，你弄到泰昂肉了。我们终于能吃上美味烧烤啦，嘿嘿。"

msgid "Thank you. Delicious BBQ is now complete."
msgstr "谢谢。美味的烧烤做成了。"

msgid "Master, [Sentinel] Patrick looks preoccupied again."
msgstr "师父，[哨兵]帕特里克看起来又心事重重了。"

msgid "For the protection of Moradon... What is it you wanted to say to me?"
msgstr "为了守护莫拉登……你想跟我说什么来着？"

msgid "Peddlers that have arrived recently say they were attacked by Kecoons en route to the castle. Kecoons are malicious monsters who attack humans and take their belongings. Say, do you mind venturing to the outskirts of Moradon and teaching them a lesson?"
msgstr "近来刚到的商贩说，他们在来城堡的路上遭到了凯昆的袭击。凯昆是种歹毒的怪物，会攻击人类、抢夺财物。我说，你愿不愿意跑一趟莫拉登郊外，给它们点颜色瞧瞧？"

msgid "You never let me down. Thank you in advance."
msgstr "你从不让我失望。先谢啦。"

msgid "You seem to be tied up right now. I`ll ask you later."
msgstr "你眼下好像脱不开身。我回头再找你。"

msgid "Your ability is wasted. Don't you need to catch this much at least?"
msgstr "你的本事可白费了。你至少该抓这么多吧？"

msgid "Master, I caught all of the Kecoons as promised. Let's go back to [Sentinel] Patrick."
msgstr "师父，我如约把凯昆都抓住了。咱们回[哨兵]帕特里克那儿去。"

msgid "Thanks to you the number of Kecoons dwelling in the village outskirts have been reduced significantly. Thank you. I`ll ask for your help again next time."
msgstr "多亏了你，盘踞在村子郊外的凯昆数量大幅减少。谢谢。下次再找你帮忙。"

msgid "Another day in thriving Moradon! What do you want?"
msgstr "繁荣的莫拉登又一天！你想要什么？"

msgid "I received word that peddlers are having a hard time traveling due to Bulcans lurking in the sand plains. Moradon is a quasi-desert with 80% of the terrain covered with sand. Their numbers are sure to grow if they go unchecked. Do you think it`s possible for you to wipe out the Bulcans inhabiting the sand? "
msgstr "我接到报告，说沙原上潜伏着布坎，商贩们行路艰难。莫拉登是个半沙漠地带，八成地面都是沙。放任不管的话，它们的数量肯定会涨。你觉得你能把盘踞在沙地里的布坎清掉吗？"

msgid "Thank you. I`m counting on you."
msgstr "谢谢。我全指望你了。"

msgid "That`s too bad. See you later."
msgstr "那太遗憾了。回头见。"

msgid "In order to guarantee the safety of the peddlers, at least five Bulcans must be caught. "
msgstr "为了保证商贩的安全，至少得抓五只布坎。"

msgid "I caught all of 5 Bulcans. Let's go back to [Guard] Patrick."
msgstr "5 只布坎我全抓了。咱们回[卫兵]帕特里克那儿去。"

msgid "Excellent. Thanks to you the number of Bulcans have declined markedly. Thank you."
msgstr "好极了。多亏了你，布坎的数量明显下降。谢谢。"

msgid "I`m Moradon`s Guardian, no, still just Sentinel Patrick. What did you want?"
msgstr "我是莫拉登的守护者，不，眼下还是哨兵帕特里克。你有什么事？"

msgid "This time Bulcan creatures have appeared, but they are more powerful. The creatures called Wild Bulcan look similar to regular Bulcan in appearance, but these creatures are more ferocious. Several mercenaries and peddlers have already been vicitimized by these Wild Bulcans. I think you can solve this matter for us this time too. Please hunt five Wild Bulcans, which are similar to but fiercer than Bulcan, and come back."
msgstr "这次出现的是布坎的同类，但更加强大。那种叫「荒野布坎」的怪物，外形和普通布坎相似，却更加凶残。已经有好几个佣兵和商贩遭了这些荒野布坎的毒手。我想这次你也能帮我们解决。请去猎杀五只和布坎相似却更凶猛的荒野布坎，再回来。"

msgid "I knew you would accept this mission as well. Thank you."
msgstr "我就知道你也会接下这个任务。谢谢。"

msgid "Are you rejecting it? You have grown a lot."
msgstr "你要拒绝？你成长了不少。"

msgid "Hey, you must hunt at least five Wild Bulcans. Don't even think about going easy."
msgstr "喂，你至少得猎杀五只荒野布坎。别想手下留情。"

msgid "Master, you`ve hunted down the Bulcans again. Hurry back to [Sentinel] Patrick."
msgstr "师父，你又把布坎猎杀了。快回[哨兵]帕特里克那儿去。"

msgid "I should`ve asked you from the beginning. Thank you for taking care of it for me."
msgstr "我早该一开口就找你的。谢谢你替我办妥。"

msgid "Master, I hear that Kecoons are running rampant again lately in the Moradon outskirts."
msgstr "师父，我听说近来莫拉登郊外的凯昆又猖獗起来了。"

msgid "Wonder why there`s no word from [Sentinel] Patrick. It`s about time he asked you to get rid of them."
msgstr "不知为什么[哨兵]帕特里克那边还没动静。他也差不多该叫你去收拾它们了。"

msgid "Master, what if we go ahead and hunt down Kecoon Warriors which are at the root of the commotion and pleasantly surprise [Sentinel] Patrick?"
msgstr "师父，咱们索性把这场骚乱的根源——凯昆战士都猎杀了，给[哨兵]帕特里克一个惊喜怎么样？"

msgid "Knew you`d be up to it, Master. Let`s move to Moradon outskirts where Kecoon Warriors primarily breed."
msgstr "我就知道你行的，师父。咱们去莫拉登郊外，凯昆战士主要在那儿繁殖。"

msgid "Jeez, Master, you`re more passive than you look."
msgstr "哎呀师父，你比看上去要被动啊。"

msgid ".........."
msgstr "…………"

msgid "Master, you caught 10 Kecoon Warriors. This should be enough to surprise [Sentinel] Patrick."
msgstr "师父，你抓了 10 只凯昆战士。这下足够给[哨兵]帕特里克一个惊喜了。"

msgid "No way. I didn`t ask you because I felt so guilty enlisting your help all the time. And you went ahead and resolved it without my asking."
msgstr "不会吧。我之所以没找你，是因为老是麻烦你帮忙，心里过意不去。结果你倒好，没等我开口就把事解决了。"

msgid "Thank you so much. I`ll never forget what you did for me today. Wish you can be a true colleague of mine."
msgstr "太感谢了。我永远不会忘记你今天为我做的。但愿你能成为我真正的同事。"

msgid "Master, we have to first finish the hunt we started!"
msgstr "师父，我们得先把已经开始的狩猎干完！"

msgid "Phew..."
msgstr "呼……"

msgid "Kecoons seem to be running rampant again lately in the Moradon outskirts."
msgstr "近来莫拉登郊外的凯昆似乎又猖獗起来了。"

msgid "Lately... No, never mind, I can`t ask you. Goodbye!"
msgstr "近来……不，算了，我不能再麻烦你了。再见！"

msgid "You`re declining my request? What an upstart."
msgstr "你要拒绝我的请求？好你个新人。"

msgid "What are you doing?"
msgstr "你在做什么？"

msgid "Dying and killing, dying and killing... There is nothing left for me anymore."
msgstr "死去活来，杀来杀去……我已经一无所有了。"

msgid "Thanks to you, I think we will have a ceremony to commemorate the spirits of the warriors who have been freed. As there were troubles up to now because of these Zombie creatures, I think we'll use Apples of Moradon as a sacrifice. What do you think? Isn't it a good idea?"
msgstr "多亏了你，我想我们可以为那些得以解脱的战士亡灵举行一场纪念仪式。因为这些僵尸怪物，至今麻烦不断，我想就用莫拉登苹果当祭品。你觉得怎么样？是不是个好主意？"

msgid "So can you obtain their apples for me? Even though I am in such a situation, I intend to perform the grave site ceremonies so that the spirits of the dead warriors can sleep peacefully. Apples of Moradon can be obtained from all kinds of zombies."
msgstr "那你能帮我弄到它们的苹果吗？我眼下虽处境如此，还是打算举行墓地仪式，好让阵亡战士的灵魂安息。莫拉登苹果可以从各种僵尸身上获得。"

msgid "As soon as Apple of Moradon is secured, I am going to hold the ceremony immediately. Please note that Apple of Moradon can be obtained from all kinds of zombies."
msgstr "一备齐莫拉登苹果，我立刻就举行仪式。请注意莫拉登苹果可以从各种僵尸身上获得。"

msgid "We are eternally grateful.|Now the dead warriors can finally rest after their ancient wanderings."
msgstr "我们感激不尽。|如今阵亡的战士在千年漂泊之后，终于可以安息了。"

msgid "The war on the continent of Adonis is doing great injustice to the warriors who have turned into casualties of war. "
msgstr "阿多尼斯大陆上的战争，对战死沙场的战士们太不公了。"

msgid "With the ceremony delayed, Rotten Eyes have seized this place and turned it into a situation which the warriors' spirits can't reside peacefully. I feel like I am turning into the dead being surrounded by this. If we do nothing, Rotten Eyes will take over the warriors' spirits soon."
msgstr "仪式一拖再拖，腐眼便占据了此地，闹得战士的灵魂都不得安宁。我被这一切包围，感觉自己都要变成死人了。我们要是袖手旁观，腐眼很快就会吞噬战士们的灵魂。"

msgid "As long as these Rotten Eyes exist, their spirits may not be able to sleep peacefully. I feel pathetic that there is nothing I can do."
msgstr "只要这些腐眼还在，他们的灵魂就无法安息。我却什么也做不了，感到可悲。"

msgid "Congratulations~ Master, you have finally reached 35Lv.  If you show  Promise of Training to Vilbore, he will give you special present. "
msgstr "恭喜~师父，你终于到 35 级了。你把「修行之约」拿给维尔博雷看，他就会给你特别礼物。"

msgid "Don't block me any more."
msgstr "别再挡我的路了。"

msgid "I heard that someone wiped out Rotten Eyes.. Was it you? I think I probably was a little rude to you. I am sorry. Their spirits can rest comfortably now, can't they? Oh, thank you very much."
msgstr "我听说有人把腐眼都清掉了……是你吗？我想我之前对你有点粗鲁。对不起。他们的灵魂现在可以安息了，是吧？哦，太感谢了。"

msgid "Do you like the new Moradon?|We've organized a small event to celebrate the birth of New Moradon. The First Event!"
msgstr "你喜欢新的莫拉登吗？|我们筹办了一个小活动，庆祝新莫拉登的诞生。第一届活动！"

msgid "Master, according to rumors the [Warrior Master] is teaching the ultimate skill to those warriors who have reached the apex as a warrior. Go for it. "
msgstr "师父，据传[战士大师]正在向那些已臻战士巅峰的战士传授终极技能。去争取吧。"

msgid "You are well qualified to advance to the ultimate warrior level."
msgstr "你完全有资格进阶到终极战士境界。"

msgid "To complete the ultimate warrior skill, you will need 5 [SpellStone Powder]. Are you ready for this?"
msgstr "要练成战士终极技能，你需要 5 份[法术石粉末]。你准备好了吗？"

msgid "Preliminary "
msgstr "预备"

msgid "To complete the ultimate warrior skilll, you need 5 [SpellStone Powder]."
msgstr "要练成战士终极技能，你需要 5 份[法术石粉末]。"

msgid "Master, all the items needed to master ultimate warrior skills have been acquired. Let`s hurry back to [Warrior Master] Skaki. "
msgstr "师父，掌握战士终极技能所需的道具都弄到了。咱们快回[战士大师]斯卡基那儿去。"

msgid "This is Howling Sword and Iron Skin, the ultimate level skills. You will triumph in the war by your own powers.  "
msgstr "这就是终极技能——嚎叫剑与铁肤。你将凭自己的力量在战争中取胜。"

msgid "Master, according to rumors the [Secret Proxy] is teaching the ultimate skill to those rogues who have reached the apex as a rogue. Go for it. "
msgstr "师父，据传[密探]正在向那些已臻刺客巅峰的刺客传授终极技能。去争取吧。"

msgid "Children of wind and shadow, that is us rogues. You, who have reached the final rogue training stage, are qualified to learn and employ the final skill.  "
msgstr "风与影之子，那就是我们刺客。你已抵达刺客修行的最终阶段，有资格学习并施展最终技能。"

msgid "To learn the ultimate rogue skill, you will need 5 [SpellStone Powder]. Are you ready for this?"
msgstr "要学刺客终极技能，你需要 5 份[法术石粉末]。你准备好了吗？"

msgid "Let me know when you have equipped all of them."
msgstr "等你把它们都备齐了再来告诉我。"

msgid "Do not lose your pride as a descendant of the wind and shadow.  "
msgstr "别丢掉你作为风与影后裔的骄傲。"

msgid "To learn the ultimate rogue skilll, you need 5 [SpellStone Powder]."
msgstr "要学刺客终极技能，你需要 5 份[法术石粉末]。"

msgid "Master, all the items needed to learn the rogue final skill has been collected. Let`s hurry back to [Secret Proxy] Clarence."
msgstr "师父，学刺客最终技能所需的道具都集齐了。咱们快回[密探]克拉伦斯那儿去。"

msgid "This is the final secret technique, Dark Pursuer and Bloody Beast. Your ability will be a hope to us rogues."
msgstr "这就是最终秘术——暗黑追猎者与血色猛兽。你的能力将是我们刺客的希望。"

msgid "Master, according to rumors the [Archmage] is teaching the ultimate skill to those mages who have reached the apex as a mage. Go for it. "
msgstr "师父，据传[大法师]正在向那些已臻法师巅峰的法师传授终极技能。去争取吧。"

msgid "Magic is the greatest ability created by man. You are well qualified to employ the ultimate magic. Is it time for another archmage to come on board..."
msgstr "魔法是人类创造出的最伟大的能力。你完全有资格施展终极魔法。又一位大法师即将登场了吗……"

msgid "To complete the ultimate mage spell, you will need 5 [SpellStone Powder]. Are you ready for this?"
msgstr "要练成法师终极咒文，你需要 5 份[法术石粉末]。你准备好了吗？"

msgid "Come back when you are equipped with all of them."
msgstr "你把它们都备齐了再来。"

msgid "Even if you do master the magic, it`s up to you whether you practice it or not! Why are you faltering?"
msgstr "就算你掌握了魔法，练不练还得看你自己！你在犹豫什么？"

msgid "To complete the ultimate mage spell, you need 5 [SpellStone Powder]."
msgstr "要练成法师终极咒文，你需要 5 份[法术石粉末]。"

msgid "Master, all the items needed to complete ultimate magic employed by archmages have been acquired. Let`s hurry back to [Archmage] Drake."
msgstr "师父，练成大法师所用终极魔法所需的道具都弄到了。咱们快回[大法师]德雷克那儿去。"

msgid "You now possess ultimate magic. With two different magic for each element, your powers will be incomparable and unprecedented. You have nothing more to wish for as a mage."
msgstr "你如今掌握了终极魔法。每个元素各有两种不同魔法，你的力量将前所未有、无可匹敌。作为一名法师，你已别无所求。"

msgid "Master, according to rumors [Priest] Minerva is teaching the ultimate skill to those priests who have reached the pinnacle as a priest . Go for it. "
msgstr "师父，据传[牧师]密涅瓦正在向那些已臻牧师巅峰的牧师传授终极技能。去争取吧。"

msgid "Priests save the world in the name of the gods. You are qualified to undergo the final training of the priesthood. In the final training the gods will confer the greatest ability available to a priest upon you.   "
msgstr "牧师以神之名拯救世界。你有资格接受牧师的最终修行。在最终修行中，神将把牧师所能拥有的最伟大能力赐予你。"

msgid "To train the ultimate divine power, you will need 5 [SpellStone Powder]. Are you ready for this?"
msgstr "要修炼终极神力，你需要 5 份[法术石粉末]。你准备好了吗？"

msgid "Let me know when you are equipped all of the elements needed to be bestowed with the ability of the gods."
msgstr "等你把被赐予神之能力所需的所有元素都备齐了，再来告诉我。"

msgid "Even if you do not undergo the final training, you must not neglect the duty of the priesthood.  "
msgstr "就算你不接受最终修行，也绝不能荒废牧师的职责。"

msgid "To receive the ultimate divine power, you need 5 [SpellStone Powder]."
msgstr "要获得终极神力，你需要 5 份[法术石粉末]。"

msgid "Master, you have collected all the items needed to be bestowed with the ability of the gods. Let`s hurry back to [Priest] Minerva.  "
msgstr "师父，被赐予神之能力所需的道具你都收集齐了。咱们快回[牧师]密涅瓦那儿去。"

msgid "The gods have heeded your will. Please continue to work to save the world. "
msgstr "神已垂听你的心愿。请继续努力拯救世界。"

msgid "Master, wonder what`s going on with the food rationing. [Sentinel] Patrick should know about it. Go ask him."
msgstr "师父，不知粮食配给是怎么回事。[哨兵]帕特里克应该知道。去问问他。"

msgid "Moradon is in my hands. What do you want?"
msgstr "莫拉登在我手中。你想要什么？"

msgid "Wheat bread, Moradon`s special local product, has killer taste. But since not too long ago, Gavolts raided the harvested mill and as a result, the food supply is running low and the number of citizens suffering from malnutrition rising. Can you wipe those monsters out and help the farmers of Moradon? "
msgstr "全麦面包是莫拉登的特产，味道绝了。可不久前，加沃尔特袭击了收割后的磨坊，结果粮食供应告急，营养不良的百姓越来越多。你能把那些怪物清掉，帮帮莫拉登的农民吗？"

msgid "Thanks. If you do this for me, I`ll buy drinks."
msgstr "谢谢。你帮了我，我请你喝酒。"

msgid "That`s too bad. I`ll ask someone else."
msgstr "那太遗憾了。我找别人吧。"

msgid "In order for the farmers to be relieved, at least five of them may have to be caught."
msgstr "要让农民们安心，至少得抓住五只。"

msgid "Master, you`ve done a decent job at wiping out Gavolts. Go back to [Sentinel] Patrick ."
msgstr "师父，你清加沃尔特干得漂亮。回[哨兵]帕特里克那儿去吧。"

msgid "Good work. The wheat supply has been normalized again. Let`s indulge in plenty of bread and wine tonight."
msgstr "干得好。小麦供应又恢复正常了。今晚咱们多吃面包多喝酒，好好犒劳一下。"

msgid "For the protection of Moradon... What did you want to say to me?"
msgstr "为了守护莫拉登……你想跟我说什么？"

msgid "Do you know of monsters called Bultures? They belong to the Bulcan species, but 3 times as large. Even the most accomplished warriors are rendered helpless in front of them, but they should be no match for you. Their numbers have increased markedly lately. Nothing trumps Bultures in the Moradon monster food chain so we can`t just sit by the sidelines. Can you please hunt them and rein them in?"
msgstr "你听说过一种叫「大秃鹫」的怪物吗？它们属于布坎一族，个头却是三倍大。再厉害的战士在它们面前也无可奈何，可你应该不是它们的对手。它们近来数量大增。在莫拉登怪物的食物链里，大秃鹫位居顶端，我们不能坐视不管。你能去猎杀它们、把它们镇住吗？"

msgid "You never let me down. "
msgstr "你从不让我失望。"

msgid "You don`t look too well. Come back when you`re feeling better."
msgstr "你脸色不太好。等你好点了再来。"

msgid "I commend you for accepting my request but you should have kept your word."
msgstr "你肯接我的请求，我赞赏，但你本该信守承诺。"

msgid "Wow, you`re incredible, Master, getting rid of so many of these giant monsters. Let`s hurry back to [Sentinel] Patrick and brag."
msgstr "哇，师父，你太了不起了，干掉了这么多大怪物。咱们快回[哨兵]帕特里克那儿去报功吧。"

msgid "You succeeded again? Amazing!"
msgstr "你又成功了？了不起！"

msgid "You`ve arrived again without fail. Bulcan-type monsters are really tenacious. The giant Bultures seem to be the most powerful of them all, but that`s not true. Across the creek outside of Moradon in the farthest outskirts dwell human-sized Silans. They are normal  sized, but their muscle strength and physical power are incomparable since they primarily feed on underground iron bars. With their numbers continuously escalating, we need to wipe them out for the safety of the residents. Those shoddy mercenaries were no match for them. That is why I`m asking you."
msgstr "你又准时来了。布坎一类的怪物真难缠。巨型大秃鹫看似最强，其实不然。在莫拉登最远郊外、小溪对岸，住着人形大小的西兰。它们个头正常，可因为主要以地下的铁条为食，肌肉力量和体魄都无可匹敌。它们数量不断增多，为了居民的安全，我们必须把它们清掉。那些蹩脚佣兵根本不是它们的对手。所以我才来找你。"

msgid "It should be a boon to your ability enhancement. Thank you."
msgstr "这对你提升本事应该大有裨益。谢谢。"

msgid "Maybe Silans are still too dangerous for you. Come back after you`ve enhanced your power."
msgstr "西兰对你来说也许还是太危险。等你实力提升了再来。"

msgid "Listen, it`s nothing novel. Did it slip your mind? Get at least 10 Silans, right?"
msgstr "听着，这不是什么新鲜事。你忘了？至少干掉 10 只西兰，对吧？"

msgid "Master, you`ve caught all 5 Silans. Your ability is growing everyday. Hurry back to [Sentinel] Patrick."
msgstr "师父，5 只西兰你都抓了。你的本事天天见长。快回[哨兵]帕特里克那儿去。"

msgid "I knew you`d be able to pull it off this time as well. You`ll soon catch up to me."
msgstr "我就知道你这次也能搞定。你很快就要追上我了。"

msgid "I`m Warrior Master Skaki. Do you have anything to say to me?"
msgstr "我是战士大师斯卡基。你有什么要跟我说的吗？"

msgid "Why did you come to me?"
msgstr "你为什么来找我？"

msgid "The power of evil in the Adonis continent is gaining stock. What did you want?"
msgstr "阿多尼斯大陆上的邪恶势力正在抬头。你想要什么？"

msgid "Master, have you heard of a monster called the werewolf?"
msgstr "师父，你听说过一种叫狼人的怪物吗？"

msgid "They`re nocturnal but I heard they grew increasingly violent of late."
msgstr "它们是夜行动物，可我听说近来它们越来越凶暴了。"

msgid "You know who to go see about this time as well, don`t you?"
msgstr "这回事该去找谁，你心里有数吧？"

msgid "Jeez, [Sentinel] Patrick`s just the person who`d be in the know on something like this, right?"
msgstr "哎呀，这种事[哨兵]帕特里克不正好最清楚嘛，对吧？"

msgid "Moradon`s Guardian, no still just Sentinel Patrick. What is it? "
msgstr "莫拉登的守护者，不，眼下还是哨兵帕特里克。什么事？"

msgid "You appear just in time like an apparition. I don`t know if you`ve heard but the werewolves are funning rampant recently. They`re powerful enough that not many mercenaries in Moradon can take them down.  Maybe they`re no match for you, either. And what`s more, their habitat is teeming with all kinds of fierce monsters. You still want to have a go at them?"
msgstr "你来得真及时，跟凭空冒出来似的。不知你听说没有，近来狼人猖獗。它们很强，莫拉登没几个佣兵能拿下它们。对你来说大概也不好对付。更何况它们的栖息地还到处是各种凶猛的怪物。你还想去试试吗？"

msgid "You still want to have a go at them? Seriously?"
msgstr "你还想去试试？认真的？"

msgid "I`m telling you this because I`m worried for your safety. Just come back whenever you feel endangered."
msgstr "我跟你说这些，是担心你的安全。一旦觉得有危险，随时回来。"

msgid "Even you`re no match for them this time. It might be a wise decision..."
msgstr "这次连你都不是它们的对手。那或许是个明智的决定……"

msgid "Your resolve was commendable but looks like you failed to reduce the number of werewolves."
msgstr "你的决心值得称赞，但看样子你没能减少狼人的数量。"

msgid "Incredible, Master. Werewolves are one of the strongest monsters in Moradon. I bet [Sentinel] Patrick will be pleasantly surprised as well. "
msgstr "了不起，师父。狼人是莫拉登最强的怪物之一。我打赌[哨兵]帕特里克也会又惊又喜。"

msgid "You`re amazing. I would like to express my admiration as a fellow guard. I`m being totally sincere."
msgstr "你真了不起。身为同行卫兵，我想表达我的敬佩。我说的句句真心。"

msgid "This is a token of my gratitude. I think you`re ready to venture out to a bigger world. Thanks for everything. (He may have already surpassed me...)"
msgstr "这是我的一点心意。我觉得你已经可以去闯荡更大的世界了。多谢你做的一切。（他恐怕已经超过我了……）"

msgid "Information is key. We do know that there's a strange movement in El Morad, but we need you to recover the Classified Document from the spy."
msgstr "情报至上。我们确实知道艾莫拉德那边有些奇怪动向，但需要你从密探那儿夺回机密文件。"

msgid "Information is key. We do know that there's a strange movement in Karus, but we need you to recover the Classified Document from the spy."
msgstr "情报至上。我们确实知道卡鲁斯那边有些奇怪动向，但需要你从密探那儿夺回机密文件。"

msgid "This is a guard post, near the national borders. Border disputes occur regularly, so the warriors here are always prepped and ready."
msgstr "这是一处靠近国境的哨所。边境冲突时有发生，所以这里的战士时刻整装待命。"

msgid "Are you kidding me? Here's where the El Moradian Knights are  dispatched from."
msgstr "你在逗我吗？艾莫拉德骑士就是从这里派遣出去的。"

msgid "The enemies are still alive. "
msgstr "敌人还没死绝。"

msgid "Master! If it ends like this, then yes, the warriors under our feet may sleep in peace."
msgstr "师父！要是这样就结束了，那我们脚下的战士们总算可以安息了。"

msgid "The Training Stone still has some strength left in it."
msgstr "训练石还有些力量。"

msgid "Only priests possessing the holy healing skill above 30 can learn holy water production. "
msgstr "只有掌握 30 级以上神圣治疗技能的牧师，才能学习圣水制作。"

msgid "What kind of holy water do you wish to obtain?"
msgstr "你想获得哪种圣水？"

msgid "Master! Let`s go see Grand Priest Helena to learn holy water production~"
msgstr "师父！咱们去找大祭司海伦娜学习圣水制作吧~"

msgid "Are you ready to learn holy water production?"
msgstr "你准备好学习圣水制作了吗？"

msgid "You have exceeded the weight limit. You cannot produce holy water."
msgstr "你超过了负重上限。无法制作圣水。"

msgid "You don`t have enough holy water."
msgstr "你的圣水不够。"

msgid "You don`t have enough prayers."
msgstr "你的祈祷不够。"

msgid "If you learn about the upgrade for strengthening weapon from Blacksmith Hepa, he will give you a weapon suitable for your job as a reward."
msgstr "你从铁匠赫帕那里了解到强化武器的方法后，他会赏你一件适合你职业的武器。"

msgid "Master Blacksmith Hepa is about to talk about the strengthening of weapon! Go there quickly!"
msgstr "铁匠大师赫帕正要讲武器强化的事！快去！"

msgid "The strengthening of weapon is a fundamental basis! First as practice, go up the stairs with me, purchase a dagger (+1) from the [Arms Dealer] Gargameth, and then purchase the [Upgrade Scroll (Low Class Item)] from the [Scroll Merchant] Charon and strengthen the dagger (+2)! And then I will exchange it with a weapon that is suitable for your job! "
msgstr "武器强化是基本功！首先拿它练手，跟我上楼梯，从[武器商]加萨梅斯那里买一把短剑(+1)，再从[卷轴商]卡戎那里买[强化卷轴（低级道具）]，把短剑强化到(+2)！然后我就给你换一把适合你职业的武器！"

msgid "I say this one more time. The dagger (+1) can be purchased from the [Arms Dealer] Gargameth and the [Upgrade Scroll (Low Class Item)] from the [Scroll Merchant] Charon."
msgstr "我再说一遍。短剑(+1)可以从[武器商]加萨梅斯那里买，[强化卷轴（低级道具）]从[卷轴商]卡戎那里买。"

msgid "Come on, go there and come back. Weapon is not acquired for free!"
msgstr "快去快回。武器可不是白给的！"

msgid "Well, you don't like it? This is a  good opportunity.... If you like it, come back to me"
msgstr "怎么，你不喜欢？这可是个好机会……你要是喜欢，就回来找我。"

msgid "Haven't you had the strengthening yet? You have to strengthen the dagger (+2) and come back!"
msgstr "你还没强化吗？你得把短剑强化到(+2)再回来！"

msgid "I succeeded in the refining! Hurry up and bring this to [Blacksmith] Hepa."
msgstr "我强化成功了！快把这个带给[铁匠]赫帕。"

msgid "You were successful, weren't you! Let me see. # Please select the weapon that you want to receive as a reward"
msgstr "你成功了，是吧！让我看看。# 请选择你想领取作为奖励的武器。"

msgid "This is the right of passage to Lunar Valley. You can go to the front by traversing here."
msgstr "这是通往月谷的必经之路。穿过这里就能到前面。"

msgid "The Imperial Palace Chef will give a reward for the Tyon meat he needs and receive the quest which entails delivering BBQ to the Lunar Gate Sentinel."
msgstr "御厨会为他所需的泰昂肉给予报酬，并接到把烧烤送到月门哨兵那里的任务。"

msgid "EXP are awarded for delivering BBQ to the Lunar Gate Sentinel as well as the Islante Woman Quest."
msgstr "把烧烤送到月门哨兵处，以及完成艾斯兰特女子任务，都能获得经验值。"

msgid "A large reward is awarded for delivering the Lunar Gate Sentinel`s ring to the Islante woman."
msgstr "把月门哨兵的戒指交给艾斯兰特女子，可获得丰厚奖励。"

msgid "Thank you for delivering the ring."
msgstr "谢谢你把戒指送来。"

msgid "There's a lull in the battle at the moment. You don't have to go in."
msgstr "眼下战斗暂时平息。你不必进去。"

msgid "Welcome.|You're here to reinforce the borders of Kalluga Valley, right?"
msgstr "欢迎。|你是来增援卡卢加峡谷边境的，对吧？"

msgid "Master!! There's trouble on the borders of Kalluga Valley, at the access point! Must be a big battle or something."
msgstr "师父！！卡卢加峡谷边境的通道口出事了！多半是一场大战什么的。"

msgid "Master, if you need  Middle Class Upgrade Scroll , then you should look for Osmond ^^"
msgstr "师父，你要是需要中级强化卷轴，就该去找奥斯蒙德 ^^"

msgid "A Middle Class Upgrade Scroll??? Ah~ I heard that it is the scroll that upgrades the level of middle class weapons... Do you need that?"
msgstr "中级强化卷轴？？啊~我听说那是用来给中级武器升级的卷轴……你需要那个？"

msgid "Hm~ I have kept it somewhere in the supply storage before. I think I will have to look for it.  Since it is one of the supplies, I can not give it to you without Rage's permission..."
msgstr "嗯~我之前把它收在补给仓库某个地方了。我得找找看。因为它是补给品之一，没有拉吉的许可我不能给你……"

msgid "Will you participate in National Defense Combat?"
msgstr "你要参加国境防御战吗？"

msgid "Master! There's trouble on the borders of Kalluga Valley, at the access point!  Must be a big battle or something."
msgstr "师父！卡卢加峡谷边境的通道口出事了！多半是一场大战什么的。"

msgid "If you want the Magic Scroll, you have to do something for me. See, I lost an Apple of Moradon, right? You get me a replacement, and I'll hand over the Magic Scroll. However, be sure to keep this a secret from Rage."
msgstr "你想要魔法卷轴，就得替我办件事。你看，我弄丢了一颗莫拉登苹果，对吧？你给我弄一颗来补上，我就把魔法卷轴交给你。不过，千万别让拉吉知道这事。"

msgid "Master, you have collected all the Apples of Moradon that Osmond requested. "
msgstr "师父，奥斯蒙德要的莫拉登苹果你都收集齐了。"

msgid "You must protect the Training Stone for 30 minutes of the battle.  You will gain EXP for participating in the National Defence Combat. You get 2 million EXP, a Red Box and a EXP scroll when you win... And just 1 million EXP when you lose."
msgstr "你必须在战斗中守护训练石 30 分钟。参加国境防御战可获得经验值。获胜时可得 200 万经验、一个红宝箱和一张经验卷轴……失败时只得 100 万经验。"

msgid "Please bring them to me before Rage finds out.. Sob."
msgstr "趁拉吉还没发现，快把它们带给我……呜呜。"

msgid "Phew ~ You have brought them.. I thought you were never coming back."
msgstr "呼~你把它们带来了……我还以为你不回来了。"

msgid "Are you ready to sacrifice your life for your nation?|Lead the party to that battlefield and return with 100 lives of our enemy.  "
msgstr "你准备好为国捐躯了吗？|带队杀向那片战场，带着 100 条敌人的性命回来。"

msgid "Master~  The war in Ronark Land doesn't seem to be going so well due to the knights of El Morad."
msgstr "师父~ 罗纳克之地的战况因为艾莫拉德的骑士似乎不太顺利。"

msgid "Master. There's trouble on the borders of Kalluga Valley, at the access point!  Must be a big battle or something."
msgstr "师父。卡卢加峡谷边境的通道口出事了！多半是一场大战什么的。"

msgid "It's tricky, because the border line is right *in* the valley, so the fighting never stops.  Currently, the whole place is blocked-up with a huge national Training Stone, but it's very limited. So they're recruiting knights here who can protect the Training Stone when its power weakens periodically."
msgstr "麻烦就麻烦在国境线正好在峡谷*里面*，所以战斗从不停歇。眼下整个地方被一块巨大的国家级训练石封住了，可它的力量非常有限。所以他们在这儿招募骑士，好在训练石力量周期性减弱时守护它。"

msgid "You're not really suited to small battles like this. It'd be better to go somewhere like Lunar Valley, where there's more action."
msgstr "你不太适合这种小打小闹。不如去月谷那种打得更热闹的地方。"

msgid "You must protect the Training Stone for 30 minutes of the battle.  You will gain EXP for participating in the National Defence Combat. You get 7 million EXP, a Red Box and a EXP scroll when you win... And 3.5 million EXP and a EXP scroll when you lose."
msgstr "你必须在战斗中守护训练石 30 分钟。参加国境防御战可获得经验值。获胜时可得 700 万经验、一个红宝箱和一张经验卷轴……失败时可得 350 万经验和一张经验卷轴。"

msgid "This is too much for you to deal with. Comeback after you've had a bit more training."
msgstr "这你还应付不来。多修行一阵子再回来。"

msgid "Welcome.|You're here to reinforce the borders, right?"
msgstr "欢迎。|你是来增援边境的，对吧？"

msgid "Have you killed all 100?|I will give you a reward in return for those lives."
msgstr "100 个都杀完了吗？|我会用这些性命换给你一份报酬。"

msgid "You need Pathos' Glove Certificate to receive Patho's Glove. You can purchase Pathos' Glove Certificate from Power Up Store"
msgstr "要领到悲情手套，你需要悲情手套凭证。你可以在充值商店购买悲情手套凭证。"

msgid "Attack Aurora..Glove that increase wrath of Pathos...That is one of Pathos' Glove with Attack aurora. 2% attack power increase with a choice of additional attack power option."
msgstr "攻击曙光……点燃悲情之怒的手套……这是带攻击曙光的悲情手套之一。攻击力提升 2%，并可附加一条攻击力属性。"

msgid "Defense Aurora..Glove with desire to overcome Pathos' weakness..That is one of Pathos' Glove with Defense Aurora. +10 Defense power increase with a choice of additional defense power option."
msgstr "防御曙光……怀着克服悲情之弱心愿的手套……这是带防御曙光的悲情手套之一。防御力提升 10 点，并可附加一条防御力属性。"

msgid "Thank you. Enjoy your adventure"
msgstr "谢谢。祝你冒险愉快。"

msgid "Attack Aurora...You chose 3% attack damage increse when attacking Warrior class only option. Would you like to exchange?"
msgstr "攻击曙光……你选了「仅攻击战士职业时伤害提升 3%」属性。要兑换吗？"

msgid "Attack Aurora...You chose 3% attack damage increse when attacking Rogue class only option. Would you like to exchange?"
msgstr "攻击曙光……你选了「仅攻击刺客职业时伤害提升 3%」属性。要兑换吗？"

msgid "Attack Aurora...You chose 3% attack damage increse when attacking Magician class only option. Would you like to exchange?"
msgstr "攻击曙光……你选了「仅攻击法师职业时伤害提升 3%」属性。要兑换吗？"

msgid "Attack Aurora...You chose 3% attack damage increse when attacking Priest class only option. Would you like to exchange?"
msgstr "攻击曙光……你选了「仅攻击牧师职业时伤害提升 3%」属性。要兑换吗？"

msgid "Defense Aurora..You chose 3% defense increase when getting attacked by a Warrior class only option. Would you like to exchange?"
msgstr "防御曙光……你选了「仅被战士职业攻击时防御提升 3%」属性。要兑换吗？"

msgid "Defense Aurora..You chose 3% defense increase when getting attacked by a Rogue class only option. Would you like to exchange?"
msgstr "防御曙光……你选了「仅被刺客职业攻击时防御提升 3%」属性。要兑换吗？"

msgid "Defense Aurora..You chose 3% defense increase when getting attacked by a Magician class only option. Would you like to exchange?"
msgstr "防御曙光……你选了「仅被法师职业攻击时防御提升 3%」属性。要兑换吗？"

msgid "Defense Aurora..You chose 3% defense increase when getting attacked by a Priest class only option. Would you like to exchange?"
msgstr "防御曙光……你选了「仅被牧师职业攻击时防御提升 3%」属性。要兑换吗？"

msgid "Hello, Master! How was it today?"
msgstr "你好，师父！今天过得怎么样？"

msgid "What brings you here? This is the official residence of  <topclanname> Knight Squad, the highest squad. I'm Roctar, the Manager."
msgstr "什么风把你吹来了？这里是最高小队 <topclanname> 骑士团的官邸。我是管理员罗克塔。"

msgid "This is the official residence that is open to only the highest Knight squad in Karus. The King granted this place as a reward for the labor of the Knight Squad with the highest status in Karus. Owning the place is an honor as the Clan which represents our Nation. It's a special place that only first-class clans are allowed to enter."
msgstr "这是只对卡鲁斯最高骑士团开放的官邸。国王把此地赐予卡鲁斯地位最高的骑士团，作为对他们辛劳的奖赏。拥有此地，是作为代表我国的公会的一份荣誉。这是只有一等公会才能进入的特别场所。"

msgid "What brings you here? This is the official residence of  <topclanname> Knight Squad, the highest squad. I'm Elliot, the Manager."
msgstr "什么风把你吹来了？这里是最高小队 <topclanname> 骑士团的官邸。我是管理员埃利奥特。"

msgid "This is the official residence that is open to only the highest Knight squad in El Morad. The King granted this place as a reward for the labor of the Knight Squad with the highest status in Karus. Owning the place is an honor as the Clan which represents our Nation. 1À§ Å¬·£¸¸ÀÌ ÀÔÀåÀÌ Çã¶ôµÈ ¾ÆÁÖ Æ¯º°ÇÑ °÷ÀÌÁÒ"
msgstr "这是只对艾莫拉德最高骑士团开放的官邸。国王把此地赐予卡鲁斯地位最高的骑士团，作为对他们辛劳的奖赏。拥有此地，是作为代表我国的公会的一份荣誉。这是只有排名第一的公会才能进入的非常特别的地方。"

msgid "This is the official residence that is open only to  <topclanname>, the highest Knight squad in Karus. The King granted this place as a reward for the labor of the Knight Squad with the highest status in Karus. Owning the place is an honor as a Clan which represents our Nation. Would you like to enter?"
msgstr "这是只对卡鲁斯最高骑士团 <topclanname> 开放的官邸。国王把此地赐予卡鲁斯地位最高的骑士团，作为对他们辛劳的奖赏。拥有此地，是作为代表我国的公会的一份荣誉。你想进去吗？"

msgid "This is the official residence that is open only to  <topclanname>, the highest Knight squad in El Morad. The King granted this place as a reward for the labor of the Knight Squad with the highest status in Karus. Owning the place is an honor as the Clan which represents our Nation. Would you like to enter?"
msgstr "这是只对艾莫拉德最高骑士团 <topclanname> 开放的官邸。国王把此地赐予卡鲁斯地位最高的骑士团，作为对他们辛劳的奖赏。拥有此地，是作为代表我国的公会的一份荣誉。你想进去吗？"

msgid "You already received weapons and armors today. You'd better visit tomorrow to get them."
msgstr "你今天已经领过武器和防具了。明天再来领吧。"

msgid "Welcome. How have you been? Well, to see you come to me today, you may heard of a news... haha-"
msgstr "欢迎。近来可好？看你今天来找我，想必是听说了什么消息……哈哈——"

msgid "This time, we'll lend you armor and a weapon especially for you. Hmm~ you <selfname> are a warrior... (looking at the list... )  Glaive and  Chitin Armor Set are ready for you. Would you like to receive it?"
msgstr "这一次，我们特别为你出借防具和武器。嗯~你 <selfname> 是战士……（翻看着清单……）巨刃和甲壳套装已经为你备好了。你要领吗？"

msgid "This time, we'll lend you armor and a weapon especially for you. Hmm~ you <selfname> are Rogue... (looking at the list... )  Mirage Dagger,  Chitin Bow and  Chitin Armor Set are ready for you. Would you like to receive it?"
msgstr "这一次，我们特别为你出借防具和武器。嗯~你 <selfname> 是刺客……（翻看着清单……）幻影匕首、甲壳弓和甲壳套装已经为你备好了。你要领吗？"

msgid "This time, we'll lend you armor and a weapon especially for you. Hmm~ you <selfname> are a Wizard... (looking at the list... )  Elemental Staff and  Crimson Armor Set are ready. Would you like to rec"
msgstr "这一次，我们特别为你出借防具和武器。嗯~你 <selfname> 是法师……（翻看着清单……）元素法杖和赤红套装已经备好了。你要领吗？"

msgid "This time, we'll lend you armor and a weapon especially for you. Hmm~ you <selfname> are a Wizard... (looking at the list... )  Elemental Staff and  Crimson Armor Set are ready. Would you like to receive it?"
msgstr "这一次，我们特别为你出借防具和武器。嗯~你 <selfname> 是法师……（翻看着清单……）元素法杖和赤红套装已经备好了。你要领吗？"

msgid "This time, we'll lend you armor and a weapon especially for you. Hmm~ you <selfname> are warrior... (looking at the list... )  Raptor and  Chitin Shell Armor Set are ready for you. Would you like to receive it?"
msgstr "这一次，我们特别为你出借防具和武器。嗯~你 <selfname> 是战士……（翻看着清单……）迅猛斧和甲壳壳套装已经为你备好了。你要领吗？"

msgid "This time, we'll lend you armor and a weapon especially for you. Hmm~ you <selfname> are Rogue... (looking at the list... )  Shard,  Iron Bow and  Chitin Shell Armor Set are ready for you. Would you like to receive it?"
msgstr "这一次，我们特别为你出借防具和武器。嗯~你 <selfname> 是刺客……（翻看着清单……）裂片、铁弓和甲壳壳套装已经为你备好了。你要领吗？"

msgid "This time, we'll lend you armor and a weapon especially for you. Hmm~ you <selfname> are a Wizard... (looking at the list... )  Elixir Staff and  Complete Armor Set are ready for you. Would you like to receive it?"
msgstr "这一次，我们特别为你出借防具和武器。嗯~你 <selfname> 是法师……（翻看着清单……）灵药法杖和全套甲套装已经为你备好了。你要领吗？"

msgid "This time, we'll lend you armor and a weapon especially for you. Hmm~ you <selfname> are a Priest... (looking at the list... )  Lycaon Mace,  Defender of the Lord and  Chitin Shell Armor Set are ready for you. Would you like to receive it?"
msgstr "这一次，我们特别为你出借防具和武器。嗯~你 <selfname> 是牧师……（翻看着清单……）狼形战锤、主君守护者和甲壳壳套装已经为你备好了。你要领吗？"

msgid "Only those of level 47 or higher can participate in this event. Please, visit later after you train yourself more."
msgstr "只有 47 级以上才能参加本次活动。请先多修行一阵子，稍后再来。"

msgid "Insufficient inventory space. To receive the item, you should have at least 6 inventory slots."
msgstr "背包空间不足。要领到此道具，你至少需要 6 个背包格。"

msgid "Insufficient inventory space. To receive the item, you should have at least 8 inventory slots."
msgstr "背包空间不足。要领到此道具，你至少需要 8 个背包格。"

msgid "Insufficient inventory space. To receive the item, you should have at least 7 inventory slots."
msgstr "背包空间不足。要领到此道具，你至少需要 7 个背包格。"

msgid "Hello...  I'm Slay, I manage the Graveyard. I don't know how many years have passed since I started to watch over this graveyard. Ah- Could you help me?"
msgstr "你好……我叫斯雷，负责看管这片墓地。我开始守护这座墓地以来，不知过了多少年了。啊——你能帮帮我吗？"

msgid "What brings you here? Well, excuse me, I have something to do... and you seem pretty busy, too... "
msgstr "什么风把你吹来了？这个，不好意思，我有点事要忙……你看起来也挺忙的……"

msgid "I don't know since when, but  Rotten Eyes have appeared around the tomb, and I can't drive them out by myself. They're Zombie Monsters like Undyings, and the problem is they make a terrible mess everywhere, makes the Tomb look awful. Could you try and stop them from coming in and ruining the place?"
msgstr "不知从什么时候起，坟墓周围出现了腐眼，我一个人赶不走它们。它们是和亡灵一样的僵尸怪物，问题是它们到处弄得一团糟，把坟墓弄得难看极了。你能不能想办法阻止它们进来糟蹋这个地方？"

msgid "You must save this Tomb no matter what happens. Please, do your best."
msgstr "无论发生什么，你都必须守护这座坟墓。请尽力而为。"

msgid "Meeting you was possibly the best bit of luck I've ever had! Thank you very much. Here's a little something for ya. This is what I found while I've managed this place. This will be quite useful."
msgstr "遇见你，大概是我这辈子走的最好的运！太感谢了。这是一点小意思，给你。这是我看管这地方时捡到的。应该能派上大用场。"

msgid "What brings you here?"
msgstr "什么风把你吹来了？"

msgid "Hmm... we seem to have a special guest in the Tomb. It's certainly an uninvited Guest -  people call it Vatalion, and it's stronger than both Zombies and Undyings. I can't do anything with them here. Could you help me?"
msgstr "嗯……坟墓里好像来了位特殊客人。那肯定是位不速之客——人们叫它瓦塔里昂，它比僵尸和亡灵都强。它在这儿我什么也做不了。你能帮帮我吗？"

msgid "Well, nothing... I will try to talk to you later as you seem very busy now."
msgstr "嗯，没什么……看你现在很忙，我回头再跟你说吧。"

msgid "God, what am I supposed to do?"
msgstr "老天，我该怎么办？"

msgid "What - How - You drove out the Vatalions... I'll never forget this. This is something I dug-up near the Tomb a few days ago. Doesn't look like ordinary stuff. Please, take it as a token of my appreciation."
msgstr "什么——怎么会——你把瓦塔里昂赶跑了……我永远不会忘记这份恩情。这是我前几天在坟墓附近挖到的东西。看着不像寻常物件。请收下，聊表谢意。"

msgid "You'll get a Weapon out of this if you do [Sentinel] Zalk this favor."
msgstr "你帮[哨兵]扎尔克这个忙，就能从他那儿得到一件武器。"

msgid "Frankly we aren`t very interested in goblins but we are interested in the armor they`re wearing.| Their technique is terrible but they use ace ingredients. If we just touch it up a little, it becomes a great body armor in no time.| If you bring me Goblin Armor I`ll ask my friends in the Blacksmiths Guild to repair your armor. If you have sub par armor, a new goblin armor wouldn`t hurt."
msgstr "说实话我们对哥布林没什么兴趣，可对它们穿的甲胄很感兴趣。|它们的手艺蹩脚，用的却是上等材料。只要我们稍加打磨，转眼就能变成很棒的甲胄。|你要是把哥布林盔甲带给我，我就请铁匠公会的朋友帮你修补盔甲。要是你的盔甲不怎么样，换件新的哥布林盔甲也不亏。"

msgid "Taking your figure and that of the goblins into account, I`ll need at least 5 pieces of armor of the same body part to make body armor of the same. Will you go find them?"
msgstr "考虑到你的身材和哥布林的身材，我至少需要 5 件同一部位的盔甲，才能做出一件同样部位的甲胄。你愿意去找吗？"

msgid "Hey! I need 5 Goblin Armor tops to make Goblin Body Armor top. Do I need to have you stand next to each other and size you two up? "
msgstr "喂！我需要 5 件哥布林盔甲上衣，才能做一件哥布林甲胄上衣。要不要把你们俩拉到一块儿，让我比一比大小？"

msgid "Still, my pals at the guild are going to repair your armor. You should give them a small fee. They have to make ends meet, too. They will charge 100,000 Noahs to make one Goblin Body Armor top."
msgstr "不过，公会里的朋友们会帮你修补盔甲。你该给他们一点工钱。他们也得糊口。做一件哥布林甲胄上衣要收你 10 万诺亚。"

msgid "Here. Here`s a Goblin Body Armor just for you. Doesn`t it look great? "
msgstr "给。这是专门为你做的一件哥布林甲胄。看着不错吧？"

msgid "Hey! I need 5 Goblin Armor bottoms to make Goblin Body Armor bottom. Do I need to have you stand next to each other and size you two up? "
msgstr "喂！我需要 5 件哥布林盔甲下装，才能做一件哥布林甲胄下装。要不要把你们俩拉到一块儿，让我比一比大小？"

msgid "Still, my pals at the guild are going to repair your armor. You should give them a small fee. They have to make ends meet, too. They will charge 80,000 Noahs to make one Goblin Body Armor top."
msgstr "不过，公会里的朋友们会帮你修补盔甲。你该给他们一点工钱。他们也得糊口。做一件哥布林甲胄上衣要收你 8 万诺亚。"

msgid "Hey! I need 5 Goblin Armor helmets to make Goblin Body Armor helmet. Do I need to have you stand next to each other and size you two up? "
msgstr "喂！我需要 5 件哥布林盔甲头盔，才能做一件哥布林甲胄头盔。要不要把你们俩拉到一块儿，让我比一比大小？"

msgid "Still, my pals at the guild are going to repair your armor. You should give them a small fee. They have to make ends meet, too. They will charge 50,000 Noahs to make one Goblin Body Armor helmet."
msgstr "不过，公会里的朋友们会帮你修补盔甲。你该给他们一点工钱。他们也得糊口。做一件哥布林甲胄头盔要收你 5 万诺亚。"

msgid "Here. Here`s a Goblin Body Armor just for you. Doesn`t it look great?  "
msgstr "给。这是专门为你做的一件哥布林甲胄。看着不错吧？"

msgid "Hey! I need 5 Goblin Armor gauntlets to make Goblin Body Armor gauntlet. Do I need to have you stand next to each other and size you two up? "
msgstr "喂！我需要 5 件哥布林盔甲护手，才能做一件哥布林甲胄护手。要不要把你们俩拉到一块儿，让我比一比大小？"

msgid "Still, my pals at the guild are going to repair your armor. You should give them a small fee. They have to make ends meet, too. They will charge 40,000 Noahs to make one Goblin Body Armor gauntlet."
msgstr "不过，公会里的朋友们会帮你修补盔甲。你该给他们一点工钱。他们也得糊口。做一件哥布林甲胄护手要收你 4 万诺亚。"

msgid "Hey! I need 5 Goblin Armor gauntlets to make Goblin Body Armor boots. Do I need to have you stand next to each other and size you two up? "
msgstr "喂！我需要 5 件哥布林盔甲护手，才能做一双哥布林甲胄靴子。要不要把你们俩拉到一块儿，让我比一比大小？"

msgid "Still, my pals at the guild are going to repair your armor. You should give them a small fee. They have to make ends meet, too. They will charge 30,000 Noahs to make one pair of Goblin Body Armor boots."
msgstr "不过，公会里的朋友们会帮你修补盔甲。你该给他们一点工钱。他们也得糊口。做一双哥布林甲胄靴子要收你 3 万诺亚。"

msgid "[Blacksmith Heppa] will make you Goblin Body Armor top for 5 Goblin Armor top and 100,000 Noahs. "
msgstr "[铁匠赫帕]会用 5 件哥布林盔甲上衣和 10 万诺亚，给你做一件哥布林甲胄上衣。"

msgid "[Blacksmith Heppa] will make you Goblin Body Armor bottom for 5 Goblin Armor bottom and 80,000 Noahs. "
msgstr "[铁匠赫帕]会用 5 件哥布林盔甲下装和 8 万诺亚，给你做一件哥布林甲胄下装。"

msgid "[Blacksmith Heppa] will make you Goblin Body Armor helmet for 5 Goblin Armor helmet and 50,000 Noahs. "
msgstr "[铁匠赫帕]会用 5 件哥布林盔甲头盔和 5 万诺亚，给你做一件哥布林甲胄头盔。"

msgid "[Blacksmith Heppa] will make you Goblin Body Armor gauntlet for 5 Goblin Armor gauntlet and 40,000 Noahs. "
msgstr "[铁匠赫帕]会用 5 件哥布林盔甲护手和 4 万诺亚，给你做一件哥布林甲胄护手。"

msgid "[Blacksmith Heppa] will make you Goblin Body Armor boots for 5 Goblin Armor boots and 30,000 Noahs. "
msgstr "[铁匠赫帕]会用 5 件哥布林盔甲靴子和 3 万诺亚，给你做一双哥布林甲胄靴子。"

msgid "Master!  <font color=@#990000@>[Mercenary Quartermaster] Mr. Osmund</font> is looking for you, Master, for the preparation of war materials"
msgstr "师父！<font color=@#990000@>[军需官]奥斯蒙德先生</font>在找你，师父，是为了筹备军需。"

msgid "Note that [Report User] is excluded from National Defense Combat."
msgstr "请注意，[举报用户]不得参加国境防御战。"

msgid "Uh oh...Problem! Big problem! Where can I get hold of some Blood of Glyptodont?"
msgstr "哎呀……出事了！出大事了！我上哪儿去弄雕齿兽之血啊？"

msgid "Master, I hear [Archmage] Drake is looking for people to assign a mission."
msgstr "师父，我听说[大法师]德雷克在找人派发任务。"

msgid "Master, you also need the Stamp of Intelligence to learn the 70v, 72Lv, 75Lv and 78Lv skills. [Priest] Minerva will tell you about it."
msgstr "师父，要学 70 级、72 级、75 级和 78 级技能，你还需要智慧印记。[牧师]密涅瓦会告诉你详情。"

msgid "The border defending battle is held every day at 10 AM and 1, 3, 5 and 10 PM and 1 AM. And it is held additionally at 8 PM on Tuesday, Friday, Saturday and Sunday when there is no war. When the relevant time comes, the announcement for recruitment will be aired automatically so that application for participation can be made."
msgstr "边境防御战每天在上午 10 点、下午 1 点、3 点、5 点、10 点以及凌晨 1 点举行。此外，在没有战争的周二、周五、周六、周日晚 8 点加开一场。时间一到，招募公告会自动播报，届时即可报名参加。"

msgid " Master, now you can learn Absolute Power.  Let's look for [Archmage] Drake."
msgstr "师父，现在你可以学绝对之力了。咱们去找[大法师]德雷克吧。"

msgid "Master, I heard there`s a collectible item essential to high-level knights. I heard [Archmage] Drake knows about it."
msgstr "师父，我听说有一件高级骑士必备的收藏品。听说[大法师]德雷克知道。"

msgid "Master, do you know of Ssohn Magic? Archmage Drake is looking for someone to whom he can teach it."
msgstr "师父，你知道索恩魔法吗？大法师德雷克在找可以传授这门魔法的人。"

msgid "Master, [Archmage] Drake is giving an Impact Magic Scroll lecture. Let`s go check it out."
msgstr "师父，[大法师]德雷克要讲冲击魔法卷轴了。咱们去看看。"

msgid "Master, you need various objects to obtain the  Impact Magic Scroll. Let`s go find out the details from [Archmage] Drake."
msgstr "师父，要领到冲击魔法卷轴，你需要好几样东西。咱们去[大法师]德雷克那儿打听详情吧。"

msgid "Master, have you hear of a powerful attack magic called Impact Magic? Wouldn`t  [Archmage] Drake know about it?"
msgstr "师父，你听说过一种叫冲击魔法的强力攻击魔法吗？[大法师]德雷克应该知道吧？"

msgid "Tyons have disappeared to an extent, but they will multiply again as they have superior breeding ability."
msgstr "泰昂已经少了一些，可它们繁殖能力极强，还会再增多的。"

msgid "This year`s harvest will be ruined because of the Tyons. Wish someone would get rid of them for me. "
msgstr "今年的收成就要毁在泰昂手里了。真希望有人替我把它们除掉。"

msgid "I will award you handsomely if you eliminate the Tyons what infiltrated the farm and bring me their meat. I`m counting on you."
msgstr "你要是把窜进农场的泰昂消灭掉、把它们的肉带给我，我会重赏你。我全指望你了。"

msgid "Tyons are stock monsters around the farm. There will be plenty of them here. "
msgstr "泰昂是农场周围的常驻怪物。这附近会有很多。"

msgid "Not bad. Look outside. There`s already some of them lurking outside. but they will multiply again as they have superior breeding ability."
msgstr "不错。往外面看。外面已经潜伏着几只了。不过它们繁殖能力极强，还会再增多的。"

msgid "If you bring the Farm Manager Tyon meat, he will give you 1,000 Noahs in return."
msgstr "你把泰昂肉带给农场管理员，他会给你 1000 诺亚作为回报。"

msgid "Your passion is commendable, but save your strength. "
msgstr "你的热情值得称赞，不过还是省省力气吧。"

msgid "Are you still working on the thing I asked for??"
msgstr "我托你办的事你还在忙吗？？"

msgid "Ah~ thank you. I don't know how I could repay this... Ah, when I was leaving the Island of Fog, I found this ring.  It doesn't fit me or my boyfriend, so please take this."
msgstr "啊~谢谢。我真不知该怎么报答你……啊，我离开雾之岛时捡到了这枚戒指。我戴不合适，我男朋友戴也不合适，所以请你收下吧。"

msgid "There`s plenty of cooking ingredients but it`s not time to eat yet so wait."
msgstr "食材倒是够多，可还没到吃饭的时候，先等等。"

msgid "Don`t you think I should make a fabulous dish!? "
msgstr "你不觉得我该做一道大餐吗！？"

msgid "Master, it`s time for the Imperial Palace Chef to start cooking. Go see what he`s up to."
msgstr "师父，御厨该开始做饭了。去看看他在忙活什么。"

msgid "Oh, no. I`m going to make BBQ but I`m short on Tyon meat."
msgstr "哦，糟了。我要做烧烤，可泰昂肉不够。"

msgid "Can you bring me 2 slabs of Tyon meat from the nearby farm? I will make you great BBQ and a handsome reward in return. How about it? "
msgstr "你能从附近的农场给我弄两块泰昂肉来吗？我会给你做美味的烧烤，外加一份丰厚的报酬。怎么样？"

msgid "Master, you have collected all slabs of Tyon meat. Let`s go the Imperial Palace Chef. "
msgstr "师父，泰昂肉你都收集齐了。咱们去找御厨吧。"

msgid "Tyons live near the farm to the right of the castle. They`re a bit savage so be careful."
msgstr "泰昂住在城堡右边的农场附近。它们有点凶暴，小心点。"

msgid "Oh! You brought them? Here`s your reward. "
msgstr "哦！你带来了？这是你的报酬。"

msgid "Can I ask you one more favor?!"
msgstr "我能再拜托你一件事吗？！"

msgid "The Imperial Palace Chef told me he`d bring me BBQ today. Didn`t you run into him on the way?"
msgstr "御厨跟我说他今天会给我带烧烤来。你路上没碰到他吗？"

msgid "Thank you for bringing me the food..|Um, I`m sorry to ask you a favor but I was wondering if you can take this ring to my love. She`ll be somewhere near the Islante entrance. "
msgstr "谢谢你给我送饭来。|嗯，我不好意思再拜托你，可不知你能不能替我把这枚戒指交给我的心上人。她应该在艾斯兰特入口附近的某个地方。"

msgid "I`m sorry to ask you a favor but I`m hoping you, <selfname>, would do this for me. "
msgstr "不好意思再麻烦你，可我希望由你，<selfname>，来替我办这件事。"

msgid "Did you have something to day to me?"
msgstr "你有话要跟我说吗？"

msgid "I heard that my love has been banished to Lunar Gate and is residing there. If only I could see his face just once ..."
msgstr "我听说我的心上人被放逐到了月门，住在那儿。哪怕只见他一面也好……"

msgid "The Imperial Palace Chef  will give a reward for the Tyon meat he needs and receive the quest which entails delivering BBQ to the Lunar Gate Sentinel. "
msgstr "御厨会为他所需的泰昂肉给予报酬，并接到把烧烤送到月门哨兵那里的任务。"

msgid "Master, I hear Blacksmith Heppa developed a better body armor than the Body Armor of Destruction. Let`s go see what it is."
msgstr "师父，我听说铁匠赫帕做出了比毁灭甲胄更好的甲胄。咱们去看看是什么。"

msgid "Talisman of Talia are made from an ancient giant race but they were all looted in the War of Darkness and almost none are left. I heard recently that some Ungas produced them. Talisman of Talia are used to turn the Body Armor of Destruction into Talia Body Armor. Talia Body Armor possesses many traits but it cannot not be repaired yet. If you bring some Talisman of Talia I can try and make some for you. Want to give it a shot?"
msgstr "塔利亚护符是上古巨人族造的，可它们都在黑暗战争中被洗劫一空，几乎没剩下。我听说近来有一些温加造出了它们。塔利亚护符是用来把毁灭甲胄改造成塔利亚甲胄的。塔利亚甲胄具备许多特性，但目前还无法修理。你要是带些塔利亚护符来，我可以试着给你做几件。想试试吗？"

msgid "I`ll make it for you if you bring me 5 Talisman of Talia which can be obtained by hunting Ungas and the Body Armor of Destruction top and crystals. "
msgstr "你只要把猎杀温加获得的 5 枚塔利亚护符、毁灭甲胄上衣和水晶带来，我就给你做。"

msgid "You`re short on Talisman of Talia. Body Armor with holes won`t be any good. You need to collect 5."
msgstr "你的塔利亚护符不够。带窟窿的甲胄可不行。你得凑齐 5 枚。"

msgid "You`re short on Body Armor of Destruction tops. How do you expect me to make body armor with this. If you bring me Body Armor of Destruction ingredients I`ll make it for you. "
msgstr "你的毁灭甲胄上衣不够。就这点东西你让我怎么做甲胄？你把毁灭甲胄的材料带来，我就给你做。"

msgid "You`re short on crystals. They`re needed as an adhesive.  Without it, the defense ability will fast disappear."
msgstr "你的水晶不够。它们是用来做黏合剂的。没有它，防御能力很快就会流失。"

msgid "Here you go. Good work. I wanted to make this armor, too but I couldn`t get my hands on the ingredients. I should be the one thankful. Hahaha."
msgstr "给。干得漂亮。这件甲胄我也想做，可就是弄不到材料。该说谢谢的是我。哈哈哈。"

msgid "If you bring Blacksmith Heppa the Body Armor of Destruction top, 5 Talisman of Talia, and 1 crystal, he will make you Talia Body Armor endowed with one trait out of many. "
msgstr "你把毁灭甲胄上衣、5 枚塔利亚护符和 1 块水晶带给铁匠赫帕，他就会给你做一件附带众多特性之一的塔利亚甲胄。"

msgid "The thing?! What was it.. Ah~~~!!! The Special Chocolate! I... Sold it..."
msgstr "那个东西？！是什么来着……啊~~~！！！特制巧克力！我……把它卖了……"

msgid "  [Canyon Keeper] Skar  at Python Valley  said that he was going to pay double for the chocolate.  So I just sold it to him, haha~~"
msgstr "蟒蛇谷的[峡谷守护者]斯卡尔说他愿意出双倍价钱买巧克力。所以我就卖给他了，哈哈~~"

msgid "Did you lose your way??"
msgstr "你迷路了吗？？"

msgid "What, chocolate? That's what I bought, and you are telling me to give it to you, I'm quite confused.. This isn't right, don't you think so???"
msgstr "什么，巧克力？那是我买的东西，你却叫我给你，我实在摸不着头脑……这说不通，你不觉得吗？？？"

msgid "Hm... Then bring me something that is worthy of trading with this one.  I think I can accept the handmade chocolate of  [Chocolatier] Valence."
msgstr "嗯……那你就拿件配得上跟它交换的东西来。我想我可以收[巧克力师]瓦朗斯的手工巧克力。"

msgid "Fallen Spirit of Flame...  They seem like huge burning men with manes and whips of flames with many leather strings... If you see how horrible they look once, you'll never want to see them again."
msgstr "堕落火焰精灵……它们看起来像浑身燃烧的巨人，长着鬃毛，挥舞着缀满皮条的火焰长鞭……你只要见识过一次它们有多可怕，就再也不想见第二回。"

msgid "It's called Balog. They're already notorious in this region. You may be the one who can get rid of them. Don't you think so?"
msgstr "它们叫巴洛格。在这一带早已臭名昭著。能除掉它们的，也许就是你。你不觉得吗？"

msgid "Even Balog dropped their knees before you, Master~"
msgstr "连巴洛格都在你面前屈膝了，师父~"

msgid "They're already notorious in this region. We need your help."
msgstr "它们在这一带早已臭名昭著。我们需要你的帮助。"

msgid "You did it again... well~now that you caught Balog, where do you want to go?? Haha~"
msgstr "你又做到了……好啦~既然已经抓住了巴洛格，你接下来想去哪儿？？哈哈~"

msgid "Master, it's said that there are creatures that were created from the changes of Spirit of Flame... Please meet [Ascetic] Veda and check it out."
msgstr "师父，据说有些生物是由火焰精灵变异而成的……去见见[苦行者]吠陀，打听一下。"

msgid "Master, have you ever heard about ambilaterality of the Guard Tower in Ronark Land? Ask [Magician] Casielo for details."
msgstr "师父，你听说过罗纳克之地哨塔的双面性吗？详情去问[法师]卡谢洛吧。"

msgid "The Guard Tower in the base here may do good... or harm on us. It has ambilaterality."
msgstr "我们这座基地里的哨塔，可能对我们有利……也可能有害。它有双面性。"

msgid "You already got rid of the guardian Ibexs today. May the power of Guard Tower be with you... "
msgstr "你今天已经除掉了守护者羱羊。愿哨塔的力量与你同在……"

msgid "Literally, if we take up the Guard Tower, we'll be blessed, but at the same time we will make the Guard Tower angry. So the Protector of Guard Tower will appear."
msgstr "说白了，我们占据哨塔就会得到祝福，但同时也会激怒哨塔。于是哨塔守护者就会现身。"

msgid "Ibexs, guardian of Guard Tower (Ibexs). To concentrate on combat with Karus in the base, we'd better get rid of the guardian Ibexs first. If the Guard Tower falls into the hands of El Morad, the guardians that we should attack will disappear. Remember that."
msgstr "哨塔守护者——羱羊（Ibexs）。为了集中精力在基地与卡鲁斯作战，我们最好先除掉守护者羱羊。哨塔一旦落入艾莫拉德手中，我们该攻击的守护者就会消失。记住这一点。"

msgid "Protector of Guard Tower - The guardians appear only when the central Guard Tower is occupied. - If your enemy occupies the Guard Tower, the guardians will disappear. - You have only 20 minutes. - If you can't get reward within 20 minutes, you fail."
msgstr "哨塔守护者——只有中央哨塔被占领时守护者才会出现。——若你的敌人占领了哨塔，守护者就会消失。——你只有 20 分钟。——20 分钟内拿不到报酬就算失败。"

msgid "Master, I have accomplished the quest I got from Casielo!"
msgstr "师父，我完成了从卡谢洛那里接的任务！"

msgid "What about the quest I assigned to you?"
msgstr "我派给你的任务办得怎么样了？"

msgid "<selfname>,...  You finished the quest I assigned you pefectly! You'll be blessed by Karus... "
msgstr "<selfname>……你把我派给你的任务完成得滴水不漏！卡鲁斯会保佑你的……"

msgid "The fight with the Protectors of Guard Tower starts now... <selfname>, come and visit me again tomorrow, and I will assign you a new mission."
msgstr "与哨塔守护者的战斗现在开始……<selfname>，明天再来找我，我会给你派新任务。"

msgid "Master, have you ever heard about ambilaterality of the Guard Tower in Ronark Land? Ask [Magician] Aragona for details."
msgstr "师父，你听说过罗纳克之地哨塔的双面性吗？详情去问[法师]阿拉戈纳吧。"

msgid "You already got rid of the guardian Crisis today. May the power of Guard Tower be with you... "
msgstr "你今天已经除掉了守护者危机兽。愿哨塔的力量与你同在……"

msgid "Crisis, guardian of Guard Tower (Crisis). To concentrate on the combat with Karus in the base, we'd better get rid of the guardian Crisis first. If the Guard Tower falls into the hands of Karus, the guardians that we should attack will disappear. Remember that."
msgstr "哨塔守护者——危机兽（Crisis）。为了集中精力在基地与卡鲁斯作战，我们最好先除掉守护者危机兽。哨塔一旦落入卡鲁斯手中，我们该攻击的守护者就会消失。记住这一点。"

msgid "Master, I have accomplished the quest I got from Aragona!"
msgstr "师父，我完成了从阿拉戈纳那里接的任务！"

msgid "<selfname>,...  You did a perfect quest for what I'd assigned to you. You'll be blessed by El Morad... "
msgstr "<selfname>……你把我派给你的任务完成得非常出色。艾莫拉德会保佑你的……"

msgid "<selfname>,...  You'd better train more and come back again, as you seem incapable to know the truth about the Guardian Tower... "
msgstr "<selfname>……你似乎还没能力洞悉哨塔的真相，还是多修行一阵子再回来吧……"

msgid "Spies are mainly active at the back of Karus Military HQ."
msgstr "密探主要在卡鲁斯军部大楼后方活动。"

msgid "Spies are mainly active at the back of El Mora Military HQ."
msgstr "密探主要在艾莫拉德军部大楼后方活动。"

msgid "The spies you rescued are now recuperating. You will be assigned to another mission soon. But anyway, well-done."
msgstr "你救回的密探正在休养。很快会给你派下一个任务。不管怎样，干得好。"

msgid "Hmm... There are spies I planted to see El Morad's movement. But I have lost my contact with them for a few days. I have no idea if they're alive or dead... or if they were caught by El Morad... "
msgstr "嗯……我派了些密探去监视艾莫拉德的动向。可我已经跟他们失去联络好几天了。我不知道他们是死是活……也不知是不是被艾莫拉德抓了……"

msgid "Really?? Well, then, please. The spies that I'd previously assigned used to quest at the back of El Morad Military HQ. Could you search the area? Please take the spies, and collect the Intelligence Report they recorded."
msgstr "真的吗？？那好，拜托你了。我先前派去的密探，一直在艾莫拉德军部大楼后方一带执行任务。你能去那片区域搜搜吗？请把密探们带出来，并收集他们记录的情报报告。"

msgid "       Find the spy! - You can rescue 4 spies. (Reward offered differs depending on the number of Intelligence Reports you get from the spies you rescue) - If you're killed by an enemy Nation's player, your count of rescued spies and Intelligence Reports is reset. - During the quest, Summon skills are disabled. [ /town ] can be used, but your count of rescued spies and Intelligence Reports will be reset."
msgstr "       找到密探！——你可以救出 4 名密探。（根据你从救出的密探那里拿到的情报报告数量，给予的报酬不同。）——你若被敌国玩家杀死，救出密探数和情报报告数将清零。——任务期间，召唤技能禁用。可以使用[/town]，但你的救出密探数和情报报告数将清零。"

msgid "Master, I recovered some spies and Intelligence Reports. Are you going back? Or... are you continuing the rescue quest???"
msgstr "师父，我救回了一些密探和情报报告。你要回去了吗？还是……继续救援任务？？？"

msgid "Hmm... It's taking too long to complete the mission... It's already past midnight."
msgstr "嗯……完成任务花的时间太久了……已经过了午夜。"

msgid "Don't you have any news related to spies??? Hmm... I expect good news."
msgstr "你没有密探的消息吗？？？嗯……我等着好消息。"

msgid "Oh~Did you come back? You found 1 out of 4. Well done, the other 3 will be searched for by another group... "
msgstr "哦~你回来了？4 个里找到了 1 个。干得好，剩下 3 个会由另一队去找……"

msgid "Oh~Did you come back? You found 2 out of 4. Well done, the other 2 will be searched for by another group... "
msgstr "哦~你回来了？4 个里找到了 2 个。干得好，剩下 2 个会由另一队去找……"

msgid "Wow~You found 3 out of 4... I'm impressed by your searching skills. Thank you very much. "
msgstr "哇~4 个里你找到了 3 个……你的搜寻本领让我刮目相看。非常感谢。"

msgid "Gosh... you rescued all 4? And 4 intelligence reports?? You're excellent, well-done!!"
msgstr "天哪……4 个你全救回来了？还带回 4 份情报报告？？你太出色了，干得漂亮！！"

msgid "The spies you rescued are now recovering. You will be assigned to another mission soon. But first and foremost, well-done."
msgstr "你救回的密探正在休养。很快会给你派下一个任务。但首先，干得漂亮。"

msgid "Hmm... There are spies I put into place to see Karus's movement. But I have lost contact with them for a few days. I have no idea if they're dead or alive... or if they were caught by Karus... "
msgstr "嗯……我派了些密探去监视卡鲁斯的动向。可我已经跟他们失去联络好几天了。我不知道他们是死是活……也不知是不是被卡鲁斯抓了……"

msgid "Really?? Well, then, please. The spies that I'd previously assigned used to quest at the back of Karus Military HQ. Could you search the area? Please find the spies, and recover the Intelligence Report they recorded."
msgstr "真的吗？？那好，拜托你了。我先前派去的密探，一直在卡鲁斯军部大楼后方一带执行任务。你能去那片区域搜搜吗？请找到密探们，并取回他们记录的情报报告。"

msgid "Master, I found the spies and the Intelligence Report. Are you going back? Or... are you continuing the rescue mission???"
msgstr "师父，我找到了密探和情报报告。你要回去了吗？还是……继续救援任务？？？"

msgid "Don't you have any news on the spies??? Hmm... I expect good news."
msgstr "密探的事你没有消息吗？？？嗯……我等着好消息。"

msgid "Wow~You found 3 out of 4... I'm impressed by your skills. Thank you very much. "
msgstr "哇~4 个里你找到了 3 个……你的本领让我刮目相看。非常感谢。"

msgid "Oh my... I didn't expect to meet the Karus here... What are you doing here???"
msgstr "哎呀……真没想到会在这儿碰到卡鲁斯的人……你在这儿干什么？？？"

msgid "Oh my... Wait a second!! Who are you?! Why are you with our spies??"
msgstr "哎呀……等一下！！你是谁？！你怎么跟我们的密探在一起？？"

msgid "Who are you!! Get out of my way and get out of my sight!! You're interfering with my mission!!"
msgstr "你是谁！！滚开，别让我再看见你！！你在妨碍我的任务！！"

msgid "Hmm~ I'm doing my mission assigned by Caesar. I'm a spy who is watching the El Morad and researching geographical traits!"
msgstr "嗯~我正在执行凯撒交给我的任务。我是监视艾莫拉德、调查地理特征的密探！"

msgid "Really?? Hmm..Actually, I couldn't even think about going back, because the security was tightened. I need to deliver the Intelligence Report to Caesar, but the deadline has already passed... (Caesar won't like this... ) Could you do me a favor? Could you deliver this to him?"
msgstr "真的吗？？嗯……说实话，因为警戒加强，我连回去的念头都不敢有。我得把情报报告交给凯撒，可期限早就过了……（凯撒会不高兴的……）你能帮我个忙吗？你能替我把这个交给他吗？"

msgid "Ugh... I can't help it if it's Caesar's order. Then I will trust you and follow. Protect me, okay? I won't let you get away if you try to run from me!! Well~let's go!!"
msgstr "唉……既然是凯撒的命令，我也没办法。那我就信你，跟你走。保护好我，好吗？你要是撇下我自己跑，我可饶不了你！！那~咱们走！！"

msgid "A strange fellow... "
msgstr "一个奇怪的家伙……"

msgid "Oh my... I didn't expect to meet the El Morad... What are you doing here???"
msgstr "哎呀……真没想到会碰到艾莫拉德的人……你在这儿干什么？？？"

msgid "Who are you!! Get out of my sight!! You're interfering with my mission!!"
msgstr "你是谁！！别让我再看见你！！你在妨碍我的任务！！"

msgid "Hmm~ I'm doing my mission, as assigned by Julius. I'm a spy, watching the Karus and researching geographical features! Hmm~"
msgstr "嗯~我正在执行尤利乌斯交给我的任务。我是监视卡鲁斯、调查地理特征的密探！嗯~"

msgid "Really?? Hmm..Actually, I couldn't even think about going back, because Karus security has been tightened. I've need to deliver the Intelligence Report to Julius, but the deadline has already passed. (Julius won't like this... ) Could you do me a favor? Could you deliver this to him?"
msgstr "真的吗？？嗯……说实话，因为卡鲁斯的警戒加强，我连回去的念头都不敢有。我得把情报报告交给尤利乌斯，可期限早就过了。（尤利乌斯会不高兴的……）你能帮我个忙吗？你能替我把这个交给他吗？"

msgid "Ugh... I can't help it if it's Julius's order. Then I will trust you and follow. Protect me, okay? I won't let you get away if you try to run from me!! Well~let's go!!"
msgstr "唉……既然是尤利乌斯的命令，我也没办法。那我就信你，跟你走。保护好我，好吗？你要是撇下我自己跑，我可饶不了你！！那~咱们走！！"

msgid "Well, I was looking for migrants, too! To win the next Lunar War, they're recruiting many soldiers. Are you ready for migration?"
msgstr "巧了，我也在找要移民的人！为了赢下下一场月战，他们正在大量招兵。你准备好移民了吗？"

msgid "Well... to transfer your Nation, you should bring the  Nation Transfer Certificate needed for a Nation transfer. You can buy the Nation Transfer Certificate at the PowerUP Store."
msgstr "嗯……要转国，你得带上转国所需的转国凭证。你可以在充值商店购买转国凭证。"

msgid "Change your character to the nation you want, and click OK to transfer your Nation. Don't be surprised if the game automatically disconnects."
msgstr "把你的角色转到想去的国家，点确定即可转国。游戏自动断线也别惊讶。"

msgid "You can enter Krowaz's Land only if you have Country CONT. Please go back to the castle to charge CONT, and come back."
msgstr "只有拥有国家点数贡献，你才能进入克罗兹之地。请先回城堡充值贡献，再来。"

msgid "Oh, applying for the entire clan to transfer, eh. The camp they are transferring to will have their strength boosted significantly! Are you ready to move?"
msgstr "哦，是要整个公会集体移民啊。他们转去的阵营实力会大幅提升！你们准备好出发了吗？"

msgid "You are trying to move to El Morad. We provide the item which enables you to preserve the clan at the same grade considering all the deeds you have done, so I will first check the grade of your clan and then give you the item.   Are you ready?"
msgstr "你们要转去艾莫拉德。我们会综合你们立下的所有功绩，提供一件能让公会保持原等级的道具，所以我先核对你们公会的等级，再把道具给你。准备好了吗？"

msgid "You are trying to move to Karus. We provide the item which enables you to preserve the clan at the same grade considering all the deeds you have done, so I will first check the grade of your clan and then give you the item.   Are you ready?"
msgstr "你们要转去卡鲁斯。我们会综合你们立下的所有功绩，提供一件能让公会保持原等级的道具，所以我先核对你们公会的等级，再把道具给你。准备好了吗？"

msgid "The grade of your clan is Formal Knight Squad. Would you like to receive the [Certificate of Formal Knight] and the item?"
msgstr "你们公会的等级是正式骑士团。你要领[正式骑士凭证]和那件道具吗？"

msgid "The grade of your clan is Royal Knight Squad. Would you like to receive the [Certificate of Royal Knight] and the item?"
msgstr "你们公会的等级是皇家骑士团。你要领[皇家骑士凭证]和那件道具吗？"

msgid "The grade of your clan is Training Knight Squad. Would you like to receive the [Certificate of Training Knight] and the item?"
msgstr "你们公会的等级是训练骑士团。你要领[训练骑士凭证]和那件道具吗？"

msgid "Well... To transfer your nation, you should bring the  Nation Transfer Certificate. You can buy the  Exile Application Form  at the Power-up store."
msgstr "嗯……要转国，你得带上转国凭证。你可以在充值商店购买流放申请书。"

msgid "This definitely is an  Exile Application Form."
msgstr "这铁定是一份流放申请书。"

msgid "Then I will change the  Exile Application Form to the items you need for migration and give them to you, are you ready?"
msgstr "那我就把这份流放申请书换成你移民所需的道具交给你，准备好了吗？"

msgid "Your clan haven't made any great contribution yet, I'm sorry but I can not give you the certificate, but don't feel too sad as your CONT recovers when you move. "
msgstr "你们公会还没立下什么大功，抱歉，我不能给你凭证，不过别太难过，因为你转过去后贡献会恢复。"

msgid "You are the leader of the transferred clan, and you are here to reestablish the prestige of your clan as it was in the previous nation, right?!"
msgstr "你是移民公会的会长，来这儿是想让公会恢复在上一个国家时的威望，对吧？！"

msgid "Hm? It is only available for the clan leaders.  I'm sorry but you are not qualified."
msgstr "嗯？这只有公会会长才能办。抱歉，你没资格。"

msgid "Firstly, I will check the current grade of the present clan as per procedure, and wait for a moment as the promotion is determined by the confirmed grade. "
msgstr "首先，我会按流程核对该公会当前的等级，晋升是依据确认后的等级决定的，请稍等。"

msgid "Oh! You are [Formal Knight Squad] right now! Would you like to be promoted to the next grade, [Royal Knight Squad]!?"
msgstr "哦！你们现在是[正式骑士团]！你们想晋升到下一等级[皇家骑士团]吗？！"

msgid "You are already [Royal Knight Squd], aren't you!? Haha, there is no more place for you to go up!"
msgstr "你们已经是[皇家骑士团]了，是吧！？哈哈，你们再也没地方可升了！"

msgid "Um, you are [Training Knight Squad], you can promote to the next grade [Formal Knight Squad]. Would you like to be promoted?"
msgstr "嗯，你们是[训练骑士团]，可以晋升到下一等级[正式骑士团]。你们想晋升吗？"

msgid "Your clan has never been promoted. Would you like to be promoted to [Training Knight Squad]?"
msgstr "你们公会从未晋升过。你们想晋升到[训练骑士团]吗？"

msgid "You have been promoted! I expect your clan to contribute even more from now on!"
msgstr "你们晋升了！我期待你们公会今后做出更多贡献！"

msgid "To promote the clan, you have to bring the certificate of the relevant degree. You either don't have the certificate or you got it but haven't transferred yet, so return when you have the certificate or complete the transfer!"
msgstr "要晋升公会，你得带上对应等级的凭证。你要么没有凭证，要么有了还没转国，所以等你有了凭证、或完成转国后再回来！"

msgid "You have Nation Transfer Certificate, you can make national transfer right now.  And   for the clan leaders who are transferring right now, we are providing the item which enables them to recover the clan, so if you are a clan leader, don't forget to take it.  "
msgstr "你有转国凭证，现在就可以转国。另外，对于此刻正在转国的公会会长，我们提供能恢复公会的道具，所以你要是公会会长，别忘了领取。"

msgid "Before using the Nation Transfer item, remember that you can get the Clan Recovery Item here if you are the leader of your clan, you can use the item after you transfer. "
msgstr "使用转国道具之前，请记住：如果你是公会会长，可以在这儿领到公会恢复道具，转国后再使用该道具。"

msgid "You already got it! Don't be too greedy!"
msgstr "你已经领过了！别太贪心！"

msgid "There`s no items to trade."
msgstr "没有可交易的物品。"

msgid "||What would you like to trade?"
msgstr "||你想交易什么？"

msgid "You don`t have the treasure chest in the Forgotten Temple| It is a precious box which can be obtained only by destroying the Army of Darkness in the Kelino Temple."
msgstr "你没有遗忘神殿的宝箱|这是一个珍贵的箱子，只有消灭凯里诺神殿的黑暗军团才能获得。"

msgid "Trade 2nd grade treasure chest"
msgstr "兑换二级宝箱"

msgid "Trade 1st grade treasure chest"
msgstr "兑换一级宝箱"

msgid "What would you like to trade?"
msgstr "你想交易什么？"

msgid "bandit suppression squad has begun again. Hurry, Master. "
msgstr "剿匪小队再次出动了。快点，主人。"

msgid "I hear the number of bandits who raid merchants converging near Moradon are on the rise. Accordingly, the Grand Merchant has asked us to suppress the bandits and eliminate their monsters.  I will give you directions once your squad has accumulated 4-8 members. Don`t worry about gathering members. If you accept my suggestion, I`ll gather them for you."
msgstr "我听说在莫拉登附近劫掠商人的强盗数量正在增加。因此，大商人要求我们镇压强盗并清除他们的怪物。当你的小队集结4-8名成员后，我会告诉你方向。不用担心招募成员。如果你接受我的建议，我会帮你召集。"

msgid "Member gathering is complete."
msgstr "成员集结完毕。"

msgid "I will relay it to you when the next suppression squad is dispatched. No other requests have come in."
msgstr "下一次镇压小队派遣时我会通知你。目前没有其他请求。"

msgid "Master, you`re now adept at combat and mercenary duties. Isn`t it about time you distinguish yourself form the other novices?"
msgstr "主人，你现在已经熟悉战斗和雇佣兵职责了。是时候从其他新手之中脱颖而出了吧？"

msgid "How are you? I am [Tycoon] Kaishan. I am transferring the recognized beginning level warriors of Karus to the next level. If you bring the fee of 3000 Noah to me now, I will promote you to the next level."
msgstr "你好吗？我是[Tycoon]凯山。我负责将卡鲁斯公认的初级战士晋升到下一阶。如果你现在带来3000诺亚的费用，我就会把你晋升到下一阶。"

msgid "How are you? I am [Tycoon] Kaishan. I am transferring the recognized beginning level warriors of El Morad to the next level. If you bring the fee of 3000 Noah to me now, I will promote you to the next level."
msgstr "你好吗？我是[Tycoon]凯山。我负责将艾莫拉德公认的初级战士晋升到下一阶。如果你现在带来3000诺亚的费用，我就会把你晋升到下一阶。"

msgid "I`ve heard that you`re a great help to Moradon including contributing to its security. |You seem to be well qualified for a job change indeed. Will you under go a job change?"
msgstr "我听说你为莫拉登帮了大忙，包括维护它的安全。|看来你确实具备转职的资格。你要进行转职吗？"

msgid "3,000 Noahs are required for the job change ceremony."
msgstr "转职仪式需要3,000诺亚。"

msgid "Congratulations, Master. You are now a step closer to the master road of the true knight."
msgstr "恭喜你，主人。你离真正骑士的大师之路又近了一步。"

msgid "The job change ceremony has already ended"
msgstr "转职仪式已经结束了"

msgid "Job changes are possible from Level 10 and above"
msgstr "10级及以上即可转职"

msgid "Would you like to redistribute?"
msgstr "你想重新分配吗？"

msgid "Do you want to leave?"
msgstr "你想离开吗？"

msgid "For the 2nd job change you need the help of the most acclaimed expert in your field.|Let`s go talk to [Warrior Master] Skaki."
msgstr "二次转职需要你所在领域最受推崇的专家的帮助。|去找[Warrior Master]斯卡基谈谈吧。"

msgid "For the 2nd job change you need at least Level 60 skills!"
msgstr "二次转职需要至少60级的技能！"

msgid "You have already completed the ritual."
msgstr "你已经完成仪式了。"

msgid "Oh, it`s time for you to undergo a 2nd job change? You have persevered well. Don`t be lax as the true chivalric mission begins now. You need the ingredients below to perform the 2nd job change ritual."
msgstr "哦，是时候进行二次转职了吗？你坚持得很好。真正的骑士使命现在才开始，不要松懈。进行二次转职仪式需要以下材料。"

msgid "Not all the sacrificial offerings to hold the ceremony have been prepared yet. "
msgstr "举行仪式所需的祭品还没有全部准备好。"

msgid "Master, all the materials needed for the 2nd job change has been collected. It won`t be long till you become a celebrated first-rate warrior."
msgstr "主人，二次转职所需的所有材料都已收集齐了。用不了多久你就会成为赫赫有名的一流战士。"

msgid "All the preparations are complete. I appoint you Berserkerhero. Do you want to change jobs now?"
msgstr "一切准备就绪。我任命你为狂战士英雄。你现在要转职吗？"

msgid "For the 2nd job change you need the help of the most acclaimed expert in your field.|Let`s go talk to [Secret Proxy] Clarence."
msgstr "二次转职需要你所在领域最受推崇的专家的帮助。|去找[Secret Proxy]克拉伦斯谈谈吧。"

msgid "You have finally fulfilled the requirements for the 2nd job change. You will be the pride of us rogues if you successfully complete it. Your road to becoming a true rogue master begins now. To complete the 2nd job change you need the ingredients below."
msgstr "你终于满足了二次转职的条件。如果你成功完成，你将成为我们盗贼的骄傲。你成为真正盗贼大师的道路现在开始。完成二次转职需要以下材料。"

msgid "You haven't collected all the sacrificial offerings to hold the ceremony yet. "
msgstr "你还没有收集齐举行仪式所需的全部祭品。"

msgid "Master, all the materials needed for your 2nd job change has been collected. It won`t be long till you become a celebrated first-rate rogue."
msgstr "主人，你的二次转职所需的所有材料都已收集齐了。用不了多久你就会成为赫赫有名的一流盗贼。"

msgid " All the items needed for the ceremony have been prepared.  I will confer you by the name of Shadow Bane.  Would you like to hold the ceremony right now?"
msgstr "举行仪式所需的物品都已准备就绪。我将以暗影之灾之名授予你。你想现在就举行仪式吗？"

msgid "For the 2nd job change you need the help of the most acclaimed expert in your field.|Let`s go talk to [Archmage] Drake."
msgstr "二次转职需要你所在领域最受推崇的专家的帮助。|去找[Archmage]德雷克谈谈吧。"

msgid "To undergo the 2nd job change you need the magic powers of at least Level 60."
msgstr "进行二次转职需要至少60级的魔力。"

msgid "Mages undergoing a 2nd job change are no longer governed by my powers. If you want that power go and collect the ingredients below. "
msgstr "进行二次转职的法师不再受我的力量管辖。如果你想要那份力量，去收集以下材料吧。"

msgid "Master, all the materials needed for your 2nd job change has been collected. It won`t be long till you become a celebrated first-rate mage."
msgstr "主人，你的二次转职所需的所有材料都已收集齐了。用不了多久你就会成为赫赫有名的一流法师。"

msgid "You brought everything I asked for. Here... you will now receive the appellation of omniscient Elimentalload  Do you want to undergo the job change now?"
msgstr "我要的东西你都带来了。来……你现在将获得全知元素主宰的称号。你现在要进行转职吗？"

msgid "For the 2nd job change you need the help of the most acclaimed expert in your field.|Let`s go talk to [Priest] Minerva."
msgstr "二次转职需要你所在领域最受推崇的专家的帮助。|去找[Priest]密涅瓦谈谈吧。"

msgid "To perform the 2nd job change you need to be at least Level 60 in order to receive the help of the gods."
msgstr "要进行二次转职，你需要达到至少60级才能获得众神的帮助。"

msgid "You`re attempting your 2nd job change, how impressive... Your training thus far must have moved the gods. You need the ingredients below to approach the gods closer."
msgstr "你要尝试二次转职了，真了不起……你至今的修炼一定感动了众神。你需要以下材料来更接近众神。"

msgid "Master, all the materials needed for your 2nd job change has been collected. It won`t be long till you become a celebrated first-rate priest."
msgstr "主人，你的二次转职所需的所有材料都已收集齐了。用不了多久你就会成为赫赫有名的一流祭司。"

msgid "You are equipped with all the materials needed for your 2nd job change. You have made a vow with the gods under the title Shadowknight. Would you like to perform the ceremony now?"
msgstr "二次转职所需的所有材料你都已备齐。你已以暗影骑士之名与众神立下誓言。你想现在就举行仪式吗？"

msgid "Please come back later."
msgstr "请稍后再来。"

msgid "I handle items purchased from the [Power-Up Store]. Which items will you use?"
msgstr "我负责处理从[Power-Up Store]购买的物品。你要使用哪些物品？"

msgid "This is the Clan Stadium , the greatest combat site on the continent. |Would you like to enter?"
msgstr "这里是部落竞技场，大陆上最宏大的战斗场所。|你想进入吗？"

msgid "Are you ready to enter? | Only those permitted (Level 46~59 and above) can participate in the Forgotten Temple at 11 AM, 6 PM, and 11 PM."
msgstr "你准备好进入了吗？|只有符合条件者（46~59级及以上）才能在上午11点、下午6点和晚上11点参加遗忘神殿。"

msgid "Are you ready to enter? | Only those permitted 60 and above) can participate in the Forgotten Temple at noon, 7 PM, and midnight."
msgstr "你准备好进入了吗？|只有符合条件者（60级及以上）才能在正午、晚上7点和午夜参加遗忘神殿。"

msgid "Temple entrance is not granted to your players level."
msgstr "你的等级不允许进入神殿。"

msgid "100,00 Noahs are needed to enter Forgotten Temple."
msgstr "进入遗忘神殿需要100,00诺亚。"

msgid "The temple is full. No more than 81 people are allowed entry."
msgstr "神殿已满。最多允许81人进入。"

msgid "Entry is not permitted at this time. Only those permitted ( Level 60 and above) can participate in the Forgotten Temple at noon, 7 PM, and midnight."
msgstr "此时不允许进入。只有符合条件者（60级及以上）才能在正午、晚上7点和午夜参加遗忘神殿。"

msgid "This is the Ness Holyland which emits magic powers linked to the Forgotten Holyland. Only Level 46-59 can participate. |Those who have undertaken 2nd job changes or whose levels exceed the limit are not allowed entry."
msgstr "这里是奈斯圣地，散发着与遗忘圣地相连的魔力。只有46-59级可以参加。|已进行二次转职或等级超过上限者不得进入。"

msgid " Entry is not Entry is not permitted at this time. Only those permitted (Level 46~59 and above) can participate in the Forgotten Temple at 11 AM, 6 PM, and 11 PM."
msgstr "此时不允许进入。只有符合条件者（46~59级及以上）才能在上午11点、下午6点和晚上11点参加遗忘神殿。"

msgid "Jewel of the Abyss exchange"
msgstr "深渊宝石兑换"

msgid "You don`t have the Jewel of the Abyss. You can obtain it at Abyss Dungeon in Delos.  "
msgstr "你没有深渊宝石。你可以在迪洛斯的深渊地牢中获得它。"

msgid "Are you ready to learn the secrets of holy water production?"
msgstr "你准备好学习圣水制作的秘诀了吗？"

msgid "I`m in charge of the knight squad and knight ranking. What piques your interest?  "
msgstr "我负责骑士小队和骑士排名。你对什么感兴趣？"

msgid "You do not possess the equal of knight squad rank No. 50. "
msgstr "你的骑士小队排名未达到第50名。"

msgid "You have already collected your knight stipend for today."
msgstr "你今天已经领取过骑士津贴了。"

msgid "You do not possess the equal of ladder rank No. 100. "
msgstr "你的天梯排名未达到第100名。"

msgid "You have already collected your monthly stipend for today."
msgstr "你今天已经领取过月度津贴了。"

msgid "Thanks to the legacy of the warriors who wage battle against the enemy, our land has remained safe and intact. For a fee, I raise the country CONT of warriors who have country CONT below 100. "
msgstr "多亏了与敌人作战的战士们留下的遗产，我们的土地才得以安然无恙。支付费用后，我会为国家贡献值低于100的战士提升国家贡献值。"

msgid "The fee for acquiring 500 country CONT is 1.5 million Noahs, and 350, 000 Noahs for 100 country CONT."
msgstr "获取500国家贡献值的费用是150万诺亚，获取100国家贡献值的费用是350,000诺亚。"

msgid "Do you want to receive 500 country CONT?"
msgstr "你想获得500国家贡献值吗？"

msgid "Do you want to receive 100 country CONT?"
msgstr "你想获得100国家贡献值吗？"

msgid "You don`t have enough Noahs. You must pay a fee of 1.5 million Noahs to obtain 500 country CONT."
msgstr "你的诺亚不足。你必须支付150万诺亚的费用才能获得500国家贡献值。"

msgid "You don`t have enough Noahs. You must pay a fee of 350,000 Noahs to obtain 100 country CONT."
msgstr "你的诺亚不足。你必须支付350,000诺亚的费用才能获得100国家贡献值。"

msgid "There`s nothing I can do for you. I only deal with clans. "
msgstr "我帮不了你。我只与部落打交道。"

msgid "Your clan has to serve your country more. Only clans above class 3 are eligible to become knight squads."
msgstr "你的部落要为国家效力更多。只有三级以上的部落才有资格成为骑士小队。"

msgid "Please relay to your clan leader that this mission can only be completed by him..."
msgstr "请转告你的部落首领，这个任务只能由他本人完成……"

msgid "The knight squad is a combat unit certified by the emperor. As proof of serving your country, only clans above class 3 are eligible to become knight squads. And you must prove your valor and ability. Caitharos is waiting to test you at the coliseum. After defeating Caitharos bring back the [Key of Honor] and 10 million Noahs. "
msgstr "骑士小队是由皇帝认证的战斗单位。作为为国效力的证明，只有三级以上的部落才有资格成为骑士小队。而且你必须证明你的勇气和能力。凯萨罗斯正在斗兽场等待考验你。击败凯萨罗斯后，带回[荣誉之钥]和1000万诺亚。"

msgid "The coliseum is home to many trials. The moment you enter the coliseum to undergo the knight squad test, all clan members in the mainland will be transported there. There is no distinction between enemy and friendly forces at the coliseum. Your friend can attack you as well as your opponent. Only the strong will emerge with the [Key of Honor]."
msgstr "斗兽场充满了各种考验。你一进入斗兽场接受骑士小队考验，大陆上的所有部落成员都会被传送到那里。斗兽场里没有敌我之分。你的朋友和对手一样都可以攻击你。只有强者才能带着[荣誉之钥]脱颖而出。"

msgid "You may lose valuable EXP in the coliseum. And you may be detained there. Or you may be defeated by other clan members and lose the [Key of Honor]."
msgstr "你可能在斗兽场损失宝贵的经验值。你可能会被滞留在那里。或者你可能被其他部落成员击败而失去[荣誉之钥]。"

msgid "And the most important of all is that you, the clan leader, has to personally acquire the [Key of Honor]. Your friends aid in your combat against Caitharos but they cannot help you to acquire the key. Do not forget. I bid you good luck.  "
msgstr "最重要的是，你作为部落首领必须亲自取得[荣誉之钥]。你的朋友会协助你与凯萨罗斯作战，但他们无法帮你取得钥匙。别忘了。祝你好运。"

msgid "If you want to join the knight squad you must seize the [Key of Honor] from Caitharos."
msgstr "如果你想加入骑士小队，就必须从凯萨罗斯手中夺取[荣誉之钥]。"

msgid "Did you bring the ingredients below needed for the knight squad promotion?"
msgstr "你带来了骑士小队晋升所需的以下材料吗？"

msgid "How`s your journey coming along?"
msgstr "你的旅程进展如何？"

msgid "What kind of mission do you want?"
msgstr "你想要什么样的任务？"

msgid "Master! Let's go and check out theDark Lunar War."
msgstr "主人！我们去看看暗月之战吧。"

msgid "The news is that the El Moradians are on the move. But it's hard to say what they're up to. I planted a spy in their ranks, but I've still not had the  Classified Document from them. Look, <selfname>, can you investigate this matter for me?"
msgstr "有消息说艾莫拉德人正在行动。但很难说他们在搞什么。我在他们之中安插了一名间谍，但我还没有从他那里拿到机密文件。听着，<selfname>，你能帮我调查这件事吗？"

msgid "This mission can only be attempted if you're Lvl 45 to Lvl 49."
msgstr "这个任务只有在45级到49级之间才能接取。"

msgid "There's no  Classified Document!  Dark Luna War's gate stays open until there is a winning nation, between 8am to 10pm every Wednesday. Bring the Classified Document that spy has from there."
msgstr "没有机密文件！暗月之战的大门在每周三上午8点到晚上10点之间开放，直到决出获胜国。从那里把间谍手中的机密文件带来。"

msgid "Have you brought the Classified Document? What's the situation there? No, everything will be in the document. Give me the  Classified Document please."
msgstr "你带来机密文件了吗？那边情况如何？不，一切都写在文件里。请把机密文件给我。"

msgid "Master! Let's go and check out theLunar War."
msgstr "主人！我们去看看月之战吧。"

msgid "This mission can only be attempted if you're Lvl 50 or higher. Come and see me after you've spilt some more blood!"
msgstr "这个任务只有在50级及以上才能接取。再多沾染一些鲜血后再来找我吧！"

msgid "There's no  Classified Document!  Luna War's gate stays open until there is a winning nation, between 8am to 10pm every Monday and Thursday. Bring the Classified Document that spy has from there."
msgstr "没有机密文件！月之战的大门在每周一和周四上午8点到晚上10点之间开放，直到决出获胜国。从那里把间谍手中的机密文件带来。"

msgid "Please continue to fight for your country."
msgstr "请继续为你的国家而战。"

msgid "Have you talked to the main castle`s councilor? He should`ve told you who I am| So what kind of spy document did you need?"
msgstr "你和主城堡的议员谈过了吗？他应该已经告诉你我是谁了|那么你需要什么样的间谍文件呢？"

msgid "Go see the councilor at inside Luferson Castle first"
msgstr "先去卢弗森城堡里面找议员"

msgid "You must deliver the  Dark Lunar spy document to the councilor.  "
msgstr "你必须把暗月间谍文件交给议员。"

msgid "You have the Dark Lunar spy document."
msgstr "你持有暗月间谍文件。"

msgid "You must deliver the Lunar spy document to the councilor.  "
msgstr "你必须把月之战间谍文件交给议员。"

msgid "You have the Lunar spy document."
msgstr "你持有月之战间谍文件。"

msgid "Master! Let`s go see the Guardian of the Seven Keys~"
msgstr "主人！我们去见七钥守护者吧~"

msgid "Seven keys to the Land of the Hidden Truth were made according to ancient records discovered near the Land of the Fairies but they were entrusted to different guardians who all went their separate ways. Will you go retrieve the seven keys? "
msgstr "通往隐秘真相之地的七把钥匙是根据精灵之地附近发现的古代记录打造的，但它们被托付给了各自分散的不同守护者。你愿意去寻回这七把钥匙吗？"

msgid "Did you retrieve the seventh key? If you give me the seventh key I will award you EXP in return."
msgstr "你寻回第七把钥匙了吗？如果你把第七把钥匙给我，我会奖励你经验值作为回报。"

msgid "Please retrieve the seventh key for me. I will give you another written order.  "
msgstr "请帮我寻回第七把钥匙。我会再给你一份书面命令。"

msgid "Brave warrior!! Where is the seventh key? You must retrieve the seventh key in order to complete your mission."
msgstr "勇敢的战士！！第七把钥匙在哪里？你必须寻回第七把钥匙才能完成任务。"

msgid "You already collected your knight stipend for today."
msgstr "你今天已经领取过骑士津贴了。"

msgid "You do not possess the equal of ladder rank No. 100."
msgstr "你的天梯排名未达到第100名。"

msgid "You already collected your monthly stipend."
msgstr "你已经领取过月度津贴了。"

msgid "And the most important of all is that you, the clan leader, has to personally acquire the [Key of Honor]. Your friends aid in your combat against Caitharos but they cannot help you to acquire the key. Do not forget. I bid you good luck. "
msgstr "最重要的是，你作为部落首领必须亲自取得[荣誉之钥]。你的朋友会协助你与凯萨罗斯作战，但他们无法帮你取得钥匙。别忘了。祝你好运。"

msgid "To be eligible to join the knight squad you must seize the [Key of Honor] from Caitharos."
msgstr "要获得加入骑士小队的资格，你必须从凯萨罗斯手中夺取[荣誉之钥]。"

msgid "The news is that Karus' forces are on the move. But it's hard to say what they're up to. I planted a spy in their ranks, but I've still not had the  Classified Document from them. Look, <selfname>, can you investigate this matter for me?"
msgstr "有消息说卡鲁斯的军队正在行动。但很难说他们在搞什么。我在他们之中安插了一名间谍，但我还没有从他那里拿到机密文件。听着，<selfname>，你能帮我调查这件事吗？"

msgid "There's no  Classified Document!  Luna War's gate opens till there is a winning nation between 8am to 10pm on every Monday and Thursday. Bring the Classified Document that spy has from there."
msgstr "没有机密文件！月之战的大门在每周一和周四上午8点到晚上10点之间开放，直到决出获胜国。从那里把间谍手中的机密文件带来。"

msgid "Go see the councilor at inside El Morad Castle first"
msgstr "先去艾莫拉德城堡里面找议员"

msgid "I`m the Catcher of Keys, the guardian of the first key! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Written Order of Seven Keys]. "
msgstr "我是擒钥者，第一把钥匙的守护者！我只会向带来[七钥书面命令]的人提问。"

msgid "I`m the Catcher of Keys, the guardian of the first key! You are qualified to answer the question since you possess the [Written Order of Seven Keys]. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是擒钥者，第一把钥匙的守护者！既然你持有[七钥书面命令]，就有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

msgid "What kind of power does Cypher have?"
msgstr "赛弗拥有什么样的力量？"

msgid "Your answer is incorrect. Your [Written Order of Seven Keys] has been consumed as penalty. I will leave now in search of the secret of the keys. "
msgstr "你的回答不正确。你的[七钥书面命令]已被作为惩罚消耗。我现在要出发去寻找钥匙的秘密了。"

msgid "I`m the Watcher of Keys, the guardian of the second key! I only pose the question to those who bring the [First Key]."
msgstr "我是守望钥者，第二把钥匙的守护者！我只会向带来[第一把钥匙]的人提问。"

msgid "I`m the Watcher of Keys, the guardian of the second key!  You are qualified to answer the question since you possess the [First Key]. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是守望钥者，第二把钥匙的守护者！既然你持有[第一把钥匙]，就有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

msgid "What did the god Pathos originally govern? "
msgstr "帕特奥斯神最初掌管什么？"

msgid "Your answer is incorrect. Pathos is the god of change and confusion.| Your [First Key] has been consumed as penalty. I will leave now in search of the secret of the keys. "
msgstr "你的回答不正确。帕特奥斯是掌管变化与混乱的神。|你的[第一把钥匙]已被作为惩罚消耗。我现在要出发去寻找钥匙的秘密了。"

msgid "I`m the Protector of Keys, the guardian of the third key! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Second Key]."
msgstr "我是护钥者，第三把钥匙的守护者！我只会向带来[第二把钥匙]的人提问。"

msgid "I`m the Protector of Keys, the guardian of the third key!  You are qualified to answer the question since you possess the [Second Key]. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是护钥者，第三把钥匙的守护者！既然你持有[第二把钥匙]，就有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

msgid "What is in the box Logos hid in the Land of Fairies?"
msgstr "洛戈斯藏在精灵之地的箱子里装着什么？"

msgid "Your answer is incorrect. Logos hid a box containing Cypher`s severed head in the Land of Fairies.| Your [Second Key] has been consumed as penalty. I will leave now in search of the secret of the keys. "
msgstr "你的回答不正确。洛戈斯把一个装着赛弗头颅的箱子藏在了精灵之地。|你的[第二把钥匙]已被作为惩罚消耗。我现在要出发去寻找钥匙的秘密了。"

msgid "I`m the Sentinel of Keys, the guardian of the fourth key! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Third Key]."
msgstr "我是哨兵钥者，第四把钥匙的守护者！我只会向带来[第三把钥匙]的人提问。"

msgid "I`m the Sentinel of Keys, the guardian of the fourth key!  You are qualified to answer the question since you possess the [Third Key]. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是哨兵钥者，第四把钥匙的守护者！既然你持有[第三把钥匙]，就有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

msgid "Who is the son of the emperor of El Morad abandoned in the wilderness? "
msgstr "被遗弃在荒野中的艾莫拉德皇帝之子是谁？"

msgid "Your answer is incorrect. Your [Third Key] has been consumed as penalty. I will leave now in search of the secret of the keys. "
msgstr "你的回答不正确。你的[第三把钥匙]已被作为惩罚消耗。我现在要出发去寻找钥匙的秘密了。"

msgid "I`m the Patrol of Keys, the guardian of the fifth key! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Fourth Key]."
msgstr "我是巡钥者，第五把钥匙的守护者！我只会向带来[第四把钥匙]的人提问。"

msgid "I`m the Patrol of Keys, the guardian of the fifth key! You are qualified to answer the question since you possess the [Fourth Key]. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是巡钥者，第五把钥匙的守护者！既然你持有[第四把钥匙]，就有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

msgid "Did Logos create mankind? "
msgstr "是洛戈斯创造了人类吗？"

msgid "Your answer is incorrect. Your [Fourth Key] has been consumed as penalty. I will leave now in search of the secret of the keys. "
msgstr "你的回答不正确。你的[第四把钥匙]已被作为惩罚消耗。我现在要出发去寻找钥匙的秘密了。"

msgid "I`m the Searcher of Keys, the guardian of the sixth key! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Fifth Key]."
msgstr "我是寻钥者，第六把钥匙的守护者！我只会向带来[第五把钥匙]的人提问。"

msgid "I`m the Searcher of Keys, the guardian of the sixth key! You are qualified to answer the question since you possess the [Fifth Key]. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是寻钥者，第六把钥匙的守护者！既然你持有[第五把钥匙]，就有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

msgid "Who was created out of confusion?"
msgstr "谁是由混乱之中诞生的？"

msgid "Your answer is incorrect. Your [Fifth Key] has been consumed as penalty. I will leave now in search of the secret of the keys. "
msgstr "你的回答不正确。你的[第五把钥匙]已被作为惩罚消耗。我现在要出发去寻找钥匙的秘密了。"

msgid "I`m the Keeper of Keys, the guardian of the seventh key! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Sixth Key]."
msgstr "我是守钥者，第七把钥匙的守护者！我只会向带来[第六把钥匙]的人提问。"

msgid "I`m the Keeper of Keys, the guardian of the seventh key! You are qualified to answer the question since you possess the [Sixth Key]. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是守钥者，第七把钥匙的守护者！既然你持有[第六把钥匙]，就有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

msgid "What is the name of the mountain range that Xigenon and his men negotiated? "
msgstr "西格农和他的部下谈判时所在的山脉叫什么名字？"

msgid "Your answer is incorrect. Your [Sixth Key] has been consumed as penalty. I will leave now in search of the secret of the keys. "
msgstr "你的回答不正确。你的[第六把钥匙]已被作为惩罚消耗。我现在要出发去寻找钥匙的秘密了。"

msgid "I have no mission to give you."
msgstr "我没有任务可以交给你。"

