msgid "Do you remember that day? The war against Pathos which turned the land crimson... After that day the only compensation the heroes who survived received were Pathos`s curse and a frigid blade |Let`s show those El Moradians who drove us to these cutting Iskan mountain range that the we are the true descendants of the heroes!"
msgstr "你还记得那一天吗？对抗帕特奥斯、把大地染成血色的那场战争……那天之后，幸存的英雄们得到的唯一补偿就是帕特奥斯的诅咒和一把冰冷的刀刃|让我们向那些把我们逼到这险峻伊斯坎山脉的艾莫拉德人证明，我们才是英雄真正的后裔！"

msgid "For long, our ancestors have sacrificed ceaselessly and carried on warfare to unite the continent| The Krusians are trying to take that hard-earned land from us. Show them who the true conquerors of the continent are!"
msgstr "长久以来，我们的祖先为统一大陆不断牺牲、征战|克鲁斯人正想从我们手中夺走那块来之不易的土地。让他们看看谁才是大陆真正的征服者！"

msgid "You do not have enough inventory."
msgstr "你的背包空间不足。"

msgid "Did you enjoy the background on the Ardream confrontation?| Take the 200 CONT you received to the front and bring back 30 enemy lives (CONT will be given to you only once) "
msgstr "阿德雷姆对峙的背景你了解得还尽兴吗？|带着你获得的200贡献值去前线，带回30名敌人的性命（贡献值只给你一次）"

msgid "Master, Sentinel Patrick is hiring new recruits.Go apply."
