msgstr "你真是天赋异禀。你的名字在前线家喻户晓只是时间问题。你达到答应我的等级了吗？"

msgid "Awesome, Master, you have reached Level 60, as promised to [Sentinel] Patrick. Go to him and receive your supplies."
msgstr "太棒了，主人，你如约达到了60级，正如对[哨兵]帕特里克承诺的那样。去找他领取补给吧。"

msgid "You haven`t reached Level 50 yet. Try harder. "
msgstr "你还没达到50级。再努力些。"

msgid "The new recruit event is under way^^"
msgstr "新兵活动正在进行中^^"

msgid "I hope you`ll reach your goal and receive the supplies."
msgstr "希望你能达成目标并领取补给。"

msgid "Supplies are being distributed to the players who have achieved the new recruit event. Which supply to you want?"
