msgid "The Forgotten Temple is not currently open as it is under construction. We will reopen shortly. "
msgstr "遗忘神殿目前因修缮暂未开放。我们会很快重新开放。"

msgid "You don`t have the lottery tickets. You need lottery tickets to obtain gifts."
msgstr "你没有抽奖券。你需要抽奖券才能领取礼物。"

msgid "You brought lottery tickets. Do you want the gift?"
msgstr "你带来了抽奖券。你想要礼物吗？"

msgid "This is Bridewell Prison where players who engage in macro and other inappropriate activities are detained. If you believe you are being held wrongfully please consult Customer Service.   |1st warning : detained for 60 minutes |2nd warning : detained for 1  day |3rd warning : detained for 1 week |4th warning : account blockage"
msgstr "这里是 Bridewell 监狱，用于关押使用宏及其他违规行为的玩家。如果你认为自己被错误关押，请联系客服。|第一次警告：关押60分钟|第二次警告：关押1天|第三次警告：关押1周|第四次警告：封号"

msgid "I am Adelia descended from the heavens! The heavenly rabbits escaped to earth through broken fences. I will give you a present if you retrieve 5 heavenly rabbits for me. | If you have received Logo`s Shout from an event, it is not exchangeable."
msgstr "我是从天而降的阿德莉亚！天兔们冲破栅栏逃到了人间。如果你帮我找回5只天兔，我就送你一份礼物。|如果你是通过活动获得的洛戈斯呐喊，它不可交易。"

