msgid "This is the Discipline Dungeon. You have been charged of using a hack tool."
msgstr "这里是惩戒地牢。你被指控使用外挂工具。"

msgid "Master, I hear the mercenary captain is looking for men to join the bandit suppression squad. Let`s go check it out."
msgstr "主人，我听说佣兵队长在招人加入剿匪小队。我们去看看吧。"

msgid "As bandits are increasingly emerging In the mountain behind Moradon, I`m forming a suppression squad. Would you like to join?"
msgstr "莫拉登后山的强盗日益增多，我正在组建镇压小队。你想加入吗？"

msgid "Infiltrate the bandit base, eliminate their leader, and bring back the proof. Simple enough, no? "
msgstr "潜入强盗基地，消灭他们的首领，并把证明带回来。够简单了吧？"

msgid "The bandit suppression squad`s been already dispatched. Apply again later."
msgstr "剿匪小队已经派出了。稍后再来申请。"

msgid "Do you want to form a bandit suppression squad?"
msgstr "你想组建剿匪小队吗？"

msgid "Rock Mountain - Be careful of the Rock Giant who attacks from above the rock."
msgstr "岩石山——小心从岩石上方攻击你的岩石巨人。"

msgid "Picket fence barricade - Be wary of orc bandit archers who attack from behind the picket fences."
msgstr "尖栅栏路障——小心躲在尖栅栏后攻击你的兽人强盗弓箭手。"

msgid "Bandit hideout - Destroy the boss monster inside the hideout."
msgstr "强盗窝点——消灭窝点内的首领怪物。"

msgid "Master, this must be the proof. Let`s go see the mercenary captain now."
msgstr "主人，这一定就是证明了。我们现在去找佣兵队长吧。"

msgid "You don`t have the proof. Proof of the bandit leader is necklace worn by their boss Labuma. Kill him and bring me his necklace."
msgstr "你没有证明。强盗首领的证明是他们首领拉布玛戴的项链。杀了他，把他的项链带给我。"

msgid "The proof is authentic. Here, it should come into good use."
msgstr "证明是真的。给，这会派上好用场的。"

msgid "After wiping out the bandits and their boss Labuma, take his proof to Mercenary Captain Cougar for a reward."
msgstr "消灭强盗及其首领拉布玛后，把他的证明带给佣兵队长库加领赏。"

msgid "Master, I heard the mercenary captain is preparing a training evaluation. Let`s go see him."
msgstr "主人，我听说佣兵队长在准备训练考核。我们去找他吧。"

msgid "I think the time has come to test how much you`ve grown."
msgstr "我觉得是时候考验一下你成长了多少了。"

msgid "Don`t feel obligated. It`s not a difficult exam. Catch the Smirdon inside the stadium and bring back 10 Dragon Jewels. Isn`t it a piece of cake?"
msgstr "别有压力。这不是什么难考试。在竞技场内抓住斯米尔顿，带回10颗龙之宝石。不是小菜一碟吗？"

msgid "You came back after eliminating all 100, didn't you?|If you give me their lives, I will give you a reward in return."
msgstr "你把100只全消灭后才回来的，对吧？|如果你把它们的性命交给我，我就会给你奖赏。"

msgid "Master, all the Dragon Jewels have been collected. Let`s talk to the stadium manager and get out of here."
msgstr "主人，所有龙之宝石都收集齐了。我们去跟竞技场管理员谈谈，然后离开这里。"

msgid "You`re short on Dragon Jewels. Are you going to go back to the stadium?"
msgstr "你的龙之宝石不够。你要回竞技场吗？"

msgid "Good. You`re all right. I should give you an appropriate award for passing the test."
msgstr "好。你不错。你通过了考验，我该给你一份相应的奖励。"

msgid "You will pass the test if you catch the Smirdon in the arena where Mercenary Captain Cougar sends you and bring back 10 Dragon Jewels to him."
msgstr "只要你在佣兵队长库加派你去的竞技场内抓住斯米尔顿，并把10颗龙之宝石带给他，你就会通过考验。"

msgid "That gate in the front is the first right of passage to the bandit hideout. If you want to leave, click on[Withdraw from bandit suppression squad]."
msgstr "前方那扇门是通往强盗窝点的第一道必经之路。如果你想离开，点击[退出剿匪小队]。"

msgid "Please keep this in mind if you want to proceed. The monsters here are not a mob of bandits. Their attack is methodical enough to have demolished the previous suppression squad."
msgstr "如果你要继续，请记住这一点。这里的怪物不是一群乌合之众。它们的攻击很有章法，足以击溃上一支镇压小队。"

msgid "To enter the bandit hideout, you must pass the first right of passage at front and pass through the land of the Rock Giants. Be careful as Rock Giants attack from above the rocks there."
msgstr "要进入强盗窝点，你必须通过前方的第一道必经之路，穿过岩石巨人之地。那里的岩石巨人会从岩石上方攻击，要小心。"

msgid "If you cross the river in the center, you will approach the bandit hideout. Orcs and archers will surface from that point. If you kill the archers and advance, you will find Bandit Boss Labuma."
msgstr "如果你穿过中央的河，就会接近强盗窝点。兽人弓箭手会从那里出现。如果你杀了弓箭手继续前进，就会找到强盗首领拉布玛。"

msgid "Killing Bandit Boss Labuma awards proof of the bandit leader. Take the proof to Mercenary Captain Cougar and he will give you a big reward. "
msgstr "击杀强盗首领拉布玛会获得强盗首领证明。把证明带给佣兵队长库加，他会给你一大笔奖励。"

msgid "Sorry, you can`t leave."
msgstr "抱歉，你不能离开。"

msgid "Master, Mercenary Captain Cougar is performing training assessment. Let`s go take the test."
msgstr "主人，佣兵队长库加正在进行训练考核。我们去参加考试吧。"

msgid "You want to provide proof of your training? Let`s see. Here it is, <selfname>. "
msgstr "你想证明你的训练成果？我看看。好了，给你，<selfname>。"

msgid "You need more training. How do I know that? Not just anyone becomes mercenary captain, you know. You have be at least Level 40 to prove yourself."
msgstr "你需要更多训练。我怎么知道的？佣兵队长可不是谁都能当的。你至少要到40级才能证明自己。"

msgid "It`s time for you to prove your training. I will send to a place teeming with goblins I raised just for warrior training purposes. They`re not just your stock goblins so they`ll be a formidable opponent. If your power increases in there you can leave."
msgstr "是时候证明你的训练成果了。我会把你送到一个满是哥布林的地方，那些哥布林是我专门为训练战士养的。它们可不是普通哥布林，会是个强劲的对手。如果你在那里力量提升了，就可以离开。"

msgid "You don`t need to prove your training. Goodbye."
msgstr "你不需要证明你的训练成果。再见。"

msgid "Your ability has been enhanced, Master. I think we can leave now."
msgstr "你的能力提升了，主人。我想我们现在可以离开了。"

msgid "Catch the goblin at the spot where Captain Cougar sends you and upgrade your ability. The test is completed by upgrading your ability and talking to the stadium manager."
msgstr "在库加队长派你去的地方抓住哥布林，提升你的能力。提升能力后与竞技场管理员对话即可完成考核。"

msgid "Master, I hear monsters are raiding people in herds. Captain Polkwein seems to be forming a monster suppression squad. Let`s go check it out."
msgstr "主人，我听说怪物成群结队地袭击人。波尔克温队长好像在组建怪物镇压小队。我们去看看吧。"

msgid "Monsters have grown brave and are increasingly attacking merchants and civilian residents so we`re trying to locate their hide out and wipe them out. I can only send you as a party no matter how strong you are. It`s for your own good. Don`t object."
msgstr "怪物胆子大了，越来越多地袭击商人和平民，所以我们正设法找到它们的窝点并消灭它们。不管你多强，我都只能以队伍形式派你去。这是为你好。别反对。"

msgid "The task is too trivial for someone of your ability. I`ll summon you if something more important comes up."
msgstr "这个任务对你这样的人来说太琐碎了。有更重要的事我再叫你。"

msgid "I hear the monsters have taken refuge in the Delok Creek in Kartia Desert. If you kill Ripper, their leader, and bring me the proof, you don`t have to worry about going. I`ve already pulled some strings. "
msgstr "我听说怪物躲进了卡提亚沙漠的德洛克溪谷。如果你杀了它们的首领撕裂者，把证明带给我，你就不用愁去不了了。我已经打点好了一些关系。"

msgid "You won`t be able to pull it off on your own. Not even our best and brightest could get rid of them. I`ll send you if you come back in a party."
msgstr "你一个人办不成这事。就连我们最精锐的人都没能除掉它们。你组好队再来，我就派你去。"

msgid "Are you joining the monster suppression squad?"
msgstr "你要加入怪物镇压小队吗？"

msgid "This is the proof. If we take this to Fargo, he will give a reward."
msgstr "这就是证明。我们把它带给法戈，他会给奖励的。"

msgid "This is the proof. If we take this to Polkwein, he will give a reward."
msgstr "这就是证明。我们把它带给波尔克温，他会给奖励的。"

msgid "You have to kill Monster Leader Ripper and bring back proof. Don`t tell me you still haven`t even gone near him."
msgstr "你必须杀死怪物首领撕裂者并带回证明。别告诉我你还根本没靠近过他。"

msgid "All right. Here`s the reward. Knew you could do it."
msgstr "好吧。这是奖励。我就知道你能行。"

msgid "Get Captain Polkwein`s monster suppression squad request, join the squad, kill their leader Ripper and bring the captain the proof."
msgstr "接下波尔克温队长的怪物镇压小队请求，加入小队，杀死它们的首领撕裂者，把证明带给队长。"

msgid "How odd. The monster raids have decreased but plagues and famine are breaking out in its place. We formed a suppression squad to assess the reason. "
msgstr "真奇怪。怪物袭击减少了，却取而代之爆发了瘟疫和饥荒。我们组建了一支镇压小队去查明原因。"

msgid "The task is too small for someone of your ability. I`ll summon you if something more important comes up."
msgstr "这个任务对你这样的人来说太小了。有更重要的事我再叫你。"

msgid "We lost contact with the suppression squad which traveled far and wide to discover the reason but we lost contact with them in the Pizarre Snowfield. We dispatched search parties 3 times and found out why. Ferocious monsters are guarding something there and a powerful curse energy has been detected as well. There must be a link to the events in the mainland. Kill the monsters and investigate the curse energy. Monster power is stronger than anywhere else there. If you die, your weapons and armor will incur extensive damage."
msgstr "我们派去四处查明原因的镇压小队在皮扎雪原失去了联系。我们派出了三支搜索队才查明原因。凶猛的怪物在那里守护着什么东西，还探测到一股强大的诅咒能量。这一定和大陆上的事件有关联。杀死怪物，调查诅咒能量。那里的怪物力量比别处都强。如果你死了，你的武器和护甲会受到严重损坏。"

msgid "Do you want to join the Devil`s Army suppression squad?"
msgstr "你想加入恶魔军团镇压小队吗？"

msgid "Did you even approach the recesses of the curse energy? Don`t tell me you lost how to get there."
msgstr "你到底有没有靠近诅咒能量的深处？别告诉我你连怎么去都忘了。"

msgid "So that`s what happened. Thank you anyhow. Here`s your reward."
msgstr "原来是这么回事。不管怎样，谢谢你。这是你的奖励。"

msgid "Kill the monsters who were former members of the Devil`s Army, investigate the curse energy and go to Captain Polkwein."
msgstr "杀死那些曾是恶魔军团成员的怪物，调查诅咒能量，然后去找波尔克温队长。"

msgid "Passionate Warrior`s Desert - Lose the monsters who are chasing you."
msgstr "热血战士沙漠——甩掉追你的怪物。"

msgid "Abandoned Relic Site - Be careful of the scouters hiding out in the relic site."
msgstr "废弃遗迹——小心躲在遗迹里的侦察者。"

msgid "Abandoned Temple - Eliminate Ripper, the monster leader, and take the proof to the captain."
msgstr "废弃神殿——消灭怪物首领撕裂者，把证明带给队长。"

msgid "Ice Hill - Be careful of the monsters who attack from to the hilltop"
msgstr "冰丘——小心从山顶攻击你的怪物"

msgid "Frigid pond - Be wary of the monsters who attack from inside the seemingly lifeless pond."
msgstr "寒潭——小心从看似毫无生气的池塘里攻击你的怪物。"

msgid "Altar of Ice - Pathos`s subordinates who are casting curse at mainland must be killed."
msgstr "冰之祭坛——必须杀死那些向大陆降下诅咒的帕特奥斯部下。"

msgid "Great. Here`s your reward. Knew you`d be able to do it."
msgstr "很好。这是你的奖励。我就知道你能行。"

msgid "Get Captain Fargo`s monster suppression squad request, join the squad, kill their leader Ripper and bring the captain the proof."
msgstr "接下法戈队长的怪物镇压小队请求，加入小队，杀死它们的首领撕裂者，把证明带给队长。"

msgid "Kill the monsters who were former members of the Devil`s Army, investigate the curse energy and go to Captain Fargo."
msgstr "杀死那些曾是恶魔军团成员的怪物，调查诅咒能量，然后去找法戈队长。"

msgid "Master, I hear the plagues circulating. Something feels ominous. Let`s go ask Captain Polkwein."
msgstr "主人，我听说瘟疫在蔓延。感觉有不祥的事。我们去问问波尔克温队长吧。"

msgid "This is the certificate. Fargo will give you a reward for it."
msgstr "这就是证明书。法戈会因此给你奖励。"

msgid "Caution - Your CONT will drop if you die. Take caution."
msgstr "警告——你死了贡献值会下降。小心。"

msgid "Who are you then?|New face, you could die wandering around here. Hide yourself, quickly."
msgstr "你是谁？|新面孔，你在这附近乱逛会死的。快躲起来。"

msgid "Master! Moradon Merchant Shaimer is looking for you. Hmm~ He is becoming a bother for my master!!"
msgstr "主人！莫拉登商人沙默在找你。哼~他都成我主人的麻烦了！！"

msgid "Ahhh~ My savior, <selfname>! Listen up. One of the nobles in Moradon is collecting eyes. Funny guy, but anyway. He's collected almost every monster eye around, except for the  Eyes of Rotten Eye... And guess who he's asked to find it for him? He's always coming by doing business with the boss, so I couldn't refuse him..."
msgstr "啊~我的救星，<selfname>！听好了。莫拉登有个贵族在收集眼睛。怪人一个，不过无所谓。他几乎收集了附近所有怪物的眼睛，除了腐眼之眼……你猜他托谁去找？他总来跟老板做生意，我没法拒绝他……"

msgid "Well, there's not much I can do because as you know,  even the hunters stay away from those zombies. So you can see my dilemma. You up for a bit of eye collection then?"
msgstr "唉，我也没办法，因为你也知道，连猎人都躲着那些僵尸。所以你看我多为难。那你愿意帮忙收集一些眼睛吗？"

msgid "Master, you've collected enough Rotten Eyes. Let's get out of here as soon as possible."
msgstr "主人，你已经收集了足够的腐眼。我们尽快离开这里吧。"

msgid "That's some weird hobby he's got there. Blurgh~ It makes me feel sick."
msgstr "他这爱好真够怪的。呃~我都想吐了。"

msgid "Ill... Yuk|Good effort though. I was worried you wouldn't make it back from this one. Thank you so much. Ill... Yuk~ Yuk~"
msgstr "恶心……咦|不过你干得不错。我还担心你这次回不来呢。太感谢了。恶心……咦~咦~"

msgid "Master! Moradon Merchant Clark is looking for you. Hmm~ He is becoming a bother for my master!!"
msgstr "主人！莫拉登商人克拉克在找你。哼~他都成我主人的麻烦了！！"

msgid "Hmm... Well, Fargo seems to hold your skills in high esteem. But I still need to see for myself just how good you are. As Fargo introduced you to me, I will give you the fund needed for the adventure. Grab your gear and follow me. I'll explain on the way"
msgstr "嗯……好吧，法戈似乎很看重你的本事。但我还是要亲眼看看你到底有多强。既然是法戈把你介绍给我的，我会给你冒险所需的资金。拿上你的装备跟我来。路上我再解释"

msgid "I might be able to see him when I resign. Ha Ha!"
msgstr "我辞职后说不定就能见到他了。哈哈！"

msgid "I don't know how many years it's been living with all this tension. It'll be so good just to relax and have a drink with  Cougar today..."
msgstr "这种提心吊胆的日子不知过了多少年。今天能放松下来跟库加喝一杯就太好了……"

msgid "These days, Silver Feather is very popular with the society crowd."
msgstr "最近，银羽毛在上流社会很受欢迎。"

msgid "Erm, Silver Feather? Silver Feather shines, even at night~ just wear it once, and you'll feel like a god~~ Heh, It's the one material that's never left out of a noble woman's dress. But, being so valuable, it's a bugger to get hold of."
msgstr "呃，银羽毛？银羽毛就算在夜里也会发光~只要戴一次，你就会觉得自己像神一样~嘿，它是贵妇裙子上从不缺的材料。可它这么值钱，真难弄到。"

msgid "I heard that some of the  Saber Tooths have Silver Feathers... But I'm not sure if this is entirely true. Anyway, can you please hunt me down some Silver Feather? I'll make some profit selling it, and you'll get some decent EXP. Everyone's a winner! Hee Hee!"
msgstr "我听说有些剑齿虎身上有银羽毛……但我不确定这是不是完全真的。不管怎样，你能帮我猎一些银羽毛来吗？我卖了能赚点钱，你也能拿到不少经验值。双赢！嘿嘿！"

msgid "Weelll.... Not every Saber Tooth has Silver Feather. Anyway Master, you tried hard."
msgstr "唉……不是每只剑齿虎都有银羽毛。不过主人，你已经很努力了。"

msgid "I need at least  <font color=@#660066@>3 Silver Hairs</font> to make a profit. Yes, indeed."
msgstr "我至少需要<font color=@#660066@>3根银毛</font>才能赚钱。是的，没错。"

msgid "Wow! The shine! It must be Silver Feather~!!"
msgstr "哇！这光泽！一定是银羽毛~！！"

msgid "Hmm... Well, Polkwein seems to hold your skills in high esteem. But I still need to see for myself just how good you are. As Polkwein introduced you to me, I will give you the fund needed for the adventure. Grab your gear and follow me. I'll explain on the way"
msgstr "嗯……好吧，波尔克温似乎很看重你的本事。但我还是要亲眼看看你到底有多强。既然是波尔克温把你介绍给我的，我会给你冒险所需的资金。拿上你的装备跟我来。路上我再解释"

msgid "Ach, the enemy's too bloody strong. At least  Cougar is by my side. To the death!"
msgstr "唉，敌人太强了。至少库加在我身边。死战到底！"

msgid "Are you new here?|Don't relax in Ronark Land. It's far too dangerous. If you don't wish to die, that is..."
msgstr "你是新来的吗？|在罗纳克大陆别放松警惕。这里太危险了。如果你不想死的话……"

msgid "Master! Shaimer is once again looking for some material..."
msgstr "主人！沙默又在找什么材料了……"

msgid "Wow, the grapevine's smoking today!|So, you remember Karon that you helped out before? She said that Blood of Beast you brought her was really quality stuff. So now she wants you to get her some  Skeletons!"
msgstr "哇，今天消息传得真快！|你还记得你以前帮过的卡隆吗？她说你带给她的野兽之血质量真不错。所以现在她想让你给她弄些骷髅！"

msgid "You might already know, but anyway I want to ask you for those Skeletons. A friend told me you can easily get the Apple of Moradon from  Skeleton Warriors. Makes sense I suppose! "
msgstr "你也许已经知道了，但我还是想跟你要那些骷髅。一个朋友告诉我，你能很容易从骷髅战士身上弄到莫拉登苹果。我觉得有道理！"

msgid "One, two, and three Apples of Moradon! Success!"
msgstr "一、二、三个莫拉登苹果！成功！"

msgid "My trust in you knows no bounds, <selfname>!! Heh!"
msgstr "我对你的信任无边无际，<selfname>！！嘿！"

msgid "WoW, there's nothing you can't get!"
msgstr "哇，没有你弄不到的东西！"

msgid "Master! Clark is once again looking for some material..."
msgstr "主人！克拉克又在找什么材料了……"

msgid "Hmm... Rage is not someone who would do that... I don't know how good you are, but you've done a lot of good deeds for the country. Here, use this for purchasing goods for war. And, let me explain about ¡®here' briefly."
msgstr "嗯……拉格不是会做那种事的人……我不知道你有多强，但你为国家做了不少好事。来，用这个购买军需物资。另外，我简单给你讲讲¡®这里¡¯的情况。"

msgid "Rage! My good, old friend..."
msgstr "拉格！我的老伙计……"

msgid "Master! Shaimer's merchant caravan has been attacked by someone while on the move. You should go and see if they need assistance."
msgstr "主人！沙默的商队在路上被人袭击了。你该去看看他们是否需要帮助。"

msgid "Phew... We were on the way to Moradon with all the stuff you found for us. Somewhere along the way though, bandits ambushed us, gave us a real good beating. we've patched ourselves up as best as we can, but... There are still some serious injuries, broken bones and so on..."
msgstr "呼……我们带着你帮我们找到的所有货物往莫拉登走。可走到半路，强盗伏击了我们，把我们狠狠揍了一顿。我们已经尽力包扎了，可……还有些重伤、骨折之类的……"

msgid "Maybe it's true, maybe not, but I heard if you grind <font color=@#660066@>Coarse Bone Powder</font> into a potion, it heals broken bones. Three men are wounded, so 3 portions would do it. Please help us."
msgstr "不知真假，但我听说把<font color=@#660066@>粗骨粉</font>磨进药里能治骨折。有三个人受伤，所以3份就够了。请帮帮我们。"

msgid "3 Coarse Bone Powders have been gathered. Hope it's not too late."
msgstr "3份粗骨粉已收集齐。希望还不算太晚。"

msgid "Can you please hurry up? There isn't much time left before these injuries become fatal."
msgstr "你能快点吗？这些伤要变成致命伤就没多少时间了。"

msgid "I don't know what to say... I'm constantly in your debt. My staff are like my family to me. Thank you so, so much."
msgstr "我都不知道说什么好了……我一直欠你的人情。我的伙计们就像我的家人。太感谢了。"

msgid "Master! Clark's merchant caravan has been attacked by someone while on the move. You should go and see if they need assistance."
msgstr "主人！克拉克的商队在路上被人袭击了。你该去看看他们是否需要帮助。"

msgid "I recommend you return to Karus and really get to know it. You'll be able to increase your strength fighting tougher monsters, and there's a lot of good adventures to be had around Karus' heart, Luferson Castle. Would you like to go there? "
msgstr "我建议你回卡鲁斯好好了解一下。你可以通过挑战更强的怪物提升实力，在卡鲁斯的中心卢弗森城堡周围还有很多精彩的冒险。你想去那里吗？"

msgid "Supply goods cannot just be given away unless they're already personal property. Until the approval comes down from Rage..."
msgstr "补给物资不能随便送人，除非它们已经是个人财产。在拉格的批文下来之前……"

msgid "Master! Merchant Shaimer seems to have good news, so let's go and find out^^"
msgstr "主人！商人沙默好像有好消息，我们去看看吧^^"

msgid "There's a memorial service being held at Moradon Castle to give thanks for the peace, and they're buying all the Memorial Goods from our boss. Great news, eh?"
msgstr "莫拉登城堡要举办一场感恩和平的祭奠仪式，他们正从我们老板这里买下所有祭奠用品。好消息，是吧？"

msgid "There is one small problem, though. A couple of Apples of Moradon were in route to Moradon for the memorial service, but heavy sand storms have seriously delayed their arrival. I can't just give up now, supplying these Memorial Goods is a huge honor for my family. I'm really up against it this time..."
msgstr "不过有个小问题。有几批莫拉登苹果正运往莫拉登供祭奠之用，但沙尘暴让它们严重延误了。我现在不能放弃，供应这些祭奠用品对我们家来说是莫大的荣誉。我这次真的被逼到份上了……"

msgid "Really, there isn't much time left. Please rush to deliver them to Shaimer."
msgstr "真的，没多少时间了。请赶快把它们送给沙默。"

msgid "Yikes, what am I going to do, there isn't much time to prepare for the Memorial service!"
msgstr "哎呀，我该怎么办，准备祭奠仪式的时间不多了！"

msgid "Nice~ Timing~~!! Thank you so much. I'm going to tell everyone how <selfname> saved the service! Heh."
msgstr "太好了~来得正是时候~~！！太感谢了。我要告诉大家<selfname>是如何救了这场祭奠的！嘿。"

msgid "Master! Merchant Clark seems to have good news, so let's go and find out^^"
msgstr "主人！商人克拉克好像有好消息，我们去看看吧^^"

msgid "Master, Do you know the village known as  Folk Village? It's a small village just outside Moradon Castle... Why not pay ¡®em a visit?"
msgstr "主人，你知道那个叫民俗村庄的村子吗？它就在莫拉登城堡外不远……何不去拜访一下呢？"

msgid "Really, there isn't much time left. Please rush to deliver them to Clark."
msgstr "真的，没多少时间了。请赶快把它们送给克拉克。"

msgid "You want me to just let you run around in the Armor supply?|You know the stuff in there is state property, right? It's forbidden to use any of it for personal use."
msgstr "你想让我就这么放你在护甲补给处乱逛？|你知道那里的东西是国家财产吧？严禁私用。"

msgid "I don't know what's going, on but I'm in a hurry here, so go talk with Quartermaster Osmond about it."
msgstr "我不知道发生了什么，但我这儿正忙着，你去找军需官奥斯蒙德谈这事吧。"

msgid "Master! Did you know that these days Orc Talismans are used for making weapons? Why's that? Would Shaimer know why?"
msgstr "主人！你知道吗，最近兽人护符被用来打造武器？这是为什么？沙默会知道原因吗？"

msgid "Ah~ an Orc Talisman?|I've heard that Moradon's [Blacksmith] Heppa is always interested in making special weapons. He and I have traded a lot of stuff, and Orc Talismans have always been the most popular."
msgstr "啊~兽人护符？|我听说莫拉登的[铁匠]赫帕一直对打造特殊武器很感兴趣。他和我交易过很多东西，兽人护符一直是最受欢迎的。"

msgid "Phew... <selfname> knows too much about me!  It's really quite simple - Orc Talismans are found on Lard Orc's armor. One more thing - Lard Orcs are really ugly."
msgstr "呼……<selfname>太了解我了！其实很简单——兽人护符在肥兽人的护甲上。还有一件事——肥兽人真的很丑。"

msgid "Is this an Orc Talisman? Looks like scrap to me..."
msgstr "这是兽人护符？我看着像废品……"

msgid "Heppa wants 1,000 of 'em this month, and I'm... hmm... exactly 7 short. Not bad."
msgstr "赫帕这个月要1000个，而我……嗯……正好缺7个。不错。"

msgid "Ah, so this month's trade with Heppa was a success. Thanks."
msgstr "啊，这个月和赫帕的交易成功了。谢谢。"

msgid "Master! Did you know that these days Orc Talismans are used for making weapons? Why's that? Would Clark know why?"
msgstr "主人！你知道吗，最近兽人护符被用来打造武器？这是为什么？克拉克会知道原因吗？"

msgid "<selfname>, you're quite a persevering soul, aren't you? Okay, let's do this then. As I said before, I cannot supply goods unless they're personally owned. But it'd be different if you did something for Moradon."
msgstr "<selfname>，你还真有毅力，是吧？好吧，那就这么办。我以前说过，除非是私人物品，否则我不能发放物资。但如果你为莫拉登做点什么，那就另当别论了。"

msgid "Should I trust you? Ok, I'm putting you in charge of the Folk Village's security. Occasionally, the  Spoiler attacks traveling merchants near the village. I'll give you the supply docket that you want, if you take care of the Spoilers."
msgstr "我该信你吗？好吧，我让你负责民俗村庄的治安。偶尔，掠夺者会袭击村庄附近的行商。如果你解决掉掠夺者，我就给你想要的补给单。"

msgid "Is this Orc Talisman? Looks like scrap to me..."
msgstr "这是兽人护符？我看着像废品……"

msgid "<selfname>, comeback after you've finished the current mission. You must be getting lazy, pilling up all the missions and not finishing them."
msgstr "<selfname>，完成当前任务后再来。你肯定变懒了，任务堆一堆却不完成。"

msgid "These are good talismans! [Blacksmith] Heppa will be pleased.|So I'll reward you well if you bring me an [Orc Talisman]."
msgstr "这些护符不错！[铁匠]赫帕会高兴的。|所以如果你给我带来一个[兽人护符]，我会好好奖励你。"

msgid "Master! I hear that Shaimer is secretly trading with El Morad... That's no good! What does he think he's doing?"
msgstr "主人！我听说沙默在偷偷跟艾莫拉德做交易……这可不行！他以为他在干什么？"

msgid "What... How did you know about that?|Nobody knows about it... Well, to be honest I don't know too much either. All I know is that sometime ago El Morad offered me to trade  Oaths of Darkness quietly so I've been doing so, and nothing more than that."
msgstr "什么……你怎么知道的？|没人知道这事啊……好吧，老实说我也不太清楚。我只知道不久前艾莫拉德提出让我悄悄交易黑暗誓言，我就照做了，仅此而已。"

msgid "I was going to make this trade the last one. I don't want to get in too deep with those people, it's bad for business. Trading with them is just too much for my nerves to take, no matter how good the money is. And, I can't seem to fill the quantity for this last trade. Perhaps you could help me out here?"
msgstr "我本打算把这次交易作为最后一次。我不想跟那些人陷得太深，对生意不好。跟他们交易太让我神经紧张了，不管钱有多好赚。而且，这最后一次的数量我好像凑不齐。也许你能帮我一把？"

msgid "You've got enough Oaths of Darkness now, Master. Let's skedaddle. It so creepy here, I get frightened every time."
msgstr "主人，你现在的黑暗誓言够了。我们快溜吧。这里太瘆人了，我每次都害怕。"

msgid "By the way, what do these Oaths of Darkness do?"
msgstr "顺便问一句，这些黑暗誓言是干什么用的？"

msgid "Ahh, great, thank you.|I've lost weight worrying about this business. I'm not going to get involved in this part, it's too much for me."
msgstr "啊，太好了，谢谢。|我为这事操心都瘦了。这部分我不掺和了，我承受不了。"

msgid "Master! I hear that Clark is secretly trading with Karus... That's no good! What does he think he's doing?"
msgstr "主人！我听说克拉克在偷偷跟卡鲁斯做交易……这可不行！他以为他在干什么？"

msgid "I'm happy to report that the Spoiler-clearing mission is complete! Hee Hee!"
msgstr "我很高兴地报告，清除掠夺者的任务完成了！嘿嘿！"

msgid "You've got enough Oaths of Darkness now, Master. Let's skedaddle. It so creepy here. I get frightened every time."
msgstr "主人，你现在的黑暗誓言够了。我们快溜吧。这里太瘆人了。我每次都害怕。"

msgid "So, how goes it?"
msgstr "怎么样了？"

msgid "You clearly defeated them. Nice work. I was afraid that I would regret giving you that mission,  but it looks like I was wrong on that one. Anyway, well done. Here, it's the Boots of War Voucher I promised you. Show it to [Mercenary Supply Officer] Osmond."
msgstr "你显然击败了他们。干得好。我还怕给你那个任务会后悔呢，但看来我错了。总之，干得漂亮。给，这是我答应你的战争之靴凭证。把它拿给[佣兵补给官]奥斯蒙德看。"

msgid "Master. I think I hear the sound of Shaimer hitting jackpot even from here! Heh heh!"
msgstr "主人。我觉得我在这儿都能听见沙默中头奖的声音了！嘿嘿！"

msgid "Ha Ha, fortune eh? I've still got a long way to go yet! Ahh, Silver Feather-based clothes have become this season's must-have items for our Noble women. If you're not wearing  Silver Feather clothes, you're nobody!  The feathers are well known for their amazing color and incredible softness."
msgstr "哈哈，财运是吧？我还差得远呢！啊，以银羽毛为原料的衣服成了这季贵妇们的必备品。不穿银羽毛衣服，你就不算个角色！这种羽毛以惊人的色泽和不可思议的柔软而闻名。"

msgid "But, as always, supply is being outstripping by demand. I've hired some renowned Moradon hunters to gather the feathers for me, but it ain't easy because the  Meganterions are really brutal beasts. Ahem... <selfname>, perhaps you might have better luck in this endeavor? Heh Heh."
msgstr "不过，一如往常，供不应求。我雇了一些莫拉登有名的猎人帮我采集羽毛，可这不容易，因为巨型兽真的是凶猛的野兽。啊咳……<selfname>，也许你在这件事上运气会更好？嘿嘿。"

msgid "Phew! Master, you really tried hard. Looks like they really are hard to get."
msgstr "呼！主人，你真的很努力了。看来它们真的很难弄到。"

msgid "I need about 10 of ¡®em. Keep up the good work <selfname>! Hee Hee!"
msgstr "我大概需要10个。继续好好干，<selfname>！嘿嘿！"

msgid "Great work <selfname>, thanks to your effort, Moradon's ladies are still the best-dressed! Infinite thanks!"
msgstr "干得好<selfname>，多亏你的努力，莫拉登的女士们依然是穿得最时髦的！万分感谢！"

msgid "Master. I think I hear the sound of Clark hitting jackpot even from here! Heh heh!"
msgstr "主人。我觉得我在这儿都能听见克拉克中头奖的声音了！嘿嘿！"

msgid "Just wearing the Boots of War on their own without the rest of the War set doesn't look so good, Master. Couldn't you get the other parts too?"
msgstr "只穿战争之靴、不穿战争套装的其他部分看起来不太好看，主人。你不能把其他部位也弄来吗？"

msgid "Thanks to you, <selfname>, I can provide the textiles in time again.|If you hand me the [Silver Feather] I will give you a reward. "
msgstr "多亏了你，<selfname>，我又能及时供应纺织品了。|如果你把[银羽毛]交给我，我会给你奖励。"

msgid "Dead characters cannot enter. "
msgstr "死亡的角色无法进入。"

msgid "[Name Change Scroll]You must retrieve all of items in your mail box before changing character name. "
msgstr "[改名卷轴]更改角色名前，你必须先取回邮箱中的所有物品。"

msgid "The stars come out and the moon shines like never before. All signs of a fresh start and a new beginning. Come, I will bless the people with my sword and they'll be united in their strength and resolve. And when they are united so, the world will look on in wonder at the might of their souls."
msgstr "群星出现，月光前所未有地明亮。一切都预示着重生和新的开端。来吧，我将以我的剑祝福人民，他们将团结起力量与决心。当他们如此团结时，世界将惊叹于他们灵魂的伟力。"

msgid "When 10,000 Statues of Akarra have been gathered, a blessing of EXP will fall upon all Karus."
msgstr "当收集到10,000座阿卡拉雕像时，经验祝福将降临整个卡鲁斯。"

msgid "When 10,000 Statues of Akarra have been gathered, a blessing of EXP will fall upon all El Morad."
msgstr "当收集到10,000座阿卡拉雕像时，经验祝福将降临整个艾莫拉德。"

msgid "Recently, someone's been pilfering the military funds. I suspect my personal slave, but I want you to find out who it is for sure."
msgstr "最近有人在盗用军饷。我怀疑是我自己的奴隶，但我要你查清楚到底是谁。"

msgid "Move aside please, little one. You'll have to be much stronger if you want to talk to me."
msgstr "让开，小家伙。你要跟我说话，还得更强才行。"

msgid "Hey! Aren't you the famous <selfname>? I'm El Morad Castle's resident Nobleman, Alpuer Kane the 4th. I heard you were the ¡®Messenger of Love' between Karus's Warrior and the beautiful Nusram. Like many of our people, I've quite an interest in their sad love story. "
msgstr "嘿！你不就是那个有名的<selfname>吗？我是艾莫拉德城堡常驻贵族，阿尔普·凯恩四世。我听说你是卡鲁斯战士和美丽的努斯拉姆之间的¡®爱之使者¡¯。像我们许多人一样，我对他们的悲惨爱情故事很感兴趣。"

msgid "Listen, I want to help you. If you give me 10 [Will of War] I'll give the matter my full attention."
msgstr "听着，我想帮你。如果你给我10个[战争意志]，我就全力调查此事。"

msgid "Listen, I want to help you. If you bring me 10 [Will of War] I'll give the matter my full attention."
msgstr "听着，我想帮你。如果你给我带来10个[战争意志]，我就全力调查此事。"

msgid "First of all, find my slave. I suspect he might know about the missing military funds. See what you can find out. I'll reward you with a Red Treasure Chest! By the way, my slave's name is Triger."
msgstr "首先，找到我的奴隶。我怀疑他可能知道军饷失踪的事。看看你能查出什么。我会奖励你一个红色宝箱！对了，我奴隶的名字叫特里格。"

msgid "<selfname>, what kind of person is this Sentinel that Alpuer's talking about? "
msgstr "<selfname>，阿尔普说的这个哨兵是什么样的人？"

msgid "Back so soon? That's good then. Anyway, thank you for your all your effort, it's most appreciated. Here, by way of saying ¡®thanks' to you... Right now, there's a suspicious Sentinel in Moradon. I'm  off to check him out. Perhaps I will see you later? Until then."
msgstr "这么快就回来了？那挺好。总之，感谢你所做的一切，非常感激。来，作为对你的一点¡®谢意¡¯……现在莫拉登有个形迹可疑的哨兵。我这就去查查他。也许我们稍后再见？回见。"

msgid "Haven't you find him yet?"
msgstr "你还没找到他吗？"

msgid "Say what? Is my master looking for me? Bugger. What did I do wrong this time then? He accused me of stealing 4 gold bars last time. But, this is my fate, so off  I go. I¡®ll go and attend to him now. See you around. Perhaps.."
msgstr "你说什么？主人在找我？糟了。那这次我又做错什么了？上次他还告我偷了4根金条。不过，这就是我的命，那我走了。我这就去伺候他。回头见。也许吧……"

msgid "See you around. Perhaps.."
msgstr "回头见。也许吧……"

msgid "Where am I?"
msgstr "我在哪儿？"

msgid "You shouldn't trust the nobles too much. They look elegant and benign on the outside, but inside they're rotten to the core."
msgstr "你不该太信那些贵族。他们外表优雅和善，内心却烂到根子里。"

msgid "(Surprise~!) Holly~ You scared me! Have you heard the rumor? The Nobles are at war... ah~ never mind. Just pretend you didn't hear anything."
msgstr "（吓一跳~！）霍莉~你吓到我了！你听说那个传闻了吗？贵族们开战了……啊~算了。就当你什么都没听见。"

msgid "Yeah, I know. I heard the nobles pretend to work for peace, but in fact are only trying to prolong the violence. Gods know why they'd do that... But I hate them for it because I'm the one who actually has to go out there and fight, when I'm recruited."
msgstr "嗯，我知道。我听说贵族们假装为和平奔走，实际上只是想拖延暴力。天知道他们为什么要这么做……可我因此恨他们，因为真被征召出去打仗的是我。"

msgid "I also heard that Alpuer Kane the 4th is involved in some fishy business. He looks like he stinks anyway. Ha. That's about all I know. You should meet Alpuer Kane the 4th yourself if you want more details."
msgstr "我还听说阿尔普·凯恩四世牵涉进什么可疑的勾当。反正他看起来就很臭。哈。我知道的就这些。你想要更多细节，就自己去见阿尔普·凯恩四世吧。"

msgid "Who says talk is cheap!"
msgstr "谁说说话不花钱！"

msgid "Give this to the Karus warrior, Klasras."
msgstr "把这个交给卡鲁斯战士克拉斯拉斯。"

msgid "Give this to El Morad's Lady Nusram."
msgstr "把这个交给艾莫拉德的努斯拉姆女士。"

msgid "Eh? So, <selfname>, we meet again! Do you think our destinies might be meeting briefly? (Smirk)~ Do me a favor would you-"
msgstr "嗯？这么说，<selfname>，我们又见面了！你觉得我们的命运是不是短暂交汇了？（坏笑）~帮我个忙好吗——"

msgid "I'm disturbed by the fact that even though we strive for peace, the enemy continues to slowly invade our land. So I was wondering. Wouldn't peace fall on the Adonisian Continent if Klasras and Nusram's love were to be given full bloom?"
msgstr "令我不安的是，尽管我们努力追求和平，敌人仍在不断蚕食我们的土地。所以我在想。如果让克拉斯拉斯和努斯拉姆的爱情充分绽放，阿多尼斯大陆不就会迎来和平了吗？"

msgid "So, let us first gather 20 [Will of War]. We'll talk about the rest later."
msgstr "那么，我们先收集20个[战争意志]。其余的以后再说。"

msgid "Will you give this to Klasras? Tell her it's a small present in the name of El Morad. I'll give you 3 Fragments of Sloth if you deliver it safely."
msgstr "你愿不愿意把这个交给克拉斯拉斯？告诉她这是代表艾莫拉德的一点小礼物。如果你安全送到，我会给你3个懒惰碎片。"

msgid "Good job <selfname>, well done!"
msgstr "干得好<selfname>，漂亮！"

msgid "Ah~ You delivered it? Excellent, here're the Fragments as promised. It won't be long now before their love unites them in time and place... I'm so glad..."
msgstr "啊~你送到了？太好了，这是说好的碎片。用不了多久，他们的爱情就会让他们在时空里相聚了……我真高兴……"

msgid "Deliver it safely please."
msgstr "请安全送到。"

msgid "Send word of the good news to my brother!"
msgstr "把这个好消息捎信给我兄弟！"

msgid "WoW! This is... precious... Thank you. Thank you so much for caring about the two of us."
msgstr "哇！这……太珍贵了……谢谢你。太感谢你关心我们俩了。"

msgid "Master, You should return to that Alpuer Kane the 4th now and give him the message."
msgstr "主人，你现在该回到那个阿尔普·凯恩四世那里，把消息告诉他。"

msgid "Master, How about sharing the good news with Nusram? Ohhh, it'd be good if you could take 20 [Will of War] with you, too."
msgstr "主人，把这个好消息告诉努斯拉姆怎么样？哦，要是你能带上20个[战争意志]就更好了。"

msgid "Is that what the nobility said? Really? I'm delighted to hear it. Ahh, the sky is so clear, they must be celebrating for us. I must tell my brother the good news..."
msgstr "贵族们真这么说吗？真的？听到这我太高兴了。啊，天空这么晴朗，他们一定在为我们庆祝。我得把这个好消息告诉我兄弟……"

msgid "You don't have any [Will of War] with you though. Show me your Will. Show me 20, that should be enough."
msgstr "可你身上一个[战争意志]都没有。给我看看你的意志。给我20个，应该就够了。"

msgid "My brother is the Nameless Warrior. You should have seen him around the Tomb. He'll be delighted when he hears about this. You will help me, won't you?"
msgstr "我兄弟就是无名战士。你该在墓碑附近见过他。他听到这消息会高兴的。你会帮我的，对吧？"

msgid "What...Is that really true? Finally, there might be an end to this ancestral war. Peace will come and blanket us, and I will even be able to close my eyes and rest. The most amazing thing is that the nobles are encouraging and blessing this peace. I still can't believe it..."
msgstr "什么……这是真的吗？这场祖传的战争终于可能要结束了。和平会降临、笼罩我们，我甚至可以闭眼安息了。最了不起的是贵族们竟在鼓励和祝福这场和平。我还是不敢相信……"

msgid "Anyway, thank you so much. I don't have much to give, but please accept this. Please, send my appreciation to Alpuer Kane the 4th when you see him."
msgstr "总之，太感谢了。我没什么可给的，但请收下这个。请你见到阿尔普·凯恩四世时转达我的谢意。"

msgid "Master, How about telling ol' Alpuer Kane the 4th about all this good stuff? Just checking, but you do have 20 [Will of War], right?"
msgstr "主人，把这些好事告诉老阿尔普·凯恩四世怎么样？随便问问，不过你身上有20个[战争意志]吧？"

msgid "Ahh, how is my sister Nusram doing these days."
msgstr "啊，我妹妹努斯拉姆近来可好。"

msgid "Welcome. I've just received some Holy Water directly from El Morad's own King, and I'd like you to personally give it to them as a symbol of the peace."
msgstr "欢迎。我刚从艾莫拉德国王那里直接收到一些圣水，我想请你亲手把它交给他们，作为和平的象征。"

msgid "Long time no see. If you want to talk to me, you'll need 20 [Will of War]."
msgstr "好久不见。你要是想跟我谈话，需要20个[战争意志]。"

msgid "When you give the Holy Water to Klasras, you'll be helping the people of his nation to receive the Worship of Peace. I'll pay you 2 Fragments of Jealousy. Will you do it?"
msgstr "你把圣水交给克拉斯拉斯时，就是在帮助他国家的人民接受和平崇拜。我会付你2个嫉妒碎片。你愿意做吗？"

msgid "You must give this Holy Water to Klasras."
msgstr "你必须把这圣水交给克拉斯拉斯。"

msgid "You must give this Holy Water to Nusram."
msgstr "你必须把这圣水交给努斯拉姆。"

msgid "Heh Heh Heh... Yes, yes. You did just as I asked, well done. Peace! What bloody peace? History is written in war and blood. Ha ha ha ha!! Those who do not write history, die in it instead!! Well done anyway. Here's your cut. Mwuahahahahaha!!!"
msgstr "嘿嘿嘿……好，好。你照我说的做了，干得好。和平！哪门子和平？历史是用战争和鲜血写成的。哈哈哈哈！！那些写不了历史的人，就死在历史里吧！！总之干得不错。这是你的那份。呜哈哈哈哈哈！！！"

msgid "You must deliver this!"
msgstr "你必须把这个送到！"

msgid "When you give the Holy Water to Klasras, you'll be helping the people of his nation to receive the Worship of Peace. I will pay you 2 Fragments of Jealousy, or 25 million EXP. Will you do this?"
msgstr "你把圣水交给克拉斯拉斯时，就是在帮助他国家的人民接受和平崇拜。我会付你2个嫉妒碎片，或2500万经验值。你愿意做吗？"

msgid "What's that? You should see the look on your face! You're no match for me yet! Mwuahahaha~ Finally, the war has begun!!"
msgstr "怎么回事？你真该看看你那张脸！你还不是我的对手！呜哈哈哈~终于，战争开始了！！"

msgid "Huh! Did Alpuer really give this to you? How nice... Well then, I accept it with gratitude."
msgstr "啊！阿尔普真的把这个给你了？真好……那好，我感激地收下了。"

msgid "(~worried~) Errr What... What is this? How... How could you... rr...Errr..argh...err..."
msgstr "（~担心~）呃啊……什么……这是什么？你……你怎么能……呃……啊……呃……"

msgid "Why won't you give it to me?"
msgstr "你为什么不把它给我？"

msgid "No, something is wrong... Oh gods... I feel the war is almost upon us... Aieeee! Where... Where's my weapon? My weapon is missing! Gone! It was a +8 Dagger!"
msgstr "不，有什么不对劲……众神啊……我感觉战争就要来了……啊啊啊！我的武器……我的武器呢？我的武器不见了！没了！那可是一把+8的匕首啊！"

msgid "What am I going to do? I was wearing a Dagger (+8) a moment ago, and now... Blast!"
msgstr "我该怎么办？刚才我还拿着一把匕首(+8)，现在……该死！"

msgid "Phew! Thank you so much! Please, for finding my Dagger, choose whatever you want."
msgstr "呼！太感谢了！为了感谢你找到我的匕首，你想要什么尽管挑。"

msgid "I'm busy because I haven't found my dagger yet. Hmm..."
msgstr "我还忙着呢，因为我还没找到我的匕首。嗯……"

msgid "Eh? Isn't that short sword actually a Dagger (+8)? You going to give it to me or what?"
msgstr "嗯？那把短剑不就是一把匕首(+8)吗？你到底给不给我？"

msgid "Hey! Aren't you the famous <selfname>? I'm Luferson's resident Nobility, Chronoris Shes. I heard you were the ¡®Messenger of Love' between Karus's Warrior and the beautiful Nusram. Like many of our people, I've quite an interest in their sad love story. "
msgstr "嘿！你不就是那个有名的<selfname>吗？我是卢弗森的常驻贵族，克罗诺里斯·谢斯。我听说你是卡鲁斯战士和美丽的努斯拉姆之间的¡®爱之使者¡¯。像我们许多人一样，我对他们的悲惨爱情故事很感兴趣。"

msgid "I want to help you. If you bring me 10 [Will of War] I will consider it."
msgstr "我想帮你。如果你给我带来10个[战争意志]，我就考虑。"

msgid "First, find my slave. I suspect he might know about the missing military funds. See what you can find out. I'll reward you with a Red Treasure Chest! By the way, my slave's name is Takatu."
msgstr "首先，找到我的奴隶。我怀疑他可能知道军饷失踪的事。看看你能查出什么。我会奖励你一个红色宝箱！对了，我奴隶的名字叫塔卡图。"

msgid "<selfname>, what kind of person is this Sentinel that Chronoris's talking about?"
msgstr "<selfname>，克罗诺里斯说的这个哨兵是什么样的人？"

msgid "What? Is my master looking for me? Phew... What did I do wrong this time... He accused me of stealing 4 gold bars last time... But, this is my fate so I must go. I must go to my master now. Then I will see you next time."
msgstr "什么？主人在找我？呼……我这次又做错什么了……上次他还告我偷了4根金条……不过，这就是我的命，我必须去。我现在必须去见主人。那我们下次再见。"

msgid "Then I will see you next time"
msgstr "那我们下次再见"

msgid "I also heard that Chronoris Shes is involved in some fishy business. He looks like he stinks anyway. Ha. That's about all I know. You should meet Chronoris Shes yourself for more detail..."
msgstr "我还听说克罗诺里斯·谢斯牵涉进什么可疑的勾当。反正他看起来就很臭。哈。我知道的就这些。你想要更多细节，就自己去见克罗诺里斯·谢斯吧……"

msgid "Will you give this to Nusram? Tell her it's a small present in the name of Karus. I will give you 3 Fragments of Sloth if you deliver it safely."
msgstr "你愿不愿意把这个交给努斯拉姆？告诉她这是代表卡鲁斯的一点小礼物。如果你安全送到，我会给你3个懒惰碎片。"

msgid "Master, You should go see Chronoris Shes now and give him the message."
msgstr "主人，你现在该去见克罗诺里斯·谢斯，把消息告诉他。"

msgid "Master, How about sharing the good news with Klasras? Ohhh, it'd be good if you could take 20 [Will of War] with you, too."
msgstr "主人，把这个好消息告诉克拉斯拉斯怎么样？哦，要是你能带上20个[战争意志]就更好了。"

msgid "Anyway, thank you so much. I don't have much to give, but please accept this. Please, give my appreciation to Chronoris Shes when you see him."
msgstr "总之，太感谢了。我没什么可给的，但请收下这个。请你见到克罗诺里斯·谢斯时转达我的谢意。"

msgid "Master, How about telling Chronoris Shes about all this good stuff? Just checking, but you do have 20 [Will of War], right?"
msgstr "主人，把这些好事告诉克罗诺里斯·谢斯怎么样？随便问问，不过你身上有20个[战争意志]吧？"

msgid "Ahh, how is my sister Klasras doing these days."
msgstr "啊，我妹妹克拉斯拉斯近来可好。"

msgid "Welcome. I've just received some Holy Water directly from Karus' own King, and I'd like you to personally give it to them as a symbol of the peace."
msgstr "欢迎。我刚从卡鲁斯国王那里直接收到一些圣水，我想请你亲手把它交给他们，作为和平的象征。"

msgid "When you give the Holy Water to Nusram, you'll be helping the people of her nation to receive the Worship of Peace. I'll pay you 2 Fragments of Jealousy. Will you do this?"
msgstr "你把圣水交给努斯拉姆时，就是在帮助她国家的人民接受和平崇拜。我会付你2个嫉妒碎片。你愿意做吗？"

msgid "Heh Heh Heh... Yes Yes. You did just as I asked, well done. Peace! What bloody peace? History is written in war and blood. Ha ha ha ha!! Those who do not write history, die in it instead!! Well done anyway. Here's your cut. Mwuahahahahaha!!!"
msgstr "嘿嘿嘿……好，好。你照我说的做了，干得好。和平！哪门子和平？历史是用战争和鲜血写成的。哈哈哈哈！！那些写不了历史的人，就死在历史里吧！！总之干得不错。这是你的那份。呜哈哈哈哈哈！！！"

msgid "When you give the Holy Water to Nusram, you'll be helping the people of her nation to receive the Worship of Peace. I will pay you 2 Fragments of Jealousy, or 25 million EXP. Will you do this?"
msgstr "你把圣水交给努斯拉姆时，就是在帮助她国家的人民接受和平崇拜。我会付你2个嫉妒碎片，或2500万经验值。你愿意做吗？"

msgid "Huh! Did Choronis really give this to you? How nice... Well then, I accept it with gratitude."
msgstr "啊！克罗诺尼斯真的把这个给你了？真好……那好，我感激地收下了。"

msgid "The weather is so good..."
msgstr "天气真好……"

msgid "Choose one. It's a choice of two. Mwuahahaha!!"
msgstr "选一个吧。二选一。呜哈哈哈！！"

msgid "The 12th Warrior Red Devil uniform is a reward for a KO World Cup victory.|Be ware that you can only wear it for a week. It's then removed after the 13th of July."
msgstr "第12战士红魔制服是KO世界杯获胜的奖励。|请注意你只能穿一周。7月13日之后它会被收回。"

msgid "You need a [Certificate of Red Devil uniform top] to receive the Red Devil top. A [Certificate of Red Devil uniform] can be found during World Cup events, such as in treasure chests."
msgstr "获得红魔上装需要[红魔制服上衣证书]。[红魔制服证书]可在世界杯活动期间获得，例如宝箱中。"

msgid "Choose the one you want."
msgstr "选择你想要的那个。"

msgid "First, tell Alpuer that I found the slave."
msgstr "先告诉阿尔普，我找到奴隶了。"

msgid "First, tell Choronis that I found the slave."
msgstr "先告诉克罗诺尼斯，我找到奴隶了。"

msgid "Gah! I think you were deceived by Alpuer, <selfname>!"
msgstr "啊！我觉得你被阿尔普骗了，<selfname>！"

msgid "Gah! I think you were deceived by Chronoris, <selfname>!!"
msgstr "啊！我觉得你被克罗诺里斯骗了，<selfname>！！"

msgid "I want peace to come quickly."
msgstr "我希望和平快点到来。"

msgid "I want the peace to come quick."
msgstr "我希望和平快点到来。"

msgid "(~smirk~) My name is Chard... People call me ¡®Enchanter' Chard. Do you understand the meaning of these drums?"
msgstr "（~坏笑~）我叫查德……人们叫我¡®附魔师¡¯查德。你明白这些鼓声的含义吗？"

msgid "War. The drums announce the outbreak of war. Every nation busies its' self preparing their war supplies,  calling softly under their breath for blood. Will you join them?"
msgstr "战争。鼓声宣告战争爆发。每个国家都忙着准备军需，低声呼唤着鲜血。你要加入他们吗？"

msgid "If you had the true blood of a knight flowing in you, I don't think you would just sit by and watch. Tell me, what's it like? Show me you have the will to protect this nation by standing at the front lines, and I will awaken your sleeping potential with each Talisman you bring me. "
msgstr "如果你体内流淌着真正骑士的血，我想你不会袖手旁观。告诉我，感觉如何？站到前线向我证明你有保护这个国家的意志，你每给我带来一个护符，我就会唤醒你沉睡的潜能。"

msgid "I will always help you if you need it. See you then..."
msgstr "如果你需要，我随时会帮你。回见……"

msgid "For me to help you each time, I will need 15 [Will of War]."
msgstr "我每次帮你，都需要15个[战争意志]。"

msgid "First, bring the 15 [Will of War]."
msgstr "先带来15个[战争意志]。"

msgid "Select the ability you wish to unlock."
msgstr "选择你想解锁的能力。"

msgid "In the Lunar war, CONT cannot be charged."
msgstr "在月之战中，无法积攒贡献值。"

msgid "Apologies for any inconvenience caused by the ¡®item disappearing' bug.|Please keep the Power-Up items until the 27th of July if you have suffered from the bug."
msgstr "对于¡®物品消失¡¯bug造成的不便，我们深表歉意。|如果你遭遇了该bug，请把Power-Up物品保留到7月27日。"

msgid "You are not on the compensation list.|You have already been compensated or you are not registered. Please contact our Client Center via the website."
msgstr "你不在补偿名单上。|你已经获得过补偿，或者你没有登记。请通过网站联系我们的客服中心。"

msgid "You do not have enough space in the inventory.|You need 3 empty shelves in the inventory to receive compensation."
msgstr "你的背包空间不足。|你需要背包里有3个空位才能领取补偿。"

msgid "Enjoy Knight Online!"
msgstr "尽情享受骑士OL吧！"

msgid "Sorry, but this mission can only support 40 players at one time. Come back in a little while."
msgstr "抱歉，这个任务一次最多支持40名玩家。请稍后再来。"

msgid "You've already accomplished your mission.|See you tomorrow."
msgstr "你已经完成任务了。|明天见。"

msgid "Welcome.|The most important thing now is intelligence. War with El Morad is unavoidable, so we must be ready. Our first priority is to clarify the status of El Morad's military forces, their strategy and any preparations they're making."
msgstr "欢迎。|现在最重要的是情报。与艾莫拉德的战争不可避免，我们必须做好准备。我们的首要任务是查明艾莫拉德的军力状况、他们的战略以及他们正在做的任何准备。"

msgid "In order to undertake this mission you'll need 30 [Will of War]. You need to give me 15 of them before the infiltration can begin.|Are you in?"
msgstr "要接这个任务，你需要30个[战争意志]。潜入开始前你得先给我其中15个。|你加入吗？"

msgid "Retrieve the Classified Document from the Secret Locker in El Morad Castle. I will make a separate payment to you for this."
msgstr "从艾莫拉德城堡的秘密储物柜中取回机密文件。我会为此单独付你报酬。"

msgid "You haven't enough Wills of War. You need to show me 30 [Will of War] to engage the mission."
msgstr "你的战争意志不够。你需要给我看30个[战争意志]才能接任务。"

msgid "One more thing!|I'll increase your reward, if you can also bring me the keys from El Morad's Asga Village, Laiva Village and Doda camp. Got that? The keys are kept in each village's communal Locker. Good luck."
msgstr "还有一件事！|如果你还能把艾莫拉德阿斯加村、莱瓦村和多达营地里的钥匙给我带来，我就增加你的奖励。明白吗？钥匙存放在每个村庄的公共储物柜里。祝好运。"

msgid "Your mission is up to here|See you tomorrow."
msgstr "你的任务到此为止|明天见。"

msgid "Well done!|The Goddess of Victory must be on our side! Ha Ha, here's your reward."
msgstr "干得好！|胜利女神一定站在我们这边！哈哈，这是你的奖励。"

msgid "Well done!|The Goddess of Victory must be on our side! Shame, you earned the Classified Document only after you were killed. You've got to get it whilst alive! Then I'll increase your award."
msgstr "干得好！|胜利女神一定站在我们这边！可惜，你是在被杀之后才拿到机密文件的。你得活着拿到它！那样我就增加你的奖励。"

msgid "Good, you brought the key.|Select your reward. In return, you'll have to give me 3 keys for the [Green Treasure Chest], 2 keys for the [Red Treasure Chest] and 1 key for a [Lottery Ticket]. Got it?"
msgstr "好，你把钥匙带来了。|选择你的奖励。作为交换，你得给我3把钥匙换[绿色宝箱]、2把钥匙换[红色宝箱]、1把钥匙换一张[抽奖券]。明白吗？"

msgid "I'm disappointed tbh.|You didn't get the Classified Document or the keys. Nub. Try again tomorrow."
msgstr "说实话我很失望。|你既没拿到机密文件也没拿到钥匙。菜鸟。明天再来试。"

msgid "Your inventory is bursting. Come back after you've cleared some space."
msgstr "你的背包塞爆了。腾出点空间后再来。"

msgid "You don't have enough keys."
msgstr "你的钥匙不够。"

msgid "Sorry, but you're a bit too low a level for this mission. Come back when you've hit at least Lvl 45, Ok?"
msgstr "抱歉，你的等级接这个任务有点低。至少到45级再来，好吗？"

msgid "Sorry, but I can't give you any missions right now because of the Lunar War."
msgstr "抱歉，由于月之战，我现在无法给你任何任务。"

msgid "Welcome.|The most important thing now is intelligence. War with Karus is unavoidable, so we must be ready. Our first priority is to clarify the status of Karus' military forces, their strategy and any preparations they're making."
msgstr "欢迎。|现在最重要的是情报。与卡鲁斯的战争不可避免，我们必须做好准备。我们的首要任务是查明卡鲁斯的军力状况、他们的战略以及他们正在做的任何准备。"

msgid "Retrieve the Classified Document from the Secret Locker in Karus' Castle. I will make a separate payment to you for this."
msgstr "从卡鲁斯城堡的秘密储物柜中取回机密文件。我会为此单独付你报酬。"

msgid "One more thing!|I'll increase your reward, if you can also bring me the keys from Karus' Belua Village, Linnart Village and Raon camp. Got that? The keys are kept in each village's communal Locker. Good luck."
msgstr "还有一件事！|如果你还能把卡鲁斯贝卢阿村、林纳特村和拉昂营地里的钥匙给我带来，我就增加你的奖励。明白吗？钥匙存放在每个村庄的公共储物柜里。祝好运。"

msgid "Aren't you <selfname>? You've already found the Classified Document."
msgstr "你不是<selfname>吗？你已经找到机密文件了。"

msgid "<selfname>! Your inventory is full."
msgstr "<selfname>！你的背包满了。"

msgid "[Would you like to take the Classified Document?]"
msgstr "[你想拿走机密文件吗？]"

msgid "<selfname>! You've already found the Classified Document."
msgstr "<selfname>！你已经找到机密文件了。"

msgid "<selfname>! You've already swiped this village's key. "
msgstr "<selfname>！你已经拿过这个村庄的钥匙了。"

msgid "[Would you like to take the key?]"
msgstr "[你想拿走钥匙吗？]"

msgid "The enemy's secrets are in their castle. I'll reward you more for each key you bring me from Asga and Laiva villages and the Doda Camp. Good luck."
msgstr "敌人的秘密就在他们的城堡里。你从阿斯加村、莱瓦村和多达营地每给我带来一把钥匙，我就多给你奖励。祝好运。"

msgid "The enemy's secrets are in their castle. I'll reward you more for each key you bring me from Belua and Linnart villages and the Raon Camp. Good luck."
msgstr "敌人的秘密就在他们的城堡里。你从贝卢阿村、林纳特村和拉昂营地每给我带来一把钥匙，我就多给你奖励。祝好运。"

msgid "I'm sorry, the Lunar War is starting soon, and I can't give out any missions in the hour before it begins."
msgstr "抱歉，月之战马上就要开始了，开战前一小时内我无法发放任何任务。"

msgid "Sorry, but salary and booty can't be handed out between 6:15pm and 7pm. Please rememeber."
msgstr "抱歉，下午6:15到7点之间无法发放俸禄和战利品。请记住。"

msgid "Would you like to be 'ported back to your country after you mission?"
msgstr "任务结束后你想被传送回你的国家吗？"

msgid "I'll reward you if you recover the enemy's Classified Document and the keys."
msgstr "如果你取回敌人的机密文件和钥匙，我会奖励你。"

msgid "<selfname>! You won't find the keys or the document during the Lunar War. Go and grind some mobs somewhere instead."
msgstr "<selfname>！月之战期间你找不到钥匙或文件。不如去别处刷刷怪吧。"

msgid "Come to me for anything related to the Knight Squad. What can I help you with today?"
msgstr "骑士小队相关的事都来找我。今天有什么能帮你的？"

msgid "Select the challenge <selfname> wants to attempt."
msgstr "选择<selfname>想尝试的考验。"

msgid "The Formal Knight Squad is the King's own approved Combat Unit. To become a member, you must hold 1st Class qualifications as a training Knight Squad. <selfname> must also demonstrate great loyalty to the nation. Right now,  Isiloon is waiting to test you in the Abyss of Hell. You must fight Isiloon, retrieve the [Emblem of Honor], and pay Knight Squad promotional dues of 10 million Noah."
msgstr "正式骑士小队是国王亲自批准的战斗单位。要成为其成员，你必须拥有训练骑士小队的一等资格。<selfname>还必须展现对国家的高度忠诚。现在，伊西伦正在地狱深渊等待考验你。你必须与伊西伦战斗，取回[荣誉纹章]，并缴纳1000万诺亚的骑士小队晋升费。"

msgid "Your Knight Squad must do more service to the nation. A 1st Class Knight Squad can earn the right to be promoted as a Formal Knight Squad."
msgstr "你的骑士小队必须为国家效力更多。一等骑士小队才能获得晋升为正式骑士小队的权利。"

msgid "I have nothing that will help you. I only issue missions to Knight Squads. "
msgstr "我没什么能帮你的。我只向骑士小队发放任务。"

msgid "The Abyss of Hell consists of many trials. As soon as you enter for your Knight Squad test,  everyone else in your clan will be summoned to your side. There is no distinction down there between enemy and ally. Anyone can attack anyone else, friend or foe. This is what makes it so challenging. Only the best and strongest combatant will earn the [Emblem of Honor]."
msgstr "地狱深渊由许多考验组成。你一进去参加骑士小队考核，你部落里的其他人都会被召唤到你身边。那里没有敌我之分。任何人都可以攻击任何人，无论是敌是友。这正是它如此具有挑战性的原因。只有最优秀、最强的战斗者才能赢得[荣誉纹章]。"

msgid "Consequences include the loss of EXP, becoming trapped temporarily, or losing the contest to another Knight Squad, in which case the [Emblem of Honor] goes with them, of course."
msgstr "后果包括损失经验值、被暂时困住，或在竞争中输给另一支骑士小队，那样的话[荣誉纹章]自然就归他们了。"

msgid "Despite all of this, you must focus on one thing-|You,  <selfname>, Knight Squad Leader, must physically get  the [Emblem of Honor] yourself! By which I mean, your allies can help you to defeat Isiloon in combat, but they won't be able to loot the emblem. That's up to you. Bear it in mind, anyway. I wish you luck."
msgstr "尽管如此，你必须专注于一件事——|你，<selfname>，骑士小队长，必须亲手亲自拿到[荣誉纹章]！我的意思是，你的盟友可以帮你在战斗中击败伊西伦，但他们无法拾取纹章。那得靠你自己。总之记住这一点。祝你好运。"

msgid "Did you bring everything required for promotion to Formal Knight Squad?"
msgstr "你带来了晋升正式骑士小队所需的一切吗？"

msgid "You need the [Emblem of Honor] from Isiloon to be promoted to Formal Knight Squad."
msgstr "你需要从伊西伦那里获得[荣誉纹章]才能晋升正式骑士小队。"

msgid "Congratulations on your promotion to Formal Knight Squad! I hope you accomplish many honorable deeds for the nation now that you are a Formal Knight Squad."
msgstr "恭喜你晋升正式骑士小队！希望你现在身为正式骑士小队，为国家立下许多功勋。"

msgid "The Royal Knight Squad is the nation's elite Combat Unit. To become a member, you must hold 1st Class qualifications in Knight Squad training. <selfname> must also demonstrate great loyalty to the nation. Right now, Red Dragon is waiting to test you in the Cave of the Fire Dragon. You must fight Red Dragon and retrieve the [Emblem Royal], along with your Knight Squad promotion dues of 100 million Noah, and 25,000 Knight Squad saving points."
msgstr "皇家骑士小队是国家的精锐战斗单位。要成为其成员，你必须拥有骑士小队训练的一等资格。<selfname>还必须展现对国家的高度忠诚。现在，红龙正在火龙洞穴等待考验你。你必须与红龙战斗并取回[皇家纹章]，同时缴纳1亿诺亚的骑士小队晋升费，以及25,000骑士小队储蓄点数。"

msgid "Your Knight Squad must do more service to the nation. A 1st Class Knight Squad can earn the right to be promoted as a Royal Knight Squad."
msgstr "你的骑士小队必须为国家效力更多。一等骑士小队才能获得晋升为皇家骑士小队的权利。"

msgid "There are many trials in the Cave of the Red Dragon. As soon as you enter for your Knight Squad test,  everyone else in your clan will be summoned to your side. There is no distinction down there between enemy and ally. Anyone can attack anyone else, friend or foe. This is what makes it so challenging. Only the best and strongest combatant will earn the [Emblem Royal]."
msgstr "红龙洞穴里有许多考验。你一进去参加骑士小队考核，你部落里的其他人都会被召唤到你身边。那里没有敌我之分。任何人都可以攻击任何人，无论是敌是友。这正是它如此具有挑战性的原因。只有最优秀、最强的战斗者才能赢得[皇家纹章]。"

msgid "Consequences include the loss of EXP, becoming trapped temporarily, or losing the contest to another Knight Squad, in which case the [Emblem Royal] goes with them, of course."
msgstr "后果包括损失经验值、被暂时困住，或在竞争中输给另一支骑士小队，那样的话[皇家纹章]自然就归他们了。"

msgid "Despite all of this, you must focus on one thing-|You,  <selfname>, Knight Squad Leader, must physically get  the [Emblem Royal] yourself! By which I mean, your allies can help you to defeat Red Dragon in combat, but they won't be able to loot the emblem. That's up to you. Bear it in mind, anyway. I wish you luck."
msgstr "尽管如此，你必须专注于一件事——|你，<selfname>，骑士小队长，必须亲手亲自拿到[皇家纹章]！我的意思是，你的盟友可以帮你在战斗中击败红龙，但他们无法拾取纹章。那得靠你自己。总之记住这一点。祝你好运。"

msgid "Did you bring everything required for promotion to Royal Knight Squad?"
msgstr "你带来了晋升皇家骑士小队所需的一切吗？"

msgid "Hmm, you have insufficient Noah. You need 100 million Noah for your Royal Night Squad registration fee."
msgstr "嗯，你的诺亚不足。你的皇家骑士小队注册费需要1亿诺亚。"

msgid "You need the [Emblem Royal] from Red Dragon to be promoted to Royal Knight Squad."
msgstr "你需要从红龙那里获得[皇家纹章]才能晋升皇家骑士小队。"

msgid "Congratulations on your promotion to Royal Knight Squad! Show us you're worthy of the title!"
msgstr "恭喜你晋升皇家骑士小队！向我们证明你配得上这个称号！"

msgid "Sorry, but this test can only be attempted by a 1st  Class training Knight Squad. It's a useless test to you, <selfname>."
msgstr "抱歉，这个考验只能由一等训练骑士小队尝试。对你来说这是个没用的考验，<selfname>。"

msgid "Sorry, but this test can only be attempted by a 1st  Class Formal Knight Squad. It's a useless test to you, <selfname>."
msgstr "抱歉，这个考验只能由一等正式骑士小队尝试。对你来说这是个没用的考验，<selfname>。"

msgid "You need 3rd Clan qualifications as a proof of national service to become a training Knight Squad. Also, you must prove your courage and ability. Right now, Caitharos is waiting to test you in the Coliseum. You have to fight Isiloon and retrieve the [Key of Glory], as well as your training Knight Squad dues of 10 million Noah."
msgstr "你需要三级部落资格作为为国效力的证明，才能成为训练骑士小队。此外，你必须证明你的勇气和能力。现在，凯萨罗斯正在斗兽场等待考验你。你必须与伊西伦战斗并取回[荣耀之钥]，同时缴纳1000万诺亚的训练骑士小队费用。"

msgid "Congratulations! <selfname>'s squad is now an approved National Combat Unit. I hope you achieve many honorable things trying for the Formal Knight Squad position in the future."
msgstr "恭喜！<selfname>的小队现在是一支获批准的国家战斗单位了。希望你今后为争取正式骑士小队的位置立下许多功勋。"

msgid "Sorry, but to get your Knight Squad to the next class, you must undergo the Royal Knight Squad promotion test. Would you like to give it a shot?"
msgstr "抱歉，要让你的骑士小队晋阶，你必须参加皇家骑士小队晋升考核。你想试一试吗？"

msgid "Sorry, try applying for promotion after you've been made a Formal Knight Squad."
msgstr "抱歉，成为正式骑士小队后再来申请晋升。"

msgid "You are already the highest-class Knight Squad."
msgstr "你已经是最高阶的骑士小队了。"

msgid "Would you like to raise your Knight Squad's class?|You need 45,000 Knight Squad saving points to be promoted to 1st Class Royal Knight Squad."
msgstr "你想提升骑士小队的阶级吗？|你需要45,000骑士小队储蓄点数才能晋升一等皇家骑士小队。"

msgid "Congratulations!|Your Knight Squad class has been raised a level. Well done indeed!"
msgstr "恭喜！|你的骑士小队阶级提升了一级。干得漂亮！"

msgid "Sorry, but your Knight Squad's saving points are insufficient. You need 45,000 points to rise to the next class."
msgstr "抱歉，你的骑士小队储蓄点数不足。你需要45,000点才能晋阶。"

msgid "Sorry, but your Knight Squad's saving points are insufficient. You need 40,000 points to rise to the next class."
msgstr "抱歉，你的骑士小队储蓄点数不足。你需要40,000点才能晋阶。"

msgid "Sorry, but your Knight Squad's saving points are insufficient. You need 35,000 points to rise to the next class."
msgstr "抱歉，你的骑士小队储蓄点数不足。你需要35,000点才能晋阶。"

msgid "Sorry, but your Knight Squad's saving points are insufficient. You need 30,000 points to rise to the next class."
msgstr "抱歉，你的骑士小队储蓄点数不足。你需要30,000点才能晋阶。"

msgid "Sorry, but your Knight Squad's saving points are insufficient. You need 20,000 points to rise to the next class."
msgstr "抱歉，你的骑士小队储蓄点数不足。你需要20,000点才能晋阶。"

msgid "Sorry, but your Knight Squad's saving points are insufficient. You need 15,000 points to rise to the next class."
msgstr "抱歉，你的骑士小队储蓄点数不足。你需要15,000点才能晋阶。"

msgid "Sorry, but your Knight Squad's saving points are insufficient. You need 10,000 points to rise to the next class."
msgstr "抱歉，你的骑士小队储蓄点数不足。你需要10,000点才能晋阶。"

msgid "Sorry, but your Knight Squad's saving points are insufficient. You need 7,000 points to rise to the next class."
msgstr "抱歉，你的骑士小队储蓄点数不足。你需要7,000点才能晋阶。"

msgid "The Formal Knight Squad is the King's own approved Combat Unit. To become a member, you must hold 1st Class qualifications as a training Knight Squad. <selfname> must also demonstrate great loyalty to the nation. Right now, Isiloon is waiting to test you in the Abyss of Hell. You must fight Isiloon, retrieve the [Emblem of Honor], and pay Knight Squad promotional dues of 10 million Noah."
msgstr "正式骑士小队是国王亲自批准的战斗单位。要成为其成员，你必须拥有训练骑士小队的一等资格。<selfname>还必须展现对国家的高度忠诚。现在，伊西伦正在地狱深渊等待考验你。你必须与伊西伦战斗，取回[荣誉纹章]，并缴纳1000万诺亚的骑士小队晋升费。"

msgid "Despite all of this, you must focus on one thing-|You,  <selfname>, Knight Squad Leader, must physically get  the [Emblem Royal] yourself! By which I mean, your allies can help you to defeat Isiloon in combat, but they won't be able to loot the emblem. That's up to you. Bear it in mind, anyway. I wish you luck. "
msgstr "尽管如此，你必须专注于一件事——|你，<selfname>，骑士小队长，必须亲手亲自拿到[皇家纹章]！我的意思是，你的盟友可以帮你在战斗中击败伊西伦，但他们无法拾取纹章。那得靠你自己。总之记住这一点。祝你好运。"

msgid "The Imperial Knight Squad is the nation's elite Combat Unit. To become a member, you must hold 1st Class qualifications as a Formal Knight Squad. <selfname> must also demonstrate great loyalty to the nation. Right now, Red Dragon is waiting to test you in the Cave of the Fire Dragon. You must fight Red Dragon and retrieve the [Emblem Royal], along with your Knight Squad promotion dues of 100 million Noah, and 25,000 Knight Squad saving points."
msgstr "帝国骑士小队是国家的精锐战斗单位。要成为其成员，你必须拥有正式骑士小队的一等资格。<selfname>还必须展现对国家的高度忠诚。现在，红龙正在火龙洞穴等待考验你。你必须与红龙战斗并取回[皇家纹章]，同时缴纳1亿诺亚的骑士小队晋升费，以及25,000骑士小队储蓄点数。"

msgid "Sorry, but class applications can only be made by the Squad Leader or Co-Leader."
msgstr "抱歉，阶级申请只能由小队长或副小队长提出。"

msgid "Sorry, but your Knight Squad's saving points are insufficient. You need 25,000 points to be promoted to Royal Knight Squad."
msgstr "抱歉，你的骑士小队储蓄点数不足。你需要25,000点才能晋升皇家骑士小队。"

msgid "Sorry, but the saving points in the Knight Squad is insufficient. You need 25,000 points to be promoted to Royal Knight Squad."
msgstr "抱歉，骑士小队的储蓄点数不足。你需要25,000点才能晋升皇家骑士小队。"

msgid "Would you like to be 'ported out after the promotion test?"
msgstr "晋升考核后你想被传送出去吗？"

msgid "Would you like to raise your Knight Squad's class?|You need 40,000 Knight Squad saving points to be promoted to 2nd Class Royal Knight Squad."
msgstr "你想提升骑士小队的阶级吗？|你需要40,000骑士小队储蓄点数才能晋升二等皇家骑士小队。"

msgid "Would you like to raise your Knight Squad's class?|You need 35,000 Knight Squad saving points to be promoted to 3rd Class Royal Knight Squad."
msgstr "你想提升骑士小队的阶级吗？|你需要35,000骑士小队储蓄点数才能晋升三等皇家骑士小队。"

msgid "Would you like to raise your Knight Squad's class?|You need 30,000 Knight Squad saving points to be promoted to 4th Class Royal Knight Squad."
msgstr "你想提升骑士小队的阶级吗？|你需要30,000骑士小队储蓄点数才能晋升四等皇家骑士小队。"

msgid "Would you like to raise your Knight Squad's class?|You need 20,000 Knight Squad saving points to be promoted to 1st Class Formal Knight Squad."
msgstr "你想提升骑士小队的阶级吗？|你需要20,000骑士小队储蓄点数才能晋升一等正式骑士小队。"

msgid "Would you like to raise your Knight Squad's class?|You need 15,000 Knight Squad saving points to be promoted to 2nd Class Formal Knight Squad."
msgstr "你想提升骑士小队的阶级吗？|你需要15,000骑士小队储蓄点数才能晋升二等正式骑士小队。"

msgid "Would you like to raise your Knight Squad's class?|You need 10,000 Knight Squad saving points to be promoted to 3rd Class Formal Knight Squad."
msgstr "你想提升骑士小队的阶级吗？|你需要10,000骑士小队储蓄点数才能晋升三等正式骑士小队。"

msgid "Would you like to raise your Knight Squad's class?|You need 7,000 Knight Squad saving points to be promoted to 4th Class Formal Knight Squad."
msgstr "你想提升骑士小队的阶级吗？|你需要7,000骑士小队储蓄点数才能晋升四等正式骑士小队。"

msgid "Finally, the war against Karus has begun. I wonder if the Karus are ready for us. El Morad is already fully prepared and ready to go. HA!!~"
msgstr "终于，对抗卡鲁斯的战争开始了。不知道卡鲁斯有没有准备好对付我们。艾莫拉德已经全面备战就绪。哈！！~"

msgid "In the war against Karus, <selfname>, I want to see some serious results from you. You'll bring me [Will of Victory] as proof of your deeds, and I will reward you for every 10 I see from you. Just so you know, [Will of War] is earned for enemy player kills. You got that? Good, now get out there and kick some!"
msgstr "在对抗卡鲁斯的战争中，<selfname>，我要看到你拿出点真成绩。你要把[胜利意志]带给我作为你战功的证明，你每带来10个我就奖励你。跟你说一声，[战争意志]是靠击杀敌方玩家获得的。明白吗？好，现在出去大干一场吧！"

msgid "Ah~ [War of Will], great. That's great, good work <selfname>. Here's a little something for you. But remember, the war against Karus has only just begun. Keep bringing me those Wills, for the greater glory of El Morad!"
msgstr "啊~[战争意志]，好。太好了，干得好<selfname>。这是给你的一点小东西。但记住，对抗卡鲁斯的战争才刚刚开始。继续把那些意志带给我，为了艾莫拉德更大的荣耀！"

msgid "Erm, Your inventory appears to be full. Show some initiative and clear out the junk eh?"
msgstr "呃，你的背包好像满了。主动点，把垃圾清一清好吗？"

msgid "Finally, the war against El Morad has begun. I wonder if El Morad is ready for us. Karus is already fully prepared and ready to go. HA!!~"
msgstr "终于，对抗艾莫拉德的战争开始了。不知道艾莫拉德有没有准备好对付我们。卡鲁斯已经全面备战就绪。哈！！~"

msgid "In the war against El Morad, <selfname>, I want to see some serious results from you. You'll bring me [Will of Victory] as proof of your deeds, and I will reward you for every 10 I see from you. Just so you know, [Will of War] is earned for enemy player kills. You got that? Good, now get out there and kick some!"
msgstr "在对抗艾莫拉德的战争中，<selfname>，我要看到你拿出点真成绩。你要把[胜利意志]带给我作为你战功的证明，你每带来10个我就奖励你。跟你说一声，[战争意志]是靠击杀敌方玩家获得的。明白吗？好，现在出去大干一场吧！"

msgid "Ah~ [War of Will], great. That's great, good work <selfname>. Here's a little something for you. But remember, the war against El Morad has only just begun. Keep bringing me those Wills, for the greater glory of Karus!"
msgstr "啊~[战争意志]，好。太好了，干得好<selfname>。这是给你的一点小东西。但记住，对抗艾莫拉德的战争才刚刚开始。继续把那些意志带给我，为了卡鲁斯更大的荣耀！"

msgid "This is the Forgotten Temple. It's a very holy place. I can't allow you to enter, all covered in sin like that. Go and wash it all off and then come back."
msgstr "这里是遗忘神殿。这是个非常神圣的地方。你浑身是罪，我不能让你进去。去把它都洗干净再回来。"

msgid "Sorry. This is an examination period. Please wait a moment."
msgstr "抱歉。现在是考试时间。请稍等片刻。"

msgid "You need a [Gryphon's Armor Voucher] to get the Gryphon Armor. A [Gryphon's Armor Voucher] can be purchased from the Power-up store."
msgstr "获得狮鹫护甲需要[狮鹫护甲凭证]。[狮鹫护甲凭证]可以在Power-up商店购买。"

msgid "You have selected Gryphon Armor HP+200 Nice isn't it? Do you really want it?"
msgstr "你选择了狮鹫护甲 HP+200 不错吧？你真的要它吗？"

msgid "You have selected Gryphon Armor Defense +30. Nice isn't it? Do you really want it?"
msgstr "你选择了狮鹫护甲 防御 +30。不错吧？你真的要它吗？"

msgid "You have selected Gryphon Armor EXP Gain Rate +4%. Nice isn't it? Do you really want it?"
msgstr "你选择了狮鹫护甲 经验获取率 +4%。不错吧？你真的要它吗？"

msgid "You have selected Gryphon Armor Noah Drop Rate +6%. Nice isn't it? Do you really want it?"
msgstr "你选择了狮鹫护甲 诺亚掉落率 +6%。不错吧？你真的要它吗？"

msgid "You have selected Gryphon Armor HP+100 Nice isn't it? Do you really want it?"
msgstr "你选择了狮鹫护甲 HP+100 不错吧？你真的要它吗？"

msgid "You have selected Gryphon Armor Defense +20. Nice isn't it? Do you really want it?"
msgstr "你选择了狮鹫护甲 防御 +20。不错吧？你真的要它吗？"

msgid "You have selected Gryphon Armor EXP Gain Rate +2%. Nice isn't it? Do you really want it?"
msgstr "你选择了狮鹫护甲 经验获取率 +2%。不错吧？你真的要它吗？"

msgid "You have selected Gryphon Armor Noah Drop Rate +3%. Nice isn't it? Do you really want it?"
msgstr "你选择了狮鹫护甲 诺亚掉落率 +3%。不错吧？你真的要它吗？"

msgid "You need a [Gryphon's Helmet Voucher] to get the Gryphon Helmet. A [Gryphon's Helmet Voucher] can be purchased from the Power-up store."
msgstr "获得狮鹫头盔需要[狮鹫头盔凭证]。[狮鹫头盔凭证]可以在Power-up商店购买。"

msgid "There's an SAT event going on now.|If you bring me the SAT item, I'll give you something good.|#Event Date: 16th of November to the 23rd of November, before  examination time."
msgstr "现在正在进行SAT活动。|如果你把SAT物品带给我，我会给你好东西。|#活动日期：11月16日至11月23日，考试前。"

msgid "If you bring me 10 each of the [S], [A] and [T] Talismans, for a total of 30 in one go, I'll trade ¡®em for a [Pass Notice].|# Pass Notice: Increases EXP gain by 20% for an hour."
msgstr "如果你一次性给我带来10个[S]、10个[A]和10个[T]护符，共30个，我就把它们换成一张[及格通知]。|#及格通知：一小时内经验获取提升20%。"

msgid "Ah, one more thing! The [S], [A] and [T] talismans are dropped by all monsters."
msgstr "啊，还有一件事！[S]、[A]和[T]护符由所有怪物掉落。"

msgid "Well done. Best of luck to everyone sitting the SAT test today."
msgstr "干得好。祝今天参加SAT考试的每个人好运。"

msgid "Yes, it's 10 each, total of 30.|Do you want to trade them for a [Pass Notice]?"
msgstr "对，每种10个，共30个。|你想把它们换成[及格通知]吗？"

msgid "Hmm... I'm sure I said 5 Kekoon Gallbladders..."
msgstr "嗯……我记得我说的是5个凯昆胆囊……"

msgid "Good, good, just as I expected.|Now I'll tell you about the Upgrade Scroll (Low Class). Open your ears."
msgstr "好，好，果然不出我所料。|现在我跟你说说强化卷轴（低级）。竖起耳朵听。"

msgid "To buff extra strength into a weapon, you need the right Upgrade Scroll."
msgstr "要给武器附加额外力量，你需要合适的强化卷轴。"

msgid "Go to the Magic Anvil and upgrade your weapon."
msgstr "去魔法铁砧那里强化你的武器。"

msgid "Have you done your homework yet?"
msgstr "你做完功课了吗？"

msgid "The Enhancement Scroll (Low Class) that I gave you is the spell you use to upgrade the weapon with. For the record, weapons are divided into three classes -  Low Class, Medium Class and High Class."
msgstr "我给你的强化卷轴（低级）就是你用来强化武器的咒语。顺便说一句，武器分为三类——低级、中级和高级。"

msgid "Now, go and do the Iron bar Mission(Quest)again."
msgstr "现在，再去做一次铁锭任务(Quest)。"

msgid "I don't know if you've noticed yet, but  when you do an upgrade, you have to use the appropriate spell for each class of weapon. i.e. Low Class Scrolls for Low Class Weapons, Medium Scrolls for Medium Weapons, and so on."
msgstr "不知道你注意到没有，强化时，你必须为每类武器使用合适的咒语。也就是说，低级武器用低级卷轴，中级武器用中级卷轴，以此类推。"

msgid "Well, come back with that weapon I gave you and upgrade it with an Enhancement Scroll (Low Class). As I said before, the upgrade must be done at the Magic anvil. You'll find it over by the Scroll Merchant Charon."
msgstr "好吧，把我给你的那把武器带回来，用强化卷轴（低级）强化它。如我之前所说，强化必须在魔法铁砧进行。你可以在卷轴商人卡戎那边找到它。"

msgid "Master! You've successfully upgraded the weapon and earned a Magical Enhancement Rock in the process. Let's go back to Heppa and see what he says."
msgstr "主人！你成功强化了武器，还顺便获得了一块魔法强化石。我们回去找赫帕，看他怎么说。"

msgid "So you've done a Weapon Enhancement Upgrade eh? How was it? Well, you'll have many opportunities to buff your weapons, so better get a grip on the process. So,  shall we take it to the next level?|Are you ready?"
msgstr "这么说你做了一次武器强化升级？感觉怎么样？你以后会有很多机会强化武器，所以最好把这个过程搞熟。那么，我们进入下一级吧？|你准备好了吗？"

msgid "I'm going to tell you about the weapon  Attack Power attribute. The Attack Power attribute covers   additional damage beyond your weapon's normal Attack Power. What do you think so far? Opened your ears up already eh? Ha Ha!"
msgstr "我来跟你讲讲武器的攻击力属性。攻击力属性指的是超出你武器普通攻击力的额外伤害。目前觉得怎么样？已经竖起耳朵了吧？哈哈！"

msgid "Do me a favor, if you want to know more. I'm making a new thing here, but I don't have enough Iron bar. Bring me   3 Iron bar and 3,000 Noah. I'll tell you the rest after that."
msgstr "如果你还想知道更多，就帮我个忙。我在这儿做个新东西，但铁锭不够。给我带来3个铁锭和3,000诺亚。之后我再告诉你剩下的。"

msgid "Master! Right, the Iron bar and Noah is in hand, let's hump it back to Blacksmith Heppa."
msgstr "主人！好了，铁锭和诺亚都到手了，我们赶快扛回铁匠赫帕那里吧。"

msgid "Oh, right. Well done. Ok, I can stick to the weapon production schedule now. Humm... First, take this Elemental Scroll (Low Class item)."
msgstr "哦，对。干得好。好，我现在可以按武器生产计划进行了。嗯……首先，拿着这个元素卷轴（低级物品）。"

msgid "Hmm... You don't want to help me? Disappointing, isn't it?"
msgstr "嗯……你不想帮我？真让人失望，不是吗？"

msgid "Master! [Blacksmith] Hepa is looking for you again! They said they were going to practice how to attach the attributes! Anyway, let's go there!"
msgstr "主人！[铁匠]赫帕又在找你了！他说要练习怎么附加属性！总之，我们去那儿吧！"

msgid "In addition to the strengthening of weapon, it is the provision of weapon attributes which can make the weapons strong! Then shall we provide the weapon with attributes as a practice? Purchase dagger (+1) from the [Arms Dealer] Gargameth and the [Elemental Scroll (Low Class Item)] from the [Scroll Merchant] Charon and try to attach the attributes!"
msgstr "除了武器强化，附加武器属性也能让武器变强！那我们就以附加属性为练习吧？从[武器商人]加雷梅斯那里购买匕首(+1)，从[卷轴商人]卡戎那里购买[元素卷轴（低级物品）]，然后试着附加属性！"

msgid "The dagger (+1) can be purchased from the [Arms Dealer] Gargameth and the [Elemental Scroll (Low Class Item)] from the [Elemental Scroll (Low Class Item)] Charon! Be sure to remember that it is the [Elemental Scroll (Low Class Item)] "
msgstr "匕首(+1)可以从[武器商人]加雷梅斯那里购买，[元素卷轴（低级物品）]从[元素卷轴（低级物品）]卡戎那里购买！一定要记住是[元素卷轴（低级物品）]"

msgid "Master! I was successful in strengthening the attributes! Hurry up and go to [Blacksmith] Hepa!"
msgstr "主人！我成功强化属性了！快去[铁匠]赫帕那里！"

msgid "Oh, Ok, you've done it. Right, let's wrap this up. I said that there's a way to reveal the attribute effect on (+7) Normal Upgrade items, remember? Well, you can do that with a Reverse Scroll. Using a Reverse Scroll on a weapon will tell you what it could do,   saving you from having to upgrade it until (+8)."
msgstr "哦，好，你做到了。那好，我们收尾吧。我说过有一种方法可以揭示(+7)普通强化物品的属性效果，记得吗？你可以用还原卷轴做到这一点。在武器上使用还原卷轴会告诉你它能有什么效果，让你不必非得强化到(+8)。"

msgid "You've done a fine job so far.|I know it sounds complicated, but once you've done it a few times, it'll all come clear and be a great asset to you. Here, it's nothing great, but take it anyway. Perhaps it'll help you somewhere along the way. Think of it as an investment? HAHAHAHA!!!"
msgstr "你到目前为止干得不错。|我知道听起来很复杂，但你做过几次之后，一切就会明了，对你大有裨益。来，这不是什么好东西，但还是收下吧。也许它在你路上某个地方会帮到你。就当是笔投资？哈哈哈哈哈！！！"

msgid "Oh, whilst you're out and about, could you bring me the  Magical Enhancement Rock from Menissiah? Thanks. Sorry to keep bothering you."
msgstr "哦，既然你在外边跑，能不能帮我从梅尼西亚带一块魔法强化石来？谢谢。抱歉一直麻烦你。"

msgid "Bring me the weapon I gave you after the step  one enhancement."
msgstr "把我给你的那把经过一阶强化后的武器带给我。"

msgid "Bring me 3 Iron bar and 3,000 Noah.|We'll talk about the rest later."
msgstr "给我带来3个铁锭和3,000诺亚。|其余的以后再说。"

msgid "Bring me the weapon I gave you after you did the Attack Power attribute upgrade. Use the Elemental Scroll (Low Class) with the  Magic anvil and then upgrade. I trust you can handle that."
msgstr "把我给你的那把做完攻击力属性升级后的武器带给我。用元素卷轴（低级）在魔法铁砧上强化。我相信你能搞定。"

msgid "You were successful, weren't you! Let me see."
msgstr "你成功了，是吧！让我看看。"

msgid "Come to me if you need more Armor. Keep helping me, and I'll keep supplying the Armor. Anyway, do you know about Armor Upgrades?"
msgstr "你需要更多护甲就来找我。继续帮我，我就继续供应护甲。对了，你知道护甲强化吗？"

msgid "Come to me if you need more Armor. If <selfname> continues to help me, I'll always supply 'em with Armor."
msgstr "你需要更多护甲就来找我。如果<selfname>继续帮我，我会一直供应护甲。"

msgid "There's nobody who knows more than [Blacksmith] Heppa about upgrading stuff. Go see him in Moradon."
msgstr "强化这方面没人比[铁匠]赫帕懂得多。去莫拉登找他吧。"

msgid " Do you know anything about <font color=@#990000@>armor upgrade</font> by any chance?"
msgstr "你碰巧了解<font color=@#990000@>护甲强化</font>吗？"

msgid "Master! Remember about Armor Upgrades from Moradon's [Blacksmith] Heppa."
msgstr "主人！记得去找莫拉登的[铁匠]赫帕了解护甲强化。"

msgid "It's been while I've seen you.|Guess you want to hear about Armor Upgrades then? Armor Upgrades aren't much different from Weapon Upgrades. Whilst weapons have upgrades for their Attack Power attribute, armor has  Enchant Upgrades for their  Ability attribute."
msgstr "好久没见你了。|那你是想听听护甲强化喽？护甲强化和武器强化没多大区别。武器有攻击力属性强化，护甲则有能力属性的附魔强化。"

msgid "Before we go any further, I want to check your understanding of the armor Enhancement Upgrades. Bring me your  Full Plate Boots after you've done a +5 Enhancement Upgrade on ¡®em."
msgstr "在我们继续之前，我想检查一下你对护甲强化升级的理解。把你的全身板甲靴做一次+5强化升级后带给我。"

msgid "Before we go any further, I want to check your understanding of the armor Enhancement Upgrades. Bring me your  Rogue Full Plate Boots after you've done a +5 Enhancement Upgrade on ¡®em."
msgstr "在我们继续之前，我想检查一下你对护甲强化升级的理解。把你的盗贼全身板甲靴做一次+5强化升级后带给我。"

msgid "Before we go any further, I want to check your understanding of the armor Enhancement Upgrades. Bring me your  Crystal Plate Boots after you've done a +5 Enhancement Upgrade on ¡®em."
msgstr "在我们继续之前，我想检查一下你对护甲强化升级的理解。把你的水晶板甲靴做一次+5强化升级后带给我。"

msgid "Before we go any further, I want to check your understanding of the armor Enhancement Upgrades. Bring me your  Priest Full Plate Boots after you've done a +5 Enhancement Upgrade on ¡®em."
msgstr "在我们继续之前，我想检查一下你对护甲强化升级的理解。把你的祭司全身板甲靴做一次+5强化升级后带给我。"

msgid "Fair enough, you seem to have the hang of it.|I like you, you're good. Heh. Now then, let me explain Enchant Upgrades."
msgstr "很好，你好像已经掌握窍门了。|我喜欢你，你不错。嘿。那好，我来给你讲讲附魔强化。"

msgid "You're familiar with the upgrade process, right? Right."
msgstr "你熟悉强化流程了，对吧？好。"

msgid "The Enchant Upgrade is only for Armor Upgrades. I'm thinkin' of armors' Ability attribute here... Enhancement Upgrades   give your armor a bonus ability by unlocking an extra Strength, Agility, Health, Intelligence or Magic attribute."
msgstr "附魔强化只用于护甲强化。我这里说的是护甲的能力属性……强化升级会通过解锁额外的力量、敏捷、生命、智力或魔法属性，给你的护甲附加一项能力加成。"

msgid "As usual, the Scroll has to be in the same Class as the armor, and again, you can only upgrade a piece of armor once per scroll. One cool thing is that you can choose which ability attribute to unlock, but once you've done that you can never change it. Ok?"
msgstr "一如往常，卷轴必须和护甲同阶，而且每张卷轴只能强化一件护甲一次。有一点很酷，就是你可以选择解锁哪个能力属性，但一旦选了就永远不能更改。明白吗？"

msgid "Okay, bring me  10 Fang of Wolfman. Do that, and I'll give you an Enchant Scroll. I need the fangs for a weapon I'm making right now. Deal?"
msgstr "好，给我带来10颗狼人之牙。做到了，我就给你一张附魔卷轴。我现在正在做的一把武器需要这些牙。成交？"

msgid "Sorry, I'm a little tired at the moment. Let's give it a rest eh?"
msgstr "抱歉，我现在有点累。我们歇一歇好吗？"

msgid "Master! You've got all the teeth now. Let's head back to Heppa and exchange them for the Enchant Scroll."
msgstr "主人！你现在牙都凑齐了。我们回去找赫帕，把它们换成附魔卷轴吧。"

msgid "Thanks. Choose the scroll you want..."
msgstr "谢谢。选择你想要的卷轴……"

msgid "Hmm... I actually asked for 10 Fangs."
msgstr "嗯……我要的可是10颗牙。"

msgid "The weather today is incredible isn't it? I really need some major downtime. We'll talk about it next time."
msgstr "今天天气好极了，不是吗？我真的需要好好休息一下。我们下次再谈。"

msgid "As I said before, once an Enchant Upgrade ability is unlocked on the Armor, it can't be changed or taken back. So think carefully before you go wasting scrolls and putting useless enchantments on things."
msgstr "如我之前所说，护甲上一旦解锁了附魔强化能力，就不能更改或收回。所以在你浪费卷轴、给东西附上没用的附魔之前，要想清楚。"

msgid "Okay, how about giving the ol' Enchant Upgrade scroll a whirl? Bring me your  Full Plate Boots (+5) after you've done an Enchant Upgrade."
msgstr "好，要不要试试那张老附魔强化卷轴？给你的全身板甲靴做完附魔强化后带给我。"

msgid "Okay, how about giving the ol' Enchant Upgrade scroll a whirl? Bring me your  Rogue Plate Boots (+5) after you've done an Enchant Upgrade."
msgstr "好，要不要试试那张老附魔强化卷轴？给你的盗贼板甲靴做完附魔强化后带给我。"

msgid "Okay, how about giving the ol' Enchant Upgrade scroll a whirl? Bring me your  Crystal Plate Boots (+5) after you've done an Enchant Upgrade."
msgstr "好，要不要试试那张老附魔强化卷轴？给你的水晶板甲靴做完附魔强化后带给我。"

msgid "Okay, how about giving the ol' Enchant Upgrade scroll a whirl? Bring me your  Priest Plate Boots (+5) after you've done an Enchant Upgrade."
msgstr "好，要不要试试那张老附魔强化卷轴？给你的祭司板甲靴做完附魔强化后带给我。"

msgid "You done the Enchant Upgrade yet?"
msgstr "你做完附魔强化了吗？"

msgid "Great, you did it. Ha Ha! Can't you feel the armor giving you an extra edge with its new Ability attribute? Anyway, I think at last I've told you everything I know. Here, have this on me. Consider it a ¡®graduation' present from the School of Heppa! Ha Ha Ha!"
msgstr "太好了，你做到了。哈哈！你难道感觉不到护甲的新能力属性给你带来的额外优势吗？总之，我想我终于把我知道的都告诉你了。来，这个我请了。就当是赫帕学校的¡®毕业¡¯礼物吧！哈哈哈！"

msgid "Bring me your Full Plate Boots after you've done a +4 Enhancement Upgrade on ¡®em."
msgstr "把你的全身板甲靴做一次+4强化升级后带给我。"

msgid "Bring me your Rogue Plate Boots after you've done a +4 Enhancement Upgrade on ¡®em."
msgstr "把你的盗贼板甲靴做一次+4强化升级后带给我。"

msgid "Bring me your Crystal Robe Boots after you've done a +4 Enhancement Upgrade on ¡®em."
msgstr "把你的水晶长袍靴做一次+4强化升级后带给我。"

msgid "Bring me your Priest Full Plate Boots after you've done a +4 Enhancement Upgrade on ¡®em."
msgstr "把你的祭司全身板甲靴做一次+4强化升级后带给我。"

msgid "Can you get me those 10 Fang of Wolfman for the weapon I'm working on? Thanks."
msgstr "你能帮我弄到那10颗狼人之牙吗？我正在做的武器需要。谢谢。"

msgid "Okay, this time you're going to do an Enchant Upgrade!"
msgstr "好，这次你要做一次附魔强化！"

msgid "Huh, long time no see. What's up?"
msgstr "哟，好久不见。怎么了？"

msgid "Oh, really? I thought Heppa would come himself... Magical Enhancement Rock!! This is what Heppa is looking for, right? Very well, it's his again."
msgstr "哦，真的吗？我还以为赫帕会自己来呢……魔法强化石！！这就是赫帕在找的东西，对吧？很好，那又归他了。"

msgid "What kind of fun will today bring us?"
msgstr "今天会给我们带来什么乐子呢？"

msgid "Yeah, I'd love to hear about your Weapon Upgrade.I*First, though, you need to hear about the  Scroll (Low Class) creation Quest."
msgstr "好，我很想听听你的武器强化。不过首先，你得先听听卷轴（低级）制作任务。"

msgid "Plus, I have a favor to ask. I need a   Magical Enhancement Rock, a rare thing indeed. It's for this weapon I'm making."
msgstr "另外，我有件事想求你。我需要一块魔法强化石，那可是稀罕物。是给我正在做的这把武器用的。"

msgid "I know that  [Merchant's Daughter] Menissiah has a Magical Enhancement Rock. I've already contacted her about it after hearing that she had one in her collection. I'd go over and talk to her myself, but this knee is killing me (~whimper~)"
msgstr "我知道[商人之女]梅尼西亚有一块魔法强化石。听说她收藏里有一块后，我已经跟她联系过了。我本想自己过去跟她谈，可我这膝盖疼得要命（~呜咽~）"

msgid "Anyway, first do the Weapon Upgrade, then you can bring me the  Magical Enhancement Rock. Menissiah will hand it over to ya."
msgstr "总之，先做武器强化，然后你再把魔法强化石给我带来。梅尼西亚会交给你的。"

msgid "And on your way back, grab that  Magical Enhancement Rock for me will ya?. Tell Menissiah you came on my behalf."
msgstr "回来的路上，帮我把那块魔法强化石拿来好吗？告诉梅尼西亚你是替我来的。"

msgid "Armor Upgrade... Sort out some armor that you like. I'll explain everything later."
msgstr "护甲强化……挑几件你喜欢的护甲。我稍后再解释一切。"

msgid "Master, as I recall, you'll get the boots from Castle's [Mercenary Adjutant] Rage after completing the Full Plate Armor (Boots) Quest. Remember?"
msgstr "主人，我记得你完成全身板甲（靴子）任务后，会从城堡的[佣兵副官]拉格那里拿到靴子。记得吗？"

msgid "Gj master, the upgrade was successful. Let's go back to ol' Heppa now."
msgstr "干得好主人，强化成功了。我们现在回老赫帕那里吧。"

msgid "Master, you didn't lose the boots did you? If you want another pair, you'll have to go back to Castle's [Mercenary Adjutant] Rage and complete the Full Plate Armor (Boots) Quest. Again."
msgstr "主人，你没把靴子弄丢吧？如果你还想要一双，就得回城堡的[佣兵副官]拉格那里，再做一次全身板甲（靴子）任务。"

msgid "Master, if you want to hear about Enchant Upgrades from Heppa, you must complete the Armor Enhancement Quest."
msgstr "主人，如果你想从赫帕那里了解附魔强化，就必须完成护甲强化任务。"

msgid "Merry Christmas!! | I have a special Christmas Quest Event for you!! | * Oh! Christmas Tree Event: 12/19 - 12/28"
msgstr "圣诞快乐！！|我有一个特别的圣诞任务活动给你！！|*哦！圣诞树活动：12/19 - 12/28"

msgid "We need help decorating the Christmas Trees!  We are missing the ornaments.  Please go hunt the Christmas Trees and bring the ornaments back to me. "
msgstr "我们需要人帮忙装饰圣诞树！我们缺装饰品。请去猎杀圣诞树，把装饰品给我带回来。"

msgid "Oh! Christmas Tree Event Rewards | * 10 Golden Star Ornaments -> Christmas Cross| * 10 Red Bow Ornaments -> Candy Cane Belt| * 10 Tinsel Ornaments -> Snowman Transformation Scroll| * 5 Golden Stars, 1 Red Bows, 5 Tinsels -> Christmas Present"
msgstr "哦！圣诞树活动奖励|*10个金星装饰品->圣诞十字|*10个红蝴蝶结装饰品->拐杖糖腰带|*10个金属箔装饰品->雪人变身卷轴|*5个金星、1个红蝴蝶结、5个金属箔->圣诞礼物"

msgid "Oh~ you tried very hard. Did you hurt yourself anywhere? As a token of appreciation, I will give you my weapon. I believe you will hunt easier in the future with this weapon."
msgstr "哦~你很努力。你没伤到哪里吧？为表感谢，我把我的武器送给你。我相信你以后用这把武器狩猎会更轻松。"

msgid "I recommend you go back to El Morad, eh? You'll be able to increase your strength fighting tougher monsters, and there's a lot of good adventures to be had around El Morad's heart, the El Morad Castle. Would you like to go there? "
msgstr "我建议你回艾莫拉德，好吗？你可以通过挑战更强的怪物提升实力，在艾莫拉德的中心艾莫拉德城堡周围还有很多精彩的冒险。你想去那里吗？"

msgid "How'd the hunting go? Yaaah, well, anyway. Well done."
msgstr "狩猎怎么样？哎呀，总之。干得好。"

msgid "Thanks a lot. As a token of our appreciation, we'd like to give you the treasure of our village.|It won't be a great boon to you, but please accept it anyway."
msgstr "非常感谢。为表感谢，我们想把我们村庄的宝物送给你。|它对你不算什么大恩惠，但还是请收下。"

msgid "Thank you so much. As a token of our appreciation, we'd like to give you the treasure of our village.|It won't be a great boon to you, but please accept it anyway."
msgstr "太感谢了。为表感谢，我们想把我们村庄的宝物送给你。|它对你不算什么大恩惠，但还是请收下。"

msgid "You are amazing!"
msgstr "你太厉害了！"

msgid "You chose a Christmas Cross| I will give you a Christmas Cross if you bring me 10 Golden Star Ornaments"
msgstr "你选择了圣诞十字|如果你给我带来10个金星装饰品，我就给你一个圣诞十字"

msgid "Oh~~ I am so glad you brought me 10 Golden Star Ornaments| Would you like to exchange for a Christmas Cross?"
msgstr "哦~~我太高兴你给我带来了10个金星装饰品|你想兑换一个圣诞十字吗？"

msgid "Thank you | Merry X-Mas ~~"
msgstr "谢谢|圣诞快乐~~"

msgid "You chose a Candy Cane Belt| I will give you a Candy Cane Belt if you bring me 10 Red Bow Ornaments"
msgstr "你选择了拐杖糖腰带|如果你给我带来10个红蝴蝶结装饰品，我就给你一条拐杖糖腰带"

msgid "Oh~~ I am so glad you brought me 10 Red Bow Ornaments| Would you like to exchange for Candy Cane Belt?"
msgstr "哦~~我太高兴你给我带来了10个红蝴蝶结装饰品|你想兑换拐杖糖腰带吗？"

msgid "You chose a Snowman Transformation Scroll| I will give you a Snowman Transformation Scroll if you bring me 10 Tinsel Ornaments"
msgstr "你选择了雪人变身卷轴|如果你给我带来10个金属箔装饰品，我就给你一张雪人变身卷轴"

msgid "Oh~~ I am so glad you brought me 10 Tinsel Ornaments| Would you like to exchange for Snowman Transformation Scroll?"
msgstr "哦~~我太高兴你给我带来了10个金属箔装饰品|你想兑换雪人变身卷轴吗？"

msgid "You chose Chrismas Present| I will give you chrismas Gift card if you bring me 5 Golden Star, 5 Tinsel, and 1 Red Bow Ornament"
msgstr "你选择了圣诞礼物|如果你给我带来5个金星、5个金属箔和1个红蝴蝶结装饰品，我就给你圣诞礼品卡"

msgid "Oh~~ I am so glad you brought me 5 Golden Star, 5 Tinsels, and 1 Red Bow Ornament| Would you like to exchange for a Chrismas Present?"
msgstr "哦~~我太高兴你给我带来了5个金星、5个金属箔和1个红蝴蝶结装饰品|你想兑换圣诞礼物吗？"

msgid "You haven't upgraded it yet.|You didn't lose the weapon did you?"
msgstr "你还没强化它。|你没把武器弄丢吧？"

msgid "Master, you should upgrade the thing first."
msgstr "主人，你该先把那东西强化了。"

msgid "You successfully upgraded it. That was a lesson worth learning then. So, did you get the Magical Enhancement Rock?"
msgstr "你成功强化了它。那这一课也算没白上。那么，你拿到魔法强化石了吗？"

msgid "Your inventory is full, nub.|Make some space and I'll give you a present."
msgstr "你背包满了，菜鸟。|腾出点空间，我就给你礼物。"

msgid "Master! Imperial Palace Chef Veros is the best. You should go and ask Veros for some BBQ cuisine."
msgstr "主人！皇宫厨师维罗斯是最棒的。你该去找维罗斯要点烧烤料理。"

msgid "Master! Imperial Palace Chef Veros is the best. You should go and ask Jakata for some BBQ cuisine."
msgstr "主人！皇宫厨师维罗斯是最棒的。你该去找雅卡塔要点烧烤料理。"

msgid "Master, the lover must be near the Lunar Gate. Help their love to blossom eh? Ah, it's so sad..."
msgstr "主人，恋人一定就在月之门附近。帮他们的爱情开花结果吧，好吗？啊，太悲伤了……"

msgid "Master! [Kaishan`s Daughter] Menissiah wants to see you quick."
msgstr "主人！[凯山之女]梅尼西亚急着要见你。"

msgid "Oh. I thought you`d be willing to do me the favor. "
msgstr "哦。我还以为你愿意帮我这个忙呢。"

msgid "Can you hunt Gavolts this time and bring me Apple of Moradon? I will compensate you with Speed Potion."
msgstr "这次你能猎杀加沃尔特并给我带来莫拉登苹果吗？我会用速度药水作为报酬。"

msgid "Thank you very much. I vow to succeed."
msgstr "非常感谢。我发誓一定成功。"

msgid "Master, you`ve collected all 5 Apple of Moradon. Let`s go take it Menissiah."
msgstr "主人，你已经收集齐5个莫拉登苹果了。我们把它给梅尼西亚送去吧。"

msgid "I told you I need  Apple of Moradon."
msgstr "我说过我需要莫拉登苹果。"

msgid "I`ll finally be able to make the potion. Please wait. Here. It is made with Menissiah`s care."
msgstr "我终于能配制药水了。请稍等。给。这是梅尼西亚用心制作的。"

msgid "You don`t think you can? Darn, what am I going to do."
msgstr "你觉得你办不到吗？该死，我该怎么办。"

msgid "I mastered a potion production method which requires Apple of Moradon, but I haven`t been able to obtain the ingredients yet. I will give you the hasten potion if you  bring me  Apple of Moradon. "
msgstr "我掌握了一种需要莫拉登苹果的药水制作方法，但还没能弄到材料。如果你给我带来莫拉登苹果，我就给你加速药水。"

msgid "Master, [Mercenary] Russel is looking for you."
msgstr "主人，[佣兵]拉塞尔在找你。"

msgid "What took you so long?  I have a favor to ask you. Dragon Tooth soldiers and knights have been killing and looting the village of late. I need your help as there`s too many of them to handle alone. "
msgstr "怎么这么久才来？我有件事想求你。龙牙士兵和骑士最近一直在村子里烧杀抢掠。他们太多了，我一个人应付不过来，需要你的帮助。"

msgid "The first Dragon Tooth soldiers to hunt is a far from the previous skeleton-class monsters. Brace yourself! "
msgstr "第一个要猎杀的龙牙士兵和之前的骷髅级怪物完全不同。做好准备！"

msgid "Master, the hunt was demanding but you gained a lot of experience. "
msgstr "主人，这次狩猎很艰难，但你获得了不少经验。"

msgid "Thank you. We will depart for Dragon Tooth Skeleton hunting soon. Rest up."
msgstr "谢谢。我们很快就要出发去猎杀龙牙骷髅了。好好休息。"

msgid "Master, [Mercenary] Tales is looking for you."
msgstr "主人，[佣兵]泰尔斯在找你。"

msgid "The first Dragon Teeth soldier to hunt is a far from the previous skeleton-class monsters. Brace yourself! "
msgstr "第一个要猎杀的龙牙士兵和之前的骷髅级怪物完全不同。做好准备！"

msgid "If you do a favor for [Mercenary] Tales, you will be rewarded with experience points."
msgstr "如果你帮[佣兵]泰尔斯一个忙，就会获得经验值奖励。"

msgid "Indern`s triumph"
msgstr "因德恩的胜利"

msgid "Indern`s defeat"
msgstr "因德恩的失败"

msgid "No time to kill. Get ready to go hunting right away. It`s Dragon Tooth Skeletons this time so repair your equipment and be well prepared. "
msgstr "没时间磨蹭了。马上准备出发狩猎。这次是龙牙骷髅，所以修好你的装备，做好充分准备。"

msgid "You should be able to do this alone. Are you scared?"
msgstr "你应该能独自完成。你害怕吗？"

msgid "No time to kill. Get ready to go hunting right away. It`s Dragon Tooth Skeletons this time so repair your equipment and be well prepared."
msgstr "没时间磨蹭了。马上准备出发狩猎。这次是龙牙骷髅，所以修好你的装备，做好充分准备。"

msgid "If you do a favor for [Mercenary] Russell, you will be rewarded with experience points."
msgstr "如果你帮[佣兵]拉塞尔一个忙，就会获得经验值奖励。"

msgid "Master, I hear [Sentinel] Zalk is giving out top-notch treasure... Let`s go see if it`s true."
msgstr "主人，我听说[哨兵]扎尔克在发放顶级宝物……我们去看看是不是真的。"

msgid "Hooray~!! That treasure`s yours now, Master."
msgstr "万岁~！！那宝物现在是你的了，主人。"

msgid "Arrdream?? That place is a battle zone accessible to 60Lv and below. The place where clashes with the Karus occur frequently!! I'll give you a separate letter of introduction, so go to [Search Captain] Laekand listen about the situation in detail. "
msgstr "阿德雷姆？？那地方是60级及以下才能进入的战区。是与卡鲁斯频繁交战的地方！！我会单独给你一封介绍信，去找[侦察队长]莱克详细听听情况。"

msgid "Ronark Land... It's an exploration territory like Arrdream, and we are fighting intense battles against the enemy to gain control of the area. I'll give you a letter of introduction, so go and introduce yourself to [Search Captain] Della."
msgstr "罗纳克大陆……它和阿德雷姆一样是个探索区域，我们正在与敌人激战以争夺该地区的控制权。我会给你一封介绍信，去跟[侦察队长]德拉自我介绍一下吧。"

msgid "Ronark Land... It's an exploration territory like Arrdream, and we are fighting intense battles against the enemy to gain control of the area. I'll give you a letter of introduction, so go and introduce yourself to [Defense Captain] Elrod."
msgstr "罗纳克大陆……它和阿德雷姆一样是个探索区域，我们正在与敌人激战以争夺该地区的控制权。我会给你一封介绍信，去跟[防御队长]埃尔罗德自我介绍一下吧。"

msgid "Have you purchased Ultra Premium? Then you've found the right person. You can exchange the Event Item that you received from purchasing Ultra Premium to one that you really want. Select the item you wish to trade."
msgstr "你购买了超级尊享版吗？那你找对人了。你可以把购买超级尊享版获得的活动物品换成你真正想要的。选择你想兑换的物品。"

msgid "I think I've said this before, but unless Rage gives his permission, I can't hand out the supplies."
msgstr "我记得我说过，除非拉格允许，否则我不能发放补给。"

msgid "Master, there's a rumor going about that Rage is handing out great treasure... Let's go and check if its true or not."
msgstr "主人，有传言说拉格在发放大宝物……我们去看看是不是真的。"

msgid "Yes!! Now the treasure is all ours- I mean yours, master!"
msgstr "好耶！！现在宝物全是我们的——我是说你的，主人！"

msgid "Ha ha, so you heard the rumor? Well, I found some armor and a weapon and I'm going to give ¡®em away. But not for free, as a reward for some hard work. So I'm giving a nice pair of boots to the one who hunts 10 Spoilers in the shortest time."
msgstr "哈哈，你听到传言了？嗯，我找到了一些护甲和一把武器，打算把它们送出去。但不是白送，而是作为辛苦劳作的奖励。所以我要把一双好靴子送给在最短时间内猎杀10只掠夺者的人。"

msgid "Want to give it a shot? You should be able to pull it off. "
msgstr "想试一试吗？你应该能办到。"

msgid "I told you to bring me 10!"
msgstr "我叫你给我带10个来！"

msgid "My intuition never fails.. You are well qualified to wear the boots. Hope they will come to good use."
msgstr "我的直觉从不出错……你完全有资格穿这双靴子。希望它们能派上好用场。"

msgid "If you heed [Mercenary Adjutant] Rage's request you can obtain craft items as a reward. "
msgstr "如果你听从[佣兵副官]拉格的请求，就能获得制作物品作为奖励。"

msgid "Master... How about Scorpion Hunting this time?"
msgstr "主人……这次猎蝎子怎么样？"

msgid "Now all that`s left to do is get our reward!"
msgstr "现在剩下的就是领赏了！"

msgid "You have not enough Noah."
msgstr "你的诺亚不足。"

msgid "This is one battle field you can't relax on -  This is Ardream!"
msgstr "这是一个你不能放松的战场——这里是阿德雷姆！"

msgid "This is a place where only the strong survive. This is Ronark Land!!"
msgstr "这是一个只有强者才能生存的地方。这里是罗纳克大陆！！"

msgid "Master.. What about scorpion hunt this time?"
msgstr "主人……这次猎蝎子怎么样？"

msgid "Hey! Can you help me with scorpion hunting this time? Please catch just ten of them."
msgstr "嘿！这次你能帮我猎蝎子吗？请抓十只就好。"

msgid "I will give you my gauntlet as reward. How does that sound?"
msgstr "我会把我的护手作为奖励给你。怎么样？"

msgid "Nothing in this world is free."
msgstr "这世上没有免费的东西。"

msgid "Haha~ You`re more talented than I thought. Here`s the gauntlet I promised. "
msgstr "哈哈~你比我想的更有本事。这是我答应你的护手。"

msgid "Master, [Sentinel] Zalk is giving a helmet as the reward this time.. "
msgstr "主人，[哨兵]扎尔克这次拿头盔当奖励……"

msgid "Good work, Master.."
msgstr "干得好，主人。"

msgid "This is the heart of Karus - Luferson Castle."
msgstr "这里是卡鲁斯的中心——卢弗森城堡。"

msgid "This is the heart of El Morad - Luferson Castle."
msgstr "这里是艾莫拉德的中心——卢弗森城堡。"

msgid "Master, Rage is giving you the helmet this time."
msgstr "主人，拉格这次把头盔给你。"

msgid "Master, you did try hard, I know."
msgstr "主人，我知道你确实很努力。"

msgid "It`s Lycan monsters this time. They`re wolfmen and you`ll be able to find them right outside the castle gate. Want to give it a shot?"
msgstr "这次是狼人怪物。他们是狼形人，你在城堡大门外就能找到他们。想试一试吗？"

msgid "Hunt me 20 Lycans"
msgstr "给我猎20只狼人"

msgid "Listen, I`m not in the mood to joke around."
msgstr "听着，我没心情开玩笑。"

msgid "You`re amazing. I`ll be sure to remember your name."
msgstr "你太厉害了。我一定会记住你的名字。"

msgid "Master, [Sentinel] Zalk is giving body armor bottom as reward this time. Wonder which monster it is..."
msgstr "主人，[哨兵]扎尔克这次拿下身护甲当奖励。不知道是哪个怪物……"

msgid "I'm Dueller, I manage the Clan Stadium. If you have any questions, just ask me, any time."
msgstr "我是决斗者，我管理部落竞技场。有任何问题随时问我。"

msgid "As soon as you enter this place, it's a total free-for-all. No allies, just enemies all around.  Can you handle that?"
msgstr "你一进入这个地方，就是完全混战。没有盟友，周围全是敌人。你应付得来吗？"

msgid "This is a place where you can fight your allies with enemies in your party! Speaking of parties, teamwork will keep you alive out there. Think about it."
msgstr "这是一个你可以和队友里的敌人一起打盟友的地方！说到队伍，团队合作才能让你在那里活下来。好好想想吧。"

msgid "There's always something kicking off in here."
msgstr "这里总是有事情在发生。"

msgid "Welcome. Will you help with the Loup-garou Hunt? I only need you to hunt 10 of them."
msgstr "欢迎。你愿意帮忙猎狼人吗？我只需要你猎10只。"

msgid "I will give you my body armor bottom this time."
msgstr "这次我会把我的下身护甲给你。"

msgid "If it sounds too demanding, it`s not too late to give up"
msgstr "如果觉得要求太高，现在放弃还不晚"

msgid "You`re truly reliable. Good work!"
msgstr "你真可靠。干得好！"

msgid "Master, [Sentinel] Zalk called again. Ready to go hunting?"
msgstr "主人，[哨兵]扎尔克又打电话来了。准备好去狩猎了吗？"

msgid "Ahhh, bugger it.|I've been all over the place buying things to trade in Moradon, and tired myself out before I even got there. This stuff is bloody useless anyway (~grumble grumble~)."
msgstr "啊，该死。|我到处买东西想在莫拉登做买卖，结果还没到就把自己累垮了。这些东西反正也他妈的没用（~嘟嘟囔囔~）。"

msgid "I need to reduce the load a bit.|Hey, would you take this off me? It'd be a shame to throw it away and who knows, it might be useful to you one day."
msgstr "我得减点负重。|嘿，你能帮我拿走这个吗？扔了怪可惜的，谁知道呢，说不定哪天对你有用。"

msgid "You're greedier than I am!|Look at all the crap you're carrying around, almost as much as me! You should throw some stuff away mate! Ha Ha Ha!"
msgstr "你比我还贪！|看看你背的这堆破烂，都快跟我一样多了！你该扔点东西了，伙计！哈哈哈！"

msgid "Are you.. <selfname>?|A dark shadow follows you.. I'm curious what fate has in store for you."
msgstr "你是……<selfname>吗？|一道黑影跟着你……我很好奇命运为你安排了什么。"

msgid "Master, [Sentinel] Melverick called again. Ready to go hunting?"
msgstr "主人，[哨兵]梅尔弗里克又打电话来了。准备好去狩猎了吗？"

msgid "Knew you`d show up again. Haha. Hunt me 20 Dark Eyes this time."
msgstr "就知道你会再来。哈哈。这次给我猎20只暗眼。"

msgid "Want to give it a try?"
msgstr "想试一试吗？"

msgid "Haha~ Take it slow. They're not as docile as you think. "
msgstr "哈哈~慢慢来。它们可不像你想的那么温顺。"

msgid "Good work. Don`t be too rough on my body armor now."
msgstr "干得好。现在可别把我的身护甲弄得太脏。"

msgid "Mr. Patrick is looking for you Master! "
msgstr "帕特里克先生在找你，主人！"

msgid "It's not hard to divine your fate. And anyway, it's about time for a break. I was getting kind of hungry. In fact, it could be fate that we met! Listen, for 10,000 Noah I'll show you a little of your own future."
msgstr "占卜你的命运并不难。而且，也该休息一下了。我有点饿了。其实，我们相遇也许就是缘分！听着，付10,000诺亚，我就给你看看你的一点未来。"

msgid "Okay, great. Shall we begin?"
msgstr "好，太好了。我们开始吧？"

msgid "Yeah, well, we could start, but you don't seem to have the 10,000 Noah..."
msgstr "好，我们可以开始，但你好像没有那10,000诺亚……"

msgid "From the 15th of February, the Goddess Akarra's (patron of life and peace) trust has fallen upon us for 2 weeks."
msgstr "从2月15日起，阿卡拉女神（生命与和平的守护神）的庇佑已降临我们身上，为期两周。"

msgid "Long time no see. I called you for no ther reason than to ask a favor of you. Nowadays, they say Orcs are stationed on the outskirts of Folk Village. The timing is not good. If they invade us during these troubled times, we will certainly lose as there are only new recruits available to defend..."
msgstr "好久不见。我找你没别的事，就是想求你帮个忙。如今，听说兽人驻扎在民俗村庄郊外。时机不好。如果他们在这乱世入侵我们，我们肯定会输，因为只有新兵可以防守……"

msgid "How is it? If you take care of Orc Watchers, I will give a corresponding reward"
msgstr "怎么样？如果你解决掉兽人监视者，我会给你相应的奖励"

msgid "[In reserve]"
msgstr "[备用]"

msgid "If you fulfill a [Guard] Patrick's request, you can receive an experience value as a reward."
msgstr "如果你完成[守卫]帕特里克的请求，就能获得经验值作为奖励。"

msgid "Master, do you know Telson in charge of imperial palace security? Why don`t you pay him a visit? "
msgstr "主人，你知道负责皇宫警卫的特尔森吗？何不去拜访他一下？"

msgid "You'll receive an Event Item Voucher if you purchase Ultra Premium. First, bring me the voucher."
msgstr "你购买超级尊享版会收到一张活动物品凭证。先把凭证带给我。"

msgid "You've selected Trina's Piece. Would you like to exchange it for Trina's Piece?"
msgstr "你选择了特里娜碎片。你想把它兑换成特里娜碎片吗？"

msgid "The exchange was successful. Thanks."
msgstr "兑换成功。谢谢。"

msgid "You have selected Karibedis' Piece Would you like to exchange it for 4 Karibedis Pieces?"
msgstr "你选择了卡里贝迪斯碎片。你想把它兑换成4个卡里贝迪斯碎片吗？"

msgid "Master, do you know Verca in charge of imperial palace security? Why don`t you pay him a visit? "
msgstr "主人，你知道负责皇宫警卫的维尔卡吗？何不去拜访他一下？"

msgid "Nice to meet you. I`m the [Mercenary Adjutant] Rage. I`d like to ask you a favor if you don`t mind."
msgstr "很高兴见到你。我是[佣兵副官]拉格。如果你不介意，我想求你帮个忙。"

msgid "There's these Skeleton monsters. Undead, undying, you know the drill. So will you protect our village and hunt them down for us?"
msgstr "有这些骷髅怪物。亡灵、不死，你懂的。那你愿意保护我们的村庄，帮我们把它们猎杀吗？"

msgid "When are you going to finish your mission?"
msgstr "你什么时候完成任务？"

msgid "Thank you very much. The toughest is behind us. I will give you my body armor as compensation."
msgstr "非常感谢。最艰难的部分已经过去了。我会把我的身护甲作为补偿给你。"

msgid "Master, the imperial palace guard wants to see you quick."
msgstr "主人，皇宫警卫急着要见你。"

msgid "You have selected the Redistribution Item. Would you like to exchange it for one Redistribution Item?"
msgstr "你选择了重置道具。你想把它兑换成一个重置道具吗？"

msgid "Moradon has changed a lot. 10 years has even changed the river and the mountains... Never thought Moradon would develop this much. What do you reckon? Do you like the new Moradon? Tut Tut."
msgstr "莫拉登变了很多。十年连山河都变了……从没想过莫拉登会发展成这样。你觉得呢？你喜欢新的莫拉登吗？啧啧。"

msgid "¡®Allo. I'm Norman.|I may look old and weak, but I'm still a Magician. Tut Tut. Shall I join Moradon's birthday festivities?"
msgstr "¡®你好。我是诺曼。|我可能看起来又老又弱，但我仍是个魔法师。啧啧。我该加入莫拉登的生日庆典吗？"

msgid "Oi oi - don't look at me like that... If you don't believe me, I'll prove it. Hmm, so, what if I improve one of your abilities? You'd believe it then wouldn't you?"
msgstr "喂喂——别那样看我……如果你不信，我会证明给你看。嗯，那如果我提升你的一项能力呢？那你就会信了，对吧？"

msgid "Master, the imperial palace sentinel wants to see you quick."
msgstr "主人，皇宫哨兵急着要见你。"

msgid "I looked everywhere for you.  If you`re not too busy I could use your help. I received word that Paralyzer monsters surfaced around the castle. I`ve got a hunch something`s up their sleeve. "
msgstr "我到处在找你。如果你不太忙，我想请你帮忙。我收到消息说城堡附近出现了麻痹者怪物。我有种预感它们在打什么主意。"

msgid "They should be eliminated just in case. Eliminate 20 of them. Will you take on the task? "
msgstr "为以防万一，应该消灭它们。消灭20只。你愿意接这个任务吗？"

msgid "Oh~ you tried very hard. Did you hurt yourself anywhere? As a token of appreciation, I will give you my weapon. Here, you'll have an easier time hunting with this weapon. Please pick one that you like from here."
msgstr "哦~你很努力。你没伤到哪里吧？为表感谢，我把我的武器送给你。来，你用这把武器狩猎会更轻松。请从这里挑一件你喜欢的。"

msgid "You`re already finished? I`ll give you my body armor as reward. They`re supplied exclusively to us imperial palace guards but they`re more useful than they look. Haha... "
msgstr "你已经完成了？我会把我的身护甲作为奖励给你。它们是专供我们皇宫警卫的，但它们比看起来更实用。哈哈……"

msgid "Master, the imperial palace guard sent an urgent message. Why don`t you go see him? "
msgstr "主人，皇宫警卫发来了急信。你何不去见他？"

msgid "Now, in return, would you bring me  15 Morandon Invitations? Got it now then?"
msgstr "那么作为回报，你能给我带来15张莫拉登邀请函吗？现在明白了吧？"

msgid "Now, in return, would you bring me  15 Morandon Invitations? It won't be so hard to get together. Tut Tut-"
msgstr "那么作为回报，你能给我带来15张莫拉登邀请函吗？凑齐不会太难。啧啧——"

msgid "Finally! Now, choose an ability for me to buff. Tut Tut."
msgstr "终于！现在，选一项能力让我强化。啧啧。"

msgid "Oh, you`re here. I wanted to see you urgently as there was no one else with whom I could entrust this mission. We`ve just organized the list of monsters who pose a potential threat. "
msgstr "哦，你来了。我急着要见你，因为没有别人可以托付这个任务。我们刚整理好一份具有潜在威胁的怪物名单。"

msgid "We`re short on knights who can take on this mission. We need your help. The first monster to be eliminated is the Dire Wolf. "
msgstr "我们缺少能承担这个任务的骑士。我们需要你的帮助。第一个要消灭的怪物是恐狼。"

msgid "Thank you. I hope you`ll continue to help me in the future."
msgstr "谢谢。我希望你以后继续帮我。"

msgid "Master, you`re going to help out the imperial palace sentinel again, aren`t you? That means now!! Heh heh..."
msgstr "主人，你又要去帮皇宫哨兵了，是吧？那就意味着现在就去！！嘿嘿……"

msgid "Don't you think you're being a bit greedy? Tut Tut."
msgstr "你不觉得你有点贪吗？啧啧。"

msgid "If you hunt outside Moradon Castle, you'll easily get enough   Morandon Invitations. Whoever collects 30 invitations will be given many presents through a prize draw. Presents include NDS, Happy Money Vouchers and Mgame Present Cash Vouchers. For more details, please check the event page on the website."
msgstr "如果你在莫拉登城堡外狩猎，很容易就能凑够莫拉登邀请函。收集到30张邀请函的人将通过抽奖获得许多礼物。礼物包括NDS、快乐钱券和Mgame礼品现金券。详情请查看网站上的活动页面。"

msgid "<selfname> is either already in the event draw list or hasn't got enough Invitations to register on it."
msgstr "<selfname>要么已经在活动抽奖名单里，要么邀请函还不够报名。"

msgid "Master, you`re going to help out the imperial palace guard again, aren`t you? That means now!! Heh heh..."
msgstr "主人，你又要去帮皇宫警卫了，是吧？那就意味着现在就去！！嘿嘿……"

msgid "The monster to be hunted this time is the Smilodon. They`re the local carnivore of the Adonis continent whose bodies are covered by a hard shell. Be careful as they are capable of waging a rapid attack. "
msgstr "这次要猎杀的怪物是剑齿虎。它们是阿多尼斯大陆的本地食肉动物，身体覆盖着硬壳。小心，它们能发动快速攻击。"

msgid "The reward will be the same as last time, imperial palace guard body armor. Thank you in advance.  "
msgstr "奖励和上次一样，皇宫警卫身护甲。先谢谢你了。"

msgid "Thank you so much. We`ll meet again when there`s another mission."
msgstr "太感谢了。有下一个任务时我们再见。"

msgid "Master, we have a message from Zalk. He would surely give us a hunting mission, right?"
msgstr "主人，扎尔克捎信来了。他肯定会给我们狩猎任务的，对吧？"

msgid "You don't have enough Invitations.|You need 30 Invitations to get on the Event Draw List."
msgstr "你的邀请函不够。|你需要30张邀请函才能进入活动抽奖名单。"

msgid "<selfname> is registered as your name. Please note that winners will be announced on the 22nd of February on the website."
msgstr "<selfname>已以你的名字登记。请注意中奖者将于2月22日在网站上公布。"

msgid "Master, This Moradon place is quite unfamiliar, eh? Go find Mercenary Captain Cougar, he'll explain all about Moradon."
msgstr "主人，这个莫拉登地方你很陌生吧？去找佣兵队长库加，他会把莫拉登的一切都告诉你。"

msgid "Master, we have a message from Melverick. He would surely give us a hunting mission, right?"
msgstr "主人，梅尔弗里克捎信来了。他肯定会给我们狩猎任务的，对吧？"

msgid "The third target is Wild Smilodon. Their defense ability is higher than ordinary Smirdons."
msgstr "第三个目标是野生剑齿虎。它们的防御能力比普通剑齿兽更高。"

msgid "Your objective is to capture 10 of them. It shouldn`t be too difficult. "
msgstr "你的目标是捕获10只。应该不会太难。"

msgid "Thank you. Things are progressing faster than planned. "
msgstr "谢谢。事情进展得比计划还快。"

msgid "Master, do you know [Sentinel] Zalk in the El Morad Castle?"
msgstr "主人，你认识艾莫拉德城堡里的[哨兵]扎尔克吗？"

msgid "You must be new to Moradon.|This is a neutral area where citizens of both Karus and El Morad may mix freely. It's the only place on the continent where the two peoples coexist peacefully. Follow me, there's more to tell."
msgstr "你一定是刚到莫拉登。|这是一个中立区域，卡鲁斯和艾莫拉德的公民都可以自由往来。这是大陆上唯一一个两个民族和平共处的地方。跟我来，还有更多要告诉你。"

msgid "Moradon is also the center of Commerce on the Adonisian Continent, and again, the only neutral city not belonging solely to either Karus or El Morad."
msgstr "莫拉登也是阿多尼斯大陆的商业中心，而且是唯一一个不只属于卡鲁斯或艾莫拉德任一方的中立城市。"

msgid "Master, do you know [Sentinel] Melverick in the Luferson Castle?"
msgstr "主人，你认识卢弗森城堡里的[哨兵]梅尔弗里克吗？"

msgid "Hm... A stranger- It might be your first adventure here in Karus. Nice to meet you.- I am Melverick, a Sentinel at the Luferson Castle. I am at your service.-If you have time, could you do me a favor?"
msgstr "嗯……陌生人——这也许是你在卡鲁斯的第一次冒险。很高兴见到你。——我是梅尔弗里克，卢弗森城堡的一名哨兵。随时为你效劳。——如果你有时间，能帮我个忙吗？"

msgid "Here in the mainland, we have creatures called  Shadow Seekers that are notorious for causing troubles everywhere. Even now they are rampaging about at various places, so could you please help us with them?"
msgstr "在这片大陆上，有一种叫暗影追寻者的生物，到处惹是生非，臭名昭著。即使现在它们还在各处肆虐，你能帮我们对付它们吗？"

msgid "Oh, you can always come and see me when you need new weapons. I can keep supporting you with weapons until you reach 35Lv."
msgstr "哦，你需要新武器时随时可以来找我。我可以一直供应你武器，直到你升到35级。"

msgid "Don`t strain yourself. You won`t be able to handle them alone. "
msgstr "别勉强自己。你一个人应付不了它们。"

msgid "Thanks a lot! I will ask a favor of you next time too."
msgstr "非常感谢！下次我还会找你帮忙的。"

msgid "Don't like your fate today? Heh, come and see me tomorrow then."
msgstr "不喜欢你今天的命运吗？嘿，那明天再来找我吧。"

msgid "Master, [Mercenary] Russel is looking for you urgently. "
msgstr "主人，[佣兵]拉塞尔急着找你。"

msgid "Aren't you tired of traveling alone, master? Why not get yourself one of the Familiars that  [Trainer] Kate breeds?"
msgstr "主人，你一个人旅行不累吗？何不弄一只[驯兽师]凯特培育的灵兽呢？"

msgid "Don`t strain yourself. Come back after you`ve completed the last monster hunt. "
msgstr "别勉强自己。完成上一次怪物狩猎后再回来。"

msgid "Undertake [Mercenary Adjutant] Rage`s request and you`ll receive weaponry as compensation. "
msgstr "接受[佣兵副官]拉格的请求，你就会获得武器作为补偿。"

msgid "Undertake [Mercenary Adjutant] Rage`s request and you`ll receive weaponry as compensation."
msgstr "接受[佣兵副官]拉格的请求，你就会获得武器作为补偿。"

msgid "Heed [Mercenary] Russel`s request and you`ll receive 5th armor as compensation. "
msgstr "听从[佣兵]拉塞尔的请求，你就会获得5阶护甲作为补偿。"

msgid "Heed [Mercenary] Tales`s request and you`ll receive 5th armor as compensation. "
msgstr "听从[佣兵]泰尔斯的请求，你就会获得5阶护甲作为补偿。"

msgid "Hey. I`m going on a hunt. Have you heard of Ash Knights? If this comes through we`ll make a bundle. Lend me a hand.  "
msgstr "嘿。我要去狩猎了。你听说过灰烬骑士吗？如果成了，我们能大赚一笔。帮我一把。"

msgid "Hey. I`m going on a hunt. Have you heard of Ash Knights? If this comes through we`ll make a bundle. Lend me a hand."
msgstr "嘿。我要去狩猎了。你听说过灰烬骑士吗？如果成了，我们能大赚一笔。帮我一把。"

msgid "If you do a favor for [Imperial Guard] Bekar, you will be rewarded with experience points."
msgstr "如果你帮[帝国近卫兵]贝卡一个忙，就会获得经验值奖励。"

msgid "If you do a favor for [Imperial Guard] Telson, you will be rewarded with experience points."
msgstr "如果你帮[帝国近卫兵]特尔森一个忙，就会获得经验值奖励。"

msgid "If you do a favor for [Guard] Hashan, you will be rewarded."
msgstr "如果你帮[守卫]哈山一个忙，就会获得奖励。"

msgid "If you do a favor for [Guard] Beth, you will be rewarded."
msgstr "如果你帮[守卫]贝丝一个忙，就会获得奖励。"

msgid "[Sentinel] Hashan will award 5 each of weaponry, armor, and enchant scrolls for hunting treants."
msgstr "[哨兵]哈山会因狩猎树精而奖励武器、护甲和附魔卷轴各5件。"

msgid "[Sentinel] Beth will award 5 each of weaponry, armor, and enchant scrolls for hunting treants."
msgstr "[哨兵]贝丝会因狩猎树精而奖励武器、护甲和附魔卷轴各5件。"

msgid "If you do a favor for [Imperial Guard] Bekar, you will be rewarded."
msgstr "如果你帮[帝国近卫兵]贝卡一个忙，就会获得奖励。"

msgid "If you do a favor for [Imperial Guard] Telson, you will be rewarded."
msgstr "如果你帮[帝国近卫兵]特尔森一个忙，就会获得奖励。"

msgid "If you do a favor for [Mercenary] Russell, you will be rewarded."
msgstr "如果你帮[佣兵]拉塞尔一个忙，就会获得奖励。"

msgid "If you do a favor for [Mercenary] Tales, you will be rewarded."
msgstr "如果你帮[佣兵]泰尔斯一个忙，就会获得奖励。"

msgid "[Sentinel] Cape will award  the treasure chest at the Forgotten Temple for undertaking the request. "
msgstr "[哨兵]凯普会因接受请求而奖励遗忘神殿的宝箱。"

msgid "[Sentinel] Cheina will award  the treasure chest at the Forgotten Temple for undertaking the request. "
msgstr "[哨兵]切伊娜会因接受请求而奖励遗忘神殿的宝箱。"

msgid "How'd the hunting go? Select the weapon you want."
msgstr "狩猎怎么样？选择你想要的武器。"

msgid "A chance to put some experience under your belt like this doesn`t come by often. "
msgstr "像这样积累经验的机会可不常有。"

msgid "Master! [Mercenary] Russel has been wounded in a recent battle!"
msgstr "主人！[佣兵]拉塞尔在最近的一场战斗中受伤了！"

msgid "And with Apes causing a headache recently, the injury to Russel is really a bad news."
msgstr "加上最近猿怪让人头疼，拉塞尔受伤真是个坏消息。"

msgid "Mmm... How about dealing with the Ape problem yourself, master?"
msgstr "嗯……主人，你自己来处理猿怪的问题怎么样？"

msgid "Oh, shame. You're already on too many quests."
msgstr "哦，真遗憾。你接的任务太多了。"

msgid "You might like to know that the Apes around here are enormous meat-eating bastards who favor surprise attacks. So, like, be careful!"
msgstr "你最好知道，这附近的猿怪是巨大的食肉混蛋，喜欢偷袭。所以，小心点！"

msgid "Master, you tried hard. Let's go and claim the reward."
msgstr "主人，你很努力。我们去领赏吧。"

msgid "Apes..."
msgstr "猿怪……"

msgid "Master! [Mercenary] Tales has been wounded in a recent battle!"
msgstr "主人！[佣兵]泰尔斯在最近的一场战斗中受伤了！"

msgid "And with Apes causing a headache recently, the injury to Tales is really a bad news."
msgstr "加上最近猿怪让人头疼，泰尔斯受伤真是个坏消息。"

msgid "There's a warrior with no name who wanders around in Moradon. He was praised as a hero once... Wouldn't it be great to meet him?"
msgstr "有一个无名战士在莫拉登四处游荡。他曾被赞为英雄……见到他不是很棒吗？"

msgid "Master, maybe you should go hunting with [Mercenary] Russel. "
msgstr "主人，也许你该跟[佣兵]拉塞尔一起去狩猎。"

msgid "What`s that? You want to go hunting with me? Haha... Don`t go overboard now, my prey is no piece of cake. "
msgstr "什么？你想跟我一起去狩猎？哈哈……别高兴太早，我的猎物可不是好惹的。"

msgid "I`ll give you another prey. Burning Skeletons should be perfect for you. Want to give it a shot? "
msgstr "我给你换个猎物。燃烧骷髅对你来说应该正好。想试一试吗？"

msgid "You know what? If you bring me Burning Skeletons, I'll repay you in weapons all the way to Level 50! Come see me anytime, Ok?"
msgstr "你知道吗？如果你给我带来燃烧骷髅，我会用武器报答你，一直供应到50级！随时来找我，好吗？"

msgid "Master, maybe you should go hunting with [Mercenary] Tales."
msgstr "主人，也许你该跟[佣兵]泰尔斯一起去狩猎。"

msgid "What`s that? You want to go hunting with me? Haha... Don`t go overboard now, my prey is no piece of cake."
msgstr "什么？你想跟我一起去狩猎？哈哈……别高兴太早，我的猎物可不是好惹的。"

msgid "I`m going to hunt for prey that`ll bring home some money."
msgstr "我要去猎点能赚钱的猎物。"

msgid "You've already got too many missions. Come back after you clear your mission log a bit."
msgstr "你接的任务已经太多了。先清理一下任务日志再回来。"

msgid "Master, the 6th armor bottom is in Belua Village. [Sentinel] Cape should know. "
msgstr "主人，6阶下身护甲在贝卢亚村。[哨兵]凯普应该知道。"

msgid "What if you hunt monsters first and receive them as compensation? Lich monsters should be all right... "
msgstr "你先去猎怪物，然后把它们作为补偿领取怎么样？巫妖怪物应该没问题……"

msgid "Lich are resurrected corpses of mages slain in the war against Pathos and they practice powerful magic. Be careful. "
msgstr "巫妖是在与帕托斯的战争中被杀的法师复活的尸体，他们会施展强大的魔法。小心。"

msgid "Shouldn`t 10 be enough?"
msgstr "10只应该够了吧？"

msgid "Long time no see. What brings you to our village?"
msgstr "好久不见。什么风把你吹到我们村来了？"

msgid "Master, the 6th armor bottom is in Belua Village. [Sentinel] Cheina should know. "
msgstr "主人，6阶下身护甲在贝卢亚村。[哨兵]切伊娜应该知道。"

msgid "Sheesh, wasn`t it one heck of a fight?"
msgstr "哎呀，那一场战斗可真够呛，是吧？"

msgid "Don`t tell me you hunted them alone. At any rate, good work."
msgstr "别告诉我是你一个人猎的。不管怎样，干得好。"

msgid "[Mercenary] Russel sent word. Must be about another hunting mission. "
msgstr "[佣兵]拉塞尔捎信来了。一定又是狩猎任务。"

msgid "How are you feeling? We`re embarking on another big hunt, want to join us? As I won`t be able to face the prey alone,  I`m gathering colleagues to accompany me. "
msgstr "你感觉怎么样？我们又要开始一场大狩猎了，想加入我们吗？因为我一个人对付不了猎物，所以正在召集同伴陪我一起。"

msgid "We're going after 40 Haungas! Isn't that great! Ha-ha-ha!"
msgstr "我们要去猎40只豪加！太棒了吧！哈哈哈！"

msgid "Your ability`s growing by leaps and bounds. You know that`s all on my account, don`t you? Haha..."
msgstr "你的实力突飞猛进。你知道这全靠我吧？哈哈……"

msgid "[Mercenary] Tales sent word. Must be about another hunting mission."
msgstr "[佣兵]泰尔斯捎信来了。一定又是狩猎任务。"

msgid "Master, maybe we should swing by Belua Village. Wonder if everything`s all right. "
msgstr "主人，也许我们该顺道去贝卢亚村看看。不知道一切是否安好。"

msgid "Eh, eh, I was about to contact you. It's just that the villagers can't freely go out of the village because of the monsters lurking nearby."
msgstr "哎，我正想联系你呢。只是因为附近潜伏着怪物，村民不能自由出村。"

msgid "As you know, we are barely protecting the village and don't have the strength to take care of them. Would you please help us?"
msgstr "如你所知，我们勉强守住村子，没有力气去对付它们。你能帮帮我们吗？"

msgid "Master, maybe we should swing by Asga Village. Wonder if everything`s all right. "
msgstr "主人，也许我们该顺道去阿斯加村看看。不知道一切是否安好。"

msgid "As you`re well aware, we`re short on men just for village security and we have no means of confronting them. Can you help us?"
msgstr "如你所知，我们光守卫村子就人手不足，更没办法对付它们。你能帮帮我们吗？"

msgid "Master, Linnart Village is recruiting knights due to heightened monster attacks. I think you should go talk to [Sentinel] Hashan. "
msgstr "主人，由于怪物袭击加剧，林纳特村正在招募骑士。我觉得你该去找[哨兵]哈山谈谈。"

msgid "Nice to meet you. I am Hashan, in charge of village security. I`ve heard so much about you. Meeting you in person like this finally affords hope to our village. "
msgstr "很高兴见到你。我是负责村庄警卫的哈山。我久仰你的大名。像这样亲自见到你，终于给我们村带来了希望。"

msgid "The monster attacks have jumped markedly and the resulting damage dire. At this rate, it`s just a matter of time till our village disappears. Please save our village. "
msgstr "怪物袭击急剧增加，造成的损失惨重。照这样下去，我们村消失只是时间问题。请救救我们的村庄。"

msgid "Master. [Imperial Palace Guard] Verca is about to go on a hunt, so how about joining him?"
msgstr "主人。[皇宫警卫]维尔卡正要去狩猎，你何不和他一起去？"

msgid "Ha ha~ I guess it reached your ears as well. Yes, it is true. This time I am going to hunt the Hornets, so do you want to join me?"
msgstr "哈哈~我想你也听说了吧。是的，是真的。这次我要去猎黄蜂，你想加入我吗？"

msgid "You may be able to gain valuable experience from this hunt. Why don`t you and your colleagues come join us? "
msgstr "你也许能从这次狩猎中获得宝贵经验。你和你的同伴何不来加入我们？"

msgid "Haha... how is it going? Good work. "
msgstr "哈哈……怎么样？干得好。"

msgid "Master, [Imperial Palace Guard] Verca is recruiting warriors for a massive Haunga hunt. Why don`t you go join him? "
msgstr "主人，[皇宫警卫]维尔卡正在招募战士参加一场大规模豪加狩猎。你何不去加入他？"

msgid "This time it's hunting the Haunga Warriors, so do you want to be on it? By the way, a Haunga Warrior isn't easy to hunt as it is strong and has high defense power as well as resistances."
msgstr "这次是猎豪加战士，你想参加吗？顺便说一句，豪加战士不好猎，因为它很强，防御高，还有抗性。"

msgid "However, this should be a simple task for someone of your skill level, <selfname>."
msgstr "不过，以你这样的实力，这应该是小菜一碟，<selfname>。"

msgid "Good work. You`ve gained valuable experience from this hunt."
msgstr "干得好。你从这次狩猎中获得了宝贵经验。"

msgid "Master, Laiva Village is recruiting knights due to heightened monster attacks. I think you should go talk to [Sentinel] Beth.  "
msgstr "主人，由于怪物袭击加剧，莱瓦村正在招募骑士。我觉得你该去找[哨兵]贝丝谈谈。"

msgid "Nice to meet you. I am Beth, in charge of village security. I`ve heard so much about you. Meeting you in person like this finally affords hope to our village. "
msgstr "很高兴见到你。我是负责村庄警卫的贝丝。我久仰你的大名。像这样亲自见到你，终于给我们村带来了希望。"

msgid "Master. [Imperial Palace Guard] Telson is about to go on a hunt, so how about joining him?"
msgstr "主人。[皇宫警卫]特尔森正要去狩猎，你何不和他一起去？"

msgid "Master, [Imperial Palace Guard] Telson is recruiting warriors for a Haunga Warrior hunt. Why don`t you go join him? "
msgstr "主人，[皇宫警卫]特尔森正在招募战士参加豪加战士狩猎。你何不去加入他？"

msgid "As this hunt is large scale, it might affect other missions you are undertaking. Please go finish your current hunt first. "
msgstr "由于这次狩猎规模较大，可能会影响你正在进行的其他任务。请先去完成你当前的狩猎。"

msgid "I`m swamped today. I`ll see you next time."
msgstr "我今天忙得很。下次再见。"

msgid "Are you hunting monsters?"
msgstr "你在猎怪物吗？"

msgid "I'd like to ask you for help, but as you are already on a hunt I do not wish to bother you with it."
msgstr "我想请你帮忙，但你已经在狩猎了，我不想因此打扰你。"

msgid "Thank you. Wasn`t it more demanding than you thought?"
msgstr "谢谢。是不是比你想的更费劲？"

msgid "You already have a hunt under way. Come back when you`re finished with it."
msgstr "你已经有一场狩猎在进行了。完成后再回来。"

msgid "Thank you. It seems the road to knighthood is extremely demanding."
msgstr "谢谢。看来通往骑士的路极其艰难。"

msgid "Hope the village will regain peace soon..."
msgstr "希望村子早日恢复安宁……"

msgid "Thank you very much. I`m so glad we have a knight like you in our village."
msgstr "非常感谢。我们村有你这样的骑士，我真高兴。"

msgid "Master! [Sentinel] Hashan an urgent from Linnart Village! You must go see him now! "
msgstr "主人！[哨兵]哈山从林纳特村发来急信！你必须马上去见他！"

msgid "You came. Residents are shivering in fear due to the Uruk Hai who have converged at the village entrance. Please get rid of them. "
msgstr "你来了。村民们因聚集在村口的强兽人而吓得发抖。请把它们清除掉。"

msgid "There's a lot of them, but it should be a simple task for someone of your skill level, <selfname>."
msgstr "它们数量很多，但以你这样的实力应该是小菜一碟，<selfname>。"

msgid "Master! [Sentinel] Beth an urgent from Laiva Village! You must go see her now!"
msgstr "主人！[哨兵]贝丝从莱瓦村发来急信！你必须马上去见她！"

msgid "Master, [Sentinel] Hashan`s gravely concerned on account of the monsters. What if you go ahead and hunt them down first? "
msgstr "主人，[哨兵]哈山因为怪物的事非常担忧。你先去把它们猎了怎么样？"

msgid "What do you mean you`ll think about it... Think of the residents under siege!! "
msgstr "你说你要考虑考虑是什么意思……想想被围困的村民吧！！"

msgid "What about hunting treants? They attack with tree branches and their defense ability`s exceptional due to the old vines. But they`re weak against fire attacks. "
msgstr "猎树精怎么样？它们用树枝攻击，由于古老藤蔓，防御能力极强。但它们怕火属性攻击。"

msgid "Master... you should finish the current hunt first."
msgstr "主人……你该先完成当前的狩猎。"

msgid "You`re going on the hunt, aren`t you?"
msgstr "你要去狩猎了，是吧？"

msgid "I never knew protecting the village was this demanding."
msgstr "我从没想过保护村子这么费劲。"

msgid "Is there anything you want to say to me... If not, I have to get going. I`m on my want to hunt treants. "
msgstr "你有什么要跟我说的吗……如果没有，我得走了。我正要去猎树精。"

msgid "To think that my sound suggestion was rejected..."
msgstr "没想到我的好建议竟被拒绝了……"

msgid "Hm..."
msgstr "嗯……"

msgid "The hunt`s over!! Let`s go see [Sentinel] Hashan now. "
msgstr "狩猎结束了！！我们现在去见[哨兵]哈山吧。"

msgid "Hmm... looks like you`re in the middle of a hunt."
msgstr "嗯……看来你正在狩猎中。"

msgid "Whoa... you`ve hunted treants. That`s my job. Thank you. This is your compensation. Please accept it."
msgstr "哇……你猎了树精。那本来是我的工作。谢谢。这是你的补偿。请收下。"

msgid "Master, [Sentinel] Beth`s gravely concerned on account of the monsters. What if you go ahead and hunt them down first? "
msgstr "主人，[哨兵]贝丝因为怪物的事非常担忧。你先去把它们猎了怎么样？"

msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "嗯……"

msgid "Oh, you`re here. Please protect our village from the Ancients. They`re treant like monsters with high defense ability. "
msgstr "哦，你来了。请保护我们的村庄免受古树怪的侵扰。它们是类似树精的怪物，防御能力很高。"

msgid "Sorry to be only asking for help all the time. I`ll requite your help someday. "
msgstr "抱歉总是只找你帮忙。总有一天我会报答你的。"

msgid "[Sentinel] Cape will compensate you with 5th armor if you heed the request. "
msgstr "如果你听从请求，[哨兵]凯普会用5阶护甲补偿你。"

msgid "[Sentinel] Cheina will compensate you with 5th armor if you heed the request. "
msgstr "如果你听从请求，[哨兵]切伊娜会用5阶护甲补偿你。"

msgid "Master, here in the mainland there is a graveyard... How about meeting Bottom who is the keeper of the place?"
msgstr "主人，这片大陆上有一座墓地……去见见看守那地方的博顿怎么样？"

msgid "Hello... I'm Bottom, and I manage the Graveyard. I don't know how many years have passed since I started to keep this graveyard. Ah- Could you help me, by the way?"
msgstr "你好……我是博顿，我管理这座墓地。从我开始看守这座墓地起，不知过了多少年。啊——对了，你能帮帮我吗？"

msgid "What brings you here? Well, excuse me, I have something to do... And you seem pretty busy, too.."
msgstr "什么风把你吹来了？嗯，抱歉，我有事要做……而且你看起来也挺忙的……"

msgid "I don't know since when, but  Rotten Eyes have begun to appear at the graveyard and I cannot drive them out by myself. They're zombie monsters like Undyings, and the problem is that they come and make a terrible mess in the place. Could you try and protect the graveyard from them?"
msgstr "不知从什么时候起，墓地开始出现腐眼，我一个人赶不走它们。它们是像不死者一样的僵尸怪物，问题是它们来这里把地方弄得一团糟。你能试着保护墓地免受它们侵扰吗？"

msgid "Well done master, well done."
msgstr "干得好主人，干得好。"

msgid "The graveyard must be protected no matter what happens. Please, do your best."
msgstr "无论发生什么，墓地都必须受到保护。请尽力而为。"

msgid "Meeting you is possibly the best bit of luck I've ever had! Thank you, thank you so much. Here's a little something for ya. This is what I found while I've been keeping this place, and should be quite useful."
msgstr "遇到你也许是我这辈子最走运的事！谢谢，太感谢了。这是给你的一点小意思。这是我看守这地方时找到的，应该挺有用。"

msgid "There must be something wrong down in the Tomb, master."
msgstr "主人，墓穴下面一定出了什么事。"

msgid "Well, it's nothing... I will try to talk to you later as you seem very busy now."
msgstr "嗯，没什么……你现在看起来很忙，我晚点再跟你谈。"

msgid "What - How - You drove out all those Vatalions..I'll never forget this. And this is something I picked up near the graveyard a few days ago, and it doesn't look like something ordinary... Please, take it as a token of my appreciation."
msgstr "什么——怎么——你把那些瓦塔里昂全都赶走了……我永远不会忘记这件事。还有，这是我几天前在墓地附近捡到的，看起来不像普通东西……请收下，作为我的一点心意。"

msgid "Master, the mainland has its own Gravesite. Slay defends the site. How about you meet him?"
msgstr "主人，大陆上有它自己的墓地。斯雷在守卫那地方。你去见见他怎么样？"

msgid "As it has already been reported to [Mercenary Adjutant] Rage that I would stand guard until tomorrow, I am worried since they are still short of Apples. As I don't have anybody else that I can turn to in this situation, can you secure the Apples of Moradon for me? Five or more will be alright."
msgstr "我已经向[佣兵副官]拉格报告说我会守到明天，但我担心他们还缺苹果。这种情况下我没有别人可以求助，你能帮我弄到莫拉登苹果吗？五个以上就行。"

msgid "Oops, seems like you already have too many other missions. Come back when you've taken care of some of them."
msgstr "哎呀，你好像已经有太多别的任务了。先处理掉一些再回来。"

msgid "You are still doing yesterday's mission. Sorry, but that mission isn't valid any more."
msgstr "你还在做昨天的任务。抱歉，那个任务已经失效了。"

msgid "Thanksgiving Day, the biggest holiday in 2008! We have prepared a special event for the occasion!"
msgstr "感恩节，2008年最盛大的节日！我们为此准备了特别活动！"

msgid "It is the duel in a game of Yut!! Erm? Are you asking what the difference is from the New Year Holiday? Hu hu, if you beat me, I will give you not just 10,000 Noahs but also a premium coupon, which you can exchange with a [Special Pet Transformation Scroll] when you collect 50 coupons. Now, how about betting 5,000 Noahs for a match?"
msgstr "这是一场掷柶游戏对决！！呃？你问和新年活动有什么区别？哼哼，如果你赢了我，我不仅给你10,000诺亚，还给你一张高级优惠券，攒够50张就能兑换一张[特殊宠物变身卷轴]。那么，押5,000诺亚来一局怎么样？"

msgid "You are engaging in National Defence Combat."
msgstr "你正在参与国防战。"

msgid "If you take on too many missions, it will produce calamitous results. Please finish your current hunting mission first. "
msgstr "如果你接太多任务，会造成灾难性后果。请先完成你当前的狩猎任务。"

msgid "A hunt of this intensity is a piece of cake, right? Heh heh..."
msgstr "这种强度的狩猎对你来说是小菜一碟，对吧？嘿嘿……"

msgid "Master, how`re you feeling? The imperial palace guard is looking for you... "
msgstr "主人，你感觉怎么样？皇宫警卫在找你……"

msgid "Did you just get here? How are you feeling? We`re hunting Saber Tooth this time, a Smirdon like monster. I feel a little guilty always enlisting your help.  "
msgstr "你刚到吗？感觉怎么样？这次我们猎剑齿虎，一种类似剑齿兽的怪物。总是找你帮忙，我有点过意不去。"

msgid "In return, I`ll give you knight-class body armor as reward beginning with this mission. It`s incomparable to the previous ones. "
msgstr "作为回报，从这个任务开始，我会给你骑士级身护甲作为奖励。这和之前的没法比。"

msgid "Thank you. This is the imperial knight body armor. "
msgstr "谢谢。这是皇宫骑士身护甲。"

msgid "How is your adventure here in the mainland? Isn't it tough? Haha- just like before, I came here to ask you for a hunt. The targets are the Saber Tooths.. They are pretty ferocious, but would you like to hunt them?"
msgstr "你在这片大陆的冒险怎么样？不艰难吗？哈哈——和之前一样，我来找你是想请你狩猎。目标是剑齿虎……它们相当凶猛，但你想猎它们吗？"

msgid "I will give you a very useful armor when you complete this hunt."
msgstr "你完成这次狩猎后，我会给你一件非常实用的护甲。"

msgid "Well done. The reward is the armor suppied only to the Palace Guards, so I am sure you'll find it handy."
msgstr "干得好。奖励是专供皇宫警卫的护甲，我相信你会觉得很实用。"

msgid "Hum...The targets of this hunt are Skeletons of the Warrior class. It might be a difficult hunt as it is said that they never stop attacking until the last drop of the magic of life that sustains them is left in them."
msgstr "嗯……这次狩猎的目标是战士级骷髅。这可能是一场艰难的狩猎，因为据说它们会一直攻击，直到维持它们的最后一滴生命魔法耗尽。"

msgid "I know you will succeed."
msgstr "我知道你会成功的。"

msgid "As I expected... Well done. I'll contact you when there is another assignment, then."
msgstr "不出所料……干得好。那下次有任务时我再联系你。"

msgid "So does my armor fit you? My nation only issues it to high ranking guards. Not just anyone can get hold of it."
msgstr "我的护甲合你身吗？我的国家只把它发给高级警卫。不是谁都能弄到的。"

msgid "I am sure you are quite familiar with Skeleton monsters by now. Your target is Skeleton Knight."
msgstr "我想你现在对骷髅怪物已经很熟悉了。你的目标是骷髅骑士。"

msgid "Master, Zalk is looking for you. I wonder when these missions would end..."
msgstr "主人，扎尔克在找你。不知道这些任务什么时候是个头……"

msgid "This is the your mission. You`ve been an enormous help. The prey is Death Knights, skeletons known for their power."
msgstr "这是你的任务。你帮了大忙。猎物是死亡骑士，以力量著称的骷髅。"

msgid "Please do your best till the end!"
msgstr "请坚持到最后！"

msgid "Thank you. I will remember your name!"
msgstr "谢谢。我会记住你的名字！"

msgid "Master, Melverick is looking for you. I wonder when these missions would end..."
msgstr "主人，梅尔弗里克在找你。不知道这些任务什么时候是个头……"

msgid "You'll get some Armor out of this if you do the [Nameless Warrior] this favor."
msgstr "如果你帮[无名战士]这个忙，就能得到一些护甲。"

msgid "Master, Someone stole Belua Village's precious Cardinal Jewel. Who could've done that?"
msgstr "主人，有人偷走了贝卢亚村珍贵的红雀宝石。会是谁干的？"

msgid "[Mercenary Adjutant] Rage will award craft armor for heeding his request."
msgstr "[佣兵副官]拉格会因听从他的请求而奖励制作护甲。"

msgid "[Imperial Palace Guard] Telson will award craft armor for heeding his request."
msgstr "[皇宫警卫]特尔森会因听从他的请求而奖励制作护甲。"

msgid "Battalion is the chief Zombie. Please, be my strength"
msgstr "巴塔里昂是僵尸首领。请助我一臂之力"

msgid "Master, Someone stole Asga Village's precious Asgaberry. Who could've done that?"
msgstr "主人，有人偷走了阿斯加村珍贵的阿斯加浆果。会是谁干的？"

msgid "You'll get a weapon when you carry out [Sentinel] Melverick;s request."
msgstr "你完成[哨兵]梅尔弗里克的请求时，就会得到一把武器。"

msgid "[Imperial Palace Guard] Telson will award weaponry for heeding his request."
msgstr "[皇宫警卫]特尔森会因听从他的请求而奖励武器。"

msgid "Master, there is an an urgent message from [Sentinel] Cape! "
msgstr "主人，[哨兵]凯普发来急信！"

msgid "Nice to meet you. I am Cape, a Sentinel of the Belua Village. Since I've heard a lot about your reputation, I've contacted you to ask you a favor."
msgstr "很高兴见到你。我是凯普，贝卢亚村的哨兵。因为久仰你的大名，我才联系你想请你帮个忙。"

msgid "I have an urgent request but I see you`re busy with your current hunt."
msgstr "我有个紧急请求，但我看你正忙着当前的狩猎。"

msgid "Residents are terrified from recent Lard Orc attacks. There aren`t any competent soldiers to stand guard and their morale`s hit rock bottom as well. Please thwart the Lard Orcs. "
msgstr "村民们因最近猪油兽人的袭击而惊恐万分。没有能守卫的像样士兵，士气也跌到了谷底。请击退猪油兽人。"

msgid "Master, what you did was noble."
msgstr "主人，你做的很高尚。"

msgid "Please help us."
msgstr "请帮帮我们。"

msgid "Hmm, the Lard Orcs are getting ready to charge again. Listen, if you take out the Lard Orcs I'll supply you with as many weapons as you want."
msgstr "嗯，猪油兽人又准备进攻了。听着，如果你解决掉猪油兽人，你想要多少武器我就供应多少。"

msgid "Thank you so much. As a token of our appreciation, we'd like to give you our village treasure.|It won't be a great boon to you, but please accept it anyway. Choose what you want."
msgstr "太感谢了。为表感谢，我们想把我们村的宝物送给你。|它对你不算什么大恩惠，但还是请收下。选择你想要的。"

msgid "Master, there is an an urgent message from [Sentinel] Cheina! "
msgstr "主人，[哨兵]切伊娜发来急信！"

msgid "Glad to meet you. I`m Cheina, in charge of Laiva Village security. I`ve heard a lot lot about you and came to enlist your help."
msgstr "很高兴见到你。我是负责莱瓦村警卫的切伊娜。我久仰你的大名，特地来请你帮忙。"

msgid "Thank you so much. You`re a lifesaver."
msgstr "太感谢了。你真是救星。"

msgid "Master, there`s a message from [Sentinel] Cape."
msgstr "主人，[哨兵]凯普捎信来了。"

msgid "I have yet another favor to ask you. Monsters named Scolars dwell in our village outskirts. It`s a magic organism Pathos spurned out of casting a curse on scarecrows. They attack all humans who approach them with curse magic."
msgstr "我还有件事想求你。我们村子郊外住着一种叫斯科拉尔的怪物。那是帕托斯对着稻草人下咒后吐出来的魔法生物。它们用诅咒魔法攻击所有靠近的人类。"

msgid "I know it`s no easy task but I don`t have anyone else to ask. Please help us."
msgstr "我知道这不容易，但我没有别人可求。请帮帮我们。"

msgid "Thank you. Peace has been restored to the village once again. This is all I can give you now in compensation but I promise to reward you handsomely next time."
msgstr "谢谢。村子又恢复了安宁。这是我现在能给你的全部补偿，但我保证下次会重赏你。"

msgid "Master, there`s a message from [Sentinel] Cheina."
msgstr "主人，[哨兵]切伊娜捎信来了。"

msgid "Master, I heard there`s a mercenary at Raon Camp who exclusively hunts monsters. You think that`s true? "
msgstr "主人，我听说拉昂营地里有个专门猎怪物的佣兵。你觉得是真的吗？"

msgid "I`m Russel, the monster-hunting mercenary. There`s no monster in the world I can`t capture. How are your monster hunting skills? Wanna learn a few tips from me? Haha..."
msgstr "我是拉塞尔，猎怪物的佣兵。世上没有我抓不到的怪物。你的猎怪本领怎么样？想跟我学几招吗？哈哈……"

msgid "Hey! Why don`t you wrap up your current hunt first."
msgstr "嘿！你何不先把当前的狩猎了结了。"

msgid "Shall we start with simple Kongau since you don`t look too sharp? You can quit if you think you won`t be able to handle it. "
msgstr "既然你看起来不太行，我们从简单的孔高开始好吗？如果你觉得应付不来，可以放弃。"

msgid "Master! It won't make any more trouble now that I've given it a good fright."
msgstr "主人！我好好吓唬了它一顿，它现在再也不会捣乱了。"

msgid "Is that the best you can do? What a joke."
msgstr "你就这点本事吗？开什么玩笑。"

msgid "Hmm... you hunted them faster than I thought. Here`s a valuable body armor as reward. It might be too lavish for you, haha... "
msgstr "嗯……你猎得比我想的快。这是一件贵重的身护甲作为奖励。对你来说可能太奢侈了，哈哈……"

msgid "You underestimated my master... this is a piece of cake!! Don`t flinch. Let`s go get our reward!!"
msgstr "你小看我家主人了……这简直是小菜一碟！！别退缩。我们去领赏吧！！"

msgid "You've subdued those damned Apes? Thank you very much ? This is a sign of my appreciation, use it well."
msgstr "你制服了那些该死的猿怪？非常感谢？这是我的一点心意，好好用。"

msgid "Seems like I underestimated you a little. Hope we can see more of each other in the future. In any case, here`s a gift."
msgstr "看来我有点小看你了。希望我们以后能多见面。不管怎样，这是份礼物。"

msgid "Whew... it`s over!! That was one difficult hunt, wasn`t it?"
msgstr "呼……结束了！！那真是一场艰难的狩猎，是吧？"

msgid "Experience isn`t something afforded to just anyone."
msgstr "经验不是随便什么人都能得到的。"

msgid "Long time no see. How have you been? Do you know about a monster named Grell? They look hideous, can see through objects, and they can ascertain objects 10 Km away. "
msgstr "好久不见。近来可好？你听说过一种叫格雷尔的怪物吗？它们长相狰狞，能透视物体，还能察觉10公里外的东西。"

msgid "Can you capture that Grell? I`d really like to see them. "
msgstr "你能抓一只那格雷尔吗？我真想亲眼看看。"

msgid "Long time no see. Let`s talk again when you`ve finished your current hunt."
msgstr "好久不见。等你把手头的狩猎做完，我们再聊吧。"

msgid "Hooray... treasure chest here I come!!"
msgstr "万岁……宝箱，我来啦！！"

msgid "I`d really like to see those Grell monsters... "
msgstr "我真想看看那些格雷尔怪物……"

msgid "Thank you. With my seeking your help all the time, at least this time I can give you something in return."
msgstr "谢谢。老是麻烦你帮忙，至少这一次我能给你些回报。"

msgid "Long time no see. How have you been? Do you know about a monster named Grell? They look hideous, can see through objects, and they can ascertain objects 10Km away. "
msgstr "好久不见。近来可好？你听说过一种叫格雷尔的怪物吗？它们长相狰狞，能透视物体，还能察觉10公里外的东西。"

msgid "If you hunt Lich for [Sentinel] Cape you will receive 6th armor as compensation."
msgstr "如果你为[Sentinel]Cape猎杀巫妖，将获得6阶护甲作为报酬。"

msgid "If you hunt Lich for [Sentinel] Cheina you will receive 6th armor as compensation."
msgstr "如果你为[Sentinel]Cheina猎杀巫妖，将获得6阶护甲作为报酬。"

msgid "Master, go to [Sentinel] Cape now and ask about the armor."
msgstr "主人，现在就去找[Sentinel]Cape询问护甲的事吧。"

msgid "The 6th armor is in our village. Do you want it?"
msgstr "6阶护甲就在我们村里。你想要吗？"

msgid "I`m busy right now, come back later."
msgstr "我现在很忙，过会儿再来。"

msgid "You`ve enlivened the village again. Thank you."
msgstr "你又一次让村子热闹起来了。谢谢你。"

msgid "No way.. You hunted Liches? I could`ve just given it to you for free. Thanks anyhow."
msgstr "不会吧……你真去猎杀巫妖了？我本来直接白送你就行了。不过还是谢谢。"

msgid "Master, go to [Sentinel] Cheina now and ask about the armor."
msgstr "主人，现在就去找[Sentinel]Cheina询问护甲的事吧。"

msgid "Manticore is known for its body of lion, a tail of scorpion and fearful wings."
msgstr "蝎狮以狮子般的身躯、蝎子般的尾巴和可怕的翅膀而闻名。"

msgid "To see is to belive.. I heard it's seen from somewhere Karus."
msgstr "眼见为实……我听说有人在卡鲁斯附近见过它。"

msgid "To see is to belive.. I heard it's seen from somewhere Elmorad."
msgstr "眼见为实……我听说有人在艾莫拉德附近见过它。"

msgid "I don`t know how to thank you. This is compensation for your help. This is all I can give you."
msgstr "我真不知该如何谢你。这是给你的谢礼，我能拿出来的就这么多了。"

msgid "Uruk Blades are advancing toward this region after having killed people at the village entrance. I knew orcs were strong and brutal but I never imagine it would be to this extent. Please help me."
msgstr "乌鲁克刃兵在村口杀了人后，正朝这片地区逼近。我早知道兽人强悍凶暴，却没想到会到这种地步。请帮帮我。"

msgid "Don`t tell me you`re planning on facing them alone."
msgstr "你该不会打算一个人去对付他们吧。"

msgid "Master, isn`t it high time you got a new body armor? [Sentinel] Hashan should know where we can find top-of-the-line armor. "
msgstr "主人，你是不是该换件新的身甲了？[Sentinel]Hashan应该知道哪里能找到最好的护甲。"

msgid "Oh, speaking of body armor, I have one myself. A warrior gave it to me during the war against Pathos and I`ve held onto it till now. I`ll give it to you for every mission you accomplish."
msgstr "说到身甲，我自己倒有一件。那是对阵帕托斯的战争中一位战士送给我的，我一直留到现在。你每完成一个任务，我就给你一件。"

msgid "Would you like to try hunting Deruvish? There`s a relic site in the village outskirts but careful since they`re no easy prey.   "
msgstr "想试试猎杀德鲁维什吗？村子外缘有一处遗迹，但要小心，它们可不好对付。"

msgid "Yes~! Hunting mission accomplished~!"
msgstr "好耶~！狩猎任务完成啦~！"

msgid "The body armor`s valuable and I can`t just hand it out for free."
msgstr "这身甲很贵重，我不能白白送人。"

msgid "Seems like there`s no one else who can handle such valuables. Here`s the gauntlet, as promised."
msgstr "看来没有别人配得上这么贵重的东西。说好的，这是护手。"

msgid "Master, isn`t it high time you got a new body armor? [Sentinel] Beth should know where we can find top-of-the-line armor. "
msgstr "主人，你是不是该换件新的身甲了？[Sentinel]Beth应该知道哪里能找到最好的护甲。"

msgid "[Sentinel] Hashan will give you 6th armor as compensation if you undertake his mission. "
msgstr "如果你接受[Sentinel]Hashan的任务，他会给你6阶护甲作为报酬。"

msgid "[Sentinel] Beth will give you 6th armor as compensation if you undertake her mission. "
msgstr "如果你接受[Sentinel]Beth的任务，她会给你6阶护甲作为报酬。"

msgid "Master, let`s go get a mission from [Sentinel] Hashan."
msgstr "主人，我们去找[Sentinel]Hashan接个任务吧。"

msgid "If you succeed in this hunt I`ll give you boots as reward. Apostle are nomad monks of the Esoteric Buddhist order and turn into savage mages of darkness come nightfall. "
msgstr "这次狩猎成功的话，我就把靴子当奖品给你。使徒是密教教派的云游僧侣，一到夜幕降临就会变成凶残的黑暗法师。"

msgid "If you hunt 40 Apostles I`ll give you my boots. Will you do it?"
msgstr "如果你猎杀40个使徒，我就把我的靴子给你。愿意做吗？"

msgid "Thank you. Here are the boots, as promised."
msgstr "谢谢。说好的，这是靴子。"

msgid "Master, let`s go get a mission from [Sentinel] Beth."
msgstr "主人，我们去找[Sentinel]Beth接个任务吧。"

msgid "Welcome. You will be hunting trolls this time. They are monsters which led the Army of Darkness in the war against Pathos. They have low defense power and immunity but they possess great strength and high HP."
msgstr "欢迎。这次你要猎杀巨魔。它们是对阵帕托斯战争中率领黑暗军团的怪物。它们防御和抗性较低，但力量强大、血量很高。"

msgid "If you hunt 40 trolls I`ll give you my helmet. Will you do it?"
msgstr "猎杀40只巨魔的话，我就把我的头盔给你。愿意吗？"

msgid "Thank you. Here`s the helmet, as promised."
msgstr "谢谢。说好的，这是头盔。"

msgid "Did you obtain the bottom? Now all I have left is the top. The prey for this hunt is Stone Golem. Ancient priests infused stones with life and employed them as servants. But they`ve lost self-control and have turned into savage monsters now...  "
msgstr "下装拿到了吗？现在就剩下上装了。这次狩猎的目标是石傀儡。古代祭司赋予石头生命，把它们当仆人使唤。但它们如今失去了自控，变成了凶残的怪物……"

msgid "I wish you success in this hunt as well. "
msgstr "祝你这次狩猎也顺利。"

msgid "Thank you. Here`s the top, as promised."
msgstr "谢谢。说好的，这是上装。"

msgid "Master, you`re a loser!!!"
msgstr "主人，你这个废物！！！"

msgid "[Mercenary] Russel will award weaponry for heeding his request."
msgstr "[Mercenary]Russel会为听从他请求的人颁发武器。"

msgid "[Mercenary] Tales  will award weaponry for heeding his request."
msgstr "[Mercenary]Tales会为听从他请求的人颁发武器。"

msgid "You'll get some Armor out of this when you hunt all the Apes and go to [Mercenary] Russel."
msgstr "等你把所有巨猿都猎杀后去找[Mercenary]Russel，就能拿到护甲。"

msgid "Hmm... we seem to have some unexpected guests at the graveyard. They are certainly uninvited guests - they are called  Vatalions, which are much tougher than the Undyings or Rotten Eyes. I can't do any work because of them. Could you help me?"
msgstr "嗯……墓地那边好像来了些不速之客。绝对是不请自来的——它们叫瓦塔里昂，比不死者和腐眼厉害得多。因为它们我啥活都干不了。你能帮帮我吗？"

msgid "What`s all that you`re lugging around... Please put them away and come back.  "
msgstr "你扛着的那都是些什么……请先放下，再回来。"

msgid "Have you seen the Kecoon Captains around the castle? It's alarming how their numbers have suddenly shot up."
msgstr "你见过城堡附近的凯昆队长吗？它们的数量突然暴增，真让人担心。"

msgid "Yaaah... hunting about 5 of them would do the trick. I'll pay you loads."
msgstr "呀……猎杀个5只左右就能解决问题。我会给你一大笔钱。"

msgid "Yahoo! Well done. Now let's go and get that reward from Patrick."
msgstr "耶！干得好。现在我们去找Patrick领赏吧。"

msgid "Good job. It was clever of me to ask you to do that. Heh! Here's the reward I promised."
msgstr "干得好。请你出马真是明智。哼！这是我答应的酬劳。"

msgid "Hey! Is the mission over yet?"
msgstr "喂！任务做完了没？"

msgid "Master, do you know a monster called the Giant Bulcan? No? Let's go and ask [Sentinel Patrick] about it."
msgstr "主人，你知道一种叫巨型布尔坎的怪物吗？不知道？那我们去问问[Sentinel Patrick]吧。"

msgid "The Giant Bulcan? Yeah, he's an enormous bugger, even by Bulcan standards. Bulcans have no eyes so they hate it when you go up close and mess with them."
msgstr "巨型布尔坎？是啊，就算按布尔坎的标准看，那也是个庞然大物。布尔坎没有眼睛，所以特别讨厌你凑到近处去招惹它们。"

msgid "Here's a thought... Go out and catch 10 Bulcans to start."
msgstr "这么着……先出去抓10只布尔坎来试试。"

msgid "Nail the Giant Bulcan after you've taken care of all the others."
msgstr "把其他的都解决掉之后，再干掉那只巨型布尔坎。"

msgid "Phew! Well done master. Did the world of good for your abilities and experience eh? Ha ha!"
msgstr "呼！干得好，主人。你的能力和经验是不是大涨了？哈哈！"

msgid "Obviously, the harder the hunt, the more EXP you'll get from it."
msgstr "显然，狩猎越难，你从中获得的经验就越多。"

msgid "Good job. Your skills got a good workout there eh master?."
msgstr "干得好。你的身手是不是好好练了一把，主人？"

msgid "Ah~ Welcome. I thought you would come. Have you seen a monster called Giant Gavolt?"
msgstr "啊~欢迎。我就知道你会来。你见过一种叫巨型加沃尔特的怪物吗？"

msgid "It is called that way as its body is big even among Gavolts.  Anyway, those with big bodies are strong so be careful. Ha ha... your goal is 25 of them! Will you give it a try?"
msgstr "它之所以叫这个名字，是因为就算在加沃尔特里它的体型也算大的。总之，块头大的都强，要小心。哈哈……你的目标是25只！要不要试试？"

msgid "Master, They say that [Sentinel] Patrick is collecting  Apple of Moradon. Let's go and see if we can profit from this."
msgstr "主人，听说[Sentinel]Patrick在收购莫拉登苹果。我们去看看能不能赚上一笔。"

msgid "r"
msgstr "r"

msgid "Please bring me Apple of Moradon. You already know that you can get apples if you catch werewolves even if I don't explain it to you, don't you? Ha ha..."
msgstr "请给我带些莫拉登苹果来。不用我多说，你也知道抓狼人就能拿到苹果，对吧？哈哈……"

msgid "You've collected all the Apple of Moradon. Let's go back and see Patrick now."
msgstr "莫拉登苹果都收齐了。我们现在回去找Patrick吧。"

msgid "Good job. Here's a little something for you."
msgstr "干得好。这是给你的一点小意思。"

msgid "Master, Do you know a monster called the Glyptodont? Let's go and ask [Sentinel Patrick] about it."
msgstr "主人，你知道一种叫雕齿兽的怪物吗？我们去问问[Sentinel Patrick]吧。"

msgid "The Glyptodont? You're talking about that big, ugly-looking bugger? "
msgstr "雕齿兽？你是说那个又大又丑的家伙？"

msgid "Well, the Glyptodont is a giant omnivore that can be found pretty much anywhere on the Adonisian Continent. It's slow, but hits hard. How about going out and thinning their numbers a bit? It'll go much easier if you form a party."
msgstr "雕齿兽是一种大型杂食动物，在阿多尼斯大陆几乎随处可见。它动作慢，但攻击很猛。出去稍微削减一下它们的数量怎么样？组个队伍会轻松得多。"

msgid "Phew! Well done master. It looks stupid, but it's pretty powerful. Hee Hee!"
msgstr "呼！干得好，主人。它看着蠢，其实挺厉害的。嘻嘻！"

msgid "It'll be hard to deal with on your own. Better to form a party before tackling it."
msgstr "你一个人很难对付。最好先组个队再上。"

msgid "So, what's it like hunting Glyptodont? Ha Ha! Anyway, Well done."
msgstr "怎么样，猎杀雕齿兽的感觉如何？哈哈！总之，干得好。"

msgid "Welcome. There should be a monster called Gloomwing outside the Castle there. Gloomwing is a Gavolt with extra hard scales. Gloomwing's scale is a popular material in armor and weapons."
msgstr "欢迎。城堡外面应该有一种叫黯翼的怪物。黯翼是一种鳞片格外坚硬的加沃尔特。黯翼的鳞片是制作护甲和武器的热门材料。"

msgid "I'd like you to hunt 10 Gloomwings... Sound good?"
msgstr "我想让你猎杀10只黯翼……怎么样？"

msgid "Master, [Mercenary Adjutant] Rage is urgently looking for you!"
msgstr "主人，[Mercenary Adjutant]Rage急着找你！"

msgid "As I see <selfname>, now I am relieved. I just want to let you know that Keilans are gathering near the outskirts of Folk Village and their numbers are growing."
msgstr "一见到<selfname>，我就放心了。我只想告诉你，基兰们正在民俗村外缘附近聚集，数量还在增加。"

msgid "As their numbers are growing rapidly, we are in big trouble. Can you help me take care of these of Keilans? "
msgstr "它们数量增长得很快，我们麻烦大了。你能帮我收拾掉这些基兰吗？"

msgid "Master, you did a good job. Now Rage's worry will completely disappear."
msgstr "主人，你干得好。现在Rage的烦恼该彻底消除了。"

msgid "I just believe in you <selfname>."
msgstr "我就只信你了，<selfname>。"

msgid "Ah! The Adonisian Continent's best holiday - the Creation of Logos! It chills everyone out for a little while, regardless of their origins or beliefs."
msgstr "啊！阿多尼斯大陆最盛大的节日——创世节！它能让所有人都暂且放松下来，无论出身或信仰。"

msgid "I want everyone to be together on this holiday. That's the god's wish too."
msgstr "我希望大家在这个节日里团聚。这也是神的意愿。"

msgid "Thank you very much! This is a small token of my appreciation."
msgstr "非常感谢！这是我的一点心意。"

msgid "Will you participate in National Defence Combat?"
msgstr "你要参加国防战吗？"

msgid "There aren't enough soldiers to carry the battle. Be aware that taking on too many enemies by yourself is pretty damn reckless."
msgstr "没有足够的士兵来支撑这场战斗。要知道，你一个人对付太多敌人可是相当鲁莽的。"

msgid "Note that [Report User] is excluded from National Defence Combat."
msgstr "请注意，[Report User]不参与国防战。"

msgid "Hmm ? if you've not made any contribution to the country, you can't be dispatched. First, charge CONT from [Knight Squad Secretary] Charel in this castle."
msgstr "嗯？如果你没有为国家做出任何贡献，就无法被派遣。先到这座城堡里的[Knight Squad Secretary]Charel那里充入CONT。"

msgid "Master, Shall we go some hunting and get some more experience? Hee Hee!"
msgstr "主人，我们去猎一场、再攒点经验怎么样？嘻嘻！"

msgid "Are you going out to hunt? Hmm... How about hunting Hell Hounds?"
msgstr "你要出去狩猎吗？嗯……去猎杀地狱猎犬怎么样？"

msgid "Hell Hounds are meat-eating beasts that have their breeding grounds behind the Goblin Village. Its has a characteristically fast attack speed and is popular among hunters because it drops Talismans of Destruction. This hunt will be a great experience for you."
msgstr "地狱猎犬是肉食猛兽，繁殖地在哥布林村后面。它攻击速度极快，而且会掉落毁灭护符，很受猎人欢迎。这次狩猎对你会是一次很好的历练。"

msgid "Well done! Should I give you a massage now? Hee Hee!"
msgstr "干得好！要不要我现在给你按按？嘻嘻！"

msgid "How's the hunt going? Experience doesn't always come easy. Cheer up!"
msgstr "狩猎进展如何？经验可不是唾手可得的。振作点！"

msgid "Hahahahaha!! You got wasted! Well done. I think."
msgstr "哈哈哈哈哈！！你被收拾惨了！干得好。我觉得。"

msgid "Master, do you know anything about Manticore? You should ask Keife for more information."
msgstr "主人，你了解蝎狮吗？你该去问问Keife获取更多信息。"

msgid "A Manticore is a fearsome winged beast that has the body of a lion and the tail of a scorpion. You'll understand better if you see it for yourself."
msgstr "蝎狮是一种可怕的有翼猛兽，长着狮子的身躯和蝎子的尾巴。你亲眼见到就更明白了。"

msgid "I recently heard that a Manticore has been seen somewhere near Karus."
msgstr "我最近听说有人在卡鲁斯附近见过蝎狮。"

msgid "I recently heard that a Manticore has been seen somewhere near El Morad."
msgstr "我最近听说有人在艾莫拉德附近见过蝎狮。"

msgid "How you feeling today?"
msgstr "你今天感觉怎么样？"

msgid "Well done. Was it as hard as they say?"
msgstr "干得好。是不是像人们说的那么难？"

msgid "Bekar is gathering knights who will participate in the Phantom Hunt. Master, you should sign up as well!"
msgstr "Bekar正在召集参加幻影狩猎的骑士。主人，你也该报名！"

msgid "Would you like to join the Phantom Hunt?"
msgstr "你想参加幻影狩猎吗？"

msgid "The Phantom is in the Hell Abyss of Delos Abyss Dungeon. Return from the hunt and the Transformation Magic Scroll is yours."
msgstr "幻影就在迪洛斯深渊地牢的地狱深渊里。狩猎归来，变身魔法卷轴就是你的了。"

msgid "Phew~ It's done. Let's get out of here. I don't like this eerie feeling..."
msgstr "呼~搞定了。我们离开这儿吧。我不喜欢这种阴森的感觉……"

msgid "I heard the Phantom can be found in Hell Abyss of Delos Abyss Dungeon."
msgstr "我听说幻影就在迪洛斯深渊地牢的地狱深渊里。"

msgid "Well done. Here's the Transformation Scroll, as promised."
msgstr "干得好。说好的，这是变身卷轴。"

msgid "Master, do you about a Monster named Groom Hound? Perhaps Verca would know about it?"
msgstr "主人，你了解一种叫格魯姆猎犬的怪物吗？或许Verca会知道？"

msgid "Master, do you about a Monster named Groom Hound? Perhaps Telson would know about it?"
msgstr "主人，你了解一种叫格魯姆猎犬的怪物吗？或许Telson会知道？"

msgid "Groom Hound? Hum...I don't know exactly, but I heard that it's a Smirdon type monster residing in the Abyss of Hell."
msgstr "格魯姆猎犬？嗯……我不太确定，但我听说它是一种栖息在地狱深渊的斯米尔顿类怪物。"

msgid "The hunt is over so let's get out quickly~ Feels so gloomy every time I come here... "
msgstr "狩猎结束了，我们快走吧~ 每次来这儿都觉得好压抑……"

msgid "How did you feel about hunting the Groom Hounds? Don't you just feel like hunting them over and over again? Haha~ it was just a joke."
msgstr "猎杀格魯姆猎犬感觉如何？是不是恨不得一遍又一遍地猎它们？哈哈~开个玩笑。"

msgid "Master, Zamed the Search Captain is looking for you... I wonder why?"
msgstr "主人，搜索队长Zamed在找你……不知道是为什么？"

msgid "Master, Laek the Search Captain is looking for you... I wonder why?"
msgstr "主人，搜索队长Laek在找你……不知道是为什么？"

msgid "Ah, I was looking for you. Your reputation is known even here in Ardream. I contacted you because I have a special favor to ask."
msgstr "啊，我正找你呢。你的名声连阿德雷姆这里都听说了。我联系你，是因为有件特别的事想请你帮忙。"

msgid "Hmm...I don't want to interrupt your hunting. I'll see you later."
msgstr "嗯……我不想打扰你狩猎。回头见。"

msgid "There are two particular monsters here in Ardream, Atros and Lyot. Atros was active in Pathos' Darkness Army's Raiders unit. Recently, these two monsters joined forces and now present an overwhelming threat that must be dealt with immediately and violently. From what I've heard, you're the ideal candidate for the job. Can you do it?"
msgstr "阿德雷姆这里有两个特别的怪物：阿特罗斯和莱奥特。阿特罗斯曾效力于帕托斯黑暗军团的突袭部队。最近这两个怪物联手了，如今构成必须立即、强力铲除的压倒性威胁。据我所知，你正是干这事的理想人选。你能行吗？"

msgid "Phew! Atros is strong enough, eh? The upside is, your skills got a great workout there!"
msgstr "呼！阿特罗斯够强吧？好处是，你的身手好好练了一把！"

msgid "Hmm ? Are you still hunting? I doubt your reputation is exaggerated."
msgstr "嗯？你还在狩猎？看来你的名声一点也没夸大。"

msgid "You're every bit as good as they say you are. Thank you so much."
msgstr "你果然和人们说的一样厉害。太感谢了。"

msgid "Veda is looking for you, master. But who is Veda??"
msgstr "Veda在找你，主人。不过Veda是谁啊？？"

msgid "Welcome to Islante. I appreciate your interest in our corner of the world. My name is Veda, I train in aesthetic practices here in Islante."
msgstr "欢迎来到艾斯兰特。感谢你对我们这方天地的兴趣。我叫Veda，在艾斯兰特修习美学之道。"

msgid "Welcome to Islante. I appreciate your interest in our corner of the world. My name is Tabeth, I train in aesthetic practices here in Islante."
msgstr "欢迎来到艾斯兰特。感谢你对我们这方天地的兴趣。我叫Tabeth，在艾斯兰特修习美学之道。"

msgid "Hmm.. You still have unfinished hunt training."
msgstr "嗯……你还有没完成的狩猎训练。"

msgid "I called for you because with your reputation and ability, Islante is the perfect place for you to improve your skills. You'll understand if you start hunting Doom Soldiers."
msgstr "我叫你来，是因为凭你的名声和能力，艾斯兰特是你提升技艺的理想之地。等你开始猎杀末日士兵就明白了。"

msgid "Well done~ The work here in Islante is better than I expected."
msgstr "干得好~ 你在艾斯兰特的表现比我预想的还好。"

msgid "The road of practice must be walked with patience."
msgstr "修行之路必须耐心行走。"

msgid "Good job. Are you satisfied with that?"
msgstr "干得好。这样你满意了吗？"

msgid "You were with Veda a long time. How about paying him a little visit?"
msgstr "你跟Veda待了很久。去拜访他一下怎么样？"

msgid "We meet again. How goes the training?"
msgstr "我们又见面了。训练怎么样了？"

msgid "I saw some Harpy type Monsters - Crimson Wings I think they're called - a few days ago while I was training. Big wings, Sharp claws... it's said that hundreds of people have died from their poisons in even little scratches. But, for you, they'd make for great training."
msgstr "几天前我训练时见过一些鹰身女妖类的怪物——好像叫赤翼。大翅膀、利爪……据说哪怕只是被轻轻划伤，也有上百人死于它们的毒素。不过对你来说，它们会是很好的训练对象。"

msgid "Well done. Was it a hard hunt? But I can see the results of your training already. Well done. Heh."
msgstr "干得好。狩猎辛苦吧？但我已经能看到你训练的成果了。干得好。哼。"

msgid "Master, There's a monster with a devil's shape! I'll bet Veda knows about it."
msgstr "主人，有一种长着恶魔外形的怪物！我打赌Veda一定知道。"

msgid "The devil-shaped monster is actually a Gargoyle. "
msgstr "那恶魔外形的怪物其实是石像鬼。"

msgid "Yeah, the devil monster is really a Gargoyle. "
msgstr "对，那恶魔怪物其实是石像鬼。"

msgid "It's a stony monster with the devil's visage that owes its life to an ancient spell. After the war against Pathos, the seals were permanently removed and it's been stuck here threatening humans ever since. I think it'd be good to ¡®train' on these beasts next. Heh."
msgstr "它是一种石头怪物，长着恶魔的面容，因古老的咒文而获得生命。对阵帕托斯的战争结束后，封印被永久解除，它就一直困在这里威胁人类。我觉得接下来拿这些野兽来“练手”会不错。哼。"

msgid "It's a terrible monster to be sure. Wasn't it? I don't want to mess with them again. Anyway, we were fortunate to finish all that without any troubles."
msgstr "那确实是可怕的怪物，不是吗？我可不想再招惹它们了。总之，我们能一路顺利搞定真是幸运。"

msgid "Master, How about we go and ask Veda for another training mission?"
msgstr "主人，我们去找Veda再接个训练任务怎么样？"

msgid "Master, How about we go and ask Taved for another training mission?"
msgstr "主人，我们去找Taved再接个训练任务怎么样？"

msgid "You want to keep training? You look strong enough already... How much stronger do you want to be?? Heh."
msgstr "你还想继续训练？你看着已经够强了……你到底想强到什么地步？？哼。"

msgid "Right then, I think it's time you met the Apostle of Piercing Cold. You should be able to dispatch him easily enough. Just watch out for that meddling monk's Glacier Spell of Darkness. It can freeze your bones solid."
msgstr "那么，我想是时候让你会会“刺骨寒使徒”了。你应该能轻松干掉他。只要小心那个爱管闲事僧侣的黑暗冰川咒就行，它能把你的骨头冻得硬邦邦。"

msgid "Phew- Good effort. It was a hard fight, wasn't it?"
msgstr "呼——干得漂亮。那是场硬仗，对吧？"

msgid "Their seems to be no end to your skill! Simply amazing."
msgstr "你的身手似乎深不见底！简直了不起。"

msgid "Master, Are you ready for more training?"
msgstr "主人，你准备好接受更多训练了吗？"

msgid "Hmm... Did you have anything in particular in mind?"
msgstr "嗯……你心里有什么特别的想法吗？"

msgid "What? What are you going to do with that worm? It'll just decrease your ability. Ha Ha! This time, let's make the Apostle of Flames the target of the training. His Flame Spell of Darkness attack cannot be explained in words. So please, be careful. And wear asbestos underwear for this one!."
msgstr "什么？你拿那条蠕虫干什么？它只会削弱你的能力。哈哈！这次我们把“火焰使徒”作为训练目标。他的黑暗火焰咒攻击简直无法用言语形容。所以千万小心。这次记得穿上石棉内裤！"

msgid "There are many knights gathering in Ronark Land to hunt cursed monsters.  Would you like to go and join them, master?"
msgstr "罗纳克之地聚集了许多骑士，去猎杀被诅咒的怪物。主人，你要不要去加入他们？"

msgid "Do you want to go and hunt cursed monsters?"
msgstr "你想去猎杀被诅咒的怪物吗？"

msgid "But I want you to finish the hunts you were already on. I'm kind of busy right now, so see you later..."
msgstr "不过我希望你先把手头的狩猎做完。我现在有点忙，回头见……"

msgid "Bishop, Bach and Duke... These monsters are the cursed monsters you've been hearing about. They're magical life forms brought to life when Pathos himself cursed some tailor's dummies. They're a rewarding hunt to engage in since you can earn special strength by defeating them."
msgstr "主教、巴赫和公爵……这些怪物就是你一直听说的被诅咒怪物。它们是帕托斯亲自诅咒裁缝假人后诞生的魔法生命体。击败它们能获得特殊力量，是很值得的狩猎。"

msgid "(~yaawwnn~) This hunt's too easy."
msgstr "（~打哈欠~）这次狩猎太简单了。"

msgid "Good job. I'll see you next time. I must go and check on El Morad's movements, so..."
msgstr "干得好。下次见。我得去查看一下艾莫拉德的动向，所以……"

msgid "Good job. I'll see you next time. I must check on Karus' movements, so..."
msgstr "干得好。下次见。我得去查看一下卡鲁斯的动向，所以……"

msgid "Quit it, if you want to do it. And stop bothering me..."
msgstr "想做就去做。别再来烦我……"

msgid "That's why it's one of the hardest monsters to hunt. Go to Delos if you want to try. It's in the Abyss Dungeon's Abyss of Hell on the 9th and 10th floors."
msgstr "所以它才是最难猎杀的怪物之一。想试的话就去迪洛斯。它在深渊地牢地狱深渊的第9、10层。"

msgid "That's why it's one of the hardest monsters to hunt. Go to Delos if you want to hunt it. It's in the Abyss Dungeon's Abyss of Hell on the 9th and 10th floors."
msgstr "所以它才是最难猎杀的怪物之一。想猎它的话就去迪洛斯。它在深渊地牢地狱深渊的第9、10层。"

