msgstr "完成幻影狩猎后，[Imperial Guard]Bekar会奖赏你，"

msgid "[Imperial Guard] Telson will reward you when you complete the Phantom Hunt,"
msgstr "完成幻影狩猎后，[Imperial Guard]Telson会奖赏你，"

