msgid "You'll earn 33 million EXP if you go back to [Ascetic] Taved after the mission of Apostle of Piercing Cold Hunt."
msgstr "完成刺骨寒使徒狩猎任务后回到[Ascetic]Taved处，你将获得3300万经验。"

msgid "You'll earn 40 million EXP if you go back to [Ascetic] Veda after the mission of Apostle of Flames Hunt."
msgstr "完成火焰使徒狩猎任务后回到[Ascetic]Veda处，你将获得4000万经验。"

msgid "You'll earn 40 million EXP if you go back to [Ascetic] Taved after the mission of Apostle of Flames Hunt."
msgstr "完成火焰使徒狩猎任务后回到[Ascetic]Taved处，你将获得4000万经验。"

msgid "Master, Perhaps you've heard of the personal accessories that hold the Strength of Legends? Cape might know something..."
msgstr "主人，也许你听说过蕴藏传奇之力的个人饰品？Cape或许知道些什么……"

msgid "Master, Perhaps you've heard of the personal accessories that hold the Strength of Legends? Cheina might know something..."
msgstr "主人，也许你听说过蕴藏传奇之力的个人饰品？Cheina或许知道些什么……"

msgid "Hmm. I have 2 Legendary Accessories. I will reward you with the first of 2 rings when you complete the Machirodus hunt."
msgstr "嗯。我有两件传奇饰品。等你完成马赫罗达斯狩猎，我就把两枚戒指中的第一枚赏给你。"

msgid "Your current mission log must be quite stuffed! We can discuss some other stuff when you come back from this hunt."
msgstr "你现在的任务日志肯定塞得满满的！等你这次狩猎回来，我们再谈别的。"

msgid "The Machirodus is a kind of  Smirdon. Remember them? He's got hard skin and a quick attack, so don't treat him lightly. Would you like to try?"
msgstr "马赫罗达斯是一种斯米尔顿。还记得它们吗？它皮硬、攻击快，别小看它。想试试吗？"

msgid "This hunt is over! Woo, now you're going to be the proud owner of a Ring of Legend!"
msgstr "这次狩猎结束啦！呜，这下你就要成为传奇之戒的骄傲主人啦！"

msgid "This hunt is over! Woo, now you're going to become the proud owner of a Ring of Legend!"
msgstr "这次狩猎结束啦！呜，这下你就要成为传奇之戒的骄傲主人啦！"

msgid "If you can't take down the Machiroduses, you certainly ain't deserving of this ring!"
msgstr "连马赫罗达斯都搞不定，你可就配不上这枚戒指了！"

msgid "Well done. You are the true owner of the ring."
msgstr "干得好。你才是这枚戒指真正的主人。"

msgid "Master, How about earning the last Belt of Legend from Cape?"
msgstr "主人，去找Cape把最后一条传奇腰带赚到手怎么样？"

msgid "Master, How about earning the last Belt of Legend from Cheina?"
msgstr "主人，去找Cheina把最后一条传奇腰带赚到手怎么样？"

msgid "Do you want the Belt of Legend? Okay, you can have it if you can complete the mission I'm about to give you."
msgstr "你想要传奇腰带？好，只要你能完成我接下来要给你的任务，它就归你。"

msgid "Blood Don is a type of Smirdon monster. I will reward you with this belt when you complete the Blood Don hunt. Would you like to give it a shot?"
msgstr "血顿是一种斯米尔顿怪物。完成血顿狩猎后，我就把这条腰带赏给你。想试试吗？"

msgid "Phew~ Good effort master. Go and find Cape now~"
msgstr "呼~干得漂亮，主人。现在去找Cape吧~"

msgid "Phew~ Good effort master. Go and find Cheina now~"
msgstr "呼~干得漂亮，主人。现在去找Cheina吧~"

msgid "I knew you could do it. Here's the Belt of Legend, as promised."
msgstr "我就知道你能行。说好的，这是传奇腰带。"

msgid "Master, Finding the last Earring of Legend would be a good experience. I reckon Russel would know where to start."
msgstr "主人，找到最后那枚传奇耳环会是一次很好的历练。我想Russel会知道从何下手。"

msgid "What? Yeah? You wanted to see me? What about this Earring that holds the strength of Legend?"
msgstr "什么？嗯？你想见我？这枚蕴藏传奇之力的耳环怎么样？"

msgid "Ah. Finish the hunts you're already on first. I have to catch more monsters than most in order to make a living."
msgstr "啊。先把手头的狩猎做完。为了糊口，我得比别人多抓不少怪物。"

msgid "Hmm. This is no ordinary earring. The earring will only shine with true power for those worthy to wear it. I have it but can't wear it myself. I'll give it to you if you'll hunt the Sheriff. What do you say?"
msgstr "嗯。这可不是普通的耳环。这耳环只会在配得上佩戴它的人身上闪耀真正的力量。它在我手里，我自己却戴不了。如果你肯去猎杀治安官，我就把它给你。你说怎么样？"

msgid "Well, well. The last Strength of Legends ring is yours now, master. Congratulations!"
msgstr "哎呀呀。最后一枚传奇之力戒指现在归你了，主人。恭喜！"

msgid "Stop wandering around and just go and hunt quickly!"
msgstr "别闲逛了，赶紧去狩猎！"

msgid "Hmm... Did you catch them all, already? Well, a promise is a promise, here you go. I hope you are the true owner of this earring."
msgstr "嗯……你已经全抓住了？好，一诺千金，给你。希望你是这枚耳环真正的主人。"

msgid "Master, Found it~! The Pendant that holds the Strength of Legend!! Russel is rumored to have it. Please, let it be true..."
msgstr "主人，找到了~！那枚蕴藏传奇之力的坠饰！！传闻Russel手里有它。拜托，但愿是真的……"

msgid "...... How did you know I have the Pendant of Legend? This is the last little treasure I have."
msgstr "……你怎么知道我手里有传奇坠饰？这是我仅剩的一件小宝贝了。"

msgid "What? You think people are earning money by digging-up the ground? You're so shameless as to say you want this precious thing - for nothing! Bloody well go and do something amazing, then I might consider giving it up. Cheek!"
msgstr "什么？你以为人家钱是挖地挖出来的？你竟然厚着脸皮想白要这宝贝！赶紧去干件了不起的大事，我或许还会考虑把它让给你。臭美！"

msgid "(~grin~) Russel would give it to me if he sees the amount of hunting I've done, wouldn't he?"
msgstr "（~坏笑~）要是Russel看到我狩猎的战绩，他会把它给我的，对吧？"

msgid "(~grin~) Tales would give it to me if he sees the amount of hunting I've done, wouldn't he?"
msgstr "（~坏笑~）要是Tales看到我狩猎的战绩，他会把它给我的，对吧？"

msgid "What? Did you really hunt them? I really should know the extent of your stubbornness by now. Still, my mouth never seems to learn. Oh well, here it is then. It's yours now too."
msgstr "什么？你真去猎了？我早该领教你那股倔劲儿了。可我这嘴就是不长记性。罢了，给你吧。这下它也归你了。"

msgid "Master, by my calculations, there's still another ring to find. One last Ring of Legend... Emm... I think Verca's the one we need to tap for this piece."
msgstr "主人，据我推算，还有一枚戒指没找到。最后一枚传奇之戒……嗯……我想这件得去找Verca打听。"

msgid "Master, by my calculations, there's still another ring to find. One last Ring of Legend... Emm... I think Telson's the one we need to tap for this piece."
msgstr "主人，据我推算，还有一枚戒指没找到。最后一枚传奇之戒……嗯……我想这件得去找Telson打听。"

msgid "Are you looking for the ring that holds the Strength of Legend? To be honest, I've already sent Searchers out to find it. They'll find it soon, I'm sure. But the Strength of Legend  only grants itself to the owner it approves of. So who knows?"
msgstr "你在找那枚蕴藏传奇之力的戒指？老实说，我已经派搜索员去找了。我确信他们很快就能找到。但传奇之力只会认它认可的主人。所以谁知道呢？"

msgid "Hmm... If it's about the Ring of Legend, let's talk about it next time. Looks like you're already busy hunting¡¦"
msgstr "嗯……如果是为传奇之戒的事，我们下次再谈吧。看你已经忙着狩猎了……"

msgid "Hmm... If it's about the Ring of Legend, let's talk about it next time. Looks like you're already busy hunting..."
msgstr "嗯……如果是为传奇之戒的事，我们下次再谈吧。看你已经忙着狩猎了……"

msgid "You want to trade with me? If you defeat the Gray Oozy monsters on the way to the farm, then I'll give you the treasure. The chaos on the farm is made even worse by all the poison they gush out."
msgstr "你想跟我做交易？如果你能在去农场的路上击败那些灰黏怪，我就把宝贝给你。它们喷出的毒液让农场的乱子雪上加霜。"

msgid "Hoorah! The hunt is over! Verca would have found the ring by now wouldn't he?"
msgstr "万岁！狩猎结束了！Verca这会儿应该已经找到戒指了吧？"

msgid "Hoorah! The hunt is over! Telson would have found the ring by now wouldn't he?"
msgstr "万岁！狩猎结束了！Telson这会儿应该已经找到戒指了吧？"

msgid "The ring is still being searched for."
msgstr "那枚戒指还在搜寻中。"

msgid "You're right on time. They finally found the ring. I hope you're the real owner of this Strength of Legend ring."
msgstr "你来得正好。他们终于找到戒指了。希望你是这枚传奇之力戒指真正的主人。"

msgid "You'll earn the ring that holds the Strength of Legend, if you go on the hunt after listening to [Sentinel] Cape's story about the Machirodus."
msgstr "听完[Sentinel]Cape讲的马赫罗达斯故事后去狩猎，你就能获得那枚蕴藏传奇之力的戒指。"

msgid "You'll earn the ring that holds the Strength of Legend, if you go on the hunt after listening to [Sentinel] Cheina's story about the Machirodus."
msgstr "听完[Sentinel]Cheina讲的马赫罗达斯故事后去狩猎，你就能获得那枚蕴藏传奇之力的戒指。"

msgid "You'll earn the belt that holds the Strength of Legend, if you go on the hunt after listening to [Sentinel] Cape's story about the Blood dons."
msgstr "听完[Sentinel]Cape讲的血顿故事后去狩猎，你就能获得那条蕴藏传奇之力的腰带。"

msgid "You'll earn the belt that holds the Strength of Legend, if you go on the hunt after listening to [Sentinel] Cheina's story about the Blood dons."
msgstr "听完[Sentinel]Cheina讲的血顿故事后去狩猎，你就能获得那条蕴藏传奇之力的腰带。"

msgid "You'll earn the ring that holds the Strength of Legend, if you go on the hunt after listening to [Mercenary] Rusel's story about the Sheriffs."
msgstr "听完[Mercenary]Rusel讲的治安官故事后去狩猎，你就能获得那枚蕴藏传奇之力的戒指。"

msgid "You'll earn the ring that holds the Strength of Legend, if you go on the hunt after listening to [Mercenary] Tales' story about the Sheriffs."
msgstr "听完[Mercenary]Tales讲的治安官故事后去狩猎，你就能获得那枚蕴藏传奇之力的戒指。"

msgid "You'll earn the pendant that holds the Strength of Legend, if you go on the hunt after listening to [Mercenary] Rusel's story about the Garuna."
msgstr "听完[Mercenary]Rusel讲的加鲁纳故事后去狩猎，你就能获得那枚蕴藏传奇之力的坠饰。"

msgid "You'll earn the pendant that holds the Strength of Legend, if you go on the hunt after listening to [Mercenary] Tales's story about the Garuna."
msgstr "听完[Mercenary]Tales讲的加鲁纳故事后去狩猎，你就能获得那枚蕴藏传奇之力的坠饰。"

msgid "You'll earn the ring that holds the Strength of Legend, if you go on the hunt after listening to [Imperial Palace Guard] Verca's story about the Gray Oozy."
msgstr "听完[Imperial Palace Guard]Verca讲的灰黏怪故事后去狩猎，你就能获得那枚蕴藏传奇之力的戒指。"

msgid "You'll earn the ring that holds the Strength of Legend, if you go on the hunt after listening to [Imperial Palace Guard] Telson's story about the Gray Oozy."
msgstr "听完[Imperial Palace Guard]Telson讲的灰黏怪故事后去狩猎，你就能获得那枚蕴藏传奇之力的戒指。"

msgid "You'll earn the ring that holds the Strength of Legend, if you go on the hunt after listening to  the [Farm Manager]'s story about the Tyon."
msgstr "听完[Farm Manager]讲的泰翁故事后去狩猎，你就能获得那枚蕴藏传奇之力的戒指。"

msgid "You'll earn 19 million EXP if you go back to [Ascetic] Veda after the mission of Doom Soldier Hunt."
msgstr "完成末日士兵狩猎任务后回到[Ascetic]Veda处，你将获得1900万经验。"

msgid "You'll earn 19 million EXP if you go back to [Ascetic] Taved after the mission of Doom Soldier Hunt."
msgstr "完成末日士兵狩猎任务后回到[Ascetic]Taved处，你将获得1900万经验。"

msgid "Master, The [Farm Manager] has found a great treasure! I'm curious, let's go and see it."
msgstr "主人，[Farm Manager]发现了一件大宝贝！我很好奇，我们去看看吧。"

msgid "Treasure? Ahh, well, I was plowing the fields when I saw something shining in the dirt. So I picked it up, and it turned out to be an earring. It looks expensive, but it doesn't seem right to sell it."
msgstr "宝贝？啊，这个嘛，我正在犁地，看见泥土里有东西在发光。就捡了起来，结果是一枚耳环。它看着挺贵重的，但卖掉好像不太合适。"

msgid "Long time no see. You're also very busy hunting~ Good luck then!"
msgstr "好久不见。你也忙着狩猎呢~ 那祝你好运！"

msgid "Trade? Hmm... Are you strong? As you must have noticed on the way here, there are so many Tyons wandering around it makes it hard tog et anything done outside. If you take care of the Tyons, I'll give you the earring. No matter how valuable it is, it's not more precious than my farm."
msgstr "交易？嗯……你强不强？你来的路上肯定也注意到了，外面到处都是泰翁，根本没法干活。如果你收拾掉那些泰翁，我就把耳环给你。它再贵重，也没有我的农场金贵。"

msgid "I think this is enough~"
msgstr "我觉得这些够了~"

msgid "Catch some more! It's not right to take the earring for only that many."
msgstr "再抓一些！就这么点就想拿走耳环可不行。"

msgid "Thank you so much. Ah~ Now I don't have to risk my life just walking around the farm. Heh."
msgstr "太感谢了。啊~ 现在我在农场里走走也不用冒生命危险了。哼。"

msgid "Master, Veda is going to start you on the second training. Go and see him~"
msgstr "主人，Veda要开始对你进行第二轮训练了。去见他吧~"

msgid "Are you ready for the second round of training?"
msgstr "你准备好接受第二轮训练了吗？"

msgid "The second training target is our friend, the Brahman. Brahman are in a completely different class to the Esoteric Buddhist Monks. His nonstop attacks won't give you any breathing time. It's a tougher opponent than perhaps what you're used to, but for training, this can only be a good thing. What do you think?"
msgstr "第二轮训练的目标是我们的老朋友，婆罗门。婆罗门和密教僧侣完全不是一个级别。它连续不断的攻击会让你喘不过气。这对手可能比你习惯的要强，但对训练来说，这只有好处。你觉得呢？"

msgid "Groom Hounds are said to be in the Abyss of Hell... Is there really anyone who would fight monsters like that? What would you do? "
msgstr "据说格魯姆猎犬就在地狱深渊……真有人愿意去跟那种怪物打吗？你会怎么做？"

msgid "Groom Hounds are said to be in the Abyss of Hell... Is there really anyone who would fight monsters like that? What would you do?"
msgstr "据说格魯姆猎犬就在地狱深渊……真有人愿意去跟那种怪物打吗？你会怎么做？"

msgid "If you bring a [Exchange National Flag] item, your National flag will be exchanged with the one you'd like."
msgstr "如果你带来[Exchange National Flag]道具，你的国旗就能换成你想要的那一面。"

msgid "First, you should bring the [Exchange National Flag] item."
msgstr "首先，你得带上[Exchange National Flag]道具。"

msgid "Would you like to exchange to the [Turkish National Flag]?"
msgstr "你想换成[Turkish National Flag]吗？"

msgid "Would you like to exchange to the [U.S National Flag]?"
msgstr "你想换成[U.S National Flag]吗？"

msgid "Would you like to exchange to the [Canadian National Flag]?"
msgstr "你想换成[Canadian National Flag]吗？"

msgid "Would you like to exchange to the [German National Flag]?"
msgstr "你想换成[German National Flag]吗？"

msgid "Would you like to exchange to the [Danish National Flag]?"
msgstr "你想换成[Danish National Flag]吗？"

msgid "Would you like to exchange to the [Polish National Flag]?"
msgstr "你想换成[Polish National Flag]吗？"

msgid "Would you like to exchange to the [Korean National Flag]?"
msgstr "你想换成[Korean National Flag]吗？"

msgid "Would you like to exchange to the [Chinese National Flag]?"
msgstr "你想换成[Chinese National Flag]吗？"

msgid "Would you like to exchange to the [Japanese National Flag]?"
msgstr "你想换成[Japanese National Flag]吗？"

msgid "You've collected 10 [Seeds of All Means]. I will offer you one reward item. Which one would you like?"
msgstr "你已经收集了10个[Seeds of All Means]。我会给你一件奖励道具。你想要哪一件？"

msgid "If you bring 10 [Seeds of All Means], the proper reward will be offered."
msgstr "带来10个[Seeds of All Means]，就能获得相应的奖励。"

msgid "You do not have enough [Seeds of All Means]. Reward can be offered only if you bring 10 items."
msgstr "你的[Seeds of All Means]不够。只有带来10个道具才能发放奖励。"

msgid "Master! You've collected 10 [Seeds of All Means]. Go to [Manager] Vilbore right away! If you bring 10 [Seeds of All Means], a reward will be given."
msgstr "主人！你已经收集了10个[Seeds of All Means]。立刻去找[Manager]Vilbore！带来10个[Seeds of All Means]就能获得奖励。"

msgid "Master, go to [White Shadow] Scout leader Valencia. He is giving away great items to those who complete new missions!"
msgstr "主人，去找[White Shadow]侦察队长Valencia。他正在给完成新任务的人发放好东西！"

msgid "I can't assign you a mission. Please, come see me again some other time."
msgstr "我现在没法给你派任务。请改天再来找我。"

msgid "I have been offering [Imiru's Pray] to those who help out with the mission. You can complete your mission only once a day. Would you like to accept this mission?"
msgstr "我一直给帮着完成任务的人发放[Imiru's Pray]。你每天只能完成一次任务。你要接受这个任务吗？"

msgid "Currently, [Scouts] are dispatched throughout the land. I have to collect their [Reconnaissance Diary] once a day, but I can't do that firsthand as I have too many missions. I will give you the [Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]. Could you collect the diary?"
msgstr "目前，[Scouts]被派往全国各地。我每天都得收集他们的[Reconnaissance Diary]，但任务太多，我没法亲自去收。我会给你[Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]。你能帮我收集这些日记吗？"

msgid "You lost your [Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]? I will rewrite it for you."
msgstr "你的[Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]丢了？我给你重写一份。"

msgid "You haven't collected a [Reconnaissance Diary] yet. Get moving!"
msgstr "你还没收集到[Reconnaissance Diary]呢。赶紧行动！"

msgid "You collected all [Reconnaissance Diary]. Could you hand them over to me?"
msgstr "所有[Reconnaissance Diary]你都收集齐了。能交给我吗？"

msgid "Did you come here to collect Reconnaissance Diaries? I'm sorry, but I can't give you my [Reconnaissance Diary] if you don't have the [Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]."
msgstr "你是来收集侦察日记的？抱歉，如果你没有[Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]，我不能把我的[Reconnaissance Diary]给你。"

msgid "Did you come here to collect Reconnaissance Diary? Please, show me your [Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]."
msgstr "你是来收集侦察日记的？请出示你的[Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]。"

msgid "I confirm that this is the [Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order] of [Valencia]. Here is my [Reconnaissance Diary]. Take this and go to [Scout Marvin] to receive the next [Reconnaissance Diary]."
msgstr "我确认这是[Valencia]的[Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]。这是我的[Reconnaissance Diary]。拿着它去找[Scout Marvin]领取下一本[Reconnaissance Diary]。"

msgid "I can give you the next Reconnaissance Diary, only after you collect [Reconnaissance Diary] from [Scout Merlin]. Collect [Reconnaissance Diary] from [Scout Merlin], and then come see me."
msgstr "只有在你从[Scout Merlin]那里收集到[Reconnaissance Diary]后，我才能给你下一本侦察日记。先去[Scout Merlin]那儿拿[Reconnaissance Diary]，再来找我。"

msgid "I confirmed [Reconnaissance Diary] and signature of [Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]. Here is [2nd Reconnaissance Diary]. Take this and go to Marble to receive [3rd Reconnaissance Diary]. Do you want to collect that?"
msgstr "我已确认[Reconnaissance Diary]和[Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]上的签名。这是[2nd Reconnaissance Diary]。拿着它去找Marble领取[3rd Reconnaissance Diary]。你要收集吗？"

msgid "You didn't collect other [Reconnaissance Diary], did you? Though you have [Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order], I can't give you mine if you don't go in order. I'm sorry."
msgstr "你没去收集其他[Reconnaissance Diary]吧？虽然你有[Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]，但不按顺序来我就不能给你我的。抱歉。"

msgid "Well, let's see. Yes, that is the real [Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]! It has the signature of Scout leader [Valencia], and [Reconnaissance Diary] from [Scout Merlin] and [Scout Marvin]."
msgstr "来，我看看。没错，这是真正的[Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]！上面有侦察队长[Valencia]的签名，还有来自[Scout Merlin]和[Scout Marvin]的[Reconnaissance Diary]。"

msgid "You have done well collecting [Reconnaissance Diary] so far! Hopefully [3rd Reconnaissance Diary] is the last, but you have two more diaries to collect from to scouts. Here is [3rd Reconnaissance Diary]. Do you want to collect that?"
msgstr "到目前为止你收集[Reconnaissance Diary]干得不错！希望[3rd Reconnaissance Diary]是最后一本，但你还得从两位侦察员那儿再收两本。这是[3rd Reconnaissance Diary]。你要收集吗？"

msgid "You have collected the previous three [Reconnaissance Diary]. It must have been hard to deal with [Scout Marble]...  Anyway, could you show me your [Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]?"
msgstr "前三本[Reconnaissance Diary]你都收集齐了。应付[Scout Marble]肯定挺费劲……总之，能给我看看你的[Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]吗？"

msgid "Yes, I confirm this is the signature of [Valencia]. I will give you the [4th Reconnaissance Diary]. Do you want to collect that?"
msgstr "好，我确认这是[Valencia]的签名。我这就给你[4th Reconnaissance Diary]。你要收集吗？"

msgid "Please show me your [Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order] and the [Reconnaissance Diary] you have collected so far."
msgstr "请出示你的[Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]以及你到目前为止收集的[Reconnaissance Diary]。"

msgid "Well...  All of them are real, Scout Leader [Valencia], [Scout Merlin], [Scout Marvin]... [Scout Marble]... You, troublemaker! Hmm... And I confirmed the signature of [Scout Mark]. Well, then would you like to collect [5th Reconnaissance Diary]?"
msgstr "嗯……全都是真的，侦察队长[Valencia]、[Scout Merlin]、[Scout Marvin]……[Scout Marble]……你这个捣蛋鬼！嗯……而且我也确认了[Scout Mark]的签名。那么，你要收集[5th Reconnaissance Diary]吗？"

msgid "You have collected all the [Reconnaissance Diary]. Your mission complete when you deliver them with [Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order] to [Valencia]. Good job on your mission!"
msgstr "你已经收集齐所有[Reconnaissance Diary]。把它们连同[Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]一起交给[Valencia]，你的任务就完成了。任务干得漂亮！"

msgid "Your inventory is full. You should empty your inventory so you can carry more items."
msgstr "你的背包满了。请清理背包，以便携带更多道具。"

msgid "Master, here's the [Seed of All Means]! [Manager] Vilbore said he would offer a reward if you collect 10 [Seeds of All Means]. Pay visit to him once you have collected 10!"
msgstr "主人，这是[Seed of All Means]！[Manager]Vilbore说，如果你收集到10个[Seeds of All Means]，他会给你奖励。集齐10个就去找他吧！"

msgid "You already have the [Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]. "
msgstr "你已经有[Collect Reconnaissance Diary Order]了。"

msgid "You've just collected [Reconnaissance Diary]. You can't collect another one."
msgstr "你刚收集过[Reconnaissance Diary]。不能再收集一本。"

msgid "You completed your mission. You can do your scout mission again tomorrow."
msgstr "你完成了任务。明天可以再做一次侦察任务。"

msgid "When you bring the Leader's Ornament to [Mercenary] Russel, he will convert it to the 2nd Job Change item. "
msgstr "当你把领袖饰物带给[Mercenary]Russel时，他会把它转换成二转道具。"

msgid "When you bring the Dim Essence to [Mercenary] Russel, he will convert it to the Leader's Essence of the respective monster."
msgstr "当你把暗淡精华带给[Mercenary]Russel时，他会把它转换成对应怪物的领袖精华。"

msgid "When you bring the Leader's Ornament to [Mercenary] Tales, he will convert it to the 2nd Job Change item. "
msgstr "当你把领袖饰物带给[Mercenary]Tales时，他会把它转换成二转道具。"

msgid "When you bring the Dim Essence to [Mercenary] Tales, he will convert it to the Leader's Essence of the respective monster."
msgstr "当你把暗淡精华带给[Mercenary]Tales时，他会把它转换成对应怪物的领袖精华。"

msgid "Currently, if you bring me [Urkthron's necklace], [Colmicola's ring], [GaruKonga's belt], [Trethonz's earrings], and [Alkeradeua's belt], I will reward you with the respective [Leader's Essence]. I don't care about ability of the accessories themselves, so just bring them to me. But, you better hurry as the deadline is June 5th.  "
msgstr "现在，如果你把[Urkthron's necklace]、[Colmicola's ring]、[GaruKonga's belt]、[Trethonz's earrings]和[Alkeradeua's belt]带给我，我会给你相应的[Leader's Essence]作为报酬。我不在乎这些饰品本身的属性，直接带给我就行。不过最好快点，截止日期是6月5日。"

msgid "Did you bring [Urkthron's necklace]?"
msgstr "你把[Urkthron's necklace]带来了吗？"

msgid "Did you bring [Colmicola's Ring]?"
msgstr "你把[Colmicola's Ring]带来了吗？"

msgid "Did you bring [GaruKonga's belt]?"
msgstr "你把[GaruKonga's belt]带来了吗？"

msgid "Did you bring [Trethonz's earrings]?"
msgstr "你把[Trethonz's earrings]带来了吗？"

msgid "Did you bring [Alkeradeua's belt]?"
msgstr "你把[Alkeradeua's belt]带来了吗？"

msgid "What the hell is this?! Are you playing around with me?! Bring me another one right now!"
msgstr "这到底是什么？！你在耍我吗？！马上给我再拿一个来！"

msgid "Oh, you brought the correct one. So do you want to exchange it?"
msgstr "哦，你带对了。那你想兑换吗？"

msgid "Here you are, well done. It is good to see you smiling, and see you next time."
msgstr "给你，干得好。看到你笑真好，下次见。"

msgid "Currently, I am exchanging the existing [Centaur's Heart] with [Unstable Centaur's Heart], and since you need the [Unstable Centaur's Heart] for the second Job change you should have it exchanged quickly when you have one. Also note that you can still trade after you made the exchange."
msgstr "目前，我正在把现有的[Centaur's Heart]兑换成[Unstable Centaur's Heart]，由于二转需要[Unstable Centaur's Heart]，你一旦有了就该尽快兑换。另外请注意，兑换之后你仍可以继续交易。"

msgid "You brought a [Centaur's Heart], do you want to exchange it with an [Unstable Centaur's Heart]? "
msgstr "你带来了一个[Centaur's Heart]，想把它兑换成[Unstable Centaur's Heart]吗？"

msgid "You brought exactly 20 of [Dim Essence of the Black Magic]. Do you want it processed with the [Calllmecolar's Essence]?"
msgstr "你正好带来了20个[Dim Essence of the Black Magic]。要用[Calllmecolar's Essence]来处理它吗？"

msgid "You brought exactly 20 of [Dim Essence of the Haunga Clan]. Do you want it processed with the [GaruKonga's Essence]?"
msgstr "你正好带来了20个[Dim Essence of the Haunga Clan]。要用[GaruKonga's Essence]来处理它吗？"

msgid "You brought exactly 20 of [Dim Essence of Trethonz]. Do you want it processed with the [Trethonz's Essence]?"
msgstr "你正好带来了20个[Dim Essence of Trethonz]。要用[Trethonz's Essence]来处理它吗？"

msgid "You brought exactly 20 of [Dim Essence of Dragon Teeth Soldier]. Do you want it processed with the [Alkeradeua's Essence]?"
msgstr "你正好带来了20个[Dim Essence of Dragon Teeth Soldier]。要用[Alkeradeua's Essence]来处理它吗？"

msgid "I only can exchange for a [Centaur's Heart], so stop playing around and bring me the proper item."
msgstr "我只能兑换[Centaur's Heart]，别闹了，把正确的道具带给我。"

msgid "[Councilor] Herga is looking for someone who could infilterate the enemy nation in order to disturb them."
msgstr "[Councilor]Herga正在找能潜入敌国进行破坏的人。"

msgid "[Councilor] Nez is looking for someone who could infilterate the enemy nation in order to disturb them."
msgstr "[Councilor]Nez正在找能潜入敌国进行破坏的人。"

msgid "You can get a mission to disturb the enemy nation when you go to [Search Captain] Zamed in Arrdream Karus Base with the [False Information Paper]."
msgstr "带着[False Information Paper]去阿德雷姆卡鲁斯基地找[Search Captain]Zamed，就能接到破坏敌国的任务。"

msgid "You can get a mission to disturb the enemy nation when you go to [Search Captain] Laek in Arrdream El Morad Base with the [False Information Paper]."
msgstr "带着[False Information Paper]去阿德雷姆艾莫拉德基地找[Search Captain]Laek，就能接到破坏敌国的任务。"

msgid "You can get a mission to disturb the enemy nation when you go to [Base Spearhead] Zamed in Karus Base of Ronark Base with the [False Information Paper]."
msgstr "带着[False Information Paper]去罗纳克基地卡鲁斯基地的[Base Spearhead]Zamed处，就能接到破坏敌国的任务。"

msgid "You can get a mission to disturb the enemy nation when you go to [Base Spearhead] Krable in El Morad Base of Ronark Base with the [False Information Paper]."
msgstr "带着[False Information Paper]去罗纳克基地艾莫拉德基地的[Base Spearhead]Krable处，就能接到破坏敌国的任务。"

msgid "You can get a mission to disturb the enemy nation when you go to [Analyst] Caesar in Karus Base of Ronark Land with the [False Information Paper]."
msgstr "带着[False Information Paper]去罗纳克之地卡鲁斯基地的[Analyst]Caesar处，就能接到破坏敌国的任务。"

msgid "You can get a mission to disturb the enemy nation when you go to [Analyst] Julius in El Morad Base of Ronark Land with the [False Information Paper]."
msgstr "带着[False Information Paper]去罗纳克之地艾莫拉德基地的[Analyst]Julius处，就能接到破坏敌国的任务。"

msgid "You already rented weapons and armor for today, so return tomorrow for more."
msgstr "你今天已经租过武器和护甲了，请明天再来租。"

msgid "Welcome. Our mercenary band rents the weapons for [Spirit Alseides] Of mounting at set Confirmation. "
msgstr "欢迎。我们佣兵团会在确认后为[Spirit Alseides]提供武器租用。"

msgid "<selfname> are a warrior, so (looking at the list...) Glaive and  Chitin Armor Set are ready for you. Do you want to rent?"
msgstr "<selfname>是战士，所以（看着清单……）大刀和几丁质套装已经为你准备好了。你要租用吗？"

msgid "<selfname> are a rogue, so (looking at the list...) Mirage Dagger,  Chitin Bow and  Chitin Armor Set are ready for you. Do you want to rent?"
msgstr "<selfname>是盗贼，所以（看着清单……）幻影匕首、几丁质弓和几丁质套装已经为你准备好了。你要租用吗？"

msgid "<selfname> are a magician, so (looking at the list...) <Elemental Staff and  Crimson Armor Set are ready for you. Do you want to rent?"
msgstr "<selfname>是法师，所以（看着清单……）元素法杖和绯红套装已经为你准备好了。你要租用吗？"

msgid "<selfname> are a priest, so (looking at the list...) Lycaon Mace,  Defender of the Lord and  Chitin Armor Set are ready for you. Do you want to rent?"
msgstr "<selfname>是祭司，所以（看着清单……）狼头锤、主之守护者和几丁质套装已经为你准备好了。你要租用吗？"

msgid "<selfname> are a warrior, so (looking at the list...) Raptor and  Chitin Shell Armor Set are ready for you. Do you want to rent?"
msgstr "<selfname>是战士，所以（看着清单……）迅猛武器和几丁质外壳套装已经为你准备好了。你要租用吗？"

msgid "<selfname> are a rogue, so (looking at the list...) Shard,  Iron Bow and  Chitin Shell Armor Set are ready for you. Do you want to rent?"
msgstr "<selfname>是盗贼，所以（看着清单……）碎片、铁弓和几丁质外壳套装已经为你准备好了。你要租用吗？"

msgid "<selfname> are a magician, so (looking at the list...) Elixir Staff and  Complete Armor Set are ready for you. Do you want to rent?"
msgstr "<selfname>是法师，所以（看着清单……）灵药法杖和完整套装已经为你准备好了。你要租用吗？"

msgid "<selfname>, since you are a Priest, (checks the log) <font color=@#660066@>Homely Animal</font>, <font color=@#660066@>Defender of Piana Knights</font>, and <font color=@#660066@>Chitin Shell Armor Set</font> has been prepared for you. Will you proceed?"
msgstr "<selfname>，既然你是祭司，（查看日志）<font color=@#660066@>平凡兽</font>、<font color=@#660066@>皮雅纳骑士守护者</font>和<font color=@#660066@>几丁质外壳套装</font>已经为你准备好了。要继续吗？"

msgid "<selfname> are a warrior, so (looking at the list...) Beginner's Sword of Mercenary and  Beginner's Armor Set of Mercenary are ready for you. Do you want to rent?"
msgstr "<selfname>是战士，所以（看着清单……）佣兵新手剑和佣兵新手套装已经为你准备好了。你要租用吗？"

msgid "<selfname> are a rogue, so (looking at the list...) Beginner's Dagger of Assassin and  Beginner's Bow of Assassin,  Beginner's Armor Set of Assassin are ready for you. Do you want to rent?"
msgstr "<selfname>是盗贼，所以（看着清单……）刺客新手匕首、刺客新手弓和刺客新手套装已经为你准备好了。你要租用吗？"

msgid "<selfname> are a magician, so (looking at the list...) Staff of a rudimentary Magic Scholar and  Armor Set of a rudimentary Magic Scholar are ready for you. Do you want to rent?"
msgstr "<selfname>是法师，所以（看着清单……）初级法师学者法杖和初级法师学者套装已经为你准备好了。你要租用吗？"

msgid "<selfname> are a priest, so (looking at the list...) Mace of a rudimentary Paladin and  Armor Set of a rudimentary Paladin are ready for you.  Do you want to rent?"
msgstr "<selfname>是祭司，所以（看着清单……）初级圣骑士锤和初级圣骑士套装已经为你准备好了。你要租用吗？"

msgid "Only users who are 30Lv or higher can participate in this event. Please return after you have trained a little more."
msgstr "只有30级及以上的用户才能参加这个活动。请再练高一点后再来。"

msgid "There is not enough space in the Inventory. To receive the item, you should have at least 6 inventory slots available."
msgstr "背包空间不足。要领取道具，你至少需要留出6个背包格子。"

msgid "There is not enough space in the Inventory. To receive the item, you should have at least 8 inventory slots available."
msgstr "背包空间不足。要领取道具，你至少需要留出8个背包格子。"

msgid "There is not enough space in the Inventory. To receive the item, you should have at least 7 inventory slots available."
msgstr "背包空间不足。要领取道具，你至少需要留出7个背包格子。"

msgid "What! Why did you put the Intelligence Report in the magic bag? Come again after you've put it correctly in the basic bag!"
msgstr "什么！你为什么把情报报告放进魔法背包？把它正确放到普通背包里后再来！"

msgid "How are you? Currently, our mercenary band is renting equipments that can be used once a day for 6 hours and are suitable for the user's level. Just come to me if you are looking to rent something."
msgstr "你好吗？目前，我们佣兵团正在出租适合用户等级、每天可用一次、每次6小时的装备。想租东西就来找我。"

msgid "Please keep in mind that the equipment disappears after exactly 6 hours. Then, have a nice day."
msgstr "请记住，装备在整整6小时后就会消失。那么，祝你愉快。"

msgid "Magnificent power will be given to those who want power!"
msgstr "想要力量的人，将获得强大的力量！"

msgid "Greed brings harm, so come again once you have spent your current power. "
msgstr "贪婪会招致灾祸，等你把现有的力量用完了再来。"

msgid "Power of protection shall be given to those who wish to protect!"
msgstr "想要守护的人，将获得守护之力！"

msgid "Return once you have prepared additional space."
msgstr "腾出额外空间后再来。"

msgid "There is no space in your bag, so please make some space available."
msgstr "你的背包没有空间了，请腾出一些位置。"

msgid "You already have [Poison Knife]. You can only purchase [Poison Knife] after you have used all you currently have. "
msgstr "你已经有[Poison Knife]了。只有把现有的都用完后，才能再购买[Poison Knife]。"

msgid "We are selling [Poison Knife]. You can use it for an hour from the time of purchase regardless of how many you have. And once you have purchased [Poison Knife], you cannot buy them again until you have used all you have. Prices are as follows. Do you want to buy? 10 : 20,000 Noahs|30 : 60,000 Noahs|50 : 100,000 Noahs|100 : 200,000 Noahs"
msgstr "我们正在出售[Poison Knife]。无论你有多少，从购买起可使用一小时。而且一旦购买了[Poison Knife]，在全部用完前不能再次购买。价格如下。你要买吗？10个：20000诺亚|30个：60000诺亚|50个：100000诺亚|100个：200000诺亚"

msgid "You have purchased 10 [Poison Knife].| You can buy it again when you have used all ten."
msgstr "你购买了10个[Poison Knife]。|把这10个都用完后就可以再买。"

msgid "You have purchased 30 [Poison Knife].| You can buy it again when you have used all 30."
msgstr "你购买了30个[Poison Knife]。|把这30个都用完后就可以再买。"

msgid "You have purchased 50 [Poison Knife].| You can buy it again when you have used all 50."
msgstr "你购买了50个[Poison Knife]。|把这50个都用完后就可以再买。"

msgid "You have purchased 100 [Poison Knife].| You can buy it again when you have used all 100."
msgstr "你购买了100个[Poison Knife]。|把这100个都用完后就可以再买。"

msgid "We can exchange only if you bring the [War Trophy Chest] rewarded by the person in charge of each region for the completion of Disturbing the Enemy Nation mission."
msgstr "只有当你带来各区域负责人因你完成破坏敌国任务而奖励的[War Trophy Chest]时，我们才能兑换。"

msgid "It's the War Trophy Chest of [Outpost Captain]! Incredible! Let me see... Right! You will have a nice reward!"
msgstr "这是[Outpost Captain]的[War Trophy Chest]！了不起！我看看……对！你会得到一份不错的奖励！"

msgid "It's the War Trophy Chest of the [Base Spearhead]! Well done, I know it must have been a difficult mission. Hmm~then, the reward is... To this side!"
msgstr "这是[Base Spearhead]的[War Trophy Chest]！干得好，我知道这任务肯定很难。嗯~那么，奖励是……这边请！"

msgid "It's the War Trophy Chest of [Search Captain]. You did a good job. I hope you do even better next time! Now then, I ought to give you a reward..."
msgstr "这是[Search Captain]的[War Trophy Chest]。你干得不错。希望下次你做得更好！那么，我该给你一份奖励……"

msgid "Not all the letters are collected yet, and I can only reward you when you collect all the letters of K. N. I. G. H. T."
msgstr "字母还没收集齐，只有当你把K、N、I、G、H、T的字母全收集齐时，我才能给你奖励。"

msgid "You brought me the complete word! Now, choose the reward that you want to have. You can apply for only one, either a game item or Premium application.  Consider it carefully as all the collected letters will disappear automatically once you make your choice."
msgstr "你把完整的单词带来了！现在，选择你想要的奖励。游戏道具和高级会员申请，你只能选其一。请慎重考虑，因为一旦做出选择，所有收集到的字母都会自动消失。"

msgid "You have chosen Item Reward. Rewardable items are as follows. You apply several times as you collect the letters. The reward items can be used for 30 minutes, and any unused items disappear automatically when the Event period ends. "
msgstr "你选择了道具奖励。可奖励的道具如下。你收集字母后可以多次申请。奖励道具可使用30分钟，未使用的道具会在活动结束时自动消失。"

msgid "You have chosen the Premium application. There are plenty of prizes available in the draw. You can apply several times as you collect the letters, and the collected letters disappear when you apply for the draw. Are you sure you want to apply?"
msgstr "你选择了高级会员申请。抽奖奖品非常丰富。你收集字母后可以多次申请，申请抽奖时收集的字母会消失。你确定要申请吗？"

msgid "Your application has been confirmed. The winner of the draw will be announced on the homepage later. Thanks for your application."
msgstr "你的申请已确认。抽奖结果稍后会在主页公布。感谢你的申请。"

msgid "Your reward item has been issued. Have a pleasant day."
msgstr "你的奖励道具已发放。祝你愉快。"

msgid "Gosh! Did you come to have something made? But it's just that the tool I was using broke just a short while ago... I need to fix it first if I want to make a living, right? Sorry, but please wait till the tool is fixed. I'm Terribly sorry."
msgstr "天哪！你是来做东西的吗？可我刚才用的工具偏偏坏了……我要糊口，总得先把它修好，对吧？抱歉，请等我把工具修好。实在对不起。"

msgid "You are not suitable for the mission, as we only accept those who are Lv.66~69."
msgstr "你不适合这个任务，因为我们只接受66~69级的人。"

msgid "We are selling [Poison Knife] and [Ability Up Item]. Move to each menu to purchase the respective items. "
msgstr "我们正在出售[Poison Knife]和[Ability Up Item]。请切换到各菜单购买相应道具。"

msgid "We are selling the [Ability Up Item]. You can use it for an hour from the time of purchase regardless of how many you have. And once you have purchased [Ability Up Item], you cannot buy them again until you have used all you have. The purchase price is 1 million Noahs. Do you want to buy it?"
msgstr "我们正在出售[Ability Up Item]。无论你有多少，从购买起可使用一小时。而且一旦购买了[Ability Up Item]，在全部用完前不能再次购买。售价为100万诺亚。你要买吗？"

msgid "You already have this item. You can buy it again only after you have used all you currently have."
msgstr "你已经有这个道具了。只有把现有的都用完后，才能再购买。"

msgid "You have purchased [Scroll of Atk Up].|You can buy it again only after you have used all you currently have."
msgstr "你购买了[Scroll of Atk Up]。|把现有的都用完后才能再买。"

msgid "You have purchased [Scroll of 350 Atk Up].|ou can buy it again only after you have used all you currently have."
msgstr "你购买了[Scroll of 350 Atk Up]。|把现有的都用完后才能再买。"

msgid "You have purchased [Speed Up Potion].|ou can buy it again only after you have used all you currently have."
msgstr "你购买了[Speed Up Potion]。|把现有的都用完后才能再买。"

msgid "[2000 HP Increase Scroll] has been purchased. It has to be used completely to purchase again."
msgstr "你购买了[2000 HP Increase Scroll]。必须全部用完才能再次购买。"

msgid "I heard that [Mercenary Quartermaster] has opened up the Arsenal and renting the equipments inside!"
msgstr "我听说[Mercenary Quartermaster]开放了兵器库，正在出租里面的装备！"

msgid "We are currently receiving applications for the upcoming  4th World Championship.  Anybody who wants to make the Entry Application can do it by paying an  Entry Application Fee of 100,000 Noahs. But, 100,000 Noahs will not be refunded even if you do not get selected in the draw. Do you want to receive the entry guide?"
msgstr "我们目前正在接受即将到来的第四届世界锦标赛的报名。凡是想报名的人，缴纳100000诺亚的报名费即可。但是，即使你没被抽中，100000诺亚也不予退还。你想领取报名指南吗？"

msgid "    The 4th World IChampionship Guide|- Application to be made to [World Championship Dispatcher] from Aug. 7th ~Aug. 11th |- Prize winner confirmation : Homepage Pop-up on Aug. 18th.|- Application Fee : 100,000 Noahs|- Once applied, the entry application fee isn't refundable even if you are not selected in the draw. "
msgstr "第四届世界锦标赛指南|- 8月7日~8月11日向[World Championship Dispatcher]报名|- 获奖确认：8月18日主页弹窗|- 报名费：100000诺亚|- 一旦报名，即使未被抽中，报名费也不予退还。"

msgid "    The 4th World Championship Guide II|- when applying to enter, 100% entry User | - July Top 20 Clans by Server and Clan leaders of Top 20 Clans by nation (40 person) :  Total 280 person from Servers| - Top 50 ranked on the ladder ranking per nation and per server (100 person) : Total 1400 person from Servers| - King of each Server : Total 14 person from Servers|- 100% of all users who applied and satisfy the above conditions will be selected, but without an application the eligible users will not be able to participate."
msgstr "第四届世界锦标赛指南II|- 报名时，100%报名用户 | - 7月各服务器前20公会及各国前20公会的族长（40人）：各服务器共280人| - 各国各服务器天梯排名前50（100人）：各服务器共1400人| - 各服务器国王：共14人|- 所有报名且满足上述条件的用户100%入选，但未报名的符合条件用户无法参加。"

msgid "If you choose [Participate], your entry application and payment of 100,000 Noahs will be processed immediately, and if you click [Apply later], application will be cancelled. For more information, choose [Read Guide Again]."
msgstr "如果你选择[Participate]，将立即处理你的报名并缴纳100000诺亚；如果你点击[Apply later]，报名将被取消。想了解更多，请选择[Read Guide Again]。"

msgid "Your entry application has been processed. |For the announcement of the winners, can check the Pop-up of our homepage on Aug.18th.|Thanks."
msgstr "你的报名已处理。|获奖名单请于8月18日查看我们主页的弹窗。|谢谢。"

msgid "Your entry application has already been processed. The date of the winner announcement is Aug. 18th. Thank you."
msgstr "你的报名已经处理过了。获奖公布日期为8月18日。谢谢。"

msgid "Due to a system error, equipments of Lv. 30~46 cannot be rented right now. The service will be restored as quickly as possible. We are sorry."
msgstr "由于系统错误，目前无法租用30~46级的装备。我们会尽快恢复服务。非常抱歉。"

msgid "You don't have enough Noah. You need 100,000 Noahs for the entry application."
msgstr "你的诺亚不够。报名需要100000诺亚。"

msgid "You can acquire the Blue Treasure Chest of the Forgotten Temple by completing [Commissarial] Parrent's mission."
msgstr "完成[Commissarial]Parrent的任务，你就能获得遗忘神殿的蓝色宝箱。"

msgid "You can acquire the Blue Treasure Chest of the Forgotten Temple by completing [Commissarial] Baelertz's mission."
msgstr "完成[Commissarial]Baelertz的任务，你就能获得遗忘神殿的蓝色宝箱。"

msgid "Master! You have completed all the missions! As expected, El Morad wasn't your match!"
msgstr "主人！你完成了所有任务！果然，艾莫拉德根本不是你的对手！"

msgid "A new war zone has been created. Those wicked El Morad provoked us first! It's an important strategical point, we, Karus, must take it to have an edge in the upcoming battles!"
msgstr "一个新的战区开辟了。那些邪恶的艾莫拉德人先挑衅了我们！那是重要的战略要地，我们卡鲁斯必须拿下它，才能在接下来的战斗中占据优势！"

msgid "New war needs a new hero! Return after you have defeated 40 wicked El Morads! "
msgstr "新的战争需要新的英雄！击败40个邪恶的艾莫拉德人后再回来！"

msgid "Good! Smashing! Right, depart now! My fingers are crossed! Death to anyone who dares to stand in your way!"
msgstr "好！干得漂亮！那么，现在出发！为你祈祷！谁敢挡你的路，就让他去死！"

msgid "What is it? It's still not enough! Hurry and get back quickly!"
msgstr "怎么回事？还不够！赶紧回来！"

msgid "You have returned with your mission completed! A hero should get the war trophy deserving of his prowess! "
msgstr "你完成任务回来了！英雄就该得到与其实力相称的战争战利品！"

msgid "Finishing one mission isn't the end! You'd better keep challenging for more missions, as more you complete the better war trophy you will get at the end of the war!"
msgstr "完成一个任务不算完！你最好继续挑战更多任务，因为完成得越多，战争结束时你得到的战争战利品就越好！"

msgid "As expected of the Master! You defeated those brutal Karus! Let's hurry back and report the competion of your mission!"
msgstr "果然是主人！你击败了那些残暴的卡鲁斯人！我们快回去报告你完成任务了！"

msgid "Well.. We discovered a new war zone, this time. We realized that it was a strategically important point, and launched the first attack but were stopped by the soldiers of Karus who noticed what we were doing."
msgstr "唉……这次我们发现了一个新战区。我们意识到那是个战略要地，率先发起了进攻，但被察觉到我们意图的卡鲁斯士兵挡住了。"

msgid "By occupying this region we can drive out the brutal Karus and continue the glory of El Morad. Please return once you have defeated 40 Karus on the battlefield."
msgstr "占领这片地区，我们就能赶走残暴的卡鲁斯人，延续艾莫拉德的荣光。请在战场上击败40个卡鲁斯人后再回来。"

msgid "Good. Then, just leave for the battle zone right now. Glory to you sword!"
msgstr "好。那么，现在就奔赴战区吧。荣耀归于你的剑！"

msgid "What happened to you? You still have't left?"
msgstr "你怎么了？你还没出发？"

msgid "You have performed excellently. I have prepared a war trophy for you."
msgstr "你表现出色。我为你准备了一份战争战利品。"

msgid "Finishing one mission isn't the end. More missions you complete, the better war trophy you will get at the end of the war. So please keep on challenging."
msgstr "完成一个任务不算完。完成的任务越多，战争结束时你得到的战争战利品就越好。所以请继续挑战。"

msgid "It isn't yet the time to use this power."
msgstr "现在还不是使用这份力量的时候。"

msgid "We are sorry. You cannot access the Royal Promotion Dungeon due to an error. We will try to fix the problem as quickly as possible."
msgstr "非常抱歉。由于错误，你无法进入皇家晋升地牢。我们会尽快修复。"

msgid "To exchange the Minerva clothings you need the [Minerva Armor Certificate] or the [Minerva Hemlet Certificate] issued at a Power-up store.|There are two types of certificate where one is for 2 months use while the other is for 30 days, and please select the [Individual Voucher] if you made your purchase prior to the integration.  "
msgstr "要兑换密涅瓦服装，你需要在强化商店开具的[Minerva Armor Certificate]或[Minerva Hemlet Certificate]。|证书有两种，一种可使用2个月，另一种为30天；如果你是在合并前购买的，请选择[Individual Voucher]。"

msgid "Special Event for Thanksgiving Holiday! It is the Transformation Scroll Event! Now, we are giving special Pet Transformation Scrolls to those who collected 50 Runes of Conversion.  It is a great chance to evolve your pet into a special Pet! There are also chances of getting Krowaz, Giaga Hammer, or Cuff Binder Pet Transformation Scrolls!"
msgstr "感恩节特别活动！这是变身卷轴活动！现在，我们将向收集到50个转换符文的人发放特殊宠物变身卷轴。这是把你的宠物进化成特殊宠物的好机会！还有机会获得Krowaz、Giaga Hammer或Cuff Binder宠物变身卷轴！"

msgid "Would you like to exchange it?"
msgstr "你想兑换吗？"

msgid "Insufficient space in the inventory. Please check again."
msgstr "背包空间不足。请重新检查。"

msgid "You have chosen the [Cuff Binder Pet Transformation Scroll]. Would you like to exchange it?"
msgstr "你选择了[Cuff Binder Pet Transformation Scroll]。你想兑换吗？"

msgid "There are not enough Runes of Conversion. You need 50 for the exchange.|You can get the Rune of Conversion when you win a match against [Doge Girl] in Yut game."
msgstr "转换符文不够。兑换需要50个。|在枰游戏中战胜[Doge Girl]，就能获得转换符文。"

msgid "It has been exchanged with a [Giga Hammer Transformation Scroll]. Thank you."
msgstr "已兑换为[Giga Hammer Transformation Scroll]。谢谢。"

msgid "It has been exchanged with a [Krowaz Transformation Scroll]. Thank you."
msgstr "已兑换为[Krowaz Transformation Scroll]。谢谢。"

msgid "It requires either a [Minerva Helmet Certificate (30 days)] or [Minerva Armor Certificate (30 days)]. Please check again."
msgstr "需要[Minerva Helmet Certificate (30 days)]或[Minerva Armor Certificate (30 days)]其一。请重新检查。"

msgid "It requires either a [Minerva Helmet Certificate (2 months)] or a [Minerva Armor Certificate (2 months)]. Please check again."
msgstr "需要[Minerva Helmet Certificate (2 months)]或[Minerva Armor Certificate (2 months)]其一。请重新检查。"

msgid "It requires a [Minerva Armor Certificate]. Please check again."
msgstr "需要[Minerva Armor Certificate]。请重新检查。"

msgid "It requires a [Minerva Helmet Certificate]. Please check again."
msgstr "需要[Minerva Helmet Certificate]。请重新检查。"

msgid "A monk with two faces.. Be careful of the darkness! In the darkness, a monk who lost his spirit can stare at you from behind you."
msgstr "一个长着两张脸的僧侣……小心黑暗！在黑暗中，一个迷失了心智的僧侣可能会从你身后盯着你。"

msgid "Master, now that you have become 60 level, it will be better for you to try more adventures at the Ronarkland stronghold. Please go see <font color=@#990000@>Cruzed at the Ronarkland stronghold</font>"
msgstr "主人，既然你已经60级了，最好去罗纳克之地要塞尝试更多冒险。请去见<font color=@#990000@>罗纳克之地要塞的Cruzed</font>"

msgid "Mmh?? It went over 74 level..it is too high. Huh-"
msgstr "嗯？？已经超过74级了……太高了。唉——"

msgid "I don't want to get near to...a person like you who doesn't have any composure. Ah...I feel bad"
msgstr "我不想靠近……像你这样沉不住气的人。啊……我心情糟透了"

msgid "He is a wandering monk of Esoteric Buddhism..but his true identity is an outrageous wizard of darkness? Here it is also called <font color=@#660066@>Paramun</font>. Isn't the name cute? Haha.."
msgstr "他是个密教的云游僧侣……但他的真实身份竟是个离谱的黑暗巫师？这里也叫他<font color=@#660066@>Paramun</font>。这名字是不是很可爱？哈哈……"

msgid "I don't know why but I am afraiod of Cruzed even more."
msgstr "不知为什么，我反而更怕Cruzed了。"

msgid "Be careful..Darkness is spreading.. Darkness.."
msgstr "小心……黑暗正在蔓延……黑暗……"

msgid "Did you have a fight with Paramun? Haha.. Don't make a face like that. Don't you think that you had good experiences to some extent?"
msgstr "你和Paramun打了一架？哈哈……别摆那张脸。你不觉得自己多少也收获了不错的经历吗？"

msgid "A monk with two faces.. Be careful of the darkness! In the darkenss, a monk who lost his spirit can stare at you from behind you."
msgstr "一个长着两张脸的僧侣……小心黑暗！在黑暗中，一个迷失了心智的僧侣可能会从你身后盯着你。"

msgid "Master, now that you have become 60 level, it will be better for you to try more adventures at the Ronarkland stronghold. Please go to see <font color=@#990000@>Krable at the Ronarkland stronghold</font>"
msgstr "主人，既然你已经60级了，最好去罗纳克之地要塞尝试更多冒险。请去见<font color=@#990000@>罗纳克之地要塞的Krable</font>"

msgid "He is a wandering monk of Esoteric Buddhism..but his true identity is an outrageous wizard of darkness. Here it is also called <font color=@#660066@>Para Moon</font>. Isn't the name cute? Haha.."
msgstr "他是个密教的云游僧侣……但他的真实身份竟是个离谱的黑暗巫师。这里也叫他<font color=@#660066@>Para Moon</font>。这名字是不是很可爱？哈哈……"

msgid "I don't why but I am afraiod of Krable even more."
msgstr "不知为什么，我反而更怕Krable了。"

