msgid "Master, [Guard] Melverick has a task that needs to be assigned urgently. At first hearing, it doesn't seem to be a problem that can be completed at once..."
msgstr "主人，[Guard]Melverick有个急需派发的任务。乍一听，这似乎不是能一次完成的问题……"

msgid "<selfname>! Long time no see. I just want to let you know that we decided to carry out the subjugation of monsters on a large scale this time. However, if we go there as a troop, they all hide so we have planned an operation in which we move ecretly and individually. That is, I have to subdue them alone!"
msgstr "<selfname>！好久不见。我只想告诉你，我们这次决定大规模讨伐怪物。但是，如果我们成队前去，它们就都躲起来，所以我们计划了一个秘密、单独行动的方案。也就是说，你得独自讨伐它们！"

msgid "First, please catch 30 Kaungas! I tell you this one more time. You have to perform the task by yourself!|# When the party play is performed with the [Repeat Quest] which can perform this Quest up to Lv. 51 to 55, the monster counter doesn't go up but the counter goes up only when solo play is performed."
msgstr "首先，请抓30只Kongaus！我再说一遍。你必须独自完成任务！|# 与可在51~55级进行本任务的[Repeat Quest]组队游玩时，怪物计数不会增加，只有单人游玩时计数才会增加。"

msgid "First, please catch 40 Grells! I tell you this one more time. You have to perform the task by yourself!|# When the party play is performed with the [Repeat Quest] which can perform this Quest up to Lv. 51 to 55, the monster counter doesn't go up but the counter goes up only when solo play is performed."
msgstr "首先，请抓40只格雷尔！我再说一遍。你必须独自完成任务！|# 与可在51~55级进行本任务的[Repeat Quest]组队游玩时，怪物计数不会增加，只有单人游玩时计数才会增加。"

msgid "First, please catch 40 Apes! I tell you this one more time. You have to perform the task by yourself!|# When the party play is performed with the [Repeat Quest] which can perform this Quest up to Lv. 51 to 55, the monster counter doesn't go up but the counter goes up only when solo play is performed."
msgstr "首先，请抓40只巨猿！我再说一遍。你必须独自完成任务！|# 与可在51~55级进行本任务的[Repeat Quest]组队游玩时，怪物计数不会增加，只有单人游玩时计数才会增加。"

msgid "Master, it has has been completed! Go to Melverick quickly!"
msgstr "主人，任务完成了！快去Melverick那里！"

msgid "Oh, you completed the task! Thanks a lot. For your information, please note that this Quest can be perform repeatedly up to 55 levels."
msgstr "哦，你完成了任务！多谢。顺便告知，本任务可在55级以下反复进行。"

msgid "Master! [Guard] Zalk has a task that needs to be assigned urgently. At first hearing, it doesn't seem to be a problem that can be completed at once..."
msgstr "主人！[Guard]Zalk有个急需派发的任务。乍一听，这似乎不是能一次完成的问题……"

msgid "<selfname>! Long time no see. I just want to let you know that we decided to carry out the subjugation of monsters on a large scale this time. However, if we go there as a troop, they all hide so we have planned an operation in which we move in secretly and individually. That is, I have to subdue them alone!"
msgstr "<selfname>！好久不见。我只想告诉你，我们这次决定大规模讨伐怪物。但是，如果我们成队前去，它们就都躲起来，所以我们计划了一个秘密、单独行动的方案。也就是说，你得独自讨伐它们！"

msgid "First, please catch 30 Kongaus! I'll tell you once more. You have to perform the task by yourself!|# When the party play is performed with the [Repeat Quest] which can perform this Quest up to Lv. 51 to 55, the monster counter doesn't go up but the counter goes up only when solo play is performed."
msgstr "首先，请抓30只Kongaus！我再说一遍。你必须独自完成任务！|# 与可在51~55级进行本任务的[Repeat Quest]组队游玩时，怪物计数不会增加，只有单人游玩时计数才会增加。"

msgid "First, please catch 40 Grells! I'll tell you once more. You have to perform the task by yourself!|# When the party play is performed with the [Repeat Quest] which can perform this Quest up to Lv. 51 to 55, the monster counter doesn't go up but the counter goes up only when solo play is performed."
