msgstr "主人，任务完成了！快去Zalk那里！"

msgid "Oh! You have come. The guerilla warfare last time was magnificent. I can't forget the sight! So I will assign another task to you. It is a guerilla warfare this time too. Of course, you have to carry out the task by yourself in the same way as you did with the last task."
