msgstr "哎呀，头疼死了……你问是什么事？那个该死的……不，是某个坏蛋害的！我正忙着准备情人节呢，结果巧克力全被偷走了。而且抓到的犯人还倒打一耙说自己是受害者。谁让我被甩了呢……总之，得找到犯人埋在地里的巧克力。你从我这儿拿把镐，去城堡外围的采矿区把巧克力挖回来。作为报酬，我会给你好几件道具。"

msgid "Hello! I am luxury chocolate maker [Chocolatier]Cacao. My chocolates have a history of over 300 years and have an exquisite.. Hm.. Hm.. What are you looking for?"
msgstr "你好！我是奢华巧克力师[Chocolatier]Cacao。我的巧克力有300多年历史，味道精致……嗯……嗯……你找什么？"

msgid "You have brought the chocolates! Its covered in dirt but.. Damn.. Oops. I should kill that son of a.. Oops.. We should teach him a lesson. Tee hee hee.. Anyways would you like to trade the item you brought?"
msgstr "你把巧克力带来了！上面全是土，不过……该死……哎呀。我真该宰了那个小王八……哎呀……我们该给他点颜色瞧瞧。嘻嘻嘻……总之，你想兑换你带来的道具吗？"

msgid "You have received the pickaxe already huh? Since I'm not supporting <selfname> because I can, I'll have to charge you from now on. How much? Its just 1 million Noah."
msgstr "你已经拿过镐了？既然我不是想帮<selfname>就帮，那从今往后我就得收费了。多少？就100万诺亚。"

msgid "Its you first time right? Its free for the first time. But after long period of use it will wear out and you will have to purchase a new one!"
msgstr "这是你第一次，对吧？第一次免费。但用久了它会磨损，你就得买一把新的了！"

msgid "Its yours! Hope you can bring me as much chocolate as possible."
msgstr "给你！希望你能给我带回尽可能多的巧克力。"

msgid "You don't have enough space in your bag. Make some room and come again."
msgstr "你的背包空间不够。腾出位置再来。"

msgid "Its has been traded. Have a happy Valentine's day."
msgstr "已交易。情人节快乐。"

msgid "You don't have a voucher. Please check again."
msgstr "你没有兑换券。请重新检查。"

msgid "You have a voucher? May I take a look at it?"
msgstr "你有兑换券？能让我看看吗？"

msgid "You have brought a wedding voucher. With this you can receive a free groom or bride enchantment. Which one would you like?"
msgstr "你带来了婚礼兑换券。凭此你可以免费领取一次新郎或新娘附魔。你想要哪一种？"

msgid "Bouquet and flower shield vouchers may be traded in here. Which one would you like?"
msgstr "花束和花盾兑换券可以在这里兑换。你想要哪一种？"

msgid "You do not have enough Noah. To buy a pickaxe you need 1 million Noah."
msgstr "你的诺亚不够。买一把镐需要100万诺亚。"

msgid "Hi! I'm [Camouflage Master] Serena. I came to Adonis to help you get transformed!"
msgstr "你好！我是[Camouflage Master]Serena。我来阿多尼斯帮你变身！"

msgid "Price? It's not free. Pay 450,000 and you'll get a random scroll out of 7 possible. Nothing's free!"
msgstr "要钱的。这可不是免费。付450000，你就能从7种卷轴里随机获得一种。天下没有免费的东西！"

msgid "Sorry pal, but you're running low on funds. Come back after pay day."
msgstr "抱歉伙计，你钱不够。发薪日之后再来。"

msgid "Thanks, and here's your scroll.  Take care!"
msgstr "谢谢，这是你的卷轴。保重！"

msgid "Info of Random Transformation Scroll|- 450000 coins required.| - 1 scroll in 7 scrolls in random.| - Scroll Information| #Snowman Nunu|#Snowman Titi|#Snowman Teo| #Snowman Porum|#Magpie |#Sexy Santa| #Dream Girl"
msgstr "随机变身卷轴说明|- 需要450000金币。|- 从7种卷轴中随机获得1种。|- 卷轴信息|#雪人Nunu|#雪人Titi|#雪人Teo|#雪人Porum|#喜鹊|#Sexy Santa|#Dream Girl"

msgid "I will look forward to our next encounter."
msgstr "期待我们下次相遇。"

msgid "How do you do? What brings you to me today?"
msgstr "你好。今天是什么风把你吹来了？"

msgid "Why am I standing here? Is it not obvious? I am standing here because I am a miner! Why is a miner standing here? So I can mine ores! You sure ask silly questions! Then why am I not mining any ores? It is bothersome, that is why, you smirk bastard! Actually, this is great. Go over there and start mining some ores for me. You do not know how to? Here, I will give you a Mattock, so hold this and press [Sparce Bar] near the ore veins. Then you will automatically start mining. Go on now! If you mine up some [Mysterious Ore], I will purify it and then craft it into a useful item for you! Run along now!"
msgstr "我为什么站在这里？这不明摆着吗？我站在这里是因为我是个矿工！矿工为什么站在这里？好让我挖矿呗！你净问些傻问题！那我为什么不挖矿？因为太烦人了，就因为这个，你这个嬉皮笑脸的混蛋！其实，这倒挺好。去那边给我挖点矿石。你不会挖？来，我给你一把镐，拿着它，在矿脉附近按[Sparce Bar]。然后你就会自动开始挖矿。去吧！如果你挖到[Mysterious Ore]，我会帮你净化，然后做成一件有用的道具给你！快走快走！"

msgid "The weather sure is great today. Who are you? What do you want?"
msgstr "今天天气真不错。你是谁？你想干嘛？"

msgid "Oh, you actually managed to find [Mysterious Ore] and [Mysterious Gold Ore]. Well, do you want me to purify it and turn it into an item?"
msgstr "哦，你居然找到了[Mysterious Ore]和[Mysterious Gold Ore]。那么，你想让我把它净化成一件道具吗？"

msgid "What? You want a Mattock? You took one before. I cannot just keep giving away Mattock for free, so I will give you a Mattock for 1 M Noah."
msgstr "什么？你要镐？你之前拿过一把了。我不能老是白送镐，所以这把镐我收你100万诺亚。"

msgid "Mattock? Here's a spare one. No need to pay for it. Just go mine up some ores already. For your information, it has to be repaired when it runs out of durability, or else you will have to purchase it from me again."
msgstr "镐？这儿有把备用的。不用付钱。赶紧去挖矿吧。顺便告诉你，耐久用完了就得修，否则你又得从我这儿买一把。"

msgid "Here, take it."
msgstr "给你，拿着。"

msgid "Did you check your bag space? How packed is it if you cannot even accept this? Come back after you free up some space!"
msgstr "你检查过背包空间了吗？连这个都装不下，得塞得多满？腾出空间后再来！"

msgid "Here, take it. Hopefully it is something you wanted."
msgstr "给你，拿着。希望是你想要的东西。"

msgid "You do not have the [Exchange Coupon]. Check again!"
msgstr "你没有[Exchange Coupon]。再检查一下！"

msgid "Which [Exchange Coupon] did you bring?"
msgstr "你带来了哪张[Exchange Coupon]？"

msgid "Bring me [Mysterious Ore] and [Mysterious Gold Ore! Hurry and go mine it up!"
msgstr "把[Mysterious Ore]和[Mysterious Gold Ore]给我！快去挖！"

msgid "That will be 1 M Noah. 1 M Noah, I tell you. You have to bring me 1 M Noah!"
msgstr "这要100万诺亚。我跟你说，100万诺亚。你得给我带来100万诺亚！"

msgid "   Information on Lunar Spy & Dark Lunar Spy|- This quest must be done on the War Map during the Lunar War on Monday and Thursday or during the Dark Lunar War on Wednesday. |- Please note that this quest cannot be completed except on the designated War days listed above."
msgstr "月球间谍与黑暗月球间谍说明|- 本任务必须在周一、周四的月球战争，或周三的黑暗月球战争期间的战争地图上完成。|- 请注意，除上述指定战争日外，本任务无法完成。"

msgid "       What you need to know during Mission Quest|- This quest is rather difficult relative to its level requirement. Users who are unfamiliar with Knights Online should be aware of this.|- Users should also note that during this mission, Contribution Points and Experience Points can be lost."
msgstr "任务须知|- 相对于等级要求，本任务相当困难。不熟悉骑士OL的用户请注意这一点。|- 用户还应注意，在此任务中，贡献度和经验值都可能损失。"

msgid "Master! [Mercenary] Russell urgently requires your help! He must be struggling against strong enemies!"
msgstr "主人！[Mercenary]Russell急需你的帮助！他肯定正在跟强敌苦战！"

msgid "Greetings! How about hunting the Boss of each region this time?  Each Boss is well known among its own kind."
msgstr "你好！这次去猎杀各区域的Boss怎么样？每个Boss在同类中都赫赫有名。"

msgid "Your mission is not complete. I can only advise you when your missions are complete."
msgstr "你的任务还没完成。只有任务完成时我才能给你建议。"

msgid "Master! [Mercenary] Talesl urgently requires your help! He must be struggling against strong enemies!"
msgstr "主人！[Mercenary]Talesl急需你的帮助！他肯定正在跟强敌苦战！"

msgid "Greetings! How about hunting the Boss of each region this time? Each Boss is well known among its own kind."
msgstr "你好！这次去猎杀各区域的Boss怎么样？每个Boss在同类中都赫赫有名。"

msgid "Troll Armor can be crafted and acquired by paying 100 K Noahs during Level 50  to Level 59. The available accessories are [Gloves], [Boots], [Helmet], [Lower Garment], and [Upper Garment]. These items can be purchased only after all the required quests have been completed."
msgstr "50到59级期间，支付10万诺亚即可打造并获得巨魔护甲。可用的部位有[Gloves]、[Boots]、[Helmet]、[Lower Garment]和[Upper Garment]。这些道具只有在完成所有必需任务后才能购买。"

msgid "The fee is 100 K Noahs. Well, which part do you want?"
msgstr "费用是10万诺亚。那么，你要哪个部位？"

msgid "You don't have 100 K Noahs? No money, no goods, so you'd better get some."
msgstr "你没有10万诺亚？没钱就没货，你最好去弄点钱。"

msgid "You do not have enough inventory space. Come back after you have secured some free space."
msgstr "你背包空间不够。腾出空位后再来。"

msgid "[Lamia Hunt] quest must be completed before you can buy this.|- Karus: [Guard] Hashan from Linate Village|- El Morad: [Guard] Beth from Raiba Village."
msgstr "必须先完成[Lamia Hunt]任务才能购买。|- 卡鲁斯：利纳特村的[Guard]Hashan|- 艾莫拉德：莱巴村的[Guard]Beth。"

msgid "[Uruk Hai Hunt] quest must be completed before you can buy this.|- Karus: [Guard] Hashan from Linate Village|- El Morad: [Guard] Beth from Raiba Village."
