msgid "Do you know what a Cardinal is?"
msgstr "你知道枢机主教是什么吗？"

msgid "A Cardinal is a magical lifeform created when Pathos cast a curse on a Scarecrow. No one knows how these monsters managed to wander onto the Adonis continent, but lately we've had a few show up on the outskirts of our village."
msgstr "枢机主教是帕托斯对稻草人降下诅咒后诞生的魔法生命体。没人知道这些怪物是怎么游荡到阿多尼斯大陆的，但最近我们村子外缘出现了几只。"

msgid "It was only yesterday. A Guard out on a patrol discovered a bunch of these monsters. It wasn't a big deal with only one or two of them around, but they increase in number every day."
msgstr "就在昨天。一名巡逻的卫兵发现了一群这种怪物。只有一两只的时候不算什么，但它们的数量每天都在增加。"

msgid "At this rate, the monsters will overwhelm not only our village, but all of Adonis itself. We are currently working with other [Secret Agents] to eradicate them but we're shorthanded. <selfname>, please help us."
msgstr "照这个速度，这些怪物不仅会压垮我们村子，还会席卷整个阿多尼斯。我们目前正和其他[Secret Agents]联手清剿它们，但人手不够。<selfname>，请帮帮我们。"

msgid "I entrust this matter to you. Time is ticking so you should be on the move."
msgstr "这件事就交给你了。时间紧迫，你该出发了。"

msgid "Quite a few Cardinals have been found in places other than the outskirts of the village."
msgstr "在村子外缘以外的地方也发现了不少枢机主教。"

msgid "Those monsters were multiplying fast, but you put a stop to THAT! Please go see [Secret Agent] Clarence!"
msgstr "那些怪物繁殖得很快，但你阻止了它们！请去见[Secret Agent]Clarence吧！"

msgid "Thank you! You did better than I expected. You've made our job much easier."
msgstr "谢谢！你做得比我预想的还好。你让我们的工作轻松多了。"

msgid "Master, those must be what [Secret Agent] Clarence mentioned!"
msgstr "主人，那些一定就是[Secret Agent]Clarence提到的东西！"

msgid "Master! They have been annihilated! A Scarecrow cursed by Pathos is a nasty piece of work!"
msgstr "主人！它们已被剿灭！被帕托斯诅咒的稻草人真是个难缠的东西！"

msgid "Master! They  have been annihilated! A Scarecrow cursed by Pathos is a nasty piece of work!"
msgstr "主人！它们已被剿灭！被帕托斯诅咒的稻草人真是个难缠的东西！"

msgid "Master, [Secret Agent] Clarence seems troubled. We should go visit him."
msgstr "主人，[Secret Agent]Clarence好像有烦心事。我们该去看看他。"

msgid "You have a lot of hunts yet to be completed. Come back once you have completed your present quests."
msgstr "你还有不少狩猎没完成。完成当前任务后再来。"

msgid "You must attend Border Defense War and bring [High Level Border Defense Compensation Ascent Scroll]."
msgstr "你必须参加边境防御战，并带回[High Level Border Defense Compensation Ascent Scroll]。"

msgid "Master, it looks like [Captain] Fargo would like to assign you a new mission. Hurry and see him."
msgstr "主人，[Captain]Fargo好像想给你派个新任务。快去见他。"

msgid "You finally made it, <selfname>! I wanted to ask a favor in private."
msgstr "你终于来了，<selfname>！我想私下请你帮个忙。"

msgid "A soldier who recently returned from the border wars reported that we're short on manpower. Report for duty at the border at once!"
msgstr "一名最近从边境战争归来的士兵报告说我们人手不足。立刻去边境报到！"

msgid "It is extremely urgent. Will you join the battle at the border?"
msgstr "情况极其紧急。你愿意加入边境的战斗吗？"

msgid "#Information on Border Defense War#|- Border Defense War begins each day at the following times. |  - AM : 1AM, 10AM|  - PM : 1PM, 3PM, 5PM, 8PM, 10PM|- Please note that during Lunar and Dark Lunar War on Monday, Wednesday and Thursday, the 8PM Border Defense War will not occur.|- Border Defense War automatically starts gathering forces at the appointed time and the battle commences after 10 minutes.|- Good equipment is essential to victory.|- Equipment Support Information: Equipment can be rented from the Moradon Equipment Quartermaster with Noah payments. Fees are set according to user level."
msgstr "#边境防御战信息#|- 边境防御战每天于以下时间开始。|  - 上午：凌晨1点、上午10点|  - 下午：下午1点、3点、5点、晚上8点、10点|- 请注意，周一、周三、周四的月球战争与黑暗月球战争期间，晚上8点的边境防御战不会举行。|- 边境防御战会在指定时间自动集结兵力，并在10分钟后开战。|- 精良的装备是获胜的关键。|- 装备支援信息：可向莫拉登装备军需官租用装备，以诺亚支付。费用按用户等级设定。"

msgid "Master! We have the scroll. You can use this to boost your Experience Points for a limited period. But taking it directly to [Captain] Fargo will give you a lot of experience all at once!"
msgstr "主人！我们拿到卷轴了。你可以在限定时间内用它提升经验值。但直接把它带给[Captain]Fargo，你会一下子获得大量经验！"

msgid "Is it time?  Border Defense Battle commences automatically at these appointed times. |  - AM : 1AM, 10AM|  - PM : 1PM, 3PM, 5PM, 8PM, 10PM|#  Please note that during Lunar and Dark Lunar War on Monday, Wednesday and Thursday, the 8PM Border Defense Battle will not occur."
msgstr "到时间了吗？边境防御战会在以下指定时间自动开始。|  - 上午：凌晨1点、上午10点|  - 下午：下午1点、3点、5点、晚上8点、10点|# 请注意，周一、周三、周四的月球战争与黑暗月球战争期间，晚上8点的边境防御战不会举行。"

msgid "You brought it! How did it go? Wait, doesn't matter! I look forward to your action as a member of the Border Defense!"
msgstr "你带来了！打得怎么样？算了，无所谓！我期待你作为边境防御一员的表现！"

msgid "Master, it looks like [Captain] Folkwine would like to assign you a new mission. Hurry and see him."
msgstr "主人，[Captain]Folkwine好像想给你派个新任务。快去见他。"

msgid "#Information on Border Defense Battle#|- Border Defense Battle begins each day at the following times. |  - AM : 1AM, 10AM|  - PM : 1PM, 3PM, 5PM, 8PM, 10PM|- Please note that during Lunar and Dark Lunar War on Monday, Wednesday and Thursday, the 8PM Border Defense Battle will not occur.|- Border Defense Battle automatically starts gathering forces at the appointed time and the battle commences after 10 minutes.|- Good equipment is essential to victory.|- Equipment Support Information: Equipment can be rented from the Moradon Equipment Quartermaster with Noah payments. Fees are set according to user level."
msgstr "#边境防御战信息#|- 边境防御战每天于以下时间开始。|  - 上午：凌晨1点、上午10点|  - 下午：下午1点、3点、5点、晚上8点、10点|- 请注意，周一、周三、周四的月球战争与黑暗月球战争期间，晚上8点的边境防御战不会举行。|- 边境防御战会在指定时间自动集结兵力，并在10分钟后开战。|- 精良的装备是获胜的关键。|- 装备支援信息：可向莫拉登装备军需官租用装备，以诺亚支付。费用按用户等级设定。"

msgid "Is it time? Border Defense Battle commences automatically at these appointed times. | - AM : 1AM, 10AM| - PM : 1PM, 3PM, 5PM, 8PM, 10PM|# Please note that during Lunar and Dark Lunar War on Monday, Wednesday and Thursday, the 8PM Border Defense Battle will not occur."
msgstr "到时间了吗？边境防御战会在以下指定时间自动开始。|  - 上午：凌晨1点、上午10点|  - 下午：下午1点、3点、5点、晚上8点、10点|# 请注意，周一、周三、周四的月球战争与黑暗月球战争期间，晚上8点的边境防御战不会举行。"

msgid "Please select which effect you would like to receive. |#Cry for Charge: 80% Increment of Magic Power|#Firm Will : Defense 100|#Endless Patience : HP Increased by 500"
msgstr "请选择你想领取的效果。|#Cry for Charge：魔法力提升80%|#Firm Will：防御100|#Endless Patience：HP+500"

msgid "Please select which effect you would like to receive. |#Cry for Charge: 80% Increment of Magic Power|#Firm Will : Defense 150|#Endless Patience : HP Increased by 800"
msgstr "请选择你想领取的效果。|#Cry for Charge：魔法力提升80%|#Firm Will：防御150|#Endless Patience：HP+800"

msgid "Can't even do this much on your own? Disband the party and do it alone!"
msgstr "连这点事都没法自己搞定？解散队伍，独自去做！"

msgid "Not so easy alone, this one... Better you find some folks to help."
msgstr "这个任务一个人可不容易……你最好找些人帮忙。"

msgid "Greetings! I'm Sirin, a [White Shadow Commander]. I am responsible for the Chaos Battle. I change the Wings of heroes into items. Please make a selection from the menu."
msgstr "你好！我是Sirin，[White Shadow Commander]。我负责混沌战。我会把英雄之翼换成道具。请从菜单中选择。"

msgid "I offer the [Map of Chaos] needed to enter the Chaos War to those who have purchased a [Map of Chaos Exchange Coupon]. If you wish to exchange your coupon for a [Map of Chaos], please press [Commence Exchange]."
msgstr "我向购买了[Map of Chaos Exchange Coupon]的人提供进入混沌战争所需的[Map of Chaos]。如果你想用券兑换[Map of Chaos]，请按[Commence Exchange]。"

msgid "You do not have a [Map of Chaos Exchange Coupon]. Please be advised that a [Map of Chaos Exchange Coupon] is available for purchase at the [Power Up Store]."
msgstr "你没有[Map of Chaos Exchange Coupon]。请注意，[Map of Chaos Exchange Coupon]可在[Power Up Store]购买。"

msgid "You have chosen to make a trade. Once you proceed with this exchange, you cannot trade the item with any other users or NPC. Would you like to continue?"
msgstr "你选择了进行交易。一旦完成此次兑换，你就不能把该道具与其他任何用户或NPC交易。你要继续吗？"

msgid "You have received the requested item. Good luck in your coming battles!"
msgstr "你已领取所需道具。祝你接下来的战斗好运！"

msgid "You have gained a [Voucher of Oracle] after a victorious Chaos Battle. The voucher can be exchanged into a Wing by adding either [Ancient Text] or [Noah]. |# Using [Ancient Text] will not cost any [Noah]. It also increases the likelihood of acquiring a high level Wing that will have better attributes. |# If you make the exchange with [Noah], a Wing will be randomly selected regardless of high or low level attributes."
msgstr "你在混沌战获胜后获得了一张[Voucher of Oracle]。这张券可以加上[Ancient Text]或[Noah]兑换成翅膀。|# 使用[Ancient Text]不会花费任何[Noah]，还能提高获得属性更好的高级翅膀的概率。|# 如果你用[Noah]兑换，翅膀会随机选取，不论属性高低。"

msgid "You do not have any [Ancient Text]. Please be advised that [Ancient Text] is available for purchase at the [Power Up Store]."
msgstr "你没有[Ancient Text]。请注意，[Ancient Text]可在[Power Up Store]购买。"

msgid "You have [Ancient Text] in your possession. [Ancient Text] emits magical powers that increases your chances of gaining a [Wing] with high level attributes. Would you like to use it? |# Noah is not required when [Ancient Text] is used."
msgstr "你持有[Ancient Text]。[Ancient Text]会释放魔力，提高你获得高级属性[Wing]的概率。你要使用它吗？|# 使用[Ancient Text]时不需要诺亚。"

msgid "You do not have enough inventory space. Come back when you have enough space for this transaction."
msgstr "你背包空间不足。等有足够空间进行本次交易时再来。"

msgid "The exchange has been completed. I hope you got what you were looking for."
msgstr "兑换已完成。希望你得到了想要的东西。"

msgid "You do not have enough Noah. You need [Level x 6000 Noah] to make an exchange for a Wing."
msgstr "你的诺亚不够。兑换翅膀需要[等级 x 6000诺亚]。"

msgid "If you make the exchange with [Noah], a Wing will be randomly selected regardless of high or low level attributes. Do you wish to continue? |# Noah cost: [Level x 6000 Noah]."
msgstr "如果你用[Noah]兑换，翅膀会随机选取，不论属性高低。你要继续吗？|# 诺亚费用：[等级 x 6000诺亚]。"

msgid "You do not have a [Voucher of Oracle] in your possession. Please be advised that a [Voucher of Oracle] can be acquired through Chaos Battle."
msgstr "你没有持有[Voucher of Oracle]。请注意，[Voucher of Oracle]可通过混沌战获得。"

msgid "You have selected to accept [Reward: Wing]. [Reward: Wing] can be acquired by users who have become war heroes by defeating [Gatekeeper], [Defense Squad 1 Captain] and [Defense Squad 2 Captain] during each nation's battle for [King] or during [Lunar War]. Please select the menu of your choice."
msgstr "你选择了领取[Reward: Wing]。[Reward: Wing]可由在各国争夺[King]的战斗中或在[Lunar War]期间击败[Gatekeeper]、[Defense Squad 1 Captain]和[Defense Squad 2 Captain]、成为战争英雄的用户获得。请选择你想要的菜单。"

msgid "You are not qualified to receive a Wing. Come back after you distinguish yourself in a War."
msgstr "你没有资格领取翅膀。在战争中立功后再来。"

msgid "A wing has been given to King <selfname>. It may be used for 24 hours. After it expires, another may be acquired at the next inauguration of a King."
msgstr "翅膀已赐予国王<selfname>。可使用24小时。过期后，可在下次国王就职时再领取。"

msgid "You already received your reward for the day. Please come back tomorrow."
msgstr "你今天已经领过奖励了。请明天再来。"

msgid "[Lunar War Hero Wing Reward Information]|- The following Wing Reward menu is for users who were victorious against [Gatekeeper], [Defense Squad 1 Captain] and [Defense Squad 2 Captain] in [Lunar War].|- A Wing will be rewarded after [Next Day 6 AM] to users who were victorious against [Gatekeeper], [Defense Squad 1 Captain] and [Defense Squad 2 Captain] in [Lunar War].|- It may be used for 24 hours and may only be received once a day until the next war. |- Distributed Wings' attributes vary according to chance."
msgstr "[月球战争英雄翅膀奖励信息]|- 以下翅膀奖励菜单面向在[Lunar War]中击败[Gatekeeper]、[Defense Squad 1 Captain]和[Defense Squad 2 Captain]的用户。|- 在[Lunar War]中击败[Gatekeeper]、[Defense Squad 1 Captain]和[Defense Squad 2 Captain]的用户，将在[次日早6点]后获得翅膀奖励。|- 可使用24小时，且每天只能领取一次，直至下次战争。|- 发放翅膀的属性随机而定。"

msgid "It's an honor to meet a hero who has slain [Gatekeeper], <selfname>. You have been rewarded for your efforts. I look forward to seeing you in action in the future."
msgstr "很荣幸见到斩杀[Gatekeeper]的英雄，<selfname>。你的付出已得到奖赏。期待你未来的表现。"

msgid "It's an honor to meet a hero who has slain [Defense Squad 1 Captain], <selfname>. You have been rewarded for your efforts. I look forward to seeing you in action in the future. "
msgstr "很荣幸见到斩杀[Defense Squad 1 Captain]的英雄，<selfname>。你的付出已得到奖赏。期待你未来的表现。"

msgid "It's an honor to meet a hero who has slain [Defense Squad 2 Captain], <selfname>. You have been rewarded for your efforts. I look forward to seeing you in action in the future. "
msgstr "很荣幸见到斩杀[Defense Squad 2 Captain]的英雄，<selfname>。你的付出已得到奖赏。期待你未来的表现。"

msgid "The weapon breaker armor for levels 60~62 is being sold for 1 million Noah. The parts are [Gloves], [Boots], [Helmet], [Lower Armor], [Upper Armor], and the armor can only be bought by completing each quests."
msgstr "60~62级的破甲武器护甲以100万诺亚出售。部位有[Gloves]、[Boots]、[Helmet]、[Lower Armor]、[Upper Armor]，且只有完成各任务后才能购买。"

msgid "My commision is only 1 million Noah, now which part would you like?"
msgstr "我的佣金只要100万诺亚，那么你想要哪个部位？"

msgid "Hm.. You do not have enough Noah! Save up and come back for them."
msgstr "嗯……你的诺亚不够！攒够了再来买。"

msgid "Your inventory is full. Make some space and come back."
msgstr "你的背包满了。腾出空间再来。"

