msgid "You must spend the skill acquired from the skill box to gain another skill."
msgstr "你必须先使用从技能箱获得的技能，才能再获得一个技能。"

msgid "[Information on Ladder Rank #1 Wing Award]|-  The following menu is available to users who have achieved [Ladder Rank #1 of the Day] by defeating enemy users in the [Underdeveloped Zone].|-  A Wing will be rewarded after [Next Day 5 AM] to users who defeated enemy users in the [Underdeveloped Area].|- It may be used for 24 hours, and may only be received once a day until the next war. |- Distributed Wings' attributes vary according to chance."
msgstr "[天梯排名第1翅膀奖励信息]|- 以下菜单面向在[欠发达区域]击败敌方用户、获得[当日天梯排名第1]的用户。|- 在[欠发达区域]击败敌方用户的用户，将在[次日早5点]后获得翅膀奖励。|- 可使用24小时，且每天只能领取一次，直至下次战争。|- 发放翅膀的属性随机而定。"

msgid "You are ranked #1 in Ladder of the day! Great work! I expect you to do as well tomorrow, <selfname>!"
msgstr "你在当日天梯中排名第1！干得好！我期待你明天也表现出色，<selfname>！"

msgid "[Information on New Tier 8 Armor Set]|- This armor set is still under [Beta Test]. The armor set will be modified according to tester feedback. We look forward to a lot of user participation.|- Opinions on this armor set will be given full attention. They can be posted in the [Knight Online Home Page Survey / Discussion Forum].|- [New Tier 8 Armor Set] is being rented out from July 16, 2009 to July 30, 2009. |- Only level 75 or higher may purchase this item set.|- The price is set at 1 million Noah.|- The item is usable for 6 hours from the time of receipt and it will be deleted afterwards. |- Please be advised that this item set will be deleted from the server after July 30, 2009. |- It is sold in variations of [Vitality] and [Main Attributes in Accordance with Each Individual Class], so purchase one that suits you."
msgstr "[新8阶护甲套信息]|- 这套护甲仍在[Beta测试]中。护甲套将根据测试者反馈进行调整。我们期待大量用户参与。|- 对这套护甲的意见将被充分重视，可发布于[Knight Online主页调查/讨论论坛]。|- [新8阶护甲套]于2009年7月16日至2009年7月30日期间出租。|- 只有75级及以上才能购买此道具套。|- 售价定为100万诺亚。|- 该道具自领取起可使用6小时，之后将被删除。|- 请注意，此道具套将于2009年7月30日后从服务器删除。|- 它有[生命力]和[对应各职业主属性]两种变体，请购买适合你的那种。"

msgid "The beta test period is from July 16, 2009 to July 30, 2009. Please be advised that all items from this set will be deleted from the server after the test period."
msgstr "Beta测试期为2009年7月16日至2009年7月30日。请注意，测试期结束后，此套中的所有道具将从服务器删除。"

msgid "It costs 1 million Noah to participate in this test. Upon receipt of 1 million Noah, a 5 piece armor set will be available for rent. Please select the attributes of your choice. |- Please be advised that this item set will be deleted from the server after July 30, 2009."
msgstr "参与本次测试需花费100万诺亚。收到100万诺亚后，将可租用一套5件护甲。请选择你想要的属性。|- 请注意，此道具套将于2009年7月30日后从服务器删除。"

msgid "Only users who are Level 75 and higher can purchase this item. Please confirm your level before trying again."
msgstr "只有75级及以上的用户才能购买此道具。重试前请确认你的等级。"

msgid "One [Map of Chaos] is provided per day. However, no additional maps will be distributed for that day and it must be used within 6 hours from the time of receipt."
msgstr "每天提供一张[Map of Chaos]。但当天不会再额外发放地图，且必须在领取后6小时内使用。"

msgid "Would you like a [Map of Chaos]? If you receive a [Map of Chaos], it must be used within 6 hours or it will be deleted."
msgstr "你想要[Map of Chaos]吗？如果你领取[Map of Chaos]，必须在6小时内使用，否则将被删除。"

msgid "A [Map of Chaos Exchange Coupon] that can be exchanged for a [Map of Chaos] is available for sale until July 16th. Please be advised that all these items will be deleted after July 16th."
msgstr "可兑换[Map of Chaos]的[Map of Chaos Exchange Coupon]出售至7月16日。请注意，所有这些道具将于7月16日后删除。"

msgid "A [Map of Chaos Exchange Coupon] costs 1 million Noah. Would you like to make a purchase? |# This item will be deleted after July 16th."
msgstr "一张[Map of Chaos Exchange Coupon]售价100万诺亚。你要购买吗？|# 此道具将于7月16日后删除。"

msgid "An [Ancient Text] that induces the [Increased Chance of High Level Wing Acquisition] effect on a [Voucher of Oracle] is available for sale until July 16th. Please be advised that these items will be deleted after July 16th."
msgstr "能对[Voucher of Oracle]产生[提高高级翅膀获取概率]效果的[Ancient Text]出售至7月16日。请注意，这些道具将于7月16日后删除。"

msgid "An [Ancient Text] costs 2 million Noah. Would you like to make a purchase? |# This item will be deleted after July 16th."
msgstr "一张[Ancient Text]售价200万诺亚。你要购买吗？|# 此道具将于7月16日后删除。"

msgid "A [Make Over Coupon] allows users to modify exterior features and is available for sale until July 16th. Please be advised that this item will be deleted after July 16th."
msgstr "[Make Over Coupon]允许用户修改外观，出售至7月16日。请注意，此道具将于7月16日后删除。"

msgid "A [Make Over Coupon] costs 3 million Noah. Would you like to make a purchase?"
msgstr "一张[Make Over Coupon]售价300万诺亚。你要购买吗？"

msgid "I provide information on Chaos Battles. Please select a category for further details."
msgstr "我提供混沌战的相关信息。请选择一个类别查看详情。"

msgid "# What is Chaos?| When the [World of Enlightenment Fissure] occurs, people are devoured at |the Altar of Ancient Deities. The rules are simple: [Last One Standing]. To survive, everyone else must die. Everyone in this zone is an enemy. Everyone who opposes you or your Deity must be destroyed."
msgstr "# 什么是混沌？|当[启蒙世界裂隙]出现时，人们会在|古神祭坛被吞噬。规则很简单：[最后一人存活]。要活下去，其他所有人都得死。这个区域里每个人都是敌人。凡是与你或你的神为敌的人，都必须被消灭。"

msgid "# 1-1 Entrance| In order to enter Chaos Battle, a [Map of Chaos] must be selected from [White Shadow Commander] Sirin. Only one is available each day. This map can be used to attend 11 AM, 6 PM and 11 PM battles. The [Map of Chaos] is valid for 6 hours from time of receipt. Once used, It will be available for purchase at the [Power Up Shop]."
msgstr "# 1-1 入场|要进入混沌战，必须从[White Shadow Commander]Sirin处领取一张[Map of Chaos]。每天只有一张。这张地图可用于参加上午11点、下午6点和晚上11点的战斗。[Map of Chaos]自领取起6小时内有效。使用后，可在[Power Up Shop]购买。"

msgid "# 1-2 Start| At least 1 minute is given to prepare for battle upon entrance into Chaos Battle. The user is invincible during this minute and may use the time to configure skills and such. No damage may be inflicted by an enemy or Saw Blade Attack during this period."
msgstr "# 1-2 开始|进入混沌战时有至少1分钟备战时间。这一分钟内用户无敌，可利用这段时间配置技能等。在此期间，敌人或锯齿攻击都无法造成伤害。"

msgid "# 1-3 Battle| One minute after entrance into battle, a message will inform the user that the battle has begun. Basic combat is the same as with the standard Knight Online combat. Your chosen skill must be used to defeat your opponent. If the user has been defeated by an opponent, click [Confirm] to revive. The user will have 3 seconds of invincibility after reviving."
msgstr "# 1-3 战斗|进入战斗一分钟后，会有消息通知用户战斗已开始。基本战斗与标准骑士OL战斗相同。你必须使用所选技能击败对手。如果用户被对手击败，点击[Confirm]复活。用户复活后有3秒无敌时间。"

msgid "# 1-4 Revive| If the user is defeated by an opponent, the battle may continue by clicking [Confirm] to revive the user. The player revives in a random location within the Temple, but not where the user has been slain. The user will have 3 seconds of invincibility after reviving."
msgstr "# 1-4 复活|如果用户被对手击败，可点击[Confirm]复活以继续战斗。玩家在神殿内随机地点复活，但不会在被击杀的地点。用户复活后有3秒无敌时间。"

msgid "# 1-5 Victory| A user with a higher kill count will gain higher rank in Chaos. If the kill count is tied, superiority is given to the user with the lowest death count. If both kill and death counts are tied, the users will receive the same rank."
msgstr "# 1-5 胜利|击杀数越高的用户在混沌中排名越高。如果击杀数相同，则死亡数最少者占优。如果击杀和死亡数都相同，则这些用户获得相同排名。"

msgid "# 1-6 Reward| The top 20% will receive a [Voucher of Oracle] and all participants will receive an [Emblem of Chaos]. Details on how to use the [Voucher of Oracle] and [Emblem of Chaos] can be found under [Reward Information]."
msgstr "# 1-6 奖励|前20%将获得[Voucher of Oracle]，所有参与者将获得[Emblem of Chaos]。关于[Voucher of Oracle]和[Emblem of Chaos]的使用详情，见[奖励信息]。"

msgid "# 2-1 Basic Skill| Some basic skills that are available upon entry into Chaos. There are a total of 10 different skill types that may be configured per user requirements.| # 2-1-1 Spirit Sword| - This basic skill is available when beginning Chaos. It inflicts 1000 damage on the enemy."
msgstr "# 2-1 基础技能|进入混沌时可用的一些基础技能。共有10种不同技能类型，可按用户需求配置。|# 2-1-1 灵剑|- 这个基础技能在混沌开始时可用。它对敌人造成1000点伤害。"

msgid "# 2-1-2 Ice Counter| -  This basic skill is available when beginning Chaos. It inflicts 1000 damage to an opponent and slows movement speed."
msgstr "# 2-1-2 反击冰|- 这个基础技能在混沌开始时可用。它对对手造成1000点伤害并减缓移动速度。"

msgid "# 2-1-3 Fire Sword| - This basic skill is available when beginning Chaos. It hurls a fire ball and instantly inflicts 3000 damage from a distance."
msgstr "# 2-1-3 火焰剑|- 这个基础技能在混沌开始时可用。它投掷火球，从远处瞬间造成3000点伤害。"

msgid "# 2-1-4 Tears of Angel| - This basic skill is available when beginning Chaos. It immediately restores 1000 HP."
msgstr "# 2-1-4 天使之泪|- 这个基础技能在混沌开始时可用。它立即恢复1000点HP。"

msgid "# 2-1-5 Sprint| - This basic skill is available when beginning Chaos. It increases movement speed over a set period of time."
msgstr "# 2-1-5 冲刺|- 这个基础技能在混沌开始时可用。它在设定时间内提升移动速度。"

msgid "# 2-1-6 Ice Sword| - This basic skill is available when beginning Chaos. It launches a ranged attack that inflicts 3000 damage over time."
msgstr "# 2-1-6 冰剑|- 这个基础技能在混沌开始时可用。它发动远程攻击，随时间造成3000点伤害。"

msgid "# 2-1-7 Stealth| - This basic skill is available when beginning Chaos. It allows users to sustain invisibility while not attacking for a duration of 80 seconds. However, stealth is broken if struck while casting or if damaged in a specified attack range."
msgstr "# 2-1-7 隐身|- 这个基础技能在混沌开始时可用。它使用户在持续80秒内不攻击时保持隐身。不过，施法时被击中或在指定攻击范围内受到伤害，隐身就会被打破。"

msgid "# 2-1-8  Stun Lightning| - This basic skill is available when beginning Chaos. It inflicts 2000 electrical damage. It may also disable an enemy's mobility from time to time."
msgstr "# 2-1-8 眩晕闪电|- 这个基础技能在混沌开始时可用。它造成2000点电系伤害。它有时还能使敌人无法移动。"

msgid "# 2-1-9 Poison Knife| - This basic skill is available when beginning Chaos. It delivers a damage equivalent to 20% of the target's current HP."
msgstr "# 2-1-9 毒刀|- 这个基础技能在混沌开始时可用。它造成相当于目标当前HP 20%的伤害。"

msgid "# 2-2 Gain Skill| This skill is available through the [Chaos Cube] in Chaos. Three types exist and they are issued according to rank.|# 2-2-1 Light Pit| - This skill is learned through the Chaos Cube. It temporarily boosts movement speed by 200%. Light Pit cannot be stacked and used with Sprint."
msgstr "# 2-2 获得技能|此技能通过混沌中的[混沌立方体]获得。共有三种，按排名发放。|# 2-2-1 光坑|- 此技能通过混沌立方体习得。它暂时提升移动速度200%。光坑不能与冲刺叠加使用。"

msgid "# 2-2-2 Drain Restore| - This skill is learned through the Chaos Cube, restoring 1000 HP for a duration of 20 seconds."
msgstr "# 2-2-2 汲取恢复|- 此技能通过混沌立方体习得，在20秒内恢复1000点HP。"

msgid "# 2-2-3 Killing Blade| - This skill is learned through the Chaos Cube, enabling the user to kill an opponent in a single strike by targeting a vital point."
msgstr "# 2-2-3 致命刃|- 此技能通过混沌立方体习得，使用户能瞄准要害一击击杀对手。"

msgid "# Chaos Cube| The Chaos Cube converts unknown materials within the Temple to create new user skills."
msgstr "# 混沌立方体|混沌立方体将神殿内的未知材料转化，创造新的用户技能。"

msgid "# 3-1 Light Pit| - This skill is learned through the Chaos Cube. It temporarily boosts movement speed by 200%. Light Pit cannot be stacked and used with Sprint."
msgstr "# 3-1 光坑|- 此技能通过混沌立方体习得。它暂时提升移动速度200%。光坑不能与冲刺叠加使用。"

msgid "# 3-2 Drain Restore| - This skill is learned through the Chaos Cube, restoring 1000 HP for a duration of 20 seconds."
msgstr "# 3-2 汲取恢复|- 此技能通过混沌立方体习得，在20秒内恢复1000点HP。"

msgid "# 3-3 Killing Blade| - This skill is learned through the Chaos Cube, enabling one to kill an opponent in a single strike by targeting a vital point."
msgstr "# 3-3 致命刃|- 此技能通过混沌立方体习得，使用户能瞄准要害一击击杀对手。"

msgid "# Regarding Rewards| - In order to receive a reward, a user must be in the top 20% tier of all players. [For example, when 10 players participate, rewards will be given out to the top two players.]| - All participants will receive an [Emblem of Chaos]."
msgstr "# 关于奖励|- 要领取奖励，用户必须在所有玩家中位列前20%。[例如，10名玩家参与时，前两名获得奖励。]|- 所有参与者都将获得[Emblem of Chaos]。"

msgid "# 4-1 Voucher of Oracle| - This item is given to players who finished Chaos Battle within the top 20% tier. Go see [White Shadow Commander] Sirin and he will convert it into a [Wing] that may be used immediately."
msgstr "# 4-1 神谕券|- 此道具发给在混沌战中位列前20%的玩家。去找[White Shadow Commander]Sirin，他会把它转换成可立即使用的[Wing]。"

msgid "# 4-2 [Emblem of Chaos]| - This emblem is given to all who participate in Chaos Battle. If a user collects 5 of these emblems, they may be exchanged for other items such as a  [Wing]."
msgstr "# 4-2 [Emblem of Chaos]|- 这枚徽章发给所有参与混沌战的人。用户集齐5枚这样的徽章，就能兑换[Wing]等其他道具。"

msgid "You do not have enough [Emblem of Chaos]. Please be advised that an [Emblem of Chaos] may be acquired through Chaos Battle."
msgstr "你的[Emblem of Chaos]不够。请注意，[Emblem of Chaos]可通过混沌战获得。"

msgid "An [Emblem of Chaos] is awarded to everyone who participates in Chaos Battle. Users who did not manage to acquire a [Voucher of Oracle] can collect 5 [Emblem of Chaos] to trade for a Wing. The Wing will have an additional cost of either an [Ancient Text] or [Noah]. |# Using the [Ancient Text] will not cost any Noah. It also increases the likelihood of acquiring a high level Wing that will have better attributes. |# If you make the exchange with [Noah], a Wing will be randomly selected regardless of high or low level attributes."
msgstr "[Emblem of Chaos]发给每个参与混沌战的人。没能获得[Voucher of Oracle]的用户，可以集齐5枚[Emblem of Chaos]兑换翅膀。兑换翅膀还需额外支付[Ancient Text]或[Noah]。|# 使用[Ancient Text]不会花费任何诺亚，还能提高获得属性更好的高级翅膀的概率。|# 如果你用[Noah]兑换，翅膀会随机选取，不论属性高低。"

msgid "[Wealthy Merchant's Daughter] Menissiah has commissioned you to participate in [Chaos Battle] to bring her an [Emblem of Chaos]. Complete this quest to receive experience points, contribution points and some exceptional weapons."
msgstr "[富商之女]Menissiah委托你参加[Chaos Battle]，给她带回一枚[Emblem of Chaos]。完成此任务可获得经验值、贡献度和一些精良武器。"

msgid "[Wealthy Merchant's Daughter] Menissiah has commissioned you to participate in [Chaos Battle] to bring her [Emblem of Chaos]. Complete this quest to receive experience points, contribution points and some exceptional weapons."
msgstr "[富商之女]Menissiah委托你参加[Chaos Battle]，给她带回[Emblem of Chaos]。完成此任务可获得经验值、贡献度和一些精良武器。"

msgid "Hi! It has been a while. I need an item. Would you get it for me?"
msgstr "嗨！好久不见。我需要一件道具。你能帮我弄来吗？"

msgid "[Chaos Battle] occurs within the World of Enlightenment. An [Emblem of Chaos] may be acquired there. Think you could get it for me?  Bring me an [Emblem of Chaos] and you'll be handsomely rewarded."
msgstr "[Chaos Battle]发生在启蒙世界内。在那里可以获得[Emblem of Chaos]。你觉得能帮我弄来吗？给我带来一枚[Emblem of Chaos]，你会得到丰厚的报酬。"

msgid "You still haven't got it all? An [Emblem of Chaos] can be acquired during any [Chaos Battle] at 10 AM, 12 PM, 4 PM, 6 PM, 9 PM, 10 PM, and 12 AM."
msgstr "你还没集齐？在上午10点、中午12点、下午4点、6点、晚上9点、10点和午夜12点的任何一场[Chaos Battle]中都能获得[Emblem of Chaos]。"

msgid "You got it! I'll start my research on this new material! Thank you. Oh, um, how about keeping this from my dad, OK?"
msgstr "你拿到了！我要开始研究这种新材料了！谢谢。哦，嗯，这事能别告诉我爸吗，好吗？"

msgid "# 2-1-10 Throw Stone| - This basic skill is available when beginning Chaos. It inflicts 10 damage and can sustain multiple hits."
msgstr "# 2-1-10 投石|- 这个基础技能在混沌开始时可用。它造成10点伤害，并可连续多次命中。"

msgid "You already loaned weapon and armor today, please come back tomorrow."
msgstr "你今天已经租过武器和护甲了，请明天再来。"

msgid "Welcome.We let you borrow items for the masters who are back to complete the event. Please get it verified on our home page to receive [Secret Box] and come back to receive the equipments."
msgstr "欢迎。我们为回归完成活动的主人出借道具。请在我们主页验证以领取[Secret Box]，然后回来领取装备。"

msgid "Since <Selfname> is a warrior (looking at the list)  </ font> <font color=@#660066@> Glaive and the <font color=@#660066@> the chitin armor set </ font> have been prepared."
msgstr "既然<Selfname>是战士（看着清单）</font><font color=@#660066@>大刀</font>和<font color=@#660066@>几丁质套装</font>已经为你准备好了。"

msgid "Since <Selfname> is a Rogue (looking at the list)  </ font> <font color=@#660066@> Daggar of Mirazu and <font color=@#660066@> the chitin bow set </ font> have been prepared."
msgstr "既然<Selfname>是盗贼（看着清单）</font><font color=@#660066@>Mirazu匕首</font>和<font color=@#660066@>几丁质弓套</font>已经为你准备好了。"

msgid "Since <Selfname> is a magician (looking at the list)  </ font> <font color=@#660066@> Elemental Staff and the <font color=@#660066@> Creamson armor sets </ font> have been prepared."
msgstr "既然<Selfname>是法师（看着清单）</font><font color=@#660066@>元素法杖</font>和<font color=@#660066@>绯红套装</font>已经为你准备好了。"

msgid "Since <Selfname> is a Priest (looking at the list)  </ font> <font color=@#660066@> Rikaon Iron Mace and <font color=@#660066@> the chitin armor set </ font> have been prepared."
msgstr "既然<Selfname>是祭司（看着清单）</font><font color=@#660066@>Rikaon铁锤</font>和<font color=@#660066@>几丁质套装</font>已经为你准备好了。"

msgid "Since <Selfname> is a warrior (looking at the list)  </ font> <font color=@#660066@> Raptor and <font color=@#660066@> The chitinshell armor set </ font> have been prepared."
msgstr "既然<Selfname>是战士（看着清单）</font><font color=@#660066@>迅猛武器</font>和<font color=@#660066@>几丁质外壳套装</font>已经为你准备好了。"

msgid "Since <Selfname> is a rogue (looking at the list)  </ font> <font color=@#660066@> Iron Bow <font color=@#660066@> the Chitin Armor Set </ font> have been prepared."
msgstr "既然<Selfname>是盗贼（看着清单）</font><font color=@#660066@>铁弓</font><font color=@#660066@>几丁质套装</font>已经为你准备好了。"

msgid "We have prepared these for you."
msgstr "我们已为你准备好这些。"

msgid "is the log the <selfname> by looking at the list of (..) entry-<font color=@#660066@> The assassin's dagger and <font color=@#660066@> Beginner Assassin's Bow </ font> </ font>prepared for beginner <font color=@#660066@> the assassin armor sets </ font>."
msgstr "<selfname>（看着清单……）入门的<font color=@#660066@>刺客匕首</font>和<font color=@#660066@>新手刺客弓</font></font>已为你准备好，还有新手<font color=@#660066@>刺客套装</font>。"

msgid "You can start the event if you are over Lv 30.  Please train more and come back."
msgstr "30级以上才能参加活动。请再练高一点后再来。"

msgid "You don't have enough space in your inventory. You need 6 spaces to give out."
msgstr "你背包空间不够。发放需要6个空位。"

msgid "You don't have enough space in your inventory. You need 8 spaces to give out."
msgstr "你背包空间不够。发放需要8个空位。"

msgid "You don't have enough space in your inventory. You need 7 spaces to give out."
msgstr "你背包空间不够。发放需要7个空位。"

msgid "Hello. You can rent once in 24 hrs. If you want to rent it please let me know."
msgstr "你好。你每24小时可租用一次。如果你想租用，请告诉我。"

msgid "The euipqments will disappeared after 24 hrs. Have a great day"
msgstr "装备将在24小时后消失。祝你愉快"

msgid "For masters who are back for the Comeback Event, we're providing this service. If you qualify for the comeback event, please show me [Secret Box]."
msgstr "我们为回归活动中归来的主人提供这项服务。如果你符合回归活动条件，请向我出示[Secret Box]。"

msgid "Masters who are coming back to Knight Online, we're providing [Unlimited] service. <Selfname>, you seem to have the [Secret Box]. You must be a past knight. Which menu would you like to use? "
msgstr "回归骑士OL的主人，我们正在提供[Unlimited]服务。<Selfname>，你好像有[Secret Box]。你一定是过去的骑士。你想用哪个菜单？"

msgid "Thank you. You can obtain the following item until the event ends, please remember that."
msgstr "谢谢。在活动结束前你可以获得以下道具，请记住这一点。"

msgid "This isn't the [Come Back Event] period. When it's the right event period the service will be provided."
msgstr "现在不是[回归活动]期间。等到了活动期，这项服务就会提供。"

msgid "Yay! I'm going to go play now."
msgstr "耶！我现在要去玩啦。"

msgid "Please give the lunch box to my brother who's training to be a mercenary. I gotta go, bye!"
msgstr "请把饭盒给我那个正在接受佣兵训练的哥哥。我得走了，再见！"

msgid "Hey. Come here a moment."
msgstr "喂。过来一下。"

msgid "Man, this has all gone bad! I¡¯m going to need to throw this away! Can't you event deliver the right stuff?"
msgstr "天哪，这全坏了！我得把它扔掉！你连正确的东西都送不到吗？"

msgid "Phew¡¦ I'm almost 7 years old now but I still have to deliver my brother his lunch. Help me out here. With what? Of course the delivery!"
msgstr "唉……我都快7岁了，可还得给哥哥送午饭。帮帮我吧。帮什么？当然是送饭啊！"

msgid "Give it to my brother. Before it goes bad hurry!"
msgstr "把它给我哥哥。趁它还没坏，快点！"

msgid "My friend like to draw pictures. But he is still dreaming to approach the goal. You can find him in  Moradon Castle because he always stays in there."
msgstr "我朋友喜欢画画。但他仍在为接近目标而努力。你可以在莫拉登城堡找到他，因为他总是待在那儿。"

msgid "What are you looking for?"
msgstr "你在找什么？"

msgid "My sister made me a lunch? She's all grown up now. But why didn't she come by herself?"
msgstr "我妹妹给我做了午饭？她都长这么大了。可她为什么不自己送来？"

msgid "She went out to play! I thought she was too old for that now."
msgstr "她出去玩了！我还以为她现在已经过了那个年纪了。"

msgid "Thanks anyways. I want to reward you with [Ascend Scroll]"
msgstr "总之谢谢。我想给你[Ascend Scroll]作为报酬"

msgid "Ah, and I want you to give this journal to my friend. He dreams of being a painter but he doesn't have that much of a passion. I want to motivate him by letting him know that I'm trying my best here getting trained and that I'm thinking of him."
msgstr "啊，还有，我想让你把这本日记交给我朋友。他梦想成为画家，但没那么大热情。我想让他知道我在这里拼命训练、还惦记着他，好激励他。"

msgid "Your inventory is full. Make some space to get reward."
msgstr "你的背包满了。腾出空间来领奖励。"

msgid "ah, she must have liked <selfname>. Instead of [Ascend Scroll] she wants to follow you around. I know it could be annoying but could you please allow her?"
msgstr "啊，她一定是喜欢上<selfname>了。她不要[Ascend Scroll]，反倒想跟着你。我知道这可能挺烦人，可你能允许她吗？"

msgid "Where is my lunch box?"
msgstr "我的饭盒呢？"

msgid "Man.. I can't think of anything¡¦"
msgstr "唉……我什么都想不出来……"

msgid "who? Who again? Why are you calling someone who's having a hard time?!"
msgstr "谁？又是谁？你为什么要来找一个正发愁的人？！"

msgid "Friend? Ah, the friend in the training. That friend wanted to deliver [Training Journal]?"
msgstr "朋友？啊，训练那边的朋友。那个朋友想让我转交[Training Journal]？"

msgid "Ok. He's doing great.I'm shame at myself.  Now I will work more harder."
msgstr "好。他做得很棒。我真惭愧。现在我会更加努力。"

msgid "I want a replay. I give you disguise of guardian, it is not that outstanding ability but still useful . You can use it when you want."
msgstr "我想要重来一次。我给你守护者伪装，能力不算出众但还是有用。你想用的时候就可以用。"

msgid "So, where is the [Training Journal]?"
msgstr "那么，[Training Journal]在哪儿？"

msgid "Hello. [Sailor] Jorgu. There's the [Knight Online Anniversary] Event."
msgstr "你好。我是[Sailor]Jorgu。现在有[Knight Online周年]活动。"

msgid "You have selected to participate in the event. You can participate in Ardream, Ronarkland areas."
msgstr "你已选择参加活动。你可以在阿德雷姆、罗纳克之地区域参加。"

msgid "Knight Online Anniversary Event"
msgstr "骑士OL周年活动"

msgid "You have accumulated enough coins! The more you have the more chance to win!"
msgstr "你已经攒够硬币了！你拥有得越多，中奖概率就越大！"

msgid "It seems you don't have any suitable coins. Come on, go collect more coins."
msgstr "你好像没有合适的硬币。来吧，去收集更多硬币。"

msgid "With the two coins you can get the item. Not sure what you'll get but some are really valuable."
msgstr "两枚硬币就能换一件道具。不确定你会得到什么，但有些真的很值钱。"

msgid "I hope you got the item you wanted. Come back next time."
msgstr "希望你得到了想要的道具。下次再来。"

msgid "It seems you don't have enough inventory. Make enough space and come back."
msgstr "你好像背包不够。腾出足够空间再来。"

msgid "Items paid will be paid after the end of the days events from July 16 to July 30"
msgstr "7月16日至7月30日活动结束后，将发放已支付的道具"

msgid "Use 10 coins to receive the item."
msgstr "用10枚硬币领取道具。"

msgid "You want to participate this event."
msgstr "你想参加这次活动。"

msgid "So, now I'm 7 years old. It's my birthday today. But my brother has gone to get training and my parents just bought a stupid present. I want to receive something special and unique."
msgstr "那，我现在7岁了。今天是我生日。可我哥哥去训练了，爸妈就买了个蠢礼物。我想收到特别、独一无二的东西。"

msgid "Really? Wow. Well I like the present but.. I have another problem."
msgstr "真的？哇。嗯，我喜欢这个礼物，可是……我还有个问题。"

msgid "Don't think I'm childish. Do you like bullying me like this??!"
msgstr "别以为我幼稚。你就喜欢这样欺负我是吗？？！"

msgid "[Anniversary Event] Free Buff during the event"
msgstr "[周年活动]活动期间免费增益"

msgid "[You received buff]"
msgstr "[你已获得增益]"

msgid "[You already received another buff]"
msgstr "[你已经获得过另一个增益]"

msgid "Hi! I'm glad to see you. We are rewarding the ones who participated in the [Karus] battle and received [Chaos spirit]."
msgstr "嗨！见到你真高兴。我们正在奖励那些参加[卡鲁斯]战斗并获得[混沌之灵]的人。"

msgid "If it's possible, get the [Chaos Spirit] and come back."
msgstr "如果可以，去拿到[混沌之灵]再回来。"

msgid "You don't have the item. Participate in the [Karus] battle."
msgstr "你没有该道具。请参加[卡鲁斯]战斗。"

msgid "Participate in [World Championship] and receive [Hero Wings Exchange Coupon]"
msgstr "参加[World Championship]并领取[Hero Wings Exchange Coupon]"

msgid "Thank you. Because of you, we were able to win."
msgstr "谢谢。多亏了你，我们才能获胜。"

msgid "Event about [Attendance Event]"
msgstr "关于[签到活动]的活动"

msgid "Thanksgiving Event"
msgstr "感恩节活动"

msgid "I said [10 Chestnut]. Do you need a drink to hear me right, or something?"
msgstr "我说的是[10个栗子]。你是不是得喝点东西才能听清我说话？"

msgid "Good you got it! Now, select the buff you want. I'll get the buff you want."
msgstr "很好，你拿到了！现在，选择你想要的增益。我会给你想要的增益。"

msgid "You already have the buff. Don't be so greedy now."
