msgstr "给你。我爱这些星星！！"

msgid "Hmmph... I hate this world... who the heck are you? What? Merry Christmas? What does Christmas mean in this crazy world anyway?!"
msgstr "哼……我讨厌这个世界……你到底是谁？什么？圣诞快乐？在这个疯狂的世界里，圣诞节到底有什么意义？！"

msgid "Hmmm... What is this..this looks like a sock.. What? Why are you bothering me? Hmm? You want this? Well this is mine. I will trade with something that is useful to me."
msgstr "嗯……这是什么……看着像只袜子……什么？你为什么来烦我？嗯？你想要这个？这可是我的。我要拿它换件对我有用的东西。"

msgid "I only had one that I gave you. I will let you know if I find another one."
msgstr "我只有一个，已经给你了。要是再找到，我会告诉你。"

msgid "Oh.. You got something great here.. Ten of them.."
msgstr "哦……你这儿有好东西……整整十颗……"

msgid "Here take it. Nothing's free in this damn world."
msgstr "给，拿着。这个破世界里没有免费的东西。"

msgid "Ahhh.. I am alone again this Christmas.. What are you looking at?!"
msgstr "啊……这个圣诞节我又是一个人……你看什么看？！"

msgid "Well.. I actually found this but this is not good enough to give to someone I have crush on.What? You want to trade this with something? Really?"
msgstr "嗯……这其实是我捡到的，但拿去送给我暗恋的人还不够好。什么？你想拿这个换点东西？真的？"

msgid "Oh! You came. I appreciate your kindness. The stocking? I only had one."
msgstr "哦！你来了。谢谢你的好意。那只袜子？我只有一只。"

msgid "oh!! This is .. stars!! Ten!! This will be the best gift ever! Thank you so much!"
msgstr "噢！！这是……星星！！十颗！！这会是有史以来最好的礼物！太感谢了！"

msgid "Take this and hand me the stars!"
msgstr "拿着这个，把星星给我！"

msgid "Life is full of new adventures! Huh? Did you say Merry Christmas?  Christmas? Christmas! I feel the vibe of a new adventure!"
msgstr "生活充满了新冒险！啊？你说圣诞快乐？圣诞节？圣诞节！我感到了新冒险的气息！"

msgid "I got this while I was in a new adventure. Where did I get it? I found it at the Moradon Sewer! Ahahahaha!! It was a very dangerous and spectacular place! And this is what I got there!! If you want this, bring me something cool!!"
msgstr "这是我在一次新冒险中得到的。从哪儿弄到的？我在莫拉登下水道找到的！啊哈哈哈！！那是个非常危险又壮观的地方！这就是我在那儿弄到的！！你想要这个的话，就给我带件酷东西来！！"

msgid "Hey!! Didn't we already change what I had with yours?"
msgstr "喂！！我们不是已经把我那东西和你的换过了吗？"

msgid "Ooh! 10 stars which will lead me to new adventures!!"
msgstr "噢！10颗能引我走向新冒险的星星！！"

msgid "Come on! Let's trade!"
msgstr "来吧！我们交换！"

msgid "So noisy. People should not be to relaxed just because it is Christmas.."
msgstr "真吵。大家不该因为是圣诞节就这么放松……"

msgid "This was on the ground when I went to training place early this morning. I thought of decorating the Christmas tree .. but since there's only one.. I didnt. I need something else that can fill the Christmas Tree. Do you have any? If so, I will trade this Sock with them. "
msgstr "今天一早我去训练地时，这东西就在地上。我本想装饰圣诞树……但只有一个……我就没弄。我需要别的东西来填满圣诞树。你有吗？有的话，我就用这只袜子跟你换。"

msgid "My soldiers are very happy as well. Thank you. "
msgstr "我的士兵们也很高兴。谢谢。"

msgid "Oh.. This is very nice. These are enough to decorate the trees. "
msgstr "哦……这太好了。这些足够装饰树了。"

msgid "Wow.. I don't know what to say.. Thank you very much."
msgstr "哇……我都不知道说什么了……非常感谢。"

msgid "This is so crazy. Christmas wont get us anything!"
msgstr "这也太扯了。圣诞节什么也不会给我们！"

msgid "What is this? Is this some useless worthless old sock? Her you there,is? I don't mind as long as anything seems to worth some money. "
msgstr "这是什么？是只没用的破旧袜子吗？东西在你那儿？只要看起来值点钱，我都不介意。"

msgid "You gave me something pricy! Thanks! Ah.. And please don't tell my brother. He might want to take this away from me."
msgstr "你给了我件贵重的东西！谢谢！啊……还有，别告诉我哥哥。他可能想把这从我这儿拿走。"

msgid "Oh cool!!!"
msgstr "哦，酷！！！"

msgid "Come on. Hurry up!"
msgstr "快点。赶紧的！"

msgid "Ahh, it is Christmas... I need to make some money.. "
msgstr "啊，到圣诞节了……我得赚点钱……"

msgid "Do you have some time for me? I got this thing.. And I was wondering if you were looking for this. I would love to trade with something useful if you bring it to me."
msgstr "你有空吗？我弄到了这个东西……我在想你是不是正在找它。如果你把它带给我，我很乐意用件有用的东西跟你换。"

msgid "No more trading today. Please come back later."
msgstr "今天不交易了。请过会儿再来。"

msgid "Let me see.. Oh, you brought valuable things!"
msgstr "我看看……哦，你带来了贵重东西！"

msgid "Lets trade before my Big Bro sees me!"
msgstr "趁我哥没看见，我们赶紧换！"

msgid "Phew.. I always make mistakes everytime I come here... ah.. <selfname>.. What did I do? I always make mistakes!!"
msgstr "唉……我每次来这儿都出错……啊……<selfname>……我都干了什么？我老是出错！！"

msgid "Well.. I lost Christmas Sock which was going to wrap the gift while preparing Christmas. I was really doing great! Can you please find me the Christmas Sock? I lost it somewhere around the Moradon area.. Please help!!"
msgstr "唉……我准备圣诞节时，把要包礼物的圣诞袜子弄丢了。我本来一切都好好的！你能帮我找到那只圣诞袜子吗？我把它丢在莫拉登附近的某个地方了……求求你帮帮我！！"

msgid "Did you find it yet? But don't push too much.. I am worried that <selfname> could get hurt or something."
msgstr "你找到了吗？不过别太勉强……我担心<selfname>会受伤什么的。"

msgid "Wow! You found it! Here's a little gift for you."
msgstr "哇！你找到了！这是给你的一点小礼物。"

msgid "Thank you very much. Have a merry Christmas!!"
msgstr "非常感谢。圣诞快乐！！"

msgid "Christmas bells is ringing all around! This is a happy day! We need to make it happier and we need.... [Shining Star] !! I will give you rewards according to number of [Shining Stars] you bring! | # Reward for 100 Shining Star : Parfait Pet Transform Scroll"
msgstr "圣诞钟声四处回荡！今天是个快乐的日子！我们要让它更快乐，而我们需要……[Shining Star]！！我会根据你带来的[Shining Star]数量给你奖励！| # 100颗Shining Star的奖励：Parfait宠物变身卷轴"

msgid "You have selected [Christmas Buff Item]! If you bring 4 of [Shining Star] then you can choose 1 of [Christmas Buff Item]!"
msgstr "你选择了[Christmas Buff Item]！如果你带来4颗[Shining Star]，就能从[Christmas Buff Item]中选1个！"

msgid "This is what the [Christmas Buff Item] does!|# Reward 4 Shining Star| - EXP Stone : Increase EXP by 10%| - DEF Stone : increase DEF by 25| - HP Stone : increase HP by 250| - Attribute Stone : increase Attribute by 4"
msgstr "这就是[Christmas Buff Item]的效果！|# 奖励4颗Shining Star| - 经验石：经验提升10%| - 防御石：防御提升25| - HP石：HP提升250| - 属性石：属性提升4"

msgid "Waw! You chose the [Christmas Pet Transform Scroll]! You have good eyes! Bring me 100 [Shining Stars] and you can get the[Christmas Pet Transform Scroll] of your choice!"
msgstr "哇！你选了[Christmas Pet Transform Scroll]！你眼光真好！给我带来100颗[Shining Star]，你就能获得你选择的[Christmas Pet Transform Scroll]！"

msgid "[Christmas Pet Transform Scroll] will transform your pet into me [Parfait].. But.. Well you said you like me.. I will follow you.. not because i like <selfname> .. so dont think that I like you or anything!"
msgstr "[Christmas Pet Transform Scroll]会把你的宠物变成我[Parfait]……不过……既然你说你喜欢我……我就跟着你……才不是因为我喜欢<selfname>……所以别以为我喜欢你什么的！"

msgid "Hmm? There's not enough [Shining Stars]. Please check again."
msgstr "嗯？[Shining Star]不够。请再检查一下。"

msgid "You have collected all! Here's the reward!"
msgstr "你都收集齐了！这是奖励！"

msgid "Merry Christmas! Christmas has comeback again this year! Hmm...... however... it really doesn't feel like Christmas at all. What's the problem..? It's snowing outside.. we have the tree with perfect decorations.. what's missing..? Ah! Snowman! We dont have the Snowman!!"
msgstr "圣诞快乐！今年圣诞节又到了！嗯……不过……这完全没有圣诞节的感觉。问题出在哪……？外面在下雪……圣诞树也装饰得漂漂亮亮的……还缺什么……？啊！雪人！我们没有雪人！！"

msgid "Hoho, You need to sacrifice to improve the Christmas atmosphere. Would you go to the town's entrance and make us a Huge Snowman? Make the huge Snowman and bring the Snowman's [Scarf] as a proof."
msgstr "呵呵，你得牺牲一下来烘托圣诞气氛。你愿不愿意去镇门口给我们堆一个大雪人？堆好大雪人，再把雪人的[Scarf]带回来作为证明。"

msgid "Where's the [Scarf]? The [Scarf]? The [Scarf]? Not done yet? Hmm? Hmm?"
msgstr "[Scarf]呢？[Scarf]呢？[Scarf]呢？还没搞定？嗯？嗯？"

msgid "Finally it feels like Christmas! Please hand me the [Scarf]! "
msgstr "终于有圣诞节的感觉了！请把[Scarf]给我！"

msgid "I appreciate your help today. See you tomorrow!"
msgstr "感谢你今天的帮助。明天见！"

msgid "[Christmas Special Free Buff Event]|- Get wanted Buff for Free|- Buff types are ATK, DEF, Stamina increase and you can use more than one at a time. "
msgstr "[圣诞特别免费增益活动]|- 免费领取想要的增益|- 增益类型为攻击、防御、体力提升，可同时使用多个。"

msgid "Buff list for Level.1~34. |-Scream of Assault : ATK 10%|- Firm Will : DEF 100|-Endless Fortitude : Stamina 500"
msgstr "1~34级增益清单。|-Scream of Assault：攻击10%|-Firm Will：防御100|-Endless Fortitude：体力500"

msgid "Buff list for Level.35~60.|-Scream of Assault : ATK 10%|-Undefeated Will : DEF 150|-INfinite Fortitude : Stamina 800"
msgstr "35~60级增益清单。|-Scream of Assault：攻击10%|-Undefeated Will：防御150|-Infinite Fortitude：体力800"

msgid "Buff list for Level.61~83.|-Scream of Assault : ATK 10%|- Invincible Will : DEF 200|-Extreme Fortitude : Stamina 1000"
msgstr "61~83级增益清单。|-Scream of Assault：攻击10%|-Invincible Will：防御200|-Extreme Fortitude：体力1000"

msgid "[Christmas Special Free Buff Event]|- Get 3 types of buffs which will increase ATK, DEF, Stamina for 30 minutes.|- Buffs are different according to levels.|- 3 types of buffs can be used at the same time. You cannot get the same buff while you have the buff on you unless you cancel the buff or time's up."
msgstr "[圣诞特别免费增益活动]|- 领取3种增益，使攻击、防御、体力提升30分钟。|- 增益随等级不同而变化。|- 3种增益可同时使用。身上已有该增益时，除非取消增益或时间到，否则无法再次领取同一增益。"

msgid "Please select one effect.|-Scream of Assault : ATK 10%|-Firm Will : DEF 100|-Endless Fortitude : Stamina 500"
msgstr "请选择一个效果。|-Scream of Assault：攻击10%|-Firm Will：防御100|-Endless Fortitude：体力500"

msgid "You already have a buff. You cannot get the same type. "
msgstr "你已经有一个增益了。你不能领取同类型的。"

msgid "Please select one effect.|-Scream of Assault : ATK 10%|-Undefeated Will : DEF 150|-Infinite Fortitude : Stamina 800"
msgstr "请选择一个效果。|-Scream of Assault：攻击10%|-Undefeated Will：防御150|-Infinite Fortitude：体力800"

msgid "Please select one effect.|-Scream of Assault : ATK 10%|-Invincible Will : DEF 200|-Extreme Fortitude : Stamina 1000"
msgstr "请选择一个效果。|-Scream of Assault：攻击10%|-Invincible Will：防御200|-Extreme Fortitude：体力1000"

msgid "[Sexy Santa] Parfait help you prepare for Christmas"
msgstr "[Sexy Santa]Parfait帮你准备圣诞节"

msgid "Wow! You selected [Snowman Exchange Scroll]! Bring me 10 [Shiny star] to receive [Snowman Exchange Scroll]!"
msgstr "哇！你选择了[Snowman Exchange Scroll]！给我带来10颗[Shiny star]就能领取[Snowman Exchange Scroll]！"

msgid "You will be able to transform into one of my friends [Forum], [teetee], [Teo], or [NuNu]. You can only select one."
msgstr "你将能变成我的朋友中的一个：[Forum]、[teetee]、[Teo]或[NuNu]。你只能选一个。"

msgid "You can't enter if you are not lord of a Castellan clan."
msgstr "如果你不是城主公会的领主，就无法进入。"

msgid "I'm the [Arena Master] in charge of this soccer field. How may I be of service today?"
msgstr "我是负责这片足球场的[Arena Master]。今天有什么能为你效劳？"

msgid "You've come to enter a soccer game. I will transfer you to any team you select. The team can be composed of players from any nation. Please keep in mind that once a team has 11 players, you cannot join that team."
msgstr "你来参加足球赛。我会把你转移到你选择的任何一支队伍。队伍可由来自任何国家的玩家组成。请记住，一旦一支队伍满11人，你就不能加入了。"

msgid "The maximum number of 11 players has been selected for this team. Please select the other team."
msgstr "这支队伍已经满11人。请选择另一支队伍。"

msgid "You've already received a [Soccer Uniform] today. Please come back again tomorrow."
msgstr "你今天已经领取过[Soccer Uniform]了。请明天再来。"

msgid "You need 10 [Goal Pendants]. Please confirm the number of medals in your inventory."
msgstr "你需要10个[Goal Pendants]。请确认你背包里的奖牌数量。"

msgid "You've brought 10 [Goal Pendants]. Would you like to exchange them for a [Soccer Uniform]? Please be aware that once you choose to trade for a soccer uniform, all [Goal Pendants] in your inventory will be collected."
msgstr "你带来了10个[Goal Pendants]。你想用它们兑换[Soccer Uniform]吗？请注意，一旦你选择兑换足球服，你背包里所有的[Goal Pendants]都会被收走。"

msgid "Exchange complete. I hope you score even more goals this time!"
msgstr "兑换完成。希望你这次进更多球！"

msgid "You can't join the selected team. The difference between the two teams is more than two players at this time."
msgstr "你不能加入所选队伍。此刻两队人数差超过两人。"

msgid "Players who purchased the [Minerva Package] will be provided with the [Voucher for a Minerva Helmet] and [Voucher for a Minerva Armor]. Vouchers can be exchanged from [Vendor] Hammers."
msgstr "购买了[Minerva Package]的玩家将获得[Voucher for a Minerva Helmet]和[Voucher for a Minerva Armor]。兑换券可向[Vendor]Hammers兑换。"

msgid "You purchased the [Minerva Package]. Would you like to exchange to [Voucher for a Minerva Helmet] and [Voucher for a Minerva Armor]?"
msgstr "你购买了[Minerva Package]。你想兑换成[Voucher for a Minerva Helmet]和[Voucher for a Minerva Armor]吗？"

msgid "You don not have the [Minerva Package]. Please come back when you have purchased the [Minerva Package]."
msgstr "你没有[Minerva Package]。请购买[Minerva Package]后再来。"

msgid "Players who purchased the [Pathos Glove Package] will be provided with 2EA [Voucher for a Pathos Glove]. Vouchers can be exchanged from [Vendor] Kayra."
msgstr "购买了[Pathos Glove Package]的玩家将获得2张[Voucher for a Pathos Glove]。兑换券可向[Vendor]Kayra兑换。"

msgid "You purchased the [Pathos Glove Package]. Would you like to exchange to 2EA of [Voucher for a Pathos Glove]?"
msgstr "你购买了[Pathos Glove Package]。你想兑换成2张[Voucher for a Pathos Glove]吗？"

msgid "You don't have the [Pathos Glove Package]. Please come back when you have purchased the [Pathos Glove Package]."
msgstr "你没有[Pathos Glove Package]。请购买[Pathos Glove Package]后再来。"

msgid "You're not on a team. Only players that are registered for the game may announce the start of the game."
msgstr "你不在队伍里。只有已报名比赛的玩家才能宣布比赛开始。"

msgid "We do not have an even number of players. Please try again when we have the same number of players on each team."
msgstr "我们的玩家数不是偶数。等两队人数相同时再试。"

msgid "The game has begun. Please try again after the current game has finished."
msgstr "比赛已经开始。请在当前比赛结束后再试。"

msgid "Please deliver [Kimchi Dumpling]'s ingredients [Snow Cabbage] and [Daikon] to [Royal Chef] Yancook."
msgstr "请把[Kimchi Dumpling]的食材[Snow Cabbage]和[Daikon]送给[Royal Chef]Yancook。"

msgid "Please deliver [Gift from Homeland] acquired from [Beef Administrator] Roast from [Beef Roast]."
msgstr "请把从[Beef Administrator]Roast处的[Beef Roast]获得的[Gift from Homeland]送去。"

msgid "Please deliver [Fortune Bag] rewarded from [Spinning the Top] to [Royal Chef] Yancook."
msgstr "请把[Spinning the Top]奖励的[Fortune Bag]送给[Royal Chef]Yancook。"

msgid "Please deliver [Kimchi Dumpling] to [Beef Administrator] Roast."
msgstr "请把[Kimchi Dumpling]送给[Beef Administrator]Roast。"

msgid "Disguise as [Valen attempting to confess her love] and deliver [Chocolate] to [Her unrequited love]. |¡Ø Thisquest can only be completed once each day. |¡Ø This item has a time limit of one hour. The quest must be completed within the hour."
msgstr "伪装成[Valen attempt to confess her love]，把[Chocolate]送给[Her unrequited love]。|※ 本任务每天只能完成一次。|※ 本道具限时一小时。必须在一小时内完成任务。"

msgid "Whew, it's always busy around New Years. I wish someone would help me."
msgstr "唉，一到新年就忙个不停。真希望有人能帮帮我。"

msgid "     [New Year Event Information]|- Following event will continue from February 11 to February 25. |- Following quest is a [Repeatable] quest. However, upon the request to exchange, all [Snow Cabbage] and [Daikon] in your inventory will be [Collected] regardless of their numbers. |- Please refer to our online website for other information regarding miscellaneous events."
msgstr "[新年活动信息]|- 以下活动于2月11日至2月25日持续。|- 以下任务为[可重复]任务。但在兑换请求时，无论数量多少，你背包中所有[Snow Cabbage]和[Daikon]都会被[收走]。|- 其他杂项活动信息请查阅我们的官网。"

msgid "What's that? You want to help? Good thing, too, cause I'm swamped here. I'm short on ingredients for Kimchi Dumpling. I need 10 [Snow Cabbage] and 10 [Daikon]. Would you mind using your Mattock to grab [Snow Cabbage] and [Daikon] around the [Mining Area] that's nearby?"
msgstr "什么？你想帮忙？太好了，我这儿都忙不过来了。我做Kimchi Dumpling的食材不够了。我需要10个[Snow Cabbage]和10个[Daikon]。你能不能用你的锄头去附近[Mining Area]挖些[Snow Cabbage]和[Daikon]来？"

msgid "Still not done? I can't make [Kimchi Dumpling] without [Snow Cabbage] and [Daikon]!"
msgstr "还没好吗？没有[Snow Cabbage]和[Daikon]我做不了[Kimchi Dumpling]！"

msgid "Oh! You brought it. Just in time. Well, hand 'em over. I'm running low on ingredients! As a token of appreciation, I'll give you a Kimchi Dumpling!|¡Ø Upon completion of the current quest, all [Snow Cabbage] and [Daikon] will be collected in your inventory."
msgstr "哦！你带来了。正好赶上。来，给我吧。我食材快用完了！作为谢礼，我给你一个Kimchi Dumpling！|※ 当前任务完成后，你背包中所有[Snow Cabbage]和[Daikon]都会被收走。"

msgid "I'm running low on ingredients, so I'll take all you've got! Thanks for your trouble!"
msgstr "我食材快用完了，你给的我都收下了！辛苦你了！"

msgid "You brought [Gift from Homeland]? So where is it?"
msgstr "你带来了[Gift from Homeland]？那东西在哪儿？"

msgid "Oh, will you exchange it for an item?"
msgstr "哦，你想把它换成道具？"

msgid "You brought [Fortune Bag]? So where is it? If you're messing with me, you won't get a fortune!"
msgstr "你带来了[Fortune Bag]？那东西在哪儿？你要是耍我，就别想拿到运势！"

msgid "Greetings. I'm [Chalet Keeper] Beef. If you bring me 20 [Kimchi Dumpling], as a reward for helping [Royal Chef] Yancook I'll send you to [Beef Roast] in return. |¡Ø Even if you enter [Beef Roast], [Kimchi Dumpling] won't be taken from your inventory."
msgstr "你好。我是[Chalet Keeper]Beef。如果你给我带来20个[Kimchi Dumpling]作为帮助[Royal Chef]Yancook的谢礼，我就送你去[Beef Roast]。|※ 即使你进入[Beef Roast]，[Kimchi Dumpling]也不会从你背包中被收走。"

msgid "Upon your entrance, please deliver 20 [Kimchi Dumpling] to [Beef Administrator] Roast somewhere in [Beef Roast]. It's a special request from [Beef Administrator] Roast. Well, then! Would you like to proceed to [Beef Roast]?"
msgstr "进入后，请在[Beef Roast]某处把20个[Kimchi Dumpling]交给[Beef Administrator]Roast。这是[Beef Administrator]Roast的特别请求。那么！你要前往[Beef Roast]吗？"

msgid "You don't have enough [Kimchi Dumpling] on you. To enter, please acquire 20 [Kimchi Dumpling] from [Royal Chef] Yancook by seeing to his needs."
msgstr "你身上的[Kimchi Dumpling]不够。要进入，请去满足[Royal Chef]Yancook的需求，从他那里获得20个[Kimchi Dumpling]。"

msgid "Happy New Year. It's not every day that I see a visitor around here. So what brings you here today?"
msgstr "新年快乐。难得在这一带见到访客。今天是什么风把你吹来了？"

msgid "I've already received [Kimchi Dumpling] today. Please come back again tomorrow."
msgstr "我今天已经收过[Kimchi Dumpling]了。请明天再来。"

msgid "Are you telling me that you brought [Kimchi Dumpling] as a favor to [Chalet Keeper] Beef?"
msgstr "你是说你替[Chalet Keeper]Beef把[Kimchi Dumpling]带来了？"

msgid "That's great! It just so happens I'm in need of [Kimchi Dumpling]. Could I have them right now?"
msgstr "那太好了！我正好需要[Kimchi Dumpling]。能现在给我吗？"

msgid "Hmm. You don't have enough [Kimchi Dumpling]. Please come back after you have collected 20 of them."
msgstr "嗯。你的[Kimchi Dumpling]不够。请集齐20个后再来。"

msgid "You have exactly 20 [Kimchi Dumpling] on you. As a token of my gratitude, I'll give you [Gift from Homeland]. Would you like to make an exchange?"
msgstr "你身上正好有20个[Kimchi Dumpling]。作为谢礼，我给你[Gift from Homeland]。你要兑换吗？"

msgid "Sigh¡¦  Why a sigh? Actually for this Valentine's day, I want to propose to [That person]. But this time it's overlapping with the new years so I have to help out at home running errands. I hope someone can help me here¡¦"
msgstr "唉……为什么叹气？其实这个情人节，我想向[那个人]表白。可这次正好赶在新年，我得在家帮忙跑腿。真希望有人能帮帮我……"

msgid "[Valentine's Day Event Information]|- Event Duration: February 11, 2010 - February 25, 2010|- Following event's item [Chocolate of Love] must be delivered within an hour or else it will melt away.|- The chat function will be disabled upon the receipt of [Chocolate of Love].|- The designated person you have to deliver [Chocolate of Love] to changes every hour."
msgstr "[情人节活动信息]|- 活动时间：2010年2月11日 - 2010年2月25日|- 以下活动的道具[Chocolate of Love]必须在一小时内送达，否则会融化。|- 领取[Chocolate of Love]后聊天功能将被禁用。|- 你必须把[Chocolate of Love]送达的指定人物每小时变化一次。"

msgid "I appreciate your help. Thanks to you, I got to profess my love!"
msgstr "谢谢你的帮助。多亏了你，我才得以表白！"

msgid "[Chocolate of Love] has melted!? What a shame. Even so, I made quite a few, so I'll give you another one. Please do not fail this time."
msgstr "[Chocolate of Love]融化了！？真可惜。不过我做了不少，再给你一个。这次别再搞砸了。"

msgid "Why does [Valentine's Day] have to overlap with [New Year]? I'm so busy helping my father out with chores at home, I don't even have enough time to deliver my chocolate."
msgstr "为什么[情人节]非得和[新年]撞在一起？我在家帮父亲忙家务都忙死了，连送巧克力的时间都不够。"

msgid "Please help me. I'll transform you into me, so please deliver this chocolate to [That Person]. Oh yeah, I can't change your voice. Don't say anything, whatever you do!"
msgstr "请帮帮我。我会把你变成我的样子，请把这盒巧克力送给[那个人]。对了，我没法改变你的声音。无论如何，千万别说话！"

msgid "You still didn't deliver it? Please deliver the chocolate before it melts."
msgstr "你还没送去？趁巧克力没融化，赶紧送去。"

msgid "Did you deliver it? Oh, is this his reply!? Thank you! Thank you!"
msgstr "你送到了？哦，这是他的回复！？谢谢！谢谢！"

msgid "Yes? Is there something you need from me?"
msgstr "嗯？你有什么需要我帮忙的吗？"

msgid "I think you've got the wrong person. A lot of people look like me, so you should look again."
msgstr "我想你认错人了。很多人长得像我，你再看看。"

msgid "Your bag is full and I can't give you the reply. Please secure a free space in your inventory."
msgstr "你背包满了，我没法把回复给你。请在背包里腾出空位。"

msgid "Oh my! A chocolate? This is totally unexpected! Thank you. Here's my reply. Please take it"
msgstr "哎呀！巧克力？这真没想到！谢谢。这是我的回复。请收下"

msgid "Where's this chocolate you mentioned? You pulling my leg?"
msgstr "你说的巧克力在哪儿？你在耍我吗？"

msgid "Fight on, Korea! Greetings! I'm [Victory] who ran here in hopes of a victory in [Vancouver Olympics]! I'm giving away free buffs as symbols of victory for the Korean competitors in [Vancouver Olympics]."
msgstr "加油，韩国！你好！我是[Victory]，为了[温哥华冬奥会]的胜利一路跑来！我正在免费发放增益，作为[温哥华冬奥会]韩国选手的胜利象征。"

msgid "Duration: February 11, 2010 to February 25, 2010! During that time, I will offer free buffs regardless of level! Be sure to get as many as you need and please cheer on the Korean competitors! I apologize in advance that the buffs will vary depending upon the level of the requester."
msgstr "活动时间：2010年2月11日至2010年2月25日！在此期间，我会不分等级免费提供增益！请尽情领取你需要的，并为韩国选手加油！抱歉提前说明，增益会根据请求者的等级而有所不同。"

msgid "You already have a buff of the same kind! Try again next time!"
msgstr "你已经有同类增益了！下次再来吧！"

msgid "From February 11, 2010 to February 25, 2010, you can receive free buffs from [Vancouver Olympics] Victory at Moradon. We are off to a long-awaited vacation. Happy New Year!"
msgstr "2010年2月11日至2010年2月25日，你可以在莫拉登从[温哥华冬奥会]Victory处领取免费增益。我们要去盼望已久的假期了。新年快乐！"

msgid "Would you like to leave Beef Roast?"
msgstr "你想离开Beef Roast吗？"

msgid "You are unable to transform into me at the moment. Please be sure that you did not assume another transformation or that you are not under the influence of another buff."
msgstr "你目前无法变身成我。请确认你没有处于其他变身状态，或没有受到其他增益影响。"

msgid "    Please note the following when commencing event quests|- You cannot begin a quest on the same day that you completed a task the previous week. |- Make certain you complete the task begun on the same day of the previous week before beginning another.|- e.g.)  If you began a task on Monday of the first week, you must complete it by the Monday of the second week before beginning another."
msgstr "    开始活动任务时请注意以下事项|- 你不能在某一天开始任务，若你上周同一天完成过任务。|- 在开始新任务前，务必先完成上周同一天开始的任务。|- 例：如果你第一周的周一开始了一个任务，你必须在第二周的周一前完成它，才能开始新任务。"

msgid "We need to collect [Bloated Fish] and [Mackeral] as [Captain] Icap wishes. |¡Ø[Fishing] is near the each nation's base castle's camp (Laon/Dona). |¡Ø When the quest is completed, these items will be turned in."
msgstr "我们需要按[Captain]Icap的要求收集[Bloated Fish]和[Mackeral]。|※[Fishing]在各国主城营地（Laon/Dona）附近。|※ 任务完成时，这些道具将被上交。"

msgid "¡Ø This quest | [Jade Solo 30 years to bring the candy ingredients to receive a basket of candy to give to his girl must be passed as a daily quest once a day can be done. Takes a one-hour time limit * item must be performed within 1 hour quest."
msgstr "※ 本任务|[Jade Solo]需用30年把糖果食材带给心爱的女孩、换一篮糖果，作为每日任务每天可完成一次。限时一小时，*道具必须在1小时内完成任务。"

msgid "What? [Candy Ingredient]? Sorry I don't think I can do it. For now I have lost all the [Candy Ingrediant] into the water."
msgstr "什么？[Candy Ingredient]？抱歉，我想我办不到。我把所有[Candy Ingrediant]都掉进水里了。"

msgid "Do you want to know what happened? Okay, I¡¯ll tell you. I was transporting massive [Candy Ingredients] for this White Day. Then, suddenly, a school of fish in the water made a hole in the bottom of my ship and swallowed all the [Candy Ingredients]! I think the sweet smell has seduced them. Can you catch 20 [Fat-bellied fishes], because they swallowed all of my candy ingredients, and bring them to me? I can¡¯t go by myself because I need to fix the ship . . . Oh, can you please catch 20 [Mackerels], too? I think I¡¯ll get hungry after I fix my boat. You can purchase the fishing pole at the [Sundries Store] for fishing. Fishing places are located at near the camps (Laon, Dona) of the main castle in each country."
msgstr "你想知道发生了什么？好，我告诉你。我正为这个白色情人节运送大批[Candy Ingredients]。突然，水里的一群鱼在我船底咬了个洞，把所有[Candy Ingredients]都吞了！我想是那甜味把它们勾来了。你能捕20条[Fat-bellied fishes]带来给我吗，因为它们吞了我所有的糖果食材？我得修船，没法自己去……哦，你能不能也捕20条[Mackerels]？我想修完船会饿。你可以在[Sundries Store]买鱼竿钓鱼。钓鱼地点在各国主城附近的营地（Laon、Dona）。"

msgid "Still no? You need to catch [Bloated Fish] and [Mackerel]. "
msgstr "还没好？你得捕[Bloated Fish]和[Mackerel]。"

msgid "Finally! Sneaky Fish! I'm going to cut your stomach to find the ingredients. |¡Ø Once the quest gets completed [Bloated Fish] and [Mackerel] will be turned in."
msgstr "终于！鬼鬼祟祟的鱼！我要剖开你们的肚子找食材。|※ 任务完成后，[Bloated Fish]和[Mackerel]将被上交。"

msgid "I'll take all of these! See you again!"
msgstr "这些我都收下！回头见！"

msgid "What are you looking for? You have something for me?"
msgstr "你在找什么？你有东西要给我？"

msgid "I think you are thinking of me as someone else. People say I look a like with many other people. "
msgstr "我想你把我当成别人了。人们说我和很多人长得像。"

