msgstr "你背包空间不够，我没法给你回复。确认空间足够后再来。"

msgid "He wanted this delivered? He's not brave! Coward! I'll reply so please deliver it."
msgstr "他想让我把这个送过去？他真没种！懦夫！我会回复的，请你转交。"

msgid "Where's the candy basket?"
msgstr "糖果篮子在哪儿？"

msgid "Sigh¡¦ I don't want to be single anymore."
msgstr "唉……我不想再单身了。"

msgid "White Day Event Information."
msgstr "白色情人节活动信息。"

msgid "¡¦  for 31 years I've been single¡¦ 31 years¡¦  I should have shown her my braveside¡¦  "
msgstr "……我单身了31年……31年……我早该向她展现我勇敢的一面……"

