msgstr "为[Forest Guard]Dry收集[Small Sprout]，可获得以下之一：[EXP Scroll]、[Contribution Scroll]、[Life Scroll]、[Defense Scroll]。"

msgid "Bring the [Leaf of Disguise] to [Forest Guard] Dry and receive [Tree Transformation Hat]"
msgstr "把[Leaf of Disguise]带给[Forest Guard]Dry，领取[Tree Transformation Hat]"

msgid "You must go to [Life Guardian] Naia with [Tree Seedlings of Life] after planting [Seed of Life] in the [Gigantic heap of Earth] in the middle of Arrdream, Ronark Land and stronghold of Ronark Land.|¡Ø You can receive [Seed of Life] from [Angry Spirit of Tree], which is summoned rarely from [Heap of Earth with good quality] or [Loggers] dispatched to Arrdream, Ronark Land and the stronghold of Ronark Land. "
msgstr "你必须带着[Tree Seedlings of Life]去找[Life Guardian]Naia，此前要在阿德雷姆、罗纳克之地及罗纳克之地据点中央的[Gigantic heap of Earth]种下[Seed of Life]。|※ 你可从[Angry Spirit of Tree]获得[Seed of Life]，该精灵由派往阿德雷姆、罗纳克之地及罗纳克之地据点的[Heap of Earth with good quality]或[Loggers]稀有召唤。"

msgid "Go visit [Forest Guard] Dry with [Seed] which you can obtain from many monsters and [Fertilizer] from the merchant. |¡Ø This quest is a [chain quest].You will need to complete the whole quest to receive [Shiny Tree Soul]"
msgstr "带着可从众多怪物获得的[Seed]和从商人处获得的[Fertilizer]去拜访[Forest Guard]Dry。|※ 本任务为[连锁任务]。你需要完成整个任务才能获得[Shiny Tree Soul]"

