msgstr "你需要把[Small Sprout]带给[Forest Guard]Dry。[Small Sprout]可通过给予[Good Quality Heap of Earth]、一些[Seed]和[Fertilizer]获得。"

msgid "[Forest Guard] Dry asks for the peace of the [Mad Tree Soul]. |¡Ø This quest is a [chain quest].You will need to complete the whole quest to receive [Shiny Tree Soul]"
msgstr "[Forest Guard]Dry请求为[Mad Tree Soul]求得安宁。|※ 本任务为[连锁任务]。你需要完成整个任务才能获得[Shiny Tree Soul]"

msgid "Please deliver [Branch of the Life Tree] which can be obtained from [Good quality heap of earth] to [Forest Guard] Dry.|¡Ø This quest is a [chain quest].You will need to complete the whole quest to receive [Shiny Tree Soul]"
msgstr "请把可从[Good quality heap of earth]获得的[Branch of the Life Tree]送给[Forest Guard]Dry。|※ 本任务为[连锁任务]。你需要完成整个任务才能获得[Shiny Tree Soul]"

msgid "Please deliver [Leaf of Life] which you can obtain by completing the quest [New Life for the Pioneer Area] to [Forest Guard] Dry. |¡Ø This quest is a [chain quest].You will need to complete the whole quest to receive [Shiny Tree Soul]"
msgstr "请把通过完成任务[New Life for the Pioneer Area]获得的[Leaf of Life]送给[Forest Guard]Dry。|※ 本任务为[连锁任务]。你需要完成整个任务才能获得[Shiny Tree Soul]"

