msgid "You must bring [Branch of Life], which you can obtain from [Heap of Earth with good quality], and [Leaf of Life], which you can obtain after you complete the quest [New Life in the Frontier Zone], to [Life Guardian] Naia.|¡Ø This quest is [Repeatable Quest]. If you complete the quest [Forest Guardian], you can perform this quest once a day."
msgstr "你必须把可从[Heap of Earth with good quality]获得的[Branch of Life]，以及完成任务[New Life in the Frontier Zone]后可获得的[Leaf of Life]带给[Life Guardian]Naia。|※ 本任务为[可重复任务]。若你完成任务[Forest Guardian]，可每天完成一次本任务。"

msgid "Planting Tree Event Description"
msgstr "植树活动说明"

msgid "Today's sky seems so blue. Hello. I'm Dry who's been summoned by the [Forest Guard]."
msgstr "今天的天空好蓝。你好。我是受[Forest Guard]召唤而来的Dry。"

