msgstr "我们正在收集[Small Sprout]以拯救树木。"

msgid "Please bring me [Small Sprout] then you'll be able to select one of the following. Would you help me?"
msgstr "请把[Small Sprout]带给我，然后你就能从以下选一个。你愿意帮我吗？"

msgid "Hm.. You'll need some more. "
msgstr "嗯……你还需要多一些。"

msgid "Good job! You are done!"
msgstr "干得好！你完成了！"

msgid "I'll keep asking you for this. Until Adonis continent becomes all green!"
msgstr "我会一直请你帮忙。直到阿多尼斯大陆披上满园翠绿！"

msgid "Oh no¡¦  No matter how hard I try to plant the seed because of [Lumberjack]s I'm not able to speed up."
msgstr "哦不……无论我多努力播种，因为[Lumberjack]们，我都没法加快速度。"

msgid "To trade these [Lumberjack] I'm collecting [Leaf of Disguise] to make [Tree Transformation Hat]. Could you please bring me [Transformation Leaves] then I'll give you [Tree Transformation Hat]."
msgstr "为了对付这些[Lumberjack]，我正在收集[Leaf of Disguise]来制作[Tree Transformation Hat]。你能把[Transformation Leaves]带给我吗，我就给你[Tree Transformation Hat]。"

msgid "Will you help me? | >> This quest can be done only once."
msgstr "你愿意帮我吗？| >> 本任务只能完成一次。"

msgid "For the goal of making this continent green again, [Forest Guardian] has summoned me and [Guard of Life] Naiya."
msgstr "为了让这片大陆重披翠绿，[Forest Guardian]召唤了我和[Guard of Life]Naiya。"

msgid "We are trying our best to collect [Small Sprouts]. But we don't seem to have enough. This means you'll need to help me!"
msgstr "我们正尽力收集[Small Sprouts]。但好像还不够。这就意味着你得帮我！"

msgid "Please go ahead and bring me [Seed] and [Fertilizer]. I'll be waiting for you. |¡Ø This quest is a [chain quest].You will need to complete the whole quest to receive [Shiny Tree Soul]"
msgstr "请去把[Seed]和[Fertilizer]带给我。我会等你。|※ 本任务为[连锁任务]。你需要完成整个任务才能获得[Shiny Tree Soul]"

msgid "Next, I need [Small Sprout]. What does it mean? Please go ahead and come back with it again."
msgstr "接下来，我需要[Small Sprout]。这是什么意思？请去把它再带来。"

msgid "Thank you. With the [Seed] and [Fertilizers] you have brought to us, we were able to start on this. We have another favor to ask you now."
msgstr "谢谢。有了你带给我们的[Seed]和[Fertilizers]，我们得以开工。现在我们还有一件事要拜托你。"

msgid "This time we'll need [Small Sprout]. We have as much as possible, but it'll be great if you can contribute."
msgstr "这次我们需要[Small Sprout]。我们已经尽量收集了，但你要是能贡献就再好不过。"

msgid "What am I saying? I'm saying that you should hurry up to help us."
msgstr "我在说什么？我是说你快点来帮我们。"

msgid "Because of the ruined environment [Mad Tree Souls] are attacking human. They became really upset. Could you please calm them out? Please?"
msgstr "因为环境被毁，[Mad Tree Souls]正在攻击人类。它们变得非常愤怒。你能让它们平静下来吗？求你了？"

msgid "Trees are disappearing from Adonis Land and the guardians protecting the tree souls are disappearing as well."
msgstr "阿多尼斯大陆的树木正在消失，守护树魂的守护者也在消失。"

msgid "Their hatred has been intensified. It's so sad..  Because of the greed humans have, pure souls are invaded by the darkness."
msgstr "它们的仇恨愈发强烈。真让人难过……因为人类的贪婪，纯洁的灵魂被黑暗侵蚀。"

msgid "Could you please help them to calm down?"
msgstr "你能帮它们平静下来吗？"

msgid "It seems that the spirits have been calmed down. Now we can restore their souls into pure ones. Please bring [Branch of the life]. With this, we'll be able to wake them up."
msgstr "看来精灵们已经平静下来了。现在我们可以把它们的灵魂恢复成纯洁的样子。请把[Branch of the life]带来。有了它，我们就能唤醒它们。"

msgid "Thank you. [Mad Tree Spirit] have been restored back to the nature."
msgstr "谢谢。[Mad Tree Spirit]已回归自然。"

msgid "Now we need to make sure that this forest grows by waking the restored spirits up."
msgstr "现在我们需要通过唤醒恢复后的精灵，确保这片森林生长起来。"

msgid "Please bring [Branch of Life]. With this we will be able to wake them up."
msgstr "请把[Branch of Life]带来。有了它我们就能唤醒它们。"

msgid "They¡¯ll wake up soon! I can feel that the energy of the spirit is getting full! Now it¡¯s time to help those spirits in earnest. Recover [Seed of Life] from [Loggers] and plant it in the [Gigantic heap of Earth] in Arrdream, Ronark Land, and the Stronghold of Ronark Land. Then, get the [Tree Seedlings of Life] sprouted from the [Gigantic heap of Earth] and bring it to [Guardian of Life] Naia. Don¡¯t forget that you have to bring [Leaf of Life] to me. "
msgstr "它们很快就会醒来！我能感觉到精灵的能量正在充盈！现在是真正帮助这些精灵的时候了。从[Loggers]那里夺回[Seed of Life]，种在阿德雷姆、罗纳克之地和罗纳克之地据点的[Gigantic heap of Earth]里。然后，取回从[Gigantic heap of Earth]里萌发的[Tree Seedlings of Life]，带给[Guardian of Life]Naia。别忘了你还得把[Leaf of Life]带给我。"

msgid "Spirits are feeling that their energy is getting filled!"
msgstr "精灵们感觉到自己的能量正在充盈！"

msgid "Now it's our time to help them. We should do our best. Of course with you <selfname>."
msgstr "现在轮到我们帮助它们了。我们应该全力以赴。当然，是和你一起，<selfname>。"

msgid "First, you have to help [Guardian of Life] Naia by getting the [Seed of Life] back from the [Loggers] who has taken them away from us. Then, go to Arrdream, Ronark Land, the Stronghold of Ronark Land, and plant those seeds in the middle of [Gigantic heap of Earth], and then bring [Tree Seedlings of Life]. If you deliver [Tree Seedlings of Life] to [Guardian of Life] Naia, you¡¯ll get [Leaf of Life]. Please bring that [Leaf of Life] to me."
msgstr "首先，你必须帮[Guardian of Life]Naia，从夺走[Seed of Life]的[Loggers]那里夺回它。然后去阿德雷姆、罗纳克之地、罗纳克之地据点，把那些种子种在[Gigantic heap of Earth]中央，再取回[Tree Seedlings of Life]。如果你把[Tree Seedlings of Life]交给[Guardian of Life]Naia，就会获得[Leaf of Life]。请把那[Leaf of Life]带给我。"

msgid "Thank you <selfname>. Due to your effort, this continent will be full of trees again. I¡¯ll appoint you as the [Guardian of Forest] to return your favor! Bring me the [Application of Forest Guardian], which I gave to you before. You don¡¯t understand why you should fill this form? Well, we need to do the paperwork, don¡¯t we?"
msgstr "谢谢你，<selfname>。多亏了你的努力，这片大陆将再次林木成荫。我会任命你为[Guardian of Forest]以回报你！把我之前给你的[Application of Forest Guardian]带给我。你不明白为什么要填这张表？嗯，我们得走程序，不是吗？"

msgid "Because of you, <selfname> this continent will become green again. Thank you for helping."
msgstr "因为你，<selfname>，这片大陆将重披翠绿。谢谢你的帮助。"

msgid "I'll appoint you as a [Forest Guardian]. What's the benefit of being the guardian? You'll find out soon."
msgstr "我会任命你为[Forest Guardian]。成为守护者有什么好处？你很快就会知道。"

msgid "Please bring me [Forest Guardian Registration Form], the one I gave you earlier. I'll need this to make it official."
msgstr "请把我之前给你的[Forest Guardian Registration Form]带给我。我需要这个来正式生效。"

msgid "That's correct. Now, please bring [Sleeping Tree Spirit] to [Life Guardian] Naiya. After that, once a day, sleeping spirit will be woken up."
msgstr "没错。现在，请把[Sleeping Tree Spirit]带给[Life Guardian]Naiya。之后，每天会唤醒一只沉睡的精灵。"

msgid "Hello. I'm [Life Guardian] Naiya. I've been dispatched by [Forest Guard]."
msgstr "你好。我是[Life Guardian]Naiya。我受[Forest Guard]派遣而来。"

msgid "You already finished today. Please come back tomorrow."
msgstr "你今天已经完成了。请明天再来。"

msgid "I'll take all of the [Leaf of Disguise]. We'll need it. "
msgstr "[Leaf of Disguise]我都收下。我们会需要的。"

msgid "The reason I came here is to restore new lives in these Ardream, Ronarkland area. But it seems the place is really big so it's a bit difficult for me to handle it by myself"
msgstr "我来这里的原因，是要在这片阿德雷姆、罗纳克之地恢复新的生机。但这地方看起来实在太大，我一个人有点忙不过来"

msgid "Then regain [Life Seed] from [Lumberjack], go to Ardream, Ronarkland, plant it on [Giant Heap of Earth] and come back to me with [Life Tree Seedling]. Please hurry"
msgstr "那就从[Lumberjack]那里夺回[Life Seed]，去阿德雷姆、罗纳克之地，把它种在[Giant Heap of Earth]上，再带着[Life Tree Seedling]回来找我。请快点"

msgid "You are still not done? It's taking too long. "
msgstr "你还没做完？花太久了。"

msgid "Good job. Well it did take a long time for you to get this done. But anyways, good job."
msgstr "干得好。嗯，你确实花了不少时间才完成。不过总之，干得好。"

msgid "I'll ask you again tomorrow. Please don't runaway but come. We have many trees to plant."
msgstr "我明天再问你。请别跑开，一定要来。我们还有很多树要种。"

msgid "You came to wake sleeping tree spirits. Since you are the [Forest Guardian] you can definitely do this."
msgstr "你来唤醒沉睡的树魂了。既然你是[Forest Guardian]，你一定能做到。"

msgid "In order to wake sleeping Tree Spirit, you'll need [Leaf of Life] and [Branch of Life]. These two will be needed."
msgstr "为了唤醒沉睡的树魂，你需要[Leaf of Life]和[Branch of Life]。这两样都要。"

msgid "These are [Leaf of Life] and [Branches of Life]. You can obtain [Leaf of Life] by completing [New life to the New land] quest. [Branch of Life] can be obtained when you are planting seeds on [Good quality healp of Earth]."
msgstr "这是[Leaf of Life]和[Branches of Life]。你可以通过完成[New life to the New land]任务获得[Leaf of Life]。[Branch of Life]可在[Good quality healp of Earth]上播种时获得。"

msgid "You have brought everything. We should wake up the spirits, now."
msgstr "你把东西都带来了。我们现在该唤醒精灵了。"

msgid "Finally, it's been woken up. This child wants to be with you, <selfname>. Please take a good care of him."
msgstr "终于，它被唤醒了。这个小家伙想跟着你，<selfname>。请好好照顾它。"

msgid "It's the [Sleeping Tree Spirit]¡¦ Then it means that [Forest Observer] has been recognized as [Forest Guard]."
msgstr "这就是[Sleeping Tree Spirit]……那就意味着[Forest Observer]已被认可为[Forest Guard]。"

msgid "Where's the [Sleeping Tree Spirit]? Don't kid around."
msgstr "[Sleeping Tree Spirit]呢？别开玩笑了。"

msgid "Would you like to wake him up now?"
msgstr "你想现在唤醒它吗？"

msgid "[You can see the traces that the seedling has started to grow. We'll need to wait a day to plant it again.]"
msgstr "[你能看到幼苗已开始生长的痕迹。我们需要等一天才能再次播种。]"

msgid "[There is no seed to plant]"
msgstr "[没有种子可种]"

msgid "New Life to the New Land Quest Description"
msgstr "新土地新生任务说明"

msgid "You can trade [Organic Tree Box] with random items."
msgstr "你可以用[Organic Tree Box]兑换随机道具。"

msgid "Complete once a day [New Life to the New Land] quest and receive [Organic Tree Box]. [Organic Tree Box] has random accessories and other items."
msgstr "每天完成一次[New Life to the New Land]任务，领取[Organic Tree Box]。[Organic Tree Box]内有随机饰品和其他道具。"

msgid "Do you have the [Organic Tree Box]? Would you like to trade it?"
msgstr "你有[Organic Tree Box]吗？你想兑换吗？"

msgid "You do not have [Organic Tree Box]. You will need to complete the [New Life to New Land] quest to receive the box."
msgstr "你没有[Organic Tree Box]。你需要完成[New Life to New Land]任务来领取盒子。"

msgid "With [Enemy Invasion Scroll] sneak into the enemy area and find [Carloe]. |¡Ø This quest is only available on Mon/Wed/Fridays."
msgstr "用[Enemy Invasion Scroll]潜入敌方区域，找到[Carloe]。|※ 本任务仅在周一/三/五开放。"

msgid "With [Enemy Invasion Scroll] sneak into the enemy area and find [Enemy Secret Document], the one [Carloe] hid.|¡Ø This quest is available on Tue/Thu/Sat. "
msgstr "用[Enemy Invasion Scroll]潜入敌方区域，找到[Carloe]藏起来的[Enemy Secret Document]。|※ 本任务在周二/四/六开放。"

msgid "Please bring my brother [Carloe] who has left for Ardream, Ronarkland and also bring [Brother's Intelligence Journal]. |¡Ø This quest is only available on Sundays."
msgstr "请把我去了阿德雷姆、罗纳克之地的弟弟[Carloe]带回来，并带上[Brother's Intelligence Journal]。|※ 本任务仅在周日开放。"

msgid "My brother [Carloe] has gone to join the Lunar War. Please bring him by defeating 1 [Enemy User], and bring [Brother War Experience]. |¡Ø This quest is only available on Mondays and Thursdays during the [Lunar War]."
msgstr "我弟弟[Carloe]已去参加月球战争。请击败1名[Enemy User]把他带回来，并带上[Brother War Experience]。|※ 本任务仅在[Lunar War]期间的周一和周四开放。"

msgid "Deliver 5 [Gold Dust] to [Carlos] to receive Event Buff Item. |¡Ø [Gold Dust] can be obtained from [Carlos] and you must have [Magic Ore]."
msgstr "把5个[Gold Dust]交给[Carlos]以领取活动增益道具。|※ [Gold Dust]可从[Carlos]处获得，且你必须持有[Magic Ore]。"

msgid "Description about Month of May Event"
msgstr "五月活动说明"

msgid "Sigh..  Where did he go again? Uh, hello. What do you need?"
msgstr "唉……他又跑哪儿去了？呃，你好。你有什么事？"

msgid "You have already brought my brother's news for today. If this happens again I'll know who to ask."
msgstr "你今天已经带来我弟弟的消息了。下次再出这种事我就知道该找谁了。"

msgid "ah¡¦.   Please help me. My brother has snuck into the Elmorad Area to show off his achievement."
msgstr "啊……请帮帮我。我弟弟为了炫耀功绩，偷偷溜进了艾莫拉德区域。"

msgid "Before something happens we have to find him."
msgstr "在出事之前我们得找到他。"

msgid "This is the [Elmorad Invasion Scroll]. With this you'll be able to go to Elmorad. Please find my brother."
msgstr "这是[Elmorad Invasion Scroll]。有了它你就能去艾莫拉德。请找到我弟弟。"

msgid "You already have the [elmorad Invasion Scroll]. Please find my brother."
msgstr "你已经有[elmorad Invasion Scroll]了。请找到我弟弟。"

msgid "You haven't found him yet. Hope he's ok."
msgstr "你还没找到他。希望他没事。"

msgid "My brother's news? Really?"
msgstr "我弟弟的消息？真的？"

msgid "Ah.. It's good that he's still alive. I feel relieved now. But please bring him home soon."
msgstr "啊……他还活着就好。我现在放心了。但请尽快把他带回家。"

msgid "ah¡¦.   Please help me. My brother has snuck into the Karus Area to show off his achievement."
msgstr "啊……请帮帮我。我弟弟为了炫耀功绩，偷偷溜进了卡鲁斯区域。"

msgid "This is the [Karus Invasion Scroll]. With this you'll be able to go to Karus. Please find my brother."
msgstr "这是[Karus Invasion Scroll]。有了它你就能去卡鲁斯。请找到我弟弟。"

msgid "You already have the [Karus Invasion Scroll]. Please find my brother."
msgstr "你已经有[Karus Invasion Scroll]了。请找到我弟弟。"

msgid "Ah..  It's good that he's still alive. I feel relieved now.But please bring him home soon."
msgstr "啊……他还活着就好。我现在放心了。但请尽快把他带回家。"

msgid "Oh,  you are <selfname>.  Could you help me a moment?"
msgstr "哦，你就是<selfname>。你能帮我一下吗？"

msgid "I have received a letter from my brother who's in the enemy area. He says that he has stolen the secret of the enemy. Could you please find my brother and bring the [Enemy Secret Document]?"
msgstr "我收到了身在敌区的弟弟的来信。他说他偷到了敌方的机密。你能帮我找到我弟弟并把[Enemy Secret Document]带回来吗？"

msgid "Before something happens to him, please find him."
msgstr "在他出事之前，请找到他。"

msgid "This must be the [Enemy Secret Scroll]. Thank you so much."
msgstr "这一定就是[Enemy Secret Scroll]。太感谢你了。"

msgid "I'll deliver this [Enemy Secret Scroll] to [Advisor] Herga."
msgstr "我会把这封[Enemy Secret Scroll]交给[Advisor]Herga。"

msgid "I'll deliver this [Enemy Secret Scroll] to [Advisor] Nez."
msgstr "我会把这封[Enemy Secret Scroll]交给[Advisor]Nez。"

msgid "Ah.. My brother has run away from home again. Could you please bring him home again?"
msgstr "啊……我弟弟又离家出走了。你能再把他带回家吗？"

msgid "This time he's gone to the new land. Find him near Ardream, Ronarkland."
msgstr "这次他去了新土地。在阿德雷姆、罗纳克之地附近找他。"

msgid "You haven't brought him yet? Come on. Please bring him home before anything happens to him."
msgstr "你还没把他带来？快点。请在他出事之前把他带回家。"

msgid "It's finally returned. Hm¡¦  this is¡¦    [Spy Journal]"
msgstr "终于回来了。嗯……这是……[Spy Journal]"

msgid "Thank you. This [Spy Journal] will be delivered to [Advisor] Herga."
msgstr "谢谢。这本[Spy Journal]会交给[Advisor]Herga。"

msgid "Sigh..  My brother has left home again. Why is he so troublesome?"
msgstr "唉……我弟弟又离家了。他怎么这么不让人省心？"

msgid "This time he left home after hearing that the lunar war will happen again."
msgstr "这次他是听说又要打月球战争才离家的。"

msgid "You haven't found my brother yet?"
msgstr "你还没找到我弟弟？"

msgid "Finally you found him. This time I'm gonna show him that he can't keep doing this."
msgstr "你终于找到他了。这次我要让他知道，他不能再这样下去了。"

msgid "Thank you so much."
msgstr "太感谢你了。"

msgid "These days [Gold Dust] is so popular. If you collect [Dust Powder] you'll be rich!"
msgstr "最近[Gold Dust]很抢手。要是你收集[Dust Powder]就能发财！"

msgid "Please collect 5 [Gold Dust]. Then I'll give you reward."
msgstr "请收集5个[Gold Dust]。然后我会给你报酬。"

msgid "It's 5 [Gold Dust]"
msgstr "是5个[Gold Dust]"

msgid "Oh! This must be the [Gold dust]! I'll exchange it for you."
msgstr "哦！这一定就是[Gold dust]！我帮你兑换。"

msgid "Please continue. We would like to collect as much as possible."
msgstr "请继续。我们想尽量多收集。"

msgid "We're refining [Mysterious Ore] or [Mysterious Gold] into [Gold Dust]."
msgstr "我们正在把[Mysterious Ore]或[Mysterious Gold]精炼成[Gold Dust]。"

msgid "You can exchange one at a time."
msgstr "你可以一次兑换一个。"

msgid "You do not have [Mysterious Ore]. [Mysterious Ore] can be obtained by digging."
msgstr "你没有[Mysterious Ore]。[Mysterious Ore]可通过挖掘获得。"

msgid "Please bring [Old Box] then we'll unseal it for you. I'll be the only one who can open since I locked it in the first place."
msgstr "请把[Old Box]带来，我帮你解封。因为当初是我锁上的，只有我能打开。"

msgid "You do not have the box. Please check."
msgstr "你没有盒子。请检查。"

msgid "Would you like to open the box?"
msgstr "你想打开盒子吗？"

msgid "Please bring [Specious Box] then I'll be able to open it for you. I'll be the only one who can open since I'm the one who locked it."
msgstr "请把[Specious Box]带来，我就能帮你打开。因为是我锁上的，只有我能打开。"

msgid "Hey¡¦who are you?"
msgstr "喂……你是谁？"

msgid "My brother sent you to me? Really?"
msgstr "我弟弟派你来的？真的？"

msgid "I'm busy so don't bother me. I'm in a serious mood."
msgstr "我正忙着，别烦我。我心情很严肃。"

msgid "Hm¡¦ But I still can't go back. I haven't done what I came for."
msgstr "嗯……可我还是不能回去。我来这儿要做的事还没做完。"

msgid "Please bring this letter to my brother and tell him that I can't go back."
msgstr "请把这封信带给我弟弟，告诉他我还不能回去。"

msgid "Please deliver this to my brother."
msgstr "请把这个交给我弟弟。"

msgid "hm¡¦  When I was escaping from the enemy zone, I hid the [Enemy Secret Scroll] in the town somewhere. Please find where it is and bring it to my brother. Bring [Pickax] and dig where it is."
msgstr "嗯……我从敌区逃出来时，把[Enemy Secret Scroll]藏在了镇上某处。请找到它的位置并带给我弟弟。带上[Pickax]，在它所在的地方挖。"

msgid "My brother sent you for me? Really?"
msgstr "我弟弟派你来的？真的？"

msgid "Please go tell my brother. Bye"
msgstr "请去告诉我弟弟。再见"

msgid "Uh.. I think I've seen you somewhere. What's going on?"
msgstr "呃……我好像在哪儿见过你。怎么回事？"

msgid "My brother? Man¡¦  "
msgstr "我弟弟？天哪……"

msgid "But I still can't just go. Please help me."
msgstr "可我还是不能就这么走。请帮帮我。"

msgid "We have to defeat at least one enemy."
msgstr "我们必须至少击败一名敌人。"

msgid "We haven't defeated any. Let's do better!"
msgstr "我们还一个都没击败。我们加把劲！"

msgid "It was a good experience. Let's go back to where my brother is."
msgstr "这是一次不错的经历。我们回我弟弟那儿吧。"

msgid "My brother?? Man¡¦"
msgstr "我弟弟？？天哪……"

msgid "I still can't just go. Please help me."
msgstr "我还是不能就这么走。请帮帮我。"

msgid "Ah..  He keeps looking for me. But I haven't done what I came for."
msgstr "啊……他一直在找我。可我来这儿要做的事还没做完。"

msgid "Didn't I say that I'll go back? Stop asking me the same question again."
msgstr "我不是说过我会回去吗？别再问我同一个问题了。"

msgid "I can't be so troublesome anymore. I'll go back now."
msgstr "我不能再这么让人操心了。我现在就回去。"

msgid "I'll follow you behind so please go slow. |¡Ø If you die in the town the Quest gets canceled."
msgstr "我跟在你后面走，请慢一点。|※ 如果你在镇上死亡，任务会取消。"

msgid "Let's go!!"
msgstr "我们走吧！！"

msgid "I'm the person in charge of VIPS. Do you have the promotion coupon?"
msgstr "我是负责VIP的人。你有宣传券吗？"

msgid "You do have the voucher. I've awarded you with the prize. Thank you."
msgstr "你确实有兑换券。我已经把奖品发给你了。谢谢。"

