msgid "Hello. I¡¯m the ¡®Guide¡¯ of [Twilight Guard], Ura, and I¡¯m from the far desert country. I came here to eradicate the force of evil that I have sensed in my country. I¡¯m performing my role as a guide for heroes here, as the great and generous king of Karus promised to support me. <selfname>, I¡¯ve found that you¡¯re one of the great heroes. Will you help us?"
