msgstr "你好？我的朋友。你需要帮助吗？我负责为战争提供资金。诺亚，如有需要我会支持。"

msgid "Do you need NOAH?"
msgstr "你需要诺亚吗？"

msgid "I gave to you money. go to battle zone!"
msgstr "我给你钱了。去战场吧！"

msgid "It's August! Finally it's the Fishing season."
msgstr "八月了！终于到了捕鱼季节。"

msgid "I¡¯ve heard that a rare fish was caught recently.|It¡¯s a golden . . . I can¡¯t remember . . . |Oh yeah! The Gold Fish! Yes, it¡¯s the Gold Fish! |Please bring the Gold Fish to me if you catch it. I can sell them at a high price at the Market in Moradon.||I¡¯ll give you a special reward if you bring lots of [Gold Fishes] to me. Remember! The more, the better. ||Oh, and please bring [Goby] and [Salmon] to me if you catch them, too. If you bring me 10 [Gobies] and 10 [Salmons], I¡¯ll give you [Gem of Abyss] in exchange. |"
msgstr "我听说最近捕到了一条稀有鱼。|是条金色的……我记不得了……|哦对！金鱼！对，就是金鱼！|如果你捕到金鱼，请带给我。我可以在莫拉登的市场高价卖出。||如果你给我带来很多[Gold Fishes]，我会给你特别奖励。记住！越多越好。||哦，另外，如果你也捕到[Goby]和[Salmon]，也带给我。如果你给我带来10条[Goby]和10条[Salmon]，我会给你[Gem of Abyss]作为交换。|"

msgid "Oh, it seems like you've caught something. What did you get?"
msgstr "哦，你好像捕到了什么。你弄到了什么？"

msgid "I don't think you have enough [Muskipper] nor the [Salmon]."
msgstr "我想你的[Muskipper]和[Salmon]都不够。"

msgid "one, two, three, ¡¦ , nine, ten! Yes you do have 10 each."
msgstr "一、二、三……九、十！没错，你每样都有10条。"

msgid "Here you go. You have [Abyss Jewel]. Hopefully you can obtain good items. I'll give you some [worms]."
msgstr "给你。你有[Abyss Jewel]了。希望你能获得好道具。我给你一些[worms]。"

msgid "oh! You really caught [Gold Fish]! Show me, show me!"
msgstr "哦！你真捕到[Gold Fish]了！给我看看，给我看看！"

msgid "Hey..  You don't want to give it to me now? Didn't I say that I'll give you a reward? Think about it. If you give me lots of [Gold Fish] the top 2 people who give me the most fish will get [Master Wings]. "
msgstr "喂……你现在不想给我？我不是说过会给你奖励吗？你想想。如果你给我很多[Gold Fish]，给我鱼最多的前两名会获得[Master Wings]。"

msgid "Even if you don't have many, give me. You'll be rewarded. I'll give you some [worm]."
msgstr "即使你没多少，也给我。你会得到奖励的。我给你一些[worm]。"

msgid "Are you kidding me? You don't have one [Gold Fish]. I'm gonna take away all your worms so you can't kid anymore."
msgstr "你在跟我开玩笑吗？你连一条[Gold Fish]都没有。我要把你所有的虫子都收走，看你还怎么开玩笑。"

msgid "Hello. Hahaha. I'm the person who's been to every places on earth and have seen all the monsters around the world. I'm the captain of the Wanderer. Would you like to hear my story?"
msgstr "你好。哈哈哈。我是走遍世间每一处、见过全世界所有怪物的人。我是流浪者的船长。你想听我的故事吗？"

msgid "For now, there are two things. One, it's about [Suspicious spirit] that's wandering around the castle. The second one is about [Unique Pattern] from a Far East Country. Don't they sound interesting?"
msgstr "眼下有两件事。一是关于在城堡附近游荡的[Suspicious spirit]。第二件是来自远东国度的[Unique Pattern]。听起来是不是很有意思？"

msgid "What? You¡¯ve never heard of a story that¡¯s spreading throughout the world? |I¡¯ve heard that [Zigenon], killed by El Morad¡¯s Warrior, became a ghost and is taking vengeance.||You¡¯ll obtain powerful [Core of Ghost], which is very expensive, if you get rid of [Zigenon¡¯s Ghost]. ||Please bring it to me if you get it.| I¡¯ll give you a reward for that. |Let¡¯s help each other. (Giggle)"
msgstr "什么？你从没听过一个传遍世界的故事？|我听说被艾莫拉德战士杀死的[Zigenon]变成了鬼魂，正在复仇。||如果你除掉[Zigenon's Ghost]，就能获得强大而昂贵的[Core of Ghost]。||拿到了就带给我。|我会为此给你奖励。|我们互相帮助吧。（咯咯笑）"

msgid "What? You¡¯ve never heard of a story that¡¯s spreading throughout the world? |I¡¯ve heard that [Stone Tailer], killed by El Morad¡¯s Warrior, became a ghost and is taking vengeance.||You¡¯ll obtain powerful [Core of Ghost], which is very expensive, if you get rid of [Stone Tailer¡¯s Ghost]. ||Please bring it to me if you get it.| I¡¯ll give you a reward for that. |Let¡¯s help each other. (Giggle)"
msgstr "什么？你从没听过一个传遍世界的故事？|我听说被艾莫拉德战士杀死的[Stone Tailer]变成了鬼魂，正在复仇。||如果你除掉[Stone Tailer's Ghost]，就能获得强大而昂贵的[Core of Ghost]。||拿到了就带给我。|我会为此给你奖励。|我们互相帮助吧。（咯咯笑）"

msgid "What? |You¡¯ve never heard of a symbol with the bright energy?||I¡¯ve heard that one Eastern Country is using the symbol on its national flag.|It¡¯s also said that the pieces of the flag are used to make armor for the enemy.|| You can obtain it if you get rid of an enemy in the Frontier Zone. You can make [Taegeuk Symbol] if you combine 6 [Taegeuk Pieces] with a [Flag]. You can purchase a [Flag] from the [Merchant of Islante Nomad].|||This is expensive also, so I¡¯ll give you [Taegeukgi (Korean Flag)] as a reward for that.|"
msgstr "什么？|你从没听过带有明亮能量的符号吗？||我听说有个东方国家把这个符号用在国旗上。|还说国旗的碎片被用来为敌人制作盔甲。|| 你可以在边境地带除掉敌人来获得它。把6个[Taegeuk Pieces]和一面[Flag]组合就能做出[Taegeuk Symbol]。你可以从[Merchant of Islante Nomad]处购买[Flag]。|||这个也很贵，所以我会把[Taegeukgi（韩国国旗）]作为奖励给你。|"

msgid "You already got the [Nucleus of Spirit] as a reward. Come back tomorrow now."
msgstr "你已经把[Nucleus of Spirit]作为奖励领过了。现在请明天再来。"

msgid "I don't see any [Ying Yang Pattern]. Did you really combine the  [Flags] with 6 [Ying Yang Pieces]? Check it again."
msgstr "我没看到任何[Ying Yang Pattern]。你真的把[Flags]和6个[Ying Yang Pieces]组合了吗？再检查一下。"

msgid "It seems like you did make [Ying Yang Pattern]. As I said, here's the flag. It'll give you more exp.Try it once and let me know how it worked."
msgstr "看来你确实做出了[Ying Yang Pattern]。正如我所说，这是那面旗。它会给你更多经验。试试一次，然后告诉我效果如何。"

msgid "Hey there. I don't think you have [Nucleus of spirit]. Did you even get to meet the spirit? Come back again with it."
msgstr "喂。我想你没有[Nucleus of spirit]。你到底见没见到那个精灵？带着它再来。"

msgid "That!!!  It is really [Nucleus of Spirit]! Oh, wow. Thank you. I'll give you a reward now."
msgstr "那个！！这真的是[Nucleus of Spirit]！哦，哇。谢谢。我现在就给你奖励。"

msgid "How do you like your reward. You don't like it? Hm..  Next time I'll give you another one you would really like."
msgstr "你觉得你的奖励怎么样。你不喜欢？嗯……下次我给你一个你真正喜欢的。"

msgid "You got 10 [Warriors Article]. Would you like to exchange it with the Slogan?"
msgstr "你有10个[Warriors Article]。你想把它兑换成Slogan吗？"

msgid "[Oh! That is the [Spirit of Alseid]! |I¡¯m so lucky to see that spirit in this kind of place! |Currently, our Mercenary Squad is renting equipment that fits in with your current level for six hours a day. Thank you for showing me [Spirit of Alseid]. "
msgstr "[哦！那就是[Spirit of Alseid]！|能在这种地方见到那个精灵，我真幸运！|目前，我们的佣兵队每天六小时出租适合你当前等级的装备。谢谢你让我见到[Spirit of Alseid]。"

msgid "You don¡¯t have [Spirit of Alseids]. Please check it."
msgstr "你没有[Spirit of Alseids]。请检查。"

msgid "Oh, you must be the one who caught lots of [Gold Fish]. I'll give you the [Wing of Expert]."
msgstr "哦，你一定就是那个捕到很多[Gold Fish]的人。我会给你[Wing of Expert]。"

msgid "They only remember the first. You aren't the first. Sorry try it again next time."
msgstr "他们只记第一个。你不是第一个。抱歉，下次再试。"

msgid "This is where we dispatch soldiers from El Morad. Can't you see my face?"
msgstr "这里是我们从艾莫拉德派遣士兵的地方。你看不见我的脸吗？"

msgid "Listen to me now."
msgstr "现在听我说。"

msgid "Did you think I would apologize? No!"
msgstr "你以为我会道歉？不！"

msgid "Yes! Now I remember. I'll give you the order now. Participate in [Border Defense War] and deliver [Gift Stone of Country] to the avisor Snabaker."
msgstr "对！现在我想起来了。我这就给你下达命令。参加[边境防御战]，把[Gift Stone of Country]交给顾问Snabaker。"

msgid "Didn't I give you a mission already? Go join the battle and deliver [Thanksgiving Gift] to Snabaker"
msgstr "我不是已经给你任务了吗？去参战，把[Thanksgiving Gift]交给Snabaker"

msgid "What is this? This is the gift?  Haha"
msgstr "这是什么？这就是礼物？哈哈"

msgid "Good job. You take this."
msgstr "干得好。你收下这个。"

msgid "hm.. [Concentrated Juice of Sharab Fruit]. Let me drink it. Gulp gulp."
msgstr "嗯……[Concentrated Juice of Sharab Fruit]。让我喝一口。咕嘟咕嘟。"

msgid "Uhh! Uhh! Come to you! Bubba ... uh, uh ... Beomeu."
msgstr "呃！呃！冲你来的！布布……呃，呃……别摸我。"

msgid "Mari..a..look at me¡¦"
msgstr "玛……丽……看着我……"

msgid "what's going on? What? This is the gift?"
msgstr "怎么回事？什么？这就是礼物？"

msgid "But this is [Wet Bread]. This is a gift? "
msgstr "可这是[Wet Bread]。这也算礼物？"

msgid "It's unfair that I can't even go to my hometown¡¦ I can't do this. Please listen to me."
msgstr "连回老家都去不了，太不公平了……我受不了了。请听我说。"

msgid "If you look near the tower there's [Sharab Tree]. Bring me 2 [Sharap Fruits]. If you attack the tree you can get the fruit."
msgstr "你看塔附近有[Sharab Tree]。给我带2个[Sharap Fruits]。攻击那棵树就能获得果实。"

msgid "You obtained the [Sharab Tree]. Wait here for a minute."
msgstr "你获得了[Sharab Tree]。在这儿等我一下。"

msgid "Here you go! Here's the [Concentrated Juice of Sharab Fruit]. Bring this to [Dispatched troop leader]. This is really healthy. Also tell him that this is what I can do for the return of the gift of the thanksgiving."
msgstr "给你！这是[Concentrated Juice of Sharab Fruit]。把这个带给[Dispatched troop leader]。这东西真的很补。另外告诉他，这是我为回赠感恩节礼物所能做的一切。"

msgid "Please deliver this by today."
msgstr "请在今天之内把这个送到。"

msgid "Please bring me 2 [Sharab fruits]."
msgstr "请给我带2个[Sharab fruits]来。"

msgid "Cheers! Hey, dude. It's about time for thanksgiving. Didn't [Dispatched troop leader] say anything?"
msgstr "干杯！嘿，伙计。又到感恩节了。[Dispatched troop leader]没说什么吗？"

msgid "This is where Soldiers get dispatched by Karus."
msgstr "这里是卡鲁斯派遣士兵的地方。"

msgid "I want to go home. Oh! Hello. I'm Sonya who collects everything"
msgstr "我想回家。哦！你好。我是收集一切的Sonya"

msgid "If you obtain something you don't know how to use during fishing or digging, bring it to me. The person who gives me the most item during the event period will be rewarded. I'll repeat every 10 minutes."
msgstr "如果你在钓鱼或挖掘时弄到不知道怎么用的东西，带给我。活动期间给我道具最多的人会得到奖励。我每10分钟重复一次。"

msgid "Depending on the amount you provide you'll get prizes."
msgstr "根据你提供的数量，你会得到奖品。"

msgid "Come on. Please listen to me. According to my daughter, Amy, My Son Michel has been eaten by [Lord of Worm]. But I¡¯m not sure if it is really him. Please save my son."
msgstr "来吧。请听我说。据我女儿Amy说，我儿子Michel被[Lord of Worm]吃掉了。但我不确定那真的是他。请救救我儿子。"

msgid "[Lord of Worm] cannot be attacked with just any weapon. I've found out that the one we used the last time was too weak so I asked to make it extra special. It seems that the [Fork] that they just re-developed is stronger now. Please save my son. "
msgstr "[Lord of Worm]不是随便什么武器都能攻击的。我发现我们上次用的太弱了，所以我让人把它做得特别些。他们刚重新研发的[Fork]好像现在更强了。请救救我儿子。"

msgid "Catch [Lord of Worm] to obtain [Worm Egg]. Bring me 10 or more and show me. It's something my son really wanted. "
msgstr "捕捉[Lord of Worm]以获得[Worm Egg]。给我带来10个以上给我看。这是我儿子一直想要的东西。"

msgid "Please help. "
msgstr "请帮帮我。"

msgid "Gee¡¦..  That's not it¡¦ "
msgstr "哎呀……不是这个……"

msgid "You haven't gotten the [Lord of Worm]."
msgstr "你还没捉到[Lord of Worm]。"

msgid "ah! You caught him. You have [Worm Egg] too? Please come to me."
msgstr "啊！你捉到它了。你也有[Worm Egg]？请到我这儿来。"

msgid "Waha!! This is [Worm Egg]. Thank you for catching [Lord of Worm]."
msgstr "哇哈！！这就是[Worm Egg]。谢谢你捉到[Lord of Worm]。"

msgid "I knew you soudln't just catch him because he's a bit hard to catch. So the merchant and I had to make up a story."
msgstr "我就知道你不会那么容易捉到它，因为它有点难捉。所以我和商人不得不编了个故事。"

msgid "hahaha! But I¡¯m fair. Here's the reward. "
msgstr "哈哈哈！但我是公平的。这是奖励。"

msgid "After I rescued I've found out it's not the true! "
msgstr "我救回之后才发现不是真的！"

msgid "My son¡¦."
msgstr "我的儿子……"

msgid "Come on. Please listen to me. According to my daughter, Amy, My Son Seed has been eaten by [Lord of Worm]. But I¡¯m not sure if it is really him. Please save my son."
msgstr "来吧。请听我说。据我女儿Amy说，我儿子Seed被[Lord of Worm]吃掉了。但我不确定那真的是他。请救救我儿子。"

msgid "[Lord of Worm] isn¡¯t damaged by a general weapon. |I found out that the [Fork] isn¡¯t a strong weapon due to its special material. |So, I asked the merchant at the [Sundries Store] to produce an additional fork. ||It must be finished now. | I¡¯ve heard that the new fork is inexpensive, |so please use it to save my son."
msgstr "[Lord of Worm]不受普通武器伤害。|我发现[Fork]因其特殊材质不是件强武器。|所以我请[Sundries Store]的商人再做一把叉子。||它现在一定做好了。|我听说新叉子很便宜，|所以请用它救我儿子。"

msgid "My son..."
msgstr "我的儿子……"

msgid "Have you been well? Hahaha. Don't we need to see who'll win now?"
msgstr "你一直好吗？哈哈哈。我们难道不该看看现在谁会赢吗？"

msgid "If you win from the game of Yut, I'll give you twice more than the money that we are betting. Bet can be one of the three, chestnut, Rabbit, or Noah."
msgstr "如果你在掷柶游戏中赢了，我会给你比我们所赌钱数多一倍的奖励。赌注可以是栗子、兔子或诺亚三者之一。"

msgid "We meet again. So what's going on? | Have you heard of [Special Gift]? "
msgstr "我们又见面了。那么，怎么回事？| 你听说过[Special Gift]吗？"

msgid "You'll need to have at least 30 [Special Gift] to make something out of it. Come back when you have more than 30 or 50."
msgstr "你至少要有30个[Special Gift]才能做出点东西来。等你有30或50个以上时再来。"

msgid "That must be the [Special Gift]. How many do you have?"
msgstr "那一定就是[Special Gift]。你有几个？"

msgid "You bad [Lord of Worm] who took my son!"
msgstr "你这个抢走我儿子的坏[Lord of Worm]！"

msgid "You bad [Lord of Worm] who took my niece!"
msgstr "你这个抢走我侄女的坏[Lord of Worm]！"

msgid "You bad [Lord of Worm] who took my brother! "
msgstr "你这个抢走我弟弟的坏[Lord of Worm]！"

msgid "Yes that's it. Please keep collecting. I'll give you some more worm."
msgstr "对，就是这个。请继续收集。我再给你一些虫子。"

msgid "I told you to stop kid around. Let me take back the worms you have."
msgstr "我叫你别再开玩笑了。让我把你的虫子收回来。"

msgid "It seems you don't have enough space. Check it."
msgstr "你的空间好像不够。检查一下。"

msgid "It seems we are out of everything. Tomorrow, we'll have more. So please come back."
msgstr "我们好像什么都没了。明天我们会再补货。所以请再来。"

msgid "I can only give out once for [Dryads Spirit]."
msgstr "[Dryads Spirit]我只能发放一次。"

msgid "Here you go. "
msgstr "给你。"

msgid "This is the [Dryads Spirit]. It'll expire in 3 days."
msgstr "这就是[Dryads Spirit]。它将在3天后过期。"

msgid "I'm really upset.."
msgstr "我真的很沮丧……"

msgid "You'll have to have at least 10 of [Worm Eggs]."
msgstr "你至少要有10个[Worm Eggs]。"

msgid "Who are you ? I can feel your 'Aura'..   Don't you want to prove your power ?"
msgstr "你是谁？我能感觉到你的\"气场\"。你不想证明一下你的实力吗？"

msgid "Sombody is waiting for you by the swamp beneath graveyard in Moradon. Would you like to go ?"
msgstr "有人在莫拉登墓地下方的沼泽边等你。你想去吗？"

msgid " You ..you again ? Are your ability that weak ?  Or are you scared ?  Go quickly to the swamp beneath graveyard in Moradon.  He Is waiting for you."
msgstr "你……又是你？你的实力就这么弱吗？还是你害怕了？快去莫拉登墓地下方的沼泽。他在等你。"

msgid "Truely , you posses unique abilities. Take this , it will help you growing."
msgstr "你确实拥有独特的能力。拿着这个，它会助你成长。"

msgid "You are  ?!?!  You have the power to eliminate chaos.  [Chaos Temple ] Would you like to join ?  Go there.  Bring me back the [seal of white tiger] as proof.  I'll give you more power."
msgstr "你是？！？！你拥有消灭混沌的力量。[混沌神殿]你要加入吗？去那儿。把[seal of white tiger]作为证明带回来给我。我会给你更多力量。"

msgid "You admit [Chaos temple] every  regular  time, so you have to  keep on eye out."
msgstr "你每隔固定时间就能进入[混沌神殿]，所以你得留意。"

msgid "Haven't you been able to join [Chaos temple ] yet ?  Watch carefully the moment  the gate of [Chaos temple]  is open ."
msgstr "你还没能加入[混沌神殿]吗？仔细留意[混沌神殿]大门开启的那一刻。"

msgid " I could  see  shiny [Seal of white tiger] in you hand. It seems you have stablized enough the chaos .  I'll take all [White tiger's seal] back.  Take this."
msgstr "我能看到你手中闪亮的[Seal of white tiger]。看来你已充分平息了混沌。我会把所有[White tiger's seal]收回。拿着这个。"

msgid "Do you know the day the world is opened ?   Why don't you try to get an answer from my students who are in each village. If you show  this to them,  one of  my students will give you an answer .  You can obtain [Seal of Hyunmoo] if you give an answer to 3 students.  Please bring it to me."
msgstr "你知道世界开启之日吗？你为什么不去找我在各村的学生要个答案呢？如果你把这个给他们看，我的一个学生会给你答案。如果你答出3个学生的问题，就能获得[Seal of Hyunmoo]。请把它带给我。"

msgid "You still haven't got an answer yet because you don't have [Seal of Hyunmoo].  Please try to get an answer from my students who are in each village."
msgstr "因为你没有[Seal of Hyunmoo]，你还没得到答案。请试着去找我在各村的学生要答案。"

msgid "Finally, you got an answer because you have [Seal of Hyunmoo]. You will be growing  by getting an answer from  students. This is a gift for you."
msgstr "终于，因为你有了[Seal of Hyunmoo]，你得到了答案。你将通过从学生那里得到答案而成长。这是给你的礼物。"

msgid " I finally understood the reason. Thank you ."
msgstr "我终于明白了原因。谢谢。"

msgid " It doesn't seem the correct answer."
msgstr "这似乎不是正确答案。"

msgid "Your eyes are craving for victory.  Would you like to join [Border defense battle] ?  Then ,bring me  [seal of Phoenix] as proof after you occupy it.   I'll help you growing."
msgstr "你的眼中渴望着胜利。你想加入[边境防御战]吗？那么，在你占领后把[seal of Phoenix]作为证明带给我。我会助你成长。"

msgid "How come you didn't even occupy it ?  What is so afraid of ? Don't be afraid of joining  [Border defense battle].  You can do it. "
msgstr "你怎么连占领都没做到？你在怕什么？别害怕加入[边境防御战]。你能做到。"

msgid "Finally, you were victorious . Show me the proof.. I am certain of it.   You'll  grow one more step ."
msgstr "终于，你胜利了。把证明给我看……我对此确信无疑。你将再进一步成长。"

msgid "How are you doing ?  Have you ever heard of this story ?  There is a country that use the language is called  [Hoon.Min.Jung.um]  in East.  The scientific system is just incredible."
msgstr "你近来如何？你听过这个故事吗？东方有个国家使用一种叫[Hoon.Min.Jung.um]的语言。它的科学体系简直令人惊叹。"

msgid "You can learn the incredible system from [Hoon.Min.Jung.um] and total 4 books exist. If you obtain all of them, please give them to me. Jewel of experience: doubled  for 30 min. EXP 10% increase.  Jewel of defense :  doubled for 30 min.  Power defense 25 increase.  Jewel of life  : doubled for 30 min. HP 250 increase .   Jewel of contribution : doubled for 30 min.contribution points 4 increase.  Reward with these items."
msgstr "你可以从[Hoon.Min.Jung.um]中学习这套惊人的体系，共有4本书。如果你集齐了，请把它们给我。经验宝石：30分钟内翻倍。经验提升10%。防御宝石：30分钟内翻倍。力量防御提升25。生命宝石：30分钟内翻倍。HP提升250。贡献宝石：30分钟内翻倍。贡献度提升4。用这些道具作奖励。"

msgid "[Hoon.Min.Jung.um] Haven't you collected them yet ?  Please..   I'd like to confirm  them with my eyes."
msgstr "[Hoon.Min.Jung.um]你还没集齐吗？求你了……我想亲眼确认一下。"

msgid "Oh ~~ This is the one  [Hoon.Min.Jung.um]  !   If you get some more, I 'll keep trading."
msgstr "哦~~这就是那本[Hoon.Min.Jung.um]！！如果你再弄到一些，我会继续跟你兑换。"

msgid " Do you know that ?   It's almost time for the dead heroes' spirits to come back ~ The week of Halloween is getting close."
msgstr "你知道吗？死去英雄的灵魂快要回来了~万圣节那一周就要到了。"

msgid "What?  You seem  you don' t believe the existance of spirit.  Fine. I 'll show you.  You may be able to see [Spirit of ancient hero], then  get rid of them.  They might lie for the compensation¡¦.. Show me the proof."
msgstr "什么？你好像不相信灵魂的存在。好吧。我做给你看。你也许能看到[Spirit of ancient hero]，然后除掉它们。它们可能为了报酬而撒谎……把证明给我看。"

msgid "You still haven't caught any monster yet !  What a coward !"
msgstr "你还没捉到任何怪物！真是个懦夫！"

msgid "Did you really get rid of the monsters ?  My magical charm worked !!!  You will have better bisuniess  with your heroic story.  Thanks !!! Hahaha !!  Here is your present ! Happy Halloween !"
msgstr "你真的除掉那些怪物了吗？我的魔法护身符奏效了！！！你的英雄故事会让你生意更好。谢谢！！！哈哈哈！！这是你的礼物！万圣节快乐！"

msgid "[Jack O'Lantern] will reward you  with something good,if you bring him 5 pieces  matching with the name using pieces that I gave you."
msgstr "如果你用我给你的碎片，给他带来5片与名字相符的碎片，[Jack O'Lantern]会给你好东西作奖励。"

msgid "Can you see me ? Don't be afraid ~~ I..I don¡¯t want to wander anymore."
msgstr "你能看见我吗？别害怕……我……我不想再游荡了。"

msgid "I don't know who I am, where I am and where to go..  I heard they have [Burnt out candle] and [Pumpkin lantern] to lit the streets for ghoshs, why don't you get them for me ? I heard the monsters are afraid of [Fork] , so please  prepare it. Then , please take five x [Burnt out candle] from the monsters ."
msgstr "我不知道我是谁、我在哪里、要去哪儿……我听说他们有[Burnt out candle]和[Pumpkin lantern]为鬼魂照亮街道，你为什么不帮我弄来呢？我听说怪物们怕[Fork]，所以请准备好。然后，请从怪物那里拿5根x[Burnt out candle]给我。"

msgid "Haven' t you gotten 5x [Burnt out candle]  yet ?  I feel like I gonna be really angry..Don' t make me angry...   Please hurry ! Get me [Burnt out candle] !"
msgstr "你还没弄到5根x[Burnt out candle]吗？我感觉我真要发火了……别惹我生气……请快点！把[Burnt out candle]给我！"

msgid "You brought a lot of [burnt out candle] !  You must have one that you want among them ?  I'll take them all.  All I have now is only food that I cook when I was alive..Please take this.."
msgstr "你带来了好多[burnt out candle]！它们当中一定有你想要的一个吧？我都收下。我现在有的只有我活着时做的食物……请收下这个……"

msgid "I still have a lot of  [Burnt out candle]. I don't need your help today.  Please come back tomorrow."
msgstr "我还有很多[Burnt out candle]。我今天不需要你的帮助。请明天再来。"

msgid "I 'll never go to hell because I made a contract with the devil a  long time ago.  I am the ghost who lead  the way for other ghosts."
msgstr "我永远不会下地狱，因为我很久以前就和魔鬼订了契约。我是为其他鬼魂引路的鬼魂。"

msgid " It is really strange that I am the only one who looks like this  on Halloween ?   Let's celebrate 'Halloween '!  Put the pumpkin masks on people's heads for me."
msgstr "真奇怪，万圣节怎么就只有我一个是这副模样？我们来庆祝\"万圣节\"吧！替我把南瓜面具戴到人们头上。"

msgid "Hey ~ Hey~ Don't look down on me ~  You still have  masks in your bag !"
msgstr "嘿~嘿~别小看我~你包里还有面具呢！"

msgid "Let me see...I  see people  is wearing  pumpkin masks on their heads.. It seems he did a good job ."
msgstr "让我看看……我看到人们头上戴着南瓜面具……看来他干得不错。"

msgid "The boys look pretty good !  If you keep doing my favor and bring me  more than 10 pieces matching with the name using  pieces that I give you , I'll give you a present "
msgstr "这些小伙子看起来相当不错！如果你继续帮我，用我给你的碎片带来10片以上与名字相符的碎片，我就给你一份礼物"

msgid "Woul you like to trade pieces  you have  been collecting  so far ?  I wonder what you have and where ?!?"
msgstr "你想把你至今收集的碎片兑换吗？我好奇你有什么、在哪儿？！？！"

msgid "Are you looking  down on me because my look ?!!  Type of mask is five.  You need 10 pieces matching with the name to have any type of wepon.  You gotta help me if you want to collect  all pieces !"
msgstr "你因为我的样子就小看我吗？！面具的种类有五种。你需要10片与名字相符的碎片才能换任何一种武器。你要想集齐所有碎片就得帮我！"

