msgid "I already confirmed your power today. Please come back tomorrow."
msgstr "我今天已经确认过你的实力了。请明天再来。"

msgid "It seems  you have stablized the chaos today.  Please come back tomorrow."
msgstr "看来你今天已平息了混沌。请明天再来。"

