msgstr "我收到[Twilight Guard]Issac的命令：击败[Garioneus]，获得3个[Tongue of Garioneus]。"

msgid "I have received an order from [Twilight Guard] Issac to defeat [Huinum] and obtain 3 [Fires of Huinum]"
msgstr "我收到[Twilight Guard]Issac的命令：击败[Huinum]，获得3个[Fires of Huinum]。"

msgid "I have received an order from [Twilight Guard] Issac to defeat [Crashergimmik], [Purious], [Thralled Pluwiton], and [Pluwiton] and obtain their symbols."
msgstr "我收到[Twilight Guard]Issac的命令：击败[Crashergimmik]、[Purious]、[Thralled Pluwiton]和[Pluwiton]，获取它们的徽记。"

msgid "I have received an order from [Twilight Guard] Dolkin to defeat [Moospell] and [Ahmi] and obtain 3 [Descendant Armor Piece]."
msgstr "我收到[Twilight Guard]Dolkin的命令：击败[Moospell]和[Ahmi]，获得3个[Descendant Armor Piece]。"

msgid "I have received an order from [Twilight Guard] Dolkin to defeat [Geden], [Gedon], and [Geron] to obtain 3 [Teared Charms]. "
msgstr "我收到[Twilight Guard]Dolkin的命令：击败[Geden]、[Gedon]和[Geron]，获得3个[Teared Charms]。"

msgid "I have received an order from [Twilight Guard] Dolkin to defeat [Crasher Gimmik], [Purious], [Thralled Pluwiton] and [Pluwiton] to obtain their symbols."
msgstr "我收到[Twilight Guard]Dolkin的命令：击败[Crasher Gimmik]、[Purious]、[Thralled Pluwiton]和[Pluwiton]，获取它们的徽记。"

msgid "I have received an order from Balmanfae to defeaet [Pidama] to obtain 5 [Pidama's broken feather]."
msgstr "我收到Balmanfae的命令：击败[Pidama]，获得5个[Pidama's broken feather]。"

msgid "I have received an order from Balmanfae to defeat [Bunevilis] and obtain 5 [Evilis's leather]."
msgstr "我收到Balmanfae的命令：击败[Bunevilis]，获得5个[Evilis's leather]。"

msgid "I have received an order from [Twilight Guard] Balmanfae to defeat [Crashergimmik], [Purious], [Thralled Pluwiton], and [Pluwiton] and obtain their symbols."
msgstr "我收到[Twilight Guard]Balmanfae的命令：击败[Crashergimmik]、[Purious]、[Thralled Pluwiton]和[Pluwiton]，获取它们的徽记。"

msgid "Will you attack the Pluwiton's army? Defeat [Crashergimmik], [Purious], [Thralled Pluwiton], and [Pluwiton] and obtain their symbols."
msgstr "你要攻击Pluwiton的军队吗？击败[Crashergimmik]、[Purious]、[Thralled Pluwiton]和[Pluwiton]，获取它们的徽记。"

msgid "The title [King of King] isn't something anyone can have. It's special"
msgstr "[King of King]这个称号不是谁都能有的。它很特别"

msgid "Go get [Distorted Old Metal piece], [petrified Weapon Piece], [Metal powder of Chain], [Tears of Pluwiton] to receive the title King of King."
msgstr "去弄到[Distorted Old Metal piece]、[petrified Weapon Piece]、[Metal powder of Chain]、[Tears of Pluwiton]，以领取King of King称号。"

msgid "It seems you have all the pieces you need."
msgstr "看来你需要的碎片都齐了。"

msgid "The mission can be done once a day."
msgstr "本任务每天可完成一次。"

msgid "It seems your inventory is full."
msgstr "你的背包好像满了。"

msgid "Go find [Twilight Guardian] Spisiz to receive a mission."
msgstr "去找[Twilight Guardian]Spisiz领取任务。"

msgid "Go find [Twilight Guardian] Dolkin to receive a mission."
msgstr "去找[Twilight Guardian]Dolkin领取任务。"

msgid "Go find [Twilight Guardian] Balmanfae to receive a mission."
msgstr "去找[Twilight Guardian]Balmanfae领取任务。"

msgid "You aren't ready to take the mission. Come back later."
msgstr "你还没准备好接受任务。请稍后再来。"

msgid "It seems you are the right fit. I'll give you a mission."
msgstr "看来你很合适。我给你一个任务。"

msgid "Please defeat [Astarode] to obtain  [Astarode Vocal Cords]."
msgstr "请击败[Astarode]，取得[Astarode Vocal Cords]。"

msgid "[Astarode Vocal Cords] are needed to be used to make trumpet. Bring 3 cords."
msgstr "[Astarode Vocal Cords]是用来制作号角的材料。请带3个来。"

msgid "You'll need three [Astarode Vocal Cords]."
msgstr "你需要3个[Astarode Vocal Cords]。"

msgid "It seems you've collected all 3 cords."
msgstr "看来你已经凑齐3个了。"

msgid "This quest can be done once a day. You'll get reward for collecting 3 cords."
msgstr "这个任务每天可做一次。凑齐3个即可领取奖励。"

msgid "Defeat subordinate of Purious, [Garioneus]. You'll be able to obtain [Tongue of Gariouneus] when you defeat the ones with three heads."
msgstr "击败Purious的部下[Garioneus]。击败三头的那种，就能获得[Tongue of Gariouneus]。"

msgid "[Tongue of Garioneus] is important to study poison. You must need to obtain 3."
msgstr "[Tongue of Garioneus]对研究毒药很重要。你必须取得3个。"

msgid "You need at least 3 [Tongue of Garioneus]."
msgstr "你至少需要3个[Tongue of Garioneus]。"

msgid "It seems you have collected all three. Give them to me."
msgstr "看来三个都凑齐了。交给我吧。"

msgid "Once you have 3 [Tongue of Garioneus] bring it again."
msgstr "凑齐3个[Tongue of Garioneus]后再来。"

msgid "You don't seem to have enough inventory space."
msgstr "你的背包空间似乎不够。"

msgid "Defeat [Bunhuinum] to acquire [Fire of Huinum]."
msgstr "击败[Bunhuinum]，取得[Fire of Huinum]。"

msgid "There's a saying that you can't blow out [Fire of Huinum] even with the strong wind. We need this. "
msgstr "俗话说，[Fire of Huinum]就算狂风也吹不灭。我们需要它。"

msgid "We need at least 5 more of [Fire of Huinum]. Go defeat more."
msgstr "我们还需要至少5个[Fire of Huinum]。去多击败一些吧。"

msgid "It seems you have collected all 5. Give them to me."
msgstr "看来你已经凑齐5个了。交给我吧。"

msgid "You'll be able to come back to get your reward once a day when you collect all [Fire of Huinum]."
msgstr "每天凑齐所有[Fire of Huinum]后都可以回来领取一次奖励。"

msgid " Defeat [Crashergimmik], [Purious], [Thralled Pluwiton], and [Pluwiton] and obtain their symbols."
msgstr "击败[Crashergimmik]、[Purious]、[Thralled Pluwiton]和[Pluwiton]，取得它们的信物。"

msgid "The title [King of King] isn't something anyone can have. It's special."
msgstr "[King of King]这个称号不是谁都能拥有的，它很特别。"

msgid "Go find [Twilight Guardian] Issac to receive a mission."
msgstr "去找[Twilight Guardian] Issac接取任务。"

msgid "Please defeat [ahmi] and [Moospell] to obtain  [Astarode Vocal Cords]."
msgstr "请击败[ahmi]和[Moospell]，取得[Astarode Vocal Cords]。"

msgid "[Descendant Armor Piece] are needed to be used to make armors. Bring 3."
msgstr "[Descendant Armor Piece]是制作铠甲所需的材料。请带3个来。"

msgid "We need at least 3 pieces. Please defeat [Ahmi] and [Moospell]."
msgstr "我们至少需要3个。请击败[Ahmi]和[Moospell]。"

msgid "It seems you've collected all 3 pieces."
msgstr "看来你已经凑齐3个了。"

msgid "This quest can be done once a day. You'll get reward for collecting 3 pieces daily."
msgstr "这个任务每天可做一次。每天凑齐3个即可获得奖励。"

msgid "Defeat [Gaden], [Gedon], and [Geron] and obtain [Torn Scrolls of the three]."
msgstr "击败[Gaden]、[Gedon]和[Geron]，取得[Torn Scrolls of the three]。"

msgid "[Torn scrolls of the three] is what we need to seal pluwiton. You'll need at least 3."
msgstr "[Torn scrolls of the three]是我们用来封印pluwiton所需的。你至少需要3个。"

msgid "We must have at least 3. So please defeat [Geden], [Gedon], and [Geron]."
msgstr "我们必须凑齐至少3个。所以请击败[Geden]、[Gedon]和[Geron]。"

msgid "It seems the battle was tough. You have all three! Good."
msgstr "看来这场战斗很艰难。三个都到手了！很好。"

msgid "This can be done once a day."
msgstr "这个每天可做一次。"

msgid "Your inventory don't seem to have enough space."
msgstr "你的背包空间似乎不够。"

msgid "Defeat [Pidama]. From him obtain [Pidama's Broken Feather]."
msgstr "击败[Pidama]。从它身上取得[Pidama's Broken Feather]。"

msgid "You need at least 5 feathers."
msgstr "你至少需要5根羽毛。"

msgid "It'll be used to make the symbol so we'll need at least 5. Please defeat Pidama."
msgstr "它会被用来制作信物，所以我们至少需要5根。请击败Pidama。"

msgid "It seems you have all 5 feathers. Give them to me. Good job."
msgstr "看来5根羽毛都齐了。交给我吧。干得好。"

msgid "Defeat [Von Ebilis]. Obtain [Torn Leather of Ebilis]"
msgstr "击败[Von Ebilis]。取得[Torn Leather of Ebilis]。"

msgid "[Torn leather of Ebilis] is what we need to make the cape of knight. Bring me 5."
msgstr "[Torn leather of Ebilis]是我们制作骑士披风所需的。带5个给我。"

msgid "Obtain at least 5 [Torn leather of Ebilis]. "
msgstr "至少取得5个[Torn leather of Ebilis]。"

msgid "You must have all 5 pieces. Bring me."
msgstr "你必须凑齐5个。交给我。"

msgid "You can do this daily. You'll get rewarded daily."
msgstr "这个每天都可以做。你每天都会获得奖励。"

msgid "Am I too late for this? It seems Pluwiton is already gone. You did this?"
msgstr "我是不是来得太晚了？看来Pluwiton已经被消灭了。是你做的吗？"

msgid "That must be [Flaming Spoils of War]. I know how to open that. Do you need my help?"
msgstr "那一定是[Flaming Spoils of War]。我知道怎么打开它。需要我帮忙吗？"

msgid "Flaming Spoils of War? I haven't seen it but it seems you don't have one either."
msgstr "Flaming Spoils of War？我没见过，看来你手上也没有。"

msgid "You completed today assignment, Come back tomorrow."
msgstr "你今天的任务已经完成了，明天再来吧。"

msgid "This must be [Taurus Belt]."
msgstr "这一定是[Taurus Belt]。"

msgid "This must be [Fontus Belt]."
msgstr "这一定是[Fontus Belt]。"

msgid "This must be [Taurus Pendent]."
msgstr "这一定是[Taurus Pendent]。"

msgid "It seems you have the [Flaming Spoils of War]. I know how to open that box. I don't know what's in it but I'll help you to open it."
msgstr "看来你拿到了[Flaming Spoils of War]。我知道怎么打开那个箱子。我不知道里面有什么，但我会帮你打开。"

msgid "Your booty flame, do not seem to kill the bosses may give and receive help from near the flame booty challenge again Try it"
msgstr "你的战利品之火似乎没能击杀首领，不妨带着附近火焰战利品的帮助，再去挑战一次试试"

msgid "I don't know what's in it, but hope you can make use out of it."
msgstr "我不知道里面有什么，但希望你能派上用场。"

msgid "Would you like to be a hero? Then I'll help you to go to hell! Hahahaha"
msgstr "你想成为英雄吗？那我就送你下地狱吧！哈哈哈哈"

msgid "hehehe You're done with what you came for?"
msgstr "呵呵呵，你来这儿要办的事都办完了吗？"

msgid "It seems you have the [Spoils of War Box]. I know how to open that box. I don't know what's in it but I'll help you to open it."
msgstr "看来你拿到了[Spoils of War Box]。我知道怎么打开那个箱子。我不知道里面有什么，但我会帮你打开。"

msgid "You don't look like you have the [Spoils of War Box]. You can obtain the box when you complete the mission Twilight Guardian gives you."
msgstr "你看起来没有[Spoils of War Box]。完成Twilight Guardian给你的任务后就能得到这个箱子。"

msgid "I don¡¯t know what's in it but hope you can make use out of it."
msgstr "我不知道里面有什么，但希望你能派上用场。"

msgid "Since you have the [Battlefield Spoils of War]. You defeated Pluwiton's army! That box can't be opened easily but I know how to open it. I don't know what's in it but I'll help you."
msgstr "既然你拿到了[Battlefield Spoils of War]，说明你击败了Pluwiton的军队！那个箱子不能轻易打开，但我知道怎么开。我不知道里面有什么，但我会帮你。"

msgid "You don't seem to have the [Battlefield Spoils of War]. You can obtain this when you complete the quest after receivng the quest from the twilight guardian."
msgstr "你似乎没有[Battlefield Spoils of War]。从Twilight Guardian那里接取任务并完成后就能得到它。"

msgid "I don't know what came out of it, but hopefully you can make use of it."
msgstr "我不知道里面开出了什么，但希望你能派上用场。"

msgid "G-Zone PC Cafe  Description"
msgstr "G-Zone PC网吧 说明"

msgid "[Lucky Bag] has been stolen by the bad snowman. Please find my [Lucky Bag]."
msgstr "[Lucky Bag]被坏雪人偷走了。请帮我找回[Lucky Bag]。"

msgid "Snowman can cast spells but with this you'll be able to see what types of spells they are casting. Please defeat the snowman and get me 5 [Lucky Bag]."
msgstr "雪人会施法，但有了这个你就能看清它们施的是什么法术。请击败雪人，给我拿5个[Lucky Bag]来。"

msgid "You still don't have the [Lucky bag].  Obtain at least 5 please."
msgstr "你还没有[Lucky bag]。请至少取得5个。"

msgid "You have the [Lucky bag]! Good job! Here's the gift for you."
msgstr "你拿到[Lucky bag]了！干得好！这是给你的礼物。"

msgid "I'll be using the [Lucky Bag] now. Find me more tomorrow."
msgstr "我现在要用[Lucky Bag]了。明天再帮我多找一些来。"

msgid "We need firewood. Please bring 5 branches of [Ice Tree]."
msgstr "我们需要柴火。请带5根[Ice Tree]的树枝来。"

msgid "[Ice Tree] is a winter tree that raises only during the winter."
msgstr "[Ice Tree]是只在冬天生长的冬树。"

msgid "We'll need at least 5 [Ice Tree]. Please bring me at least 5."
msgstr "我们至少需要5棵[Ice Tree]。请带至少5棵来。"

msgid "You have brought me all 5! Thank you so much. What would you like to have?"
msgstr "你把5棵都带来了！太感谢了。你想要点什么？"

msgid "It's so cold so please bring me more then I'll reward you for it."
msgstr "天这么冷，请多带些来，我会给你奖励。"

msgid "Hello. I'm the fortune teller of [Eslant Wanderer]."
msgstr "你好。我是[Eslant Wanderer]的算命师。"

msgid "We were asked to defeat the snowman and deliver 5 [Lucky bag]."
msgstr "我们被要求击败雪人，并交付5个[Lucky bag]。"

msgid "WE were asked to find [Ice Tree] and bring 5 branches of [Ice Tree]."
msgstr "我们被要求寻找[Ice Tree]，并带5根[Ice Tree]的树枝来。"

msgid "Would you like to try out temporarily how this weapons work? You can rent it for 8 hours and it'll cost you 1,000,000."
msgstr "你想临时试试这件武器的威力吗？可以租用8小时，费用1,000,000。"

msgid "I don't have any support at this time. I thank you for your bravery but you'll have to come back later."
msgstr "我目前没有可以支援的东西。感谢你的勇敢，但你得以后再来。"

msgid "Why don't you support? Ah, are you asking what kind of support this is? We the [Twilight Guardian] have been battling [Pluwiton Army] for a long time. But they are so strong so we're losing our man."
msgstr "你为什么不来支援？啊，你问这是哪种支援？我们[Twilight Guardian]与[Pluwiton Army]战斗了很久。但它们太强了，我们正在不断减员。"

msgid "If you are interested, please help us. Defeat [Pluwiton] at Under the Castle. Then you'll be able to meet [Twilight Guardian] Martin. Deliver the form then he'll explain more."
msgstr "如果你有兴趣，请帮助我们。在Under the Castle击败[Pluwiton]。然后你就能见到[Twilight Guardian] Martin。把表格交给他，他会详细解释。"

msgid "I would like to show my appreication for what you've done."
msgstr "我想对你所做的一切表示感谢。"

msgid "Hey, there. It seems you are preparing to battle [Pluwiton Army] But it seems you aren't completely ready."
msgstr "嘿，你好。看来你正准备与[Pluwiton Army]作战，但似乎还没完全准备好。"

msgid "Do you know what [Life Crystal] is? If you have this you can ressurect when something happens to you at [Under the Castle]."
msgstr "你知道[Life Crystal]是什么吗？带着它，当你在[Under the Castle]遭遇不测时就能复活。"

msgid "I can give you one per day so take this. And please defeat [Pluwiton]."
msgstr "我每天可以给你一个，拿好这个。然后去击败[Pluwiton]吧。"

msgid "It seems you already received a [Life Crystal]. Please come back tomorrow."
msgstr "看来你已经领过[Life Crystal]了。请明天再来。"

msgid "I was ordered to deliver [Support form] to [Martin] who's located at [Under the Castle]."
msgstr "我奉命把[Support form]送到位于[Under the Castle]的[Martin]那里。"

msgid "Test"
msgstr "测试"

msgid "What is this. An application form? That's right. We thank you for your support and interest."
msgstr "这是什么？一份申请表？没错。感谢你的支援与关注。"

msgid "It'll help you. This is what we've collected in the past."
msgstr "它会帮到你。这是我们过去收集到的东西。"

msgid "You can freely enter [Under the Castle] but the apperance of [Army of Pluwiton] is limited. They are powerful so you'll need a good and big party members. "
msgstr "你可以自由进入[Under the Castle]，但[Army of Pluwiton]的出现是有限的。它们很强，所以你需要一个不错的大型队伍。"

msgid "I would like to show you my appreciation. Please help us again."
msgstr "我想向你表达我的感谢。请再帮帮我们。"

msgid "You'll apply for [Twilight Guardian]? Do you even have the [Application form]?"
msgstr "你要申请加入[Twilight Guardian]？你连[Application form]都没有吗？"

msgid "They already have the form."
msgstr "他们已经有表格了。"

msgid "It seems that the entrance to [Under the Castle] has been locked. Come back later."
msgstr "看来通往[Under the Castle]的入口已经被锁上了。稍后再来。"

msgid "Testing the Entering"
msgstr "测试进入"

msgid "You can't enter [Under the Castle]. Move to the other server and apply to enter."
msgstr "你无法进入[Under the Castle]。换到别的服务器再申请进入。"

msgid "There are too many supporters. I can't send you right now even though I know you are brave. But if someone gives up, we'll send you."
msgstr "支援者太多了。虽然我知道你很勇敢，但现在还不能派你进去。不过如果有人放弃，我们就派你去。"

msgid "Thank you for your interest in supporting the [Twilight Guardian]. But your nation is currently undergoing the battle with [Lunar War]. It seems you'll need to participate in [Lunar War] first."
msgstr "感谢你有意支援[Twilight Guardian]。但你的国家目前正在进行[Lunar War]。看来你得先参加[Lunar War]。"

msgid "You can check the efficiency of these weapons and accessories for 24 hrs. It's free for now."
msgstr "你可以在24小时内检验这些武器和饰品的效果。目前是免费的。"

msgid "Master! [Merchant's Daughter] Manisia is looking for someone who'll help her."
msgstr "主人！[Merchant's Daughter] Manisia正在找人帮忙。"

msgid "You are a single?? No?? [Valentine's Day] is a specialy day. The day you can propose to the loved ones with [Chocolate]. Bring me 10 more choclate first."
msgstr "你还是单身？不会吧？[Valentine's Day]是个特别的日子，是你用[Chocolate]向心爱之人表白的日子。先给我带10个巧克力来。"

msgid "You would like to be loved? Then bring [10 Chocolate]. You can obtain [Chocolate] by attacking [Cone Hat] with [Bamboo trees]."
msgstr "你想被爱吗？那就带[10 Chocolate]来。用[Bamboo trees]攻击[Cone Hat]就能获得[Chocolate]。"

msgid "You have collected all 10 [Chocolate]. If you take this you'll propose will be a success! But I'll take all chocolate from you now."
msgstr "你已经凑齐10个[Chocolate]了。拿着这个去表白一定会成功！不过巧克力我现在就全部收下了。"

msgid "You are a lovely one. Please come back tomorrow."
msgstr "你真是个可爱的人。请明天再来。"

msgid "You don't have any space in the inventory~~"
msgstr "你的背包里一点空间都没有了~~"

msgid "You are a single?? No?? [Valentine's Day] doesn't apply to us. Please bring me [20 Chocolate]. You need to be stronger. You need to hunt [Cone hat]."
msgstr "你还是单身？不会吧？[Valentine's Day]跟我们没关系。请给我带[20 Chocolate]来。你需要变得更强。你得去猎杀[Cone hat]。"

msgid "You want to be strong? Then bring me [20 Chocolate]. You can get chocolate by attacking [Cone Hat] with the [Bamboo]."
msgstr "你想变强吗？那就给我带[20 Chocolate]来。用[Bamboo]攻击[Cone Hat]就能得到巧克力。"

msgid "You have collected all [20 Choclate]. You are a brave one."
msgstr "你已经凑齐所有[20 Choclate]了。你真是个勇敢的人。"

msgid "You are already a brave one."
msgstr "你已经是个勇敢的人了。"

msgid "Hello. It's the new years already. Be happy~"
msgstr "你好。已经过年了。要快乐哦~"

msgid "Attention! For the glory of Karus! You are at a level to attend a battle."
msgstr "注意！为了卡鲁斯的荣耀！你已经达到可以参战的等级了。"

msgid "If you are a Karus Citizen, you must know what Elmorad has done to us. Now it's time to take revenge."
msgstr "如果你是卡鲁斯公民，一定知道艾莫拉德对我们做过什么。现在是复仇的时候了。"

msgid "[Ardream] is where level 50 - 59 players can battle. It's important to have a good strategy and skills. "
msgstr "[Ardream]是50-59级玩家对战的地方。拥有好的策略和技巧很重要。"

msgid "Yes, Battle skill will be learned from attending battles."
msgstr "是的，战斗技巧要在参战中才能学会。"

msgid "You do not have [Ardream Dispatching Form] or your level isn't fit for entering [Ardream]. You'll need to enter [Ronarkland Base] or [Ronarkland]."
msgstr "你没有[Ardream Dispatching Form]，或者你的等级不适合进入[Ardream]。你需要进入[Ronarkland Base]或[Ronarkland]。"

msgid "If you are a citizen of Karus, you know that you have to show bravery. You now have a chance to show off."
msgstr "如果你是卡鲁斯公民，就该知道要展现勇敢。现在你有机会一展身手了。"

msgid "[Ronarkland Base] is where level 60 - 69 can enter. You can really show off your skills that you have built for a long time. But you'll still need to be careful."
msgstr "[Ronarkland Base]是60-69级可以进入的地方。你可以真正展现长期磨练出的技巧。但你仍需小心。"

msgid "Yes please show off your skills!"
msgstr "是的，请大展身手吧！"

msgid "You do not have [Ronarkland Base Dispatching Form] or your level isn't fit for entering [Ronarkland Base]. You'll need to enter [Ronarkland]."
msgstr "你没有[Ronarkland Base Dispatching Form]，或者你的等级不适合进入[Ronarkland Base]。你需要进入[Ronarkland]。"

msgid "Attention! For the glory of Elmorad! You are at a level to attend a battle."
msgstr "注意！为了艾莫拉德的荣耀！你已经达到可以参战的等级了。"

msgid "If you are a Elmorad Citizen, you must know what Elmorad has done to us. Now it's time to take revenge."
msgstr "如果你是艾莫拉德公民，一定知道艾莫拉德对我们做过什么。现在是复仇的时候了。"

msgid "If you are a citizen of Elmorad, you know that you have to show bravery. You now have a chance to show off."
msgstr "如果你是艾莫拉德公民，就该知道要展现勇敢。现在你有机会一展身手了。"

msgid "You don't have enough space in your bag. Please check your bag and come again."
msgstr "你的背包空间不足。请整理背包后再来。"

msgid "Your level of less than 50 or more than 70. I have no information to give you."
msgstr "你的等级低于50或高于70。我没有可以告诉你的信息。"

msgid "You don't seem to have [Dispatching Form]. This means your mission's complete. Level up more to participate in more battles."
msgstr "你似乎没有[Dispatching Form]。这表示你的任务完成了。多升级，去参加更多战斗吧。"

msgid "Are you kidding me?"
msgstr "你在开玩笑吗？"

msgid "For the glory of Karus."
msgstr "为了卡鲁斯的荣耀。"

msgid "For the glory of Elmorad."
msgstr "为了艾莫拉德的荣耀。"

msgid "This is regarding premium item exchanges.|Please choose an option."
msgstr "这里是关于高级道具兑换的事宜。|请选择一个选项。"

msgid "This is regarding cash item exchange. |Please choose an option."
msgstr "这里是关于现金道具兑换的事宜。|请选择一个选项。"

msgid "Ah, [Dragon's Wings]!|You can exchange with [Dragon's Wings] which has been extracted from the corpse of dragons in the temporal space of Chaos. |There are 4 attributes that can be applied to you for 30 days, so choose one of them."
msgstr "啊，[Dragon's Wings]！|在混沌的时空裂缝中，从龙的尸体上提取出的[Dragon's Wings]可以用来兑换。|有4种属性可以应用到你身上，持续30天，请选择其中一种。"

msgid "You don't seem to have [Dragon's Wings Vouchers].|Please check one more time."
msgstr "你似乎没有[Dragon's Wings Vouchers]。|请再检查一遍。"

msgid "You don't seem to have [Kaishan's Trade Paper Voucher].|Please check one more time."
msgstr "你似乎没有[Kaishan's Trade Paper Voucher]。|请再检查一遍。"

msgid "Ah, [Kaishan's Trade Paper Voucher]! |Compared with regular [Merchant Mode] you can display twice as many items, and items are automatically sorted when items are sold. |However, you will be reverted into regular merchant mode after 8 hours.|*Can be used repeatedly for 30 days."
msgstr "啊，[Kaishan's Trade Paper Voucher]！|与普通[Merchant Mode]相比，你可以展示两倍数量的物品，而且物品售出后会自动整理。|不过，8小时后会恢复为普通商人模式。|*可在30天内重复使用。"

msgid "You don't seem to have [Menissiah's Trade Paper Voucher].|Please check one more time."
msgstr "你似乎没有[Menissiah's Trade Paper Voucher]。|请再检查一遍。"

msgid "Ah, [Menissiah's Trade Paper Voucher]!|This organizes the list of [Sellers/Buyers], lets you search keywords in the main list, and lets you see the prices of the searched items so you can [Whisper] or [Move] to the seller/buyer. |*Can be used repeatedly for 30 days."
msgstr "啊，[Menissiah's Trade Paper Voucher]！|它会整理[卖家/买家]列表，让你在主列表中搜索关键词，并查看所搜物品的价格，从而让你可以[密语]或[移动]到卖家/买家身边。|*可在30天内重复使用。"

msgid "What is this?"
msgstr "这是什么？"

msgid "That guy named Jake¡¦ | He is disguising himself as a tree and follows me around. I don't care for guys with no bravery. I'll take the chocolate but take this back to him. "
msgstr "那个叫Jake的家伙|他把自己伪装成一棵树，一直跟着我。我不喜欢没有勇气的男人。巧克力我收下了，但这个你拿回去还给他吧。"

msgid "You have something for me? Or because it's White Day you are just kidding?"
msgstr "你有东西要给我吗？还是说因为今天是白色情人节，你只是在开玩笑？"

msgid "Hey, Hey! Yes you.."
msgstr "喂，喂！没错，就是你……"

msgid "Could you please help my brother? | I'm worried about him. | He likes this someone but he disguises himself as some weirdo creature and follows her around. || He's somewhere near the new land. Please help him."
msgstr "你能帮帮我哥哥吗？|我很担心他。|他喜欢上了某个人，却把自己伪装成奇怪的生物跟在她身后。|他在新大陆附近某处。请帮帮他。"

msgid "Ah. And she's really popular. There will be stalkers who follows her around too. So be careful."
msgstr "啊，而且她很受欢迎。也会有别的跟踪狂跟着她。所以要小心。"

msgid "It won't be good if someone else propose to her first! Go to the new land and listen to what my brother has to say. "
msgstr "要是别人先向她表白就糟了！去新大陆听听我哥哥怎么说吧。"

msgid "It seems that it'll be hard for my brother. But if he keeps trying maybe she'll listen."
msgstr "看来我哥哥会很难办。但如果他继续努力，也许她会听进去的。"

msgid "Please come back tomorrow. I know you tried your best. Here's the reward for today. | If my brother's succeeds in proposing I have been making this to give out to the whole townspeople. | but I think I made too many."
msgstr "请明天再来。我知道你已经尽力了。这是今天的奖励。|如果我哥哥表白成功，我本来做了这个要分发给全镇的人。|不过我好像做太多了。"

msgid "hey what are you doing? What if she sees you?"
msgstr "喂，你在干什么？要是被她看到怎么办？"

msgid "But my disguise was perfect. | What? You were sent by my brother jade? | I don't think I can prpose to her. | Bad stalkers took the gift I was going to give to her. | Where is she? | She likes man who are muscular so she's wandering around the new land."
msgstr "可我的伪装很完美。|什么？你是我哥哥Jade派来的？|我觉得我没法向她表白了。|那些坏跟踪狂把我要送给她的礼物抢走了。|她在哪儿？|她喜欢肌肉发达的男人，所以正在新大陆附近转来转去。"

msgid "Please find the cholate by defeating the stalkers who are in disguise. If you find [5 Chocolate] please bring the chocolate with the letter to her instead of me. Please."
msgstr "请击败那些伪装的跟踪狂，找回巧克力。如果你找到[5 Chocolate]，请替我把巧克力和信一起带给她。拜托了。"

msgid "Ah¡¦  Ok..  Tomorrow..   Could you give this letter to Jade?"
msgstr "啊……好吧……明天……你能把这封信交给Jade吗？"

msgid "I've been single for the past 32 years."
msgstr "我已经单身32年了。"

msgid "Why you don't have spaces in your bag?"
msgstr "你的背包里怎么会没有空间？"

msgid "Your bags are full, I guess."
msgstr "你的包满了吧。"

msgid "Oh wait!! Do you have enough spaces in your bag? "
msgstr "哦等等！你的包里有足够的空间吗？"

msgid "We failed again today but there's tomorrow. Please come back tomorrow. I'll be fixing the letter."
msgstr "我们今天又失败了，但还有明天。请明天再来。我会把信改好。"

msgid "You are not a stranger. Do you know anything about the abnormal temperature?"
msgstr "你不是外人。你知道气温异常的事吗？"

msgid "What? He has no idea. | The neighborhood country is devastated with Earthquakes and Tsunami."
msgstr "什么？他一点也不知道。|邻邦正遭受地震和海啸的蹂躏。"

msgid "That's sad¡¦ | I'll give you this so have some sympathy."
msgstr "真可怜……|我把这个给你，算是一点心意。"

msgid "That's a tragedy! | Man, I hope things restore soon. || [Collector Sonya] is collecting relief goods]. If you want to help, go find her."
msgstr "真是场灾难！|老兄，希望一切能尽快恢复。|[Collector Sonya]正在募集救灾物资。如果你想帮忙，就去找她吧。"

msgid " <selfname>, welcome! | I knew you would come to help me."
msgstr "<selfname>，欢迎你！|我就知道你会来帮我。"

msgid "They say that because of the past bad weather with lots of snow, many of the housings were ruined. | Everyone's still trying to restore the loss we've had. We have to help them."
msgstr "据说因为过去那场多雪的坏天气，许多房屋都被毁了。|大家仍在努力重建损失。我们得帮帮他们。"

msgid "When I told the [Imperial Cook] he told me to bring [5 Goby] and [5 Salmon]. If you help, I'll give you reward."
msgstr "我告诉[Imperial Cook]，他让我带[5 Goby]和[5 Salmon]来。如果你帮忙，我会给你奖励。"

msgid "You do not have enough. You'll need to bring [5 Goby] and [5 Salmon]."
msgstr "你带得不够。你需要带[5 Goby]和[5 Salmon]来。"

msgid "You have all [5 Goby] and [5 Salmon]. Keep bringing more please."
msgstr "[5 Goby]和[5 Salmon]你都齐了。请继续多带些来。"

msgid "test"
msgstr "test"

msgid "To restore what we've lost please bring us [10 pebbles]. If you help I'll give you reward."
msgstr "为了重建我们失去的一切，请带[10 pebbles]来。如果你帮忙，我会给你奖励。"

msgid "You don't have enough. You have to have at least 10."
msgstr "你带得不够。你至少要有10个。"

msgid "You have all [10 Pebbles]! Keep bringing more please."
msgstr "[10 Pebbles]你都齐了！请继续多带些来。"

msgid "Do you know the heroes of Eastern countries?"
msgstr "你知道东方国家的英雄们吗？"

msgid "There's a general called Lee Soon Shin and he had 23 win out of 23 battles he's had."
msgstr "有位名叫李舜臣的将军，他经历的23场战斗全部获胜。"

msgid "Just like the General, don't yhou wanna be a hero?"
msgstr "就像那位将军一样，你不想成为英雄吗？"

msgid "What? You haven't even started the battle. It's not easy to be a hero. Do a better job."
msgstr "什么？你连战斗都还没开始。成为英雄可没那么容易。做得再好点。"

msgid "You have [Individual Mission Card x 2]. You do have the talent to be a hero."
msgstr "你有[Individual Mission Card x 2]。你确实有成为英雄的天赋。"

msgid "You do not have enough inventory space. "
msgstr "你的背包空间不足。"

msgid "If you want receive support make sure you have space in your inventory."
msgstr "如果你想领取支援，请确保背包里有空间。"

msgid "You don't have enough space in your bag. You need at least 6 spaces."
msgstr "你的背包空间不足。你至少需要6个空格。"

