msgstr "感谢你参与CBT。|这是今天的礼物。"

msgid "Today's CBT Reward has been given out. | I'll give you another reward tomorrow."
msgstr "今天的CBT奖励已经发放了。|我明天再给你另一份奖励。"

msgid "Hello. I¡¯m in charge of the event. | What can I help you with?"
msgstr "你好。我负责这个活动。|有什么我能帮你的吗？"

msgid "You have the item you are required to have. I'll give you the item you'll need."
msgstr "你已经持有所需的物品了。我会把你需要的物品给你。"

msgid "You do not have the required item. I cannot help you."
msgstr "你没有所需的物品。我帮不了你。"

msgid "You must be at least level 5 to exchange."
msgstr "你必须至少达到5级才能兑换。"

msgid "You must be at least level 15 to exchange."
msgstr "你必须至少达到15级才能兑换。"

msgid "You must be at least level 25 to exchange."
msgstr "你必须至少达到25级才能兑换。"

msgid "You must be at least level 35 to exchange."
msgstr "你必须至少达到35级才能兑换。"

msgid "Today isn't the day of the CBT participation."
msgstr "今天不是参与CBT的日子。"

msgid "I've lived long and seen many good and bad things. "
msgstr "我活了很久，见过许多好事和坏事。"

msgid "Sometimes bad incidents can't be unavoidable. | But I always feel bad when bad incidents happen. | so I made the [Joe's Slogan] to show my pitiful attitude."
msgstr "有时候不幸的事件无法避免。|但每当不幸发生时我总很难过。|所以我做了这个[Joe's Slogan]来表达我悲悯的心情。"

msgid "Since I really put in my heart to make this, I can sell it for 10,000 Noah. | If you need it you can purchase it for this price. | would you like to get it?"
msgstr "因为我是用心做的，所以可以卖10,000诺亚。|如果你需要，可以按这个价格买。|你想要吗？"

msgid "Here's the [Joe's Slogan]. Hope it gets used in a good way."
msgstr "这是[Joe's Slogan]。希望它能派上好用场。"

msgid "Hello, I'm the girl who is day dreaming all the times. | This month we have Mother's day."
msgstr "你好，我是那个总在做白日梦的女孩。|这个月是母亲节。"

