msgstr "背包空间不足。领取物品你至少需要2个背包格。"

msgid "[World Championship Application]"
msgstr "[世界锦标赛报名]"

msgid "You do not have [World Championship Application]."
msgstr "你没有[世界锦标赛报名]。"

msgid "Hello</ font> <font color=@#990000@> <selfname> I'm [VIP Manager] Julianne."
msgstr "你好</ font> <font color=@#990000@> <selfname> 我是[VIP Manager] Julianne。"

msgid "Would you like to receive benefit of [Gold Premium]?"
msgstr "你想领取[Gold Premium]的福利吗？"

msgid "You do not have [Gold Premium]."
msgstr "你没有[Gold Premium]。"

msgid "Dear <selfname>, do you like Snowman?"
msgstr "亲爱的<selfname>，你喜欢雪人吗？"

msgid "Nope, Snowman isn't our friend anymore. He's just an enemy now. "
msgstr "不，雪人不再是我们的朋友了。它现在只是个敌人。"

msgid "Due to the Naughty Snowman, the townspeople are all complaining. Snowman has made the ground slippery and it's so dangerous for us!"
msgstr "因为淘气的雪人，镇上的人都在抱怨。雪人把地面弄得很滑，对我们太危险了！"

msgid "Oh my, you the Knight must help us out! Please defeat the snowman and bring me 5 x snow crystals. I will reward you!"
msgstr "天哪，你这位骑士一定要帮帮我们！请击败雪人，给我拿5个雪晶来。我会奖励你！"

msgid "You have 5 [Snow Crystal]!"
msgstr "你有5个[Snow Crystal]了！"

msgid "Thank you so much, Knight! Here's the gift I have prepared for you. "
msgstr "非常感谢你，骑士！这是我为你准备的礼物。"

msgid "When will you defeat the Snowman?"
msgstr "你什么时候去击败雪人？"

msgid "That's too bad. I'm sure Snowman could have been defeated by you. "
msgstr "那太可惜了。我相信雪人本可以被你击败的。"

msgid "Thank you for purchasing [Chaos Wings].  Preferred Option of [Chaos Wings] is available."
msgstr "感谢你购买[Chaos Wings]。[Chaos Wings]的首选属性已开放。"

msgid "[Chaos Wings Voucher] can be exchanged for [Chaos Wings].  Please visit [NPC] Kayra in Moradon to exchange. "
msgstr "[Chaos Wings Voucher]可以兑换[Chaos Wings]。请前往莫拉登找[NPC] Kayra兑换。"

msgid "You have received Chaos Wings. Thank you for your support for Knight Online. Good Hunting!"
msgstr "你已收到混沌之翼。感谢你支持《骑士OL》。狩猎愉快！"

msgid "Which [Chaos Wings] would you like to receive?"
msgstr "你想领取哪种[Chaos Wings]？"

msgid "You do not have a [Chaos Wing Voucher]. Please return with the character who holds the [Chaos Wing Voucher]."
msgstr "你没有[Chaos Wing Voucher]。请带着持有[Chaos Wing Voucher]的角色回来。"

msgid "Please help us tomorrow. You have already obtained enough of [Mudskipper] and [Salmon]. "
msgstr "请明天再帮我们。你已经取得了足够的[Mudskipper]和[Salmon]。"

msgid "I'll take one [Evidence of Oracle]."
msgstr "我要收走一个[Evidence of Oracle]。"

msgid "You do not have [Evidence of Oracle]."
msgstr "你没有[Evidence of Oracle]。"

msgid "You have turned in 1 [Evidence of Oracle]."
msgstr "你已上交1个[Evidence of Oracle]。"

msgid "You do not have the name that fits the merchanting. Would you like to change your character name?"
msgstr "你没有适合经商的名字。你想更改角色名吗？"

msgid "To change the character name you'll be logged out from the game. Would you like to accept?"
msgstr "更改角色名会让你退出游戏。你接受吗？"

msgid "Your character name isn't suitable for merchanting. You'll need to change your character name. If you are a king or any important advisor, you won't be able to change yhour name. You'll need to withdraw from your position to change your name."
msgstr "你的角色名不适合经商。你需要更改角色名。如果你是国王或重要顾问，将无法改名。你需要辞去职位才能改名。"

msgid "Hello! It's the new year! For this year, hope you have a great new year! | If you offer contribution, your fortune will be told. | Aren't you interested?"
msgstr "你好！过年了！祝你新的一年大吉大利！|如果你捐献贡献度，就会为你占卜运势。|你不感兴趣吗？"

msgid "How much will you pay?"
msgstr "你愿意支付多少？"

msgid "Congratulations. You have a great fortune for this coming year."
msgstr "恭喜。你新的一年运势极佳。"

msgid "I'll give you reward for your great fortune."
msgstr "我会为你的好运气给你奖励。"

msgid "Happy new year! *^^*| Because this year's related to dragon. We're asking Black Dragon for a favor. But in order to do this we'll need old teeth x 10,000. I don't think we can do it by ourselves. What can we do?"
msgstr "新年快乐！*^^*|因为今年和龙有关。我们正在向黑龙祈求。但要做到这一点我们需要旧牙x 10,000。我觉得我们自己做不到。怎么办呢？"

msgid "Really? Thanks a lot. Could you collect old teeth and deliver it to me?"
msgstr "真的吗？太感谢了。你能收集旧牙并交给我吗？"

msgid "Thank you. If you help I'll repay you."
msgstr "谢谢。如果你帮忙，我会报答你的。"

msgid "I don't think we have enough teeth. What can we do?"
msgstr "我觉得我们的牙齿不够。怎么办呢？"

msgid "Wow! You brought a lot! Thank you."
msgstr "哇！你带了好多来！谢谢。"

msgid "Oh, hello! This is our warrior!"
msgstr "哦，你好！这是我们的勇士！"

msgid "Hey Mr. Warrior! Please do me a favor. | I have to make sure that our babies eat rice cake soup. But there's no meat in the soup so they aren't eating it. | Could you bring me 10 Turkey from infront of the town?"
msgstr "嘿，勇士先生！请帮我个忙。|我得确保我们的宝宝们喝上年糕汤。但汤里没有肉，他们不肯喝。|你能从镇子前面给我带10只火鸡来吗？"

msgid "You still don't have the meat? My babies are hungry. T.T"
msgstr "你还是没弄到肉吗？我的宝宝们饿坏了。T.T"

msgid "You brought the meat! Thank you!"
msgstr "你把肉带来了！谢谢！"

msgid "Here, have a bowl of soup!"
msgstr "给，喝碗汤吧！"

msgid "It's the new year! Why don't you go say happy new year to the elders at Moradon? Maybe they'll give you a reward for being so well mannered. | Oh yeah, and they'll like this rice cake soup."
msgstr "过年了！你为什么不去莫拉登向长辈们拜年呢？也许他们会因为你这么有礼貌而给你奖励。|哦，对了，他们会喜欢这碗年糕汤的。"

msgid "You haven't said the greeting yet?"
msgstr "你还没拜年吗？"

msgid "You are our Hero! Have a happy new year!"
msgstr "你是我们的英雄！新年快乐！"

msgid "Thank you. Take this!"
msgstr "谢谢。拿好这个！"

msgid "I did not not take the rice cake soup! "
msgstr "我没拿年糕汤！"

msgid "Oh, you are our hero! Have a great new year!"
msgstr "哦，你是我们的英雄！祝你新年快乐！"

msgid "Since you don't have the rice cake soup. I don't want to hear you greet me."
msgstr "既然你没有年糕汤。我不想听你拜年。"

msgid "Thank you, Take this!"
msgstr "谢谢，拿好这个！"

msgid "You don't even have the rice cake soup. I don't want to hear you greet me."
msgstr "你连年糕汤都没有。我不想听你拜年。"

msgid "Hey, Mr. Warrior. Have you seen the gourd infront of the Moradon?"
msgstr "嘿，勇士先生。你看到莫拉登前面的葫芦了吗？"

msgid "To welcome the new year, Gourds are blooming. If you throw the lucky pockets and break the gourds, you'll get EXP and old box."
msgstr "为了迎接新年，葫芦都开了。如果你投出幸运袋打破葫芦，就能获得EXP和旧箱子。"

msgid "It happens every 8 hours. Hope you are interested!"
msgstr "每8小时出现一次。希望你感兴趣！"

msgid "You already broke the gourd! Congrats! I'll open the old box for you."
msgstr "你已经打破葫芦了！恭喜！我来为你打开旧箱子。"

msgid "Mr. Warrior. Something's happened!"
msgstr "勇士先生。出事了！"

msgid "In the island of Mora which is on the west side of the Moradon, a gold dragon has appeared!"
msgstr "在莫拉登西边的莫拉岛上，出现了一条金龙！"

msgid "This gold dragon can't be defeated by normal attack."
msgstr "这条金龙无法被普通攻击击败。"

msgid "This dragon likes lucky pockets."
msgstr "这条龙喜欢幸运袋。"

msgid "Yep. Throw the poisonous lucky pockets at the dragon."
msgstr "对。把有毒的幸运袋投向那条龙。"

msgid "Congrats! Luck's on your way for this year."
msgstr "恭喜！你今年好运当头。"

msgid "Congrats! You'll have a great new year."
msgstr "恭喜！你会过一个很棒的新年。"

msgid "Careful! It looks your fortune isn't so great for this new year. Careful with Water."
msgstr "小心！看来你新年运势不太好。小心水。"

msgid "Oh! Really bad fortune¡¦ Careful now."
msgstr "哦！运势真的很差……现在要小心了。"

msgid "In order to tell your fortune, there should be spaces in your bag."
msgstr "为了给你占卜，你的包里需要有空间。"

msgid "Instead of me today, greet the other elder today."
msgstr "今天替我去向另一位长辈拜年吧。"

msgid "Dragon has appeared at the Mora Island. Would you like to participate in the Dragon subjugation?"
msgstr "龙出现在莫拉岛了。你想参加讨伐龙吗？"

msgid "I only accept one greeting per day. Come back tomorrow."
msgstr "我每天只接受一次拜年。明天再来。"

msgid "You don't have spaces in your bag."
msgstr "你的包里没有空间。"

msgid "Nation Transfer System|-  <font color=@#660066@>Only Karus users can do Nation Transfer temporary.</font> |- When transferring, all the characters within the account must withdraw from the clan |- When transferring, when you submit  the  [Exile Application Form] you can exchange it with a  [National Transfer Certificate]. Accumulation starts from this point of time."
msgstr "转国系统|- <font color=@#660066@>暂时只有卡鲁斯用户可以转国。</font> |- 转国时，账号内所有角色必须退出公会 |- 转国时，提交[流放申请表]即可兑换[转国证书]。累积从此刻开始计算。"

msgid "Only Karus users can do Nation Transfer temporary."
msgstr "暂时只有卡鲁斯用户可以转国。"

msgid "It's supposed to be a full moon but this is really unfortunate."
msgstr "本应是圆月之夜，真是不幸。"

msgid "You know how when there's full moon you are supposed to eat nuts to have good skin? I'm so busy I can't get the nuts for our kids. Could you help me?"
msgstr "你知道月圆时要吃坚果对皮肤好吗？我太忙了，没法给我们的孩子弄坚果。你能帮帮我吗？"

msgid "Just pick them on on the way to monster hunting. Give me 5 of the nuts."
msgstr "在去狩猎怪物的路上顺便捡就行。给我5个坚果。"

msgid "Knight! Thank you. If you give me chestnuts I'll give you some rice cake."
msgstr "骑士！谢谢。如果你给我栗子，我就给你些年糕。"

msgid "I don't think you have all 5 nuts. Check it please."
msgstr "我觉得你还没凑齐5个坚果。请检查一下。"

msgid "Thank you!! You must be so tired but you remembered to bring all 5 nuts."
msgstr "谢谢！！你一定很累了，但还记得把5个坚果都带来。"

msgid "This is to show my appreciation."
msgstr "这是我的一点心意。"

msgid "Knight. I want to take this chance during Valentine's day and propose. But I'm so shy. I'll need Love spirit's help."
msgstr "骑士。我想趁情人节这个机会表白。但我太害羞了。我需要爱之精灵的帮助。"

msgid "Give this letter with the chocolate to the Love Spirit who lives in the South Meadow?"
msgstr "把这封连着巧克力的信交给住在南边草地的爱之精灵好吗？"

msgid "Jane wanted to give this to him? Whatever!! |Chocolate won't work."
msgstr "Jane想把这个给他？管他呢！|巧克力是没用的。"

msgid "Do I have to really say it to make you understand? It's a different world now. You really need the ring."
msgstr "非要我说出来你才明白吗？现在世道变了。你真的需要戒指。"

msgid "Why are you asking? Bring the pickaxe and start digging! You might be able to find a ring."
msgstr "你问这个干嘛？拿起镐子开始挖吧！也许你能找到戒指。"

msgid "What you haven't found a ring? Go dig more!"
msgstr "什么，你还没找到戒指？继续挖！"

msgid "You didn't get his message yet?"
msgstr "你还没收到他的消息吗？"

msgid "Great! I'll be back soon."
msgstr "太好了！我很快就回来。"

msgid "Give this letter to Jane."
msgstr "把这封信交给Jane。"

msgid "ah.. I see..  There was already someone.. | Thank you. This is to show my apprecation."
msgstr "啊……这样啊……已经有人了……|谢谢。这是我的一点心意。"

msgid "There's Full moon celebration at Moradon."
msgstr "莫拉登正在举行圆月庆典。"

msgid "But in order to participate you'll need to bring some rice straws."
msgstr "但要参加的话，你需要带些稻草来。"

msgid "Start spinning top infront of the town you'll be able to find some rice straws. Bring me 10 rice straws to participate for the event."
msgstr "在镇前面开始抽陀螺，就能找到一些稻草。给我带10根稻草来参加活动。"

msgid "Use the bamboo to spin the tops."
msgstr "用竹子来抽陀螺。"

msgid "You don't have all 10."
msgstr "你还没凑齐10根。"

msgid "Just in time. We'll need to burn the moon house so give me all the rice straws now."
msgstr "正好。我们要烧掉月屋，现在把所有稻草给我。"

msgid "I'm giving you this fire since it's tradition. Make sure you be careful."
msgstr "这是习俗，我把这个火种给你。一定要小心。"

msgid "We're trying to select Warmonger to celebrate the Full Moon."
msgstr "我们正想选出战争狂来庆祝圆月。"

msgid "There's no requirement. Just that anyone who defeat enemy will be able to collect Warmonger Evidence and bring 10 of these to receive gifts."
msgstr "没有要求。只要击败敌人就能收集战争狂证据，带10个来就能领礼物。"

msgid "Defeat the enemy to collect Warmonger Evidence. And you'll need at least 10."
msgstr "击败敌人收集战争狂证据。你至少需要10个。"

msgid "We recognize you as a Warmonger. The prize is dumblings. What is this?? It's food!"
msgstr "我们认定你为战争狂。奖品是饺子。这是什么？？这是食物！"

msgid "How to spin the top infront of the town? It's simple. You'll need the towns people though. Get the bamboo from the merchant and use it to spin the tops."
msgstr "怎么在镇前面抽陀螺？很简单。不过你需要镇上的人。从商人那里买竹子，用它来抽陀螺。"

msgid "I don't think you know. If you cooperate there's hidden bride and grom transformation coupon. Bring those and I'll give you the scroll."
msgstr "我觉得你不知道。如果你们合作，会有隐藏的新郎新娘变身券。把那些带来，我就给你卷轴。"

msgid "You haven't found the bride and groom transformation coupon."
msgstr "你还没找到新郎新娘变身券。"

msgid "You broug the bride and groom transformation coupon! Come on, change into these clothes and go propose to the one you love."
msgstr "你把新郎新娘变身券带来了！来，换上这身衣服去向你爱的人表白吧。"

msgid "South Meadow is where the middle ground between the Village of Fork and Moradon are. It's located at 520, 310."
msgstr "南边草地是Fork村和莫拉登之间的中间地带。位于520, 310。"

msgid "You can make Love happen! If you want to deliver your love come to me. Jane must have something she wants from me."
msgstr "你可以促成姻缘！如果你想传达爱意就来找我。Jane一定有她想从我这儿得到的东西。"

msgid "Moon welcoming can only be watched once a day."
msgstr "迎月每天只能观看一次。"

msgid "The warmonger evidence is collected once a day."
msgstr "战争狂证据每天收集一次。"

msgid "You have Wing Weapon Box. | You have this type of item. | Here you go."
msgstr "你有翅膀武器箱。|你有这种物品。|给。"

msgid "You do not have Wing Weapon Box. | Check again."
msgstr "你没有翅膀武器箱。|再检查一遍。"

msgid "Pick the desired Wing from the following rewards."
msgstr "从以下奖励中选择你想要的翅膀。"

msgid "¢Ü She was an angel come from heaven ~ ~ very cute ~ her I loved ... whoops! Since when were you there?"
msgstr "♪她是从天而降的天使~~非常可爱~她，我曾深爱……哎呀！你什么时候在那儿的？"

msgid "My body is cold¡¦hungry..also my sides are cold¡¦hopefully she accept my confession this time..??"
msgstr "我浑身发冷……饥饿……两侧也发凉……希望她这次能接受我的表白……？？"

msgid "I want to confess but I have no clothes. T.T hey there! Help me get some good clothes so I can confess my love. | I want to have some wedding clothes. I heard that if you spin the top infront of the town you can get the coupon to exchange for clothes?"
msgstr "我想表白，却没有衣服。T.T喂！帮我弄些好看的衣服，好让我表白我的爱意。|我想要婚纱。听说在镇前面抽陀螺就能拿到兑换衣服的券？"

msgid "Since I'm naked do I look funny to you? | you don't have the clothes yet?"
msgstr "既然我光着身子，是不是看着很滑稽？|你还没拿到衣服吗？"

msgid "That!!!  That's the exchange coupon for clothes!!! If I confess my love I'm sure she'll say yes 100%. Thank you so much! Here you must be hungry. Take this and eat it."
msgstr "那个！！那就是兑换衣服的券！！如果我表白，她一定会100%答应。太感谢了！给，你一定饿了。拿这个吃了吧。"

msgid "Don't you want to see these special items from the Eastern countries?"
msgstr "你不想看看这些来自东方国家的特别物品吗？"

msgid "I found something.. But I don't need it. Aren't you curious? You want it? Hey now. I can't just give it to you."
msgstr "我发现了点东西……但我不需要。你不好奇吗？你想要？别这样。我不能就这么给你。"

msgid "Hm.. Let's see..  If you have 'useful leather x 100' or ;Warmonger Evidence x 10."
msgstr "嗯……让我看看……如果你有'有用皮革x 100'或者'战争狂证据x 10'。"

msgid "Nothing's free, right? | If you defeat enemy you'll get the warmonger evidence and useful leather can be obtained by getting rid of your level or higher leveled monsters."
msgstr "天下没有免费的午餐，对吧？|击败敌人你就能获得战争狂证据，而有用皮革可以通过消灭与你同级或更高级的怪物获得。"

msgid "You know how to deal! Here you are~"
msgstr "你懂交易！给你~"

msgid "Hello! This is [VIP Specialist] Julian. Thank you for your interest in the Level Jumping Event. Please check out the below Event information."
msgstr "你好！我是[VIP Specialist] Julian。感谢你关注直升等级活动。请查看下面的活动信息。"

msgid "Level Jumping Event|When you reach Lv 50 -59, you will become Lv 73 or Lv 75 (for Premium User). Respective weapons/armors will be distributed.(1st Job)|When you reach Lv 60 ? 64, you will become Lv 74 or Lv 76 (for Premium User). Respective weapons/armors will be distributed. (2nd Job)|When you reach Lv 65 -74, you will become Lv 75 and respective weapons/armors will be distributed (2nd jobWhen you reach Lv 65 ? 74 (with the premium), you will become Lv 77 and respective weapons and armors will be distributed (2nd job|¡Ø You must reach the required level to participate in the Level Jumping Event."
msgstr "直升等级活动|当你达到50-59级时，将直升到73级或75级（付费用户）。会发放相应的武器/防具。（一转）|当你达到60-64级时，将直升到74级或76级（付费用户）。会发放相应的武器/防具。（二转）|当你达到65-74级时，将直升到75级并发放相应的武器/防具（二转）；当你达到65-74级（有付费）时，将直升到77级并发放相应的武器和防具（二转）|※ 你必须达到要求的等级才能参加直升等级活动。"

msgid "Would you like to participate in the Level Jumping Event?"
msgstr "你想参加直升等级活动吗？"

msgid "Your level does not qualify to participate in the Level Jumping Event."
msgstr "你的等级不符合参加直升等级活动的条件。"

msgid "22 Inventory Slots would be needed for Level Jumping Event. Please check your inventory space."
msgstr "直升等级活动需要22个背包格。请检查你的背包空间。"

msgid "Your level is between the levels of 50 and 59. You will become Lv 73 and Lv 75 (with the premium)"
msgstr "你的等级在50到59之间。你将直升到73级，有付费则到75级。"

msgid "Your level is between the levels of 60 and 64. You will become Lv 74 and Lv 76 (with the premium)"
msgstr "你的等级在60到64之间。你将直升到74级，有付费则到76级。"

msgid "Your level is between the levels of 65 and 74 (Premium not used). Your new level will be Lv 75."
msgstr "你的等级在65到74之间（未使用付费）。你的新等级将是75级。"

msgid "Your level is between the levels of 65 nd 76 (Premium used). Your new level will be Lv 77."
msgstr "你的等级在65到76之间（使用了付费）。你的新等级将是77级。"

msgid "Premium isn't being used. |Premium usage will result in +2 Levels when participating in the Level Jumping Event."
msgstr "未使用付费。|参加直升等级活动时使用付费会提升+2级。"

msgid "You have level-jumped already by participating in the Level Jumping Event."
msgstr "你已经通过参加直升等级活动直升过等级了。"

msgid "You do not have [Under the Castle Weapon Box]. | Check again, please."
msgstr "你没有[Under the Castle Weapon Box]。|请再检查一遍。"

msgid "You have the [Under the Castle Weapon Box]. | You have received this item. | Here you go."
msgstr "你有[Under the Castle Weapon Box]。|你已经收到这个物品了。|给。"

msgid "You do not have the certificate for this item."
msgstr "你没有该物品的证书。"

msgid "You are not qualified to participate in the Level Jump Event"
msgstr "你不符合参加直升等级活动的条件。"

msgid "sobbing¡¦    my bag¡¦   How can I lose it there? How am I going to get to school? T.T"
msgstr "啜泣……我的包……我怎么会把它弄丢在那儿？我要怎么去上学？T.T"

msgid "I lost my school supplies at the fishing area. T.T Please find it for me. 5 pencils, 1 eraser, 1 pencil box are missing. You can bring more to me."
msgstr "我在钓鱼的地方弄丢了学习用品。T.T请帮我找到它。丢了5支铅笔、1块橡皮、1个铅笔盒。你可以多带些给我。"

msgid "You haven't found the supplies yet? You aren't even a child and you're so slow. Come on. Get me 5 pencils, 1 eraser, 1 pencil box."
msgstr "你还没找到学习用品吗？你又不是小孩，动作这么慢。拜托。给我弄5支铅笔、1块橡皮、1个铅笔盒来。"

msgid "Yeah! Those are mine! Thank you!"
msgstr "好！那些是我的！谢谢！"

msgid "I lost my bag.. I want to have a new one. Could you get it for me from [Suspicious Eastern Merchant]? And talk to me again to get another quest."
msgstr "我把包弄丢了……我想要个新的。你能从[Suspicious Eastern Merchant]那儿给我弄一个吗？然后再跟我说话接另一个任务。"

msgid "I have enough school suppolies now. I'm gonna go fishing again¡¦ :)"
msgstr "我现在学习用品够了。我要再去钓鱼了……:)"

msgid "sigh¡¦   sobbing¡¦ T.T  my bag¡¦    you don't have my bag yet?"
msgstr "唉……啜泣……T.T我的包……你还没拿到我的包吗？"

msgid "Yeah!! That's my bag. Thank you! You are the best, <selfname>!"
msgstr "好！！那是我的包。谢谢！你最棒了，<selfname>！"

msgid "What? You need a bag? "
msgstr "什么？你需要一个包？"

msgid "I can't just give it to you. | Give me at least 5 useful leather."
msgstr "我不能就这么给你。|至少给我5个有用皮革。"

msgid "Bag can't just be made from nothing."
msgstr "包不能凭空做出来。"

msgid "oh you! You have some useful leather. | Give me 5 then I'll make you a bag."
msgstr "哦，你！你有些有用皮革。|给我5个，我就给你做个包。"

msgid "I have made the bag. Here, make a good use of it."
msgstr "包做好了。给，好好用吧。"

msgid "Hey you have no space in your bag."
msgstr "嘿，你包里没有空间。"

msgid "Are you kidding?You don't have enough Warmonger's Evidence."
msgstr "你在开玩笑吗？你的战争狂证据不够。"

msgid "Are you kidding? You don't have enough useful leather."
msgstr "你在开玩笑吗？你的有用皮革不够。"

msgid "Oh! You have the item! Will you give me the warmonger evidence or useful leather?"
msgstr "哦！你有那个物品！你要给我战争狂证据还是有用皮革？"

msgid "There's no space in your bag."
msgstr "你的包里没有空间。"

msgid "Thank you for the school supplies. But I don't have a bag. What am I gonna do? T.T"
msgstr "谢谢你的学习用品。但我没有包。我怎么办？T.T"

msgid "You are the best, <selfname>. Bag can be purchased from 'Suspicious Eastern Merchant'."
msgstr "你最棒了，<selfname>。包可以从'可疑的东方商人'那里买到。"

msgid "I'll give you <selfname> since I don't need this. It¡¯s the 'old box'. Heard that you can get random item."
msgstr "<selfname>，这个我不需要，就给你吧。这是'旧箱子'。听说能开出随机物品。"

msgid "You have something for me? I can only make one bag a day. | ah! You! Go visit the daydreaming girl. | She lost her bag."
msgstr "你有东西要给我吗？我每天只能做一个包。|啊！你！去找那个做白日梦的女孩吧。|她把自己的包弄丢了。"

msgid "Don't lose anymore stuff for today. "
msgstr "今天别再丢东西了。"

msgid "Did you get to see the sprout on the street? It's spring already. Go out and feel the spring air!"
msgstr "你看到街上的新芽了吗？已经是春天了。出去感受一下春天的气息吧！"

msgid "Please make 2 spaces in your bag."
msgstr "请在你的包里腾出2个空格。"

msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr "你想要什么？"

msgid "Please choose what you want"
msgstr "请选择你想要的"

msgid "I hope a good time"
msgstr "希望你度过愉快时光"

msgid "You are the citizen who defeated [Ronark Monument]! Do you want to cross this river?"
msgstr "你是击败过[罗纳克纪念碑]的公民！你想渡过这条河吗？"

msgid "You have not defeated [Ronark Monument]. If you pay me 1M noah, I will let you cross this river."
msgstr "你还没有击败[罗纳克纪念碑]。如果你付我100万诺亚，我就让你过河。"

msgid "You don¡¯t have 1M noah? Bring it to cross this river."
msgstr "你没有100万诺亚？拿来才能过河。"

msgid "Welcome. Did you get to see the Knight Captain outside of the town? They used to be our soldiers. After they died, they were resurrected by lich."
msgstr "欢迎。你在镇外见到骑士队长了吗？他们曾是我们的士兵。死后被巫妖复活了。"

msgid "I hope they rest now. Could you help? Help at least 20 of them."
msgstr "我希望他们现在能安息。你能帮忙吗？至少帮助其中20个。"

msgid "Don't you pity their souls?"
msgstr "你不可怜他们的灵魂吗？"

msgid "Thank you. Because of you they can rest now."
msgstr "谢谢。因为你，他们现在可以安息了。"

msgid "Oh I'm so glad to see you! Do you remember how you defeated the Knight captain the last time?"
msgstr "哦，见到你我太高兴了！你还记得上次你是怎么击败骑士队长的吗？"

msgid "There are still many wandering souls. Can we use your skills once again?"
msgstr "还有许多游荡的灵魂。我们能再借你的本事一用吗？"

msgid "(Look at the eyes..  There's so much dark circle¡¦)"
msgstr "（看着那双眼睛……黑眼圈好重……）"

msgid "Harpies are making noises so I can't sleep. Can you get rid of them?"
msgstr "鹰身女妖吵得我睡不着。你能除掉它们吗？"

msgid "You're still not done? I can't sleep a good night sleep at night."
msgstr "你还没办完？我晚上都睡不好觉。"

msgid "Now thanks to you. I can sleep."
msgstr "现在多亏了你。我能睡着了。"

msgid "Ah I'm so sleepy.  Hey there! You are!!"
msgstr "啊，我好困。嘿！就是你！！"

msgid "You really don't know? Those harpies are making weird noises! Please take care of them."
msgstr "你真的不知道？那些鹰身女妖发出怪声！请处理掉它们。"

msgid "Welcome. Heard that apostles are hosting a conference."
msgstr "欢迎。听说使徒们正在召开集会。"

msgid "I think they are trying to call out the evil. Please go take care of them."
msgstr "我想他们是想召唤出邪恶之物。请去处理掉他们。"

msgid "We don't have time."
msgstr "我们没有时间了。"

msgid "Thanks to you. I feel so much better."
msgstr "多亏了你。我感觉好多了。"

msgid "Welcome. The reason I called you is to tell you that the apostles are gathering around."
msgstr "欢迎。我叫你来，是想告诉你使徒们正在聚集。"

msgid "Well.. I'm not sure why.. But let's catch them first."
msgstr "唉……我不确定为什么……但我们先抓住他们吧。"

msgid "What are we going to do with trolls?"
msgstr "我们要拿巨魔怎么办？"

msgid "Trolls are setting something up. They are gathering around here.  I think they might be coming to invade us. Could you defeat them?"
msgstr "巨魔们正在布置什么。它们正在附近聚集。我想它们也许要来入侵我们。你能击败它们吗？"

msgid "Did you find out the reason trolls are gathering around?"
msgstr "你查明巨魔为什么聚集了吗？"

msgid "No!!!  That can't be?!!"
msgstr "不会吧！！那怎么可能？！"

msgid "Trolls have invaded the North town. There's no survivor. Could you take revenge?"
msgstr "巨魔入侵了北边的镇子。无人生还。你能复仇吗？"

msgid "Did you take revenge?"
msgstr "你复仇了吗？"

msgid "You have done well here..  Thank you."
msgstr "你在这儿做得很好……谢谢你。"

msgid "So many have died because of the trolls. So we organized punitive expedition."
msgstr "因为巨魔死了太多人。所以我们组织了讨伐队。"

msgid "We'll takd down Harp Troll Berserker. Could you defeat 40 of them for now?"
msgstr "我们要拿下琴妖巨魔狂战士。你能先击败它们40个吗？"

msgid "Is Harp Troll Berserker strong?"
msgstr "琴妖巨魔狂战士很强吗？"

msgid "You are so awesome!"
msgstr "你太厉害了！"

msgid "Our punitive force has been sieged by the berserkers."
msgstr "我们的讨伐军被狂战士们包围了。"

msgid "Could you go help them?"
msgstr "你能去帮帮他们吗？"

msgid "Their lives at stake."
msgstr "他们的生命危在旦夕。"

msgid "The boss has been finally appeared. 'Troll Captain' is the one. Heard they are powerful"
msgstr "首领终于出现了。就是'巨魔队长'。听说它们很强。"

msgid "Yes! You have the talent."
msgstr "是的！你有这个天赋。"

msgid "do you have an understanding of their power now?"
msgstr "你现在了解它们的实力了吗？"

msgid "They weren't so much different from Harp Troll Berserkers. Good job."
msgstr "它们和琴妖巨魔狂战士没什么太大差别。干得好。"

msgid "You know how troll captain is also a threatening being to us?"
msgstr "你知道巨魔队长对我们来说也是个威胁吧？"

msgid "We have to prevent the danger. Please kill 40 of them."
msgstr "我们必须阻止这场危险。请杀掉它们40个。"

msgid "You are still now done getting rid of them?"
msgstr "你还没把它们除掉吗？"

msgid "These days, the residents of Eslant can't go outside."
msgstr "这些日子，艾斯兰特的居民们都不敢出门。"

msgid "Because of 'Iron Claw'  At night they come out to find prey."
msgstr "因为'铁爪'。它们晚上出来觅食。"

msgid "Not yet..Not enough."
msgstr "还没……不够。"

msgid "Iron Claw' are still out. Could you get rid of them?"
msgstr "'铁爪'还在外面。你能除掉它们吗？"

msgid "There's no sign that the storm will be gone."
msgstr "风暴没有要平息的迹象。"

msgid "It's because of the storm apostles. Can you take care of them?"
msgstr "那是因为风暴使徒。你能处理掉他们吗？"

msgid "From the past week, it's happening again."
msgstr "从过去一周起，又开始发生了。"

msgid "Yeah. Could you take care of them?"
msgstr "是的。你能处理掉他们吗？"

msgid "So many are afraid these days."
msgstr "这些日子很多人都很害怕。"

msgid "A few days ago, they say that armors with no bodies were killing townspeople. Can you find out what's really happening? If it's the monster, please get rid of them."
msgstr "几天前，据说没有身体的铠甲在杀害镇民。你能查明到底发生了什么吗？如果是怪物，请除掉它们。"

msgid "You found out of their identity?!"
msgstr "你查明它们的身份了？！"

msgid "Doom knight? What's happening in Eslant¡¦"
msgstr "末日骑士？艾斯兰特到底发生了什么……"

msgid "You know those doom knights you defeated? They are the armors of our soldiers."
msgstr "你知道你击败的那些末日骑士吗？它们是我们士兵的铠甲。"

msgid "I think that's it..  Please make sure that our soldiers armors don't do that again."
msgstr "我想就是这样……请确保我们士兵的铠甲不要再那样了。"

msgid "Do you know of the Order of Destruction?"
msgstr "你知道毁灭教团吗？"

msgid "You can kill the enemy instantly. Death Wizard is using that magic. I'll give you the immune so that you can go get rid of them."
msgstr "你可以瞬间杀死敌人。死亡法师正在使用那种魔法。我会给你免疫，好让你去除掉他们。"

msgid "Thank you for the last time."
msgstr "谢谢你上次的帮忙。"

msgid "No..  It's beacause you've done the deed. Could you get rid of the death wizards one more time?"
msgstr "不……那是因为你自己做成了这件事。你能再去除掉那些死亡法师一次吗？"

msgid "Horse holding a pickaxe? That's a funny monster.."
msgstr "拿着镐子的马？那真是个滑稽的怪物……"

msgid "Horse with pickaxes are threatening the townspeople. Can't you help?"
msgstr "带着镐子的马正在威胁镇民。你不能帮帮忙吗？"

msgid "I knew you'd be the person."
msgstr "我就知道你会是那个人。"

msgid "Welcome. I hear that our soldiers are eating horse meat because of you."
msgstr "欢迎。我听说因为你，我们的士兵现在吃上马肉了。"

msgid "Since those monsters can be a good food supply to use. Can you take care of them again?"
msgstr "既然那些怪物可以成为不错的食物来源。你能再处理它们一次吗？"

msgid "Thank you. Eslant is getting full because of you now."
msgstr "谢谢。艾斯兰特现在因为你而热闹起来了。"

msgid "Because of us getting rid of trolls, magicians are mad and they are coming out."
msgstr "因为我们除掉了巨魔，魔法师们动怒了，正出来活动。"

msgid "Harp Troll Magicians are pretty powerful. Careful."
msgstr "琴妖巨魔魔法师相当强。小心。"

msgid "Welcome. Those harp troll magicians are gathering around now."
msgstr "欢迎。那些琴妖巨魔魔法师正在附近聚集。"

msgid "I think they are trying to call out the trolls evil god. Can you get rid of them and seal the magic?"
msgstr "我想他们是想召唤巨魔的邪神。你能除掉他们并封印魔法吗？"

msgid "Have you seen the human with wings from the South West?"
msgstr "你在西南方见过长翅膀的人吗？"

msgid "They are the monsters who are with the evil. We call them Raven Harpie.They had bad characters and are just killing anyone they see. Can you go get rid of them?"
msgstr "他们是与邪恶为伍的怪物。我们叫它们鸦鹰身女妖。它们性情恶劣，见到谁就杀谁。你能去除掉它们吗？"

msgid "Raven Harpies are invading the South west towns."
msgstr "鸦鹰身女妖正在入侵西南方向的镇子。"

msgid "You have to help once again."
msgstr "你得再帮一次忙。"

msgid "Chief of Raven Harpies are invading South west towns now."
msgstr "鸦鹰身女妖的首领现在正在入侵西南方向的镇子。"

msgid "Thank you! The name of the chief is 'Falcon.' Please defeat him."
msgstr "谢谢！那位首领的名字叫'猎鹰'。请击败它。"

msgid "Thank you for what you did the last time."
msgstr "感谢你上次所做的一切。"

msgid "However, those in retreat might come back to invade again. Can you get rid of the rest of the falcons?"
msgstr "不过，那些败退的也许会回来再次入侵。你能除掉剩下的猎鹰吗？"

msgid "Have you seen the necklace the chief was wearing?"
msgstr "你见过那位首领戴的项链吗？"

msgid "Can you get at least 10 necklaces?"
msgstr "你能弄到至少10条项链吗？"

msgid "That's the valuable necklace."
msgstr "那是贵重的项链。"

msgid "Can you sleep well these days?"
msgstr "你这些日子睡得好吗？"

msgid "What are you talking about? Harpies are crying outloud at night. Defeat them and bring me 10 harpies feathers."
msgstr "你在说什么？鹰身女妖晚上大声嚎叫。击败它们，给我带10根鹰身女妖羽毛来。"

msgid "If you want to earn experience bring me feathers."
msgstr "如果你想赚经验，就给我带羽毛来。"

msgid "Because of you I can sleep now."
msgstr "因为你，我现在能睡着了。"

msgid "Have you see the apostles?"
msgstr "你见过使徒们吗？"

msgid "They are carrying around the skull statue. Bring me 20 of that."
msgstr "他们随身带着骷髅雕像。给我带20个来。"

msgid "You do not have enough. "
msgstr "你带得不够。"

msgid "Thank you. Now I'll make a good use of them."
msgstr "谢谢。现在我会好好利用它们。"

msgid "I heard that the trolls bones are good for disc."
msgstr "我听说巨魔的骨头对椎间盘很好。"

msgid "Yep. We'll boil that and drink the soup. Could you bring 20 bones?"
msgstr "是的。我们会把它熬汤喝。你能带20根骨头来吗？"

msgid "Come on! Bring trolls bones."
msgstr "拜托！带巨魔的骨头来。"

msgid "Thank you. Because of you it'll help on fixing the disc."
msgstr "谢谢。因为你，这会有助于治疗椎间盘。"

msgid "Did you know? Gargoyles skin is harder than the rocks."
msgstr "你知道吗？石像鬼的皮肤比石头还硬。"

msgid "We'll need to study their skin and maybe we can improve our armors. Bring me 20 gargoyles wings."
msgstr "我们需要研究它们的皮肤，也许能改进我们的铠甲。给我带20根石像鬼翅膀来。"

msgid "If you bring the Gargoyle wings we'll be able to make improved armors."
msgstr "如果你带来石像鬼翅膀，我们就能制作改良铠甲。"

msgid "Have you seen the storm apostle?"
msgstr "你见过风暴使徒吗？"

msgid "The reason that they can call out the storm is due to their magical staff. Bring me 20 'Apostle's Staff.'"
msgstr "他们之所以能召唤风暴，是因为他们的法杖。给我带20根'使徒法杖'来。"

msgid "Hurry! Bring them to me."
msgstr "快点！把它们带给我。"

msgid "hahahaha I can not improve my magic."
msgstr "哈哈哈哈，我没法提升我的魔法。"

msgid "Have you seen the doom knight?"
msgstr "你见过末日骑士吗？"

msgid "Without the soul their armors are just wandering around. I want to know why so could you bring me 20 armor pieces?"
msgstr "没有了灵魂，它们的铠甲只是到处游荡。我想知道为什么，你能给我带20块铠甲碎片来吗？"

msgid "Hm.. Not yet?"
msgstr "嗯……还没？"

msgid "I need to study more. It's amazing."
msgstr "我需要再多研究。太神奇了。"

msgid "I've figured it out! There is the soul on the armor but we just can't see it!"
msgstr "我弄明白了！铠甲上有灵魂，只是我们看不见而已！"

msgid "Could you now bring me 'Resentment Soul' It's hard to find but if you keep defeating doom Knight you'll be able to obtain them."
msgstr "你现在能给我带'怨恨之魂'来吗？它很难找，但如果你持续击败末日骑士，就能获得它们。"

msgid "oh!! You got it!!!!  You are the best."
msgstr "哦！！！你弄到了！！！！你最棒。"

msgid "Do you know?"
msgstr "你知道吗？"

msgid "Heard that jewels are embeded on the Satiros horse's hoofs? Could you bring 20 hoofs?"
msgstr "听说萨提罗斯马的蹄子里嵌着宝石？你能带20只蹄子来吗？"

msgid "So shiny. I'll give you the reward later."
msgstr "好闪。我稍后给你奖励。"

msgid "Help me!!!  I can't sleep because of those harpies."
msgstr "帮帮我！！！因为那些鹰身女妖我睡不着。"

msgid "Please forgive me if I was rude the last time. Please get rid of those awful harpies. And bring me 20 'harpies wings'. Then I'll give you reward."
msgstr "如果我上次失礼了，请原谅我。请除掉那些讨厌的鹰身女妖。然后给我带20根'鹰身女妖翅膀'来。我会给你奖励。"

msgid "Thank you so much!"
msgstr "非常感谢！"

msgid "I'm the only one left at this spacious Ronarkland. | !! You can see me? That's great."
msgstr "这空旷的罗纳克兰德里只剩我一个了。|！！你能看见我？那太好了。"

msgid "You must be the God of Contribution. You want to be the God of War? Then deliver this Warmonger's evidence and 3 Warmonger's Coins to spy who's near the enemy gate within 6 hours."
msgstr "你一定是贡献之神。你想成为战争之神吗？那就在6小时内把这个战争狂证据和3枚战争狂金币送到敌营附近的间谍那里。"

msgid "You don't know what the ghost can do! You wanted to trick the ghost!?"
msgstr "你根本不知道鬼魂能做什么！你想耍鬼魂吗！？"

msgid "I don't think we can finish up today. Let's do it tomorrow."
msgstr "我觉得我们今天做不完了。明天再做吧。"

msgid "Because of you, he's able to enter nirvana. This is to show my appreciation."
msgstr "因为你，他得以进入涅槃。这是我的一点心意。"

msgid "I heard my friends soul is wandering around Eslant. | If you invade Eslant you'll meet the soul."
msgstr "我听说我朋友的灵魂在艾斯兰特附近游荡。|如果你入侵艾斯兰特，就会遇到那个灵魂。"

