msgstr "上次大地震让许多怪物迁徙了。地形也变了不少……|因此船夫们在拓宽的湖上做生意……我自己也想去坐坐看。替我去体验一次吧。体验完之后，去跟艾斯兰特的算命师讲讲我的事。"

msgid "I don't think I've done much for our country. | I think you might be the hero though. Could you prove your skills to me? | Please bring 3 warmongers Coin. And go visit Eslant Fortune teller."
msgstr "我觉得我为国家做的不算多。|不过我觉得你也许会是那个英雄。你能向我证明你的实力吗？|请带3枚战争狂金币来。然后去见艾斯兰特的算命师。"

msgid "Do you know the item called 'Start of the Change'? If you obtain it, bring it to me. It's related to the reason for the geographical different in Ronarkland. Bring it to me to get reward."
msgstr "你知道叫'变化之始'的物品吗？如果你弄到了，就带给我。它与罗纳克兰德地形差异的原因有关。把它带给我就能获得奖励。"

msgid "You haven't started 'Start of the Change'"
msgstr "你还没开始'变化之始'"

msgid "Bring 10 start of the change, then after drawing you'll get a chance to receive prize."
msgstr "带10个变化之始来，抽奖后你就有机会获得奖品。"

msgid "Because of the Earthquake, the geography has been changed in Ronarkland. How do you like the new Ronarkland?"
msgstr "因为地震，罗纳克兰德的地形改变了。你觉得新的罗纳克兰德怎么样？"

msgid "You don't have enough space in your bag."
msgstr "你的背包空间不足。"

msgid "Didn't the dead war soul told you something?"
msgstr "战死的灵魂没告诉你什么吗？"

msgid "If you get recognized as the God of Transportation by the war soul, you'll be able to receive the test."
msgstr "如果你被战魂认可为运输之神，就能接受考验。"

msgid "If you get recognized as the God of Contribution by the war soul, you'll be able to receive the test."
msgstr "如果你被战魂认可为贡献之神，就能接受考验。"

msgid "This is!  God job. You brought the war coin. You'll contribute all of those? If you contribute all, you'll become the god of contribution."
msgstr "就是这个！干得好。你带来了战争金币。你要把这些全部捐献出来吗？如果全部捐献，你就会成为贡献之神。"

msgid "If you bring warmongers coins you'll be accepted as the contribution god."
msgstr "如果你带来战争狂金币，就会被认可为贡献之神。"

msgid "You haven't passed the test for transportation. "
msgstr "你还没有通过运输考验。"

msgid "You haven't passed the test for contribution."
msgstr "你还没有通过贡献考验。"

msgid "If you are done with what I told you to do, go talk to Eslant Fortune teller."
msgstr "如果你做完了我交代的事，去跟艾斯兰特的算命师谈谈。"

msgid "You are not the god of transportation."
msgstr "你还不是运输之神。"

msgid "You are not the god of contribution."
msgstr "你还不是贡献之神。"

msgid "You've done well today. Come back tomorrow."
msgstr "你今天做得很好。明天再来。"

msgid "If you want to take revenge for the war soul you'll need to defeat 3 enemy."
msgstr "如果你想为战魂复仇，就需要击败3名敌人。"

msgid "Bring me at least 3."
msgstr "至少给我带3个来。"

msgid "You'll need to pass the test in order to become the war God. | In order to meet the resented war soul you'll need to invade enemy's guard tower."
msgstr "你需要通过考验才能成为战神。|为了见到含恨的战魂，你需要入侵敌人的哨塔。"

msgid "Spy is located where the enemy's camp entrance is."
msgstr "间谍就位于敌营入口处。"

msgid "In order to test your skills, I'll take all the warmongers' coins."
msgstr "为了测试你的实力，我会收走所有战争狂金币。"

msgid "It's childrens day soon. But I have no money to buy something for my children."
msgstr "快到儿童节了。但我没有钱给我的孩子们买东西。"

msgid "Really? Thank you¡¦  I'll really repay you back for this. | But I have one more favor to ask you."
msgstr "真的吗？谢谢……我真的会为此报答你的。|不过我还有一件事想拜托你。"

msgid "I have to wrap the gift but the wrapper is near the Chaos area. Could you bring me one?"
msgstr "我得包装礼物，但包装纸在混沌区域附近。你能给我带一张来吗？"

msgid "If you participate in Chaos you'll get one wrapper."
msgstr "如果你参加混沌，就能得到一张包装纸。"

msgid "Thank you so much! Thank you..   My children will love these gifts too. || This isn't much but I want to give you this traditional box. I don't need it so I'll give it to you."
msgstr "非常感谢！谢谢……我的孩子们也会喜欢这些礼物的。||这虽然不多，但我想把这个传统盒子送给你。我不需要它，就给你吧。"

msgid "sobbing..(small girl crying sadly at the corner.)"
msgstr "啜泣……（一个小女孩在角落里伤心地哭着。）"

msgid "Sobbing..  For parents day I collected carnations but monsters have stolen them all. T.T"
msgstr "啜泣……为了父母节我收集了康乃馨，但怪物把它们都偷走了。T.T"

msgid "If you are hunting and you see carnations, could you bring 10 of them? | There is more than one monster. T.T"
msgstr "如果你狩猎时看到康乃馨，能给我带10朵来吗？|怪物不止一只。T.T"

msgid "You don't have enough carnations."
msgstr "你的康乃馨不够。"

msgid "Wow! Thank you!!!! I'll give you one."
msgstr "哇！谢谢！！！！我给你一个。"

msgid "Welcome. The reason I called you is to tell you that there's celebration for the God's coming. Could you bring some lanterns?"
msgstr "欢迎。我叫你来，是想告诉你有一个为神明降临而举办的庆典。你能带些灯笼来吗？"

msgid "If you dismantle items that are normal to above with [Unknown Narki] you'll be able to get the lanterns. Bring me 5."
msgstr "如果你用[Unknown Narki]拆解普通以上的物品，就能得到灯笼。给我带5个来。"

msgid "You don't have all 5."
msgstr "你还没凑齐5个。"

msgid "Good. I'll now give you a small gift from Kaishan."
msgstr "好。我现在就给你一份来自Kaishan的小礼物。"

msgid "We'll need to hang the lanter once a day."
msgstr "我们每天需要挂一次灯笼。"

msgid "Hey could you do me a favor?"
msgstr "嘿，你能帮我个忙吗？"

msgid "I want to make hammer for my teacher for teacher's day. But I can't make it because I lack in ingrediants."
msgstr "我想为教师节给我师父做一把锤子。但因为材料不够，我做不出来。"

msgid "There's a guy named [Unknown Narki] at Moradon. He's the one who can make the [master craftman's touch]. Bring me 5 master craftmans' touch."
msgstr "莫拉登有个叫[Unknown Narki]的人。他是能制作[大师工匠之手]的人。给我带5个大师工匠之手来。"

msgid "Thank you. (a bit later)  I'm done with the hammer! Bring this to my teacher heppa."
msgstr "谢谢。（过了一会儿）锤子我做好了！把这个带给我师父heppa。"

msgid "My disciple, Shojin is giving me this? Oh.. Thank you. This must be heavy for you to deliver. Take this."
msgstr "我的弟子Shojin要把这个给我？哦……谢谢。这东西带给你一定很重。拿好这个。"

msgid "I got mixed up with the other date..  Haha. Could you come back tomorrow?"
msgstr "我跟别的日子搞混了……哈哈。你能明天再来吗？"

msgid "Rent, Living expense, my daughter's studying expense, interest, supply expense. Ah!!!! What am I gonna do?"
msgstr "房租、生活费、我女儿的学费、利息、补给费。啊！！！！我怎么办？"

msgid "Tell Shojin that I'll make a good use of the hammer. Come back tomorrow."
msgstr "告诉Shojin，我会好好用这把锤子的。明天再来。"

msgid "It's teacher's day and my only disciple only knows of work."
msgstr "今天是教师节，我唯一的弟子却只知道工作。"

msgid "Can you go see if Shojin is preparing something for me?"
msgstr "你能去看看Shojin是不是在为我准备什么吗？"

msgid "OH!!! This is an awesome hammer! I like it a lot~ Tell Shojin thank you.  Take one for yourself."
msgstr "哦！！！这真是把超棒的锤子！我太喜欢了~替我谢谢Shojin。你自己也拿一个。"

msgid "Was Shojin preparing for something?"
msgstr "Shojin在准备什么吗？"

msgid "Are you kidding me? You have no money. You think I'm a beggar? There's the owner at the towns entrance who has an envelop full of money. Give that to me."
msgstr "你在开玩笑吗？你身无分文。你以为我是乞丐？镇子入口有个老板，拿着一个装满钱的信封。把那个给我。"

msgid "10 year Anniversary Celebration Description."
msgstr "十周年庆典说明。"

msgid "It's free experience of Knight Online period."
msgstr "这是《骑士OL》免费体验期。"

msgid "Knight Genie Testing Period Description."
msgstr "骑士精灵测试期说明。"

msgid "Hello, May are you help you?"
msgstr "你好，我能帮你什么吗？"

msgid "If you bring a fee of  3000 Noah, the [Tycoon] Kaishan will give you the first transfer. [Tycoon] Kaishan is up in the north from the center of Moradon."
msgstr "如果你带3000诺亚费用来，[Tycoon] Kaishan会给你第一次传送。[Tycoon] Kaishan在莫拉登中心往北。"

msgid "Welcome. Please defeat the monster Cake with a fork and bring me 5 slices of cake. "
msgstr "欢迎。请用叉子击败蛋糕怪物，给我带5片蛋糕来。"

msgid "Use the fork to defeat the enemy."
msgstr "用叉子击败敌人。"

msgid "Yay! You've got it. Wait here. I'll lift off the spell. Yap! | You'll be able to eat now. Take the cake you want."
msgstr "耶！你弄到了。在这儿等。我来解除咒语。呀！|你现在可以吃了。拿你想要的蛋糕吧。"

msgid "I'm so hungry. Cooks are making the cake with special ingredients but I have no time to go eat."
msgstr "我好饿。厨师们正在用特别的材料做蛋糕，但我没时间去吃。"

msgid "Cake!...cake!...cake!..."
msgstr "蛋糕！……蛋糕！……蛋糕！……"

msgid "This!! It's cake! Thank you! I didn't ask you for it but I'll give this to you now."
msgstr "这个！！是蛋糕！谢谢！我没向你要，但现在把这个给你。"

msgid "Welcome. These days there are libertines who are attacking towns women. Bring the bamboo from the merchant and punish them. Bring the documents libertines have."
msgstr "欢迎。这些日子有一些登徒子在袭击镇上的女人。从商人那里拿竹子去惩罚他们。把那些登徒子持有的文件带来。"

msgid "You aren't done punishing them."
msgstr "你还没惩罚完他们。"

msgid "This must be!!!   How can the libertines have the appreciation letter! Who are they?"
msgstr "这一定是！！！！那些登徒子怎么会有感谢信！他们到底是什么人？"

msgid "You had a tough day. Thank you. Come back tomorrow."
msgstr "你今天辛苦了。谢谢。明天再来。"

