msgstr "今年是第10年，在这10年里怪物力量积聚而形成的成熟精华，如果你带回来，我就把它换成装有10周年礼物的箱子。|如果猎杀过弱的怪物，精华会散掉，所以请务必猎杀至少同等水平的怪物。"

msgid "I'm almost out with the 10 year boxes."
msgstr "我的10周年箱子快用完了。"

msgid "Whoa! You got it! Here. Here's the gift I promised. Take the Gift Box to Moi to exchange."
msgstr "哇！你弄到了！给。这是我答应你的礼物。把礼盒拿给Moi兑换。"

msgid "You don't have any gold to turn in."
msgstr "你没有可以上交的金子。"

msgid "You don't have any space in your bag. Make some space then I'll give you cake."
msgstr "你的包里没有空间。腾出些空间我就给你蛋糕。"

msgid "You did hard work today.  Please come back tomorrow."
msgstr "你今天辛苦了。请明天再来。"

msgid "Celebrate the 10th anniversary of the Knight Online!"
msgstr "庆祝《骑士OL》十周年！"

msgid "10 year Anniversary Celebration Description. You have [Chaos Wing Exchange Coupon]"
msgstr "十周年庆典说明。你持有[混沌翅膀兑换券]"

msgid "[10 year Anniversary Chaos Wing Exchange Coupon] is exchanged with [Knight Chaos Day Wing]. "
msgstr "[10周年混沌翅膀兑换券]会兑换成[Knight Chaos Day Wing]。"

msgid "Have a fun at [Knight Online]."
msgstr "祝你在[骑士OL]玩得开心。"

msgid "Which [Knight Chaos Day Wing] will you exchange?"
msgstr "你要兑换哪个[Knight Chaos Day Wing]？"

msgid "You do not have the coupon."
msgstr "你没有兑换券。"

msgid "Thank you for your support for Knight Online. | Pick the box you want."
msgstr "感谢你支持《骑士OL》。|选你想要的箱子。"

msgid "You do not have the box. You'll need to bring the item."
msgstr "你没有箱子。你需要把物品带来。"

msgid "Welcome. You have the Dragon Box. What would you like to exchange it with?"
msgstr "欢迎。你有龙箱。你想用它兑换什么？"

msgid "You do not have the Dragon Box. You can obtain Dragon Box from Power Up Store."
msgstr "你没有龙箱。你可以从能量商店获得龙箱。"

msgid "Let's see what's in the [Dragon Box]. | It has this kind of item! | Here you go."
msgstr "让我们看看[龙箱]里有什么。|里面有这种物品！|给。"

msgid "You need at least 4 bag spaces. | Come back once you have enough space."
msgstr "你至少需要4个背包空格。|等你有足够空间时再来。"

msgid "Welcome. If you have the Rosetta Armor Voucher, we'll trade you with one armor of your selection."
msgstr "欢迎。如果你有罗塞塔铠甲兑换券，我们会用你所选的一件铠甲跟你交换。"

msgid "You do not have the Rosetta Armor Voucher. You can obtain the voucher through Higher Monster Summoning Staff."
msgstr "你没有罗塞塔铠甲兑换券。你可以通过高级怪物召唤法杖获得兑换券。"

msgid "This is what you got from [Rosetta Armor Voucher].|Here you go."
msgstr "这是你从[罗塞塔铠甲兑换券]里得到的东西。|给。"

msgid "You need to have at least 1 space in your inventory."
msgstr "你的背包里至少需要1个空格。"

msgid "You already received the gift. Don't be so greedy."
msgstr "你已经领过礼物了。别这么贪心。"

msgid "Welcome. If you bring the server competition event coupon, we give you one of the items."
msgstr "欢迎。如果你带来服务器竞赛活动兑换券，我们会给你其中一件物品。"

msgid "Thank you for your participation for Server Competition Event."
msgstr "感谢你参加服务器竞赛活动。"

msgid "What is that old ancient book?"
msgstr "那本古老的古书是什么？"

msgid "Man..  What should we do? You saw the start that fell at Logos? Something bad will happen!"
msgstr "唉……我们该怎么办？你看到坠落在罗各斯的那颗星了吧？要出事了！"

msgid "We don't have any¡¦   Does it mean that God has abandoned us?"
msgstr "我们什么都没有……这是否意味着神已经抛弃了我们？"

msgid "¡¦!! Yeah! That¡¯s what we can do."
msgstr "……！！对！我们可以这么做。"

msgid "From the Logos Prophecy, moment like this... (turning pages) 3:6, it says.. Stars fall from the sky and there a knight, who is born again after enduring death, will save this world."
msgstr "根据罗各斯预言，像这样的时刻……（翻着书页）3:6，上面写着……星辰从天而降，有一位历经死亡而重生的骑士，将拯救这个世界。"

msgid "Yes..  This hasn't happened but the time has come now."
msgstr "是的……这还没发生，但现在那个时刻已经到了。"

msgid "Reincarnation can be tried here now. But it's not easy. It'll be painful. But would you really like to reincarnate?"
msgstr "现在可以在这里尝试转世了。但不容易。会很痛苦。不过你真的想转世吗？"

msgid "If that's what you wish for. But prove how strong you are."
msgstr "如果这是你的愿望。但请证明你有多强。"

msgid "Become level 83 and Exp 100%."
msgstr "达到83级且经验100%。"

msgid "You don't have enough EXP. You have be to be level 83 with 100 % EXP."
msgstr "你的经验不够。你必须达到83级且经验100%。"

msgid "Congratulation on your proving of your power. The second test is about your wealth. Without wealth, you won't be able to be a hero."
msgstr "恭喜你证明了自己的力量。第二场考验是关于你的财富。没有财富，你成不了英雄。"

msgid "If you don't wanna believe it it's fine."
msgstr "你不想相信也没关系。"

msgid "Bring 100,000,000 Noah?"
msgstr "带100,000,000诺亚来？"

msgid "you still don't have 100,000,000 Noah?"
msgstr "你还是没有100,000,000诺亚？"

msgid "My eyes weren't wrong. You passed the first two tests. Now on to the last test. I want to test your ability."
msgstr "我的眼睛没看错。你通过了前两场考验。现在进行最后一场考验。我想测试你的能力。"

msgid "Bring contribution point 10,000."
msgstr "带贡献度10,000来。"

msgid "Anyone can't be a hero, you know."
msgstr "谁都成不了英雄，你知道的。"

msgid "this is the last test. So cheers!"
msgstr "这是最后一场考验。那就干杯吧！"

msgid "The mission has completed. Here's the qualificiation of the reincarnation. If you want to move on to the next life, come back. And the body after reincarnation will be stronger than you right now. And I'll take all the contribution."
msgstr "任务完成了。这是转世的资格。如果你想进入下一世，就再来。而且转世后的身体会比你现在更强。我会收走所有贡献度。"

msgid "Are you ready? You'll have to be done with the 2nd job change. Will you incarnate now?"
msgstr "你准备好了吗？你必须完成二转。你现在要转世吗？"

msgid "ah¡¦ Logos Stars are falling."
msgstr "啊……罗各斯之星正在坠落。"

msgid "I knew you would be the one!! | Now, there's the second mission."
msgstr "我就知道会是你！！|现在，还有第二个任务。"

msgid "This!! Shiny thing!!  It's a gold bar! If you want to complete, come back to me again. I'll take the gold bar now."
msgstr "这个！！闪亮的东西！！是金条！如果你想完成，就再回来找我。我现在把金条收下。"

msgid "You don't have enough contribution point. If you want to prove your skill, you'll need to offer 10,000 contribution point."
msgstr "你的贡献度不够。如果你想证明自己的本事，就需要捐献10,000贡献度。"

msgid "You do not qualify for reincarnation. You'll need to pass the three tests."
msgstr "你不符合转世条件。你需要通过三项考验。"

msgid "You haven't passed the first test of power. You'll need to first pass the first test."
msgstr "你还没有通过第一场力量考验。你需要先通过第一场考验。"

msgid "You haven't passed the second test of wealth. If you want to prove your reputation pass the second test of wealth."
msgstr "你还没有通过第二场财富考验。如果你想证明你的声望，就通过第二场财富考验。"

msgid "Only the highest level can experience the rebirth."
msgstr "只有最高等级的人才能体验重生。"

msgid "You already passed the second test!"
msgstr "你已经通过第二场考验了！"

msgid "You already passed the first test!"
msgstr "你已经通过第一场考验了！"

msgid "You already passed the third test!"
msgstr "你已经通过第三场考验了！"

msgid "Welcome. Because of the War, there's a great loss. If you bring the warmongers evidence by catching the enemies, we'll reward you. Bring me the evidence and I'll give you the item."
msgstr "欢迎。因为战争，损失惨重。如果你通过捕获敌人带来战争狂证据，我们会奖励你。把证据带给我，我就给你物品。"

msgid "Pick the one you want | 10 - Buff Jewel | 30 - Blessing or Soul Potion | 50 - Ibex or Crisis Transformation Scroll | 100 - Ascent Scroll | 200 - Weapon Enchant Scroll | 500 - Masters Teaching. | 1,000 - Special Exchange Coupon x 1"
msgstr "选你想要的|10 - 增益宝石|30 - 祝福或灵魂药水|50 - 岩羊或危机变身卷轴|100 - 飞升卷轴|200 - 武器附魔卷轴|500 - 大师教诲。|1,000 - 特别兑换券 x 1"

msgid "You do not have enough warmonger evidence. Bring at least 10"
msgstr "你的战争狂证据不够。至少带10个来"

msgid "Welcome. Currently there's war going on. If you bring the most warmonger evidence and you are one of the top 3 people who brought the most evidence you'll get reward. Will you offer the evidence?"
msgstr "欢迎。目前正在开战。如果你带来最多的战争狂证据，并且是带证据最多的前3名之一，就能获得奖励。你愿意捐献证据吗？"

msgid "You'll need at least one evidence."
msgstr "你至少需要一个证据。"

msgid "You do not have enough warmonger evidence."
msgstr "你的战争狂证据不够。"

msgid "Welcome. I'm Julianne. If you bring the dice I'll get you roll the dice for the event. Will you bring the dice to me?"
msgstr "欢迎。我是Julianne。如果你带来骰子，我就让你为活动掷骰子。你愿意把骰子带给我吗？"

msgid "You do not have the dice. You can get a dice every 2 hours. 3 dices per day max. It'll be in the inbox."
msgstr "你没有骰子。你每2小时可以获得一个骰子。每天最多3个。它会进收件箱。"

msgid "Congratulations on your premium. Give me the premium box to exchange it with one of the DC, WAR, EXP."
msgstr "恭喜你购买了高级会员。把高级会员箱给我，就可以在DC、WAR、EXP中选一个兑换。"

msgid "You do not have a premium box.! You can get a premium box, please bring it to me ^ ^"
msgstr "你没有高级会员箱！你可以获得一个高级会员箱，请带给我 ^ ^"

msgid "You¡¯ve come to exchange the event wing coupon."
msgstr "你是来兑换活动翅膀券的。"

msgid "oh.. That's the special item!"
msgstr "哦……那是特别物品！"

msgid "I'll give you the item that you can use for 14 days."
msgstr "我会给你一个可以使用14天的物品。"

msgid "Welcome. It's July 7th! Hope someone bring me chocolate and flowers."
msgstr "欢迎。今天是七月初七！希望有人给我送巧克力和花。"

msgid "Thank you! Then could you bring 20 each?"
msgstr "谢谢！那你能各带20个来吗？"

msgid "Thank yhou. Here's the gift I made as I was thinking of you. Take it please."
msgstr "谢谢。这是我想着你做的礼物。请拿好。"

msgid "Do I have to be single for this year too?"
msgstr "今年我又得当单身汉吗？"

