msgstr "欢迎。如果你有混沌翅膀兑换券，我们会为你兑换。"

msgid "Congratulations on being selected. Which wing will you want?"
msgstr "恭喜你被选中。你想要哪种翅膀？"

msgid "You do not have the chaos Wing exchange coupon."
msgstr "你没有混沌翅膀兑换券。"

msgid "10 year emblem Exchange description."
msgstr "十周年徽章兑换说明。"

msgid "you do not have 10 year emblem."
msgstr "你没有十周年徽章。"

msgid "You do not have [Event] War Hero Wing Exchange Coupon."
msgstr "你没有[活动]战争英雄翅膀兑换券。"

