msgstr "我们已经兑换了战争英雄的翅膀。"

msgid "You don't have knightage so you can't apply the warmonger evidence. You'll need to join the knightage first."
msgstr "你没有骑士团身份，所以无法上交战争狂证据。你需要先加入骑士团。"

