msgstr "欢迎。GNGWC说明"

msgid "Clan Selection Description"
msgstr "公会选择说明"

msgid "Will you register Pathos Tribute?"
msgstr "你要报名参加帕索斯贡品吗？"

msgid "You do not have Pathos Tribute."
msgstr "你没有帕索斯贡品。"

msgid "You do not have logos Tribute."
msgstr "你没有罗各斯贡品。"

msgid "Will you register Logos Tribute?"
msgstr "你要报名参加罗各斯贡品吗？"

msgid "You'll need contribution point 100 and 100000 Noah."
msgstr "你需要贡献度100和100000诺亚。"

msgid "You don't have enough contribution point."
msgstr "你的贡献度不够。"

msgid "You don't have enough Noah."
msgstr "你的诺亚不够。"

msgid "You don't have empty space in your bag."
msgstr "你的包里没有空格。"

msgid "You can only exchange logos tribute once a day. Come back tomorrow."
msgstr "你每天只能兑换一次罗各斯贡品。明天再来。"

msgid "Welcome. Facebook Like Event description."
msgstr "欢迎。Facebook点赞活动说明。"

msgid "You have the 'like' coupon."
msgstr "你持有'点赞'兑换券。"

msgid "Only the ones who join the knightage can offer."
msgstr "只有加入骑士团的人才能捐献。"

msgid "Welcome, good to see you again. Near the new land, if you defeat the enemy you'll be able to obtain new chestnuts. Bring me those."
msgstr "欢迎，很高兴再次见到你。在新大陆附近，如果你击败敌人，就能获得新栗子。把那些带给我。"

msgid "Thank you. Bring me 10 of them. In return I'll give you one of the following 3 year ginseng, 3 year red ginseng, Sea cucumber stew and steamed sea cucumber. And the scroll that you'll be able to transform into me. :)"
msgstr "谢谢。给我带10个来。作为回报，我会给你以下之一：3年人参、3年红参、海参汤和蒸海参。还有一张能把你变成我的卷轴。:)"

msgid "You have the new chestnut! I need 10 of that. Give me then I'll reward you."
msgstr "你有新栗子了！我需要10个。给我，我就奖励你。"

msgid "Warrior! We're in trouble!"
msgstr "勇士！我们有麻烦了！"

msgid "Monsters have captured the rabbits who need to pount in a mortar."
msgstr "怪物抓走了那些需要在研钵里舂的兔子。"

msgid "20 of the rabbits. Please rescue them."
msgstr "20只兔子。请救出它们。"

msgid "What happened to our rabbits?"
msgstr "我们的兔子怎么了？"

msgid "Wow! Thank you warrior! Rabbits are free now. This is the gift from rabbits!"
msgstr "哇！谢谢你，勇士！兔子们自由了。这是兔子们送的礼物！"

msgid "Look ta this, Warrior. I've picked up some weapons around under the castle."
msgstr "看看这个，勇士。我在城堡之下附近捡到了一些武器。"

msgid "I can't even use them all. Will you want to use some?"
msgstr "我用都用不完。你想用一些吗？"

msgid "I can't just give them to you. I can lend you though. For about 6 hours. Bring me Rabbit or Chestnut x 20."
msgstr "我不能就这么给你。不过可以借给你。大约6小时。给我带兔子或栗子x 20来。"

msgid "Which one will you want to borrow? It's only for today."
msgstr "你想借哪一个？仅限今天。"

msgid "You don't have enough rabbit or chestnuts."
msgstr "你的兔子或栗子不够。"

msgid "Welcome. I'm here to celebrate thanksgiving. Have a great thanksgiving!"
msgstr "欢迎。我来庆祝感恩节。感恩节快乐！"

msgid "You do not have enough new chestnuts."
msgstr "你的新栗子不够。"

msgid "You have rescued at least 20 rabbits. Give it to me then I'll give you reward."
msgstr "你已经救出至少20只兔子了。交给我，我就给你奖励。"

msgid "You can use the renting system until October 1st."
msgstr "你可以使用租借系统直到10月1日。"

msgid "Do you know that when there's full moon there's a giant bird infront of the Moradon. Some of the people are shocked just seeing the shadow of this giant bird. What type of bird would this be? I hear that the bird appears every 8 hours."
msgstr "你知道月圆时莫拉登前面会有一只巨鸟吗？有些人光看到这巨鸟的影子就吓一跳。这会是哪种鸟呢？我听说这只鸟每8小时出现一次。"

msgid "You can only lend the wepon once."
msgstr "你只能借一次武器。"

msgid "You brought it! Which will you give me?"
msgstr "你把它带来了！你要给我哪一个？"

msgid "You don't have enough rabbits."
msgstr "你的兔子不够。"

msgid "You don't have enough new chestnuts."
msgstr "你的新栗子不够。"

msgid "You don't have enough rabbits!"
msgstr "你的兔子不够！"

msgid "Welcome, we are lending one item per day for free. Items are fire crackers, MP potion, HP potion, or Eagle Wing. It's random. Will you want one?"
msgstr "欢迎，我们每天免费借出一件物品。物品是爆竹、MP药水、HP药水或鹰之翼。是随机的。你想要一个吗？"

msgid "Monsters have captured the rabbits who need to pount in a mortar. If you rescue them I'll give you reward."
msgstr "怪物抓走了那些需要在研钵里舂的兔子。如果你救出它们，我就给你奖励。"

msgid "You don't have the rabbits yet?"
msgstr "你还没有兔子？"

msgid "You rescued the rabbits Thank you. Pick the one you want."
msgstr "你救出了兔子。谢谢。选你想要的那个。"

msgid "You already received the gift for today. Come back tomorrow."
msgstr "你已经领过今天的礼物了。明天再来。"

msgid "You don't have enough rabbit."
msgstr "你的兔子不够。"

