msgstr "恭喜你获胜！你可以兑换有效期30天的GNGWC徽章。"

msgid "For under the castle you can enter only on Fridays between the hours of 20 and 24 hours. You can't enter any other times."
msgstr "城堡之下只能在周五的20点到24点之间进入。其他时间无法进入。"

