msgstr "你没有WAR锦标赛徽章兑换券"

msgid "Congratulation!!!"
msgstr "恭喜！！！"

msgid "Welcome. We're exchanging cash item for the reward of the maintenance. The item will only be valid for one day. Select the menu to exchange the item."
msgstr "欢迎。我们正在把现金道具兑换成维护奖励。该物品仅有效期一天。请选择菜单兑换物品。"

msgid "You don't have the item voucher."
msgstr "你没有物品兑换券。"

msgid "Thank you for your support for Knight Online."
msgstr "感谢你支持《骑士OL》。"

msgid "Do you want to receive benefits of [Switching Premium]?"
msgstr "你想领取[切换高级会员]的福利吗？"

