msgstr "你手上的不是[切换高级会员]。请检查是不是别的高级道具。"

msgid "This is previous! You have the new weapon box. Congratulations.| Which weapon would you want?"
msgstr "这是旧的！你有新武器箱。恭喜。|你想要哪件武器？"

msgid "Hope you make a good use of the power of Dragon."
msgstr "希望你好好运用龙的力量。"

msgid "I cannot give you this item because the dragon's power isn't balanced. | Once the power's balanced we'll exchange it for you."
msgstr "因为龙的力量不平衡，我无法给你这个物品。|等力量平衡了我们再为你兑换。"

msgid "Welcome. It's the 2013 new years. Happy new year everyone!"
msgstr "欢迎。到2013年新年了。大家新年快乐！"

msgid "Help <selfname>. T.T We're trying to make rice cake soup but on the way back after getting the item, monsters have stolen the item. Could you please find 5 of what we lost?"
msgstr "帮帮<selfname>。T.T我们想做年糕汤，但在拿东西回来的路上，怪物把东西偷走了。你能帮我们找出丢失的5样东西吗？"

msgid "You haven't found the rice cake soup ingredients? You just need 5."
msgstr "你还没找到年糕汤的材料吗？你只需要5样。"

msgid "oh, <selfname>! Thank you. Our children can eat the soup now because of you."
msgstr "哦，<selfname>！谢谢。因为你，我们的孩子们现在能喝汤了。"

msgid "Welcome. We're having the event for the users who are enjoying the under the castle renewal."
msgstr "欢迎。我们正在为享受城堡之下翻新的用户举办活动。"

msgid "Defeat the Under the Castle Boss and bring 'Wing of Purious' 'Seal Piece of Pluwiton', and 'Pluwiton's Horn' then I'll give you the voucher."
msgstr "击败城堡之下的首领，带回'Wing of Purious'、'Seal Piece of Pluwiton'和'Pluwiton's Horn'，我就给你兑换券。"

msgid "If you turn in the voucher to me, after drawing and you become the winner you'll get the weapon exchange coupon! If you bring more vouchers your chance of winning will increase!"
msgstr "如果你把兑换券交给我，抽奖后中奖者就能获得武器兑换券！你带越多兑换券，中奖机会就越高！"

msgid "You have 3 ingredients for Under the Castle. Will you exchange them for a voucher?"
msgstr "你有3个城堡之下的材料。你想用它们兑换一张兑换券吗？"

msgid "Welcome, for the new year there's a competition for selecting the warmonger. Defeat the enemy to collect the evidence of warmonger. Bring them to me to receive gifts."
msgstr "欢迎，为了新年，有一个选出战争狂的比赛。击败敌人收集战争狂证据。把它们带给我领礼物。"

msgid "You do not have warmonger evidence."
msgstr "你没有战争狂证据。"

msgid "Thank you. Here's the gift I'm giving you.l"
msgstr "谢谢。这是我给你的礼物。"

msgid "Welcome! In celebration of this year's Valentine's Day, we will host a tournament to select a War Hero. "
msgstr "欢迎！为了庆祝今年的情人节，我们将举办一场选出战争英雄的锦标赛。"

msgid "We're gathering the evidence for selecting the true War Hero."
msgstr "我们正在收集证据，以选出真正的战争英雄。"

msgid "It's simple! Defeat the enemy in War zones to collect War Hero Evidence. Bring 10 and exchange them for a small gift."
msgstr "很简单！在战区击败敌人收集战争英雄证据。带10个来就能兑换一份小礼物。"

msgid "You do not have enough War Hero evidence. "
msgstr "你的战争英雄证据不够。"

msgid "You do not want to receive my gift? There's no space in your inventory!"
msgstr "你不想领我的礼物吗？你的背包里没有空间！"

msgid "You can choose from Cupid's Wings, or Bride or Groom item exchange vouchers. Which one do you want?"
msgstr "你可以从丘比特之翼或新郎新娘物品兑换券中选一个。你想要哪个？"

msgid "You have Bride or Groom Exchange Voucher! Do you want to use it?"
msgstr "你有新郎新娘兑换券！你想使用它吗？"

msgid "You do not have Bride or Groom Exchange Voucher."
msgstr "你没有新郎新娘兑换券。"

msgid "Welcome to Knight Online. Do you have the Soldier Support Box?"
msgstr "欢迎来到《骑士OL》。你有士兵支援箱吗？"

msgid "You do not have the box. "
msgstr "你没有箱子。"

msgid "Pick the item you want."
msgstr "选你想要的物品。"

msgid "Hope you have a good time at Knight Online."
msgstr "祝你在《骑士OL》玩得开心。"

msgid "Welcome to the new server. Now it's more fun and exciting. "
msgstr "欢迎来到新服务器。现在更有趣、更刺激了。"

msgid "You do not have the item of Warrior's Return."
msgstr "你没有勇者归来的物品。"

msgid "You don't have not enough spaces in your inventory. You need 16 spaces."
msgstr "你的背包空间不足。你需要16个空格。"

msgid "I've just distributed the support for settlement. Have fun at Knight Online."
msgstr "我刚发放了定居支援。祝你在《骑士OL》玩得开心。"

