msgstr "欢迎。|如果你达到60级或以上并想转到别的服务器，可以领取大量现金道具。转之前请想清楚。"

msgid "Pick the server you want. Once you move you can't come back."
msgstr "选你想去的服务器。一旦转过去就回不来了。"

msgid "Server Move is only possible at the training center."
msgstr "服务器迁移只能在训练中心进行。"

msgid "Welcome. You are a special user. Here's the gold pickax and the gold fishing rod. You can rent one once a day. Which one do you like?"
msgstr "欢迎。你是特别用户。这是金镐和金钓竿。你每天可以租一次。你喜欢哪一个？"

msgid "Only the switching premium user can lend the gold fishing rod or the pickax."
msgstr "只有切换高级会员用户才能借金钓竿或金镐。"

msgid "You can lend it once a day."
msgstr "你每天可以借一次。"

msgid "Only for the new users we're lending the items."
msgstr "我们只向新用户借出物品。"

msgid "You do not have the item lending coupon."
msgstr "你没有物品租借券。"

msgid "We'll give you the item that fits your occupation and your level. Will you receive?"
msgstr "我们会给你符合你职业和等级的物品。你要领吗？"

msgid "You don't have buff coupon."
msgstr "你没有增益券。"

msgid "You have the buff coupon. Which one do you want?"
msgstr "你有增益券。你想要哪一个？"

msgid "You are not a level 60 yet. | If you don't move now you won't be able to receive prizes."
msgstr "你还没到60级。|如果现在不迁移，你就领不到奖品了。"

msgid "You are over level 60. You can receive the item. Will you want to move?"
msgstr "你超过60级了。你可以领取物品。你想迁移吗？"

msgid "You brought the buff box. Do you want to receive a jewel?"
msgstr "你带来了增益箱。你想领一颗宝石吗？"

msgid "You do not have the buff box. If you bring the box we'll give you the buff jewel."
msgstr "你没有增益箱。如果你带来箱子，我们就给你增益宝石。"

msgid "I've exchanged the item. Have fun at the training center. Cheers!"
msgstr "我已经兑换了物品。祝你在训练中心玩得愉快。干杯！"

msgid "Welcome! You have the halloween box. If you give it to me I'll open it for you. | From the disguise box you'll be able to receive Scream, Pumpkin, Assassin, Wizard, Pumpkin masks. | Do you want me to open it for you?"
msgstr "欢迎！你有万圣节箱子。如果你把它给我，我就为你打开。|从变身箱里你可以获得尖叫、南瓜、刺客、法师、南瓜面具。|你要我为你打开吗？"

msgid "If you bring the mask box, I'll give you the mask."
msgstr "如果你带来面具箱，我就给你面具。"

msgid "Yay you received a pretty mask! Have fun with it!"
msgstr "耶，你领到了一个漂亮的面具！玩得开心！"

msgid "Have a fun at Knight Online."
msgstr "祝你在《骑士OL》玩得开心。"

msgid "Welcome. You have the transformation scroll for Magpie mother. Do you want me to exchange it for you?"
msgstr "欢迎。你有喜鹊妈妈变身卷轴。你要我为你兑换吗？"

msgid "If you bring the magpie mother transformation scroll, I'll exchange it for you."
msgstr "如果你带来喜鹊妈妈变身卷轴，我就为你兑换。"

