msgid "Welcome. You can exchange Dark Knight Weapon Chest for the weapon you want."
msgstr "欢迎。你可以用暗黑骑士武器箱兑换想要的武器。"

msgid "You don't have the Dark Knight Weapon Chest. You can obtain it from Black Treasure Chest which drops at Forgotten Temple with a low chance."
msgstr "你没有暗黑骑士武器箱。它可从遗忘神殿低概率掉落的黑宝箱中获得。"

msgid "Sir, have you heard about the recent Hellfire Dragon cave discovery? Someone took the Aldrade's Crystal and woke the Hellfire Dragon. If we don't do anything, the whole continent will be burnt. Will you please help defeat Hellfire Dragon?"
msgstr "先生，你听说最近发现的地狱火龙洞穴了吗？有人拿走了奥尔德雷德水晶，唤醒了地狱火龙。如果我们不做点什么，整个大陆都会被烧毁。你能帮我们击败地狱火龙吗？"

msgid "Would you please gather Feather of Hellfire Dragon? You can gain it by killing enemies, or by killing monsters of your level. I will give you a random item if you bring me 10 Feather of Hellfire Dragon. The following is a list of items you can get.\n Holy Water of Grace, Potion of Soul, Gem of Contribution, Gem of Experience, Gem of Life, Gem of Defense, Abyss Holy Water(S), Hellfire Dragon Pet Transformation Scroll, Magpie Pet Transformation Scroll, Pluwiton Pet Transformation Scroll, Krowaz Pet Transformation Scroll, Wings of Hellfire Dragon Exchange Voucher, Dragon Chest. Would you like to exchange?"
msgstr "你能帮我收集地狱火龙之羽吗？可通过击杀敌人或击杀与你同级的怪物获得。带来10根地狱火龙之羽，我就送你随机道具。以下是你可获得的道具列表。\n 恩惠圣水、灵魂药水、贡献宝石、经验宝石、生命宝石、防御宝石、深渊圣水(S)、地狱火龙宠物变身卷轴、喜鹊宠物变身卷轴、普鲁维顿宠物变身卷轴、克罗瓦兹宠物变身卷轴、地狱火龙翅膀兑换券、龙箱。要兑换吗？"

msgid "Not enough Feather of Hellfire Dragon.  You can gain it by killing enemies, or by killing monsters of your level."
msgstr "地狱火龙之羽不足。可通过击杀敌人或击杀与你同级的怪物获得。"

msgid "Thank you. These feathers will help a lot while fighting against Pirak. Here is my small present. "
msgstr "谢谢。这些羽毛在对抗皮拉克时会很有用。这是我的一点小礼物。"

msgid "Welcome. As you know, we need Feather of Hellfire Dragon in order to fight against Pirak. For players who donate more than 100 Feather of Hellfire Dragon, 1 of 3 titles will be given. (Hellfire Dragon , Terrae Dragon, Storm Dragon). Would you like to donate?"
msgstr "欢迎。如你所知，我们需要地狱火龙之羽来对抗皮拉克。对捐献超过100根地狱火龙之羽的玩家，将赐予3个称号之一（地狱火龙、大地龙、风暴龙）。你想捐献吗？"

msgid "You have less than 100 Feather of Hellfire Dragon. Please come back when you have more than 100 Feather of Hellfire Dragon to donate."
msgstr "你的地狱火龙之羽不足100根。请凑够100根以上再来捐献。"

msgid "Thank you. You are worthy to receive the title. Please defeat Pirak¡¦"
msgstr "谢谢。你配得上这个称号。请击败皮拉克…"

msgid "Knight of Hellfire Dragon, you already have the title. Please be safe. "
msgstr "地狱火龙骑士，你已经有称号了。请保重。"

msgid "Sir, I heard that few knights can use the power of Hellfire Dragon since Pirak was unleashed. People say that Hellfire Dragon's power grants 50% increase in attack. I wish I had that kind of power. "
msgstr "先生，我听说自从皮拉克被释放后，很少有骑士能使用地狱火龙的力量。人们说地狱火龙的力量能使攻击提升50%。真希望我也有那种力量。"

msgid "You can use the power of the Hellfire Dragon by killing monsters of your level or obtaining Hellfire Dragon Chest which spawns at Melee arena. Hellfire Dragon Chest spawns at Melee arena at 1:00 , 7:00 everyday."
msgstr "你可以通过击杀与你同级的怪物，或获得在近战竞技场刷新的地狱火龙箱来使用地狱火龙之力。地狱火龙箱每天1:00、7:00在近战竞技场刷新。"

msgid "Welcome. I can exchange Hellfire Dragon Egg or Wings of Hellfire Dragon Exchange Voucher for Wings of Hellfire. Hellfire Dragon Chest spawns at the Melee Arena at 1:00, 7:00 everyday."
msgstr "欢迎。我可以用 Hellfire 龙蛋或地狱火龙翅膀兑换券兑换地狱火之翼。地狱火龙箱每天1:00、7:00在近战竞技场刷新。"

msgid "You have Hellfire Dragon Exchange Voucher or Hellfire  Dragon Egg. Please select the option you want."
msgstr "你持有地狱火龙兑换券或地狱火龙蛋。请选择你想要的选项。"

msgid "You don't have Hellfire Dragon Exchange Voucher or Hellfire Dragon Egg. You can get it by defeating Hellfire Dragon Pirak."
msgstr "你没有地狱火龙兑换券或地狱火龙蛋。可通过击败地狱火龙皮拉克获得。"

msgid "You don't have Wings of Hellfire Dragon Exchange Voucher (15 Days)"
msgstr "你没有地狱火龙翅膀兑换券(15天)"

msgid "You don't have Wings of Hellfire Dragon Exchange Voucher (1 Month)"
msgstr "你没有地狱火龙翅膀兑换券(1个月)"

msgid "You don't have Wings of Hellfire Dragon Exchange Voucher (3 Months)"
msgstr "你没有地狱火龙翅膀兑换券(3个月)"

msgid "You don't have Wings of Hellfire Dragon Exchange Voucher (6 Months)"
msgstr "你没有地狱火龙翅膀兑换券(6个月)"

msgid "Here you are. Thank you for defeating Hellfire Dragon."
msgstr "给。感谢你击败地狱火龙。"

msgid "You can earn Mark of Hellfire Dragon from Hellfire Dragon Chest at Moradon battle arena. I will grant you a proper title if you bring the Mark of Hellfire Dragon to me. Highest title will grant you all the subordinate titles as well."
msgstr "你可在莫拉登战场竞技场的地狱火龙箱中获得地狱火龙印记。把地狱火龙印记带给我，我会赐予你相称的称号。最高称号会同时赐予所有下位称号。"

msgid "1. 1 Mark of Hellfire Dragon: Hellfire Dragon Fighter\n (STR,DEX,MANA,INT)+3\n 2. 5  Mark of Hellfire Dragon: Hellfire Dragon Slayer\n (STR,DEX,MANA,INT)+5\n 3. 10 Mark of Hellfire Dragon: Hellfire Dragon Slayer Master\n (STR,DEX,MANA,INT)+10, Defense -20\n 4. 20 Mark of Hellfire Dragon: Hellfire Dragon Slayer God\n (STR,DEX,MANA,INT)+15, Defense -50"
msgstr "1. 1个地狱火龙印记：地狱火龙斗士\n (力量,敏捷,法力,智力)+3\n 2. 5个地狱火龙印记：地狱火龙猎杀者\n (力量,敏捷,法力,智力)+5\n 3. 10个地狱火龙印记：地狱火龙猎杀大师\n (力量,敏捷,法力,智力)+10，防御-20\n 4. 20个地狱火龙印记：地狱火龙猎杀之神\n (力量,敏捷,法力,智力)+15，防御-50"

msgid "Which title do you want? You will need to exchange your Mark of Hellfire Dragon."
msgstr "你想要哪个称号？需要用你的地狱火龙印记兑换。"

msgid "1 Mark of Hellfire Dragon will be used. Do you want to exchange for the title 'Hellfire Dragon Fighter'?"
msgstr "将消耗1个地狱火龙印记。你想兑换称号'地狱火龙斗士'吗？"

msgid "5 Mark of Hellfire Dragon will be used. Do you want to exchange for the title 'Hellfire Dragon Slayer'?"
msgstr "将消耗5个地狱火龙印记。你想兑换称号'地狱火龙猎杀者'吗？"

msgid "10 Mark of Hellfire Dragon will be used. Do you want to exchange for the title 'Hellfire Dragon Master Slayer'?"
msgstr "将消耗10个地狱火龙印记。你想兑换称号'地狱火龙猎杀大师'吗？"

msgid "20 Mark of Hellfire Dragon will be used. Do you want to exchange for the title  'Hellfire Dragon Slayer God'?"
msgstr "将消耗20个地狱火龙印记。你想兑换称号'地狱火龙猎杀之神'吗？"

msgid "Not enough Mark of Hellfire Dragon. Please check your inventory."
msgstr "地狱火龙印记不足。请检查背包。"

msgid "You already have the title. Aim for a better one!"
msgstr "你已经有称号了。向着更好的目标努力吧！"

msgid "Welcome. We exchange Hellfire Dragon Egg for Knight Online 11th Anniversary Emblem (6 Hours). The Emblem decreases damage taken. Would like to exchange?"
msgstr "欢迎。我们用 Hellfire 龙蛋兑换骑士OL 11周年纹章(6小时)。该纹章减少受到的伤害。要兑换吗？"

msgid "You don't have the Hellfire Dragon Egg. You can get it by killing Hellfire Dragon Pirak."
msgstr "你没有 Hellfire 龙蛋。可通过击杀地狱火龙皮拉克获得。"

msgid "Which emblem do you want?"
msgstr "你想要哪个纹章？"

msgid "Inferior ones, bring me the Aldrade's Crystal. You will have the true power. "
msgstr "卑微的人啊，把奥尔德雷德水晶带给我。你将拥有真正的力量。"

msgid "Inferior ones. You don't understand my words?"
msgstr "卑微的人啊。你听不懂我的话吗？"

msgid "(Puts Aldrade's Crystal on the altar.) Hahaha! How dare you underrate my power. I will wipe out all of you."
msgstr "(把奥尔德雷德水晶放在祭坛上。)哈哈哈！竟敢轻视我的力量。我会把你们全部消灭。"

msgid "Welcome! We are running a raffle for Knight Online's 11th Anniversary. Do you need a raffle ticket?"
msgstr "欢迎！我们正在为骑士OL 11周年举办抽奖。你需要抽奖券吗？"

msgid "Click the Event button on the bottom left corner and get a raffle ticket! Raffle tickets will be given once daily per account. "
msgstr "点击左下角的活动按钮领取抽奖券！每个账号每天发放一次抽奖券。"

msgid "Welcome. The only way to defeat Hellfire Dragon Pirak is by using the power of Dragon Stone. Would you please give your Dragon Stones to me? I will reward the top 1-20 players who donated the most Dragon Stones. (Garges Weapon, Wings of Hellfire Dragon, etc.)"
msgstr "欢迎。击败地狱火龙皮拉克的唯一方法是使用龙石之力。你能把你的龙石交给我吗？我会奖励捐献龙石最多的前1-20名玩家（加格斯武器、地狱火龙翅膀等）。"

msgid "Thank you for the Dragon Stone. The winner will be revealed at the end of the event."
msgstr "感谢你的龙石。中奖者将在活动结束时公布。"

msgid "You don't have the Dragon Stone. You can get if from Dragon Chest."
msgstr "你没有龙石。可从龙箱获得。"

msgid "Oh, where are you my dear rose! Wait, Have you seen my rose? Could you please bring it to me?"
msgstr "哦，我亲爱的玫瑰在哪里！等等，你见过我的玫瑰吗？能帮我带来吗？"

msgid "Oh! That's my rose! I will exchange my rose with reward."
msgstr "哦！那是我的玫瑰！我会用奖励来交换我的玫瑰。"

msgid "Your level is too low. You need to be at least Lv.35 to exchange the rose. "
msgstr "你的等级太低。兑换玫瑰至少需要35级。"

msgid "Oh my lovely rose. Thank you. Here is your reward!"
msgstr "哦我可爱的玫瑰。谢谢。这是你的奖励！"

msgid "That's not the rose I'm looking for."
msgstr "那不是我要找的玫瑰。"

msgid "You have not enough space in inventory."
msgstr "背包空间不足。"

msgid "Welcome. I can exchange 11th anniversary emblem. Please select the option you want from menu."
msgstr "欢迎。我可以兑换11周年纹章。请从菜单中选择你想要的选项。"

msgid "You don't have 12th anniversary exchange voucher. Please check your inventory."
msgstr "你没有12周年兑换券。请检查背包。"

msgid "[Plain old ring]? This is the only thing I have. I don't know how you'll use this but use it carefully."
msgstr "[素圈戒指]？这是我仅有的东西。我不知道你会怎么用它，但请小心使用。"

msgid "[Moradon Merchant] Shaimer  has asked to help [Secret Deputy] Clarence for the celebration preparation."
msgstr "[莫拉登商人] Shaimer 请你帮助[秘密副官] Clarence 筹备庆典。"

msgid "[Moradon Merchant] Clark has asked to help [Secret Deputy] Clarence for the preparation of celebration."
msgstr "[莫拉登商人] Clark 请你帮助[秘密副官] Clarence 筹备庆典。"

msgid "You have to help [Secret Deputy] Clarence to obtain Wine Fruit."
msgstr "你要帮助[秘密副官] Clarence 取得酒果。"

msgid "You have to help [Secret Deputy] Clarence to obtain Blood Money and Meat."
msgstr "你要帮助[秘密副官] Clarence 取得血腥钱和肉。"

msgid "Deliver [Celebration Preparation Box] to [Castle Cook]."
msgstr "把[庆典筹备箱]交给[城堡厨师]。"

msgid "Deliver [Celebration Dish] to [Moradon Merchant] Shaimer."
msgstr "把[庆典菜肴]送给[莫拉登商人] Shaimer。"

msgid "Deliver [Celebration Dish] to [Moradon Merchant] Clark."
msgstr "把[庆典菜肴]送给[莫拉登商人] Clark。"

msgid "Bring this invitation letter to [Merchant] Kaishan, [Daughter of Merchant] Menesia, [Chief of Mercenary] Kuger and bring the response."
msgstr "把这封邀请函送给[商人] Kaishan、[商人之女] Menesia、[佣兵队长] Kuger，并带回回信。"

msgid "Talk to [Captain] Fargo about what's happened during the celebration."
msgstr "向[队长] Fargo 询问庆典期间发生了什么。"

msgid "Talk to [Captain] Folkwine about what's happened during the celebration."
msgstr "向[队长] Folkwine 询问庆典期间发生了什么。"

msgid "Talk to Pablo to serve the order of [Captain] Fargo."
msgstr "与 Pablo 谈话，执行[队长] Fargo 的命令。"

msgid "Talk to Agatha to serve the order of [Captain] Folkwine."
msgstr "与 Agatha 谈话，执行[队长] Folkwine 的命令。"

msgid "Defeat [Harpie] who's threatening the Eslant while Pablo is trying to locate the monster cave."
msgstr "在 Pablo 设法定位怪物洞穴期间，击败威胁艾斯兰特的[鹰身女妖]。"

msgid "Defeat [Harpie] who's threatening the Eslant while Agatha is trying to locate the monster cave."
msgstr "在 Agatha 设法定位怪物洞穴期间，击败威胁艾斯兰特的[鹰身女妖]。"

msgid "Deliver [Monster Base Map] to [Captain] Fargo."
msgstr "把[怪物基地地图]交给[队长] Fargo。"

msgid "Deliver [Monster Base Map] to [Captain] Folkwine."
msgstr "把[怪物基地地图]交给[队长] Folkwine。"

msgid "Defeat Monster [Grendel] and bring it's right arm like [Captain] Fargo ordered."
msgstr "击败怪物[格伦德尔]，按[队长] Fargo 的命令带回它的右臂。"

msgid "Defeat Monster [Grendel] and bring it's right arm like [Captain] Folkwine ordered."
msgstr "击败怪物[格伦德尔]，按[队长] Folkwine 的命令带回它的右臂。"

msgid "[Captain] Fargo proclaimed the emergency. Go to [Elder Wizard] Drake."
msgstr "[队长] Fargo 宣布紧急状态。去找[长老法师] Drake。"

msgid "[Captain] Folkwine proclaimed the emergency. Go to [Elder Wizard] Drake."
msgstr "[队长] Folkwine 宣布紧急状态。去找[长老法师] Drake。"

msgid "Collect the Soldier's article following the order of [Elder Wizard] Drake."
msgstr "按[长老法师] Drake 的命令收集士兵的信物。"

msgid "Bring [Broken Soldiers Article] to Pablo."
msgstr "把[破碎的士兵信物]带给 Pablo。"

msgid "Bring [Broken Soldiers Article] to Agatha."
msgstr "把[破碎的士兵信物]带给 Agatha。"

msgid "Pablo has asked to collect [Piece of Rage] to honor the ones who's died in the battle."
msgstr "Pablo 请你收集[愤怒碎片]，以纪念在战斗中牺牲的人。"

msgid "Ask Minerva to restore the article."
msgstr "请密涅瓦修复那件信物。"

msgid "Collect the ingredients to make [Restoration Holy Water]."
msgstr "收集制作[修复圣水]所需的材料。"

msgid "[Restoration Holy Water] needs to be delivered to Pablo."
msgstr "[修复圣水]需要交给 Pablo。"

msgid "[Restoration Holy Water] needs to be delivered to Agatha."
msgstr "[修复圣水]需要交给 Agatha。"

msgid "Practice against [Troll] following Pablo's order."
msgstr "按 Pablo 的命令，对[兽人]进行演练。"

msgid "Practice against [Troll] following Agatha's order."
msgstr "按 Agatha 的命令，对[兽人]进行演练。"

msgid "Go report to [Captain] Fargo that we're ready."
msgstr "去向[队长] Fargo 报告我们已经准备就绪。"

msgid "Go report to [Captain] Folkwine that we're ready."
msgstr "去向[队长] Folkwine 报告我们已经准备就绪。"

msgid "Defeat [Grendel's Mother] and bring the hair following the order of [Captain] Fargo."
msgstr "按[队长] Fargo 的命令，击败[格伦德尔之母]并带回毛发。"

msgid "Defeat [Grendel's Mother] and bring the hair following the order of [Captain] Folkwine."
msgstr "按[队长] Folkwine 的命令，击败[格伦德尔之母]并带回毛发。"

msgid "Find out what's happened by visiting Malverick."
msgstr "拜访 Malverick，查明发生了什么。"

msgid "Find out what's happened by visiting Zark."
msgstr "拜访 Zark，查明发生了什么。"

msgid "Move to Moradon and collect information about [Runaway Slave]."
msgstr "前往莫拉登，收集关于[逃亡奴隶]的情报。"

msgid "Go find runaway slaves from Kaluga Valley."
msgstr "去卡卢加山谷寻找逃亡奴隶。"

msgid "Find Golden Chalice from [Urkuron]."
msgstr "从[Urkuron]身上找到黄金圣杯。"

msgid "Bring [Dragon Golden Chalice] to Malverick."
msgstr "把[龙之黄金圣杯]带给 Malverick。"

msgid "Bring [Dragon Golden Chalice] to Zark."
msgstr "把[龙之黄金圣杯]带给 Zark。"

msgid "Bring [Dragon Golden Chalice] to Fargo."
msgstr "把[龙之黄金圣杯]带给 Fargo。"

msgid "Bring [Dragon Golden Chalice] to Folkwine."
msgstr "把[龙之黄金圣杯]带给 Folkwine。"

msgid "To prepare the fight against the dragon, bring [Unmelting Metal Piece]."
msgstr "为备战巨龙，带来[不熔金属碎片]。"

msgid "Defeat [Flame Rock] following the suggestion of [Captain] Fargo."
msgstr "按[队长] Fargo 的建议击败[火焰岩]。"

msgid "Defeat [Flame Rock] following the suggestion of [Captain] Folkwine."
msgstr "按[队长] Folkwine 的建议击败[火焰岩]。"

msgid "Bring molar of the [Angry Red Dragon] following [Captain] Fargo's order."
msgstr "按[队长] Fargo 的命令，带回[愤怒红龙]的臼齿。"

msgid "Bring molar of the [Angry Red Dragon] following [Captain]Folkwine's order."
msgstr "按[队长] Folkwine 的命令，带回[愤怒红龙]的臼齿。"

msgid "Start conversation with [Ascetic] Beda about missing Unit."
msgstr "与[苦行僧] Beda 谈谈失踪小队的事。"

msgid "Find whereabouts of the two who were leading the unit."
msgstr "找到率领该部队的两人的下落。"

msgid "[Hero who has lost two eyes] asked a favor to collect [Hero's Article]. "
msgstr "[失去双眼的英雄]拜托你收集[英雄遗物]。"

msgid "Find [Hero's Corpse] and collect [Valuable Soul]."
msgstr "找到[英雄遗体]并收集[高贵灵魂]。"

msgid "Deliver to Beda the [Collected Hero's Article]."
msgstr "把[收集到的英雄遗物]交给贝达。"

msgid "Deliver to Tabed the [Collected Hero's Article]."
msgstr "把[收集到的英雄遗物]交给塔贝德。"

msgid "Deliver to Pablo the [Collected Hero's Article]."
msgstr "把[收集到的英雄遗物]交给巴勃罗。"

msgid "Deliver to Agatha the [Collected Hero's Article]."
msgstr "把[收集到的英雄遗物]交给阿加莎。"

msgid "Noble Soul is resting now. Talk to Beda."
msgstr "高贵的灵魂现已安息。去和贝达谈谈。"

msgid "Noble Soul is resting now. Talk to Tabed."
msgstr "高贵的灵魂现已安息。去和塔贝德谈谈。"

msgid "Have to help the returning of the soul by defeating [Apostle] and [DeruBishi]."
msgstr "击败[使徒]和[德鲁比什]，帮助灵魂回归。"

msgid "Talk to [Hero who has lost his eyes]."
msgstr "与[失去双眼的英雄]交谈。"

msgid "Deliver [Order of Return] to [Captain] Fargo."
msgstr "把[归还命令]交给[队长]法戈。"

msgid "Deliver [Order of Return] to [Captain] Folkwine."
msgstr "把[归还命令]交给[队长]福尔克温。"

msgid "Defeat [Chief of Savage Tribe] and obtain [Recovered Horn] to help out with the returning of the Hero."
msgstr "击败[野蛮部落酋长]，取得[夺回的号角]，以帮助英雄回归。"

msgid "Talk to Fargo. Talk to Beda."
msgstr "与法戈交谈。与贝达交谈。"

msgid "Talk to Fargo. Talk to Tabed."
msgstr "与法戈交谈。与塔贝德交谈。"

msgid "You have just heard about hero's favor from Beda. Go find [Valley Monitoring Scout] and talk to him."
msgstr "你刚从贝达那里听说了英雄的委托。去找[山谷监视侦察兵]和他谈谈。"

msgid "You have just heard about hero's favor from Tabed. Go find [Valley Monitoring Scout] and talk to him."
msgstr "你刚从塔贝德那里听说了英雄的委托。去找[山谷监视侦察兵]和他谈谈。"

msgid "Defeat [Raven Harpie]."
msgstr "击败[渡鸦鹰身女妖]。"

msgid "Defeat [Creamson Wing] and [Falcon]."
msgstr "击败[赤红之翼]和[猎隼]。"

msgid "Defeat [Stone Golum]."
msgstr "击败[石傀儡]。"

msgid "Talk to Beda."
msgstr "与贝达交谈。"

msgid "Talk to Tabed."
msgstr "与塔贝德交谈。"

msgid "Deliver [Attack Preparation Planning] to Fargo."
msgstr "把[进攻准备计划]交给法戈。"

msgid "Deliver [Attack Preparation Planning] to Folkwine."
msgstr "把[进攻准备计划]交给福尔克温。"

msgid "Talk to Herga to get approval for subjugation."
msgstr "与赫尔加交谈，取得讨伐许可。"

msgid "Talk to Nez to get approval for subjugation."
msgstr "与内兹交谈，取得讨伐许可。"

msgid "There's an order from the King. For the glory of Karus! Deliver [Participation Order] to Fargo."
msgstr "国王有令。为了卡鲁斯的荣耀！把[参战命令]交给法戈。"

msgid "There's an order from the King. For the glory of El morad! Deliver [Participation Order] to Folkwine."
msgstr "国王有令。为了艾莫拉德的荣耀！把[参战命令]交给福尔克温。"

msgid "Obtain [Garlong's Secret letter] by defeating [King Savage]."
msgstr "击败[野蛮之王]，取得[加隆的密信]。"

msgid "There's a rumor about annihilation. [Captain] Fargo is looking for you."
msgstr "流传着灭顶之灾的谣言。[队长]法戈正在找你。"

msgid "There's a rumor about annihilation. [Captain] Folkwine is looking for you."
msgstr "流传着灭顶之灾的谣言。[队长]福尔克温正在找你。"

msgid "Citizens of Karus are afraid because of the rumor. Defeat [Aif] and [Grey Oz]."
msgstr "谣言让卡鲁斯的居民惶恐不安。击败[艾夫]和[灰色软泥怪]。"

msgid "Citizens of El Morad are afraid because of the rumor. Defeat [Aif] and [Grey Oz]."
msgstr "谣言让艾莫拉德的居民惶恐不安。击败[艾夫]和[灰色软泥怪]。"

msgid "Citizens of Karus are afraid because of the rumor. Defeat [Beren] and [Cardinal]."
msgstr "谣言让卡鲁斯的居民惶恐不安。击败[巴伦]和[红衣主教]。"

msgid "Citizens of El morad are afraid because of the rumor. Defeat [Beren] and [Cardinal]."
msgstr "谣言让艾莫拉德的居民惶恐不安。击败[巴伦]和[红衣主教]。"

msgid "Citizens of Karus are afraid because of the rumor. Defeat [Urkblade] and [Urkhi]."
msgstr "谣言让卡鲁斯的居民惶恐不安。击败[厄克之刃]和[厄克海]。"

msgid "Citizens El morad are afraid because of the rumor. Defeat [Urkblade] and [Urkhi]."
msgstr "谣言让艾莫拉德的居民惶恐不安。击败[厄克之刃]和[厄克海]。"

msgid "The truth has been revealed. Talk to Beda."
msgstr "真相大白。与贝达交谈。"

msgid "The truth has been revealed. Talk to Tabed."
msgstr "真相大白。与塔贝德交谈。"

msgid "This is really important that you do not tell anyone. Talk to Pablo."
msgstr "此事万分重要，切勿告诉任何人。与巴勃罗交谈。"

msgid "This is really important that you do not tell anyone. Talk to Agatha."
msgstr "此事万分重要，切勿告诉任何人。与阿加莎交谈。"

msgid "Deliver [Top Secret Document] to Herga."
msgstr "把[绝密文件]交给赫尔加。"

msgid "Deliver [Top Secret Document] to Nez."
msgstr "把[绝密文件]交给内兹。"

msgid "Everything's been revealed. Deliver [Treason Arrest Order] to Fargo."
msgstr "一切都已揭晓。把[叛国逮捕令]交给法戈。"

msgid "Defeat Garlong and collect [Traitor's Evidence]."
msgstr "击败加隆，收集[叛徒的证据]。"

msgid "Master, [Moradon Merchant] Shaimer is looking for you. Go ahead and visit him, please."
msgstr "主人，[莫拉登商人]沙默在找你。请前去拜访他。"

msgid "Master, [Moradon Merchant] Clark is looking for you. Go ahead and visit him, please."
msgstr "主人，[莫拉登商人]克拉克在找你。请前去拜访他。"

msgid "Hello <selfname>! Long time no see! Ha, ha, ha. What are you looking for today?"
msgstr "你好 <selfname>！好久不见！哈，哈，哈。今天你在找什么？"

msgid "Not sure if you know but we will be opening a party for the king's grace to thank him! Please help us prepare for the celebration!"
msgstr "不知道你知不知道，我们要为感谢国王的恩典举办一场宴会！请帮我们准备庆祝活动吧！"

msgid "You will help us? Thank you! So for now, please visit [Secret Agent]Clarence. He will send the needed food for the festival!"
msgstr "你愿意帮忙吗？谢谢！那么现在，请去见[密探]克拉伦斯。他会送来宴会所需的食物！"

msgid "That was cold ......"
msgstr "真是冷淡……"

msgid "[Secret Agent]Clarence is in [Bellua Village]."
msgstr "[密探]克拉伦斯在[贝卢阿村]。"

msgid "[Secret Agent]Clarence is in [Asga Village]."
msgstr "[密探]克拉伦斯在[阿斯加村]。"

msgid "Hi <selfname>? Have you come to help prepare the Festival?"
msgstr "嗨，<selfname>？你是来帮忙准备宴会的吗？"

msgid "Welcome. We need your help. Food needs to be delivered to the castle but there is still a lot missing. [Aged Wine Fruit] is needed, could you get it for me?"
msgstr "欢迎。我们需要你的帮助。食物得送到城堡，但还缺很多。需要[陈酿酒果]，你能帮我弄来吗？"

msgid "Not done yet? We have to hurry to finish the Festival preparations."
msgstr "还没弄好吗？我们得抓紧完成宴会准备。"

msgid "One, two ... That's everything! Thanks for you help. I should compensate you! These are the weapons I used to use, take what you need!"
msgstr "一、二……齐了！谢谢你的帮忙。我该酬谢你！这些是我以前用过的武器，需要什么就拿去吧！"

msgid "Master, Clarence is looking for you. He is still in Bellua Village"
msgstr "主人，克拉伦斯在找你。他还在贝卢阿村。"

msgid "Master, Clarence is looking for you. He is still in Asga Village"
msgstr "主人，克拉伦斯在找你。他还在阿斯加村。"

msgid "We have enough wine fruit! Thank you <selfname>. Now we can get started in other matters."
msgstr "酒果够了！谢谢你 <selfname>。现在可以开始处理别的事了。"

msgid "A festival would need meat! So , this time to collect [Blood Pig Meat], People like it due to its great taste. You can do it quickly can't you?"
msgstr "宴会总得有肉！这次去收集[血猪肉]，它味道极好，大家都喜欢。你能很快搞定吧？"

msgid "You said you would hurry?"
msgstr "你不是说会抓紧吗？"

msgid "Good quality meat... Makes me feel good! Thanks."
msgstr "上好的肉……让人心情舒畅！谢谢。"

msgid "You forgot? I'll give it to you one last time."
msgstr "你忘了？我最后再交代你一次。"

msgid "You just need to give the [Royal Chef] the [Festival Preparation Box]. He is in Luferson Castle."
msgstr "你只需把[宴会准备箱]交给[皇家厨师]。他在卢弗森城堡。"

msgid "You are <selfname> aren't you? What brings you here?"
msgstr "你就是 <selfname> 吧？什么风把你吹来了？"

msgid "You came to deliver this from Bellua Village? I was waiting for it, let's see ..."
msgstr "你是从贝卢阿村送来这个的？我一直在等，让我看看……"

msgid "Blast! It is not the right stuff ..."
msgstr "糟了！这不是要的东西……"

msgid "Well, well, shall we get the food started? It'll be over soon, give me a minute."
msgstr "好啦好啦，我们这就开始做菜吧？很快就好，稍等我一下。"

msgid "You just need to give the [Royal Chef] the [Festival Preparation Box]. He is in El Morad Castle."
msgstr "你只需把[宴会准备箱]交给[皇家厨师]。他在艾莫拉德城堡。"

msgid "You came to deliver this from Asga Village? I was waiting for it, let's see ..."
msgstr "你是从阿斯加村送来这个的？我一直在等，让我看看……"

msgid "Master, the preparations are almost over. Let's go back to [Moradon Merchant] Shaimer."
msgstr "主人，准备工作差不多结束了。我们回去找[莫拉登商人]沙默吧。"

msgid "Master, the preparations are almost over. Let's go back to [Moradon Merchant] Clark."
msgstr "主人，准备工作差不多结束了。我们回去找[莫拉登商人]克拉克吧。"

msgid "You back! Did things go well?"
msgstr "你回来啦！事情顺利吗？"

msgid "The [Royal Chef] said <selfname> would bring food."
msgstr "[皇家厨师]说 <selfname> 会把食物送来。"

msgid "Hmm? Where did it go? Could you have eaten it on the way?"
msgstr "嗯？跑到哪儿去了？你该不会在路上偷吃了吧？"

msgid "Appetizing! Now, Let the feast begin!"
msgstr "真诱人！那么，宴会开始吧！"

msgid "[Moradon Merchant]Shaimer is looking for you. Did the preparations not finish?"
msgstr "[莫拉登商人]沙默在找你。准备工作还没完成吗？"

msgid "[Moradon Merchant]Clark is looking for you. Did the preparations not finish?"
msgstr "[莫拉登商人]克拉克在找你。准备工作还没完成吗？"

msgid "Oh! <selfname>! I was able to finish it because of you. But ... There is still one thing missing,. Can I make one last request?"
msgstr "哦！<selfname>！多亏了你我才得以完成。不过……还缺一样东西，我能再提最后一个请求吗？"

msgid "There are still people missing that were invited! Could you go find them and get an answer from them?"
msgstr "还有些受邀的人没到！你能去找他们，把回复带回来吗？"

msgid "Hmm? No reply yet?"
msgstr "嗯？还没有回复？"

msgid "You have brought three responces. But there are some problems to start the festival."
msgstr "你带回了三份回复。不过要举办宴会还有些问题。"

msgid "Nothing is for certain but the castle might be under attack. [Captain] Harugo is looking for you <selfname>, go find him."
msgstr "虽然还不能确定，但城堡可能会遭到袭击。[队长]哈鲁戈在找你 <selfname>，去找他吧。"

msgid "It's the festival. Here is my reply. Tell him I will be there for sure."
msgstr "是宴会啊。这是我的回复。告诉他我一定到场。"

msgid "Festival invite? What should I wear... Oh! Here is my reply!"
msgstr "宴会邀请？我该穿什么好呢……哦！这是我的回复！"

msgid "Festival? I'm a little worried but because you <selfname> are working so hard, makes me feel better. I will have Patrick work and attend."
msgstr "宴会？我有点担心，但因为有你 <selfname> 这么努力，我就放心多了。我会派帕特里克出席。"

msgid "Luferson Castle seems to be in trouble. Find [Captain]Harugo."
msgstr "卢弗森城堡似乎出事了。去找[队长]哈鲁戈。"

msgid "Welcome <selfname>, your deeds are famous these days, I've heard a lot about you."
msgstr "欢迎你 <selfname>，近来你的事迹名声远扬，我可听说了不少。"

msgid "Many soldiers were attacked last night to monsters in the middle of the festival. We are preparing to find those monsters! But we don't know what it is¡¦"
msgstr "昨晚宴会进行到一半时，很多士兵遭到怪物袭击。我们正准备找出那些怪物！但我们不知道那是什么……"

msgid "In the meantime go to [Eslant] and find [Eslant Wise Man]Pablo and identify the monster!"
msgstr "在此期间，去[艾斯兰特]找[艾斯兰特智者]巴勃罗，查明那怪物的身份！"

msgid "El Morad Castle seems to be in trouble. Find [Captain]Falkwine."
msgstr "艾莫拉德城堡似乎出事了。去找[队长]福尔克温。"

msgid "In the meantime go to [Eslant] and find [Eslant Wise Man]Agata and identify the monster!"
msgstr "在此期间，去[艾斯兰特]找[艾斯兰特智者]阿加莎，查明那怪物的身份！"

msgid "[Eslant Wise Man]Pablo needs to be alerted! To go to Eslant go to the entrance and take the portal!"
msgstr "得通知[艾斯兰特智者]巴勃罗！要去艾斯兰特，就到入口处乘传送门！"

msgid "[Eslant Wise Man]Agata needs to be alerted! To go to Eslant go to the entrance and take the portal!"
msgstr "得通知[艾斯兰特智者]阿加莎！要去艾斯兰特，就到入口处乘传送门！"

msgid "Who are you? What? Are you here for errands?"
msgstr "你是谁？什么？你是来跑腿办事的？"

