msgid "Master, have you heard of the [Goblin Subjugation Squad]? They are a special dispatch of troops created to subjugate Goblins by residing around Goblin villages.  You can receive your mission from them.  So why don't you go? "
msgstr "主人，你听说过[哥布林讨伐队]吗？那是为讨伐哥布林而派驻在哥布林村附近的特别部队。你可以从他们那里接受任务。那你为什么不去呢？"

msgid "How are you? I am Raul of the [Goblin Subjugation Squad]. We are currently subjugating Goblins nearby in obedience to the King his majesty's orders. "
msgstr "你好吗？我是[哥布林讨伐队]的劳尔。我们奉国王陛下之命，正在附近讨伐哥布林。"

msgid "We have moblized the troops because the number of Goblin attacks has drastically increased recently. "
msgstr "因为近来哥布林袭击急剧增多，我们才调动了部队。"

msgid "So with various situations, we are trying to repel the increasing number of Goblins.  <selfname>, why don't you fulfill your responsiblity as a citizen of Karus by joining us?   "
msgstr "面对种种情况，我们正在击退越来越多的哥布林。<selfname>，何不加入我们，尽一份卡鲁斯公民的责任呢？"

msgid "Good. The number of Kobold has been increasing recently. Please start by subjugating them first.  "
msgstr "好。近来狗头人的数量在增加。先从讨伐它们开始吧。"

msgid "How are you? I am Wells of the [Goblin Subjugation Squad]. We are currently subjugating Goblins nearby in obedience to the King his majesty's orders. "
msgstr "你好吗？我是[哥布林讨伐队]的威尔斯。我们奉国王陛下之命，正在附近讨伐哥布林。"

msgid "So with various situations, we are trying to repel the increasing number of Goblins.  <selfname>, why don't you fulfill your responsiblity as a citizen of El Morad by joining us?   "
msgstr "面对种种情况，我们正在击退越来越多的哥布林。<selfname>，何不加入我们，尽一份艾莫拉德公民的责任呢？"

msgid "Master, let's help [Goblin Subjugation Squad] and start fighting Goblins!"
msgstr "主人，我们去帮[哥布林讨伐队]，开始对付哥布林吧！"

msgid "You are here, <selfname>. The number of Kobold inhabiting in Goblin villages has been growing exponentially. "
msgstr "你来了，<selfname>。栖息在哥布林村的狗头人数量正呈指数级增长。"

msgid "It is clear that if Kobold continues to expand, they will take over this entire land to make it their habitat if we do nothing.  Would you help me?"
msgstr "很明显，若放任狗头人扩张，它们迟早会占领整片土地作为栖息地。你愿意帮我吗？"

msgid "There are just too many of them. Let's do a little better this time. "
msgstr "实在太多了。这次再加把劲。"

msgid "You have done well/Goob job."
msgstr "你做得很好/干得漂亮。"

msgid "When you reach Lv61, I'll give you another mission. Until then, I hope you become stronger through training. "
msgstr "等你到Lv61，我再给你新任务。在那之前，希望你通过训练变得更强。"

msgid "Man, there's not even time to breathe. It is Bugbear this time. There is recent intel that they are trying to attack a nearby town. Let's hurry."
msgstr "天啊，连喘气的工夫都没有。这次是熊地精。最新情报说它们要袭击附近的镇子。我们快行动。"

msgid "Master, once again, the Goblin subjugation. Looks like there's an intel that Bug Bears are about to attack a nearby town. Let's go and stop them."
msgstr "主人，又轮到讨伐哥布林了。有情报说熊地精正要袭击附近的镇子。我们去阻止它们。"

msgid "Oh, you're back. There's an important intel that just came in. The [Bug Bears] which are known to be very hostile among Goblins are about attack a nearby town. "
msgstr "哦，你回来了。刚收到一份重要情报。哥布林中以凶暴著称的[熊地精]正要袭击附近的镇子。"

msgid "We must stop them before they attack the town. I need you to help me again."
msgstr "我们必须在它们袭击镇子前阻止它们。我需要你再帮我一次。"

msgid "Let's keep it up and subjugate our enemy!"
msgstr "继续加油，讨伐我们的敌人！"

msgid "Haha, that's great. I fought hard, too, but I am no comparison to you, <selfname>."
msgstr "哈哈，太好了。我也奋力作战了，但和你 <selfname> 比起来不值一提。"

msgid "When you reach Lv62, I'll give you another mission. Until then, I hope you become stronger through training. "
msgstr "等你到Lv62，我再给你新任务。在那之前，希望你通过训练变得更强。"

msgid "There's bad news. The goblins have attacked the village and killed our colleagues. I would bet my life it was those sneaky Pookas. I am ready to make them suffer. Let's get them."
msgstr "有个坏消息。哥布林袭击了村子，害死了我们的同事。我敢拿命打赌，就是那些鬼鬼祟祟的普卡干的。我要让它们付出代价。我们动手吧。"

msgid "Ah, master. The continued subjugation has made the Goblins angry. Let's hurry to [Goblin Subjugation Squad] at once."
msgstr "啊，主人。连续的讨伐把哥布林激怒了。我们立刻赶去[哥布林讨伐队]那里。"

msgid "Oh no, this is bad. The two previous subjugations has made the Goblins really angry."
msgstr "糟糕，这下坏了。前两次讨伐把哥布林彻底激怒了。"

msgid "We won't just sit and watch them attack us.  Why don't we strike first and defeat [Pookas], their vanguard, so that they won't even dare thinking about attacking us."
msgstr "我们不能坐视它们来攻。何不先下手，击败它们的先锋[普卡]，让它们连攻都不敢想。"

msgid "Come on guy, not yet! Our enemies are still strong. "
msgstr "上吧，兄弟，还没完呢！我们的敌人还很强。"

msgid "Phew, I guess we can breath now.  Well done."
msgstr "呼，这下能喘口气了。干得好。"

msgid "When you reach Lv63, I'll give you another mission. Until then, I hope you become stronger through training. "
msgstr "等你到Lv63，我再给你新任务。在那之前，希望你通过训练变得更强。"

msgid "There is now only one final subjugation. Goblin Bouncers are the strongest of the Goblin race. These guys never reveal themselves because they like to ambush their opponent. They have now come out of hiding because of our subjugation missions. We will destroy these goblins at their roots."
msgstr "现在只剩最后一次讨伐了。哥布林保镖是哥布林一族中最强的。这些家伙喜欢伏击对手，从不轻易现身。因为我们的讨伐任务，它们终于走出了藏身之处。我们要把这些哥布林连根铲除。"

msgid "Now, we have come to our final subjugation mission!|[Goblin Bouncers] dwell only in the deep underground or where there is only darkness. But it is clear that they are sensing the danger of our subjugation!"
msgstr "现在，我们迎来了最后的讨伐任务！|[哥布林保镖]只栖息在深邃的地下，或只有黑暗的地方。但它们显然察觉到了我们讨伐的危险！"

msgid "You are here. The [Goblin Bouncers], our enemy's main troop, are finally  exposed. If we subjugate them, they won't dare to act for some time."
msgstr "你来了。我们敌军的主力[哥布林保镖]终于现身了。若讨伐掉它们，它们一段时间内就不敢再动。"

msgid "They always gave us trouble because they only attacked from behind.  But we have finally wiped them out completely.  All thanks to you, <selfname>. Now, come on and let's get going. "
msgstr "它们总躲在背后偷袭，让我们吃尽苦头。但我们终于把它们彻底消灭了。这全靠你，<selfname>。现在，我们走吧。"

msgid "More! More! It is still not enough!"
msgstr "还要！还要！这还不够！"

msgid "You have done well! You live up to your reputation. May the glory of God be with you, <selfname>."
msgstr "你做得很好！不愧是你。愿神的荣耀与你同在，<selfname>。"

msgid "[Temporary]"
msgstr "[临时]"

msgid "All subjugation missions are completed. All you need to do is to report to Herga, the [advisor] of the Luferson Castle. I must stay here for our enemy may still remain.  Please deliver the report for me, <selfname>. "
msgstr "所有讨伐任务都完成了。你只需去向卢弗森城堡的[参谋]赫尔加报告。我必须留在这里，因为敌人可能还没肃清。请替我把报告送去，<selfname>。"

msgid "Now, we have come to our final subjugation mission!| [Goblin Bouncers] dwell only in the deep underground or where there is only darkness. But it is clear that they are sensing the danger of our subjugation!"
msgstr "现在，我们迎来了最后的讨伐任务！| [哥布林保镖]只栖息在深邃的地下，或只有黑暗的地方。但它们显然察觉到了我们讨伐的危险！"

msgid "All subjugation missions are completed. All you need to do is to report to Nez, the [advisor] of the El Morad Castle. I must stay here for our enemy may still remain.  Please deliver the report for me, <selfname>. "
msgstr "所有讨伐任务都完成了。你只需去向艾莫拉德城堡的[参谋]内兹报告。我必须留在这里，因为敌人可能还没肃清。请替我把报告送去，<selfname>。"

msgid "The subjugation is now complete. Give this [Subjugation Report] to Herga, the [advisor]."
msgstr "讨伐现已完成。把这份[讨伐报告]交给[参谋]内兹吧。"

msgid "Is that you, <selfname>? What's going on?"
msgstr "是你吗，<selfname>？出什么事了？"

msgid "Is this a report from the [Goblin Subjugation Squad] that was dispatched to the Goblin village?"
msgstr "这是派往哥布林村的[哥布林讨伐队]送来的报告吗？"

msgid "You need to stop messing around!"
msgstr "你别再胡闹了！"

msgid "Oh, the subjugation is complete. You contributed to this greatly, <selfname>. Great work. "
msgstr "哦，讨伐完成了。你为此出了大力，<selfname>。干得好。"

msgid "The subjugation is now complete. Give this [Subjugation Report] to Nez, the [advisor]."
msgstr "讨伐现已完成。把这份[讨伐报告]交给[参谋]内兹吧。"

msgid "Stop messing around. You are making me angry."
msgstr "别胡闹了。你惹我生气了。"

msgid "The subjugation is complete. You contributed to this greatly, <selfname>. Great work. "
msgstr "讨伐完成了。你为此出了大力，<selfname>。干得好。"

msgid "Oh, have you lost it? I'll give it to you again but do not make a mistake."
msgstr "哦，你是不是弄丢了？我再给你一次，别再弄错了。"

msgid "Ok, now I should mix this sample here¡¦.and another one here... Oh, I'm sorry. What brings you here?"
msgstr "好，现在我该把这份样品混到这儿……再放一点到那儿……哦，抱歉。什么风把你吹来了？"

msgid "Ver, the [Chief of Subjugation Squad] needs help.  Shall we talk to him? "
msgstr "维尔，[讨伐队队长]需要帮忙。我们去和他谈谈吧？"

msgid "Good day to you. I am Ver, the [Chief of Subjugation Squad]."
msgstr "你好。我是[讨伐队队长]维尔。"

msgid "We are currently running a research to find more [effective ways] to reduce the number of Goblins to minimize the number of battles."
msgstr "我们正在研究用更[有效的方法]减少哥布林数量，尽量少打仗。"

msgid "That being said ...Have you ever messed around with food when you were young? I need to ask you a favor in regards to that. "
msgstr "话虽如此……你小时候有没有拿食物搞过恶作剧？我想就这事请你帮个忙。"

msgid "Good. You sure are full of skills enough to play a [joke]. You need some ingredients to obtain. You need to gather [Oaks Poisonous Weed Bundle] that [Rad Oaks] carry around. "
msgstr "好。你可真会玩[恶作剧]。你需要弄些材料。去收集[辐射兽人]随身带着的[辐射兽人之毒草束]。"

msgid "Grey, the [Chief of Subjugation Squad] needs help.  Shall we talk to him? "
msgstr "格雷，[讨伐队队长]需要帮忙。我们去和他谈谈吧？"

msgid "Good day to you. I am Grey, the [Chief of Subjugation Squad]."
msgstr "你好。我是[讨伐队队长]格雷。"

msgid "What does he mean by playing the [joke]? |I keep thinking about the last laugh he had¡¦Let's go once again. "
msgstr "他说的玩[恶作剧]是什么意思？|我一直想着他刚才那阵笑……我们再去一趟吧。"

msgid "Hmm ... first ¡¦you would need ingredients.  How can you mess around if you don't have the ingredients?"
msgstr "嗯……首先……你得有材料。没有材料怎么搞恶作剧？"

msgid "First, you need to collect [Oaks Herb Bundle] that [Rad Oaks] carry around.  That nasty looking herb that stinks will be the main ingredient of this joke."
msgstr "首先，你要收集[辐射兽人]随身带着的[辐射兽人之毒草束]。那模样难看、味道刺鼻的草，就是这次恶作剧的主料。"

msgid "What are you doing? Are you playing a joke on me?"
msgstr "你在干什么？是在跟我开玩笑吗？"

msgid "You have collected well.  Wait for a moment.  All I have to do is mix it with this pre-made medicine. He he he."
msgstr "你收集得不错。稍等。我只要把它和这预先配好的药混在一起就行。嘿嘿嘿。"

msgid "Now, take these [experimental poisonous weeds] into the Goblin village and mix them with [Goblin Iron Pot], [Gobllin Food Box], and [Goblin Well], and bring me a sample so I can see the reaction. "
msgstr "现在，把这些[实验毒草]带进哥布林村，和[哥布林铁锅]、[哥布林食物箱]以及[哥布林水井]混在一起，再带个样品回来给我看看反应。"

msgid "Looks like he's about to start the joke.  What kind of joke is he playing? "
msgstr "他好像要开始搞恶作剧了。他在玩什么花样？"

msgid "Now, it's the time for the joke you've all been waiting for. "
msgstr "好了，现在是大家期待已久的恶作剧时间。"

msgid "Tut,tut you have such a weak mind ..."
msgstr "啧，啧，你这胆子也太小了……"

msgid "Oh, great. My eyes never mistake. I look forward to your next joke. "
msgstr "哦，太好了。我眼光从不差。期待你的下一个恶作剧。"

msgid "Come again when you reach Lv61. You don't have enough skills to perform this yet. "
msgstr "等你到Lv61再来。你现在本事还不够干这个。"

msgid "Now, shall we move on to the next joke? I need [Manticore Poison Pouch] that only comes from the tail of the [Manticore]. Hurry up and collect them fast. "
msgstr "那我们进入下一个恶作剧吧？我需要只从[蝎狮]尾巴上取得的[蝎狮毒囊]。快点收集来。"

msgid "Ugh, so this is what you meant by playing the joke with food. You see, my mom told me never to play with food¡¦"
msgstr "呃，原来你说的拿食物搞恶作剧是这意思啊。你看，我妈从小就告诉我别拿食物胡闹……"

msgid "Hmm let's see, ah, I know which ingredient to play joke with.  You will help me out with this, right?"
msgstr "嗯，让我想想，啊，我知道该拿什么材料搞恶作剧了。你会帮我的，对吧？"

msgid "Guess what! It's the [Manticore Poison Pouch] that only comes from the tail of the [Manticore]. Not Surprised? Well... anyhow, hurry up and bring it to me! "
msgstr "你猜怎么着！就是只从[蝎狮]尾巴上取得的[蝎狮毒囊]。不惊讶吗？哼……不管怎样，快把它给我弄来！"

msgid "Oh man, that joke is just not funny.  Go gather the ingredient fast so that I can show you what a real joke is all about!"
msgstr "哎呀，这恶作剧一点都不好笑。快去把材料弄来，好让我给你见识见识什么才叫真正的恶作剧！"

msgid "This is it! Hehehe! Now let me mix it here like this and that and this and uh¡¦"
msgstr "就是这个！嘿嘿嘿！现在我把它这样那样、这样那样地混进去，呃……"

msgid "Now, in the same way again, mix this [experimental poisonous weeds] with [Goblin Iron Pot], [Gobllin Food Box], and [Goblin Well], and bring me a sample so I can see the reaction. "
msgstr "现在，照旧把这些[实验毒草]和[哥布林铁锅]、[哥布林食物箱]以及[哥布林水井]混在一起，再带个样品回来给我看看反应。"

msgid "Uhg, now [Manticore Poison Pouch] on top of [Oaks Poison Pouch]?...You sure have one peculiar taste. "
msgstr "呃，在[辐射兽人毒囊]之上又加[蝎狮毒囊]？……你这口味可真够独特的。"

msgid "Shall we begin the second joke? Isn't it just too fun? "
msgstr "我们开始第二个恶作剧吧？是不是太好玩了？"

msgid "Why are you here? What about the sample?"
msgstr "你来干什么？样品呢？"

msgid "Oh, goood. Very good. This is getting better!"
msgstr "哦，好。很好。越来越有意思了！"

msgid "Come again when you reach Lv62. You don't have enough skills to perform this yet. "
msgstr "等你到Lv62再来。你现在本事还不够干这个。"

msgid "Next, I decided to use more special ingredient.|According to the essay, [Turning a curse into a poison?], you can make a curse turn into poison. Get it? Please go bring me the [cursed plant stem] from [Barron] which is the element that makes up hi s body."
msgstr "接下来，我决定用更特别的材料。|根据那篇《诅咒能否化为毒药？》的文章，你可以把诅咒化成毒。明白了吗？去从[巴伦]身上——它身体的组成部分——把[诅咒植物茎]给我弄来。"

msgid "Next, I decided to use more special ingredient.|According to the essay, [Turning a curse into a poison?], you can make a curse turn into poison. Get it? Please go bring me the [cursed plant stem] from [Barron] which is the element that makes up his body."
msgstr "接下来，我决定用更特别的材料。|根据那篇《诅咒能否化为毒药？》的文章，你可以把诅咒化成毒。明白了吗？去从[巴伦]身上——它身体的组成部分——把[诅咒植物茎]给我弄来。"

msgid "Master, Ver, the [Subjugation Squad Chief], is studying something very hard thesedays.  Is he upto something?"
msgstr "主人，[讨伐队队长]维尔近来在埋头研究着什么。他在打什么主意？"

msgid "Hmm ¡¦I see..so it is possible? Oh, <selfname>, you are here. Good."
msgstr "嗯……原来如此……这么说真的可行？哦，<selfname>，你来了。好。"

msgid "Next, I decided to use more special ingredient.|According to the essay, [Turning a curse into a poison?], you can make a curse turn into poison. Get it? Please go bring me the [cursed plant stem] from [Barron] which is the element that makes him up."
msgstr "接下来，我决定用更特别的材料。|根据那篇《诅咒能否化为毒药？》的文章，你可以把诅咒化成毒。明白了吗？去从[巴伦]身上——它身体的组成部分——把[诅咒植物茎]给我弄来。"

msgid "Hmm, I see. What are you doing there? [Barron] is not here?"
msgstr "嗯，我知道了。你在那儿干什么？[巴伦]不在这儿？"

msgid "So this is how it looks like. Shall I get to the experiment at once? "
msgstr "原来长这样。我这就开始实验吧？"

msgid "Shall we test how this works right away?  Now, take this [Experimental Plant] into the Gobliln village and mix it with [Goblin Iron Pot], [Gobllin Food Box], and [Goblin Well], and, once again, bring me a [sample] so I can see the reaction! "
msgstr "我们这就试试它管不管用？现在，把这株[实验植物]带进哥布林村，和[哥布林铁锅]、[哥布林食物箱]以及[哥布林水井]混在一起，再一次带个[样品]回来给我看看反应！"

msgid "So what joke now? This joke is just too exhuasting for both the one who plays and the one that's being played on."
msgstr "这回又是什么恶作剧？这恶作剧不管是整人的还是被整的，都太累人了。"

msgid "Now that I have the ingredient, as a [researcher] with the right attitude, I should test it right away, right? "
msgstr "既然材料到手，作为一名态度端正的[研究员]，我当然该立刻做实验，对吧？"

msgid "In that sense, the effect would have to experiment? Experimental plants, the the Goblin village of [Goblin cauldron station allows the reaction placed in wells Goblin Goblin food box, when or. Please bring Swatches!"
msgstr "说起来，效果得做实验才行。把实验植物放进哥布林村的[哥布林大釜]，再投进哥布林食物箱、哥布林水井里，等它起反应。请把样品带来！"

msgid "Hurry up, will ya?"
msgstr "你快点行不行？"

msgid "I can't believe that I just proved that you can turn a curse into a poison.  What an overwhelming feeling this is! "
msgstr "我真不敢相信，我居然证明了诅咒能化成毒。这感觉太痛快了！"

msgid "Come again when you reach Lv63. You don't have enough skills to perform this yet. "
msgstr "等你到Lv63再来。你现在本事还不够干这个。"

msgid "Now, I'm going to use an ingredient that's wild. I mean WILD!. I need [Burning Poison] from the body of [Burning Stone].  Watch out, you might burn your hands, kekeke. "
msgstr "接下来，我要用一个狂野的材料。我是说，超狂野！我要从[燃烧岩石]身上取得[沸腾毒液]。小心点，别烫到手，嘿嘿嘿。"

msgid "I hope this is the last one. I feel like I'm going to be poisoned if I collect anymore poison."
msgstr "希望这是最后一次了。再收集毒，我自己都要中毒了。"

msgid "Hehehe ... unfortunately, this will be the last experiment now that the subjugation is almost complete and I'm beginning to see the research result. I hate to end the joke but can't help it because it's an order. "
msgstr "呵呵呵……可惜啊，讨伐快收尾、研究也快出成果了，这将是最后一次实验。我也不想让恶作剧收场，可这是上头的命令，没办法。"

msgid "So I'm going to use an ingredient that's wild. I mean WILD!. I need [Burning Poison] from the body of [Burning Stone].  Watch out, you might burn your hands, kekeke. "
