msgstr "又见到你真高兴。"

msgid "You need to collect something very unusual this time. It's called [Undying Tooth] that comes from the [Undying]. I'm surprised that somebody's looking for such. Well, I don't have high hopes, but good luck. "
msgstr "这次你要收集一样很稀罕的东西。就是从[不死者]身上取的[不死之牙]。居然有人找这种东西，我都吃惊。我倒不抱多大希望，不过祝好运。"

msgid "Too difficult? I know, who wants to deal with them rotten bodies?"
msgstr "太难了？我知道，谁愿意去碰那些腐烂的尸体呢？"

msgid "Great! That's going to fill all the demands."
msgstr "太好了！这下需求全满足了。"

msgid "Well, please help that foolish man by delivering this [Suspicious Parcel] to Pablo, the [Sage of Islant]. And make sure you bring the receipt. "
msgstr "那就帮那个糊涂蛋一把，把这个[可疑包裹]交给艾斯兰特的[智者]巴勃罗吧。务必把收据带回来。"

msgid "[Sailor] Armada is going frantic again. Go do him a favor before it gets worse. "
msgstr "[水手]阿玛达又在发狂了。趁还没闹大，快去帮他一把。"

msgid "Aaaaaaaah, Eeeeeeek, Waaaaahhhh¡¦What the hell is this. Oh, you are here. "
msgstr "啊啊啊，咿咿咿，哇啊啊啊……这到底是什么。哦，你来了。"

msgid "(Stammering) Please! Put this strange box away! That bad fellow passed this to me and told me to deliver. However, it looks really strange and filthy, and it¡¯s driving me crazy! Deliver this to a person called [Sage of Islante] Pablo!! Get this thing away from me, quickly!! Don¡¯t forget to bring the receipt!! If you forget the receipt, I¡¯m going to see this thing again!"
msgstr "（结结巴巴）拜托！快把这怪箱子拿走！那个坏家伙把它塞给我，叫我送货。可它看着又怪又脏，快把我逼疯了！把这个送到一个叫艾斯兰特[智者]巴勃罗的人那里！快把这东西从我这儿拿走！！别忘了把收据带回来！！要是忘了收据，我还得再看这玩意儿一眼！"

msgid "Good lord! Why is that box still here? Get it off!!"
msgstr "老天！那箱子怎么还在这儿？快拿走！！"

msgid "Huff..huff. How dare that little mucker trying to revenge me. Good lord!"
msgstr "呼……呼。那个小混蛋竟敢想报复我。老天！"

msgid "Come back later when you reach Lv64. I will have another favor to ask you, then."
msgstr "等你到Lv64再来。到时我还有事要拜托你。"

msgid "Ahh, it's almost finished. I heard [Lamia] tribe that gives you a rare armor material called [Hard Snake Scale] lives nearby. Can you go get it? Upon delivery, he will reward you handsomely. "
msgstr "啊，快收尾了。我听说附近住着[拉米亚]一族，能给你一种稀有的铠甲材料[坚硬蛇鳞]。你能去取来吗？送到后他会重谢你的。"

msgid "[Sailor] Kidd is going frantic again. Go do him a favor before it gets worse. "
msgstr "[水手]基德又在发狂了。趁还没闹大，快去帮他一把。"

msgid "(Stammering) Please! Put this strange box away! That bad fellow passed this to me and told me to deliver. However, it looks really strange and filthy, and it¡¯s driving me crazy! Deliver this to a person called [Sage of Islante] Agatha!! Get this thing away from me, quickly!! Don¡¯t forget to bring the receipt!! If you forget the receipt, I¡¯m going to see this thing again!"
msgstr "（结结巴巴）拜托！快把这怪箱子拿走！那个坏家伙把它塞给我，叫我送货。可它看着又怪又脏，快把我逼疯了！把这个送到一个叫艾斯兰特[智者]阿加莎的人那里！快把这东西从我这儿拿走！！别忘了把收据带回来！！要是忘了收据，我还得再看这玩意儿一眼！"

msgid "[Sailor] Hayes is looking for you again. He sent you off to Islant last time. What's he want now? "
msgstr "[水手]海斯又在找你了。上次他把你派去艾斯兰特。这次他又想要什么？"

msgid "Tut, tut,tut¡¦That fool¡¦ Oh, you are here."
msgstr "啧，啧，啧……那个笨蛋……哦，你来了。"

msgid "The next thing I need to ask of you is a rare armor material called [Hard Snake Scale] which you can get from [Lamia]. This will be your last favor. Thank you for all your work."
msgstr "接下来我要拜托你的，是一种从[拉米亚]身上取得的稀有铠甲材料[坚硬蛇鳞]。这是最后一件事了。谢谢你做的一切。"

msgid "It's the last mission. Can you do a little better?"
msgstr "这是最后一个任务。你能不能办得更漂亮点？"

msgid "Well ... The quality is very good. Good."
msgstr "嗯……品质非常好。好。"

msgid "Could you help that fool for the last time? Please deliver [Armor Material Box] to [Blacksmith] of Moradon. This will be the last delivery. But please bring me the receipt! "
msgstr "你能最后再帮那个糊涂蛋一把吗？请把[铠甲材料箱]交给莫拉登的[铁匠]。这是最后一趟送货。但请务必把收据给我带回来！"

msgid "[Sailor] Haine is looking for you again. He sent you off to Islant last time. What's he want now? "
msgstr "[水手]海因又在找你了。上次他把你派去艾斯兰特。这次他又想要什么？"

msgid "Ahhh, how come [Sailor] Armada looks always busy? What am I trying to say? Well¡¦he is looking for you again. Go at once. "
msgstr "啊，[水手]阿玛达怎么总是忙忙碌碌的？我想说什么来着？嗯……他又在找你了。快去。"

msgid "Whoa, now I'm back to myself. Oh, you are here!"
msgstr "哇，我总算缓过来了。哦，你来了！"

msgid "Ha-ha-ha! Hey buddy, thank you so far. I called you because I wanted to show my appreciation to you. Do you want to know how I¡¯m going to show it? Hmm . . . Here. It¡¯s [Armor Material Box]. What? Are you asking me what it is? Give me a break. Of course, this is what you have to deliver. Deliver this to a person called [Blacksmith] Heppa in Moradon, and bring the receipt. Come on! Go, quickly!"
msgstr "哈哈哈！嘿，兄弟，谢谢你一路帮忙。我叫你来，是想表示一下谢意。你想知道我怎么谢你吗？嗯……给。这是[铠甲材料箱]。什么？你问这是什么？别逗了。这当然就是你要送的货。把它交给莫拉登一个叫[铁匠]赫帕的人，把收据带回来。来！快去！"

msgid "Why are you still here? Don't be sluggish."
msgstr "你怎么还在这儿？别磨蹭。"

msgid "Kekeke, well done. Why am I laughing? I'm laughing because the work is almost finished. Harharhar! "
msgstr "嘿嘿嘿，干得好。我笑什么？因为活儿快干完了呀。哈哈哈！"

msgid "By the way, you¡¯re very good at working. I¡¯ve told the captain that You¡¯ve done a very good job and he wrote a [Captain¡¯s Recommendation Letter]! Bring this to a person called [Trader] Drill. He¡¯s one of our colleagues and is now in Islante. He¡¯s somewhat meticulous, but he¡¯ll hire you if you show him this recommendation letter! So, see you again!"
msgstr "对了，你干活可真利索。我跟船长说了，你活儿干得漂亮，他就写了一封[推荐信]！把这个带去给一个叫[商人]德里尔的人。他是我们的同事，现在在艾斯兰特。他这人有点挑剔，但你拿出这封推荐信，他就会雇你！那么，再见啦！"

msgid "Somebody's looking us from Islant. Go to him at once. "
msgstr "艾斯兰特有个人在找你。马上去找他。"

msgid "How do you ¡¦and who are you?"
msgstr "你是……你是谁？"

msgid "You are recommended by the captain? Hmmm¡¦I guess you've got some skills. "
msgstr "你是船长推荐来的？嗯……看来你有点本事。"

msgid "By the way, where's the [Captain Recommendation]? [Sailor] Armada? That clumsy fool must have forgotten to give it to you. Please come back with it. "
msgstr "话说回来，[队长推荐信]呢？[水手]阿玛达？那个笨手笨脚的蠢货一定是忘了给你。请带着它再来。"

msgid "Hmm, this looks like it. Well, then I will officially ask you to help us with our mission here. "
msgstr "嗯，这就是了。那我就正式请你帮我们这里的忙了。"

msgid "You need more training. See you when you reach Lv65."
msgstr "你还得多历练。等你到Lv65再来见我。"

msgid "Good. But first, I need to ask you something urgently. "
msgstr "好。不过首先，我有件急事要问你。"

msgid "By the way, where's the [Captain Recommendation]? [Sailor] Kidd? That clumsy fool must have forgotten to give it to you. Please come back with it. "
msgstr "话说回来，[队长推荐信]呢？[水手]基德？那个笨手笨脚的蠢货一定是忘了给你。请带着它再来。"

msgid "I think [Merchant] Drill has something to say to you. Go talk to him."
msgstr "我想[商人]德里尔有话要对你说。去和他谈谈。"

msgid "We broke up with other party at the Port Pugative and came striaght here first to Islant. "
msgstr "我们在普格蒂夫港和一行人分手后，先直接来到了艾斯兰特。"

msgid "Our mission is to collect articles that are rare and precious to Islant area. "
msgstr "我们的任务是收集艾斯兰特地区稀有珍贵的物品。"

msgid "But with the failure to employ combat troops, we are just sitting here stand-by. But now that the captain sent us you, would you please help us? "
msgstr "但因为没能雇到战斗部队，我们只能在这儿干等待命。如今船长把你派来了，你能帮帮我们吗？"

msgid "You¡¯re going to help us, aren¡¯t you? Good. Then, let¡¯s collect the items that we decided to collect, one by one. First, collect the [Blood of Berserker] from [Half Troll Berserker] and then deliver it to [Appraiser] Rockus. It¡¯s very popular because it hugely increases the body¡¯s adrenaline. "
msgstr "你会帮我们的，对吧？好。那我们就一件件收集我们定好的物品。首先，从[半巨魔狂战士]身上收集[狂战士之血]，再交给[鉴定师]罗库斯。它因为能大幅提升身体的肾上腺素而很受欢迎。"

msgid "I think [Trader] Ellen has something to say to you. Go talk to him."
msgstr "我想[商人]埃伦有话要对你说。去和他谈谈。"

msgid "We broke up with other party at the Port Hashak and came striaght here first to Islant. "
msgstr "我们在哈沙克港和一行人分手后，先直接来到了艾斯兰特。"

msgid "You¡¯re going to help us, aren¡¯t you? Good. Then, let¡¯s collect the items that we decided to collect, one by one. First, collect the [Blood of Berserker] from [Half Troll Berserker] and then deliver it to [Appraiser] Diz. It¡¯s very popular because it hugely increases the body¡¯s adrenaline. "
msgstr "你会帮我们的，对吧？好。那我们就一件件收集我们定好的物品。首先，从[半巨魔狂战士]身上收集[狂战士之血]，再交给[鉴定师]迪兹。它因为能大幅提升身体的肾上腺素而很受欢迎。"

msgid "Man, another collecting mission? Talk to the [Item Appraiser] Lockers. "
msgstr "天啊，又一个收集任务？去找[物品鉴定师]罗库斯谈谈。"

msgid "Hmm ... This looks like ... Whoa, you the hell are you?"
msgstr "嗯……这看起来……哇，你到底是谁？"

msgid "Oh, [Trader] Drill sent you here. You surprised me, standing there like that! Anyway, that¡¯s not important. I¡¯ll get to the point right away. Please obtain [Blood of Berserker] from [Half Troll Berserker]. It¡¯s very precious, since it increases the body¡¯s adrenaline very rapidly. Please bring it carefully."
msgstr "哦，是[商人]德里尔派你来的。你这么站着吓了我一跳！算了，那不重要。我这就说正事。请从[半巨魔狂战士]身上取得[狂战士之血]。它能极快地提升身体的肾上腺素，非常珍贵。请小心带来。"

msgid "You haven't got it yet? Talk to me when you have it. I'm busy organizing the list. ."
msgstr "你还没弄到？弄到了再来找我。我正忙着整理清单。"

msgid "Well, Good. We have enough now.  "
msgstr "好。这下够了。"

msgid "Well, then I need to start the appraisal but I am currently out of [Exid Potion]. Can you bring me a few [Exid Potion] from the [Store]?"
msgstr "那我该开始鉴定了，可我现在[高效药水]用完了。你能从[商店]给我买几瓶[高效药水]来吗？"

msgid "Oh, [Trader] Drill sent you here. You surprised me by standing there like that! Anyway, that¡¯s not important. I¡¯ll get to the point right away. Please obtain [Blood of Berserker] from [Half Troll Berserker]. It¡¯s very precious, since it increases the body¡¯s adrenaline very rapidly. Please bring it carefully."
msgstr "哦，是[商人]德里尔派你来的。你这么站着吓了我一跳！算了，那不重要。我这就说正事。请从[半巨魔狂战士]身上取得[狂战士之血]。它能极快地提升身体的肾上腺素，非常珍贵。请小心带来。"

msgid "[Item Appraiser] Lockers is appraising something. Let's go take a look. "
msgstr "[物品鉴定师]罗库斯正在鉴定东西。我们去看看吧。"

msgid "There you are. Now that you have what I asked you for, shall we start the appraisal? "
msgstr "你来了。既然你把我要的东西弄来了，我们开始鉴定吧？"

msgid "Well, that's why I need to start the appraisal but I am currently out of [Exid Potion]. Can you bring me a few [Exid Potion] from the [Store]?"
msgstr "嗯，正因如此我才要开始鉴定，可我现在[高效药水]用完了。你能从[商店]给我买几瓶[高效药水]来吗？"

msgid "Are you holding a grudge against me? Go get it fast."
msgstr "你是记恨我了？快去弄来。"

msgid "So you have it. Well done. Let's start the appraisal."
msgstr "你弄到了。干得好。我们开始鉴定吧。"

msgid "Then, I will see you when you reach Lv66. You don't have enough skills to collect the following items."
msgstr "那么，等你到Lv66再见。接下来的东西你现在还没本事收集。"

msgid "And in the meanwhile, please collect the next item. [First-Class Canine] from [Iron Claws]. It's very precious and tough to get it.  Good luck."
msgstr "趁这工夫，请收集下一样物品。从[铁爪]身上取[一等犬齿]。它非常珍贵，很难得。祝好运。"

msgid "[Item Appraiser] Disney is appraising something. Let's go take a look. "
msgstr "[物品鉴定师]迪兹正在鉴定东西。我们去看看吧。"

msgid "And in the meantime, please collect the next item. [First-Class Canine] from [Iron Claws]. It's very precious and tough to get it.  Good luck."
msgstr "趁这工夫，请收集下一样物品。从[铁爪]身上取[一等犬齿]。它非常珍贵，很难得。祝好运。"

msgid "Is appraisal done yet? Let's go to [Item Appraiser] Lockers."
msgstr "鉴定还没好吗？我们去找[物品鉴定师]罗库斯吧。"

msgid "Hmm ... So it takes a longer time that I thought to calculate each quality. "
msgstr "嗯……鉴定每样品质要花的时间比我想的长。"

msgid "You don't have it yet?"
msgstr "你还没弄到？"

msgid "That was fast. I'm not even through with the previous appraisal yet. "
msgstr "真快。我上一样还没鉴定完呢。"

msgid "Well, we still have a lot of time left.  In the meantime, let's collect the next item. I need [Thick Half Troll Leather] from [Half Troll Captain]. It's the toughest of all leather. This time, take your time."
msgstr "那我们时间还多。趁这工夫，收集下一样物品吧。我要从[半巨魔队长]身上取[厚实半巨魔皮]。它是所有皮革中最坚韧的。这次你慢慢来。"

msgid "Well, we still have a lot of time left.  In the meantime, let's collect the next item. I need [Thick Half Troll Leather] from [Half Troll Captain]. It's the toughest of all leather. You can take your time on this."
msgstr "那我们时间还多。趁这工夫，收集下一样物品吧。我要从[半巨魔队长]身上取[厚实半巨魔皮]。它是所有皮革中最坚韧的。这次你可以慢慢来。"

msgid "I guess appraising is a difficult thing. It's about time for [Item Appraiser] Lockers to look for you.  Shall we go to him?"
msgstr "看来鉴定是件麻烦事。该[物品鉴定师]罗库斯找你了。我们去找他吧？"

msgid "Hmm¡¦ It's almost done. Its superb quality gets me so excited. So the next appraisal is on the second item you collected."
msgstr "嗯……快好了。它那绝佳的品质让我兴奋不已。那么接下来鉴定你收集的第二样物品。"

msgid "You don't have it yet? It's okay. Please take your time."
msgstr "你还没弄到？没关系。请慢慢来。"

msgid "Good timing. All appraisals are finished."
msgstr "来得正好。鉴定全部完成了。"

msgid "It¡¯s taking longer than I thought to appraise. While you¡¯re waiting, please go to [Blacksmith] Heppa of Moradon and receive [Appraisal Tool Set], which I have requested from him not long ago. Then, bring it to me. I guess it¡¯ll cost a hundred thousand Noahs, so bring the money. Don¡¯t worry. I¡¯ll give you the money when you bring the receipt."
msgstr "鉴定比我想的要花时间。你等着的时候，去莫拉登的[铁匠]赫帕那里取我不久前向他订的[鉴定工具套装]，再带给我。我估摸着要花十万诺亚，所以把钱带上。别担心。你把收据带来，我就把钱给你。"

msgid "I guess appraising is a difficult thing. It's about time for [Item Appraiser] Disney to look for you.  Shall we go to him?"
msgstr "看来鉴定是件麻烦事。该[物品鉴定师]迪兹找你了。我们去找他吧？"

msgid "It¡¯s taking longer than I thought to appraise. While you're waiting, please go to [Blacksmith] Heppa of Moradon and receive [Appraisal Tool Set], which I have requested from him not long ago. Then, bring it to me. I guess it¡¯ll cost a hundred thousand Noahs, so bring the money. Don¡¯t worry. I¡¯ll give you the money when you bring the receipt."
msgstr "鉴定比我想的要花时间。你等着的时候，去莫拉登的[铁匠]赫帕那里取我不久前向他订的[鉴定工具套装]，再带给我。我估摸着要花十万诺亚，所以把钱带上。别担心。你把收据带来，我就把钱给你。"

msgid "Ahh, this is exhausting. We should go to  [Item Appraiser] Lockers.  I think he's holding a grudge against us. Boohoo."
msgstr "啊，真累人。我们该去找[物品鉴定师]罗库斯了。我觉得他记恨上我们了。呜呜。"

msgid "Phew ... So finally the appraisal is done. It took too much time."
msgstr "呼……鉴定终于完成了。花了太多时间。"

msgid "It¡¯s taking longer than I thought to appraise. While you¡¯re waiting, please go to [Blacksmith] Heppa of Moradon and receive [Appraisal Tool Set], which I have requested from him not long ago. Then, bring it to me. I guess it¡¯ll cost a hundred Noahs, so bring the money. Don¡¯t worry. I¡¯ll give you the money when you bring the receipt."
msgstr "鉴定比我想的要花时间。你等着的时候，去莫拉登的[铁匠]赫帕那里取我不久前向他订的[鉴定工具套装]，再带给我。我估摸着要花一百诺亚，所以把钱带上。别担心。你把收据带来，我就把钱给你。"

msgid "100,000 Noa?, Where's the tool?"
msgstr "十万诺亚？工具呢？"

msgid "You are finally here. So you have managed to set aside all your emotions!"
msgstr "你终于来了。看来你已经把心情都收拾好了！"

msgid "Then please come back when you reach Lv67. You will only be able to collect the next items then.  "
msgstr "那等你到Lv67再来。到那时你才能收集下一样物品。"

msgid "Then, shall we bring it together and search for the next item? The next item is [Brilliant Stone] of [Death Wizard].  Good luck. "
msgstr "那我们把这个一并带去，找下一样物品吧？下一样是[死亡巫师]的[光辉石]。祝好运。"

msgid "Ahh, this is already the fourth! How many times more is [Item Appraiser] Lockers going to sweat us? "
msgstr "啊，这都第四次了！[物品鉴定师]罗库斯还要折腾我们几回？"

msgid "You are here. [Appraisal Tool Set] has really did its job. Hahaha! Thank you, <selfname.."
msgstr "你来了。[鉴定工具套装]可真派上了用场。哈哈哈！谢谢你，<selfname>。"

msgid "Lalalala - Huh? You don't have it yet?"
msgstr "啦啦啦——嗯？你还没弄到？"

msgid "Good! Let me start the appraisal at once."
msgstr "好！我这就开始鉴定。"

msgid "Come on, there is no time for a rest. Let's collect the next item. It's going to the last item. Go get  [Perfect Goat Horn] of [Satyros]. It's the most expensive item of this area!"
msgstr "来，没时间休息了。我们收集下一样物品吧。这将是最后一样。去取[萨提罗斯]的[完整公羊角]。这可是这一带最贵重的物品！"

msgid "There is nothing more to collect in Islant and he still wants us. Will this be the last time? Go to [Item Appraiser] Lockers. "
msgstr "艾斯兰特已经没什么可收集的了，可他还在找我们。这会是最后一次吗？去找[物品鉴定师]罗库斯吧。"

msgid "Oh, you are here. It feels good to finish the appraisal fast. Thanks to you, I have secured a lot of good items. "
msgstr "哦，你来了。这么快就鉴定完真痛快。多亏你，我弄到了不少好东西。"

msgid "You don't have it yet? Is it too much for you to handle?"
msgstr "你还没弄到？对你来说太难了吗？"

msgid "There's nothing too difficult for you to collect! Well done. "
msgstr "没有你收集不到的东西！干得好。"

msgid "All searches are done. I have acquired many first-class items. Oh, [Merchant] Drill has something to say to you. Please go meet him. "
msgstr "所有采集都完成了。我弄到了许多一等品。哦，[商人]德里尔有话要对你说。请去见他。"

