msgstr "看来魔法这东西很棘手。去找[魔法协会]的塞萨尔吧，他会给你下一个任务。"

msgid "It is an honor to meet you again. The last mission was successful. You did an excellent job."
msgstr "很高兴再次见到你。上一个任务很成功。你干得漂亮。"

msgid "Let me give your next mission right away. Please take down their second axis, the [Half Troll Sorcerer]. It's going to be tougher but I have my faith in you. "
msgstr "我这就交代下一个任务。请拿下他们的第二根支柱[半巨魔巫师]。这会更棘手，但我相信你。"

msgid "The magic force is becoming more unstable. Please take down the second axis, the [Half Troll Sorcerer]."
msgstr "魔力正变得越来越不稳定。请拿下第二根支柱[半巨魔巫师]。"

msgid "The second axis has collapsed successfully. But we are not safe yet."
msgstr "第二根支柱已成功倒下。但我们还不安全。"

msgid "I will explain your next mission when you reach Lv67. It is too early yet."
msgstr "等你达到67级，我再交代下一个任务。现在还太早。"

msgid "I'll next mission. During the five-axis began to stroke the magic of the darkness disappears and the two balance fluctuations. Fend down the a axis, with remaining two must be balanced. Please balance out quickly by removing the Death Wizard."
msgstr "接下来的任务。五根支柱中有两根被黑暗魔法侵蚀消失，平衡出现了波动。击倒其中一根支柱后，剩下两根必须保持平衡。请尽快除掉[死亡法师]来恢复平衡。"

msgid "I feel something even worse in Islant. Would Cesar of [Associate of Magic] know what's going on?"
msgstr "我感觉艾斯兰特出了更糟的事。[魔法协会]的塞萨尔知道是怎么回事吗？"

msgid "Just in the nick of time. We have an emergency."
msgstr "来得正是时候。我们有紧急情况。"

msgid "Will the next mission. During the five-axis began to stroke the magic of the darkness disappears and the two balance fluctuations. Fend down the a axis, with remaining two must be balanced. Please balance out quickly by removing the Death Wizard."
msgstr "接下来的任务。五根支柱中有两根被黑暗魔法侵蚀消失，平衡出现了波动。击倒其中一根支柱后，剩下两根必须保持平衡。请尽快除掉[死亡法师]来恢复平衡。"

msgid "Uhh... I'm not sure how much longer it can hold up. Please get rid of [Death Wizard] at once."
msgstr "呃……我不确定它还能撑多久。请立刻除掉[死亡法师]。"

msgid "Huff ... Now it is balanced. I thought we almost lost it."
msgstr "呼……现在平衡了。我还以为我们快撑不住了。"

msgid "I will explain your next mission when you reach Lv68. It is too early yet."
msgstr "等你达到68级，我再交代下一个任务。现在还太早。"

msgid "Now just two axes left. You really need to move faster now. First, eliminate [Bitter Apostle]. They must be elimiated first before we can destroy the other axis."
msgstr "现在只剩两根支柱了。你得加快速度了。先除掉[苦痛使徒]。必须先消灭它们，才能摧毁另一根支柱。"

msgid "The magic force is now in balance. Cesar of [Associate of Magic] says things must be done swiftly without delay from now on. "
msgstr "魔力现已恢复平衡。[魔法协会]的塞萨尔说，从今往后事情必须迅速处理、不得拖延。"

msgid "There you are. Let me explain right away."
msgstr "你来了。我这就说明。"

msgid "Now just two axes left. You really need to move faster now. First, eliminate [Frost Apostle]. They must be elimiated first before we can destroy the other axis."
msgstr "现在只剩两根支柱了。你得加快速度了。先除掉[冰霜使徒]。必须先消灭它们，才能摧毁另一根支柱。"

msgid "They are about to collapst but not just yet."
msgstr "它们快要倒下了，但还没到时候。"

msgid "Now just one axis left. Let's get it together."
msgstr "现在只剩一根支柱了。我们一鼓作气吧。"

msgid "I will explain your next mission when you reach Lv69. It is too early yet."
msgstr "等你达到69级，我再交代下一个任务。现在还太早。"

msgid "Okay, we are left with just one axis. Once that is taken down, the magic force of Islant will normalize along with other regions. Please eliminate [Stormy Apostle]. They are the last axis. With them gone, everything will be stable again."
msgstr "好，我们只剩最后一根支柱了。一旦将它拿下，艾斯兰特的魔力就会与其他地区一同恢复正常。请除掉[风暴使徒]。它们是最后一根支柱。它们一消失，一切就会再度稳定。"

msgid "Just one axis left! Let's go get'em. "
msgstr "只剩一根支柱了！我们上吧，干掉它们。"

msgid "Are you all ready?"
msgstr "你们都准备好了吗？"

msgid "The last axis still remains for magic force is yet in balance. Do a little better."
msgstr "最后一根支柱仍在，因为魔力尚未恢复平衡。再加把劲。"

msgid "The magic force is coming back! The Islant will soon be stable."
msgstr "魔力正在恢复！艾斯兰特很快就会稳定下来。"

msgid "You have done very well. Please help us [Associate of Magic] again."
msgstr "你做得非常好。请再帮帮我们[魔法协会]吧。"

msgid "Master, are you familiar with [Nightmare Sinner]? They appear in people's dream and extort of their souls. I didn't think they actually exist! Let's go see Cesar of [Associate of Magic]."
msgstr "师傅，你听说过[梦魇罪人]吗？它们会出现在人们的梦中，夺走他们的灵魂。我没想到它们真的存在！我们去见[魔法协会]的塞萨尔吧。"

msgid "Ah, you are here, <selfname>. I'm in a mess because I've gone through so much stress these days. It's because of the monsters that are stigmatized as [Nightmare Sinner]. And I'm in charge of eliminating them. Can you please help me?"
msgstr "啊，你来了，<selfname>。我最近压力太大，搞得一团糟。都是因为那些被称作[梦魇罪人]的怪物。而消灭它们正是我的职责。你能帮帮我吗？"

msgid "Ah, thank you. Then, please take care of [Doomed Knights] first. What rancour could they possible have against people that they appear in their dreams to torment them? Well, be careful and good luck!"
msgstr "啊，谢谢。那么，请先解决[末日骑士团]。它们究竟对人有什么深仇大恨，要跑到梦里去折磨人呢？好了，小心点，祝你好运！"

msgid "Not yet? Please hurry. "
msgstr "还没好吗？请快点。"

msgid "Well done. You live upto your name, <selfname>"
msgstr "干得好。你果然名不虚传，<selfname>。"

msgid "The second nightmare sinners are called the [Nightmare]. They are the worst of their kind. They appear in people's dream riding a horse and guide them to the deep end of nightmare. Be careful and good luck!"
msgstr "第二批梦魇罪人叫做[梦魇]。它们是同类中最凶恶的。它们会骑在马上出现在人们的梦中，把人引向梦魇的深渊。小心点，祝你好运！"

msgid "Hello again. Thank you last time for the [Doom Knight]. However, [Nightmare Sinners] are still around. "
msgstr "又见面了。上次谢谢你解决了[末日骑士]。不过[梦魇罪人]仍在四处出没。"

msgid "[The endless desire of the sinners that devour dreams...] What the¡¦ You didn'tleave yet?"
msgstr "[吞噬梦境的罪人们无尽的欲望……]搞什么，你还没走？"

msgid "Oh no, you completed eliminated them."
msgstr "哦不，你已经把它们全部消灭了。"

msgid "Thank you. All existing [Nightmare Sinners] all paid for their sins. However, another [Nightmare sinners] may appear once again. If such day comes, I hope you could help us again. "
msgstr "谢谢你。现存的[梦魇罪人]都已为自己的罪孽付出了代价。不过，别的[梦魇罪人]或许还会再次出现。若那一天到来，希望你能再帮帮我们。"

msgid "[Nightmare Sinners]¡¦ It's a terrifying name. Leisa of [Associate of Magic] is looking for you again. Hurry down to Islant at once. "
msgstr "[梦魇罪人]……真是个可怕的名字。[魔法协会]的雷莎又在找你了。赶快去艾斯兰特。"

msgid "[Chief Researcher] Gaz is in Islant. He's doing a research on magic at the [Magic Soceity]."
msgstr "[首席研究员]加兹在艾斯兰特。他正在[魔法协会]做一项魔法研究。"

msgid "What do you want? Unless it's urgent, leave me alone."
msgstr "你想干什么？除非急事，否则别来烦我。"

msgid "The leader? I see. Let me explain to you. There have been some strange movements of magical creatures in Islant. And I'm here to invetigate by collecting specimen and conducting a research.g specimen."
msgstr "会长吗？明白了。我来跟你解释。艾斯兰特的魔法生物出现了一些奇怪的动静。我来这里正是为了采集标本、展开研究。"

msgid "By specimen, I mean magical creatures in whose body [Mana Piece] is already finished crystalizing. And I collect and analyze them. <selfname>, it would mean a great deal if you could collect [Mana Piece] and bring them back to me."
msgstr "所谓标本，指的是体内[魔力碎片]已经结晶完成的魔法生物。我负责收集并分析它们。<selfname>，如果你能收集[魔力碎片]带回来给我，意义重大。"

msgid "If you have decided to help me, please first bring me the apparatus. I need a catalyst called [Potion of Soul] and [Magician's Stone] to test its reaction to pure magic. You can get them from [Potion Merchant] and [Store] respectively. Please hurry."
msgstr "如果你决定帮我，请先把器具带来。我需要一种叫[灵魂药水]的催化剂和[法师之石]，来测试它对纯魔法的反应。你可以分别从[药水商人]和[商店]那里获得。请快点。"

msgid "[Chief Researcher] Aldos is in Islant. He's doing a research on magic at the [Magic Soceity]."
msgstr "[首席研究员]奥尔多斯在艾斯兰特。他正在[魔法协会]做一项魔法研究。"

msgid "[Chief Researcher] Gaz needs materials for his experiment."
msgstr "[首席研究员]加兹的实验需要材料。"

msgid "So did you decide to help me?"
msgstr "那么，你决定帮我了吗？"

msgid "You don't have enough money? You lack a lot of stuff."
msgstr "你钱不够？你缺的东西可多着呢。"

msgid "Good, you have collect them well."
msgstr "很好，你收集得不错。"

msgid "Please come back to me when you reach Lv66. You look very weak. You need to be stronger."
msgstr "请达到66级后再来找我。你看起来很虚弱，需要变得更强。"

msgid "Then, please collect [Mana Piece] of the magical creature.|First collect [Unstable Mana Piece] from [Half Troll Sorcerer]. It has the most disturbing appearance. With that, I should be able to dig into the cause."
msgstr "那么，请采集魔法生物的[魔力碎片]。|先从[半巨魔巫师]身上采集[不稳定魔力碎片]。它的样子最令人不安。有了它，我应该就能查明原因。"

msgid "[Chief Researcher] Aldos needs materials for his experiment."
msgstr "[首席研究员]奥尔多斯的实验需要材料。"

msgid "Then, please collect [Mana Piece] of the magical creature. |First collect [Unstable Mana Piece] from [Half Troll Sorcerer]. It has the most disturbing appearance. With that, I should be able to dig into the cause."
msgstr "那么，请采集魔法生物的[魔力碎片]。 |先从[半巨魔巫师]身上采集[不稳定魔力碎片]。它的样子最令人不安。有了它，我应该就能查明原因。"

msgid "[Chief Researcher] Gaz is starting his research. He wouldn't be able to collect all that by himself. Let's go help him."
msgstr "[首席研究员]加兹开始了他的研究。他一个人收集不了那么多。我们去帮帮他。"

msgid "You are here. You should prepare them in advance because it could be a tough work. "
msgstr "你来了。这活儿可能很辛苦，你最好事先做好准备。"

msgid "It's [Unstable Mana Piece] from the [Half Troll Sorcerer].  You haven't forgotten, right?"
msgstr "是从[半巨魔巫师]那里取得的[不稳定魔力碎片]。你没忘吧？"

msgid "It's twisting the flow of manas around as if it's unstable¡¦just like the book said."
msgstr "它正扰乱周围魔力的流动，似乎很不稳定……就跟书上写的一样。"

msgid "Please come back to me when you reach Lv67. You look very weak. You need to be stronger."
msgstr "请达到67级后再来找我。你看起来很虚弱，需要变得更强。"

msgid "The next [Mana Piece] is [Unstable Mana Piece] of [Death Wizard]. Also called envoy, they suck the vitim's last worldly thought and in doing that, they acculumate impure energy. And recently that energy had an explosive amount of growth. Please hurry."
msgstr "下一个[魔力碎片]是[死亡法师]的[不稳定魔力碎片]。它们也被称为使者，会吸取受害者临终时对尘世的最后一缕执念，并借此积聚不纯的能量。而最近那股能量爆发式地增长。请快点。"

msgid "You are here. You should prepare them in advance because it can be a tough work. "
msgstr "你来了。这活儿可能很辛苦，你最好事先做好准备。"

msgid "The next [Mana Piece] is [Impure Mana Piece] of [Death Wizard]. Also called envoy, they suck the vitim's last worldly thought and in doing that, they acculumate impure energy. And recently that energy had an explosive amount of growth. Please hurry."
msgstr "下一个[魔力碎片]是[死亡法师]的[不纯魔力碎片]。它们也被称为使者，会吸取受害者临终时对尘世的最后一缕执念，并借此积聚不纯的能量。而最近那股能量爆发式地增长。请快点。"

msgid "Got a call, he needs the second [Mana Piece]. Go to [Chief Researcher] Gaz."
msgstr "来了电话，他需要第二块[魔力碎片]。去找[首席研究员]加兹。"

msgid "So I see you again. You had no choice? Hmm... you could refuse if you want to. Well...enough of idle talk."
msgstr "又见到你了。你别无选择了？嗯……你想拒绝也可以。好了……闲话少说。"

msgid "Anyway, next [Mana Pieces] that you should collect are [Impure Mana Pieces] of [Death Wizards]. They, also called as a psycho-pump, absorb the last consciousness from their victims and accumulate impure energies in their body during that evil deed. However, the numbers of those [Death Wizards] have increased enormously in recent days. Please hurry."
msgstr "总之，接下来你要收集的[魔力碎片]是[死亡法师]的[不纯魔力碎片]。它们也被称为引导亡灵者，会在作恶时吸取受害者的最后意识，并在体内积聚不纯能量。不过，近来这些[死亡法师]的数量急剧增加。请快点。"

msgid "It's [Impure Mana Piece] from the [Death Wizard]. Understand?  [Death Wizard] and [Impure Mana Piece]!"
msgstr "是从[死亡法师]那里取得的[不纯魔力碎片]。明白吗？[死亡法师]和[不纯魔力碎片]！"

msgid "So this is [Impure Mana Piece]. Let's hurry and see the reaction.."
msgstr "原来这就是[不纯魔力碎片]。我们快点看看反应吧。"

msgid "Let's see ¡¦next I need [Frost Mana Piece]. As you can expect, you can get it from [Frost Apostle]. It is a magical creature that uses the cold magic. Please go get it."
msgstr "我看看……接下来我需要[冰霜魔力碎片]。你大概猜到了，可以从[冰霜使徒]那里取得。它是一种使用寒冷魔法的魔法生物。请去取来。"

msgid "So I see you again. You had no choice? You could refuse if you want to. Well...enough of idle talk."
msgstr "又见到你了。你想拒绝也可以。好了……闲话少说。"

msgid "Please come back to me when you reach Lv68. You look very weak. You need to be stronger."
msgstr "请达到68级后再来找我。你看起来很虚弱，需要变得更强。"

msgid "I feel like [Chief Researcher] Gaz is going to need you. Let's go to Islant."
msgstr "我感觉[首席研究员]加兹要找你了。我们去艾斯兰特吧。"

msgid "What a coincidence! I was just about to ask for you."
msgstr "真巧！我正想找你呢。"

msgid "[Frost Mana Piece] from the [Frost Apostle]¡¦are they called [Frost Apostle] because they give you [Frost Mana Piece]? Kekeke...it's just too funny. By the way, what are you doing here? "
msgstr "从[冰霜使徒]那里取得的[冰霜魔力碎片]……它们是因为会给人[冰霜魔力碎片]才叫[冰霜使徒]的吗？咯咯咯……真是太好笑了。对了，你来这里做什么？"

msgid "Just looking at it makes me cold. Please give it to me fast. "
msgstr "光是看着它我就觉得冷。快给我吧。"

msgid "Please come back to me when you reach Lv69. You look very weak. You need to be stronger."
msgstr "请达到69级后再来找我。你看起来很虚弱，需要变得更强。"

msgid "So this is going to be the last one. It will be pretty tough this time. It's the [Storm Apostle], a magical creature that uses storm magic. Please get the [Storm Mana Piece] which carries their energy."
msgstr "这就是最后一个了。这次会相当棘手。是[风暴使徒]，一种使用风暴魔法的魔法生物。请去取走承载着它们能量的[风暴魔力碎片]。"

msgid "I feel like [Chief Researcher] Aldos is going to need you. Let's go to Islant."
msgstr "我感觉[首席研究员]奥尔多斯要找你了。我们去艾斯兰特吧。"

msgid "Got a call from [Chief Researcher] Gaz. He says this going to be the last one. Let's go to Islant."
msgstr "[首席研究员]加兹来了电话。他说这是最后一个了。我们去艾斯兰特吧。"

msgid "Ah, you are here. I'm going to ask you for the last request. The previous researches went smoothly so I suspect no need for further experiments. Now, there's only one last experiment left to go."
msgstr "啊，你来了。我要拜托你最后一件事。之前的研究都很顺利，我想不需要再做实验了。现在只剩最后一个实验了。"

msgid "It will be pretty tough this time. It's the [Storm Apostle], a magical creature that uses storm magic. Please get the [Storm Mana Piece] which carries their energy."
msgstr "这次会相当棘手。是[风暴使徒]，一种使用风暴魔法的魔法生物。请去取走承载着它们能量的[风暴魔力碎片]。"

msgid "It's [Storm Apostle]. It's [Storm Mana Piece]!. Please don't do this to me."
msgstr "是[风暴使徒]。是[风暴魔力碎片]！求你别这样对我。"

msgid "Nicely done. I can now do the final experiment."
msgstr "干得漂亮。我现在可以做最后的实验了。"

msgid "You have done very well. You will be on top of my list if I need something else in the future, <selfname. Goodbye. "
msgstr "你做得非常好。将来我要是还需要帮手，第一个就找你，<selfname>。再见。"

msgid "Got a call from [Chief Researcher] Ados. He says this going to be the last one. Let's go to Islant."
msgstr "[首席研究员]奥尔多斯来了电话。他说这是最后一个了。我们去艾斯兰特吧。"

msgid "What? Did you say that you want to extract the magic power? It¡¯s not difficult. I can extract magic power for one time per one ore. Well, two times are possible, with luck. So, do you want to do it?|¡Ø This menu is only for the quest [Knock, and the Door Will Open].|¡Ø You need [Mysterious Ore] or [Mysterious Gold Ore]."
msgstr "什么？你说你想提取魔力？这不难。每一块矿石我可以提取一次魔力。运气好的话，两次也行。那么，你想做吗？|※ 此菜单仅用于任务[敲门，门便会为你敞开]。|※ 你需要[神秘矿石]或[神秘金矿石]。"

msgid "Not sure if it went well."
msgstr "不知道进行得顺不顺利。"

msgid "You need to speak to Bros of [Associate of Magic] of Land Ronark."
msgstr "你需要去见罗纳克之地[魔法协会]的布罗斯。"

msgid "You have to receive [Common Old Ring] from [Grand Merchant¡¯s Daughter] Menissiah of Moradon and [Marble that conveys Magic Power] from [Mercenary Supply Officer] Osmond in Folk Village of Moradon, and deliver them at the request of [Magic Society] Bros, of Ronark Land. "
msgstr "你需要从莫拉登[大商人之女]梅尼西亚那里取得[普通旧戒指]，从莫拉登村落的[佣兵补给官]奥斯蒙那里取得[传导魔力的大理石]，并应罗纳克之地[魔法协会]布罗斯的要求把它们送去。"

msgid "You have to receive [Common Old Ring] from [Grand Merchant¡¯s Daughter] Menissiah of Moradon and [Marble that conveys Magic Power] from [Mercenary Supply Officer] Osmond in Folk Village of Moradon, and deliver them at the request of [Magic Society] Seis, of Ronark Land. "
msgstr "你需要从莫拉登[大商人之女]梅尼西亚那里取得[普通旧戒指]，从莫拉登村落的[佣兵补给官]奥斯蒙那里取得[传导魔力的大理石]，并应罗纳克之地[魔法协会]塞斯的要求把它们送去。"

msgid "You have to make [Exquisitely Carved Sealing Ring] using [Common Old Ring] and [Marble that conveys Magic Power] and bring it to [Jeweler] Jewel of Moradon at the request of [Magic Society] Bros, of Ronark Land. |¡Ø You¡¯ll need 200,000 Noahs to make [Exquisitely Carved Sealing Ring]."
