msgstr "好久不见，<selfname>。我还以为你在这儿没什么事了。嗯……[魔力传导/扩散大理石]？我这儿堆了一大堆。看在老交情上，给你一块也无妨。不过这事你可得对雷格保密。"

msgid "So you want me to make [Delicately Crafted Seal Ring]? Let see¡¦you got [Plain Old Ring], [Magic Power Transmission/Diffusion Marble]...Guess you got all the materials.  But it's going to cost you [200,000 Noahs]. Do you still want it? "
msgstr "你想让我做[精雕封印戒指]？我看看……你有[普通旧戒指]、[魔力传导/扩散大理石]……看来材料都齐了。不过这要收你[20万诺亚]。你还要做吗？"

msgid "You need more materials. You need [Plain Old Ring], [Magic Power Transmission/Diffusion Marble] along with [200,000 Noahs]. I guess you can get the materials from the one who requested this. And as for noahs...well...good luck! "
msgstr "你还缺材料。你需要[普通旧戒指]、[魔力传导/扩散大理石]以及[20万诺亚]。材料嘛，我想你可以找拜托你的人要。至于诺亚嘛……那就祝你好运了！"

msgid "Here, it's finished. Piece of a cake. Please come back to me if you need anything else."
msgstr "给，做好了。小菜一碟。还需要什么就再来找我。"

msgid "Oh, it's you again. I've been waiting for you. You must have [Hidden Seal Letter] with you, don't you? Here, take it. I'm sure you will nail it."
msgstr "哦，又是你。我一直在等你。你身上一定带着[隐秘封印信]吧？给，拿好。我相信你一定能搞定。"

msgid "Oh, you are here! You must be here for what [Associate of Magic] has requested. I have just finished it. Harharhar! This is a piece of cake for me. This is the [Unlocking Lock] that never unlocks!"
msgstr "哦，你来了！你一定是为[魔法协会]拜托的事而来。我刚做完。哈哈哈哈！这对我来说就是小菜一碟。这就是那把永远打不开的[解锁之锁]！"

msgid "I'm patrol leader [Chaser] of [White Shadow]. I'm currently in charge of patrolling Croix estate. "
msgstr "我是[白影]的巡逻队长[追逐者]。我目前负责巡逻克鲁瓦庄园。"

msgid "So you need the [Water of Croix Estate]. You don't need to look any further because I have it. Let me give you some."
msgstr "这么说你需要[克鲁瓦庄园之水]？你不用再到处找了，我这儿就有。我给你一些吧。"

msgid "[There's an unknown energy]"
msgstr "[存在一股未知的能量]"

msgid "Evil energy is roaring. Do you want to summon devil? "
msgstr "邪恶的能量在咆哮。你想召唤恶魔吗？"

msgid "Kekekeke¡¦.Kekekeke¡¦Kekekekek¡¦hmmmm¡¦kekekekeke"
msgstr "咯咯咯……咯咯咯……咯咯咯咯……嗯哼哼……咯咯咯咯咯"

msgid "It's the [Eye of the Wise Queen]. Kekeke¡¦with scraficing it, are you trying to summon [That Guy]? Well, it doesn't matter. Kekekeke"
msgstr "这是[智慧女王之眼]。咯咯……你是想献祭它来召唤[那家伙]吗？罢了，无所谓。咯咯咯"

msgid "Oh no, you lost it? Let me give it to you again."
msgstr "哦不，你把它弄丢了？我再给你一份吧。"

msgid "Do you need [Devil Summon Letter]? It was free the first time but you need [1,000,000 Noahs] thereafter. Do you want to spend 1,000,000 noahs to buy it?"
msgstr "你需要[恶魔召唤信]吗？首次免费，但之后需要[100万诺亚]。你想花100万诺亚买它吗？"

msgid "Do you need [Devil Summon Letter]? It was free the first time but you need [1,000,000 Noahs] thereafter. But you don't have enough noa. Remember, I can only give it to you when you have 1,000,000 noahs."
msgstr "你需要[恶魔召唤信]吗？首次免费，但之后需要[100万诺亚]。可你的诺亚不够。记住，只有当你有100万诺亚时我才能给你。"

msgid "There is not enough space in the inventory. Secure enough space and then come back."
msgstr "背包空间不足。留出足够空间后再来。"

msgid "What do you want with me?"
msgstr "你找我有什么事？"

msgid "Master! [Associate of Magic] is looking for you in Ronark Land. What do they want this time?"
msgstr "师傅！[魔法协会]在罗纳克之地找你。这次又是什么事？"

msgid "Greetings, <selfname>. I am Bros of [Associate of Magic]. I'm on some mission here in Ronark Land."
msgstr "你好，<selfname>。我是[魔法协会]的布罗斯。我在罗纳克之地执行某项任务。"

msgid "It's called the [Devil War]. Many members of [Associate of Magic] have fought and died in this war."
msgstr "这叫做[恶魔战争]。许多[魔法协会]的成员都在这场战争中奋战并牺牲了。"

msgid "Therefore I want to make a request to you. Can you participate in this [Devil War]? Help us seal [72 Devil] and drive devils away from this world."
msgstr "因此我想拜托你一件事。你能参加这场[恶魔战争]吗？帮我们封印[72恶魔]，把恶魔从这个世界驱逐出去。"

msgid "Thank you! First, we¡¯ll need a ring to seal the devils. I¡¯m not able to leave my place now, so please collect the materials instead of me. First, receive [Common Old Ring] from [Grand Merchant¡¯s Daughter] Menissiah of Moradon and [Marble that conveys Magic Power] from [Mercenary Supply Officer] Osmond in Folk Village of Moradon and bring them to me."
msgstr "谢谢你！首先，我们需要一枚戒指来封印恶魔。我现在不能离开岗位，请你替我去收集材料。先从莫拉登[大商人之女]梅尼西亚那里领取[普通旧戒指]，从莫拉登村落的[佣兵补给官]奥斯蒙那里领取[传导魔力的大理石]，然后带给我。"

msgid "Greetings, <selfname>. I am Seith of [Associate of Magic]. I'm on some mission here in Ronark Land."
msgstr "你好，<selfname>。我是[魔法协会]的塞斯。我在罗纳克之地执行某项任务。"

msgid "Thank you! First, we¡¯ll need a ring to seal the devils. I¡¯m not able to leave my place now, so please collect the materials instead of me. First, receive [Common Old Ring] from [Grand Merchant's Daughter] Menissiah of Moradon and [Marble that conveys Magic Power] from [Mercenary Supply Officer] Osmond in Folk Village of Moradon and bring them to me. "
msgstr "谢谢你！首先，我们需要一枚戒指来封印恶魔。我现在不能离开岗位，请你替我去收集材料。先从莫拉登[大商人之女]梅尼西亚那里领取[普通旧戒指]，从莫拉登村落的[佣兵补给官]奥斯蒙那里领取[传导魔力的大理石]，然后带给我。"

msgid "Hmm,it's the [Devil War]. We may just have gotten ourselves into trouble again. Shall we go to Bros of [Associate of Magic]?"
msgstr "嗯，是[恶魔战争]啊。我们怕是又给自己揽上麻烦了。我们去找[魔法协会]的布罗斯吧？"

msgid "To seal the devils, [Seal Ring] which can hold their souls is required."
msgstr "要封印恶魔，需要一枚能困住他们灵魂的[封印戒指]。"

msgid "I¡¯m not able to leave my place now, so please collect the materials instead of me. First, receive [Common Old Ring] from [Grand Merchant¡¯s Daughter] Menissiah of Moradon and [Marble that conveys Magic Power] from [Mercenary Supply Officer] Osmond, in Folk Village of Moradon, and bring them to me. "
msgstr "我现在不能离开岗位，请你替我去收集材料。先从莫拉登[大商人之女]梅尼西亚那里领取[普通旧戒指]，从莫拉登村落的[佣兵补给官]奥斯蒙那里领取[传导魔力的大理石]，然后带给我。"

msgid "Mm-hmm¡¦You don't have them yet? You can get [Plain Old Ring] from [Grand Merchant's Daughter] Menissiah of Moradon and the [Magic Power Tranmission/Diffusion Marble] from [Mercenary Supply Officer] Osmond of Moradon folk Village. Please hurry."
msgstr "嗯嗯……你还没拿到？你可以从莫拉登[大商人之女]梅尼西亚那里取得[普通旧戒指]，从莫拉登村落的[佣兵补给官]奥斯蒙那里取得[魔力传导/扩散大理石]。请快点。"

msgid "So you collected them all. Great work."
msgstr "原来你都收集齐了。干得漂亮。"

msgid "Now, [Delicately Crafted Seal Ring] must be made by using [Plain Old Ring] and [Magic Power Transmission/Diffusion Marble]. There is a great jeweller in Moradon by the name of Jewel, the [Jeweller]. You can get help from him."
msgstr "接下来，必须用[普通旧戒指]和[魔力传导/扩散大理石]制作出[精雕封印戒指]。莫拉登有位了不起的珠宝匠，叫朱厄尔，是[珠宝商]。你可以找他帮忙。"

msgid "Hmm,it's the [Devil War]. We may just have gotten ourselves into trouble again. Shall we go to Seith of [Associate of Magic]?"
msgstr "嗯，是[恶魔战争]啊。我们怕是又给自己揽上麻烦了。我们去找[魔法协会]的塞斯吧？"

msgid "Mm-hmm¡¦You don't have them yet? You can get [Plain Old Ring] from Menisia, the Grand Merchant's Daughter] of Moradon and the [Magic Power Tranmission/Diffusion Marble] from [Mercenary Supply Officer] Osmond of Moradon Folk Village. Please hurry."
msgstr "嗯嗯……你还没拿到？你可以从莫拉登[大商人之女]梅尼西亚那里取得[普通旧戒指]，从莫拉登村落的[佣兵补给官]奥斯蒙那里取得[魔力传导/扩散大理石]。请快点。"

msgid "Thought it was difficult to get the materials, it's got easier than you think.Broth by a tricky magic Phalanx got to pretend to try? Ahem."
msgstr "我还以为材料很难弄到手，结果比你想的容易。要不要在魔法协会的人面前装出一副很辛苦的样子？咳咳。"

msgid "I have received the materials you collected. However, I can't use them in this state to seal devils."
msgstr "我收到了你收集的材料。不过这种状态下我没法用它们封印恶魔。"

msgid "First of all, [Delicately Crafted Seal Ring] must be made by using [Plain Old Ring] and [Magic Power Transmission/Diffusion Marble]. There is a great jeweller in Moradon by the name of Jewel, the [Jeweller]. You can get help from him."
msgstr "首先，必须用[普通旧戒指]和[魔力传导/扩散大理石]制作出[精雕封印戒指]。莫拉登有位了不起的珠宝匠，叫朱厄尔，是[珠宝商]。你可以找他帮忙。"

msgid "Is it finished it yet? Only Jewel, the [Jeweller] of Moradon is able to make [Delicately Crafted Seal Ring]."
msgstr "做好了吗？只有莫拉登的[珠宝商]朱厄尔才能制作[精雕封印戒指]。"

msgid "You did it! So this is the [Delicately Crated Seal Rign]¡¦ Thank you."
msgstr "你做到了！原来这就是[精雕封印戒指]……谢谢。"

msgid "Now, it's time to start sealing [72 Devil]. First seal [24Devil] Niberius and [48Devil] Hagenti. Come back to me once you have eliminated them. Then I will purify the souls imbued into your body, <selfname> and seal them."
msgstr "现在，该开始封印[72恶魔]了。先封印[第24恶魔]尼伯琉斯和[第48恶魔]哈根提。消灭他们后回到我这里。然后我会净化你体内浸染的灵魂，<selfname>，并将其封印。"

msgid "I thought it would be much more difficult to get the materials but you did it so easily. Should we pretend to Seith of [Associate of Magic] that it was difficult to get them? Ahem."
msgstr "我还以为材料会难弄得多，结果你轻轻松松就办到了。我们要不要在[魔法协会]的塞斯面前假装很辛苦？咳咳。"

msgid "Now, it's time to start sealing [72 Devil]. First seal [24Devil] Niberius and [48Devil] Hagenti. Come back to me once you have eliminated them. Then I will purify the souls imbued into your body,<selfname> and seal them."
msgstr "现在，该开始封印[72恶魔]了。先封印[第24恶魔]尼伯琉斯和[第48恶魔]哈根提。消灭他们后回到我这里。然后我会净化你体内浸染的灵魂，<selfname>，并将其封印。"

msgid "The [Seal Ring] is completed. Now, it's the real start of [Devil War]!"
msgstr "[封印戒指]完成了。现在，[恶魔战争]真正开始了！"

msgid "Now that [Seal Ring] is complete, all we've got to do is to lock the souls of [Devil] in this."
msgstr "[封印戒指]既已完成，我们要做的就是把[恶魔]的灵魂锁进这里面。"

msgid "I don't see the souls imbued in you. You haven't eliminate them yet."
msgstr "我没看到浸染在你身上的灵魂。你还没消灭他们。"

msgid "You're imbued with souls of devil. You have done well."
msgstr "你身上浸染着恶魔的灵魂。你做得很好。"

msgid "I have sealed the souls of devil that were imbued in you, <selfname>. Now please give me that seal letter."
msgstr "我已经封印了你身上浸染的恶魔灵魂，<selfname>。现在请把那封印信交给我。"

msgid "I thought they would be stronger considering the name and all. How pathetic! Huhuhu. Let's report it to Bros of [Associate of Magic]."
msgstr "看名字还以为他们会更强呢。真没用！呵呵呵。我们去向[魔法协会]的布罗斯报告吧。"

msgid "You are here. Your last work was great."
msgstr "你来了。上次的活儿干得漂亮。"

msgid "Please give me the seal letter that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>."
msgstr "那么，请把要封印在你体内的封印信交给我，<selfname>。"

msgid "Where is the seal letter?"
msgstr "封印信在哪儿？"

msgid "Thank you. With this seal letter, the soul of devil will be locked in this ring."
msgstr "谢谢。有了这封印信，恶魔的灵魂就会被锁进这枚戒指。"

msgid "It is now time to eliminate devils in the other world. We must first fight [60Devil] Bapula and [72Devil] Andromalius then [36Devil] Storas, the crow's noble. Be fully prepared for they are strong and have many men."
msgstr "现在该去另一个世界消灭恶魔了。我们必须先迎战[第60恶魔]巴普拉和[第72恶魔]安朵斯，然后是乌鸦贵族[第36恶魔]斯托拉斯。他们很强、手下又多，请做好充分准备。"

msgid "I thought they would be stronger considering the name and all. How pathetic! Huhuhu. Let's report it to Seith of [Associate of Magic]."
msgstr "看名字还以为他们会更强呢。真没用！呵呵呵。我们去向[魔法协会]的塞斯报告吧。"

msgid "Wow, how amazing to seal them up in a flash! Surely [Associate of Magic] is full of amazing people. Now let's go to Bros of [Associate of Magic] to get the next mission."
msgstr "哇，一瞬间就封印了，真厉害！[魔法协会]果然人才济济。我们去找[魔法协会]的布罗斯接下一个任务吧。"

msgid "Now you have to go through a portal into another world and fight devils there."
msgstr "现在你得穿过传送门进入另一个世界，在那里与恶魔作战。"

msgid "You must first fight [60Devil] Bapula and [72Devil] Andromalius then [36Devil] Storas, the crow's noble. Be fully prepared for they are strong and have many men."
msgstr "你必须先迎战[第60恶魔]巴普拉和[第72恶魔]安朵斯，然后是乌鸦贵族[第36恶魔]斯托拉斯。他们很强、手下又多，请做好充分准备。"

msgid "You haven't sealed yet? Then I will send you again to them."
msgstr "你还没封印？那我再把你送回他们那里。"

msgid "You have sealed them up for sure. With this, we can seal three more devils."
msgstr "你确实把他们封印了。这样一来，我们还能再封印三个恶魔。"

msgid "I see you have much more power and you¡¯ll be able to fight against the stronger devils, <selfname>. Therefore, I¡¯m going to ask you to seal [Devil 12] Prince Sitri this time. He¡¯s a Prince of Devildom. He can control everything related to the love and sex of people with magic. Bring the [Devil 12 Summoning Scroll] that I gave you, and go to the [Luferson Castle], where the [Devil 12 Summoning Stone] is located. You can summon and destroy him there. "
msgstr "我看你力量大增，应该能迎战更强的恶魔了，<selfname>。所以这次我要请你封印[第12恶魔]西特王子。他是魔界的一位王子，能用魔法操控世人的情爱与情欲。带上我给你的[第12恶魔召唤卷轴]，前往[第12恶魔召唤石]所在的[卢弗森城堡]。你可以在那里召唤并消灭他。"

msgid "Wow, how amazing to seal them up in a flash! Surely [Associate of Magic] is full of amazing people. Now let's go to Seith of [Associate of Magic] to get the next mission."
msgstr "哇，一瞬间就封印了，真厉害！[魔法协会]果然人才济济。我们去找[魔法协会]的塞斯接下一个任务吧。"

msgid "I see you have much more power and you¡¯ll be able to fight against the stronger devils, <selfname>. Therefore, I¡¯m going to ask you to seal [Devil 12] Prince Sitri this time. He¡¯s a Prince of Devildom. He can control everything related to the love and sex of people with magic. Bring the [Devil 12 Summoning Scroll] that I gave you, and go to the [El Morad] Castle, where the [Devil 12 Summoning Stone] is located. You can summon and destroy him there. "
msgstr "我看你力量大增，应该能迎战更强的恶魔了，<selfname>。所以这次我要请你封印[第12恶魔]西特王子。他是魔界的一位王子，能用魔法操控世人的情爱与情欲。带上我给你的[第12恶魔召唤卷轴]，前往[第12恶魔召唤石]所在的[艾莫拉德]城堡。你可以在那里召唤并消灭他。"

msgid "Phew, we have only sealed 5 devils. But what the hell, [72Devil]? This means there are 67 of'em remaining. Keep your chin up, master¡¦"
msgstr "呼，我们才封印了5个恶魔。不过管他呢，[第72恶魔]？这意味着还剩67个。振作起来，师傅……"

msgid "It is a good start. Everything's going well."
msgstr "这是个好开端。一切顺利。"

msgid "I see you have much more power and you¡¯ll be able to fight against the stronger devils, <selfname>. Therefore, I¡¯m going to ask you to seal [Devil 12] Prince Sitri this time. He¡¯s a Prince of Devildom. He can control everything related to the love and sex of people with magic. Bring the [Devil 12 Summoning Scroll] that I gave you, and go to the [El Morad] Castle, where the [Devil 12 Summoning Stone] is located. You can summon and destroy him there."
msgstr "我看你力量大增，应该能迎战更强的恶魔了，<selfname>。所以这次我要请你封印[第12恶魔]西特王子。他是魔界的一位王子，能用魔法操控世人的情爱与情欲。带上我给你的[第12恶魔召唤卷轴]，前往[第12恶魔召唤石]所在的[艾莫拉德]城堡。你可以在那里召唤并消灭他。"

msgid "I'm still sensing [12Devil] Sitri's soul. Please eliminate him immediately."
msgstr "我仍能感应到[第12恶魔]西特的灵魂。请立刻消灭他。"

msgid "You have done well. His soul just got locked up in the [Seal Ring]."
msgstr "你做得很好。他的灵魂已被锁进[封印戒指]。"

msgid "Let's start the next seal. It's [35Devil] Marshosias and [59 Devil] Orias. Just as last time, eliminate them and bring their souls to me."
msgstr "开始下一个封印。是[第35恶魔]马科西亚斯和[第59恶魔]欧利亚斯。和上次一样，消灭他们后把他们的灵魂带给我。"

msgid "Ah, that was a tought fight. I feel like having a hot bath. But we gotta report first, don't we? Let's go to Bros of [Associate of Magic]."
msgstr "啊，那真是场恶战。我好想泡个热水澡。不过得先去报告，对吧？我们去找[魔法协会]的布罗斯吧。"

msgid "Sealing [12Devil] Sitri has created quite a stir among them. Thanks to that, [Associate of Magic]'s progress is accelerating."
msgstr "封印[第12恶魔]西特在他们当中引起了不小的震动。多亏于此，[魔法协会]的进展正在加快。"

msgid "Ah, that was a tought fight. I feel like having a hot bath. But we gotta report first, don't we? Let's go to Seith of [Associate of Magic]."
msgstr "啊，那真是场恶战。我好想泡个热水澡。不过得先去报告，对吧？我们去找[魔法协会]的塞斯吧。"

msgid "I don't what it is but what you did must be something amazing. Hehe, this feels great. Let's keep on rocking!"
msgstr "我不知道是怎么回事，但你做的事一定很了不起。嘿嘿，感觉真爽。我们继续冲吧！"

msgid "Hmm ... You need to go to the underworld. The devil this time is [23Devil] Ainis, the duke of destruction. With him are [47Devil] Bual and [66Devil] Chimeries. They are all very powerful. Be careful."
msgstr "嗯……你得前往冥界。这次的恶魔是毁灭公爵[第23恶魔]艾尼斯。与他同行的还有[第47恶魔]布艾尔和[第66恶魔]奇默雷斯。他们都非常强大。小心。"

msgid "Where did you two sealed?"
