msgid "This time...Hmm ... You need to go to the underworld. The devil this time is [23Devil] Ainis, the duke of destruction. With him are [47Devil] Bual and [66Devil] Chimeries. They are all very powerful. Be careful."
msgstr "这次……嗯……你得前往冥界。这次的恶魔是毁灭公爵[第23恶魔]艾尼斯。与他同行的还有[第47恶魔]布艾尔和[第66恶魔]奇默雷斯。他们都非常强大。小心。"

