msgstr "[第11恶魔]古森的倒下削弱了敌人的力量。多亏了你，<selfname>。"

msgid "Phew, it was a tough fight. Let's go to Bros of [Associate of Magic]"
msgstr "呼，真是场苦战。我们去找[魔法协会]的布罗斯吧。"

msgid " [Devil 34] Furfur has very strong and dreadful power, and he rules storms and thunderbolts. According to a story, the [Devil 34] Furfur has destroyed a castle only by his power. Destroy [Devil 58] Ami and [Devil 71] Dantalion with [Devil 34] Furfur. It¡¯ll be helpful if you remove the devils that can be strong forces for the devil army. "
msgstr "[第34恶魔]弗尔佛拥有极为强大可怕的力量，司掌风暴与雷霆。传说[第34恶魔]弗尔佛仅凭一己之力就摧毁过一座城堡。请连同[第34恶魔]弗尔佛一起，消灭[第58恶魔]阿米和[第71恶魔]丹塔罗里昂。除掉这些能成为恶魔大军强大战力的恶魔会很有帮助。"

msgid "[Devil 34] Furfur has very strong and dreadful power, and he rules storms and thunderbolts. According to a story, the [Devil 34] Furfur has destroyed a castle only by his power. Destroy [Devil 58] Ami and [Devil 71] Dantalion with [Devil 34] Furfur. It¡¯ll be helpful if you remove the devils that can be strong forces for the devil army. "
