msgid "Be gone, devils! Here comes <selfname>. Hehe, let's go to Bros of [Associate of Magic] to get the next mission."
msgstr "滚开吧，恶魔们！<selfname>来了。嘿嘿，我们去找[魔法协会]的布罗斯接下一个任务吧。"

msgid "It is time to go to the third underground world. Our opponent is a very powerful devil this time."
msgstr "该前往第三个地下世界了。这次我们的对手是一位非常强大的恶魔。"

msgid "[Devil 34] Furfur has very strong and dreadful power, and he rules storms and thunderbolts. According to a story, the [Devil 34] Furfur has destroyed a castle only by his power. Destroy [Devil 58] Ami and [Devil 71] Dantalion with [Devil 34] Furfur. It¡¯ll be helpful if you remove the devils that can be strong forces for the devil army."
msgstr "[第34恶魔]弗尔佛拥有极为强大可怕的力量，司掌风暴与雷霆。传说[第34恶魔]弗尔佛仅凭一己之力就摧毁过一座城堡。请连同[第34恶魔]弗尔佛一起，消灭[第58恶魔]阿米和[第71恶魔]丹塔罗里昂。除掉这些能成为恶魔大军强大战力的恶魔会很有帮助。"

msgid "This one has the shape of Kentauros and also the shape of a starfish . . . Oh, I was talking about [Devil 10] President Buer who you have to fight against this time. It¡¯s said that one can be cured and treated only by his touch. It¡¯s certainly a good ability. However, since he¡¯s our enemy we can¡¯t consider his ability a good one. Bring this [Devil 10 Summoning Scroll] and go to the [Luferson Castle] where the [Devil 10 Summoning Stone] is located. Then, summon and destroy him. "
msgstr "这家伙既有半人马的形状，又有海星的形状……哦，我说的是你这次要迎战的[第10恶魔]总统布艾尔。据说只要被他触摸就能治愈百病。这能力确实不错。不过既然他是我们的敌人，我们就不能把他的能力当好事。带上这[第10恶魔召唤卷轴]，前往[第10恶魔召唤石]所在的[卢弗森城堡]。然后召唤并消灭他。"

msgid "This one has the shape of Kentauros and also the shape of a starfish . . . Oh, I was talking about [Devil 10] President Buer who you have to fight against this time. It¡¯s said that one can be cured and treated only by his touch. It¡¯s certainly a good ability. However, since he¡¯s our enemy we can¡¯t consider his ability a good one. Bring this [Devil 10 Summoning Scroll] and go to the [El Morad Castle] where the [Devil 10 Summoning Stone] is located. Then, summon and destroy him. "
msgstr "这家伙既有半人马的形状，又有海星的形状……哦，我说的是你这次要迎战的[第10恶魔]总统布艾尔。据说只要被他触摸就能治愈百病。这能力确实不错。不过既然他是我们的敌人，我们就不能把他的能力当好事。带上这[第10恶魔召唤卷轴]，前往[第10恶魔召唤石]所在的[艾莫拉德城堡]。然后召唤并消灭他。"

msgid "Bros of [Associate of Magic] requests for you, master. Is this about the [Devil War]? Let's go to Ronark Land."
msgstr "[魔法协会]的布罗斯找你，师傅。是关于[恶魔战争]的事吗？我们去罗纳克之地吧。"

msgid "We the [Associate of Magic] are heading for our victory. However, we also suspect our enemy's counterattack. Hmm¡¦"
msgstr "我们[魔法协会]正迈向胜利。不过我们也担心敌人的反击。嗯……"

msgid "Still¡¦ I feel the soul of [10Devil] General Buer. He must be eliminated fast."
msgstr "尽管如此……我仍能感应到[第10恶魔]将军布艾尔的灵魂。必须尽快消灭他。"

msgid "Good work. Now we have 18 of'em sealed up. Still a long way left to go. Good luck!"
msgstr "干得好。现在我们已经封印了18个。路还长。祝你好运！"

msgid "Among them, there are devils who have many troops. They are [33Devil] Gaf and [57Devil] Ose. They say [33Devil] Gaf has a total of 66 troops. Your mission is to scatter their underworld troops by eliminating them."
msgstr "其中有些恶魔手下众多。他们就是[第33恶魔]加夫和[第57恶魔]欧塞。据说[第33恶魔]加夫总共统领66支军队。你的任务就是消灭他们，打散他们的冥界部队。"

msgid "Seith of [Associate of Magic] requests for you, master. Is this about the [Devil War]? Let's go to Ronark Land."
msgstr "[魔法协会]的塞斯找你，师傅。是关于[恶魔战争]的事吗？我们去罗纳克之地吧。"

msgid "There are devils who have many troops. They are [33Devil] Gaf and [57Devil] Ose. They say [33Devil] Gaf has a total of 66 troops. Your mission is to scatter their underworld troops by eliminating them."
msgstr "有些恶魔手下众多。他们就是[第33恶魔]加夫和[第57恶魔]欧塞。据说[第33恶魔]加夫总共统领66支军队。你的任务就是消灭他们，打散他们的冥界部队。"

msgid "Are you sure they are low-ranking devil? Then, how much more powerful will the higher ones be? Does Bros of [Associate of Magic] know?"
msgstr "你确定他们只是低阶恶魔？那更高阶的该有多强？[魔法协会]的布罗斯知道吗？"

msgid "Among them, there are still many devils in the human world tormenting people even at this moment. And this has been growing ever since the start of the [Devil World]. To resist it, we must eliminate their numbers."
msgstr "其中还有许多恶魔此刻仍在人间折磨世人。而且自从[恶魔世界]开启以来这种情况愈演愈烈。为了对抗它，我们必须削减他们的数量。"

msgid "Are you sure they are low-ranking devil? Then, how much more powerful will the higher ones be? Does Seith of [Associate of Magic] know?"
msgstr "你确定他们只是低阶恶魔？那更高阶的该有多强？[魔法协会]的塞斯知道吗？"

msgid "Master, hurry and give the seal letter to Bros of [Associate of Magic]!"
msgstr "师傅，快把封印信交给[魔法协会]的布罗斯！"

msgid "Time to cross into another world. [21Devil] General Morox of 36 troops is another devil with many troops. With him are powerful [45Devil] Vine and [65Devil] Andrealpus. Please eliminate and seal their souls."
msgstr "又要穿越到另一个世界了。统领36支军队的[第21恶魔]莫罗克斯将军是另一个手下众多的恶魔。与他同行的还有强大的[第45恶魔]维恩和[第65恶魔]安德里亚斯。请消灭他们并封印其灵魂。"

msgid "Again to another world? It's all conusing. They all look the same. Let's talk to Bros of [Associate of Magic] about it."
msgstr "又去另一个世界？真让人晕。它们看起来都一样。我们去找[魔法协会]的布罗斯问问吧。"

msgid "In the underworld, there are many same worlds in different dimensions. Devils, as the owner of these dimensions, raise their army and power. And we, [Associate of Magic], take the responsibility of resisting their force."
msgstr "在冥界，不同维度里存在着许多相同的世界。恶魔作为这些维度的主宰，不断培植自己的军队与力量。而我们[魔法协会]肩负着抵抗其力量的重任。"

msgid "Anyways, time to cross into another world. [21Devil] General Morox of 36 troops is another devil with many troops. With him are powerful [45Devil] Vine and [65Devil] Andrealpus. Please eliminate and seal their souls."
msgstr "总之，又要穿越到另一个世界了。统领36支军队的[第21恶魔]莫罗克斯将军是另一个手下众多的恶魔。与他同行的还有强大的[第45恶魔]维恩和[第65恶魔]安德里亚斯。请消灭他们并封印其灵魂。"

msgid "This time you have to fight against [Devil 9] Paimon, King of Hell, who has two hundred legions of demons under his rule. He¡¯s a devil who regards honor and glory as very important, and he always leads the war with his strong legions. Bring the [Devil 9 Summoning Scroll] and summon him from the [Devil 9 Summoning Stone] at [Luferson Castle]. Then, destroy him so that we can seal his spirit."
msgstr "这次你要迎战[第9恶魔]地狱之王拜蒙，他统治着两百个恶魔军团。他是一位极为看重荣誉与荣耀的恶魔，总是率领他强大的军团作战。带上[第9恶魔召唤卷轴]，在[卢弗森城堡]用[第9恶魔召唤石]召唤他。然后消灭他，好让我们封印他的灵体。"

msgid "Again to another world? It's all conusing. They all look the same. Let's talk to Seith of [Associate of Magic] about it."
msgstr "又去另一个世界？真让人晕。它们看起来都一样。我们去找[魔法协会]的塞斯问问吧。"

msgid "This time you have to fight against [Devil 9] Paimon, King of Hell, who has two hundred legions of demons under his rule. He¡¯s a devil who regards honor and glory as very important, and he always leads the war with his strong legions. Bring the [Devil 9 Summoning Scroll] and summon him from the [Devil 9 Summoning Stone] at [El Morad Castle]. Then, destroy him so that we can seal his spirit."
msgstr "这次你要迎战[第9恶魔]地狱之王拜蒙，他统治着两百个恶魔军团。他是一位极为看重荣誉与荣耀的恶魔，总是率领他强大的军团作战。带上[第9恶魔召唤卷轴]，在[艾莫拉德城堡]用[第9恶魔召唤石]召唤他。然后消灭他，好让我们封印他的灵体。"

msgid "The group Underworld numbers have been reduced? Their chief a the history of wotjiman Hatch I think you're still going strong.Listen to think of [Phalanx magic broth by"
msgstr "冥界那边的数目减少了？他们的头目……我想你仍在势如破竹。听我说，去找魔法协会的布罗斯吧。"

msgid "You're gonna get.This time must be relative drank and that led to a larger bag."
msgstr "你会成功的。这次必须相对应地召唤那个，才能引出更大的包裹。"

msgid "It¡¯s [Devil 9] Paimon, King of Hell, who has two hundred legions of demons under his rule. He¡¯s a devil who regards honor and glory as very important, and he always leads the war with his strong legions. Bring the [Devil 9 Summoning Scroll] and summon him from the [Devil 9 Summoning Stone] at [El Morad Castle]. Then, destroy him so that we can seal his spirit."
msgstr "这是[第9恶魔]地狱之王拜蒙，他统治着两百个恶魔军团。他是一位极为看重荣誉与荣耀的恶魔，总是率领他强大的军团作战。带上[第9恶魔召唤卷轴]，在[艾莫拉德城堡]用[第9恶魔召唤石]召唤他。然后消灭他，好让我们封印他的灵体。"

msgid "Not yet. [9Devil] Phymon¡¦his glory and honor have not fallen yet."
msgstr "还没。[第9恶魔]拜蒙……他的荣耀与威名尚未倒下。"

msgid "The fall of [9Devil] Phymon's glory and honor is confirmed. And his soul, sealed. Great work."
msgstr "[第9恶魔]拜蒙的荣耀与威名已确认陨落。他的灵魂也已封印。干得漂亮。"

msgid "Come back when you reach Lv72. You're not strong enough for your next mission."
msgstr "达到72级后再来。你的力量还不足以迎接下一个任务。"

msgid "He often finds hidden treasures and thus revered as god by many treasure hunters. But to us, he is just another threatening devil. Please eliminate [20Devil] Purson and [44Devil] Sharks."
msgstr "他常能寻得隐藏的宝藏，因此被许多寻宝者奉为神明。但对我们来说，他不过是又一个构成威胁的恶魔。请消灭[第20恶魔]普尔森和[第44恶魔]沙克斯。"

msgid "Has the number of underworld troops gone down? We have defeated their boss but their troops still remain strong. Let's find out what Seith of [Associate of Magic] thinks about this."
msgstr "冥界部队的数量下降了吗？我们打败了他们的头目，但他们的部队仍然很强。我们去看看[魔法协会]的塞斯对此怎么看。"

msgid "You are here. You need to fight a devil with a larger scale of army."
msgstr "你来了。你需要迎战一支规模更大军队的恶魔。"

msgid "The number of our enemy's soldier has drasticall gone down. It surely was worth it to take down their main force. Let's go to Bros of [Associate of Magic]."
msgstr "敌人士兵的数量骤降。端掉他们主力果然值当。我们去找[魔法协会]的布罗斯吧。"

msgid "You are here. Since you, <selfname>, defeated [9Devil] Phymon, the war is going in our favor. We cannot lose this chance. Let's seal the next devil."
msgstr "你来了。自从你打败[第9恶魔]拜蒙后，<selfname>，战局正朝我们有利的方向发展。我们不能错失这个机会。来封印下一个恶魔吧。"

msgid "The number of our enemy's soldier has drasticall gone down. It surely was worth it to take down their main force. Let's go to Seith of [Associate of Magic]."
msgstr "敌人士兵的数量骤降。端掉他们主力果然值当。我们去找[魔法协会]的塞斯吧。"

msgid "Man, I should have asked him where hidden treasures are. Oh well, let's just go to Bros of [Associate of Magic] to seal the devils."
msgstr "唉，我真该问问他宝藏埋在哪儿。算了，我们还是去找[魔法协会]的布罗斯封印恶魔吧。"

msgid "This devil will be a difficult one to fight against. It¡¯s notorious [Devil 32] Asmodeus, who is said to have both angel and demon sides. He¡¯s very particular. We¡¯ve given up on him completely. I¡¯m asking you to fight against him since you¡¯re the only one who can destroy him, <selfname>. Additionally, please seal [Devil 56] Gomory and [Devil 70] Seere, who are following him."
msgstr "这个恶魔会很难对付。就是声名狼藉的[第32恶魔]阿斯莫德，据说他兼具天使与恶魔两面。他极其棘手。我们已经彻底对他放弃希望了。我之所以请你去迎战，是因为你是唯一能消灭他的人，<selfname>。此外，请封印追随他的[第56恶魔]戈莫里和[第70恶魔]西雷。"

msgid "Man, I should have asked him where hidden treasures are. Oh well, let's just go to Seith of [Associate of Magic] to seal the devils."
msgstr "唉，我真该问问他宝藏埋在哪儿。算了，我们还是去找[魔法协会]的塞斯封印恶魔吧。"

msgid "It really feels great to see those devils sealed up. Is this the joy of labor? Anyways, let's go get the next labor from Bros of [Associate of Magic]."
msgstr "看到那些恶魔被封印，真是痛快。这就是劳动的喜悦吗？总之，我们去找[魔法协会]的布罗斯领下一份活儿吧。"

msgid "Need to go through the interminable passage. There lies many devils that are hardly seen."
msgstr "需要穿过那条无尽的通道。那里盘踞着许多罕见的恶魔。"

msgid "[Devil 8] Barbatos, also called Ace Hunter, is able to understand the voices of animals. It means that he¡¯s a natural-born hunter. As you can predict, something horrible will happen if he decides to hunt us . . . I don¡¯t even want to think about it. So, we have to get him before he gets us. Go to the [Luferson Castle] with the [Devil 8 Summoning Scroll], find the [Devil 8 Summoning Stone] at [Luferson Castle], and then, summon and destroy him."
msgstr "[第8恶魔]巴巴托斯，又称王牌猎手，能听懂动物的语言。这意味着他是天生的猎手。可想而知，如果他决定猎捕我们……那将是多么可怕。我想都不愿想。所以，我们必须先下手为强。带上[第8恶魔召唤卷轴]前往[卢弗森城堡]，在[卢弗森城堡]找到[第8恶魔召唤石]，然后召唤并消灭他。"

msgid "Was this guy the tough one? This is too ... Anyways, I'm glad we got sealed. Shouldn't we complain to Bros of [Associate of Magic]? Hehe."
msgstr "这家伙就是那个硬点子？这也太……总之，很高兴我们封印成了。我们要不要去跟[魔法协会]的布罗斯抱怨一下？嘿嘿。"

msgid "There's a strange movement of the devils. They have been quiet since the fall of [9Devil] but I think they are upto something. No time to rest. Let's get down to the next devil."
msgstr "恶魔们有股奇怪的动静。自从[第9恶魔]倒下后他们一直很安静，但我觉得他们在谋划什么。没时间休息。来对付下一个恶魔吧。"

msgid "The bowstring of [8Devil] Barbatos still sings on his hand. And that song is the requiem for the prey. Let's hurry."
msgstr "[第8恶魔]巴巴托斯的弓弦仍在他手中鸣响。而那歌声，正是猎物的安魂曲。我们快点。"

msgid "His bowstring is cut!"
msgstr "他的弓弦断了！"

msgid "Hmm, there's a strange energy. I feel something is about to happen. Here's your next mission. Eliminate [31Devil] Poras and [55Devil] Orobas and bring their soul to me."
msgstr "嗯，有股奇怪的能量。我感觉要出事了。这是你的下一个任务。消灭[第31恶魔]波拉斯和[第55恶魔]欧若博斯，把他们的灵魂带给我。"

msgid "Hmm, there's a strange energy. I feel something is about to happen. Here's your next mission. Eliminate [31Devil] Poras and [55Devil] Orobas and bring their souls to me."
msgstr "嗯，有股奇怪的能量。我感觉要出事了。这是你的下一个任务。消灭[第31恶魔]波拉斯和[第55恶魔]欧若博斯，把他们的灵魂带给我。"

msgid "Huff and puff¡¦ It does not feel so great to be a prey. Let's return to Bros of [Associate of Magic]."
msgstr "呼哧带喘……当猎物的滋味可真不好受。我们回[魔法协会]的布罗斯那里吧。"

msgid "The [8Devil] Barbatos's bowstring's been cut but they don't seem to be shaken at all. Despite the fact that he was a high-rank devil¡¦."
msgstr "[第8恶魔]巴巴托斯的弓弦已断，可他们似乎丝毫没有动摇。尽管他曾是高阶恶魔……"

msgid "Bros of [Associate of Magic] seems to be strangely nervous. Do you know anything about it?"
msgstr "[魔法协会]的布罗斯看起来异常紧张。你知道些什么吗？"

msgid "Now it's time to get the Duke of Silver Armor out of the deep abyss. It shouldn't be that hard to find him because [19Devil] Saleos is always dressed in his glittering armor. And with him are [43Devil] Sabnak and [64Devil] Flauros. Seal them up as well. "
msgstr "现在该把银甲公爵从深渊里揪出来了。找到他应该不难，因为[第19恶魔]萨利欧斯总是身披闪闪发亮的铠甲。与他同行的还有[第43恶魔]萨布纳克和[第64恶魔]弗劳罗斯。把他们一并封印。"

msgid "Hmm, I'm starting to feel nervous myself. This is all because of Bros of [Associate of Magic], right?"
msgstr "嗯，我自己都开始紧张了。这都是因为[魔法协会]的布罗斯，对吧？"

msgid "Ah, let's put aside the nervousness and get down to our business."
msgstr "啊，先把紧张放到一边，办正事吧。"

msgid "I received bad news. [Devil 7] Amon, the first enemy that we¡¯ve been on the lookout for, started a huge attack. I¡¯ve heard that a lot of our members are dying on the battlefield. Originally, he was called [Unknowable Man], and this was the reason I felt so agitated. It¡¯s very urgent. Bring the [Devil 7 Summoning Scroll], which I gave you, and go to [Devil 7 Summoning Stone] in the [Luferson Castle]. Then, summon and destroy him. There isn¡¯t much time! Hurry!"
msgstr "我收到了坏消息。[第7恶魔]亚蒙——我们一直紧盯的头号敌人——发动了大规模进攻。我听说我们许多成员正战死沙场。他原本被称为[不可知之人]，这正是我此前心神不宁的原因。事态万分紧急。带上我给你的[第7恶魔召唤卷轴]，前往[卢弗森城堡]中的[第7恶魔召唤石]。然后召唤并消灭他。时间不多了！快！"

msgid "Hmm, I'm starting to feel nervous myself. This is all because of Seith of [Associate of Magic], right?"
msgstr "嗯，我自己都开始紧张了。这都是因为[魔法协会]的塞斯，对吧？"

msgid "I received bad news. [Devil 7] Amon, the first enemy that we¡¯ve been on the lookout for, started a huge attack. I¡¯ve heard that a lot of our members are dying on the battlefield. Originally, he was called [Unknowable Man], and this was the reason I felt so agitated. It¡¯s very urgent. Bring the [Devil 7 Summoning Scroll], which I gave you, and go to [Devil 7 Summoning Stone] in the [Luferson Castle]. Then summon and destroy him. There isn¡¯t much time! Hurry!"
msgstr "我收到了坏消息。[第7恶魔]亚蒙——我们一直紧盯的头号敌人——发动了大规模进攻。我听说我们许多成员正战死沙场。他原本被称为[不可知之人]，这正是我此前心神不宁的原因。事态万分紧急。带上我给你的[第7恶魔召唤卷轴]，前往[卢弗森城堡]中的[第7恶魔召唤石]。然后召唤并消灭他。时间不多了！快！"

msgid "Something went wrong at the [Associate of Magic]. Let's go meet Bros of [Associate of Magic] at once."
msgstr "[魔法协会]出了事。我们马上去见[魔法协会]的布罗斯。"

msgid "<selfname>, you have finally come sir. Welcome."
msgstr "<selfname>，你终于来了，先生。欢迎。"

msgid "Ah ... Just thinking about those fire burning our men makes me¡¦. There's no time!"
msgstr "啊……一想到那些吞噬我们同伴的烈火，我就……没时间了！"

msgid "His soul was successfully sealed. Thanks to you, <selfname>, we were able to save the lives of many men. Thank you."
msgstr "他的灵魂已成功封印。多亏了你，<selfname>，我们才救下许多同伴的性命。谢谢。"

msgid "You can only stand your next opponent when you reach Lv73. Come back to me when you reach Lv73."
msgstr "你要达到73级才能迎接下一个对手。达到73级后再来找我。"

msgid "Your next opponent is a [18Devil] Badin also called the Archduke of Hell. And he is not too be taken lightly. With him is [42Devil] Bepal who is as powerful. Please elliminate them both."
msgstr "你的下一个对手是[第18恶魔]巴丁，又称地狱大公。他绝不可小觑。与他同行的还有同样强大的[第42恶魔]贝帕尔。请把他们二人一并消灭。"

msgid "Something went wrong at the [Associate of Magic]. Let's go meet Seith of [Associate of Magic] at once."
msgstr "[魔法协会]出了事。我们马上去见[魔法协会]的塞斯。"

msgid "The devils' massive counterattack has begun. What should we do, master? Let's help Bros of [Associate of Magic]."
msgstr "恶魔的大规模反击已经开始。我们该怎么办，师傅？我们去帮帮[魔法协会]的布罗斯吧。"

msgid "The [7Devil] Amon is defeated but their attack has gotten stronger. We had no choice but to retreat at the moment. This is why I must ask you, <selfname>, for a very difficult mission. "
msgstr "[第7恶魔]亚蒙已被击败，但他们的攻势反而更猛。我们目前被迫暂时撤退。正因如此，我必须拜托你一项极为艰巨的任务，<selfname>。"

msgid "This is the beginning of a tough fight. Let's focus! Bros of [Associate of Magic] is looking for you. Let's give him a hand."
msgstr "一场恶战才刚刚开始。集中精神！[魔法协会]的布罗斯在找你。我们去帮帮他吧。"

msgid "Phew. The atmosphere in the battlefield isn¡¯t changing. We¡¯re facing continuous difficulties. We must seal rest of the devils without a moment¡¯s delay. However, you have to stay alert because your next target is [Devil 30] Forneus, who swallows his enemy with the features of a great sea monster. He¡¯s very strong and thus has been granted the title of Marquis. Additionally, please seal [Devil 54] Murmur and [Devil 69] Decarabia together."
msgstr "呼。战场上的气氛丝毫没有缓和。我们面临着接连不断的困境。我们必须一刻不迟疑地封印剩下的恶魔。不过你要保持警惕，因为你的下一个目标是[第30恶魔]弗内乌斯，他会以大海怪般的形貌吞噬敌人。他极为强大，因而获赐侯爵之衔。此外，请一并封印[第54恶魔]摩尔莫和[第69恶魔]迪卡拉比亚。"

msgid "This is the beginning of a tough fight. Let's focus! Seith of [Associate of Magic] is looking for you. Let's give him a hand."
msgstr "一场恶战才刚刚开始。集中精神！[魔法协会]的塞斯在找你。我们去帮帮他吧。"

msgid "The was seems to be getting very unfavorable for us. Let's get it together and help Bros of [Associate of Magic]."
msgstr "战局似乎对我们越来越不利。我们振作起来，去帮帮[魔法协会]的布罗斯吧。"

msgid "We have turned one corner but the war is still going unfavorable for us. Sigh¡¦"
msgstr "我们虽熬过了一关，但战局仍对我们不利。唉……"

msgid "We must seal rest of the devils without a moment¡¯s delay. However, you have to stay alert because your next target is [Devil 30] Forneus, who swallows his enemy with the features of a great sea monster. He¡¯s very strong and thus has been granted the title of Marquis. Additionally, please seal [Devil 54] Murmur and [Devil 69] Decarabia together."
msgstr "我们必须一刻不迟疑地封印剩下的恶魔。不过你要保持警惕，因为你的下一个目标是[第30恶魔]弗内乌斯，他会以大海怪般的形貌吞噬敌人。他极为强大，因而获赐侯爵之衔。此外，请一并封印[第54恶魔]摩尔莫和[第69恶魔]迪卡拉比亚。"

msgid "One more devil to seal! It's the [6Devil] Duke Baleporo, the god of thieves. Be careful, this man's got bad habit of stealing. Take the [6Devil Sommon Letter] to [6Devil Summon Stone] in [Islant]. Summon and eliminate him there."
msgstr "再封印一个恶魔！那就是盗贼之神[第6恶魔]巴列波罗公爵。小心，这家伙有偷窃的坏毛病。带上[第6恶魔召唤信]前往[艾斯兰特]的[第6恶魔召唤石]。在那里召唤并消灭他。"

msgid "The was seems to be getting very unfavorable for us. Let's get it together and help Seith of [Associate of Magic]."
msgstr "战局似乎对我们越来越不利。我们振作起来，去帮帮[魔法协会]的塞斯吧。"

msgid "As Bros of [Associate of Magic] said, we have turned the corner but it still looks very bad. Shouldn't we just fight the boss? Hehe."
msgstr "正如[魔法协会]的布罗斯所说，我们虽然熬过了一关，但形势仍然很糟。我们干脆去打BOSS吧？嘿嘿。"

msgid "An instruction from above. Looks like they want to resolve this situation."
msgstr "上面下达了指示。看来他们想解决当前的局面。"

msgid "The [6Devil] Balepor's touch just doesn't know how to stop."
msgstr "[第6恶魔]巴列波的纠缠就是停不下来。"

msgid "The [6Devil] Balepor's touch has finally stopped.Thank you."
msgstr "[第6恶魔]巴列波的纠缠终于停了。谢谢。"

msgid "It's [29Devil] Astarot, the archduke of the underworld. As you are well-aware of it, he is a powerful devil so be careful. With him are [53Devil] Kaim and he is not too be taken lightly, either. Stay focus!"
msgstr "是冥界大公[第29恶魔]阿斯塔罗特。如你所知，他是个强大的恶魔，小心。与他同行的还有[第53恶魔]凯姆，同样不可小觑。保持专注！"

msgid "As Seith of [Associate of Magic] said, we have turned the corner but it still looks very bad. Shouldn't we just fight the boss? Hehe."
msgstr "正如[魔法协会]的塞斯所说，我们虽然熬过了一关，但形势仍然很糟。我们干脆去打BOSS吧？嘿嘿。"

msgid "Did it work this time? You sweat so much for it but somewhow it's not changing the situation of war."
msgstr "这次奏效了吗？你为此汗流浃背，可战局却不知为何仍毫无起色。"

msgid "Time to follow the second instruction. With [6Devil] Balepor defeated, our men's morale is sprouting. Let's grab this chance."
msgstr "该遵照第二条指示行动了。随着[第6恶魔]巴列波被击败，我军士气正在回升。我们抓住这个机会。"

msgid "I'm glad our men's morale went up. Go to Bros of [Associate of Magic] and he'll give you your next mission."
msgstr "真高兴我军士气上来了。去找[魔法协会]的布罗斯，他会给你下一个任务。"

msgid "The war is still in our enemy's favor but there's stil a hope. We must eliminate and seal [17Devil] Botis who controls 26 troops and his followers [41Devil] Pokalror and [63Devil] Andras."
msgstr "战局仍对敌人有利，但还有一线希望。我们必须消灭并封印统领26支军队的[第17恶魔]波提斯，以及他的随从[第41恶魔]波卡洛尔和[第63恶魔]安德拉斯。"

msgid "I'm glad our men's morale went up. Go to Seith of [Associate of Magic] and he'll give you your next mission."
msgstr "真高兴我军士气上来了。去找[魔法协会]的塞斯，他会给你下一个任务。"

msgid "I'm starting to see hope. Time for another trip to the other side. Go to Bros of [Associate of Magic]."
msgstr "我开始看到希望了。又要去对面跑一趟了。去找[魔法协会]的布罗斯。"

msgid "Good time. I'm about to destroy the portal of the underworld."
msgstr "来得正好。我正要摧毁冥界的传送门。"

msgid "I¡¯ll give you the last order. You have to seal [Devil 5] President Marbas, who has great fame even in Hell. He¡¯s a high-ranked devil who governs thirty-six legions. He¡¯s very dangerous and needs to be watched for, because he can cause and spread diseases. Go to [Islante] with the [Devil 5 Summoning Scroll] and destroy him after summoning him from the [Devil 5 Summoning Stone]. We¡¯ll have a chance to counterattack if he¡¯s removed."
msgstr "我向你下达最后的命令。你必须封印[第5恶魔]总统玛尔巴士，他在地狱也享有盛名。他是统领三十六个军团的高阶恶魔。他极为危险，必须严加提防，因为他能引发并散播疾病。带上[第5恶魔召唤卷轴]前往[艾斯兰特]，用[第5恶魔召唤石]召唤他后将其消灭。除掉他，我们就有反击的机会。"

msgid "I'm starting to see hope. Time for another trip to the other side. Go to Seith of [Associate of Magic]."
msgstr "我开始看到希望了。又要去对面跑一趟了。去找[魔法协会]的塞斯。"

msgid "I said the last instructions that came down from the upper part of the magic PhalanxDid you depend by Phalanx magic Bros,."
msgstr "我说的是从魔法协会上层下达的最后指示。去找魔法协会的布罗斯吧。"

msgid "You're gonna get. Now is your last chance to change the war situation. If successful, this friendly'll rise again."
msgstr "你会成功的。这是你扭转战局的最后机会。一旦成功，我方将再度崛起。"

msgid "I¡¯ll give you the last order. You have to seal [Devil 5] President Marbas, who has great fame even in Hell. He¡¯s a high-ranked devil who governs thirty-six legions. He¡¯s very dangerous and need to be watched for, because he can cause and spread diseases. Go to [Islante] with the [Devil 5 Summoning Scroll] and destroy him after summoning him from the [Devil 5 Summoning Stone]. We¡¯ll have a chance to counterattack if he¡¯s removed."
msgstr "我向你下达最后的命令。你必须封印[第5恶魔]总统玛尔巴士，他在地狱也享有盛名。他是统领三十六个军团的高阶恶魔。他极为危险，必须严加提防，因为他能引发并散播疾病。带上[第5恶魔召唤卷轴]前往[艾斯兰特]，用[第5恶魔召唤石]召唤他后将其消灭。除掉他，我们就有反击的机会。"

msgid "The war is still unfavorable for us. Please lend is a little more power."
msgstr "战局仍对我们不利。请再借我们一点力量。"

msgid "Have you succeeded? It is true!! You have just given us a big hope."
msgstr "你成功了吗？真的吗！！你刚给了我们莫大的希望。"

msgid "Come back to me when you reach Lv74. You must be stronger before facing your next enemy."
msgstr "达到74级后再来。你必须变得更强，才能迎接下一个敌人。"

msgid "Let's drive this momentum. You need to eliminate [16Devil] Zephar, the duke of the west wind. They say he brings the victory wind. With him is [40Devil] Raum. Eliminate both of them and let's take their wind of victory."
msgstr "乘胜追击。你需要消灭西风公爵[第16恶魔]泽法。据说他会带来胜利之风。与他同行的还有[第40恶魔]劳姆。把他们二人一并消灭，夺过他们的胜利之风。"

msgid "There's a last instruction from the authority of the [Associate of Magic]. Let's go to Seith of [Associate of Magic] at once."
msgstr "[魔法协会]的高层下达了最后指示。我们马上去见[魔法协会]的塞斯。"

msgid "You are here. This is our last chance to turn the war around. If we succeed, our force will rise again."
msgstr "你来了。这是我们扭转战局的最后机会。若成功，我方将再度崛起。"

msgid "Let¡¯s follow up this situation. You must destroy [Devil 16] Red Duke Zepar, who¡¯s also called Count of West Wind because he brings the wind of victory. Also, destroy and seal [Devil 40] Raum, who is helping [Devil 16] Zepar. Seize the wind of victory from them."
msgstr "我们顺势推进。你必须消灭[第16恶魔]红公爵泽帕尔，他又称西风伯爵，因为他会带来胜利之风。同时消灭并封印协助[第16恶魔]泽帕尔的[第40恶魔]劳姆。从他们手中夺取胜利之风。"

msgid "Now, it's the start of the fight back.We'm the, girdle the one hand, by Phalanx magic Bros!"
msgstr "现在，反击开始了。我们攥紧拳头，随魔法协会的布罗斯一起上！"

msgid "From now on, you truly begin to fight back. Let's win this war!"
msgstr "从现在起，我们才真正开始反击。打赢这场战争！"

msgid "It's the start of our counterattack. Let's help Seith of [Associate of Magic]."
msgstr "这是我们反击的开端。我们去帮帮[魔法协会]的塞斯。"

msgid "We are on the verge of our counterstrike. Let's win this war!"
msgstr "我们的反击箭在弦上。打赢这场战争！"

msgid "Phew, I guess we can breath now.  Let's go to Bros of [Associate of Magic] and start the seal ritual."
msgstr "呼，我想我们可以喘口气了。我们去找[魔法协会]的布罗斯，开始封印仪式吧。"

msgid "We must drive devils into a corner by keeping this mood. We¡¯ve sealed many numbers of devils already, and I think they¡¯re faltering now. By starting with [Devil 28] Berith, who¡¯s also called King of Cruelty, you must seal [Devil 52] Allocen and [Devil 68] Bellial as well. If you succeed in this mission, they¡¯ll shrink back more."
msgstr "我们必须保持这股势头，把恶魔逼入绝境。我们已经封印了许多恶魔，我想他们现在正节节败退。从残暴之王[第28恶魔]贝瑞斯开始，你还必须封印[第52恶魔]阿洛森和[第68恶魔]彼列。若你成功完成这项任务，他们就会更加退缩。"

msgid "Phew, I guess we can breath now.  Let's go to Seith of [Associate of Magic] and start the seal ritual."
msgstr "呼，我想我们可以喘口气了。我们去找[魔法协会]的塞斯，开始封印仪式吧。"

msgid "The wind of victory is now with us! You are amazing,  master! What is the next mission? Let's find out from Bros of [Associate of Magic]."
msgstr "胜利之风现在吹向了我们！你太厉害了，师傅！下一个任务是什么？我们去向[魔法协会]的布罗斯打听吧。"

msgid "Oh, good timing. The members of [Associate of Magic] have found another portal to the underworld."
msgstr "哦，来得正好。[魔法协会]的成员又发现了一处通往冥界的传送门。"

msgid "Did not sealed yet?Then again, they will send you to a place where"
msgstr "还没封印？那他们会再把你送到那个地方。"

msgid "You were sealed for sure. This drank more were able to be sealed."
msgstr "你确实封印成了。这下又有更多恶魔得以被封印。"

msgid "The goal is to get [Devil4] Gamigin. You'll be able to call out [Devil4] by using the [Devil4 Summoning Stone] located at [Eslant]."
msgstr "目标是拿下[第4恶魔]加米金。你可以用位于[艾斯兰特]的[第4恶魔召唤石]召唤出[第4恶魔]。"

msgid "The wind of victory came driving towards us! Amazing master! What is the next mission? Come on, Say unto the monk magic Phalanx Go!"
msgstr "胜利之风迎面吹来！了不起的师傅！下一个任务是什么？走，跟魔法协会的人出发！"

msgid "Oh, just as you were. Found one more door to go now the section of magic Phalanx, they drank their space."
msgstr "哦，跟你想的一样。魔法协会那边又找到一扇通往他们空间的门。"

msgid "We'll need to seal [Devil28] and [Devil52] and [Devil68]."
msgstr "我们需要封印[第28恶魔]、[第52恶魔]和[第68恶魔]。"

msgid "Marching and marching! With this momentum, we will be able to wipe them all out. Do you think Bros of [Associate of Magic] feels the same way?"
msgstr "前进，再前进！借着这股势头，我们就能把他们全部肃清。你觉得[魔法协会]的布罗斯是不是也这么想？"

msgid "A good news! The war situation is changing favorably towards us!"
msgstr "好消息！战局正朝我们有利的方向转变！"

msgid "The souls of the dead are answering to his call. Let's get rid of [4Devil] Gamigin fast."
msgstr "死者的灵魂正在回应他的召唤。我们快点除掉[第4恶魔]加米金。"

msgid "The souls of the dead can sleep peacefully. Well done."
msgstr "死者的灵魂可以安息了。干得漂亮。"

msgid "They seem confused since [Devil 4] Gamygyn was sealed. However, it made them to strengthen their solidarity. It was an unexpected result, but we can¡¯t stop there. We can vanquish them slowly. Your next targets are [Devil 27] Ronebe, who¡¯s also called Earl of Red Mist, and [Devil 51] Balam. If their numbers decrease they¡¯ll have no choice, no matter how their solidarity is strengthened. Let¡¯s advance!"
msgstr "由于[第4恶魔]加米金被封印，他们似乎乱了阵脚。然而这反而促使他们加强了团结。这是个意料之外的结果，但我们不能就此停手。我们可以逐步将他们击溃。你的下一个目标是又称红雾伯爵的[第27恶魔]罗内贝，以及[第51恶魔]巴力。只要他们数量减少，无论团结得多么牢固都无计可施。我们前进吧！"

msgid "Marching and marching! With this momentum, we will be able to wipe them all out. Do you think Seis of [Associate of Magic] feels the same way?"
msgstr "前进，再前进！借着这股势头，我们就能把他们全部肃清。你觉得[魔法协会]的塞斯是不是也这么想？"

msgid "They seem to be confused after [Devil 4] Gamygyn is sealed. However, it made them to strengthen their solidarity. It was an unexpected result, but we can¡¯t stop there. We can vanquish them slowly. Your next target is [Devil 27] Ronebe, who¡¯s also called, Earl of Red Mist, and [Devil 51] Balam. If their numbers decrease they¡¯ll have no choice, no matter how their solidarity is strengthened. Let¡¯s advance!"
msgstr "由于[第4恶魔]加米金被封印，他们似乎乱了阵脚。然而这反而促使他们加强了团结。这是个意料之外的结果，但我们不能就此停手。我们可以逐步将他们击溃。你的下一个目标是又称红雾伯爵的[第27恶魔]罗内贝，以及[第51恶魔]巴力。只要他们数量减少，无论团结得多么牢固都无计可施。我们前进吧！"

msgid "You defeated the [4Devil] Gamigin the chief devil. But it seems our enemy has gotten stronger. What happened? Will Bros of [Associate of Magic] know what's going on?"
msgstr "你打败了头号恶魔[第4恶魔]加米金。可我们的敌人似乎反而更强了。怎么回事？[魔法协会]的布罗斯知道发生了什么吗？"

msgid "You have sealed the [4Devil] Gamigin. You are good! However, the opposite of what we expected is happening."
msgstr "你封印了[第4恶魔]加米金。你真行！不过，事情正朝我们预期相反的方向发展。"

msgid "Whew, it's endless. But we're not too far away. First, let's return to Bros of [Associate of Magic]!"
msgstr "唉，真是没完没了。但我们也快到终点了。先回[魔法协会]的布罗斯那里吧！"

msgid "Where did you place the seal?"
msgstr "你把封印放到哪里了？"

msgid "There is a devil who knows what the true chivalry is. It¡¯s [Devil 15] Eligor whom you must fight against this time. Actually, he¡¯s a brave knight rather than a devil. Since you¡¯re one of the great knights, I think it¡¯ll be a fair battle for both of you, <selfname>. Additionally, please seal [Devil 39] Malphas and [Devil 62] Valac, who are with [Devil 15] Eligor."
msgstr "有那么一位深谙真正骑士道的恶魔。他就是你这次必须迎战的[第15恶魔]埃利戈。说起来，与其说他是恶魔，不如说他是位英勇的骑士。既然你也是伟大的骑士之一，我想这对你们二位会是一场公平的较量，<selfname>。此外，请封印与[第15恶魔]埃利戈同行的[第39恶魔]马尔帕斯和[第62恶魔]瓦拉克。"

msgid "Whew, it's endless. But we're not too far away. First, let's return to Seis of [Associate of Magic].!"
msgstr "唉，真是没完没了。但我们也快到终点了。先回[魔法协会]的塞斯那里吧！"

msgid "Thank you.Now sealed with the soul in the ring. It will be locked."
msgstr "谢谢。如今封印在戒指里的灵魂将被锁住。"

msgid "The [Devil15]Eligor is one of the true devils. You <selfname> are a great knight, so it would be an epic battle for you two. [Devil39]Malpas and [Devil62]Ballac are to be sealed as well."
msgstr "[第15恶魔]埃利戈是货真价实的恶魔之一。你<selfname>是位伟大的骑士，所以这对你们二位会是一场史诗般的战斗。[第39恶魔]马尔帕斯和[第62恶魔]巴拉克也要一并封印。"

msgid "The sealing is almost done. I hope nothing goes wrong during the process. Go to [Associate of Magic]Bros and let him know."
msgstr "封印即将完成。希望过程中别出岔子。去通知[魔法协会]的布罗斯吧。"

msgid "Here you are. The [Association of Magic] has found a better place to stay."
msgstr "你来了。[魔法协会]找到了一处更好的落脚地。"

msgid "They are not sealed yet? Okay then, I'll send you to that place again."
msgstr "还没封印好？那好吧，我再把你送到那个地方去。"

msgid "They are completely sealed. Now the three devils are sealed forever."
msgstr "他们已被彻底封印。现在这三个恶魔永远地被封印了。"

msgid "It seems that their forces became weakened due to the continuous sealing. I think it was effective to seal from the lower level devils. Now, it¡¯s time to remove their brain. It¡¯s [Devil 3] Vassago whom you must fight against this time. [Devil 3] Vassago is playing a key role as their brain with his infinite wisdom and ability to look into the past and the future. It¡¯s time for him to step down from his post. Go to [Islante] with the [Devil 3 Summoning Scroll], which I gave you. Find [Devil 3 Summoning Stone], and then summon and destroy him."
msgstr "看来连续的封印削弱了他们的力量。我想从低阶恶魔封起确实有效。现在，该端掉他们的头脑了。他就是你这次必须迎战的[第3恶魔]瓦沙戈。[第3恶魔]瓦沙戈以其无穷的智慧与洞察过去未来的能力，充当着他们的军师。是时候让他下台了。带上我给你的[第3恶魔召唤卷轴]前往[艾斯兰特]。找到[第3恶魔召唤石]，然后召唤并消灭他。"

msgid "The sealing is almost done. I hope nothing goes wrong during the process. Go to [Associate of Magic]Seis and let him know."
msgstr "封印即将完成。希望过程中别出岔子。去通知[魔法协会]的塞斯吧。"

msgid "You are here now. They have found a new place."
msgstr "你现在来了。他们找到了一处新地方。"

msgid "It seems that their forces became weakened due to the continuous sealing. I think it was effective to seal from the lower level devils. Now, it¡¯s time to remove their brain. It¡¯s [Devil 3] Vassago who you have to fight against, this time. [Devil 3] Vassago is playing a key role as their brain with his infinite wisdom and ability to look into the past and the future. It¡¯s time for him to step down from his post. Go to [Islante] with the [Devil 3 Summoning Scroll], which I gave you. Find [Devil 3 Summoning Stone], and then summon and destroy him."
msgstr "看来连续的封印削弱了他们的力量。我想从低阶恶魔封起确实有效。现在，该端掉他们的头脑了。他就是你这次必须迎战的[第3恶魔]瓦沙戈。[第3恶魔]瓦沙戈以其无穷的智慧与洞察过去未来的能力，充当着他们的军师。是时候让他下台了。带上我给你的[第3恶魔召唤卷轴]前往[艾斯兰特]。找到[第3恶魔召唤石]，然后召唤并消灭他。"

msgid "He was the devil but was a good Knight. But of course, master, you were better. Go visit [Associate of Magic]Bros. There's a new mission for you."
msgstr "他虽是恶魔，却是位好骑士。不过师傅，当然还是你更厉害。去见[魔法协会]的布罗斯吧。有个新任务在等你。"

msgid "Welcome sir. Good job. Are you ready for the next battle?"
msgstr "欢迎，先生。干得漂亮。准备好迎接下一场战斗了吗？"

msgid "You haven't defeated him."
msgstr "你还没打败他。"

msgid "You have defeated him! Glory is ours now."
msgstr "你打败他了！荣耀现在属于我们。"

msgid "Come when you level up to be 75. You'll need to be stronger."
msgstr "升到75级再来。你需要变得更强。"

msgid "Now we only have Devil12. Don't be so relaxed now. We'll need to seal them all. [Devil14] Rerage is a great hunter. Almost same skill as [Devil8] BarBartos. You'll need to get rid of him now. And you'll also see [Devil38] Halpass."
msgstr "现在我们只剩第14个等恶魔了。别松懈，我们得把他们全部封印。[第14恶魔]雷拉格是个厉害的猎手，本事几乎和[第8恶魔]巴巴托斯不相上下。你现在得除掉他。你还会见到[第38恶魔]哈帕斯。"

msgid "He was the devil but was a good Knight. But of course, master, you were better. Go visit [Associate of Magic]Seis. There's a new mission for you."
msgstr "他虽是恶魔，却是位好骑士。不过师傅，当然还是你更厉害。去见[魔法协会]的塞斯吧。有个新任务在等你。"

msgid "Thank you. It was an awesome battle. Now are you ready for the next mission?"
msgstr "谢谢。那真是场精彩的战斗。现在准备好接下一个任务了吗？"

msgid "We're almost done defeating all the devils. Let's visit Bros to receive the next mission."
msgstr "我们就要把所有恶魔都打完了。去找布罗斯接下一个任务吧。"

