msgstr "封印[第3恶魔]后，他们变弱了。"

msgid "It seems that you aren't done defeating them."
msgstr "看来你还没把他们打完。"

msgid "You have defeated them all! Good job."
msgstr "你把他们全打败了！干得漂亮。"

msgid "You have sealed all the souls , <selfname>. Give them to me."
msgstr "你已封印了所有灵魂，<selfname>。交给我吧。"

msgid "You are almost done defeating them all. Go visit Seis for the next mission."
msgstr "你就快把他们全部打完了。去找塞斯接下一个任务。"

msgid "hahaha, we're doing good. Let's go back to Bros."
msgstr "哈哈哈，我们进展不错。我们回布罗斯那里吧。"

msgid "You are here now. Good job."
msgstr "你现在来了。干得漂亮。"

msgid "Give me the sealed documents."
msgstr "把封印文书交给我。"

msgid "Thank you. With the sealed document you'll be sealed forever with the soul."
msgstr "谢谢。有了这封印文书，灵魂就会被永远封印。"

msgid "It's about time that the heads of the Devils are coming out. Defeat [Devil26] Bune, [Devil50] Purcass, [Devil67] Armduasis."
msgstr "恶魔的首脑们终于要现身了。打败[第26恶魔]布涅、[第50恶魔]普尔卡斯、[第67恶魔]阿姆杜西亚斯。"

msgid "We're almost done. Cheer up, Master! Bros is looking for you so go find him at Ronarkland."
msgstr "我们就快完成了。振作起来，师傅！布罗斯在罗纳克之地找你，去见他吧。"

msgid "We have to hope for the best."
msgstr "我们只能抱最好的希望。"

msgid "You aren't done sealing? I'll send you once again."
msgstr "你还没封印完？我再送你去一次。"

msgid "You've done sealing. "
msgstr "你封印完成了。"

msgid "This time is't [Devil2] Agares. With the [Devil2 Summoning Scroll] find [Devil2 Summon Stone] here at Ronarkland. They might be "
msgstr "这次是[第2恶魔]阿加雷斯。带上[第2恶魔召唤卷轴]，在罗纳克之地这里找到[第2恶魔召唤石]。他们可能……"

msgid "End did not stay long! Come master! Looking monk Keisei Phalanx magic reveal with your Lorna greater land can not be."
msgstr "没持续多久！来吧师傅！魔法协会的人在罗纳克之地等你，快去。"

