msgstr "有传言说现在已有了结论。去见布罗斯，听听是怎么回事。"

msgid "We've been waiting for you. Now it's time to defeat the enemy."
msgstr "我们一直在等你。现在是打败敌人的时候了。"

msgid "Hurry now."
msgstr "快点。"

msgid "Good job now."
msgstr "现在干得漂亮。"

msgid "Because of the sealing of [Devil2] Devils are defeated. Now the left ones are [Devil25] GlashalaBlas and [Devil49] Prokel."
msgstr "由于封印了[第2恶魔]，恶魔们被打败了。现在剩下的是[第25恶魔]格拉夏拉布拉斯和[第49恶魔]普罗凯尔。"

msgid "Hurry."
msgstr "快点。"

msgid "Master, you are awesome! I can almost taste the glory. Go visit Bros."
msgstr "师傅，你太厉害了！我几乎能尝到胜利的滋味了。去见布罗斯吧。"

msgid "We are not far from winning."
msgstr "我们离胜利不远了。"

msgid "You haven't defeated them all."
msgstr "你还没把他们全打败。"

msgid "Good job."
msgstr "干得漂亮。"

msgid "Master you are so awesome! Go visit Seis."
msgstr "师傅你太厉害了！去见塞斯吧。"

msgid "we are not far from the winning."
msgstr "我们离胜利不远了。"

msgid "Go talk to Bros."
msgstr "去找布罗斯谈谈。"

msgid "You came! Good job."
msgstr "你来了！干得漂亮。"

msgid "Give me the sealed one."
msgstr "把封印好的交给我。"

msgid "Where did you put it?"
msgstr "你把它放哪儿了？"

msgid "Thank you, with this sealed document, Devil Soul will be completely sealed forever in this ring."
msgstr "谢谢，有了这封印文书，恶魔的灵魂将永远地被封存在这枚戒指里。"

msgid "We've found the hidden hell. They say that there are [Devil13] Beled and [Devil37] Phenix, [Devil61] Jagan."
msgstr "我们找到了隐藏的地狱。据说里面有[第13恶魔]贝莱德、[第37恶魔]菲尼克斯和[第61恶魔]扎甘。"

msgid "Go talk to Seis."
msgstr "去找塞斯谈谈。"

msgid "Give me the sealed document."
msgstr "把封印文书交给我。"

msgid "Go visit Bros."
msgstr "去见布罗斯。"

msgid "Now we can only move forward. We're almost done with sealing all the devils."
msgstr "现在我们只能前进。我们封印所有恶魔的任务就快完成了。"

msgid "You aren't done? I'll send you there again."
msgstr "你还没完成？我再送你去那里一次。"

msgid "You are done sealing! You did seal all 71 Devils."
msgstr "你封印完成了！你确实封印了全部71个恶魔。"

msgid "Now it's the last mission. There's [Devil1] The Boss Bahal. With the sealing of this boss the war will end. With the [Devil1 Summoning Scroll] find [Devil1 Summoning Stone] and summon him."
msgstr "现在是最后一个任务。那里有[第1恶魔]BOSS巴尔。封印了这个头目，战争就会结束。带上[第1恶魔召唤卷轴]，找到[第1恶魔召唤石]并召唤他。"

msgid "Go visit Seis."
msgstr "去见塞斯。"

msgid "You aren't done with sealing? I'll send you there again."
msgstr "你还没封印完？我再送你去那里一次。"

msgid "You are done! Now we've all sealed 71 Devils."
msgstr "你完成了！现在我们已经封印了全部71个恶魔。"

msgid "You've all sealed 71 Devils. There's one last one. Visit Seis to receive the last mission."
msgstr "你已封印了71个恶魔。只剩最后一个。去找塞斯接下最后的任务。"

msgid "Finally the victory is not far away. It's all because of you, <selfname>."
msgstr "胜利终于近在眼前。这全都是因为你，<selfname>。"

msgid "There's still the [Devil1] Bahal's Army."
msgstr "还剩[第1恶魔]巴尔的军队。"

msgid "Good job! War will end now. Thank you."
msgstr "干得漂亮！战争现在就要结束了。谢谢你。"

msgid "Do you remember the monk [Chief of Associate of Magic] Mala? He wants to see you, <selfname>. He wants to award you, probably. He'll also tell you how we can forever seal the Devils."
msgstr "你还记得那位僧侣[魔法协会会长]马拉吗？他想见你，<selfname>。多半是要嘉奖你。他还会告诉我们如何永远封印恶魔。"

msgid "You've sealed 71 Devils. There's only one more. Go visit Seis for the last mission."
msgstr "你已封印了71个恶魔。只剩最后一个。去找塞斯接下最后的任务。"

msgid "You are here! We're almost done with this."
msgstr "你来了！我们就快完成了。"

msgid "[Devil1] Bahal's Army is still alive. Please end the war."
msgstr "[第1恶魔]巴尔的军队仍未消灭。请结束这场战争。"

msgid "Thank you! Now the War will end! Thank you again!"
msgstr "谢谢！现在战争就要结束了！再次感谢！"

msgid "Do you remember the monk [Chief of Associate of Magic] Pelore? He wants to see you, <selfname>. He wants to award you, probably. He'll also tell you how we can forever seal the Devils."
msgstr "你还记得那位僧侣[魔法协会会长]佩洛尔吗？他想见你，<selfname>。多半是要嘉奖你。他还会告诉我们如何永远封印恶魔。"

msgid "master! I think the war has ended. Since Malas is looking for you let's go visit [Eslant]."
msgstr "师傅！我想战争已经结束了。马拉斯在找你，我们去[艾斯兰特]看看吧。"

msgid "Hello! I've heard that <Selfname> has been great at the battle. Thank you."
msgstr "你好！我听说<Selfname>在战斗中表现英勇。谢谢。"

msgid "[Associate of Magic] Bros will teach you isolation? I haven't heard about that. "
msgstr "[魔法协会]的布罗斯要教你隔离之术？我可没听说这事。"

msgid "Their souls are sealed with the rings but we can't say that the rings power is complete."
msgstr "他们的灵魂虽已用戒指封印，但还不能说戒指的力量已经完备。"

msgid "First, we need materials to make the [Scroll of Seal]. Obtain [Hidden Scroll of Seal] from [Unidentified Old Man] in Moradon. Then, collect [Unopenable Lock] from [Heppa¡¯s Disciple] Shojin in Moradon, and [Magic Power Point of Krowaz Territory] from [White Shadow] Chacer, in Krowaz territory. Come back once you¡¯ve finished collecting all the materials."
msgstr "首先，我们需要材料来制作[封印卷轴]。从莫拉登的[身份不明的老人]那里取得[隐秘封印卷轴]。然后，从莫拉登[黑帕弟子]正人那里取得[无法开启的锁]，从克柔瓦兹领地的[白影]查瑟那里取得[克柔瓦兹领地魔力节点]。收集齐所有材料后再回来。"

msgid "Master! I think the war has ended. Since Pellore is looking for you let's go visit [Eslant]."
msgstr "师傅！我想战争已经结束了。佩洛尔在找你，我们去[艾斯兰特]看看吧。"

msgid "Oh, hello? I've heard that you've done an awesome job at the battle. Thank you so much."
msgstr "哦，你好？我听说你在战斗中干得非常出色。非常感谢。"

msgid "[Associate of Magic] Seis will teach you isolation? I haven't heard about that. "
msgstr "[魔法协会]的塞斯要教你隔离之术？我可没听说这事。"

msgid "That's weird. Didn't bros say that Malas will tell us about it? But Monk Malas has no idea."
msgstr "真奇怪。布罗斯不是说马拉斯会告诉我们吗？可僧侣马拉斯却一无所知。"

msgid "You haven¡¯t collected them all, yet. Let me tell you one more time. You have to collect [Hidden Scroll of Seal] from [Unidentified Old Man] in Moradon, [Unopenable Lock] from [Heppa¡¯s Disciple] Shojin in Moradon, and [Magic Power Point of Krowaz Territory] from [White Shadow] Chacer, in Krowaz territory."
msgstr "你还没收集齐。我再说一遍。你必须从莫拉登的[身份不明的老人]那里收集[隐秘封印卷轴]，从莫拉登[黑帕弟子]正人那里收集[无法开启的锁]，从克柔瓦兹领地的[白影]查瑟那里收集[克柔瓦兹领地魔力节点]。"

msgid "You brought them all!"
msgstr "你都带来了！"

msgid "Here, with [Completed Sealed Document] bring it to Bros. I feel something bad is going to happen."
msgstr "来，拿着[完成的封印文书]交给布罗斯。我预感要有不好的事发生。"

msgid "That's weird. Didn't Seis say that Pelore will tell us about it? But Pelore has no idea."
msgstr "真奇怪。塞斯不是说佩洛尔会告诉我们吗？可佩洛尔却一无所知。"

msgid "Seis will teach isolation? I haven't heard of that."
msgstr "塞斯要教隔离之术？我可没听说这事。"

msgid "Here, with [Completed Sealed Document] bring it to Seis. I feel something bad is going to happen."
msgstr "来，拿着[完成的封印文书]交给塞斯。我预感要有不好的事发生。"

msgid "Something's up. What could it be? Go visit [Associate of Magic] Bros."
msgstr "出事了。会是什么呢？去见[魔法协会]的布罗斯。"

msgid "Ah..  <selfname> you are finally here. "
msgstr "啊……<selfname>，你终于来了。"

msgid "[Devil32] Asmodeus has been unsealed. It was my mistake. He turned himself to look like me and locked me in and he told you to go to [Eslant]. While you were at Eslant, he stole the [Sealed Ring] and ran away!!"
msgstr "[第32恶魔]阿斯莫德被解封了。都怪我。他变成我的模样把我锁了起来，还骗你去[艾斯兰特]。趁你在艾斯兰特的时候，他偷走了[封印戒指]逃走了！！"

msgid "What? You brought the [completely Sealed document]? Where is it?"
msgstr "什么？你把[完全封印文书]带来了？在哪儿？"

msgid "You brought [Completely Sealed Document]? Malas must have known about this. I think with this we can capture [Devil32] Asmodeus again."
msgstr "你带来了[完全封印文书]？马拉斯一定早就料到了。我想有了它，我们就能重新擒住[第32恶魔]阿斯莫德。"

msgid "We now have to seal [Devil32]. But Im not sure if he's more powerful now than ever. He could have awaken all the devils to become [Awaken Asmodeus]."
msgstr "我们现在必须封印[第32恶魔]。但我不确定他现在是否比以往更强大。他可能已经唤醒了所有恶魔，变成了[觉醒阿斯莫德]。"

msgid "Something is up. What could it be? Go visit Seis to find out."
msgstr "出事了。会是什么呢？去见塞斯问个清楚。"

msgid "Ask Bros how we'll be able to seal [Awaken Asmodeus]."
msgstr "去问布罗斯，我们要怎样才能封印[觉醒阿斯莫德]。"

msgid "If we have the [Completely sealed document] we can do this."
msgstr "只要有[完全封印文书]，我们就能做到。"

msgid "It'll be harder than we've imagined. Since it's my fault I'll try to locate him."
msgstr "这会比我们想象的更艰难。既然是我的错，我来设法找到他的下落。"

msgid "I've located him. He's at Moradon. Go find [Unidentified Madosa] and show [Wise Queen's Eyes]. "
msgstr "我找到他了。他在莫拉登。去寻找[未知魔道师]，出示[智慧女王之眼]。"

msgid "Ask Seis how we can seal [Awaken Asmodeus]."
msgstr "去问塞斯，我们要怎样才能封印[觉醒阿斯莫德]。"

msgid "[Awaken Asmodeus]¡¦   I'm so scared. Ask Bros how we can seal him again."
msgstr "[觉醒阿斯莫德]……我好害怕。去问布罗斯我们要如何再次封印他。"

msgid "It's my fault¡¦"
msgstr "都怪我……"

msgid "Go find [Unidentified Madosa] and show [Wise Queen's Eyes]. "
msgstr "去寻找[未知魔道师]，出示[智慧女王之眼]。"

msgid "You haven't defeated him? You have no time, hurry!"
msgstr "你还没打败他？没时间了，快！"

msgid "You got rid of him! Now this can be sealed completely."
msgstr "你把他除掉了！这下就能彻底封印了。"

msgid "All 72 Devils are sealed. The name of this book is [Devil72 Seal Remegedon]. Bring this to Malas Monk. They'll be asleep forever."
msgstr "全部72个恶魔都已封印。这本书名为[72恶魔封印终末劫火]。把它带给马拉斯僧侣吧。他们将永远沉睡。"

msgid "Master, everything seems to be almost done. At last, let's bring this book to Malas."
msgstr "师傅，一切似乎都快完成了。最后，我们把这本书带给马拉斯吧。"

msgid "I knew you would come around this time."
msgstr "我就知道你这个时候会来。"

msgid "The war will end now."
msgstr "战争现在就要结束了。"

msgid "Where did you forget it? Check it again."
msgstr "你把它忘在哪儿了？再检查一遍。"

msgid "Good job. This [Devil72 Seal Remegedon] will be on the bottom of the lake forever. "
msgstr "干得漂亮。这[72恶魔封印终末劫火]将永远沉于湖底。"

msgid "This has been a long journey. What you have done will be told and retold. Hope you can help for our next war."
msgstr "这真是一段漫长的旅程。你所做的一切将被人们反复传颂。希望下一场战争时你还能来帮忙。"

msgid "I'll give it to you again. Don't lose it."
msgstr "我再给你一份。别再弄丢了。"

msgid "Luferson Castle's Herga is looking for you to find out what's going on with the unknown incident."
msgstr "卢弗森城堡的赫尔加在找你，想弄清那起不明事件的来龙去脉。"

msgid "Elmorad Castle's Nez is looking for you to find out what's going on with the unknown incident."
msgstr "艾莫拉德城堡的内兹在找你，想弄清那起不明事件的来龙去脉。"

msgid "Luferson Castle's Herga said to bring [Split Snake Scales] from [Lamia]."
msgstr "卢弗森城堡的赫尔加说，要从[拉米亚]那里取得[碎裂蛇鳞]。"

msgid "Elmorad Castle's Nez said to bring [Split Snake Scales] from [Lamia]."
msgstr "艾莫拉德城堡的内兹说，要从[拉米亚]那里取得[碎裂蛇鳞]。"

msgid "Find [Magic Association] Gator following what Herga said."
msgstr "按照赫尔加的吩咐，去找[魔法协会]的盖特。"

msgid "Find [Magic Association] Gator following what Nez said."
msgstr "按照内兹的吩咐，去找[魔法协会]的盖特。"

msgid "Collect [Contaminated Snake Scales] and [Contaminated Hard Snake Scales] from the contaminated area which Gator is sending you."
msgstr "从盖特派你前往的污染区域，收集[被污染的蛇鳞]和[被污染的坚硬蛇鳞]。"

msgid "Collect [Contaminated Snake Scales] and [Contaminated Hard Snake Scales] from the contaminated area which Noker is sending you."
msgstr "从诺克派你前往的污染区域，收集[被污染的蛇鳞]和[被污染的坚硬蛇鳞]。"

msgid "Collect [Haoong Clan's Warrior Blood] following the order from Luferson Castle's Herga."
msgstr "按照卢弗森城堡赫尔加的命令，收集[豪昂族战士之血]。"

msgid "Collect [Haoong Clan's Warrior Blood] following the order from Elmorad Castle's Nez."
msgstr "按照艾莫拉德城堡内兹的命令，收集[豪昂族战士之血]。"

msgid "Deliver [Haoong Clan's Warrior Blood Sample] to Gator following what Herga has ordered."
msgstr "按照赫尔加的命令，把[豪昂族战士血样]交给盖特。"

msgid "Deliver [Haoong Clan's Warrior Blood Sample] to Gator following what Nez has ordered."
msgstr "按照内兹的命令，把[豪昂族战士血样]交给盖特。"

msgid "Collect [Contaminated Haoong Clan's Warrior Blood] and [Contaminated Powder Nut Blood] from where Gator is sending you."
msgstr "从盖特派你前往的地方，收集[被污染的豪昂族战士之血]和[被污染的粉坚果之血]。"

msgid "Collect [Contaminated Haoong Clan's Warrior Blood] and [Contaminated Powder Nut Blood] from where Noker is sending you."
msgstr "从诺克派你前往的地方，收集[被污染的豪昂族战士之血]和[被污染的粉坚果之血]。"

msgid "Talk to Herga from Luferson Castle."
msgstr "与卢弗森城堡的赫尔加谈谈。"

msgid "Talk to Nez from El Morad Castle."
msgstr "与艾莫拉德城堡的内兹谈谈。"

msgid "Deliver [Contamination Component Report] to [Secret Deputy] Clarence following the order from Herga."
msgstr "按照赫尔加的命令，把[污染成分报告]交给[秘密副官]克拉伦斯。"

msgid "Deliver [Contamination Component Report] to [Secret Deputy] Clarence following the order from Nez."
msgstr "按照内兹的命令，把[污染成分报告]交给[秘密副官]克拉伦斯。"

msgid "Collect [Shiny Fruit] and [Legendary Shiny Fruit] from the place [Secret Deputy] Clarence from Belua Town sends you."
msgstr "从贝卢亚镇的[秘密副官]克拉伦斯派你前往的地方，收集[闪光果实]和[传说闪光果实]。"

