msgstr "应[秘密副官]克拉伦斯的请求，把[闪光果汁]交给[顾问]赫尔加。"

msgid "Deliver [Shiny Fruit Juice] to [Advisor] Nez following the request by [Secret Deputy] Clarence."
msgstr "应[秘密副官]克拉伦斯的请求，把[闪光果汁]交给[顾问]内兹。"

msgid "Deliver [Shiny Fruit Juice Sample] to [Palentology Research Associate] Ramark. |¡Ø [Palentology Research Associate] Ramark lives in the instant Dungeon and you can enter the Instant Dungeon through Elmorad's Nez, Karus, or Herga."
msgstr "把[闪光果汁样本]交给[古生物研究员]拉马克。|※ [古生物研究员]拉马克住在副本中，你可以通过艾莫拉德的内兹、卡鲁斯或赫尔加进入副本。"

msgid "You have to collect [Clear Sap of Old Tree] and [First Grade Sap of Old Tree] by [Biologist] Lamark¡¯s request. |¡Ø [Biologist] Lamark resides in the Instant Dungeon. You can enter the Instant Dungeon via [Councilor] Nez of El Morad or [Councilor] Herga, of Karus."
msgstr "应[生物学家]拉马克的请求，你必须收集[古树的清净树液]和[一等古树树液]。|※ [生物学家]拉马克住在副本中。你可以通过艾莫拉德的[议员]内兹或卡鲁斯的[议员]赫尔加进入副本。"

msgid "Talk to Gator about antibiotic study."
msgstr "与盖特谈谈关于抗生素研究的事。"

msgid "Talk to Noker about antibiotic study."
msgstr "与诺克谈谈关于抗生素研究的事。"

msgid "Deliver [Complete Antibiotic] to Luferson Castle's Herga following the request from Gator."
msgstr "应盖特的请求，把[完整抗生素]交给卢弗森城堡的赫尔加。"

msgid "Deliver [Complete Antibiotic] to Luferson Castle's Herga following the request from Noker."
msgstr "应诺克的请求，把[完整抗生素]交给卢弗森城堡的赫尔加。"

msgid "Use [Timing Flow] (Taion) to [Taion], following the order of Herga. |¡Ø [Timing Flow] (Taion) can be equipped like a weapon. Only when you are conducting the related quest you'll be able to use it."
msgstr "按照赫尔加的命令，把[时序之流]（泰昂）用于[泰昂]。|※ [时序之流]（泰昂）可以像武器一样装备。只有在进行相关任务时才能使用它。"

msgid "Use [Timing Flow] (Taion) to [Taion], following the order of Nez. |¡Ø [Timing Flow] (Taion) can be equipped like a weapon. Only when you are conducting the related quest you'll be able to use it."
msgstr "按照内兹的命令，把[时序之流]（泰昂）用于[泰昂]。|※ [时序之流]（泰昂）可以像武器一样装备。只有在进行相关任务时才能使用它。"

msgid "Use [Timing Flow] (MeganTaion) to [MeganTaion], following the order of Herga. |¡Ø [Timing Flow] (MeganTaion) can be equipped like a weapon. Only when you are conducting the related quest you'll be able to use it."
msgstr "按照赫尔加的命令，把[时序之流]（巨型泰昂）用于[巨型泰昂]。|※ [时序之流]（巨型泰昂）可以像武器一样装备。只有在进行相关任务时才能使用它。"

msgid "Use [Timing Flow] (MeganTaion) to [MeganTaion], following the order of Nez. |¡Ø [Timing Flow] (MeganTaion) can be equipped like a weapon. Only when you are conducting the related quest you'll be able to use it."
msgstr "按照内兹的命令，把[时序之流]（巨型泰昂）用于[巨型泰昂]。|※ [时序之流]（巨型泰昂）可以像武器一样装备。只有在进行相关任务时才能使用它。"

msgid "Deliver [100000 Noah] and [Curse Detox] to Gator to help improve antibiotic study following the order of Herga."
msgstr "按照赫尔加的命令，把[10万诺亚]和[诅咒解毒剂]交给盖特，协助改进抗生素研究。"

msgid "Deliver [100000 Noah] and [Curse Detox] to Gator to help improve antibiotic study following the order of Nez."
msgstr "按照内兹的命令，把[10万诺亚]和[诅咒解毒剂]交给盖特，协助改进抗生素研究。"

msgid "Use [Timing Flow] (Helhound) to [Helhound], following the order of Herga. |¡Ø [Timing Flow] (Helhound) can be equipped like a weapon. Only when you are conducting the related quest you'll be able to use it."
msgstr "按照赫尔加的命令，把[时序之流]（地狱猎犬）用于[地狱猎犬]。|※ [时序之流]（地狱猎犬）可以像武器一样装备。只有在进行相关任务时才能使用它。"

msgid "Use [Timing Flow] (Helhound) to [Helhound], following the order of Nez. |¡Ø [Timing Flow] (Helhound) can be equipped like a weapon. Only when you are conducting the related quest you'll be able to use it."
msgstr "按照内兹的命令，把[时序之流]（地狱猎犬）用于[地狱猎犬]。|※ [时序之流]（地狱猎犬）可以像武器一样装备。只有在进行相关任务时才能使用它。"

msgid "Talk to Luferson Castle's [Advisor] Herga."
msgstr "与卢弗森城堡的[顾问]赫尔加谈谈。"

msgid "Talk to Elmorad Castle's [Advisor] Nez."
msgstr "与艾莫拉德城堡的[顾问]内兹谈谈。"

msgid "I have an order from [Advisor] Herga to receive advice from [Magic Association Advisor] Harrigon from Ronarkland."
msgstr "我奉[顾问]赫尔加之命，去向罗纳克之地的[魔法协会顾问]哈里根征询意见。"

msgid "I have an order from [Advisor] Nez to receive advice from [Magic Association Advisor] Marcus from Ronarkland."
msgstr "我奉[顾问]内兹之命，去向罗纳克之地的[魔法协会顾问]马库斯征询意见。"

msgid "Collect [Contaminated Mana Residue] and [Pure Mana Residue] from the place [Magic Association Advisor] Harrigon sends you."
msgstr "从[魔法协会顾问]哈里根派你前往的地方，收集[被污染的魔力残渣]和[纯净魔力残渣]。"

msgid "Collect [Contaminated Mana Residue] and [Pure Mana Residue] from the place [Magic Association Advisor] Marcus sends you."
msgstr "从[魔法协会顾问]马库斯派你前往的地方，收集[被污染的魔力残渣]和[纯净魔力残渣]。"

msgid "Deliver [Mana Residue Sample] to Luferson Castle's [Advisor] Herga following Harrigon's request."
msgstr "应哈里根的请求，把[魔力残渣样本]交给卢弗森城堡的[顾问]赫尔加。"

msgid "Deliver [Mana Residue Sample] to El Morad Castle's [Advisor] Nez following Marcus's request."
msgstr "应马库斯的请求，把[魔力残渣样本]交给艾莫拉德城堡的[顾问]内兹。"

msgid "Talk to Herga about the result of the study."
msgstr "与赫尔加谈谈研究结果。"

msgid "Talk to Nez about the result of the study."
msgstr "与内兹谈谈研究结果。"

msgid "Following the order from Herga, deliver [Cracking Test Report] to Harrigon."
msgstr "按照赫尔加的命令，把[开裂测试报告]交给哈里根。"

msgid "Following the order from Nez, deliver [Cracking Test Report] to Marcus."
msgstr "按照内兹的命令，把[开裂测试报告]交给马库斯。"

msgid "Move to where the cracking happened and destruct the crack. |¡Ø Tip: Once you start attacking there, there might be monsters."
msgstr "前往开裂发生之处，破坏那道裂缝。|※ 提示：一旦你在那里开始攻击，可能会出现怪物。"

msgid "Herga is asking for you. Please go to Luferson Castle."
msgstr "赫尔加在找你。请前往卢弗森城堡。"

msgid "<selfname>.Are you doing well?"
msgstr "<selfname>，你还好吗？"

msgid "Bad Energy is disrupting Adonis Continent. Wizards are trying to find the reason for this but have no luck. "
msgstr "邪祟之力正在扰乱阿多尼斯大陆。法师们试图找出原因，却一无所获。"

msgid "We have no resouces to further find out what's going on. Can you take this assignment?"
msgstr "我们已没有更多资源继续追查真相了。你能接下这项任务吗？"

msgid "Thank you for accepting. For now, [Cracked Snake Scale] should be collected from [Lamia]. This will be used to find out the reason for the incident."
msgstr "谢谢你愿意接受。眼下，需要从[拉米亚]那里收集[碎裂蛇鳞]。它将用于查明这起事件的原因。"

msgid "Nez is asking for you. Please go to El Morad Castle."
msgstr "内兹在找你。请前往艾莫拉德城堡。"

msgid "According to Herga, something's happening at Adonis Continent."
msgstr "据赫尔加所说，阿多尼斯大陆正出事端。"

msgid "It seems you are going to help now. Like I said, find out what's causing this."
msgstr "看来你这就要去帮忙了。正如我所说，去查清楚这是什么引起的。"

msgid "For now, collect [Cracked Snake Scale] from [Lamia]."
msgstr "眼下，先从[拉米亚]那里收集[碎裂蛇鳞]。"

msgid "We have no time. Hurry!"
msgstr "我们没时间了。快！"

msgid "You brought it. Good job."
msgstr "你带来了。干得漂亮。"

msgid "Level up to 51 and come back."
msgstr "升到51级后再来。"

msgid "I can't tell what's happening here..  Hm¡¦   Please do me a favor again. Go find Gather."
msgstr "我说不清这里发生了什么……嗯……请再帮我一个忙。去找盖特。"

msgid "According to Nez, something's happening at Adonis Continent."
msgstr "据内兹所说，阿多尼斯大陆正出事端。"

msgid "I can't tell what's happening here..  Hm¡¦   You'll need to do me a favor again. Go find Knoker."
msgstr "我说不清这里发生了什么……嗯……你得再帮我一个忙。去找诺克。"

msgid "Let's go find Gather like Herga has suggested."
msgstr "我们照赫尔加说的，去找盖特吧。"

msgid "You must be <selfname>. Herga has contacted me already."
msgstr "你一定就是<selfname>。赫尔加已经联系过我了。"

msgid "From what Herga has reported and given the information we received we were able to find out that the contamination is happening all over the Adonis Continent."
msgstr "根据赫尔加的报告，以及我们收到的情报，我们查明污染正在整个阿多尼斯大陆蔓延。"

msgid "From the contaminated area, a new kind of disease is spreading. Currently it's spreading through pigs. But this might definitely effect human. Can you help us?"
msgstr "污染区域正蔓延出一种新的疾病。目前它正通过猪传播。但这必然会影响到人类。你能帮帮我们吗？"

msgid "Sure. I'll move you to the contaminated area. Obtain [Contaminated Snake Scale] from [Contaminated Lamia] and [Contaminated Hard Snake Scales] from their chief [Contaminated Ramiros]."
msgstr "好。我这就把你传送到污染区域。从[被污染的拉米亚]那里取得[被污染的蛇鳞]，从它们的首领[被污染的拉米罗斯]那里取得[被污染的坚硬蛇鳞]。"

msgid "Let's go find Knoker like Nez has suggested."
msgstr "我们照内兹说的，去找诺克吧。"

msgid "You must be <selfname>. Nez has contacted me already."
msgstr "你一定就是<selfname>。内兹已经联系过我了。"

msgid "From what Nez has reported and given the information we received we were able to find out that the contamination is happening all over the Adonis Continent."
msgstr "根据内兹的报告，以及我们收到的情报，我们查明污染正在整个阿多尼斯大陆蔓延。"

msgid "New disease? Is it like the flu?? Let's hurry and go visit Gather. I don't want to go to the doctors."
msgstr "新疾病？是不是像流感一样？我们快去看看盖特吧。我可不想去看医生。"

msgid "What's the problem? I don't think you have enough."
msgstr "出什么事了？我想你带的还不够。"

msgid "You have them all! We can start the experiment."
msgstr "你都收集齐了！我们可以开始实验了。"

msgid "Please come back when you level up to 52."
msgstr "请升到52级后再来。"

msgid "Herga from Luferson Castle is looking for you, <selfname>. When you come she says deliver [Haoong Clan Warrior's Blood]."
msgstr "卢弗森城堡的赫尔加在找你，<selfname>。他说你来了就把[豪昂族战士之血]交给他。"

msgid "New disease? Is it like the flu?? Let's hurry and go take a visit to Noker. I don't want to go to the doctors."
msgstr "新疾病？是不是像流感一样？我们快去看看诺克吧。我可不想去看医生。"

msgid "Please come back when you level up to be 52."
msgstr "请升到52级后再来。"

msgid "Nez from El Morad Castle is looking for you, <selfname>. When you come she says deliver [Haoong Clan Warrior's Blood]."
msgstr "艾莫拉德城堡的内兹在找你，<selfname>。他说你来了就把[豪昂族战士之血]交给他。"

msgid "¡¦  I ¡¦ think.. I'm getting the symptoms. Herga must know what to do."
msgstr "……我……觉得……我开始出现症状了。赫尔加一定知道该怎么办。"

msgid "I've heard of the story again."
msgstr "我又听说了那件事。"

msgid "The person who seems to be infected are [haoong's Clan Warriors]. We have to get [Haoong Clan's Warrior Blood] to study further."
msgstr "看起来被感染的是[豪昂族战士]。我们必须取得[豪昂族战士之血]来做进一步研究。"

msgid "You don't have enough. Hurry."
msgstr "你带的不够。快点。"

msgid "You have it. Let's make sample."
msgstr "你带来了。我们来做样本吧。"

msgid "Take this [Haoong Clan Warrior Blood sample] to [Magic Association] Gator."
msgstr "把这[豪昂族战士血样]带给[魔法协会]的盖特。"

msgid "¡¦  I ¡¦ think.. I'm getting the symptoms. Nez must know what to do."
msgstr "……我……觉得……我开始出现症状了。内兹一定知道该怎么办。"

msgid "Visit Gator to get the next mission."
msgstr "去见盖特，接下一个任务。"

msgid "We still have no idea what's causing it. We need more info."
msgstr "我们仍然不知道这是什么引起的。我们需要更多情报。"

msgid "You have [Haoong Clan Blood Sample]? "
msgstr "你带了[豪昂族战士血样]？"

msgid "But I can't seem to find the sample. I don't think you have it."
msgstr "可我好像没看到样本。我觉得你没带来。"

msgid "OH!!!  Interesting¡¦"
msgstr "哦！！有意思……"

msgid "Since we have the [Haoong Clan Blood Sample] I need something that'll can be compaired with. I'll send you to a place where you can collect [Contaminated Haoong's Warrior Blood], [Contaminated Powder Nut Blood]."
msgstr "既然我们有了[豪昂族战士血样]，我就需要一个可以用来对照的东西。我会把你送到一个地方，在那里你可以采集[被污染的豪昂族战士之血]、[被污染的粉坚果之血]。"

msgid "Visit Noker to get the next mission."
msgstr "去见诺克，接下一个任务。"

msgid "Herga has a nickname like that? Wow he's more awesome than I had imagined."
msgstr "赫尔加还有那样的外号？哇，他比我想象的更厉害。"

msgid "Because of Herga, we're seeing some progress."
msgstr "多亏了赫尔加，我们看到了一些进展。"

msgid "I don't think you have enough. Go collect more."
msgstr "我觉得你带的还不够。去多收集一些。"

msgid "You have them all! I'll start experiement."
msgstr "你都收集齐了！我这就开始实验。"

msgid "I'll give you the next mission when you are level 53."
msgstr "等你53级时我再交代下一个任务。"

msgid "Find Herga. I've sent the contamination report. He says he'll need to talk to you, <selfname>."
msgstr "去找赫尔加。我已经把污染报告发过去了。他说要和你谈谈，<selfname>。"

msgid "Nez has a nickname like that? Wow he's more awesome than I had imagined."
msgstr "内兹还有那样的外号？哇，他比我想象的更厉害。"

msgid "Because of Nez, we're seeing some progress."
msgstr "多亏了内兹，我们看到了一些进展。"

msgid "Find Nez. I've sent the contamination report. He says he'll need to talk to you, <selfname>."
msgstr "去找内兹。我已经把污染报告发过去了。他说要和你谈谈，<selfname>。"

msgid "Master, Herga is looking for you. He has to talk to you about the component of the contamination."
msgstr "师傅，赫尔加在找你。他要和你谈谈污染的成分。"

msgid "Hm.. Something scary is happening¡¦"
msgstr "嗯……有可怕的事正在发生……"

msgid "According to the report Gator sent, the contamination is spreading fast. Karus will die if this keeps continue like this. It's horrible."
msgstr "根据盖特送来的报告，污染正在快速蔓延。如果照这样继续下去，卡鲁斯将会灭亡。太可怕了。"

msgid "But we really can't find out how and why this is happening."
msgstr "可我们实在查不出这是如何、为何发生的。"

msgid "Deliver this report to Clarence. Since she's an elf she might have a clue."
msgstr "把这份报告交给克拉伦斯。她是精灵，或许能找到线索。"

msgid "Master, Nez is looking for you. He has to talk to you about the component of the contamination."
msgstr "师傅，内兹在找你。他要和你谈谈污染的成分。"

msgid "According to the report Noker sent, the contamination is spreading fast. El Morads will die if this keeps continue like this. It's horrible."
msgstr "根据诺克送来的报告，污染正在快速蔓延。如果照这样继续下去，艾莫拉德将会灭亡。太可怕了。"

msgid "So we just have to go find [Secret Agent] Clarence from [Belua Village]. Let's hurry."
msgstr "那我们就去找[贝卢亚村]的[密探]克拉伦斯吧。快点。"

msgid "Long time no see, <selfname>. What's going on?"
msgstr "好久不见，<selfname>。怎么回事？"

msgid "Contaminants Report? Another strange thing carrying nice surprise. What good. That I owe one they do not need you to help me."
msgstr "污染报告？又一件带着惊喜的怪事。真好。我欠他们一个人情，用不着你帮我。"

msgid "Where's the report?"
msgstr "报告在哪儿？"

msgid "What's this?"
msgstr "这是什么？"

msgid "Please collect [Shiny Fruit] and [Legendary Shiny Fruit] from the place I send you. You can get them from [Anceitn Trent] and [Legendary Old Tree]."
msgstr "请从我派你前往的地方收集[闪光果实]和[传说闪光果实]。你可以从[远古树精]和[传说古树]那里取得。"

msgid "So we just have to go find [Secret Agent] Clarence from [Aska Village]. Let's hurry."
msgstr "那我们就去找[阿斯卡村]的[密探]克拉伦斯吧。快点。"

msgid "Let's hurry and go."
msgstr "我们快走吧。"

msgid "I've read the report. It seems it's a big deal. It's better to always prevent things than fixing after bad things happen."
msgstr "我读过报告了。看来这事儿不小。与其事后补救，不如事先防范。"

msgid "You don't have enough yet. Do I have to send you again? So annoying¡¦"
msgstr "你带的还不够。非要我再送你去一次吗？真烦人……"

msgid "You have them all! Good!"
msgstr "你都收集齐了！好！"

msgid "Come back when you are level 54."
msgstr "升到54级后再来。"

msgid "Bring this fruit juice to Herga. Herga will make a good use out of this."
msgstr "把这果汁带给赫尔加。赫尔加会好好利用它的。"

msgid "Bring this fruit juice to Nez. Nez will make a good use out of this."
msgstr "把这果汁带给内兹。内兹会好好利用它的。"

msgid "We have to go back to Herga. I'm tired, Master!"
msgstr "我们得回赫尔加那里去。我累了，师傅！"

msgid "How's the result."
msgstr "结果怎么样？"

msgid "It seems the result is good. Is this [Shiny Fruit Juice]? This is the antibiotic for the disease? But this isn't enough."
msgstr "看来结果不错。这就是[闪光果汁]？这就是治那种病的抗生素？但这还不够。"

msgid "But where is the juice?"
msgstr "不过果汁在哪儿？"

msgid "It's literally shining. Wait here."
msgstr "它真的在发光。在这儿等着。"

msgid "Bring this [Shiny Fruit Juice Sample] to Ramark. He's one of the [Magic Associate] who's been dispatched to study this disease."
msgstr "把这[闪光果汁样本]带给拉马克。他是被派来研究这种疾病的[魔法协会]成员之一。"

msgid "We have to go back to Nez. I'm tired, Master!"
msgstr "我们得回内兹那里去。我累了，师傅！"

msgid "In order to meet Ramark, you have to go through Herga. Herga will lead the way."
msgstr "要见拉马克，你得先通过赫尔加。赫尔加会给你带路。"

msgid "In order to meet Ramark, you have to go through Nez. Nez will lead the way."
msgstr "要见拉马克，你得先通过内兹。内兹会给你带路。"

msgid "Who are you ...? The gift in your hand?"
msgstr "你是谁……？你手里拿的礼物？"

msgid "ah.. It wasn't.l.  It's [Shiny fruit juice Sample]¡¦  "
msgstr "啊……不是。是[闪光果汁样本]……"

msgid "Where is the [Shiny Fruit Juice Sample]?"
msgstr "[闪光果汁样本]在哪儿？"

msgid "This is ... It's more than expected ... I think we need to experiment more."
msgstr "这是……比预想的还要多……我想我们需要做更多实验。"

msgid "This isn't enough. I'll tell you what we need now. [Clean Old Tree Sap]. [1st Class Old Tree Sap]. You can get it from [Ancient Aishunt] and [Ancient Trezonz]. I'll wait for you over there."
msgstr "这还不够。我来告诉你我们现在需要什么。[清净古树树液]。[一等古树树液]。你可以从[远古艾尚特]和[远古特松兹]那里取得。我在那边等你。"

msgid "Larmark is looking for you Master. He says he lacks in something. Go through Herga."
msgstr "拉马克在找你，师傅。他说还缺些东西。从赫尔加那里过去。"

msgid "Larmark is looking for you Master. He says he lacks in something. Go through Nez."
msgstr "拉马克在找你，师傅。他说还缺些东西。从内兹那里过去。"

msgid "This is more than what I had imagined. We'll need to experiment more."
msgstr "这比我想象的还要多。我们需要做更多实验。"

msgid "You still haven't collected all?"
msgstr "你还没收集齐？"

msgid "Cor, really ... This long enough, we'll be fine."
msgstr "哎呀，真是……够长了，我们会没事的。"

msgid "I'll see what type of reaction it shows. I'll send the result to Gator. Go visit Gator."
msgstr "我来看看它会起什么样的反应。我会把结果发给盖特。去见盖特吧。"

msgid "I'll see what type of reaction it shows. I'll send the result to Noker. Go visit Noker."
msgstr "我来看看它会起什么样的反应。我会把结果发给诺克。去见诺克吧。"

msgid "Phew.. Finally. Go find Gator."
msgstr "呼……终于。去找盖特吧。"

msgid "You're back. I've received the story from Ramark with the result."
msgstr "你回来了。我已经收到拉马克连同结果一起发来的汇报了。"

msgid "Made [Complete Antibiotic] combining the [Shiny Fruit Juice] and [Clean Old Tree Sap]. "
msgstr "把[闪光果汁]和[清净古树树液]调配在一起，制成了[完整抗生素]。"

msgid "We can't be sure that this will resolve completely."
msgstr "我们还不能确定这能否彻底解决问题。"

msgid "Please deliver this [Completed Antibiotic] to Herga and do as he says. I'll try to find out if we can make more of this antibiotics."
msgstr "请把这[完成的抗生素]交给赫尔加，并照他说的做。我会想办法看能否多制造一些这种抗生素。"

msgid "Phew.. Finally. Go find Noker."
msgstr "呼……终于。去找诺克吧。"

msgid "Please deliver this [Completed Antibiotic] to Nez and do as he says. I'll try to find out if we can make more of this antibiotics."
msgstr "请把这[完成的抗生素]交给内兹，并照他说的做。我会想办法看能否多制造一些这种抗生素。"

msgid "We have to go back to Luferson Castle and meet [Advisor] Herga. Let's go, Master."
msgstr "我们得回卢弗森城堡去见[顾问]赫尔加。走吧，师傅。"

msgid "You've come back. So what's happened?"
msgstr "你回来了。那么，发生了什么？"

msgid "Antibiotic creation has been completed? Good job, <selfname>. [Completed Antibiotics]¡¦  "
msgstr "抗生素研制完成了？干得漂亮，<selfname>。[完成的抗生素]……"

msgid "So where is it?"
msgstr "那它在哪儿？"

msgid "Give it to me. I'll see how we can distribute this before the disease spreads."
msgstr "给我。我来想想如何在疾病蔓延之前把它分发下去。"

msgid "First, get this [Timing Flow (Taion)]. Equip this and vaccinate [Taion]. It'll only work on [Taion]."
msgstr "首先，拿上这[时序之流（泰昂）]。装备它，给[泰昂]接种。它只对[泰昂]有效。"

msgid "We have to go back to El Morad Castle and meet [Advisor] Nez. Let's go, Master."
msgstr "我们得回艾莫拉德城堡去见[顾问]内兹。走吧，师傅。"

msgid "You'll need to be level 55 and find Gator for the next mission."
msgstr "你需要升到55级，然后去找盖特接下一个任务。"

msgid "Antibiotics has been developed! Now we just have to use it! Go visit [Advisor] Herga. He'll give you a mission."
msgstr "抗生素研制出来了！现在我们只需用上它！去见[顾问]赫尔加吧。他会给你任务。"

msgid "We have the antibiotics now."
msgstr "我们现在有抗生素了。"

msgid "Are we done with the vaccination yet? Cheer up."
msgstr "我们接种完了吗？振作起来。"

msgid "I'm not sure if it got applied. Are we done?"
msgstr "我不确定是否接种上了。我们完成了吗？"

msgid "Come back when you are level 56 for the next mission."
msgstr "升到56级后再来接下一个任务。"

msgid "First, get this [Timing Flow (Megatereon)]. Equip this and vaccinate [Megatereon]. It'll only work on [Megatereon]."
msgstr "首先，拿上这[时序之流（巨型泰昂）]。装备它，给[巨型泰昂]接种。它只对[巨型泰昂]有效。"

msgid "Antibiotics has been developed! Now we just have to use it! Go visit [Advisor] Nez. He'll give you a mission."
msgstr "抗生素研制出来了！现在我们只需用上它！去见[顾问]内兹吧。他会给你任务。"

msgid "[Timing Flow? That's a weird name.[Advisor] Herga's reputation considering naming some sense ... Anyway, I re-call should go shinny ... Again seems to give a similar mission."
msgstr "[时序之流？这名字真怪。[顾问]赫尔加取名的品味真不敢恭维……总之，又要你跑一趟了……好像又是个类似的任务。"

msgid "Again, I think I will need a proper prescription. I gotta get some trouble."
msgstr "又要麻烦你了，我需要一份正式的处方。我得去惹点麻烦了。"

msgid "Are we done yet? We have no time!"
msgstr "我们完成了吗？我们没时间了！"

msgid "It seems that the vaccine is working!"
msgstr "看来疫苗起效了！"

msgid "We are out of antibiotics now. Please bring [100000 Noah], [Curse Antidote] to [Associate of Magic] Gator. He'll need this to make additional antibiotics."
msgstr "我们的抗生素用完了。请把[10万诺亚]、[诅咒解毒剂]带给[魔法协会]的盖特。他需要这些来制造更多抗生素。"

msgid "[Timing Flow]? Funny name. Since he's calling you, go visit Nez. You'll have another mission."
msgstr "[时序之流]？真逗的名字。既然他叫你去，就去见内兹吧。又有任务了。"

msgid "We'll need you again this time."
msgstr "这次又要拜托你了。"

msgid "Can you hurry up please?"
msgstr "你能快点吗？"

msgid "We are out of antibiotics now. Please bring [100000 Noah], [Curse Antidote] to [Associate of Magic] Noker. He'll need this to make additional antibiotics."
msgstr "我们的抗生素用完了。请把[10万诺亚]、[诅咒解毒剂]带给[魔法协会]的诺克。他需要这些来制造更多抗生素。"

msgid "Aren't we out of the antibiotics? For now let's go visit gator."
msgstr "抗生素用完了吧？我们先去见盖特吧。"

msgid "How is your mission going?"
msgstr "你的任务进展如何？"

msgid "You are out of all the antibiotics? Bring me [100000 Noah] and [Curse Antidote] for me to make more of the antibiotics."
msgstr "抗生素都用光了？把[10万诺亚]和[诅咒解毒剂]带给我，我好制造更多抗生素。"

msgid "We need [100000 Noah] and [Curse Antidote]. [Curse Antidote] can be found at the merchant."
msgstr "我们需要[10万诺亚]和[诅咒解毒剂]。[诅咒解毒剂]可以在商人那里买到。"

msgid "You have it. Let's hurry."
msgstr "你带来了。我们快点。"

msgid "You'll need to be level 57 for the next mission. Go find Herga."
msgstr "你需要升到57级接下一个任务。去找赫尔加。"

msgid "Here, I'll give you [Timing Flow (Hell Hound)].Vaccinate [Helhound] with this and go back to Herga. Thank you."
msgstr "来，我给你[时序之流（地狱猎犬）]。用它给[地狱猎犬]接种，然后回赫尔加那里。谢谢你。"

msgid "Antibiotics might be out. Let's visit Noker."
msgstr "抗生素可能用完了。我们去见诺克吧。"

msgid "How's your mission going?"
msgstr "你的任务进展如何？"

msgid "It's so tiring¡¦ Let's go visit Herga to get the next person we need to vaccinate."
msgstr "真累人……我们去见赫尔加，接下一个需要接种的目标吧。"

msgid "Let's hurry now."
msgstr "我们现在快点。"

msgid "Here take the [Timing Flow (Hellhound)]. With this [Hell Hound] should be vaccinated. Just like [Megatereon], it'll only work on [Hellhound]."
msgstr "来，拿上[时序之流（地狱猎犬）]。用它给[地狱猎犬]接种。和[巨型泰昂]一样，它只对[地狱猎犬]有效。"

msgid "It's not done yet?"
msgstr "还没完成吗？"

msgid "Now I'm less worried."
msgstr "这下我放心多了。"

msgid "Good job. But this isn't the end. For now we've stopped it but we have to be careful. We really have to find out what caused this."
msgstr "干得漂亮。但这还没完。眼下我们只是遏制住了，还得小心。我们必须查明这一切的起因。"

msgid "It's so tiring¡¦ Let's go visit Nez to get the next person we need to vaccinate."
msgstr "真累人……我们去见内兹，接下一个需要接种的目标吧。"

msgid "Go talk to Herga. He has something important to say."
msgstr "去和赫尔加谈谈。他有重要的事要说。"

msgid "You came. Let's talk now."
msgstr "你来了。我们现在就谈吧。"

msgid "So again, we've decided to ask [Associate of Magic]'s ability. Go meet [Associate of Magic Advisor] Harrigon located at [Ronarkland]. He'll be able to help us find out the cause of this."
msgstr "于是，我们决定再次求助于[魔法协会]的力量。去见位于[罗纳克之地]的[魔法协会顾问]哈里根。他能帮我们查明起因。"

msgid "You need to be at least level 58 to visit Harrigon."
msgstr "你至少要达到58级才能去见哈里根。"

msgid "Go meet [Associate of Magic Advisor] Harrigon. We have no time."
msgstr "去见[魔法协会顾问]哈里根。我们没时间了。"

msgid "Go talk to Nez. He has something important to say."
msgstr "去和内兹谈谈。他有重要的事要说。"

msgid "So again, we've decided to ask [Associate of Magic]'s ability. Go meet [Associate of Magic Advisor] Marcus located at [Ronarkland]. He'll be able to help us find out the cause of this."
msgstr "于是，我们决定再次求助于[魔法协会]的力量。去见位于[罗纳克之地]的[魔法协会顾问]马库斯。他能帮我们查明起因。"

msgid "[Ronarkland]??  Can we make it there? Why is Harrigon located at such a scary place?"
msgstr "[罗纳克之地]？我们能赶到那里吗？哈里根为什么待在那么可怕的地方？"

msgid "Who are you? Why are you looking for me?"
msgstr "你是谁？为什么找我？"

msgid "Ah.. You are the person who's sent by Herga. Nice to meet you."
msgstr "啊……你就是赫尔加派来的人。幸会。"

msgid "For now, I'll see what I can do. But I need your help."
msgstr "眼下，我先看看能做些什么。但我需要你的帮助。"

msgid "Please obtain [Contaminated Mana Residue] and [Pure Mana Residue]. You'll be able to collect them from where I send you."
msgstr "请取得[被污染的魔力残渣]和[纯净魔力残渣]。你可以从我派你前往的地方采集到。"

msgid "Ah.. You are the person who's sent by Nez. Nice to meet you."
msgstr "啊……你就是内兹派来的人。幸会。"

msgid "Harrigon's a bit weird¡¦ Talk to him again."
msgstr "哈里根有点古怪……再和他谈谈。"

msgid "Could you help?"
msgstr "你能帮个忙吗？"

msgid "I don't think you have enough.?"
msgstr "我觉得你带的不够。？"

msgid "Sure. This is enough."
msgstr "好。这些够了。"

msgid "Bring this [Mana Residue Sample] to Herga."
msgstr "把这[魔力残渣样本]带给赫尔加。"

msgid "Marcus seems a bit weird. Talk to him again."
msgstr "马库斯似乎有点古怪。再和他谈谈。"

msgid "Bring this [Mana Residue Sample] to Nez."
msgstr "把这[魔力残渣样本]带给内兹。"

msgid "Bring [Mana Residue Sample] to Herga."
msgstr "把[魔力残渣样本]带给赫尔加。"

msgid "Did you visit him? What did he say?"
msgstr "你去见他了吗？他怎么说？"

msgid "[Mana Residue Sample]? Hm¡¦  "
msgstr "[魔力残渣样本]？嗯……"

msgid "OH no¡¦  "
msgstr "哦不……"

msgid "You'll need to be at least level 59 to receive the next mission. Come back later."
msgstr "你至少要达到59级才能接下一个任务。稍后再来。"

msgid "I'll need to analyze this. Talk to me again a bit later."
msgstr "我需要分析一下。过会儿再和我谈。"

msgid "Bring [Mana Residue Sample] to Nez."
msgstr "把[魔力残渣样本]带给内兹。"

msgid "Ah you came back! What did he say?"
msgstr "啊，你回来了！他怎么说？"

msgid "So where is this [Mana Residue Sample]?"
msgstr "那么这[魔力残渣样本]在哪儿？"

msgid "oh no¡¦"
msgstr "哦不……"

msgid "Something seems very serious. Should we go talk to Herga?"
msgstr "事情似乎很严重。我们去和赫尔加谈谈吧？"

msgid "well..  I see..  It was you.."
msgstr "嗯……我明白了……是你啊……"

msgid "This isn't normal..  It's very serious."
msgstr "这不对劲……非常严重。"

msgid "Something was leaking and was contaminating..  "
msgstr "有东西正在泄漏并造成污染……"

msgid "For now, bring this [Cracking Report] to [Associate of Magic Advisor] Harrigon. And following his order, you'll need to take care of something. Hurry!"
msgstr "眼下，把这份[开裂报告]带给[魔法协会顾问]哈里根。然后按照他的吩咐，你需要去处理一些事情。快！"

msgid "Something must be serious. Talk to Nez."
msgstr "事情一定很严重。去和内兹谈谈。"

msgid "Oh no¡¦  Ah you are back."
msgstr "哦不……啊，你回来了。"

msgid "For now, bring this [Cracking Experiement Report] to [Associate of Magic Advisor] Marcus. And following his order, you'll need to take care of something. Hurry!"
msgstr "眼下，把这份[开裂实验报告]交给[魔法协会顾问]马库斯。然后按照他的吩咐，你需要去处理一些事情。快！"

msgid "Oh no! Master! It was worse than what we had imagined. Let's go meet Harrigon at [Ronarkland]."
msgstr "哦不！师傅！情况比我们想象的更糟。我们去[罗纳克之地]见哈里根吧。"

msgid "Hello~ You're back! You seem tired."
msgstr "你好~你回来了！看起来很累。"

msgid "[Cracking Experiment Report]? That was the issue. But a crack?  Something must have had happened."
msgstr "[开裂实验报告]？原来是这个问题。可是裂缝？一定是发生了什么。"

msgid "Hm¡¦ I see.. That's why."
msgstr "嗯……原来如此。难怪。"

msgid "The answer is to get rid of the main culprit. I'm asking you to do this, <selfname>. Destroy [Crack] and it's main culprit. And come back."
msgstr "答案是除掉罪魁祸首。我拜托你了，<selfname>。摧毁[裂缝]及其罪魁祸首。然后回来。"

msgid "Oh no! Master! It was worse than what we had imagined. Let's go meet Marcus at [Ronarkland]."
msgstr "哦不！师傅！情况比我们想象的更糟。我们去[罗纳克之地]见马库斯吧。"

msgid "Huff Huff ... This must be the final battle. But we don't even know whom we need to fight! I'm kinda scared. Let's visit Harrigon."
msgstr "呼哧呼哧……这一定是最终决战了。可我们连要打的是谁都不知道！我有点怕。我们去见哈里根吧。"

msgid "ah you are here. We're at the final stage."
msgstr "啊，你来了。我们到了最后阶段。"

msgid "You haven't destroyed the main culprit?"
msgstr "你还没除掉罪魁祸首？"

msgid "Oh you are done! [Krowaz Shadow].. Finally Krowaz has been awaken."
msgstr "哦，你完成了！[克柔瓦兹之影]……克柔瓦兹终于苏醒了。"

msgid "Good job. But now you'll need to defeat Krowaz. We'll do our best as well."
msgstr "干得漂亮。不过现在你得打败克柔瓦兹。我们也会尽力的。"

msgid "Huff Huff ... This must be the final battle. But we don't even know whom we need to fight! I'm kinda scared. Let's visit Marcus."
msgstr "呼哧呼哧……这一定是最终决战了。可我们连要打的是谁都不知道！我有点怕。我们去见马库斯吧。"

msgid "ah.. You lost it? I'll give it to you again, so don't lose it."
msgstr "啊……你弄丢了？我再给你一份，别再丢了。"

msgid "You lost it..  That's too bad. I'll give it to you again."
msgstr "你弄丢了……太可惜了。我再给你一份。"

msgid "Welcome, What made you come here?"
msgstr "欢迎，是什么风把你吹来了？"

msgid "Did you finish what you came for? Will you exit?"
msgstr "你来办的事办完了吗？要离开了吗？"

msgid "I'm busy so stop bothering me."
msgstr "我很忙，别来烦我。"

msgid "You'll need to be level 55 to receive the next mission. Go find [Magic Researcher] Norker."
msgstr "你需要达到55级才能接下一个任务。去找[魔法研究员]诺克。"

