msgid "Do you want to leave the Dragon Cave?"
msgstr "你想离开龙穴吗？"

msgid "As you possess the [Marble of the Dragon] you are permitted entry into the Nest of the Fire Dragon. \n Nest of the Fire Dragon is the habitat of Red Dragon, a monster incomparably powerful to previous monsters. If you are not prepared to put your life on the line as the bravest warrior of Adonis, you should not enter.\nDo you want to enter Nest of the Fire Dragon?"
msgstr "由于你持有[龙之大理石]，获准进入火龙之巢。\\n火龙之巢是红龙的栖息地，这是一种远比以往怪物强大的怪物。若你没有做好作为阿多尼斯最勇敢的战士、豁出性命的准备，就不该进入。\\n你想进入火龙之巢吗？"

msgid "You don`t have the [Marble of the Dragon] which grants entry into the Nest of the Fire Dragon. You can obtain the marble from the subordinates of Isiloon."
msgstr "你没有获准进入火龙之巢的[龙之大理石]。你可以从伊西隆的部下那里取得这块大理石。"

msgid "You do not have a Helmet of Wrath?"
msgstr "你没有愤怒头盔吗？"

msgid "Here is the Helmet of Wrath. Good use."
msgstr "这是愤怒头盔。好好用。"

msgid "Master! Mr. Potrang is looking for you."
msgstr "师傅！波特兰先生在找你。"

msgid "We are very tired and hungry. In this state, we won't be able to last long. Get some worms to make some food. You should be able to know how to get your own food."
msgstr "我们又累又饿。照这样下去撑不了多久。去弄些蠕虫来做吃的吧。你该知道怎么给自己找食物。"

msgid "Worms will be near Moradon Castle. There are people who aren't well. Could you get 5 more?"
msgstr "蠕虫就在莫拉登城堡附近。还有些人身体不适。你能再弄5只来吗？"

msgid "Good job. We will not starve now."
msgstr "干得漂亮。我们现在不会挨饿了。"

msgid "Can I help you? Why are you looking for me?"
msgstr "有什么能帮你的？你为什么找我？"

msgid "I have nothing to ask of you."
msgstr "我没什么要拜托你的。"

msgid "It's easy to get the Apple of Moradon."
msgstr "莫拉登苹果很容易弄到。"

msgid "Good job. This will be enough for us to not starve for a while."
msgstr "干得漂亮。这些够我们一阵子不挨饿了。"

msgid "Master! Mr. Potrang's looking for you."
msgstr "师傅！波特兰先生在找你。"

msgid "Good to see you. There are people who can't even move because of what Draki has done. Could you please help them out?"
msgstr "很高兴见到你。有些人因为德拉基所为，连动都动不了。你能帮帮他们吗？"

msgid "We need blankets and something that they can use to wash their body, but we need to eat something first. Could you get us some Apple of Moradon? Apples of Moradon can be obtained from worms."
msgstr "我们需要毯子和能擦洗身子的东西，但得先吃点东西。你能给我们弄些莫拉登苹果吗？莫拉登苹果可以从蠕虫身上获得。"

msgid "If you get the Apples of Moradon, others will make blankets and towels."
msgstr "你弄到莫拉登苹果后，其他人会去做毯子和毛巾。"

msgid "Good job. Thank you for what you have done."
msgstr "干得漂亮。谢谢你所做的一切。"

msgid "I'm sorry to ask you for another request. But could you help us one more time?"
msgstr "很抱歉又要拜托你。不过你能再帮我们一次吗？"

msgid "Recently, Bandicoots have increased in their population and are ruining our precious crops. Help us catch 5 Bandicoots."
msgstr "近来袋狸数量大增，正在糟蹋我们宝贵的庄稼。帮我们抓5只袋狸吧。"

msgid "I can tell how many you have, so make sure that you have enough."
msgstr "我能数出你有多少，所以务必凑够数。"

msgid "You have them all. Well done."
msgstr "你都弄到了。干得好。"

msgid "Master! Potrang is calling again."
msgstr "师傅！波特兰又在叫你了。"

msgid "Life has gotten better since we have settled in here, but now we need to get the trust of the townspeople."
msgstr "自从我们在这里安顿下来，日子好过了些，但现在我们需要取得镇民的信任。"

msgid "You don't need every single townsperson's trust, but make sure to convince the influential ones. Then, others' trust will follow. Go to those with the power and obtain their tokens of trust."
msgstr "你不需要取得每个镇民的信任，但务必说服那些有影响力的人。那样其他人的信任自然会随之而来。去找那些有头有脸的人，取得他们的信任信物。"

msgid "I don't think you have their trust yet. Try harder."
msgstr "我觉得你还没取得他们的信任。再加把劲。"

msgid "Well done. Because of you, the townspeople will trust us."
msgstr "干得好。多亏了你，镇民会信任我们的。"

msgid "Potrang has told me what's happened and as I observe what you've done, I can tell that you can be trustworthy. I'll give you this. This is the proof of our trust in you."
msgstr "波特兰把事情都告诉我了，看你所做的，我知道你值得信赖。这个给你。这是我们信任你的证明。"

msgid "Thank you for completing my request. I've heard that you are trying to get townspeople's trust? This will help you then. This is a token of my trust."
msgstr "谢谢你完成我的请求。我听说你在努力取得镇民的信任？那这个会帮到你。这是我信任你的信物。"

msgid "Seems like you are a good person. I'll give you a token of my trust for you."
msgstr "看来你是个好人。我送你一件信任信物。"

msgid "Master! Mr. Bilbor is looking for you."
msgstr "师傅！比尔博先生在找你。"

msgid "Welcome. I have a request for you."
msgstr "欢迎。我有件事拜托你。"

msgid "Looters have been showing up near Moradon harbor and bothering the townspeople. Could you please go find them and defeat them?"
msgstr "有劫匪出没在莫拉登港附近，骚扰镇民。你能去找并消灭他们吗？"

msgid "I'm so anxiously waiting now¡¦  those Looters need to be gotten rid of ASAP!"
msgstr "我现在焦急地等着呢……那些劫匪必须尽快除掉！"

msgid "Thank you. I heard that you are trying to get the townspeople's trust. This will help you."
msgstr "谢谢。我听说你在努力取得镇民的信任。这个会帮到你。"

msgid "Master! Kaishan is looking for you!"
msgstr "师傅！凯山在找你！"

msgid "Recently I've heard that you are doing good deeds so I've come to ask you a favor."
msgstr "近来我听说你在行侠仗义，所以特来请你帮个忙。"

msgid "Apple of Moradon can be found by defeating monsters near Moradon. Many are looking for this so that they can see what can come out of it. <selfname> could you help us?"
msgstr "莫拉登苹果可以通过打败莫拉登附近的怪物获得。很多人都在找它，想看看里面能开出什么。<selfname>，你能帮帮我们吗？"

msgid "Still not done? Collecting 20  Apple of Moradon seem harder than I imagined."
msgstr "还没完成？收集20个莫拉登苹果比我想象的要难。"

msgid "You have collected them all! Thank you. While you were collecting the Apples of Moradon, Potrang has came by. I'll give you a certificate now."
msgstr "你都收集齐了！谢谢。你去收集莫拉登苹果的时候，波特兰来过了。我现在给你开证明。"

msgid "Master! Master!! Potrang is looking for you!"
msgstr "师傅！师傅！！波特兰在找你！"

msgid "Glad you are here now. The reason I called for you is because Jed from Folk Village has asked for an aid."
msgstr "真高兴你来了。我叫你来，是因为村落的杰德请求援助。"

msgid "Yes. Please go to Folk Village. Bring this Support form."
msgstr "好。请前往村落。带上这份支援表。"

msgid "There's no space in your inventory to put the support form. Make some space and come back."
msgstr "你的背包没空间放支援表了。腾出空间再来。"

msgid "I'm the Captain of the guard, Jed. What do you need to tell me?"
msgstr "我是守卫队长杰德。你有什么要告诉我？"

msgid "If you aren't too busy, could you help me?"
msgstr "如果你不太忙，能帮帮我吗？"

msgid "You came because Potrang told you. What is this? Decrypted Secret Ledger? Wait here. "
msgstr "你是波特兰叫你来的吧。这是什么？解密后的秘密账本？在这儿等着。"

msgid "Master~ Mr. Jed is looking for you."
msgstr "师傅~杰德先生在找你。"

msgid "I was looking for you. Thanks for coming."
msgstr "我正找你呢。谢谢你过来。"

msgid "I've called to ask you to find Sharine. Recently townspeople are missing and it seems like it's related to disappearance of Sharine. Could you find Sharine? According to townspeople you'll be able to find suspicious box belonging to Sharine."
msgstr "我叫你来是想让你找到莎琳。近来镇民接连失踪，似乎和莎琳的失踪有关。你能找到莎琳吗？据镇民说，你能找到属于莎琳的可疑箱子。"

msgid "Ah she was there?!  Good job. Since we now know where she's located, I'm gonna go myself."
msgstr "啊，她在那儿？！干得好。既然知道她在哪里，我自己去。"

msgid "You haven't found her yet?"
msgstr "你还没找到她？"

msgid "Suspicious Box written ([Sharine]. It has stuff that seems to be related to invetigating something.)"
msgstr "写着（莎琳）的可疑箱子。里面装着似乎与某项调查有关的东西。"

msgid "The bag is full. "
msgstr "背包满了。"

msgid "Oh no! I'll give it to you again."
msgstr "哦不！我再给你一份。"

msgid "Welcome. You want to earn my trust? Come back after clearing the next quest. |1. Worm Hunt|2. Bandicoot Hunt| 3. Kecoon Hunt |4. Bulcan Hunt |5. Wild Bulcan Hunt"
msgstr "欢迎。你想赢得我的信任？完成下一个任务后再来吧。|1.猎杀蠕虫|2.猎杀袋狸|3.猎杀凯昆|4.猎杀布尔坎|5.猎杀狂野布尔坎"

msgid "You want to earn my trust? Then the quests I give you need to be cleared."
msgstr "你想赢得我的信任？那我交给你的任务就得完成。"

msgid "It's been too hard to come here crossing the continent. But did you see it too? There's a guy named Jed who's so handsome!"
msgstr "穿越大洲来到这里真是太不容易了。不过你也看到了吧？有个叫杰德的人，帅极了！"

msgid "I sell unique items from all over the world~ Would you like to take a look? |Oh, don't tell nobody I merchant here."
msgstr "我卖来自世界各地的独特货品~要不要看看？|哦，别告诉别人我这个商人在这儿。"

msgid "Black Pirates¡¦ Smugglers¡¦ Attacking Moradon?! What! It's a letter about Black Pirates stealing goods¡¦ There's no details though."
msgstr "黑海贼……走私犯……攻打莫拉登？！什么！这是封说黑海贼偷货物的信……不过没有细节。"

msgid "Yes! That sounds good. Since I'm busy to defeating these monsters, could you take care of this? Get the smugglers and investigate!|Those smugglers should be around Folk Village somewhere."
msgstr "好！听起来不错。我忙着对付这些怪物，你能处理这件事吗？抓住走私犯并展开调查！|那些走私犯应该就在村落附近某处。"

msgid "After decoding the secret ledger, it seems smugglers are trying to steal goods from Moradon for Pirates. Could you interrogate the pirates, please?"
msgstr "解密秘密账本后，看来走私犯正试图替海贼从莫拉登偷运货物。你能审问一下那些海贼吗？"

msgid "You haven't found the smugglers? They should be around Folk Village."
msgstr "你还没找到走私犯？他们应该就在村落附近。"

msgid "Smugglers were indeed communicating with Black Pirates¡¦"
msgstr "走私犯果然在和黑海贼勾结……"

msgid "Try this~ It's a medicine to cure everything~ Would you like to buy one?"
msgstr "试试这个~这是包治百病的灵药~要不要买一瓶？"

msgid "Wow! How did you?!"
msgstr "哇！你怎么做到的？！"

msgid "I'm well prepared to deal with a situation like this. Guys! Come out!"
msgstr "我早有准备应对这种局面。弟兄们！出来吧！"

msgid "Please <selfname>. Please save me this once. I've gotten the order from the Black Pirate Captain. |Oh and I just remembered. Jed was looking for you."
msgstr "求你了，<selfname>。这一次请救救我。我接到了黑海贼船长的命令。|哦对了，我刚想起来。杰德在找你。"

msgid "Please give my regards to Jed."
msgstr "请代我向杰德问好。"

msgid "Pirates are making suspicious movements¡¦  Interrogate the smugglers and find out more about the pirates."
msgstr "海贼正在采取可疑的行动……审问走私犯，进一步查清海贼的底细。"

msgid "Are you sure?! Pirates have invaded Moradon! We have no time!"
msgstr "你确定？！海贼入侵莫拉登了！我们没时间了！"

msgid "Pirates have appeared at Mora Island.|It's very suspicious.|It's also dangerous, but I'll take you there if you want."
msgstr "海贼出现在莫拉岛。|非常可疑。|也很危险，但如果你想去，我带你去。"

msgid "Yes, <selfname>, what I told you is everything. Please believe me¡¦ T.T"
msgstr "是的，<selfname>，我告诉你的就是全部了。请相信我……T.T"

msgid "<selfname> What made you come here? Heh~ Heh~"
msgstr "<selfname>，是什么风把你吹来了？呵~呵~"

msgid "Pirates? Hm¡¦ I haven't heard anything like that."
msgstr "海贼？嗯……我没听说过这种事。"

msgid "Oh~ <selfname>. Please stop..  I get it. I'll tell you everything I know."
msgstr "哦~<selfname>。求你别这样……我明白了。我把知道的都告诉你。"

msgid "Mighty Warrior! I'll be a good person now.|Oh, would you like to take this new medicine that just came in?"
msgstr "了不起的战士！我以后一定做个好人。|哦，要不要看看这刚到的新药？"

msgid "No~~  Have a safe trip back!"
msgstr "不要~~祝你一路平安！"

msgid "There isn't a day I can rest! As you know, pirates are trying to invade Moradon. We need to do something about it."
msgstr "我没有一天能消停！如你所知，海贼正试图入侵莫拉登。我们得做点什么。"

msgid "Since we don't have enough food to get to Mora Island, we will need Apples of Moradon, and  Hm..  I think the scorpions have a habit of collecting Apples of Moradon¡¦"
msgstr "既然我们食物不够走到莫拉岛，就需要莫拉登苹果，而且……嗯……我想蝎子有收集莫拉登苹果的习性……"

msgid "<selfname>, Jed is looking for you."
msgstr "<selfname>，杰德在找你。"

msgid "Something seems not right. Please go get more info from the smugglers."
msgstr "事情好像不太对劲。请再从走私犯那里多套些情报。"

msgid "Oh!!! Because of you <selfname> we can do this before they attack Moradon. This is a reward to show you my appreciation."
msgstr "哦！多亏了你，<selfname>，我们才能在他们攻打莫拉登之前行动。这是聊表心意的谢礼。"

msgid "We are running out of time. Please get Apple of Moradon. Apple of Moradon can be obtained from wolves and scorpions."
msgstr "我们时间不多了。请去弄莫拉登苹果。莫拉登苹果可以从狼和蝎子身上获得。"

msgid "We are ready now. Please go to Mora Island and defeat the Pirates. For now, get about 20 pirates.|Oh, Mora Island is located in the south of Moradon. Go to Quayside to find Laidas or Portman."
msgstr "我们现在准备好了。请前往莫拉岛打败海贼。先解决约20个海贼。|哦，莫拉岛位于莫拉登以南。去码头找莱达斯或波特曼。"

msgid "There are still many pirates left. Please get them all.|Mora Island is on the south side of Moradon. Go to Quayside to find Laidas or Portman."
msgstr "还剩很多海贼。请把他们全部解决。|莫拉岛在莫拉登南侧。去码头找莱达斯或波特曼。"

msgid "Oh! If it wasn't for you <selfname> Moradon could have been¡¦     Thank you so very much. Here, this is the reward."
msgstr "哦！要不是你，<selfname>，莫拉登恐怕就……非常感谢。来，这是谢礼。"

msgid "Welcome back. When you were defeating the pirates, you should have been able to see their weapons. They use Apples of Moradon to strengthen them. Steal their Apples of Moradon.|Mora Island is located on the south side of Moradon. Go to Quayside to find Laidas or Portman."
msgstr "欢迎回来。你打海贼的时候，应该看到他们的武器了吧。他们用莫拉登苹果来强化武器。偷走他们的莫拉登苹果。|莫拉岛位于莫拉登以南。去码头找莱达斯或波特曼。"

msgid "You didn't get the apples? You don't care if Moradon gets invaded? |Mora Island is located in the south of Moradon. Go to Quayside to find Laidas and Portman."
msgstr "你没弄到苹果？你不在乎莫拉登被入侵吗？|莫拉岛位于莫拉登以南。去码头找莱达斯和波特曼。"

msgid "You are great! Because of you, all the townsmen can sleep without any worries now."
msgstr "你真了不起！多亏了你，现在所有镇民都能安睡无忧了。"

msgid "Hmm.. According to the Smuggler's testimony, the Pirate's captain has that weird potion. Once you drink it you gain tremendous power¡¦ Can you get me that potion from the captain next time you see him?"
msgstr "嗯……根据走私犯的供述，海贼船长有一种奇怪的药水。喝下去就能获得巨大的力量……下次你见到船长时，能帮我把那药水弄来吗？"

msgid "You didn't get it yet?| Mora Island is located in the south from Moradon. Go to Quayside to find Laidas or Portman."
msgstr "你还没弄到？|莫拉岛位于莫拉登以南。去码头找莱达斯或波特曼。"

msgid "Oh! This is a leap. What? Eat a pirate ship this chapter, these three forces, yet eventually rupture the body dead? | Hmm .. Know the leap ... you'll have to investigate a little more, and I know this area well."
msgstr "哦！这可是个飞跃。什么？吞掉一艘海贼船，这三方势力，最终却让身体崩裂而死？|嗯……知道是个飞跃……还得再查一查，这一带我很熟。"

msgid "You know about a person who is called Sharine? She's a wanderer of potion researcher, I asked her to search about a mysterious elixir but haven't seen her since then.. Can you first find an evidence for her disappearance? You probably get an evidence if you open the 'Suspicious Box' on the side street."
msgstr "你知道一个叫莎琳的人吗？她是个流浪的药水研究者，我请她去查一种神秘灵药，之后就再没见过她……你能先找些她失踪的证据吗？你在侧街打开那个'可疑箱子'，大概就能得到证据。"

msgid "Hmm..Indeed..Can't find that easily"
msgstr "嗯……确实……没那么容易找到。"

msgid "Finally we might find him soon, but then.. How come Amelie possessed the last piece?"
msgstr "我们终于快找到他了，可是……为什么最后一块会在艾米丽手里？"

msgid "Welcome in! Since Portu and Human have united together, many of them heve been immigrating to Moradon recently. With those monsters moving in there have been so many issues. Can you help?"
msgstr "欢迎进来！自从波尔图与人类联合以来，近来许多人移民到莫拉登。加上那些怪物也迁了进来，问题层出不穷。你能帮忙吗？"

msgid "First of all, kill 10 each of Battalion, Rotten Eyes,Wild Smilodon, and Direwolf."
msgstr "首先，各杀掉10只营兽、腐眼、狂野剑齿虎和恐狼。"

msgid "There are still many monsters left."
msgstr "还剩很多怪物。"

msgid "Thanks! Many refugees can now travel comfortably because of you!"
msgstr "谢谢！多亏了你，许多难民现在可以安心赶路了！"

msgid "Ohh! Did you see?"
msgstr "哦！你看到了吗？"

msgid "A gorgeous woman among those refugees~"
msgstr "那些难民里有个美女~"

msgid "What?! You must be blind! How can you miss that beauty?"
msgstr "什么？！你一定是瞎了！这么个大美人你都能错过？"

msgid "Hmm ..Hmm, hmm. So, I have a favor to ask of you ..."
msgstr "嗯……嗯，嗯。那，我有件事想求你……"

msgid "I want to confess my love to her, and having a gift would be a plus. Can you go find me something good for a gift? I'm begging you. Since I'm a leader of security guards, I can't go outside of Folk Village¡¦ "
msgstr "我想向她表白，要是有份礼物就更好了。你能帮我找件像样的礼物吗？求求你了。我是守卫队长，不能离开村落……"

msgid "You didn't find one yet? Well it's not easy to decide what's good for a gift.. I once heard that the king of fruits are Apples of Moradon.. I wish I could get one¡¦"
msgstr "你还没找到吗？要挑件好礼物确实不容易……我曾听说水果之王就是莫拉登苹果……真希望能弄到一个……"

msgid "Ohh! This is an Apple of Moradon!? I really appreciate it. Just in time to eat."
msgstr "哦！这是莫拉登苹果！？太感谢了。正好可以吃。"

msgid "Oh~ Welcome <selfname>. If you have time, do you want to get a proposal ring from Jewel for me? I will pay you."
msgstr "哦~欢迎<selfname>。你有空的话，能帮我去朱厄尔那里订一枚求婚戒指吗？我会付钱给你。"

msgid "The ring is not ready yet? My heart is racing. I can't wait to give her this ring!!(Jed's face turns red.) She will be in my arms~ah~!"
msgstr "戒指还没做好吗？我的心砰砰直跳。我等不及把这枚戒指送给她了！！（杰德脸红了。）她就会投入我的怀抱~啊~！"

msgid "Ah~ Who in the world's going to refuse this ring? This is really beautiful! Even to guys like me!!"
msgstr "啊~天底下谁会拒绝这枚戒指？真漂亮啊！连我这样的男人都心动！！"

msgid "(Jed is looking nervously)<selfname>..oh What should I do?"
msgstr "（杰德紧张地张望）<selfname>……噢，我该怎么办？"

msgid "(Holding the ring) I gotta give this to her, but I can't even move one step forward..| Perhaps if <selfname> can deliver this to her? Please! I'm begging you!!"
msgstr "（攥着戒指）我必须把这个交给她，可我连一步都迈不出去……|或许<selfname>能替我把这个交给她？求你了！拜托你了！！"

msgid "Did you go yet? Please hurry!"
msgstr "你去了吗？请快点！"

msgid "Oh! Thank you <selfname>. I really appreciate it."
msgstr "哦！谢谢你，<selfname>。真的太感谢了。"

msgid "<selfname> Long time no see..(Jed is pale) I'm having trouble sleeping¡¦ any reply from her yet?...Perhaps <selfname> can go and ask her?"
msgstr "<selfname>，好久不见……（杰德脸色苍白）我睡不着觉……她有回信了吗？……或许<selfname>能去问问她？"

msgid "Oh ... Amelie ..."
msgstr "哦……艾米丽……"

msgid "Are you serious? She..me? Oh! Thank God! (Jed reads letter) (Jed is smiling) <selfname> really. I truly thank you."
msgstr "你说真的？她……我？噢！谢天谢地！（杰德读信）（杰德笑了）<selfname>，真的。我由衷地感谢你。"

msgid "Long time no see <selfname>. Did you hear that people of Folk village are vanishing? I haven't find any clues on their whereabouts, but only people who went to the graveyard are gone..<selfname>, can you search for more evidence?"
msgstr "好久不见，<selfname>。你听说村落在有人接连消失了吗？我还没查到他们的下落，但只有去过墓地的人才不见了……<selfname>，你能再找找证据吗？"

msgid "Any clue yet? We need more clues."
msgstr "有线索了吗？我们需要更多线索。"

msgid "Oh my!... Clothing from missing people..And..This ring..what???"
msgstr "我的天！……失踪者的衣服……还有……这枚戒指……什么？？？"

msgid "Hmm.. Although she's my love¡¦I cannot overlook this. <selfname> can you ask Amelie about the ring found at the graveyard?"
msgstr "嗯……虽然她是我的挚爱……但这事我不能坐视不管。<selfname>，你能去问问艾米丽关于在墓地发现的那枚戒指吗？"

msgid "I can't believe it. Just lost it there?"
msgstr "真不敢相信。就丢在那儿了？"

msgid "Ha¡¦ Good. She just lost it there."
msgstr "哈……好。她只是把它丢在那儿了。"

msgid "I can't just sit and watch. So many people gone missing. <selfname>, you want to join me for a stakeout at the graveyard tonight? I want to find these missing people no matter what."
msgstr "我不能坐视不管。这么多人失踪。<selfname>，你愿意今晚和我一起去墓地蹲守吗？无论如何我都要找到这些失踪的人。"

msgid "Find anything yet?"
msgstr "找到什么了吗？"

msgid "Amelie..How¡¦(Shocked silence)"
msgstr "艾米丽……怎么会……（震惊得说不出话）"

msgid "<selfname>¡¦ How could this be? She became a monster..| Please do me this favor.| <selfname> can you keep this ring with you? When you see her someday I want you to give this to her. I need to protect this village."
msgstr "<selfname>……怎么会这样？她变成了怪物……|请帮我这个忙。|<selfname>，你能替我保管这枚戒指吗？等你哪天见到她，我想让你把这个交给她。我必须保护这个村子。"

msgid "(Jed has a serious look. Not a word spoken.)"
msgstr "（杰德神情凝重，一言不发。）"

msgid "did you come <selfname>?"
msgstr "你来了吗，<selfname>？"

msgid "Never thought she was such a monster .... He blood formed this stone could be an evidence in some way¡¦"
msgstr "真没想到她竟是这样的怪物……他的血凝成的这块石头，或许在某种程度上能成为证据……"

msgid "By the way, why she had the last chapter of the Sharine's journal? Everything is riddled with doubt. First of all can you ask Sharine about this stone? Sharine seems to know something.."
msgstr "对了，她为什么会有莎琳日记的最后一章？一切都疑点重重。首先，你能拿这块石头去问问莎琳吗？莎琳好像知道些什么……"

msgid "Have you met Sharine? The journal tells she might be at Teil village.."
msgstr "你见过莎琳了吗？日记上说她可能在泰尔村……"

msgid "Amelie's Spiritual Stone? Amelie got contaminated with a Spiritual Stone and that made her a monster¡¦If purifying her contaminated body..Thank you. I'm glad to see her at least..Thank you."
msgstr "艾米丽的灵石？艾米丽被一块灵石感染，那才让她变成了怪物……如果净化她被感染的身体……谢谢你。至少还能见到她，我很高兴。谢谢。"

msgid "<Sharine> O what this? Where did you get this stone?"
msgstr "<莎琳>哦这是什么？你从哪儿得到这块石头的？"

msgid "What the..She finally¡¦"
msgstr "搞什么……她终于……"

msgid "I heard that she was kidnapped by Draki and was used for his experiment. The experiment to strengthen the Spiritual Stone¡¦ She was the only survivor who escaped from there."
msgstr "我听说她被德拉基绑架，用作实验对象。那项强化灵石的实验……她是唯一一个从那里逃出来的幸存者。"

msgid "She oneday came to me and ask for a cure but I didn't have any at the time.. She was left like that and I realized of my incapacity. I started to travel around the world studying more about the Spiritual Stone.."
msgstr "有一天她来找我求医，但当时我什么药也没有……她就那样走了，我这才意识到自己的无能。我开始周游世界，深入研究灵石……"

msgid "<Draki's Heart> I believe you know this as well, there was species called Draki in this continent before our kind. Very strong tribe but with God's anger, their kind almost disappeared or few survivors hid themselves somewhere deep and secret. On their chest there was a Spiritual Stone which creates a great power which was their primary energy source.. "
msgstr "<德拉基之心>我想你也知道，在我们这个种族之前，这片大陆上曾有一个叫德拉基的种族。非常强大的部族，但因神之怒，他们几近灭绝，少数幸存者躲藏在某个幽深隐秘之处。他们胸前有一块灵石，能产生巨大的力量，那是他们主要的能量来源……"

msgid "Based on my research, the pieces of Spiritual Stone are found at different places in the world. And people who are contaminated with, makes them struggle, and..become a monster."
msgstr "根据我的研究，灵石的碎片散落在世界各地。而被它感染的人会备受折磨，然后……变成怪物。"

msgid "It is not accurate yet! But, my research can be more improved. It seems to be possible from my perspective. I gotta observe more."
msgstr "还不准确！不过，我的研究还能更进一步。从我的角度看这似乎是可能的。我得多观察观察。"

msgid "Aren't you curious of ability of the stone? Here I will show you."
msgstr "你不好奇这块石头的能力吗？来，我演示给你看。"

msgid "Can you get me Amelie's blood sample? If you bring it to me, I will show you something cool."
msgstr "你能帮我弄些艾米丽的血样吗？你带给我，我就给你看点厉害的东西。"

msgid "You haven't got Amelie's blood sample yet?"
msgstr "你还没弄到艾米丽的血样吗？"

msgid "Good Job you've got it. Let's see. Keke"
msgstr "干得漂亮，弄到了。我看看。咯咯。"

msgid "Here. This is the Spiritual Stone and blood sample you brought. Feed this to that worm over there. Something incredible will happen Haha. Oh, make sure you put an armor on yourself just in case."
msgstr "给。这是你带来的灵石和血样。把这个喂给那边那只蠕虫。会发生不可思议的事，哈哈。哦，保险起见你自己穿好盔甲。"

msgid "Haven't feed it yet? Go head come on~Haha"
msgstr "还没喂吗？快去，来吧~哈哈"

msgid "How's it? Unbelievable huh? That's an ability of Spiritual Stone. Make even a puny thing into a monster¡¦Hope the stone doesn't spread out no more¡¦"
msgstr "怎么样？难以置信吧？这就是灵石的能力。连那么弱小的东西都能变成怪物……希望这石头别再扩散了……"

msgid "See what I mean? The power of Spiritual Stone ... I stay here and do more research. Oh yes. I have a favor, do you know anything about Pole of Purificaion?"
msgstr "明白我的意思了吧？灵石的力量……我留在这里继续研究。哦对了，我有件事求你，你知道净化之柱吗？"

msgid "Yes. It is a Pole which Spirit of Water possessed in the past. If we have it, we could probably heal the contaminated people. If you ever find it, can you please bring it to me?"
msgstr "是的。那是昔日水之精灵所拥有的柱子。如果有了它，我们或许就能治愈那些被感染的人。你要是找到它，能带给我吗？"

msgid "Thanks! This is my written letter to Great Elder in the castle. If you take it, you will get more information about the Spiritual Stone"
msgstr "谢谢！这是我写给城堡大长老的信。你带上它，就能得到更多关于灵石的信息。"

msgid "Go ahead. I have more researches."
msgstr "去吧。我还有更多研究要做。"

msgid "Deliver Sharine's letter to Great Elder."
msgstr "把莎琳的信交给大长老。"

msgid "Oh! Is it the Apple of Moradon? How beautiful it is!!"
msgstr "哦！是莫拉登苹果吗？真漂亮！！"

msgid "Of course! Heh heh, but nothing comes for free!  If you give me the Apple of Moradon and only 100,000 Noah I'll make a ring for her."
msgstr "当然！呵呵呵，不过天下没有免费的午餐！你把莫拉登苹果给我，再加上10万诺亚，我就给她打一枚戒指。"

msgid "Good Choice! Here~ I wish you success and much love."
msgstr "好选择！给你~祝你马到成功、爱情甜蜜。"

msgid "You don't have enough Noah..."
msgstr "你的诺亚不够……"

msgid "You don't have enough Apples of Moradon?"
msgstr "你的莫拉登苹果不够？"

msgid "It seems you don't find any evidence in the box. Where can the last page be at¡¦"
msgstr "看来你在箱子里没找到证据。最后一页会在哪儿呢……"

msgid "Now I can live happily with Jed. I'm happy :D"
msgstr "现在我可以和杰德幸福地生活了。我好开心:D"

msgid "Oh. What is this?"
msgstr "哦。这是什么？"

msgid "(The ring sparkles radiantly when she opens the box) Wow¡¦This is so beautiful¡¦ From Jed?"
msgstr "（她打开盒子时，戒指璀璨地闪耀）哇……好漂亮……是杰德送的？"

msgid "Oh¡¦Thank you¡¦but I need a man with courage. Tell him to bring this to me himself."
msgstr "哦……谢谢……但我需要一个有勇气的男人。叫他自己亲手把这个送来给我。"

msgid "Excuse me. Miss Amelie ... (clears throat)"
msgstr "打扰一下。艾米丽小姐……（清嗓子）"

msgid "(Amelie's cheek turns in red) Oh. Jed!|Thank you for saving me from the monsters last time."
msgstr "（艾米丽脸颊泛红）哦。杰德！|谢谢你上次把我从怪物手里救出来。"

msgid "It was nothing. Well, I will be thankful if you accept this ring."
msgstr "没什么。那个，如果你愿意收下这枚戒指，我会很感激。"

msgid "Why do I need to accept this ring?|(Amelie being haughty)"
msgstr "我为什么要收下这枚戒指？|（艾米丽摆起架子）"

msgid "B¡¦Because. To get rid of those monsters¡¦|(Jed is bewildered)"
msgstr "因……因为。为了除掉那些怪物……|（杰德手足无措）"

msgid "I¡¦I lo..ve you! Since the first time I saw you."
msgstr "我……我……爱……爱你！从我第一次见到你起。"

msgid "Wh..what..(Amelie being shy)|I will accept the ring¡¦but first I will think about it."
msgstr "什……什么……（艾米丽害羞）|我会收下戒指的……不过我要先考虑考虑。"

msgid "Don't you need to go to Jed? *^^*"
msgstr "你不用去见杰德吗？*^^*"

msgid "Oh. Welcome <selfname>. Jed is troubled? Haha He's waited long enough. Here. This is my response. Can you deliver it please?"
msgstr "哦。欢迎<selfname>。杰德很苦恼吗？哈哈，他等得够久了。来，这是我的答复。你能帮我转交吗？"

msgid "Please hurry¡¦ ^¤Ñ^*"
msgstr "请快点……^¤Ñ^*"

msgid "(Amelie appears unhealthy) Thank you for finding my ring.."
msgstr "（艾米丽看上去气色不好）谢谢你找到我的戒指……"

msgid "What brings you here today <selfname>?"
msgstr "今天是什么风把你吹来了，<selfname>？"

msgid "What's the matter ^^? I will answer you to the best of my ability."
msgstr "怎么了^^？我会尽力回答你。"

msgid "(Embarrassed) R.Right. I lost it the other day, Where did you find it?"
msgstr "（尴尬）对、对。我前几天弄丢了，你在哪儿找到的？"

msgid "!!!!! |I¡¦I probably lost it when I went there to visit my father's grave. Thank God you found this for me..I was really sad about this."
msgstr "!!!!! |我……我大概是去上坟扫墓的时候弄丢的。谢天谢地你帮我找到了……我为此真的好难过。"

msgid "(Amelie looks suspicious¡¦That will do it for today)"
msgstr "（艾米丽面露怀疑……今天就到这儿吧）"

msgid "Kyaaaak!!Kyak! Kak! (Amelie is out of control!) Yumyum.(Amelie is eating human flesh.)"
msgstr "呀啊啊！呀！啊！（艾米丽失控了！）yumyum。（艾米丽在吃人肉。）"

msgid "(Amelie's senses return)..Jed..Je..Jed..No!! Don't look..Please.. Don't LooooooooooooooK~!!!"
msgstr "（艾米丽恢复了神智）……杰德……杰……杰德……不！别看……求你……别——看——啊！！！"

msgid "It is ordinary worm. (What is this for..)"
msgstr "这是普通的蠕虫。（这是用来做什么的……）"

msgid "Insert the Spiritual Stone and Amelie's blood."
msgstr "放入灵石和艾米丽的血。"

msgid "Kuoooooooooooooo.(Worm's getting bigger)"
msgstr "呜噢噢噢噢噢……（蠕虫在变大）"

msgid "Wonder how Great Elder's doing.. Draki's move seems suspicious.."
msgstr "不知道大长老怎么样了……德拉基的举动很可疑……"

msgid "Master. Sharine is looking for you."
msgstr "师傅。莎琳在找你。"

msgid "Welcome¡¦,I knew it that you will come."
msgstr "欢迎……我就知道你会来。"

msgid "Long time nosee Sharine.. So is he doing alright? (Atlas unseals the letter) Oh no! The Spiritual Stone has been spreaded out this wide¡¦Have to find a Pole of Purification ASAP.."
msgstr "好久不见，莎琳……他还好吗？（阿特拉斯拆信）哦不！灵石竟已扩散到这么广……必须尽快找到净化之柱……"

msgid "According to legend, a Pole of purification was divided by 3 pieces and given to 3 most sacred sprits in Temple of Water. And when the temple collapsed, it got diappeared since then.."
msgstr "据传说，净化之柱被分成三块，交给了水之神殿中三位最神圣的精灵。而神殿倒塌后，它就此消失了……"

msgid "When Temple of Water collapsed, all 3 spirits died and there's no way to find the Pole of Purification."
msgstr "水之神殿倒塌时，三位精灵全部殒命，再也无法找到净化之柱。"

msgid "However according to oral tradition, the Spirit of Water reincarnate in human-being. If we find the reincarnated spirt of Water, we could find a Pole of Purification as well."
msgstr "不过根据口传传统，水之精灵会转世为人。如果我们找到转世的水之精灵，或许也能找到净化之柱。"

msgid "Welcome <selfname>. Come on in. Can you do me a favor by any chance?"
msgstr "欢迎<selfname>。进来吧。你能不能顺手帮我个忙？"

msgid "When we Portu ran away from Draky, there were some refugees came out together as well. However among refugees, there are few still chased by monsters."
msgstr "我们波尔图从德拉基那里逃出来时，也有一些难民一同逃了出来。然而难民之中，还有少数人仍被怪物追着。"

msgid "Yes. Please get rid of the Savages and Wolfdogs to guard the refugee way."
msgstr "好。请除掉野蛮人和狼犬，守住难民的通道。"

msgid "You haven't finish them yet? Please protect our refugees.."
msgstr "你还没解决完吗？请保护我们的难民……"

msgid "Thank you for your help. The refugees got arrived to the castle safely."
msgstr "谢谢你的帮助。难民们已安全抵达城堡。"

msgid "Welcome. I called you because food has been scarce since the refugee population has grown. Can you find something to eat for the refugees? I heard that Shebiji's Meat is delicious."
msgstr "欢迎。我叫你来，是因为难民增多后食物开始短缺。你能为难民找点吃的吗？我听说舍比吉的肉很美味。"

msgid "No food yet? People are starving to death."
msgstr "还没弄到吃的？人们都快饿死了。"

msgid "Ohh.. This is Shebiji's Meat. Thank you so much. Many refugees can survive with this."
msgstr "哦……这是舍比吉的肉。非常感谢。有了这个，许多难民就能活下来了。"

msgid "This is a dream come true to settle down here.. I have been chased by monsters everyday.."
msgstr "能在这里安顿下来，简直像做梦……我每天都被怪物追着……"

msgid "Hello. <selfname> right? So..I need a favor."
msgstr "你好。你就是<selfname>吧？那……我需要帮个忙。"

msgid "My mother's birthday is soon and I'd liked to give her a warm coat for a gift but¡¦I don't have money, nor the energy to work¡¦"
msgstr "我妈妈的生日快到了，我想送她一件暖和的外套当礼物，可是……我既没有钱，也没有力气干活……"

msgid "Can you get me 20 pieces of Wolfdog's Leather so I can make a coat for her? I will pay you back once I grow up..Please, I am begging you."
msgstr "你能帮我弄20张狼犬皮吗，好让我给她做件外套？等我长大一定还你钱……求你了，拜托了。"

msgid "Mother's birthday is around the corner.. Do you have them yet??"
msgstr "妈妈的生日就快到了……你弄到了吗？？"

msgid "Wow! Thank you <selfname>. Really I truly mean it!!"
msgstr "哇！谢谢你，<selfname>。我是真心的！！"

msgid "(Cough)(Cough) Hello <selfname>. Can you deliver this gift to my mother? She is probably near the [Advisor].(Cough)(Cough)"
msgstr "（咳嗽）（咳嗽）你好，<selfname>。你能把这份礼物交给我母亲吗？她大概在[顾问]附近。（咳嗽）（咳嗽）"

msgid "(cough) I..I'm fine~ Please do me this favor."
msgstr "（咳嗽）我……我没事~请帮我这个忙。"

msgid "You didn't give her the present yet? (cough)"
msgstr "你还没把礼物交给她吗？（咳嗽）"

msgid "<selfname> thank you. Did my mother like it?"
msgstr "<selfname>，谢谢你。我母亲喜欢吗？"

msgid "Thank you to <selfname>. I wanted to give a present to mother before I die..Really thank you..(Cough)..(Co¡¦ug)"
msgstr "感谢<selfname>。我想在临死前送母亲一份礼物……真的谢谢你……（咳嗽）……（咳……嗽）"

msgid "Sigh¡¦I wonder how Sadi is doing¡¦ it's hard to see her face because she's extremely busy working.."
msgstr "唉……不知道萨迪怎么样了……她忙得不可开交，很难见到她……"

msgid "Hello. What is it?"
msgstr "你好。什么事？"

msgid "Oh. Sadi..sobbing..I have done nothing to deserve this¡¦"
msgstr "哦。萨迪……在啜泣……我什么也没做，不该受这种待遇……"

msgid "This is not much, but it is some extra money for Sadi.|Can you deliver this <selfname>?"
msgstr "这虽然不多，但算是给萨迪的一点辛苦钱。|你能帮我转交这个吗，<selfname>？"

msgid "Sobbing..my Sadi..Sadi died ¡¦contaminated by the Spiritual Stone.."
msgstr "啜泣着……我的萨迪……萨迪死了……被灵石感染了……"

msgid "Are you <selfname>? Right. Can you help me?"
msgstr "你就是<selfname>？好。你能帮帮我吗？"

msgid "Refugees were caught by Apes during their exodus. | Can you get rid of those Apes before they eat the refugees?"
msgstr "难民在逃亡途中被猿人抓走了。|你能趁他们还没把难民吃掉之前除掉那些猿人吗？"

msgid "We don't have time. Let's hurry."
msgstr "我们没时间了。快。"

msgid "Ohoh! <selfname> thank you."
msgstr "哦哦！<selfname>，谢谢你。"

msgid "<selfname>, have you seen my father while rescuing the refugees? My father was kidnapped too.. Could you try one more time?"
msgstr "<selfname>，你救难民的时候见到我父亲了吗？我父亲也被抓走了……你能再去找一次吗？"

msgid "Thank you so much"
msgstr "非常感谢。"

msgid "You didn't find my father yet?"
msgstr "你还没找到我父亲？"

msgid "What? My father died? (Wailing) Father ... Father ... sobbing ...."
msgstr "什么？我父亲死了？（嚎啕大哭）父亲……父亲……啜泣……"

msgid "(When Leia receives the Ring of Spirit, Leia floats in the air with blue lights.)"
msgstr "（莱娅接过精灵戒指时，周身浮起蓝色光芒，悬浮在空中。）"

msgid "Ah..I..I was a Spirit¡¦Father¡¦Thank you..<selfname>. Thank you for my father¡¦and bring my memory back¡¦I'm an envoy of King Spirit. King Spirt ordered me to purify the Spiritual Stones in worldwide."
msgstr "啊……我……我曾是一位精灵……父亲……谢谢你……<selfname>。谢谢你为了我父亲……也让我找回了记忆……我是精灵王的使者。精灵王命令我净化世界各地的灵石。"

msgid "First of all, I have to go find my sisters. I could find them if I had the Earring of Spirit and Bracelet of Spirit with me. They are¡¦(Leia concentrates on her ring) hmm..They are located northwest from here. Seems Death Knight and Ancient have them near Raiba Village."
msgstr "首先，我得去找我的姐妹们。只要带上精灵耳环和精灵手镯，我就能找到她们。她们就在……（莱娅凝神注视戒指）嗯……她们在从这里往西北的方向。似乎死亡骑士和远古树怪把它们据为己有，就在莱巴村附近。"

msgid "Please find spirit of earring and bracelet."
msgstr "请找到精灵耳环和手镯。"

msgid "Aahh. Finally I can meet my sisters."
msgstr "啊哈。我终于能见到姐妹们了。"

msgid "Death Knight's King¡¦I think the Death knight's king has the earring. Be careful. When you get rid of the knight, the king will appear. Get him too and find the Earring of Spirit."
msgstr "死亡骑士之王……我想耳环在死亡骑士之王手里。小心。你除掉那些骑士后，王者就会出现。把他也解决掉，找到精灵耳环。"

msgid "Death Knight's King will appear when you kill death knights."
msgstr "你杀死死亡骑士后，死亡骑士之王就会出现。"

msgid "If Death Knights are alive, they will kill anyone. When you get the earring, please kill those Death Knights."
msgstr "只要死亡骑士还活着，他们就会杀掉任何人。你拿到耳环后，请把那些死亡骑士也杀掉。"

msgid "Please kill more Death Knights"
msgstr "请再多杀一些死亡骑士。"

msgid "Ahah. <selfname> thank you."
msgstr "啊哈。<selfname>，谢谢你。"

msgid "King of Ancient Trees..Probably those contaminated trees became Ashunt when Temple of Water collapsed. There is more possibility with the oldest Tree has the bracelet."
msgstr "远古树王……大概是水之神殿倒塌时，那些被感染的树变成了艾尚特。最老的那棵树持有手镯的可能性更大。"

msgid "Cheer up Warrior! King of Ancient will be among the Ancients."
msgstr "振作起来，战士！远古之王就在那些远古树怪之中。"

msgid "Ahah. <selfname> thank you. It wasn't easy to find. The continent is getting purified slowly."
msgstr "啊哈。<selfname>，谢谢你。找到它可不容易。这片大陆正慢慢被净化。"

msgid "Warrior. Can you ged rid of those Ashunts while you find the bracelet? The forest won't be safe as long as they're there."
msgstr "战士，你找手镯的时候能顺手除掉那些艾尚特吗？只要它们还在，森林就不得安宁。"

msgid "Cheer up warrior! Get rid of 20 Ashunts"
msgstr "振作起来，战士！除掉20只艾尚特。"

msgid "You finally brought them all. The location where earring and bracelet respond is inside of the local villages. Once you go there, find Pina and Sara and give them these eaaring and bracelet. | I will prepare for ceremony of Pole of Purification at Jeras temple. I will see you there with the sisters."
msgstr "你终于把它们都带来了。耳环与手镯感应到的位置就在附近的村落里。你到那里后，找到皮娜和萨拉，把这耳环和手镯交给她们。|我会在杰拉斯神殿准备净化之柱的仪式。我会在那里和姐妹们等你。"

msgid "You haven't found the Pina yet. Seems Pina is at towards Asga village"
msgstr "你还没找到皮娜。皮娜好像在往阿斯加村的方向。"

msgid "Ah..No doubt to see them again¡¦ Meet me at the temple of Jeras<selfname>"
msgstr "啊……能再次见到她们自不必说……到杰拉斯神殿与我会合吧，<selfname>。"

msgid "(Earrings of Spirit are flashing) ...... Oh those earrings ..."
msgstr "（精灵耳环闪烁着光芒）……哦，那对耳环……"

msgid "(Sara is shining in blue with the earring.) You came to see me.."
msgstr "（萨拉戴着耳环，在蓝光中闪耀。）你来看我了……"

msgid "Leia.. My sister is still alive..Thank you Warrior. Let's go see my sister."
msgstr "莱娅……我妹妹还活着……谢谢你，战士。我们去见我妹妹吧。"

msgid "(Bracelet of Spirit is flashing) ...... Oh that bracelet ..."
msgstr "（精灵手镯闪烁着光芒）……哦，那只手镯……"

msgid "(Pina is shining in blue with the bracelet) You came to see me.."
msgstr "（皮娜戴着手镯，在蓝光中闪耀。）你来看我了……"

msgid "Leia.. My sister still alive..Thank you Warrior. Let's go see my sister."
msgstr "莱娅……我妹妹还活着……谢谢你，战士。我们去见我妹妹吧。"

msgid "Thank you Warrior. It's all your effort for our reunion. Summon the Pole of Purification. Once we start summoning, the monsters will come and attack us. I want you to protect us against those monsters."
msgstr "谢谢你，战士。我们得以重逢全靠你的努力。召唤净化之柱吧。一旦我们开始召唤，怪物就会前来袭击我们。我要你保护我们抵挡那些怪物。"

msgid "Are you ready?"
msgstr "你准备好了吗？"

msgid "The Pole of Purification doesn't have enough holy power.."
msgstr "净化之柱的神圣之力还不够……"

msgid "(Bang!)(A bright shining staff is in the air above altar.) It's done.. Use this pole to cure those people contaminated with Spiritual Stone. "
msgstr "（砰！）（一根闪耀的法杖悬浮在祭坛上方。）成了……用这根柱子去治愈那些被灵石感染的人吧。"

msgid "I will fill the Purification pole with souls. Warrior you must protect me. Tell me when you're ready. It won't be easy to protect me against the monsters"
msgstr "我要用灵魂为净化之柱充能。战士，你必须保护我。准备好了告诉我。要保护我抵挡怪物可不容易。"

msgid "I have to protect the pole against the contamination. Please kill the mosters around us. Let's start then."
msgstr "我必须保护柱子不被污染。请把我们周围的怪物杀掉。那我们开始吧。"

msgid "Sara's part is not finished yet"
msgstr "萨拉那部分还没完成。"

msgid "Pina's part is not finished yet"
msgstr "皮娜那部分还没完成。"

msgid "Leia's part is not finished yet"
msgstr "莱娅那部分还没完成。"

msgid "There gotta be some refugees who got contaminated by Spiritual Stone at Elmorad castle. Go there and heal them."
msgstr "艾莫拉德城堡里一定有被灵石感染的难民。去那里治愈他们。"

msgid "Contaminated refugees are at the castle. Please hurry."
msgstr "被感染的难民在城堡里。请快点。"

msgid "Good job. Now those people won't die because of the Spiritual Stone."
msgstr "干得漂亮。现在那些人不会再因灵石而死了。"

msgid "Ah..It hurts¡¦Help me..it's like my chest is burning."
msgstr "啊……好痛……救救我……我的胸口像在燃烧。"

msgid "Aaah!! Help me. Ou! Ch! Ah! (Chest is dyed in dark and purification pole does not work.)"
msgstr "啊啊！！救救我。噢！哧！啊！（胸口被黑暗浸染，净化之柱失效了。）"

msgid "Ha.. Thought you could purify me..?"
msgstr "哈……以为你能净化我……？"

msgid "O my. It's Draiden!!..Spiritual Stone was Draiden's plot"
msgstr "天哪。是德拉伊登！……灵石原来是德拉伊登的阴谋。"

msgid "Warrior, this is dangerous here. Move to a different place first."
msgstr "战士，这里危险。先换个地方。"

msgid "Shit.. I got unnecessary damage because of that stupid Spirit..Hehe. But at least I got Leia down..next time is you guys.."
msgstr "可恶……因为那个蠢精灵，我白挨了一下……嘿嘿。不过至少我把莱娅放倒了……下一个就是你们……"

msgid "Draiden is an evil that lives in darkness."
msgstr "德拉伊登是栖于黑暗中的恶魔。"

msgid "Sobbing¡¦sister¡¦¡¦¡¦¡¦¡¦¡¦.."
msgstr "啜泣……妹妹………………………………"

msgid "Sobbing¡¦We can't keep being sad like this.. Once Draiden appears, Spiritual Stone's contamination will continue."
msgstr "啜泣……我们不能一直这样悲伤下去……一旦德拉伊登现身，灵石的污染就会持续。"

msgid "I have to get rid of Draiden."
msgstr "我必须除掉德拉伊登。"

msgid "<selfname>'s ability is enough. But you just don't have good enough weapons."
msgstr "<selfname>的能力足够了。只是你还没有足够好的武器。"

msgid "As far as I know, you can make a sword that can cuts the spirits with this purified Spiritual Stone."
msgstr "据我所知，你可以用这块被净化的灵石打造一把能斩杀精灵的剑。"

msgid "Yes. Draiden really doesn't have its body so you have to cut his spirit. I heard there's a great blacksmith in Adonis continent. Was it Heppa? Take this purified Spiritual Stone to him."
msgstr "是的。德拉伊登确实没有实体，所以你必须斩杀他的灵体。我听说阿多尼斯大陆有位了不起的铁匠。是黑帕吧？把这块被净化的灵石带给他。"

msgid "Have you met Heppa yet?"
msgstr "你见过黑帕了吗？"

msgid "Draiden wait for me.."
msgstr "德拉伊登，你等着我……"

msgid "Welcome~ which weapon do you need?"
msgstr "欢迎~你需要什么武器？"

msgid "!!! This is Spiritual Stone? Never seen a Spiritual Stone like this, Hmm¡¦I can make it, but I can't guarantee how it will come out. In worst case, even this Spiritual Stone will become useless."
msgstr "！！这是灵石？从没见过这样的灵石，嗯……我能打，但没法保证打出来会是什么样。最坏的情况下，连这块灵石也会报废。"

msgid "If you insist, I will try with my best. Then, can you get me those materials? I need those at least so I can make a sword with Spiritual Stone."
msgstr "你既然坚持，我就尽全力试试。那么，你能帮我弄些材料来吗？我至少需要这些材料，才能用灵石打一把剑。"

msgid "First, I need Great Wizard Draki's Elixir. With that I can make the stone calm down."
msgstr "首先，我需要大巫师德拉基的灵药。有了它，我才能让这块石头平静下来。"

msgid "Secondly, I need the Trinity jewel that contained a War force. Jeweler Jewel should know the create procedure of Trinity jewel."
msgstr "其次，我需要一颗蕴含战意的三位一体宝石。珠宝商朱厄尔应该知道三位一体宝石的制法。"

msgid "Third, I need a legendary mineral, Oriharcon. In fact, Spiritual stone is main material but its strength will be doubled with a coating of Oriharcon. You can obtain it from defeating Halion which is at south of Eslant."
msgstr "第三，我需要一种传说中的矿物——奥利哈康。其实灵石是主材料，但涂上一层奥利哈康后，它的强度会翻倍。你可以从艾斯兰特南边的哈利昂身上获得。"

msgid "Lastly, Spiritual researcher, Sherine's recipe. There's no one better than her. Get me the recipe."
msgstr "最后，还需要灵石研究者莎琳的秘方。没人比她更在行了。把秘方给我弄来。"

msgid "Yes. Please take care of yourself."
msgstr "好。请保重。"

msgid "Not enough material yet"
msgstr "材料还不够。"

msgid "Aahh.. Never knew this ever happened to me..Thank you..(Crying Heppa) I will make you the best sword I ever made!! Just wait for it!!(Heppa going into forge while holding a giant hammer)"
msgstr "啊……真没想到这种事会发生在我身上……谢谢你……（黑帕哭了）我会给你打一把我这辈子最好的剑！！你就等着吧！！（黑帕攥着大铁锤走进锻造炉。）"

msgid "Clattering~Rattles~Cracking~~! (The noise of hammering echoed in Moradon and after a week, Heppa brings a sword.)"
msgstr "叮当~哐当~锵锵~~！（打铁的声响回荡在莫拉登，一周后，黑帕带来一把剑。）"

msgid "(Heppa was holding a sword which is the most beautiful sword I ever seen.) This is my masterpiece! Hahahaha please use it on purpose!!"
msgstr "（黑帕手里握着一把我见过的最美的剑。）这是我的杰作！哈哈哈，尽管用吧！！"

msgid "I'm the blacksmith Atlas. Wait! Your star is twinkling gloriously."
msgstr "我是铁匠阿特拉斯。等等！你的星象正闪耀着光辉。"

msgid "Master! Blacksmith is looking for you."
msgstr "师傅！铁匠在找你。"

msgid "Wonder if Sharine's doing alright.."
msgstr "不知道莎琳怎么样了……"

msgid "Not enough space. Please make some space in your bag."
msgstr "空间不足。请在背包里腾出些位置。"

msgid "I can hear the sound of wind¡¦ Can you hear it as well? | What brought you here?"
msgstr "我能听见风声……你也听得见吗？|是什么风把你吹来了？"

msgid "I can feel the force of the earth.. Can you feel it as well? | What brought you here?"
msgstr "我能感觉到大地之力……你也感觉得到吗？|是什么风把你吹来了？"

msgid "I can feel the force of water... Can you feel it as well? | What brought you here?"
msgstr "我能感觉到水之力……你也感觉得到吗？|是什么风把你吹来了？"

msgid "(Bones are laid between empty cells)"
msgstr "（白骨散落在空荡的囚室之间。）"

msgid "Please save me!!!! Those Apes are trying to eat me alive.!! Please save me..We can get a prison key if you kill those Apes!!"
msgstr "请救救我！！！那些猿人想把我活活吃掉！！请救救我……你杀掉那些猿人就能拿到监狱钥匙！！"

msgid "Help me~~!! Oh!! You have a key~ Please help me out of here."
msgstr "救救我~~！！噢！！你有钥匙~请把我从这里救出去。"

msgid "Thank you. Thank you so much..Let's go out together."
msgstr "谢谢。太感谢了……我们一起出去吧。"

msgid "(King Aif smacks Leia's father with a giant bat) Run. No.! Old man. Kill. Human. Weak¡¦"
msgstr "（猿人王艾夫用巨棒猛击莱娅的父亲）跑。不。老头。杀。人。弱……"

msgid "Sigh¡¦ Look..Please deliver this letter to Leia in the castle.. I'm begging you¡¦"
msgstr "唉……你看……请把这封信交给城堡里的莱娅……我求求你……"

msgid "Old man..not delicious..you are..delicious..human.delicious."
msgstr "老头……不好吃……你……好吃……人……好吃。"

msgid "Wait. <selfname>. Can I take a look at the ring on you?"
msgstr "等等。<selfname>。我能看看你手上那枚戒指吗？"

msgid "(Once the ring touches Leia's hand, it starts glowing.) Ah.. This is what father said¡¦"
msgstr "（戒指一碰到莱娅的手，就开始发光。）啊……父亲说的就是这个……"

msgid "It's OK. Yeah. Everything is clear now..Ah¡¦.I got my memory back¡¦Thank you. <selfname>. I got it back because of you."
msgstr "没事了。嗯。现在一切都清楚了……啊……我找回记忆了……谢谢你。<selfname>。多亏了你，我才想起来。"

msgid "The memory that I was once a Spirit. I'm the Spirit of Water Leia. I lost my memory somehow. First of all I have to find my sisters."
msgstr "我曾是一位精灵的那段记忆。我是水之精灵莱娅。不知怎么就失去了记忆。首先，我得找到我的姐妹们。"

msgid "I have two sisters. If I find them, I probably get the rest of my lost memories."
msgstr "我有两个姐妹。找到她们，我大概就能找回剩下丢失的记忆。"

msgid "This ring is a 3 piece-set accessory. They pull to each other with the power of King Spirit. It can guide us to find the other pieces."
msgstr "这枚戒指是三件套饰品。它们借精灵王之力相互牵引。它能指引我们找到其余的部件。"

msgid "According to father's letter, it tells me to find a ring of Spirit from king Aif. Can you get it from King Aif? "
msgstr "根据父亲的信，要从猿人王艾夫那里找到精灵戒指。你能从猿人王艾夫那里取来吗？"

msgid "Save me please!! I worry about my daugher.. I have to see her."
msgstr "请救救我！！我担心我的女儿……我必须见到她。"

msgid "(If I open this door, would king Ape appear? Should I open it?)"
msgstr "（要是打开这扇门，猿人王会出现吗？我该打开吗？）"

msgid "(The bracelet starts to glow once it goes to Pina)"
msgstr "（手镯一交到皮娜手中，就开始发光。）"

msgid "(The earring starts to glow once it goes to Sara)"
msgstr "（耳环一交到萨拉手中，就开始发光。）"

msgid "You haven't found Sara yet. I think she's in one of the local villages."
msgstr "你还没找到萨拉。我想她就在附近的某个村落里。"

msgid "See you at Jeras Temple.<selfname>"
msgstr "杰拉斯神殿见。<selfname>"

msgid "<selfname>Welcome.| you are our great supporter <selfname>."
msgstr "欢迎<selfname>。|你是我们了不起的支持者，<selfname>。"

msgid "I don't know what to say but we've lost the Eslant's treasure which are 3 God equipments."
msgstr "我都不知该说什么好了，我们弄丢了艾斯兰特的宝藏——三件神兵。"

msgid "Yes. They're Esperancer's armor that protects against any attacks, Eclipse's Spear that cut through any armors, and Jerper's guntlet that makes user's hand as fast as the light. Of course they work on only chosen person but they're important to people of Eslant as God's possessions."
msgstr "是的。它们是能抵御一切攻击的艾斯佩朗塞铠甲、能刺穿一切护甲的日蚀之枪，以及能让出手速度快如闪电的杰珀护手。当然它们只对被选中的人生效，但作为神之遗物，它们对艾斯兰特人至关重要。"

msgid "Lost to Marcil, Badin, Garlong. They were not big threats to us but someday they came up with incredible powers and attacked us. It was too sudden and I'm sorry we couldn¡¯t protect those equipments."
msgstr "输给了马西尔、巴丁、加隆。他们原本对我们没什么威胁，可有一天他们突然获得了难以置信的力量并袭击了我们。太过突然，很抱歉我们没能护住那些神兵。"

msgid "It is mystery to us too. For now it's more important to get those 3 equipments back from them.| and there is a rumor that a strange monster showed up near ancient site in Southwest area. .|<selfname>, please bring peace to Eslant."
msgstr "这对我们也是个谜。眼下更重要的是把那三件神兵从他们手里夺回来。|而且有传言说西南方古迹附近出现了一只奇怪的怪物。。|<selfname>，请为艾斯兰特带来和平。"

msgid "<selfname>, are you now on the way to kill Marcil? If so, please save Eslant people over there. I heard that our people are used as servants. Please help them."
msgstr "<selfname>，你现在是去杀马西尔的路上吗？如果是，请救救那边的艾斯兰特人。我听说我们的同胞被当作仆役驱使。请救救他们。"

msgid "Our people not yet? The kidnapped people are captured in northwest of Marcil's settlement."
msgstr "我们的同胞还没救出来？被绑架的人被关在马西尔据点的西北方。"

msgid "You really saved kidnapped people, <selfname> thank you. This is nothing but our express of appreciation."
msgstr "你真的救出了被绑架的人，<selfname>，谢谢你。这不过是我们聊表谢意。"

msgid "Are you on the way to kill Marcil? Then I have another favor. Marcil's fellows invade to cilvilian's village and steal foods and kidnap the kids and women in the village these days. We will appreciate if you kill those bastards."
msgstr "你是去杀马西尔的路上吗？那我还有一事相求。近来马西尔的手下入侵平民村庄，抢夺粮食，还掳走村里的孩子和女人。如果你能除掉那些混蛋，我们将不胜感激。"

msgid "Fellows not yet defeated? Their settlement are located  at southwest."
msgstr "手下还没除掉？他们的据点位于西南方。"

msgid "I heard the news. You're awesome. That you got rid of them. You're the true hero. The legendary God's equipments probably belong to you.<selfname>"
msgstr "我听说消息了。你真了不起。你把他们除掉了。你是真正的英雄。传说中的神兵大概理应属于你。<selfname>"

msgid "<selfname>, are you now on the way to kill Badin? If so, please save Eslant people over there. I heard that our people are used as servants. Please help them."
msgstr "<selfname>，你现在是去杀巴丁的路上吗？如果是，请救救那边的艾斯兰特人。我听说我们的同胞被当作仆役驱使。请救救他们。"

msgid "Our people not yet? The kidnapped people are captured in northwest of Badin's settlement."
msgstr "我们的同胞还没救出来？被绑架的人被关在巴丁据点的西北方。"

msgid "Are you on the way to kill Badin? Then I have another favor. Badin's fellows invade to cilvilian's village and steal foods and kidnap the kids and women in the village these days. We will appreciate if you kill those bastards."
msgstr "你是去杀巴丁的路上吗？那我还有一事相求。近来巴丁的手下入侵平民村庄，抢夺粮食，还掳走村里的孩子和女人。如果你能除掉那些混蛋，我们将不胜感激。"

msgid "Fellows not yet defeated? Their settlement are located  at northwest."
msgstr "手下还没除掉？他们的据点位于西北方。"

msgid "I heard the news. You're awesome. That you got rid of them. You're the true here. The legendary God's equipments probably belong to you.<selfname>"
msgstr "我听说消息了。你真了不起。你把他们除掉了。你是真正的英雄。传说中的神兵大概理应属于你。<selfname>"

msgid "<selfname>, are you now on the way to kill Garlong? If so, please save Eslant people over there. I heard that our people are used as servants. Please help them."
msgstr "<selfname>，你现在是去杀加隆的路上吗？如果是，请救救那边的艾斯兰特人。我听说我们的同胞被当作仆役驱使。请救救他们。"

msgid "Our people not yet? The kidnapped people are captured in northeast of Garlong's settlement."
msgstr "我们的同胞还没救出来？被绑架的人被关在加隆据点的东北方。"

msgid "Are you on the way to kill Garlong? Then I have another favor. Garlong's fellows invade to cilvilian's village and steal foods and kidnap the kids and women in the village these days. We will appreciate if you kill those bastards."
msgstr "你是去杀加隆的路上吗？那我还有一事相求。近来加隆的手下入侵平民村庄，抢夺粮食，还掳走村里的孩子和女人。如果你能除掉那些混蛋，我们将不胜感激。"

msgid "Fellows not yet defeated? Their settlement are located  at northeast."
msgstr "手下还没除掉？他们的据点位于东北方。"

msgid "Are you going to face the enemy?Don't forget about us supporting your back, <selfname>. Please bring the peace back after you defeat Marcil / Badin / Garlong."
msgstr "你要去面对敌人了？别忘了我们在你背后支持着你，<selfname>。请在打败马西尔/巴丁/加隆后，把和平带回来。"

msgid "Not easy enemies. They're located at southwest / northwest / northeast."
msgstr "不是好对付的敌人。他们位于西南方/西北方/东北方。"

msgid "Unbelievable to defeat that strong enemy. You're truly a hero this era."
msgstr "难以置信竟能打败那么强的敌人。你真是这个时代的英雄。"

msgid "Please find back those stolen Eslant's 3 treasures from the Devils. We're all counting on you. <selfname>"
msgstr "请从恶魔手中找回那些被偷走的艾斯兰特三件宝藏。我们都指望着你了。<selfname>"

msgid "Marcil, Badin and Garlong each possess the 3 treasures. Please bring them back.."
msgstr "马西尔、巴丁和加隆各持有一件宝藏。请把它们带回来……"

msgid "Thank you. Now this equipments finally find its owner?"
msgstr "谢谢。这些神兵终于找到主人了？"

msgid "<selfname>, have you heard of sound that a mountain collapsed in southwest?"
msgstr "<selfname>，你听说西南边有座山倒塌的声响了吗？"

msgid "Yes. The Southwest mountain which has ancient ruins collapsed last night. Regarding what Patrol said, a legendary monster Prisila just revived there. Why troubles keep happening.. Perhaps <selfname> can get rid of it too?"
msgstr "是的。西边那座带有古代遗迹的山昨晚倒塌了。据巡逻兵说，一只传说中的怪物普莉希拉刚在那里复活。麻烦事怎么接二连三……或许<selfname>也能除掉它？"

msgid "if Prisila is alive, Eslant could be exterminated anytime. Prisila would be at southwest area."
msgstr "只要普莉希拉还活着，艾斯兰特随时可能被毁灭。普莉希拉应该就在西南一带。"

msgid "Although you've got 3 God's equipments on you, didn't know you could still knock out a legendary monster."
msgstr "虽然你身上带着三件神兵，却没想到你连传说中的怪物都能打倒。"

msgid "(Us receiving a letter) T¡¦This!! Ancient Draki language.. Draki tribe disappeared centuries ago.."
msgstr "（我们收到一封信）这……这个！！古代德拉基文字……德拉基部族几百年前就灭绝了……"

msgid "Yes. It's Draki's language. Maybe revival of Prisila is somehow related to Draki."
msgstr "是的。这是德拉基的文字。或许普莉希拉的复活与德拉基有某种关联。"

msgid "We should let Uranos know about this."
msgstr "我们得把这事告诉乌拉诺斯。"

msgid "He's our captain who fights in the first line of Ronalkland. Please deliver this letter to Uranos."
msgstr "他是在罗纳克之地第一线作战的队长。请把这封信交给乌拉诺斯。"

msgid "Please hurry."
msgstr "请快点。"

msgid "I could hear sound of mind¡¦What brought you here?"
msgstr "我能听见心灵的声音……是什么风把你吹来了？"

msgid "What this!! They finally come here to find the Adonis continent."
msgstr "这是怎么回事！！他们终于来到这片阿多尼斯大陆了。"

msgid "LOST PAGE. Do you know every Bible exist in Adonis continent miss pg.2? |  that legendary page tells God created Draki species before Elmorad and Karuth.."
msgstr "遗失的书页。你知道吗，阿多尼斯大陆上每本圣经都缺了第2页？|那页传说记载，神在艾莫拉德和卡鲁斯之前创造了德拉基一族……"

msgid "Yes.. They're strong and smart..They promised to come back when they got kicked out to a different world.. With curses to God, comeback with the power to defeat God..They finally got here to Adonis continent."
msgstr "是的……他们既强大又聪明……他们曾发誓被放逐到异世界后定会归来……带着对神的诅咒，以足以击败神的力量归来……他们终于来到阿多尼斯大陆了。"

msgid "They will need Draki gate to teleport themselves here. We have to destroy the gate before they coming through."
msgstr "他们需要通过德拉基之门才能把自己传送过来。我们必须在他们穿门而过之前摧毁那扇门。"

msgid "There's no way to find out. If we could find rest piece of this ruined page.."
msgstr "没办法查清楚。要是我们能找到这页残卷剩下的部分就好了……"

msgid "They keep coming and coming.. You bastards..."
msgstr "他们源源不断地涌来……你们这些混蛋……"

msgid "From someday, the dead bodies around village arose and attack the village."
msgstr "不知从哪天起，村子周围的尸体都爬了起来，袭击村子。"

msgid "Would you? Ok. Then can you kill 20 (contaminated Karuth warrior) or (contaminated Elmorad warrior) around here?"
msgstr "你愿意吗？好。那你能在这附近杀掉20个（被感染的卡鲁斯战士）或（被感染的艾莫拉德战士）吗？"

msgid "Thanks.. Give them a rest in peace. About 20."
msgstr "谢谢……让他们安息吧。大约20个。"

msgid "Seriously. It's enough to protect against warriors' attacks, but what if neibor country attack at this point.. It's like somebody's behind all this. If you don't mind, can you get ride of 30 soldiers from enemy contry user?"
msgstr "说真的。这防御战士们的攻击是够了，可要是邻国在这时打过来怎么办……这背后一定有人操纵。你不介意的话，能除掉30个来自敌国阵营的士兵吗？"

msgid "Enemies don't stop attack us! Hurry help us quick!"
msgstr "敌人不停地攻击我们！快快来帮我们！"

msgid "Indeed! I was right! I knew you could do it. Well done!"
msgstr "果然！我没看错！我就知道你能办到。干得漂亮！"

msgid "Come Come! I found this when I was killing warriors!"
msgstr "来！来！我杀那些战士的时候捡到了这个！"

msgid "Yes! It's a dark Spiritual stone. They were controled by this stone. Seems its dark force covers entire Ronalkland"
msgstr "是的！这是一块黑暗灵石。他们就是被这块石头控制的。它的黑暗力量似乎覆盖了整个罗纳克之地。"

msgid "Well? Draki? Draiden? No clue to find out for now. First let's give a peace to fallen warriors. I heard that you have a purification pole on you . If you use it on fallen warriors, you would get the purified spiritual stones. Please get me 10 of them."
msgstr "怎么样？德拉基？德拉伊登？眼下还查不出头绪。先让倒下的战士们安息吧。我听说你身上带着净化之柱。如果你用它照在倒下的战士身上，就能得到被净化的灵石。请给我弄10个来。"

msgid "If you have a pole of purification, you would get the purified spiritual stones from fallen warrirors"
msgstr "如果你有净化之柱，就能从倒下的战士身上得到被净化的灵石。"

msgid "What? The pole of purification won't work?"
msgstr "什么？净化之柱不起作用？"

msgid "Even the pole of purification doesn't work.. How powerful it could be if pole of purification has no effect to it..."
msgstr "连净化之柱都没用……如果净化之柱都对它无效，那它该有多强大……"

msgid "Ah¡¦.there's any hope¡¦It would be enough with Pole of Life.."
msgstr "啊……还有希望……有生命之柱就够了……"

msgid "You want to find out?"
msgstr "你想查清楚？"

msgid "if you insist¡¦that's what pole of purification actually looks.. Purifies no matter what kinds of darkness it is. King Spirit Rifte used in the past. King Spirit should be contained to uncover its disguise. Becoming the pole of Life."
msgstr "你既然坚持……这其实就是净化之柱的真面目。无论何种黑暗都能净化。昔日精灵王里夫特曾使用过它。精灵王必须被封印，才能揭开它的伪装。化作生命之柱。"

msgid "Yes..but forget it. Do you believe in spirit nowadays?"
msgstr "是的……不过算了。这年头谁还信精灵啊？"

msgid "Long time no see.<selfname>. How are you?"
msgstr "好久不见。<selfname>。你好吗？"

msgid "I could sometimes hear some of your adventure story at the castle. What brought you here today?"
msgstr "我偶尔在城堡里听到一些你的冒险故事。今天是什么风把你吹来了？"

msgid "Lord Rifte?"
msgstr "里夫特大公？"

msgid "it 's hard to see him.  Even us to see him once in 1000 years."
msgstr "很难见到他。连我们也是一千年才能见他一次。"

msgid "We can't go see him."
msgstr "我们没法去见他。"

msgid "Haha then we should bring him here."
msgstr "哈哈，那我们就把他请过来。"

msgid "If we want to recall him we need 200 spiritual souls. King spirit take good care of Spiritual souls."
msgstr "要召唤他，我们需要200个精灵之魂。精灵王很珍视精灵之魂。"

msgid "Monsters at Ronalkland have all spriritual souls. Release those souls and meet a king spirit."
msgstr "罗纳克之地的怪物身上都有精灵之魂。释放那些灵魂，去见精灵王。"

msgid "Not enough souls yet."
msgstr "灵魂还不够。"

msgid "I'm so exciting to see him"
msgstr "我好期待见到他。"

msgid "Are you ready? Now we will see king Spirit. Ready?"
msgstr "你准备好了吗？现在我们就要去见精灵王了。准备好了吗？"

msgid "Then I will prepare for it. Are you going to hand me the souls?"
msgstr "那我来准备仪式。你要把那些灵魂交给我吗？"

msgid "(Start speaking spells with collecting of bloody spirits)"
msgstr "（一边收集血腥的灵魂，一边开始念诵咒语。）"

msgid "(By the time spells becoming a song and echos in the village, Spirits start scatter and those scattered spirits shaped themselves into a shape of human.)"
msgstr "（当咒语化作歌谣、在村落中回荡时，精灵们开始四散，那些散乱的精灵逐渐凝聚成人形。）"

msgid "Who was looking for me?"
msgstr "是谁在找我？"

msgid "A mortal being calld me? How funny. Just wasted time |(King Spirit about to disappear)"
msgstr "一个凡人召我？真可笑。纯粹浪费时间|（精灵王即将消失。）"

msgid "(Disappearing King spirit with ignore)"
msgstr "（精灵王置若罔闻，渐渐消失。）"

msgid "(King Spirit stops) Draki? You mean son of Pathos?"
msgstr "（精灵王停下了。）德拉基？你是说帕特洛斯之子？"

msgid "This continent is about to face the end. So? What about Draki?"
msgstr "这片大陆即将迎来末日。所以呢？德拉基又如何？"

msgid "Haha.. So what do you want me to do?"
msgstr "哈哈……那你想让我做什么？"

msgid "My power? Yea? I will let you borrow. Then what do I get for?"
msgstr "我的力量？嗯？我可以借你一用。那我能得到什么好处？"

msgid "See? Haha I like the deal. Ok. But your body can't accept my tremendous power. But It's possible if you have a pole of purification."
msgstr "看到了吧？哈哈，我喜欢这笔交易。行。不过你的身体承受不住我这滔天的力量。但如果你有净化之柱，就有可能。"

msgid "You have prepared for this. Very detailed. Ok. Here's my power. I will take what I want once I collect my power. Haha"
msgstr "你早有准备。考虑得真周到。好。这是我的力量。等我收回力量时，我会拿走我想要的。哈哈。"

msgid "Welcome. Ronalk tribe's patriarches gone crazy since you were gone. Please hurry to get rid of them!"
msgstr "欢迎。自从你走后，罗纳克部族的族长们就发疯了。请快去除掉他们！"

msgid "The damage grows by patriarches everyday. Help us."
msgstr "族长们每天都在造成破坏。救救我们。"

msgid "You. What's up with your power? I never seen a person like you fast and strong."
msgstr "你。你的力量怎么回事？我从没见过像你这样又快又强的人。"

msgid "What! Perhaps that's pole of Life? Thought it was a legend."
msgstr "什么！那莫非就是生命之柱？我还以为只是个传说。"

msgid "That holy aurora light..really beautiful and powerful. That should purify the warriors. I have to ask you for one more time."
msgstr "那神圣的极光……真美，又强大。那一定能净化那些战士。我得再拜托你一次。"

msgid "Fallen warriors' dead bodies should be near the village. If you use the pole onto dead bodies, you will get purified stones. Bring 10 of them."
msgstr "倒下的战士尸体应该就在村子附近。你把柱子照在尸体上，就能得到被净化的石头。带来10个。"

msgid "Yes.. O yes¡¦ What can't a pole of Life cure.. Thank you"
msgstr "是……哦，是啊……生命之柱还有什么治不好的……谢谢。"

msgid "Come in. I don't know if you heard this too but, our strongest squad in our unit lost connection with us few days ago."
msgstr "进来吧。不知道你听说了没有，我们小队最强的分队几天前和我们失去了联系。"

msgid "They're unbitten squad.. Can you go find out?"
msgstr "他们是无人能挡的分队……你能去查一下吗？"

msgid "Thank you. They disappeared where Dragon knight commander was. If you get rid of them you should get some evidences."
msgstr "谢谢。他们在龙骑士指挥官所在的地方消失了。如果你除掉那些家伙，应该能找到一些证据。"

msgid "You haven't found any clues yet? Hope the 1st squad is ok.. We lost a connection where Dragon knights are located."
msgstr "你还没找到任何线索吗？但愿第一分队没事……我们在龙骑士所在的地方断了联系。"

msgid "Chaos Dragon knight's commander which appeared once 1000 years ago.. It's weird."
msgstr "一千年才出现一次的混沌龙骑士指挥官……太蹊跷了。"

msgid "Come! It's getting worse. 2nd squad also got disappeared just like 1st squad. Can you go find them?"
msgstr "来！情况越来越糟。第二分队也像第一分队一样消失了。你能去找他们吗？"

msgid "Thank you. They disappeared where Fossil Guard was. If you get rid of them you should get some evidences."
msgstr "谢谢。他们在化石守卫所在的地方消失了。如果你除掉那些家伙，应该能找到一些证据。"

msgid "You haven't found any clues yet? Hope the 2nd squad is ok.. "
msgstr "你还没找到任何线索吗？但愿第二分队没事……"

msgid "Chaos Fossil Guard!! Draki's fellos showed up.. I have to let everybody knows and add more manpower."
msgstr "混沌化石守卫！！德拉基的手下现身了……我得通知所有人并增派人手。"

msgid "Welcome <selfname>. Thank you for accepting our request for help. "
msgstr "欢迎<selfname>。谢谢你接受我们的求助。"

msgid "You probably heard this but, Oaks are kidnapping Portus on immigration."
msgstr "你大概听说了，橡树怪正在绑架移民途中的波尔图人。"

msgid "Indeed I tried. But at the center of Oak whre people disappeared, we can't trace anything maybe it's because of the sealing spell."
msgstr "我确实试过。但在人们消失的橡树怪中心，我们什么线索都追踪不到，或许是因为封印咒语。"

msgid "Yes. We have to first release its sealing spell to save people. That's what we want <selfname> to do."
msgstr "是的。我们必须先解除它的封印咒语才能救人。这就是我们想请<selfname>做的事。"

msgid "Thank you for saying to help us. First we have to stop the operation of Sealing tower located at Ardream's every corners."
msgstr "谢谢你愿意帮我们。首先，我们必须停运分布在阿德雷姆各处的封印之塔。"

msgid "There have to be Oaks around the sealing towers. Obtain a key to release the seal on the tower after defeating the Oaks."
msgstr "封印塔周围一定有橡树怪。打败橡树怪后，取得解除塔身封印的钥匙。"

msgid "Yes. It's tough job, it' ll be hard without <selfname>. Please do it for us."
msgstr "是的。这是项艰巨的活儿，没有<selfname>很难办。请你帮帮我们。"

msgid "Not released the seal yet? Please hurry."
msgstr "还没解除封印吗？请快点。"

msgid "Indeed <selfname>. You're awesome as I heard. This is nothing but a small reward for all this."
msgstr "果然是<selfname>。你和传闻一样了不起。这不过是聊表心意的一点谢礼。"

msgid "Weldome <selfname>. We're conducting a rescue operation after you destroyed the sealing towers from last time, but Oak's resistance is not easy. Can <selfname> go to them and reduce Oak's strength?"
msgstr "欢迎<selfname>。自从上次你摧毁了封印塔后，我们一直在展开营救行动，但橡树怪的抵抗并不好对付。<selfname>能去削弱橡树怪的力量吗？"

msgid "There still many resistance by Oaks. Please defeat only 20 each Oak warriors, archer, wizards."
msgstr "橡树怪仍在顽抗。请各只打败20个橡树战士、弓箭手和法师。"

msgid "Thank you. You're so sexy to cut those Oaks at once. This is reward for that."
msgstr "谢谢。你一刀砍掉那些橡树怪的样子真帅。这是谢礼。"

msgid "Come. We're running out of time.  Save the people while you wipe out the Oaks."
msgstr "来。我们时间不多了。你一边肃清橡树怪，一边救人。"

msgid "There are still many hostages captured. Their lives are hanging on the cliff. Please save them from the prison."
msgstr "还有很多人质被抓。他们命悬一线。请把他们从监狱里救出来。"

msgid "Indeed! <selfname>! I knew you were awesome when I first saw you. But you are more than awesome. Thank you."
msgstr "果然！<selfname>！我第一眼就知道你了不起。但你比了不起还了不起。谢谢你。"

msgid "Welcome. It's all because of the commander Kaisraq controls those brainless monsters blocking our attacks. If we get rid of him, those Oaks are nothing. Please get Kaisraq down."
msgstr "欢迎。全靠凯斯拉克指挥官操控那些没脑子的怪物挡住我们的攻势。只要除掉他，那些橡树怪就不足为惧了。请把凯斯拉克干掉。"

msgid "Please cut Kaisraq's head off!"
msgstr "请把凯斯拉克的头砍下来！"

msgid "Indeed you're great! Thank you."
msgstr "你果然了不起！谢谢你。"

msgid "<selfname> came? Recently the monsters around Eslant bocome stronger and more damages rise. I think it's all about the red Spiritual stone effects. I want you <selfname> to defeat them. Please defeat 20 cardinals."
msgstr "<selfname>来了？近来艾斯兰特周围的怪物变得更强，损失也增多了。我想这都是红色灵石在作祟。我要你，<selfname>，去打败它们。请打败20个红衣主教。"

msgid "Not yet on cardinals? More damages appear on the Refugees' immigration to Ardream"
msgstr "红衣主教还没解决？难民迁往阿德雷姆途中的损失还在增加。"

msgid "<selfname> came? Recently the monsters around Eslant bocome stronger and more damages rise. I think it's all about the red Spiritual stone effects. I want you <selfname> to defeat them. Please defeat 20 Trents?"
msgstr "<selfname>来了？近来艾斯兰特周围的怪物变得更强，损失也增多了。我想这都是红色灵石在作祟。我要你，<selfname>，去打败它们。请打败20个树精？"

msgid "Not yet on Trent? More damages appear on the Refugees' immigration to Ardream"
msgstr "树精还没解决？难民迁往阿德雷姆途中的损失还在增加。"

msgid "<selfname> came? Recently the monsters around Eslant bocome stronger and more damages rise. I think it's all about the red Spiritual stone effects. I want you <selfname> to defeat them. Please defeat 20 Barrens"
msgstr "<selfname>来了？近来艾斯兰特周围的怪物变得更强，损失也增多了。我想这都是红色灵石在作祟。我要你，<selfname>，去打败它们。请打败20个荒地兽。"

msgid "Not yet on Barren? More damages appear on the Refugees' immigration to Ardream"
msgstr "荒地兽还没解决？难民迁往阿德雷姆途中的损失还在增加。"

msgid "<selfname> came? Recently the monsters around Eslant bocome stronger and more damages rise. I think it's all about the red Spiritual stone effects. I want you <selfname> to defeat them. Please defeat 20 Ashents"
msgstr "<selfname>来了？近来艾斯兰特周围的怪物变得更强，损失也增多了。我想这都是红色灵石在作祟。我要你，<selfname>，去打败它们。请打败20个灰木兽。"

msgid "Not yet on Ashents? More damages appear on the Refugees' immigration to Ardream"
msgstr "灰木兽还没解决？难民迁往阿德雷姆途中的损失还在增加。"

msgid "Ardream's monsters become stronger ever with an effect of red spiritual stone. Now we can defend just with Ardream's military and it's all because of <selfname>. Thank you. We got here from now on. And this red spiritual stone. Can you take this to Us at Eslant?"
msgstr "多亏红色灵石的影响，阿德雷姆的怪物变得更强了。如今我们仅凭阿德雷姆的守军就能守得住，这全靠<selfname>。谢谢你。剩下的我们来处理。还有这块红色灵石。你能把它带给艾斯兰特的乌斯吗？"

msgid "Yes. As far as I know. Best professor. Maybe he know about this red spiritual stone. Can you go find him and find more about this stone?"
msgstr "是的。据我所知。最好的教授。也许他知道这块红色灵石的底细。你能去找他，多了解一下这块石头吗？"

msgid "Thanks for everything. Be well. Anything with a red spiritual stone, go see Eslant's Us"
msgstr "谢谢你所做的一切。保重。凡是和红色灵石有关的事，就去找艾斯兰特的乌斯。"

msgid "Welcome. I have heard enough about you. Supporting our unit. Thank you!"
msgstr "欢迎。关于你的事我已经听够了。支援我们的部队。谢谢你！"

msgid "Gave them a peace. Thank you."
msgstr "让他们安息吧。谢谢你。"

msgid "You don't have a pole of purification. You won't be able to accept my power.."
msgstr "你没有净化之柱。你将无法承受我的力量……"
